window.ACP_Q=[{"id":"620.1.1-001","sec":"620.1.1","dom":"620.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An experimental team changes its own process every week and wants to maintain its configuration itself. It has no need to share configuration with other projects. Which management approach is most appropriate?","opts":["Team-managed","Company-managed with shared configuration","Company-managed, with a Jira administrator changing the workflow for them every week","Selecting the Scrum template is enough to meet the management requirements"],"zh":"一個實驗小組每週都在改自己的流程，希望由團隊自己維護設定，而且沒有跨 project 共用的需求。最適合哪種管理方式？","zo":["Team-managed","Company-managed 並使用 shared configuration","Company-managed，由 Jira admin 每週幫他們改 workflow","只要選 Scrum template 就能滿足管理需求"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"正解。官方對 team-managed 的定位就是給 autonomous teams（自主團隊）：issue types、fields、workflow 全部由 project admin 自己在 project settings 裡改，不必經過 Jira admin。題目說「每週都在改自己的流程」又「沒有跨 project 共用需求」，正好對上這個定位。","B":"Shared configuration 的意思是讓新 project 直接掛上另一個 project 現有的 scheme，兩邊從此連動。這引入了題目根本沒有要求的跨 project 相依，而且日後改設定會影響到別人，跟「實驗小組想自己隨便改」完全相反。","C":"技術上可行，但違反了需求的核心。CMP 的 workflow 放在 scheme 裡，每改一次都要開單等 Jira admin，一個每週調整流程的實驗小組會被卡死。這個選項是典型的「做得到但不合適」。","D":"Template 決定的是工作節奏與起始設定（Scrum 有 sprint、Kanban 是連續流），它<strong>不決定設定由誰管理</strong>。選了 Scrum template 之後，仍然要回答「要 team-managed 還是 company-managed」這個問題。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/what-are-team-managed-and-company-managed-projects/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/what-are-next-gen-project-settings/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.1.1-002","sec":"620.1.1","dom":"620.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Six product projects must use the same workflow and must stay consistent when the workflow is adjusted in the future. What should you recommend?","opts":["Six team-managed projects whose workflows are given the same name","Company-managed projects that use shared configuration","Selecting the same template for all six projects is sufficient","Six team-managed projects that the project administrators synchronize manually on a regular basis"],"zh":"六個產品 project 必須使用同一套 workflow，將來調整時也要保持一致。你該推薦什麼？","zo":["六個 team-managed project，把 workflow 取相同名稱","Company-managed project，使用 shared configuration","六個 project 都選同一個 template 就足夠","六個 team-managed project，由 project admin 定期手動同步"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"TMP 的 workflow 是長在各自 project 裡的私有物件，六個 project 就是六份獨立的設定。把它們取成一樣的名稱只是外觀相同，日後任何一個被改動，其他五個不會跟著變，完全達不到「將來調整時也要保持一致」的要求。","B":"正解。只有 company-managed 的 scheme 是<strong>站台層級的全站物件</strong>，同一份可以掛給多個 project；Jira admin 改一次，六個 project 同時生效，這正是題目要的「將來調整也保持一致」。建立時在 Advanced 勾 Share settings with an existing project 即可。","C":"Template 只決定<strong>建立當下</strong>的起點，六個 project 建好之後就各走各的，沒有任何持續同步的機制。這是考題最愛的陷阱：把「起點相同」誤當成「永遠相同」。","D":"人工同步既無法保證一致，也不是 Jira 提供的機制——只要有人忘記或漏改，六份設定就開始分歧，而且沒有任何檢查機制會告訴你。需要保證一致時，答案永遠是共用同一份物件，而不是靠紀律。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/what-are-team-managed-and-company-managed-projects/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/create-a-new-project/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.1.1-003","sec":"620.1.1","dom":"620.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Project A and Project B share the same workflow. A Jira administrator adds a Review status to this workflow. Which projects are affected?","opts":["Only the project that was most recently associated with this workflow","Only Project A","Project A and Project B","All projects in Jira"],"zh":"Project A 與 B 共用同一份 workflow。Jira admin 在這份 workflow 加入 Review 狀態，哪些 project 會受影響？","zo":["只有最後一個掛上這份 workflow 的 project","只有 A","A 與 B","Jira 裡所有 project"],"ans":"C","why":{"B":"這個答案只看到 A，忽略了題目已經明說 B 也引用同一份 workflow。共用的本質是「兩個 project 指向同一個物件」，改動當然兩邊都會看到。","C":"正解。引用同一份 scheme 物件的 project 全部會同步改變——這正是 shared configuration 的意義，也是它的代價。想只改自己那邊，得請 Jira admin 先複製一份 workflow 與 workflow scheme 再重新指派。","D":"影響範圍只限於<strong>引用這份 workflow 的 project</strong>。站台上其他掛著不同 workflow scheme 的 project 完全不受影響，不會全站一起變。","A":"scheme 沒有「最後掛上的 project 優先」這種概念。掛上同一份 scheme 的 project 之間是平等的引用關係，不分先後。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/what-are-team-managed-and-company-managed-projects/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/create-a-new-project/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.1.1-004","sec":"620.1.1","dom":"620.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A team receives work continuously and wants to limit the amount of work in progress (WIP). Based on work cadence alone, which template is most appropriate?","opts":["Bug tracking","Company-managed","Scrum","Kanban"],"zh":"團隊持續接收工作，希望限制同時進行的數量（WIP）。單就工作節奏，哪個 template 最合適？","zo":["Bug tracking","Company-managed","Scrum","Kanban"],"ans":"D","why":{"C":"Scrum 是以固定週期（sprint）承諾一批工作，適合有規律規劃節奏的團隊。題目說的是「持續接收工作」的連續流，兩者的工作模式不同；而且 WIP 限制不是 Scrum 的核心手段。","D":"正解。Kanban board 正是為連續流設計的，而且提供 <strong>column constraints</strong>（欄位上限）來標示同時進行的數量超標。要注意它只是視覺提醒，不會真的阻止你把卡片拖進去。","A":"Bug tracking 是一個簡化的追蹤模板，以清單檢視為主，沒有 sprint 也沒有 WIP 限制的概念，回答不了題目要的「限制同時進行的數量」。","B":"Company-managed 是<strong>管理方式</strong>（設定歸誰管），不是 template。這是考題常見的混淆手法：把兩個不同層次的選項混在一起，讓你分不清「選節奏」和「選管理模式」是兩個獨立的決定。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/what-are-the-project-templates/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.1.1-005","sec":"620.1.1","dom":"620.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"On the Free plan, a regular project administrator wants to create a new project that shares its configuration with another project. Which statement is correct?","opts":["This creation option requires a Jira administrator and is not available on the Free plan.","Two projects automatically share configuration as long as they use the same template.","Anyone who can administer a project can create a project with shared configuration.","Switching to team-managed allows the projects to share schemes."],"zh":"Free plan 上的一般 project admin 想建立一個「與其他 project 共用設定」的新 project。哪個說法正確？","zo":["此建立選項需要 Jira admin，且不適用 Free plan","只要兩個 project 用同一個 template 就自動共用","只要能管理 project 就能建立 shared configuration","改用 team-managed 就可以共用 schemes"],"ans":"A","why":{"C":"Project admin 與 Jira admin 是兩個不同層級的身分。建立 company-managed project 本身就需要 <strong>Administer Jira</strong> 全域權限，更別說共用設定還要動到站台層級的 scheme。","D":"方向完全相反。TMP 根本沒有 scheme 這種物件，它的設定全部長在自己的 project 裡，是最不可能共用的一種——想共用設定只能用 CMP。","A":"正解。官方 Create a new project 頁明訂：<strong>Share settings with an existing project 只有 Jira admin 在建立 company-managed project 時才選得到，而且 Free 方案沒有這個選項</strong>。題目裡的「一般 project admin」與「Free plan」兩個條件各自都足以否決這件事。","B":"用同一個 template 只代表兩個 project 的<strong>起點</strong>相同，之後各自獨立，不會自動產生任何共用關係。這是最常被誤解的一組概念。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/create-a-new-project/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/what-are-team-managed-and-company-managed-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.1.1-006","sec":"620.1.1","dom":"620.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A team of only three people must reuse another department's shared configuration and delivers every two weeks. Which option is more appropriate?","opts":["Because the team is small, it must be team-managed.","Company-managed with Scrum, and confirm the shared configuration","Kanban, because it suits all small teams","Team-managed with Scrum, then move to company-managed later"],"zh":"只有三個人的團隊，卻必須沿用其他部門的共用設定，而且每兩週交付一次。哪個方案更合適？","zo":["人少，所以一定要 team-managed","Company-managed ＋ Scrum，並確認 shared configuration","Kanban，因為所有小團隊都適用","Team-managed ＋ Scrum，之後再搬到 company-managed"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"官方的選型準則是「團隊要<strong>自主</strong>管理自己的設定，還是要與其他 project 維持<strong>標準化</strong>」，跟團隊有幾個人完全無關。三人團隊照樣可能需要遵循全公司的統一流程。","B":"正解。題目給了兩條線索：「必須沿用其他部門的共用設定」指向 <strong>company-managed ＋ shared configuration</strong>（只有 CMP 的 scheme 能跨 project 共用）；「每兩週交付一次」則是固定週期，指向 <strong>Scrum</strong>。兩個條件要分別對應到管理方式與 template。","C":"人數不決定 template。題目明確給了「每兩週交付一次」這個固定週期的訊號，那是 Scrum 的特徵；Kanban 適合的是沒有固定週期的連續流。","D":"「先用 TMP 之後再搬」聽起來務實，實際上代價很高：<strong>沒有一鍵轉換</strong>，只能建新 project 再 bulk move，而且 sprint、story points 與報表歷史都會遺失。當需求一開始就明確指向 CMP 時，不該刻意繞這一圈。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/what-are-team-managed-and-company-managed-projects/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/migrate-between-team-managed-and-company-managed-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.1.1-007","sec":"620.1.1","dom":"620.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A team needs to group issues by Frontend, Backend, and Database, and have each module's owner assigned automatically. Which kind of project should be created?","opts":["Either kind works, because both have components.","Team-managed, using labels for grouping","Company-managed, using components and setting each component's default assignee","Team-managed, using custom roles for grouping"],"zh":"團隊需要把 issue 依「前端／後端／資料庫」分組，並讓各模組負責人自動被指派。該建哪種 project？","zo":["任一種都可以，components 兩邊都有","Team-managed，用 labels 分組","Company-managed，用 components 並設定 component 的 default assignee","Team-managed，用自訂 role 分組"],"ans":"C","why":{"B":"Labels 只是一串沒有任何屬性的純文字，可以拿來分組，但<strong>不能設定負責人，也就無法自動指派</strong>。題目的後半句需求它答不出來。","C":"正解。<strong>components 只有 company-managed 才有</strong>，而且每個 component 可以指定 Component lead 並把 Default assignee 設成 Component lead——新 issue 一掛上該 component、Assignee 留 Automatic，就會自動指派給對應的負責人，完全對上題目的兩個需求。","D":"Role 控制的是「誰能做什麼」（權限），不是「工作屬於哪個模組」（分類）。拿 role 來分組是把兩件不同的事混在一起，而且一樣做不到自動指派。","A":"錯在「兩邊都有」。<strong>components 是 company-managed 專屬功能</strong>，team-managed 完全沒有這個東西，所以兩種 project 並非都可以。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/what-are-team-managed-and-company-managed-projects/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/how-do-features-differ-based-on-project-type/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.1.1-008","sec":"620.1.1","dom":"620.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A team needs to give external contractors access to its board, but several HR-related issues must be visible only to internal staff. Which kind of project can support this?","opts":["Neither kind can; a separate project must be created.","Team-managed, with the project set to Limited","Team-managed, with role restrictions on the HR issue type","Company-managed, using an issue security scheme"],"zh":"團隊要對外部承包商開放board，但其中幾張 HR 相關 issue 只能內部看。哪種 project 才做得到？","zo":["兩種都做不到，必須另開 project","Team-managed，把 project 設成 Limited","Team-managed，對 HR issue type 設 role 限制","Company-managed，使用 issue security scheme"],"ans":"D","why":{"B":"Limited 這個 access level 只影響「<strong>沒有被明確加入</strong>」的人的預設角色。承包商既然要board，就一定會被加進來，加進來之後他看得到 project 裡的<strong>全部</strong> issue，包含 HR 那幾張。","C":"對 issue type 設 role 限制有兩個致命限制：<strong>只對之後新建的 issue 生效</strong>（既有的 HR issue 不受保護），而且無法用 Reporter、Assignee 這類動態對象授權，顆粒度遠遠不夠。","D":"正解。<strong>issue security scheme 是 company-managed 專屬</strong>，它可以在同一個 project 裡對<strong>個別 issue</strong> 設定 security level，只有 level 裡的成員（role、group、Reporter、Current assignee 等）看得到；其他人連搜尋都搜不到那張 issue。這是唯一能做到「同一個 project 內部分隱藏」的機制。","A":"CMP 在同一個 project 內就能達成，不需要把 HR 的 issue 拆到另一個 project 去。這個選項低估了 issue security 的能力。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/what-are-team-managed-and-company-managed-projects/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/what-are-next-gen-project-settings/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.1.1-009","sec":"620.1.1","dom":"620.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A company wants visitors who are not logged in to be able to view a public roadmap project. Which statement is correct?","opts":["A company-managed project grants the Browse Projects permission to Public, and the site allows anonymous access.","Setting a team-managed project to Limited is sufficient.","Any project can be viewed anonymously as long as its board link is shared.","Setting a team-managed project to Open is sufficient."],"zh":"公司想讓不用登入的訪客也能看「公開 roadmap」project。下列何者正確？","zo":["Company-managed 把 Browse Projects 授予 Public，且站台允許匿名存取","Team-managed 設成 Limited 即可","任何 project 只要分享 board 連結就能匿名看","Team-managed 設成 Open 即可"],"ans":"A","why":{"D":"這是最容易誤選的一個。Open 的意思是「站台上<strong>任何已登入的使用者</strong>自動成為 Member」，它的範圍仍然是站台內部，<strong>不等於公開到網際網路</strong>；而且 TMP 完全不支援匿名。","A":"正解。匿名存取<strong>只有 company-managed 做得到</strong>：在 permission scheme 裡把 <strong>Browse Projects 授予 Public</strong>，同時站台層也要允許匿名存取，兩個條件都成立，未登入的訪客才看得到。","B":"Limited 的範圍仍然是「這個 Jira 站台上有帳號的人」，只是決定沒被加入的人預設拿到 Viewer。它跟「不用登入」完全是兩回事。","C":"board 的可見度取決於底層 saved filter 的分享設定與各 project 的 Browse 權限，<strong>不會因為把連結貼出去就變成公開</strong>。未登入的人點連結只會被導向登入畫面。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/next-gen-permissions/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/what-are-team-managed-and-company-managed-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.1.1-010","sec":"620.1.1","dom":"620.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A team-managed project has been in use for six months, and the company wants to bring it into its standard process. When it is moved to a company-managed project, which of the following is lost and cannot be recovered?","opts":["Issue comments and attachments","Story points and report history","Issue keys (the original keys are retained)","Issue creation dates"],"zh":"一個 team-managed project 用了半年，公司要把它納入標準流程。搬到 company-managed 時，下列哪一項會遺失、無法恢復？","zo":["Issue 的留言與附件","Story points 與報表歷史","Issue key（會保留原 key）","Issue 的建立時間"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"留言與附件是 issue 本身的資料，會跟著 bulk move 一起搬過去，完整保留。","B":"正解。官方遷移頁明列：<strong>story points 以及 velocity 與報表的歷史不會帶過去</strong>，這是最讓團隊心痛的損失，因為過去的估算基準就此消失。同樣要重建的還有 custom field、workflow 的 status 與 issue types，但那些至少可以重做，歷史數據無法重建。","C":"這個敘述本身就錯了：<strong>issue key 會換成新 project 的 key</strong>，不會保留原本的。不過舊連結會由 Jira 自動轉址，所以不算「遺失」。","D":"建立時間、更新時間這類系統欄位會原樣保留，不受搬移影響。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/migrate-between-team-managed-and-company-managed-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.1.2-001","sec":"620.1.2","dom":"620.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"In a team-managed project with the Open access level, the project administrator adds Ming as a Viewer. Why can Ming still edit issues?","opts":["Open makes every user on the site a Member automatically, and assigned roles add to access rather than override it.","The Jira cache has not been refreshed.","In team-managed projects, Viewer is equivalent to Member.","The Viewer role itself can edit all issues."],"zh":"一個 Open 的 team-managed project 裡，project admin 把小明加成 Viewer，為什麼小明仍然可以編輯 issue？","zo":["Open 讓全站使用者自動成為 Member，指派的 role 是加總不是覆寫","Jira 快取沒更新","Viewer 在 team-managed 等同 Member","Viewer 本身可以編輯所有 issue"],"ans":"A","why":{"D":"Viewer 沒有 Edit any issue 權限，它本身確實不能編輯 issue。小明能編輯是因為 Open 給了他 Member，而不是因為 Viewer 有這個能力。","A":"正解。官方原句寫得很清楚：指派的 role 是 <strong>add to</strong>（而非 override）access level 給的權限。Open 已經讓全站使用者自動成為 Member，再指派一個 Viewer 只是疊加上去，取聯集之後小明仍然是 Member。想真正限制某個人，順序要反過來——<strong>先把 access level 降到 Limited，再用 role 往上加</strong>。","B":"跟快取完全無關。這是 TMP 權限模型刻意的設計（疊加而非覆蓋），重新整理一百次結果也一樣。","C":"三個內建 role 的權限差很多：Viewer 只有 Collaborate 那一組（瀏覽、留言、加附件），Member 才有建立與編輯 issue 的能力，兩者不能劃上等號。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/manage-how-people-access-your-team-managed-project/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/next-gen-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.1.2-002","sec":"620.1.2","dom":"620.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Does removing someone from the Access page of a team-managed project guarantee that they can no longer view the project?","opts":["Yes. They lose all access immediately after being removed.","No. They may still have access through the Open or Limited access level, or through a group that has been added.","Yes, as long as they are not a Jira administrator.","No. Only a site admin can truly remove them."],"zh":"從 team-managed project 的 Access 頁移除某人，就保證他無法再查看這個 project 嗎？","zo":["是，移除後立即失去所有存取","否，他可能仍透過 Open／Limited 的 access level 或被加入的 group 取得權限","是，只要他不是 Jira admin","否，只有 site admin 能真正移除"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"從 Access 頁移除，只處理掉「<strong>直接指派給個人</strong>」這一個權限來源，其他來源依然有效。這是排查權限問題時最容易漏掉的一點。","B":"正解。官方特別提醒兩件事：如果曾經把一個<strong>全站 group</strong> 加進某個 role，被移除的個人仍可能透過 group 拿到權限；此外 <strong>Open 與 Limited 這兩種 access level 本來就會給所有站台使用者一個預設 role</strong>。要真正擋住一個人，得把三條路徑（直接指派、group、access level）都檢查過。","C":"Jira admin 確實永遠進得了 project settings，但他不是唯一的例外——group 成員資格與 access level 同樣會讓移除失效。這個選項只講對了其中一小部分。","D":"Access 頁的成員移除，<strong>project admin 自己就能執行</strong>，不需要 site admin。site admin 管的是站台層級的帳號存廢，那是另一回事。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/add-people-to-team-managed-projects/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/manage-how-people-access-your-team-managed-project/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.1.2-003","sec":"620.1.2","dom":"620.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"What can the built-in Viewer role in a team-managed project do by default?","opts":["Browse and create issues","Browse only, without adding comments","Browse, add comments, add attachments, and edit or delete their own comments and attachments","Browse and delete anyone's comments"],"zh":"Team-managed project 的內建 Viewer 預設可以做什麼？","zo":["瀏覽並建立 issue","只能瀏覽，不能留言","瀏覽、留言、加附件、編輯或刪除自己的留言與附件","瀏覽並刪除所有人的留言"],"ans":"C","why":{"B":"Viewer 並不是純唯讀。這是很常見的誤解，也是考題愛設的陷阱——「Limited 之下沒被加入的人能不能留言？」答案是<strong>能</strong>。","C":"正解。依官方權限表，Viewer 擁有整組 <strong>Collaborate</strong> 權限：Add comments、Add attachments、Edit own comments、Delete own comments 與 Delete own attachments。也就是說他可以參與討論、補充資料，只是動不了工作本身（不能建立、編輯或轉換 issue）。","D":"刪除<strong>任何人</strong>的留言屬於「Manage issues」群組，是 Administrator 才有的權限；Viewer 只能刪自己的。","A":"Create issues 屬於「Work on issues」這一組權限，<strong>Viewer 沒有</strong>；它是 Member 才有的能力。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/next-gen-permissions/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.1.2-004","sec":"620.1.2","dom":"620.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A Member of a team-managed project wants to move an issue to another project. Is the Move any issue permission in the source project alone sufficient?","opts":["No. A Jira administrator must move it on their behalf.","No. The Administrator role is required in both projects.","Yes.","No. The Create issues permission in the destination project is also required."],"zh":"Team-managed 的 Member 想把一張 issue 搬到另一個 project。只有來源 project 的 Move any issue 權限夠嗎？","zo":["不夠，需要 Jira admin 代為搬移","不夠，兩邊都要 Administrator","夠","不夠，還需要目的地 project 的 Create issues 權限"],"ans":"D","why":{"C":"不夠。官方在 Move any issue 的說明中寫得很明白：要成功搬移，操作者<strong>還需要在目標 space 建立 work item 的權限</strong>。只有來源端的權限，目的地清單裡根本不會出現那個 project。","D":"正解。搬移的本質是「在目的地建立一張新的 issue，再把資料搬過去」，所以<strong>目的地的 Create issues 權限是必要條件</strong>。這也體現了官方的通則：跨 project 的動作，兩邊的權限都要有。另外提醒，搬完之後想讀得到，在目的地還得有 Browse 權限。","A":"一般成員只要具備對應權限就能自己搬移，不需要 Jira admin 代勞。這個選項把權限問題誤當成身分問題。","B":"Administrator role 並不是必要條件。真正需要的是<strong>兩端的特定權限</strong>——來源端能搬、目的端能建，跟是不是管理員無關。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/next-gen-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.1.2-005","sec":"620.1.2","dom":"620.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A team-managed project has just enabled Sprints. The board is completely empty, but the backlog contains work. What should be checked first?","opts":["Whether a sprint has been started","Whether the project has been set to Private","Whether the project needs to be deleted and re-created","Whether a Done column is missing"],"zh":"剛啟用 Sprints 的 team-managed project，board 一片空白但 backlog 有工作。先查什麼？","zo":["是否已開始 sprint","是否把 project 設成 Private","是否需要刪除 project 重建","是否缺少 Done column"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"正解。官方 Get started 頁原句：啟用 Sprints 功能之後，<strong>board 在你開始一個 sprint 之前不會顯示任何 work item</strong>。因為 Scrum board 只呈現目前進行中的 sprint，工作都待在 backlog。做法是到 Backlog 建立 sprint、把 issue 拉進去，再按 Start sprint。","B":"Private 決定的是「誰看得到這個 project」，跟 board 上顯示哪些卡片無關。何況真的是 Private 擋住的話，使用者連 backlog 都看不到，不會出現「backlog 有工作」的現象。","C":"資料完全沒有遺失，backlog 裡的工作都好好的——這只是 board 視圖與 sprint 之間的關係，重建 project 是完全不必要而且會造成損失的過度反應。","D":"每個 board 一定會有最右邊的 Done column（TMP 甚至不允許刪掉最後一個 Done 欄），所以這不可能是原因。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/get-started-with-team-managed-projects/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.1.2-006","sec":"620.1.2","dom":"620.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"What happens when a custom role in a team-managed project is deleted?","opts":["People who held that role are removed from the project.","People are not removed from the project, but notifications and issue type restrictions tied to that role are affected.","The built-in Viewer role is deleted as well.","The user accounts of people who held that role are deleted."],"zh":"刪除 team-managed project 的自訂 role 會發生什麼？","zo":["持有該 role 的人被移出 project","人不會被移出，但綁在該 role 的 notifications 與 issue type restrictions 會受影響","內建的 Viewer 也會一起被刪","持有該 role 的使用者帳號被刪除"],"ans":"B","why":{"D":"這裡有三個不同層次要分清楚：<strong>role 是權限容器、project 成員資格是這個 project 的名單、站台帳號是整個 Atlassian 站台的身分</strong>。刪 role 只動到第一層，完全碰不到後兩層。","A":"官方明講：<strong>刪除 role 並不會把持有該 role 的人移出 project</strong>。他們仍然是成員，只是少了這個 role 帶來的權限。","B":"正解。官方列出刪除自訂 role 會影響兩件事：<strong>notifications</strong>（通知設定裡若指定通知這個 role 就會失效）與 <strong>issue type restrictions</strong>（限制某些 type 只有特定 role 能用的設定也會失效），這些之後要重新設定。人則留在 project 裡不受影響。","C":"三個內建 role（Viewer、Member、Administrator）<strong>本來就不能刪除</strong>，更不會因為刪一個自訂 role 而連帶消失。想要客製化就用 Duplicate 複製一份再改。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/manage-how-people-access-your-team-managed-project/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.1.2-007","sec":"620.1.2","dom":"620.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A regular user reports, \"I don't have a Create project button.\" In the context of team-managed projects, what is the most likely cause?","opts":["The user's account does not have a Viewer seat for Jira app access.","The user does not have the Administer Jira permission.","A Jira administrator has removed the Create team-managed projects global permission from the user's group.","The user is not an Administrator of any project."],"zh":"一般使用者說「我沒有 Create project 按鈕」。在 team-managed 的情況下，最可能的原因？","zo":["他的帳號沒有 Jira app access 的 Viewer 席次","他沒有 Administer Jira","Jira admin 已從他的群組移除 Create team-managed projects 全域權限","他不是任何 project 的 Administrator"],"ans":"C","why":{"B":"建立 team-managed project <strong>不需要 Administer Jira</strong>——那是建立 company-managed project 的條件。題目已經指明是 TMP 的情境，所以不是這一項。","C":"正解。官方原句是：<strong>預設任何人都能建立 team-managed space，但 Jira admin 可以透過管理哪些群組擁有這項全域權限來加以限制</strong>。這是站台層級的全域權限「Create team-managed projects」，被收回之後 Projects 選單裡就不會出現 Create project。","D":"Project role 管的是「在某個 project 裡能做什麼」，跟「能不能建立新的 project」完全無關——後者是全域權限的範疇。","A":"有 Jira 授權席次的使用者<strong>預設就擁有建立 TMP 的全域權限</strong>；而完全沒有席次的人根本進不了 Jira，不會出現「登入後找不到按鈕」的狀況。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/create-edit-and-delete-team-managed-projects/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/manage-global-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.1.2-008","sec":"620.1.2","dom":"620.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Which statement about project key rules in team-managed projects is correct?","opts":["A key must be at least 3 characters and can contain lowercase letters.","A key can contain hyphens and underscores.","After a key is changed, the old key is immediately released for use by other projects.","A key must be at least 2 characters, start with an uppercase letter, and contain only uppercase letters and numbers; a key change can take up to 10 minutes to take effect."],"zh":"Team-managed project 的 key 規則，下列何者正確？","zo":["至少 3 字元、可含小寫字母","可含連字號與底線","改 key 後舊 key 立即釋放給其他 project 使用","至少 2 字元、大寫字母開頭、只含大寫字母與數字；改 key 最多 10 分鐘生效"],"ans":"D","why":{"D":"正解。官方 Create and edit team-managed spaces 逐條列出：<strong>至少 2 個字元、必須以大寫字母開頭、只能包含大寫字母與數字</strong>；此外還說明改 key 之後<strong>最多要 10 分鐘</strong>才會反映在 board 上，這段期間看到舊 key 是正常的。","A":"錯兩個地方：下限是 <strong>2</strong> 個字元不是 3，而且<strong>不允許小寫字母</strong>。","B":"key 只允許<strong>大寫字母與數字</strong>，連字號、底線、空白與任何符號都不行。","C":"舊的 key 不會立即釋放，它會被存進 <strong>Previous keys</strong> 作為 alias，讓舊連結繼續導向新 issue。除非有人刻意去刪除那筆 previous key，舊 key 才會釋出給其他 project 使用（代價是所有引用舊 key 的連結全部失效）。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/create-edit-and-delete-team-managed-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.1.2-009","sec":"620.1.2","dom":"620.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"In a team-managed project with the Limited access level, what can a newly hired colleague who has not been added to the project do?","opts":["View the project, add comments, and add attachments, but not create or edit issues","View, create, and edit issues","View the project but not add comments","They cannot see the project."],"zh":"一個 Limited 的 team-managed project，某位剛入職、沒被加進 project 的同事會得到什麼能力？","zo":["能看、留言、加附件，但不能建立或編輯 issue","能看、建立、編輯 issue","能看但不能留言","看不到 project"],"ans":"A","why":{"D":"完全看不到 project 的是 <strong>Private</strong>；Limited 之下全站使用者仍然找得到也進得去，只是能做的事有限。","A":"正解。官方原句：設成 Limited 時，<strong>站台上的任何人都可以檢視與留言</strong>，因為系統會自動給他們 <strong>Viewer</strong> 這個 role。而 Viewer 擁有整組 Collaborate 權限——瀏覽、留言、加附件，以及編輯或刪除自己的留言與附件。","B":"建立與編輯 issue 屬於 <strong>Member</strong> 的能力，那是 access level 設成 <strong>Open</strong> 時才會自動給予的。Limited 只給到 Viewer。","C":"這是最容易誤選的一個——<strong>Viewer 不是純唯讀，它可以留言與加附件</strong>。「Limited 之下沒被加入的人能不能留言？」答案是能。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/next-gen-permissions/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/manage-how-people-access-your-team-managed-project/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.1.2-010","sec":"620.1.2","dom":"620.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A project administrator adds an external designer as a Member, but the designer says, \"I can see the issues, but I can't drag or edit them.\" What is the most likely cause?","opts":["The project is Private.","The designer does not have Jira app access (a license seat), so a site admin must be contacted.","Members cannot edit issues by design.","The designer also needs the Administrator role."],"zh":"Project admin 把外包設計師加為 Member，但他說「看得到 issue、卻拖不動也改不了」。最可能的原因？","zo":["project 是 Private","他沒有 Jira app access（授權席次），要找 site admin","Member 本來就不能編輯","他還需要 Administrator role"],"ans":"B","why":{"B":"正解。官方原句：<strong>有些權限需要 Jira 的 app access（授權席次），而只有 site admin 能授予個人 app access</strong>。Viewer 可以給任何站台使用者不必席次，但 Member 的編輯、拖曳、轉換狀態這類權限都需要席次——所以會出現「看得到、動不了」這種典型症狀。","C":"Member 本來就具備 Edit any issue 與 Transition any issue 等權限，所以問題不在 role 給錯。","D":"Administrator 是管理 project 設定的角色，並不是「能編輯 issue」的必要條件。給他 Administrator 不但解決不了席次問題，還會過度授權。","A":"Private 只影響「<strong>沒有被明確加入</strong>」的人，而題目裡這位設計師已經被加為 Member 了，所以不是這個原因。何況真的被 Private 擋住的話，他連 issue 都看不到。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/manage-how-people-access-your-team-managed-project/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.1.3-001","sec":"620.1.3","dom":"620.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Can a Story be both a parent and a child at the same time?","opts":["Yes. A Story can sit under an Epic and also have its own sub-tasks.","No. Only an Epic can be a parent.","No. Only a Sub-task can be a child.","Yes, but only on the Premium plan."],"zh":"Story 可以同時是 parent 也是 child 嗎？","zo":["可以：Story 可掛在 Epic 下，同時有自己的 sub-task","不可以，只有 Epic 能當 parent","不可以，只有 Sub-task 能當 child","可以，但只有 Premium 方案"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"正解。官方的三層階層是 <strong>Epic（parent）→ standard（Story／Task／Bug）→ sub-task（child）</strong>，而 Story 正好位於中間層——它可以掛在某個 Epic 底下當 child，同時自己也能有 sub-task 當 parent。這正是 standard 層的特性。","B":"不只 Epic 能當 parent。standard 層的 issue（Story、Task、Bug）也可以是 sub-task 的 parent，這是最常見的用法。","C":"不只 Sub-task 能當 child。standard 層的 issue 掛在 epic 底下時，它本身就是 epic 的 child。","D":"三層階層（epic／standard／sub-task）是<strong>所有方案都有</strong>的預設結構；Premium 才需要的是「epic 之上再加更高層級」的自訂 hierarchy。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/what-are-issue-types/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.1.3-002","sec":"620.1.3","dom":"620.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Which of the following is NOT one of the default standard-level issue types in a software project?","opts":["Bug","Sub-task","Story","Task"],"zh":"下列哪一個不屬於 Software project 預設的 standard 層 issue type？","zo":["Bug","Sub-task","Story","Task"],"ans":"B","why":{"D":"Task 屬於 standard 層，適合用在不需要以使用者故事描述的一般工作。","A":"Bug 屬於 standard 層，是 Software project 的預設 type 之一。","B":"正解。<strong>Sub-task 位於 child 層（hierarchy level −1）</strong>，不是 standard 層——它只能掛在某個 standard issue 底下，不能獨立存在，也不能進 sprint。Software project 預設的 standard 層 type 是 Story、Task、Bug 三個。","C":"Story 屬於 standard 層，是 Scrum 團隊估點與規劃的主要單位。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/what-are-issue-types/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.1.3-003","sec":"620.1.3","dom":"620.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A team requires that a parent issue can be resolved only after all of its sub-tasks are completed. What should be done?","opts":["Add a validator to the sub-task workflow.","Simply create the sub-tasks; Jira blocks the transition automatically.","Add a Subtask Blocking Condition to the parent's Resolve transition.","Rename the issue type to Done."],"zh":"團隊要求所有 sub-task 完成後，parent 才能 Resolve。該怎麼做？","zo":["在 sub-task 的 workflow 加 validator","只要建立 sub-task 即可，Jira 會自動擋","在 parent 的 Resolve transition 加 Subtask Blocking Condition","把 issue type 改名為 Done"],"ans":"C","why":{"B":"建立父子關係<strong>不會產生任何流程約束</strong>。Jira 預設允許 parent 在 sub-task 未完成時就被關閉，要限制必須自己加設定。","C":"正解。官方 Configure subtasks 頁的做法：在 <strong>parent 的 workflow</strong> 上找到通往 Resolve 的 transition，加一個 <strong>Subtask Blocking Condition</strong>，並勾選 sub-task 必須達到哪些狀態。因為它是 condition，效果是 sub-task 沒完成時<strong>那個轉換按鈕根本不會出現</strong>。注意這是 CMP 專屬功能，TMP 得改用 automation。","D":"這是把 <strong>issue type（工作的種類）與 status（工作的狀態）搞混了</strong>。改名字不會產生任何流程限制。","A":"方向錯了兩次：<strong>要擋的是 parent 的 transition，不是 sub-task 的</strong>；而且這件事該用 condition（直接隱藏按鈕）而不是 validator（按下去才報錯）。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-sub-tasks/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.1.3-004","sec":"620.1.3","dom":"620.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A Jira administrator wants to disable sub-tasks across the site, but sub-tasks are already in use on the site. What should be done first?","opts":["Delete all sub-tasks.","Turn off sub-tasks in each project individually.","Disable sub-tasks directly; existing sub-tasks are converted automatically.","Convert the existing sub-tasks to a standard issue type, and then disable sub-tasks."],"zh":"Jira admin 想停用全站的 sub-task，但站台上已有使用中的 sub-task。應先做什麼？","zo":["先刪除所有 sub-task","在每個 project 個別關閉","直接關閉，既有 sub-task 會自動轉型","先把既有 sub-task 轉成 standard issue type，再停用"],"ans":"D","why":{"C":"Jira <strong>不允許</strong>在還有既存 sub-task 的情況下直接停用，也不會幫你自動轉型；它會擋下這個動作。","D":"正解。官方原句：<strong>停用這個功能之前，既有的 subtask 必須先被轉換成 standard work type</strong>。實務流程是：用 JQL 把所有 sub-task 搜出來（<code>hierarchyLevel = -1</code>），用 bulk move 或逐一 Move 轉成 standard type，全部清空之後 Disable 才按得下去。","A":"刪除會永久損失資料，而且官方並沒有要求刪除——正確做法是<strong>轉換</strong>而不是刪除，資料可以完整保留。","B":"sub-task 是<strong>全站設定</strong>（⚙ → Issues → Sub-tasks），沒有 project 層級的個別開關，所以「在每個 project 個別關閉」這件事不存在。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-sub-tasks/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.1.3-005","sec":"620.1.3","dom":"620.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A Jira administrator created a new issue type, but it does not appear as an option in a company-managed project. What should be checked first?","opts":["Whether the project's issue type scheme includes the new issue type","Whether the project needs to be renamed","Whether the board needs to be re-created","Whether the Premium plan is required"],"zh":"Jira admin 建立了新的 issue type，但 company-managed project 裡看不到這個選項。先查什麼？","zo":["該 project 的 issue type scheme 是否包含它","是否需要重新命名 project","是否需要重建 board","是否需要 Premium 方案"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"正解。官方原句：<strong>work type 是透過 work type scheme 連結到 space 的</strong>。在 CMP，issue type 是全站物件，Jira admin 建立之後還必須<strong>把它加進該 project 所使用的 issue type scheme</strong>，它才會出現在建立畫面的選單裡。這是兩個獨立的步驟，很容易漏掉第二步。","B":"project 的名稱與它能使用哪些 issue type 完全無關。","C":"board 決定的是「issue 怎麼顯示」，不決定「有哪些 issue type 可用」——後者由 issue type scheme 決定。","D":"建立與管理 issue type 是所有方案都有的基本功能，跟 Premium 無關。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/what-are-issue-types/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-sub-tasks/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.1.3-006","sec":"620.1.3","dom":"620.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A Jira administrator adds a new standard issue type named Initiative. Will it automatically be placed above Epic?","opts":["Yes. The name determines the hierarchy level.","No. The name and the hierarchy configuration are separate; a higher level requires the Premium issue type hierarchy setting.","Yes, as long as it is added to the issue type scheme.","No. Jira always has only three levels."],"zh":"Jira admin 新增一個叫「Initiative」的 standard issue type。它會自動位於 Epic 之上嗎？","zo":["會，名稱決定層級","不會，名稱與 hierarchy 設定是兩件事；要更高層級需 Premium 的 issue hierarchy 設定","會，只要把它加進 issue type scheme","不會，Jira 永遠只有三層"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"階層位置是由 <strong>hierarchy configuration</strong> 決定的，跟 issue type 叫什麼名字完全無關。把一個 standard type 取名叫 Initiative，它仍然是 standard 層。","B":"正解。官方說明：<strong>要讓某個 type 位於 Epic 之上，必須在 Premium／Enterprise 的 issue type hierarchy 設定裡，把一個標準 work type 配置到更高的層級</strong>。命名與階層是兩件完全獨立的事——這是考題很愛設的陷阱。","C":"把 type 加進 issue type scheme 只是讓它在該 project「可以被使用」，它的階層層級不會因此改變，仍然停在 standard 層。","D":"Jira 的<strong>預設</strong>階層是三層，但 Premium 以上可以在 epic 之上再加自訂層級，所以「永遠只有三層」的說法不正確。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/what-are-issue-types/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.1.3-007","sec":"620.1.3","dom":"620.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Defects reported by the QA team require two mandatory fields, Steps to reproduce and Severity, and an additional Verified status before they can be closed. What should you recommend in a company-managed project?","opts":["Add a Verified status to the Story workflow.","Mark bugs with a label; no new issue type is needed.","Create (or reuse) a Bug issue type with a dedicated screen and a dedicated workflow, and have a Jira administrator update the three corresponding schemes.","Create a sub-task issue type to handle QA."],"zh":"QA 團隊回報的缺陷需要「Steps to reproduce」「Severity」兩個必填欄位，並且要多一個「Verified」狀態才能關閉。在 company-managed project 該如何推薦？","zo":["把 Story 的 workflow 加 Verified 狀態即可","用 label 標記 Bug，不必新 type","建立（或沿用）Bug issue type，並配專用 screen 與專用 workflow，由 Jira admin 改對應的三張 scheme","建立 sub-task type 處理 QA"],"ans":"C","why":{"B":"label 只是一串沒有屬性的文字，<strong>既不能讓欄位變成必填，也不能改變流程</strong>。當需求同時涉及欄位與 workflow 時，label 的能力遠遠不夠。","C":"正解。在 CMP，issue type 本身沒有行為，行為是透過三張 scheme 對應出來的：<strong>workflow scheme</strong>（走哪套流程）、<strong>issue type screen scheme</strong>（用哪張畫面）、<strong>field configuration scheme</strong>（哪些欄位必填）。題目同時要求不同的必填欄位與不同的狀態，兩個條件都成立，正是該建立獨立 issue type 的標準情境。這三張 scheme 都要請 Jira admin 修改。","D":"sub-task 的用途是把一件工作<strong>拆給不同人在同一個 sprint 內做</strong>，它是拆工的層級，不是用來分類缺陷的手段。","A":"直接改 Story 的 workflow 會影響<strong>所有</strong>使用該 workflow 的 Story，把只有缺陷才需要的 Verified 狀態強加給所有人；而且這完全沒有解決「兩個必填欄位」的需求。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/what-are-issue-types/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.1.3-008","sec":"620.1.3","dom":"620.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A product manager wants separate reports for mobile work and web work, but both use exactly the same workflow and fields. What is the most appropriate approach?","opts":["Create a separate project for each.","Use sub-tasks to distinguish them.","Create a separate issue type for each.","Categorize the work with components (or labels), and report with a Pie chart by component."],"zh":"PM 想把「行動版」與「網頁版」的工作分開看報表，但兩者流程和欄位完全相同。最合適的做法？","zo":["為兩者各建一個 project","用 sub-task 區分","為兩者各建一個 issue type","用 component（或 label）分類，報表用 Pie chart by component"],"ans":"D","why":{"C":"題目已經明說「流程和欄位完全相同」——這正好是<strong>不該</strong>新建 issue type 的訊號。判斷準則很明確：只有當這類工作需要<strong>不同的 workflow</strong> 或<strong>不同的必填欄位</strong>時才值得獨立成 type，否則只會讓 scheme 愈養愈亂。","D":"正解。純粹的分類需求應該用 <strong>component</strong>（CMP 專屬，可設負責人）或 <strong>label</strong>（全站共用、任何人可加）解決，報表則用 Pie chart 或 Two Dimensional 依 component 分群即可，完全不必動到 issue type 與三張 scheme。","A":"為了分類而拆成兩個 project 是過度反應：不但要維護兩套設定，還會<strong>切斷共用的 backlog</strong>，讓團隊沒辦法一起排優先順序。","B":"sub-task 是把一件工作拆成更小的執行單位，屬於<strong>拆工</strong>而非<strong>分類</strong>；而且 sub-task 的估點不計入報表，用它分類會讓數字全錯。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/what-are-issue-types/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.1.3-009","sec":"620.1.3","dom":"620.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A manager has attached 600 sub-tasks to a single Task and complains that the parent does not show the list of child issues and that time tracking does not include the sub-tasks. What is the cause?","opts":["A work item displays at most 500 child issues; beyond that, they can be viewed only through search, and time tracking cannot include the sub-tasks. The parent should be split up.","A Task cannot have sub-tasks; a Story should be used instead.","Time tracking requires the Premium plan.","Sub-tasks never roll up time by design."],"zh":"主管把 600 個 sub-task 掛在同一張 Task 下，抱怨 parent 上看不到 child 清單，time tracking 也不把 sub-task 算進來。原因是什麼？","zo":["一個 work item 最多顯示 500 個 child，超過後只能改用搜尋檢視，且 time tracking 無法納入 sub-task，應把 parent 拆開","Task 不能有 sub-task，要改用 Story","Time tracking 需要 Premium","Sub-task 本來就不彙總工時"],"ans":"A","why":{"D":"sub-task 的工時<strong>本來是會</strong>彙總到 parent 的（parent 的 time tracking 面板可以勾選 include sub-tasks）。這題的狀況是因為超過 500 個 child 才失效，不是常態。","A":"正解。官方在 What are work types 的 Best practices 中寫明：<strong>一張 work item 最多只能顯示 500 個 child</strong>，超過之後就得改用搜尋來檢視；而且原句還說「如果你使用 time tracking，將無法納入 subtask」。這正好完整解釋了主管遇到的兩個症狀。官方的建議是把這個 parent 拆成多張，而不是硬塞。","B":"Task 屬於 standard 層，<strong>完全可以有 sub-task</strong>，換成 Story 不會改變任何事——問題出在數量，不是 type。","C":"time tracking 是所有方案都有的基本功能，跟 Premium 無關。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/what-are-issue-types/"],"lvl":3,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.1.3-010","sec":"620.1.3","dom":"620.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Which statement about sub-tasks and sprints is correct?","opts":["A sub-task can be moved into a different sprint on its own.","A sub-task enters and leaves a sprint with its parent and cannot be scheduled into a sprint on its own.","Story points on sub-tasks are counted in the sprint burndown.","The parent must be closed before a sub-task can be created."],"zh":"下列關於 sub-task 與 sprint 的敘述，何者正確？","zo":["Sub-task 可以單獨拉進另一個 sprint","Sub-task 跟著 parent 進出 sprint，不能單獨排 sprint","Sub-task 的 story points 會計入 sprint burndown","Sub-task 必須先關閉 parent 才能建立"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"sub-task <strong>沒有自己獨立的 sprint 欄位</strong>，無法單獨被放進另一個 sprint。","B":"正解。sub-task 永遠<strong>跟著 parent 同進同出 sprint</strong>，在 board 上通常顯示在 parent 所屬的泳道底下（Stories 泳道模式）。這個設計是刻意的——sub-task 是 parent 的一部分，把它們拆到不同 sprint 在邏輯上說不通。","C":"burndown、burnup、velocity 全部<strong>只計算 parent（standard 層）的 story points</strong>，sub-task 就算填了估點也不會被算進去。","D":"建立 sub-task 沒有任何「parent 必須先關閉」之類的前提；正好相反，實務上還常常需要用 Subtask Blocking Condition 來防止 parent 太早被關閉。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/what-are-issue-types/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.1.4-001","sec":"620.1.4","dom":"620.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Does changing the URL field in the project details change the Jira site's URL?","opts":["No. It is a field in the project details for linking to external documentation.","Yes, but it affects only this project's path.","No, because only a Jira administrator can change the site URL; this field is the project key.","Yes. This is the site URL."],"zh":"修改 project details 裡的 URL 欄位，會改掉 Jira 站台的網址嗎？","zo":["不會，它是 project 詳細資料裡連到外部文件的連結欄位","會，但只影響這個 project 的路徑","不會，因為只有 Jira admin 能改站台網址，這個欄位是 project key","會，這就是站台網址"],"ans":"A","why":{"D":"站台網址是在 admin.atlassian.com 的 Update URL 設定的，需要 org admin 權限，跟 project details 裡這個欄位毫無關係。","A":"正解。官方 Edit a space’s details 把 <strong>URL 列為 project 詳細資料裡的一個欄位</strong>，用途是連到相關的外部文件（例如 Confluence space 或產品 roadmap），會顯示在 Projects 目錄上。它跟 Jira 站台本身的網址完全無關——站台網址要到 admin.atlassian.com 用 Update URL 修改。順帶一提，<strong>這個欄位只有 CMP 有</strong>。","B":"project 在網址中的路徑是由 <strong>project key</strong> 決定的（例如 /browse/MOB-12），不是這個 URL 欄位。","C":"這個欄位不是 key，兩者是 Details 頁上並列的不同欄位。而且改站台網址與改 project key 也是兩件不同的事。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/edit-a-projects-details/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.1.4-002","sec":"620.1.4","dom":"620.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Does putting two projects in the same project category make them share a permission scheme automatically?","opts":["Yes.","No. A category is used only for grouping and finding projects in the project directory and in JQL.","Yes, and they also share a workflow.","Only if they are company-managed projects."],"zh":"把兩個 project 放進同一個 category，會讓它們自動共用 permission scheme 嗎？","zo":["會","不會，category 只用於在目錄與 JQL 中分組查找","會，且會共用 workflow","只有 company-managed 會"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"category 不是設定物件，它沒有任何權限或流程的意涵。","B":"正解。官方 categories 頁明說它的用途是<strong>把相似的 project 分在一組，方便在進階搜尋、filter 與報表中查找</strong>。它純粹是一個貼在 project 上的標籤，跟 shared configuration（真正的設定共用）完全是兩回事。","C":"workflow 由 <strong>workflow scheme</strong> 決定，只有共用同一份 scheme 的 project 才會連動，跟 category 無關。","D":"不論是 company-managed 還是 team-managed，都<strong>不會</strong>因為被歸在同一個 category 而共用任何 scheme。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/add-assign-and-delete-project-categories/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.1.4-003","sec":"620.1.4","dom":"620.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"After a project key is changed, links in Confluence pages still display the old key in their text. Will these links necessarily stop working?","opts":["No, because Jira automatically rewrites the text on Confluence pages.","Yes. The old key stops working immediately.","No. An old key kept in Previous keys still redirects to the new key; the links stop working only if the previous key is deleted.","Yes, unless all the links are re-created."],"zh":"改了 project key 之後，寫在 Confluence 頁面裡的舊 key 連結文字沒變。這些連結一定失效嗎？","zo":["否，因為 Jira 會自動改寫 Confluence 頁面文字","是，舊 key 立即失效","否，保留在 Previous keys 的舊 key 仍會導向新 key；刪除 previous key 才會失效","是，除非重新建立所有連結"],"ans":"C","why":{"B":"舊 key 預設會被保留為 <strong>alias</strong>（存在 Previous keys 裡），所以不會立即失效——這正是 Jira 把改 key 設計成安全操作的原因。","C":"正解。舊 key 保留在 <strong>Previous keys</strong> 清單中作為 alias，點下去仍會正確導向新的 issue。官方也提醒：你可以從 Previous keys 刪除舊 key，但這會<strong>限制存取所有引用該舊 key 的 work item</strong>——換句話說，刪除才是真正讓連結失效的動作。","D":"完全不必重建連結。<strong>顯示的文字</strong>與<strong>點下去會到哪裡</strong>是兩件事：文字不會變，但導向是有效的。","A":"Jira <strong>不會去改寫 Confluence 頁面或留言裡的文字</strong>，那些內容不屬於它管轄。看到舊 key 的字樣仍然存在是正常的。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/edit-a-projects-details/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/create-edit-and-delete-team-managed-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.1.4-004","sec":"620.1.4","dom":"620.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Can a regular project administrator restore a company-managed project that is already in the trash?","opts":["Yes, but only team-managed projects can be restored.","Yes, as long as it is within 60 days.","Yes, as long as the user was an Administrator of that project.","No. Restoring requires the Administer Jira global permission."],"zh":"一般 project admin 能把已在 trash 裡的 company-managed project 還原嗎？","zo":["可以，但只能還原 team-managed","可以，只要在 60 天內","可以，只要他曾是該 project 的 Administrator","不行，Restore 需要 Administer Jira 全域權限"],"ans":"D","why":{"C":"曾經是該 project 的 Administrator 只代表擁有 <strong>Administer Projects</strong>，那個權限可以<strong>把 project 丟進</strong> trash，卻不能把它救回來——這個不對稱設計是刻意的。","D":"正解。官方 Restore a project from trash 明訂需要 <strong>Administer Jira 全域權限</strong>（site admin 亦可）。記住這組不對稱：<strong>丟進 trash 相對容易，還原與永久刪除一律要站台管理員</strong>。","A":"還原這個動作<strong>不分 project 類型</strong>，CMP 與 TMP 的條件都一樣是 Administer Jira。（會分類型的是 archive：project admin 只能封存 TMP。）","B":"60 天是<strong>資料保留的期限</strong>，不是權限條件。就算在期限內，沒有 Administer Jira 一樣還原不了；反過來說有這個權限的人在期限內隨時也能提前永久刪除。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/restore-a-project-from-trash/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/move-a-project-to-trash/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.1.4-005","sec":"620.1.4","dom":"620.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"When a company-managed project is archived or moved to the trash, are the shared workflows and schemes it uses deleted along with it?","opts":["No. Moving a project to the trash does not affect shared schemes or workflows.","Yes. They are deleted along with the project after 60 days.","Yes, unless other projects also use them.","Yes. They are deleted immediately."],"zh":"把一個 company-managed project 封存或移到 trash，它引用的共用 workflow 與 scheme 會一起被刪除嗎？","zo":["不會，移到 trash 不影響共用的 scheme／workflow","會，60 天後一起刪","會，除非其他 project 也在用","會，立即刪除"],"ans":"A","why":{"D":"trash 的作用範圍只有 project 與它的資料，站台層級的設定物件一律不受影響。","A":"正解。官方 Archive a space 明文：<strong>這不會影響相關的 scheme、workflow、work type，或任何與其他 space 共用的內容</strong>。原因很單純——scheme 是站台層級的獨立物件，project 只是「引用」它；把引用者收進 trash，被引用的物件當然還在，其他共用它的 project 也照常運作。","B":"60 天後永久刪除的是<strong>這個 project 與它的 issue、components、attachments、versions</strong>，不包含 scheme。scheme 從頭到尾都不在 trash 裡。","C":"不必有「其他 project 也在用」這個條件——scheme 是獨立物件，<strong>不論有沒有別人共用，都不會因為某個 project 進 trash 而被刪除</strong>。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/archive-a-project/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/move-a-project-to-trash/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.1.4-006","sec":"620.1.4","dom":"620.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Why can't a certain project navigation tab be removed?","opts":["A tab cannot be removed once it contains data.","It may be the default tab, or it may be a List or Apps tab, which cannot be removed.","Tabs can never be changed.","Only a Jira administrator can remove tabs."],"zh":"為什麼無法移除某個 project navigation tab？","zo":["tab 一旦有資料就不能移除","它可能是 default tab，或是不能移除的 List／Apps 類型","所有 tab 永遠不能變動","只有 Jira admin 能移除 tab"],"ans":"B","why":{"B":"正解。官方 navigation 頁列出兩種擋住移除的情況：<strong>它是目前的 default tab</strong>（一個 space 永遠必須保留一個 default，要先把 default 換成別的 tab 才移除得掉），或者<strong>它是 List 與 Apps 這類系統固定項目</strong>。移除過的 tab 之後可以用導覽列的 + → Add to navigation 加回來。","C":"navigation 是可以調整的——project admin 或 board admin 能設定預設、改名、排序、移除與還原。","D":"調整 navigation 是 <strong>project admin 或 board admin</strong> 的能力，不必找 Jira admin。","A":"跟資料量完全無關。tab 上有沒有內容不影響它能不能被移除。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>官方原句：<em>Note that the List and Apps tabs can't be removed.</em>（2026-09-09 查核）。但 <strong>2026-09-09 實測：CMP 與 TMP 各試一次，List tab 都移得掉</strong>——兩種類型都成立，研判是官方文件沒跟上介面改版（Apps tab 未單獨驗證）。<strong>作答仍以官方原句為準</strong>，因為考題取材自官方文件。另外實測發現 <strong>Set as default 只有 TMP 的 tab 選單才有</strong>，CMP 沒有這一項。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/manage-and-customize-the-project-navigation/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.1.4-007","sec":"620.1.4","dom":"620.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"After a project has been in the trash for 60 days, can it still be restored at any time?","opts":["Yes, as long as no other project uses the same key.","Yes. The trash is a permanent backup.","No. It is permanently deleted when the period ends, and an administrator can also permanently delete it earlier.","Yes, but a paid plan is required."],"zh":"Project 在 trash 裡滿 60 天後，還可以隨時還原嗎？","zo":["可以，只要沒有其他 project 用同一個 key","可以，trash 是永久備份","不可以，期滿會永久刪除；管理員也可提前永久刪除","可以，但要付費方案"],"ans":"C","why":{"B":"trash <strong>不是無限期的備份機制</strong>，它只是給誤刪一個 60 天的緩衝期。真正的備份要另外做站台備份。","C":"正解。官方 Delete a space 原句：<strong>一旦從 trash 永久刪除 space，就無法再復原</strong>。而且要特別注意——60 天並不是保證：<strong>任何持有 Administer Jira 的人都可以在期限內隨時執行 Delete permanently</strong>，所以「還在 trash 就一定救得回來」是錯的。","D":"trash 的行為與方案無關，所有方案都是 60 天。","A":"key 有沒有被別人占用跟能不能還原完全無關，那是兩件不同的事。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>「保留 60 天後自動永久刪除」是考綱時代的敘述；現行 Move／Restore／Delete a space 三頁均未載明保留天數。作答用 60 天，實務上不要把它當成「一定救得回來」的保證。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/trash-for-jira-cloud-projects/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.1.4-008","sec":"620.1.4","dom":"620.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Who can move a project to the trash?","opts":["Only a site admin","Only an organization admin","Only a Jira administrator","Anyone with the Administer Jira global permission or the Administer Projects permission for that project"],"zh":"誰可以把一個 project 移到 trash？","zo":["只有 site admin","只有 Organization admin","只有 Jira admin","擁有 Administer Jira 全域權限，或該 project 的 Administer Projects 權限的人"],"ans":"D","why":{"C":"這個答案漏掉了另一半：<strong>project admin 也可以</strong>把自己管的 project 丟進 trash。","D":"正解。官方 Move a space to trash 原句：<strong>你必須擁有 Administer Jira 全域權限，或是擁有管理該 space 的權限</strong>。也就是說 project admin 就能丟。但要記住這組不對稱設計——<strong>Restore 與 Delete permanently 都只限 Administer Jira</strong>，丟得進去不代表救得回來。","A":"site admin 管的是站台層級的帳號與產品存取，不是這個動作的必要條件。","B":"organization admin 管的是組織層級的設定（帳號、計費、安全政策），<strong>不會自動具備 Jira 產品內部的權限</strong>，這是很多人搞混的地方。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>兩頁官方說法不一致：Move a space to trash 頁只寫「Administer Jira 或 administer spaces」；Archive a space 頁則寫「Space admins can only archive team-managed spaces. The same applies to moving company-managed and team-managed spaces to trash.」若題目特別指名 company-managed，請以站台實測為準（見 MERGE-LOG §1 與 620.1.4 的證據界線 callout）。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/move-a-project-to-trash/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.1.4-009","sec":"620.1.4","dom":"620.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Which values can a project's Default assignee field be set to?","opts":["Only Unassigned or the project lead (now called Space owner)","Only a project administrator","Only a component lead","Any project member"],"zh":"Project 的 Default assignee 欄位可以設成哪些值？","zo":["只有 Unassigned 或 Project lead（現行稱 Space owner）","只有 Project admin","只有 component lead","任何 project 成員"],"ans":"A","why":{"D":"不能指定任意成員。這是本題的核心考點，也是實務上最常見的誤解。","A":"正解。官方 Edit a space's details 原句：<strong>default assignee 只能設成 Unassigned 或 Space owner（也就是 project lead）</strong>，它不是一個可以自由挑人的 user picker。想指定其他人，唯一的路是先把 project lead 換成那個人。另外，如果連 Unassigned 都選不到，要去檢查 ⚙ → General configuration 的「Allow unassigned issues」是不是被關掉了。","B":"「Project admin」是一種權限身分，可能有很多人，它<strong>不是</strong> default assignee 下拉裡的選項。","C":"component lead 是<strong>component 層級</strong>的設定（在 Project settings → Components 裡），跟 project 層的 Default assignee 是不同的兩件事——雖然 component 的設定會覆蓋 project 的。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>官方 Edit a space’s details 現行原句仍是「can only be either Unassigned, or the Space owner」；坊間「新版可指定任意成員」的說法查無官方依據，不予採用（見 MERGE-LOG §1 M9）。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/edit-a-projects-details/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.1.4-010","sec":"620.1.4","dom":"620.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A project administrator wants to assign a category to the project but cannot find a suitable one. Who can create a new category?","opts":["The project administrator, in Project settings → Details","A Jira administrator, in ⚙ → Projects → Project categories; the project administrator can only select from existing categories","Anyone with the Browse Projects permission","A site administrator, in admin.atlassian.com"],"zh":"Project admin 想為 project 選一個 category，卻找不到合適的分類。誰能建立新 category？","zo":["Project admin 在 Project settings → Details 建立","Jira admin 在 ⚙ → Projects → Project categories 建立；project admin 只能挑選","任何有 Browse Projects 的人","Site admin 在 admin.atlassian.com 建立"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"Details 頁上的 Category 只是一個<strong>下拉選單，只能從既有的分類裡挑</strong>，沒有新增的入口。","B":"正解。官方 categories 頁說明：<strong>category 由 Jira admin 在 ⚙ → Projects → Project categories 建立與管理</strong>（它是站台層級的物件），project admin 只能在 Project settings → Details 把既有的分類指派給自己的 project。所以 project admin 該做的是開單請 Jira admin 新增一個分類。","C":"Browse Projects 只是「看得到這個 project 與它的 issue」的瀏覽權限，完全不涉及任何建立設定的能力。","D":"category 是 <strong>Jira 產品內部</strong>的設定，在 ⚙ 齒輪選單裡，不在 admin.atlassian.com 那個組織管理主控台。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/add-assign-and-delete-project-categories/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/edit-a-projects-details/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.1.4-011","sec":"620.1.4","dom":"620.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Before changing a project key, which of the following is most important to address in advance?","opts":["Disable issue linking","Delete and re-create the board","Notify users and prepare to update board filters and dashboards whose JQL hard-codes the old key","Move the project to the trash and then restore it"],"zh":"改 project key 前，下列哪一項最需要提前處理？","zo":["先關閉 issue linking","先把 board 刪掉重建","先通知使用者並準備更新 board filter 與 dashboard 裡寫死舊 key 的 JQL","先把 project 移到 trash 再還原"],"ans":"C","why":{"B":"board 不需要重建。board 綁的是 filter，而 filter 裡的舊 key 仍會透過 alias 運作——只是<strong>建議</strong>更新成新 key 讓設定與現況一致，不是非重建不可。","C":"正解。官方 Things to consider before changing a project key 的重點正是這個：舊連結會透過 <strong>alias</strong> 繼續有效，所以不會壞掉；但<strong>寫死舊 key 的 board filter、dashboard gadget 與各種 JQL 建議更新</strong>，而且應該<strong>事先通知使用者</strong>，免得大家看到新舊 key 混用時一頭霧水。官方另外也建議做重大變更前先備份站台。","D":"把 project 丟進 trash 再還原跟改 key 毫無關係，而且是相當危險的多餘操作。","A":"issue linking 是一個獨立的全域功能，跟 project key 沒有任何關係，不需要為了改 key 而關閉它。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/edit-a-projects-details/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.1.4-012","sec":"620.1.4","dom":"620.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"After a project is archived, what happens to its issues?","opts":["They become completely inaccessible, even through direct links","They continue to appear in search results and on boards","They are immediately and permanently deleted and cannot be restored","They no longer appear in basic or advanced search, but they can still be opened through direct links and cannot be edited"],"zh":"把一個 project 封存（Archive）之後，它的 work item 會怎樣？","zo":["完全無法存取，連直接連結也打不開","照常出現在搜尋與 board","立即被永久刪除，無法還原","從基本與進階搜尋中消失，但仍可用直接連結開啟、且不能編輯"],"ans":"D","why":{"D":"正解。官方 Archive a space 原句：<strong>它的 work item 不會出現在基本或進階搜尋結果中；你仍然可以透過直接連結存取這些 work item，但無法編輯它們</strong>。這跟 trash 的行為很像，最大的差別是<strong>封存沒有 60 天倒數</strong>。","A":"直接連結<strong>仍然打得開</strong>，只是不能編輯。而且官方特別提醒：封存前就有權限的人甚至還可以透過 <strong>API</strong> 讀到 space 的細節——要真的擋掉必須<strong>封存前先改權限</strong>。","B":"封存之後，這些 work item <strong>不會出現在基本搜尋或進階搜尋的結果中</strong>，board 上當然也看不到。","C":"封存跟永久刪除完全是兩回事：<strong>封存沒有期限、不會自動刪除，而且 Jira／site admin 隨時可以還原</strong>。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/archive-a-project/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.1.4-013","sec":"620.1.4","dom":"620.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A user who is a project administrator but not a Jira administrator reports that they can change the project key in project A, but the option is grayed out in project B. The two projects use different management models. What is the most likely explanation?","opts":["A is team-managed and B is company-managed; changing the key of a company-managed project requires an organization, site, or Jira administrator","Project A's key is shorter, so it is not restricted","Project B has unresolved issues, so its key is locked","The user happens to be a Jira administrator in project A"],"zh":"一位只有 project admin、沒有 Jira admin 的使用者反映：他在 A 專案改得動 project key，在 B 專案卻是灰的。兩個專案的管理方式不同。最合理的解釋是？","zo":["A 是 team-managed、B 是 company-managed；改 CMP 的 key 需要 org／site／Jira admin","A 的 key 比較短，所以不受限制","B 專案有未解決的 issue，所以 key 被鎖住","他在 A 專案剛好是 Jira admin"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"正解。官方 <em>Edit a space's details</em> 寫的是 <strong>Only organization, site, and Jira admins can edit a space key.</strong>，而 team-managed 那篇卻寫「有 space permissions 就能改 key」。<strong>實機驗證（2026-09-09）：TMP 的 project admin 改得動，CMP 改不動</strong>——兩篇文件都沒寫錯，各自描述了自己那一半。這也符合兩種 project 的一貫分工：<strong>TMP 的設定長在 project 裡，CMP 的設定是站台層物件</strong>。","B":"key 的長度只受命名規則限制（至少 2 字元、大寫字母開頭、只含大寫字母與數字），<strong>跟能不能編輯完全無關</strong>。","C":"issue 的狀態不會鎖住 project key。<strong>改 key 本身是安全操作</strong>——舊 key 會存進 Previous keys 當 alias，舊連結不會斷。","D":"題目已明確指出他<strong>沒有 Jira admin</strong>；而且 Jira admin 是站台層級的全域權限，不會只在某一個 project 生效。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>考試作答以官方 Edit a space's details 那句為準（改 key ＝ org／site／Jira admin，考題情境幾乎都是 CMP）；TMP 可改是 2026-09-09 的實機驗證結果。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/edit-a-projects-details/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/create-edit-and-delete-team-managed-projects/"],"lvl":3,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.1.4-014","sec":"620.1.4","dom":"620.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A company-managed project previously changed its key from MOB to APP. The company now wants to use the MOB key for a brand-new project. The project administrator of the original project plans to delete MOB from Details → Previous keys without help. What will happen?","opts":["The project administrator cannot delete it, because in a company-managed project, deleting a previous key, like changing the key, requires an organization, site, or Jira administrator","The project administrator can delete it, because a previous key is only an alias and deleting it is not a significant change","The project administrator can delete it, and Jira then automatically rewrites all old links to use the new key","The project administrator cannot delete it, because a previous key cannot be removed until the original project is deleted"],"zh":"某 company-managed project 過去把 key 從 MOB 改成 APP，現在公司想把 MOB 這個 key 拿給一個全新的 project 使用。該 project 的 project admin 打算自己到 Details → Previous keys 把 MOB 刪掉。結果會是？","zo":["他刪不掉，因為在 company-managed project 刪 previous key 和改 key 一樣需要 org／site／Jira admin","他刪得掉，因為 previous key 只是別名，刪除不算重大變更","他刪得掉，但刪除後 Jira 會自動把所有舊連結改寫成新的 key","他刪不掉，因為 previous key 在原 project 被刪除之前都無法移除"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"正解。改 key 與刪 previous key 的權限<strong>是跟著 project 類型走，不是跟著動作走</strong>：在 <strong>CMP 兩個動作都要 org／site／Jira admin</strong>，在 <strong>TMP 則 project admin 自己都做得到</strong>（2026-09-09 實機驗證）。這符合兩種 project 的一貫分工——CMP 的 project 設定是站台層物件，TMP 的設定長在 project 自己身上。","B":"previous key 確實是靠 alias 讓舊連結繼續運作，但正因為如此，<strong>刪掉它反而是整個 key 主題裡唯一真正具破壞性的動作</strong>——所有還在引用舊 key 的連結、board filter、gadget 與 JQL 都會失效，因此權限並不寬鬆。","C":"Jira <strong>不會改寫任何既有文字</strong>。改 key 時留言裡的 <code>MOB-12</code> 字面就不會變，只是點下去會導向新 key；一旦 previous key 被刪，連導向都沒了，字面仍然停在舊 key。","D":"刪除整個 project 是釋放舊 key 的<strong>另一條路</strong>，不是刪 previous key 的前提條件。previous key 本身就可以單獨刪除，前提是權限足夠。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>CMP 需 org／site／Jira admin、TMP 的 project admin 即可，為 2026-09-09 實機驗證結果；考題情境預設為 CMP。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/edit-a-projects-details/"],"lvl":3,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.1.4-015","sec":"620.1.4","dom":"620.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A project administrator of a company-managed project wants to place the project under the \"Platform\" category, but they cannot change the Category drop-down in Project settings → Details. Meanwhile, a Jira administrator who is not a member of the project is able to change it. What is the most complete explanation?","opts":["Category assignment in a company-managed project is a site-level setting that only a Jira administrator can change, and the Administer Jira permission covers the settings of every project on the site without requiring membership in the project","The category is already assigned to another project, so it is temporarily locked","The project administrator must first be added to the category's member list before assigning it","The Jira administrator can change it only because they are also an organization administrator; a regular Jira administrator cannot"],"zh":"一位 company-managed project 的 project admin 想把自己的專案歸到「Platform」這個 category 底下，但 Project settings → Details 裡的 Category 下拉他動不了。同一時間，一位 Jira admin 明明不是這個專案的成員，卻改得動。最完整的解釋是？","zo":["CMP 的 category 指派屬於站台層設定，只有 Jira admin 能做；而 Administer Jira 涵蓋站台上每一個 project 的設定，不需要先加入該 project","那個 category 已經被指派給其他 project，所以暫時鎖住","project admin 必須先被加進該 category 的成員清單才能指派","Jira admin 是因為同時具備 org admin 才改得動，一般 Jira admin 不行"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"正解。官方 <em>Edit a space's details</em> 對 company-managed 寫的是「要改 category 請找 Jira admin」，而 categories 那頁只給通用步驟、未區分類型；<strong>2026-09-09 實測定案：CMP 只有 Jira admin 改得動，TMP 的 project admin 自己就能改</strong>。後半句同樣重要——<strong>Administer Jira 是站台層權限</strong>，涵蓋每一個 project 的設定，管理員不必先成為該 project 的成員。","B":"category 本來就設計成<strong>多個 project 共用同一個標籤</strong>，這正是它拿來做跨 project 搜尋與 dashboard 的用途，不會因為已被指派而鎖住。","C":"category <strong>沒有成員清單</strong>。它只是貼在 project 上的標籤，由 Jira admin 在 ⚙ → Projects → Project categories 建立與刪除，不含任何權限設定。","D":"不需要 org admin。<strong>Administer Jira 這個產品層權限本身就足夠</strong>；org admin 當然也做得到，但它不是必要條件。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>CMP 只有 Jira admin、TMP 的 project admin 即可，為 2026-09-09 實機驗證結果；官方兩頁各自只描述了一半。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/edit-a-projects-details/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/add-assign-and-delete-project-categories/"],"lvl":3,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.2.1-001","sec":"620.2.1","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A team plans a fixed batch of features every two weeks and wants to compare how much it delivers in each period. Which board is most suitable?","opts":["Scrum board","Kanban board, because it has a Done column","Only change the project name","Only add labels to categorize the work"],"zh":"團隊每兩週固定規劃一批功能，並想比較每期的交付量。哪種 board 最適合？","zo":["Scrum board","Kanban board，因為有 Done 欄","只改 project 名稱","只加 Labels 分類"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"正解。「每兩週固定規劃一批」就是 sprint 的定義，「比較每期的交付量」則指向 <strong>Velocity chart</strong>——它以每個 sprint 兩根柱子對照承諾量與完成量，正是用來逐期比較的工具。這些功能（sprint 規劃、Sprint report、Velocity）都是 <strong>Scrum board 專屬</strong>，Kanban 沒有。","B":"每一種 board 都有 Done 欄，它只代表「完成」這個狀態，<strong>不會帶來固定週期的節奏，也不提供逐期比較的報表</strong>。Kanban 能看的是 cycle time 與流動效率。","C":"project 的名稱純粹是顯示用的文字，不會讓任何功能出現或消失。","D":"label 只能替工作貼分類標籤，<strong>建立不了交付節奏</strong>，也產生不了 velocity 這種以 sprint 為單位的統計。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/what-is-a-jira-software-board/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/create-a-board/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.2.1-002","sec":"620.2.1","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An operations team receives a varying number of requests every day. Its list of work awaiting evaluation is long and crowds the execution board. What is the best starting point?","opts":["Scrum, because there is a lot of work","Kanban with a backlog","Delete the unfinished work","Create one project per person"],"zh":"維運團隊每天不定量接件，待評估清單很長且把執行板塞滿。最佳起點？","zo":["Scrum，因為工作很多","Kanban with backlog","刪除未完成工作","每人建一個 project"],"ans":"B","why":{"D":"每人一個 project 會讓管理成本暴增（各自的權限、設定、報表），而且<strong>仍然沒有把「待評估」與「可執行」的工作分開</strong>，根本沒解決題目的問題。","A":"Scrum 適合的是「固定週期承諾一批工作」，而題目說的是<strong>每天不定量接件</strong>——這是連續流，硬套 sprint 節奏只會讓團隊每兩週重排一次計畫，卻仍然被臨時工作打斷。「工作很多」不是選 Scrum 的理由。","B":"正解。兩個需求各自對應到一個設計：<strong>Kanban</strong> 保留持續流動的工作方式，而<strong>開啟 Kanban backlog</strong> 則把「待評估」的工作移到一個獨立的 Backlog 畫面，讓執行板上只留下已經 ready 的工作。這正好解決「待評估清單很長且把執行板塞滿」的問題，而且不需要改變團隊既有的工作節奏。","C":"刪除等於丟掉需求，那些工作並沒有消失，只是不再被追蹤——這不是管理待辦的方法，而是掩蓋問題。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/what-is-a-jira-software-board/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-columns/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.2.1-003","sec":"620.2.1","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"What happens when you create a second board in the same project that reads the same saved filter?","opts":["All issues are copied automatically","A new workflow is created automatically","Both views read the same set of issues","The original board stops working"],"zh":"在同一個 project 再建第二塊 board，讀取同一個 saved filter，會發生什麼？","zo":["自動複製所有 issue","自動建立新 workflow","兩個視圖讀取同一批 issue","原 board 失效"],"ans":"C","why":{"C":"正解。因為<strong>board 的內容完全由 saved filter 決定</strong>，兩塊 board 讀同一份 filter，看到的自然是同一批 issue。所以在其中一塊 board 上把卡片拖到下一欄（等於改了 status），另一塊 board 重新整理後也會看到同樣的變化——它們是同一份資料的兩個視窗。","D":"多塊 board 可以並存，這正是 CMP 的優勢之一（TMP 才只有一塊）。原本的 board 完全不受影響。","A":"board 只是一個<strong>視圖</strong>，它不擁有資料、也不會複製任何 issue；兩塊 board 看到的是同一批 issue 的兩種呈現方式。","B":"建立 board 與建立 workflow 是完全不同的兩件事。board 是 filter 加上 column 對應，它不會產生任何新的流程物件。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/create-a-board/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/create-a-board-based-on-filters/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.2.1-004","sec":"620.2.1","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A Scrum board is completely empty, even though the backlog contains work. What should be checked first?","opts":["Whether everyone is a Jira administrator","Whether every issue has been estimated","Whether the project key was recently changed","Whether there is an active sprint and the work has been added to it"],"zh":"Scrum board 一片空白，但 backlog 明明有工作。首先檢查什麼？","zo":["是否所有人都是 Jira admin","是否每筆工作都已估點","是否最近更換了 project key","是否有 active sprint 且工作已拉進去"],"ans":"D","why":{"D":"正解。Scrum board 的 active sprints 視圖<strong>只顯示目前進行中 sprint 裡的工作</strong>；如果沒有任何 sprint 被 Start，board 本來就是一片空白，工作全都待在 backlog。要檢查兩件事：有沒有 active sprint，以及工作有沒有被拉進那個 sprint。","A":"看 board 只需要 Browse Projects 權限，跟是不是 Jira admin 毫無關係。","B":"沒有估點的 issue 照樣會顯示在 board 上，估點只影響報表的數字，<strong>不會讓卡片消失</strong>。","C":"更換 project key 不會影響 sprint 的狀態，也不會讓 board 變空白（舊 key 還有 alias 可以導向）。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/create-a-board/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/create-sprints-in-company-managed-projects/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.2.1-005","sec":"620.2.1","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Which statement about the Kanban backlog is correct?","opts":["It organizes pending work into an area separate from the execution board","Enabling it always creates two-week sprints","Work in the backlog is kept separate from the issue database","Work is completed automatically after it is enabled"],"zh":"關於 Kanban backlog，何者正確？","zo":["把待處理工作整理到獨立於執行板的區域","啟用後一定會有兩週的 sprint","backlog 裡的工作與 issue 資料庫分離","啟用後工作會自動完成"],"ans":"A","why":{"B":"Kanban backlog <strong>不會建立任何 sprint 節奏</strong>——它只是多一個規劃用的畫面，board 仍然是連續流的 Kanban，沒有兩週週期這回事。","C":"backlog 裡的仍然是<strong>原本那些 issue</strong>，資料完全沒有分離，只是換一個地方顯示而已。任何時候用 JQL 都搜得到它們。","D":"完成與否仍然由 workflow 的 status 與 board 的欄位對應決定，沒有任何東西會「自動完成」。","A":"正解。Kanban backlog 的作用是<strong>把待處理的工作整理到一個獨立於執行板的區域</strong>：執行板上只留下真正在流動的工作，backlog 畫面則可以排 rank、用 Epic panel 分組來做規劃。開啟方式是到 Board settings → Columns，把一個 status 拖進 Kanban backlog 面板。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-columns/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/what-is-a-jira-software-board/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.2.1-006","sec":"620.2.1","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"The number of issues on a Kanban board is approaching the limit, and performance is starting to slow down. What is the officially recommended maximum number of issues displayed on a single board?","opts":["1,000","5,000","There is no limit","500"],"zh":"一塊 Kanban board 上的 issue 數已接近上限，效能開始變慢。官方建議的單一 board 顯示上限是多少？","zo":["1,000","5,000","沒有上限","500"],"ans":"B","why":{"C":"是有上限的，而且超過之後不只是效能問題，卡片會直接顯示不完整。","D":"500 是<strong>單一 parent 底下 child 的顯示上限</strong>（超過之後 parent 頁面列不出完整清單，time tracking 也不再納入 sub-task），跟 board 的上限是兩回事。","A":"1,000 是 <strong>bulk change 一次能處理的 issue 上限</strong>，不是 board 的顯示上限——這兩個數字很容易混淆。","B":"正解。官方文件說明<strong>一個 board 最多顯示 5,000 個 issue</strong>，超過的部分不會出現，而且會影響效能。真的逼近上限時，正確做法是縮小 board filter 的範圍（例如排除已完成很久的工作），而不是硬撐。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/what-is-a-jira-software-board/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.2.1-007","sec":"620.2.1","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A team created a company-managed project from the Kanban template and now wants to switch to Scrum. What is the most appropriate approach?","opts":["Convert the project to team-managed","Change the board type to Scrum in Board settings","Create an additional Scrum board in the same project","Delete the project and re-create it"],"zh":"團隊原本用 Kanban template 建了 CMP，現在想改跑 Scrum。最合理的作法？","zo":["把 project 轉成 team-managed","在 Board settings 把 board type 切成 Scrum","在同一個 project 另建一個 Scrum board","刪除 project 重建"],"ans":"C","why":{"D":"刪除 project 重建會遺失所有歷史資料，是嚴重的過度反應——這個需求根本不需要動到 project。","A":"管理方式（CMP／TMP）與 board 類型（Scrum／Kanban）是兩個獨立的維度，轉成 TMP 不會讓 board 變成 Scrum；<strong>而且 TMP 只能有一塊 board，選擇反而更少</strong>。何況兩者之間沒有一鍵轉換。","B":"Board settings 裡<strong>沒有</strong>切換 board 類型的選項——board 的類型在建立當下就決定了，之後改不了。","C":"正解。<strong>CMP 允許一個 project 底下有多個 board</strong>，所以最省事的做法就是用同一份 filter（或另存一份）在同一個 project 再建一個 Scrum board。既有的 issue 一張都不用動，兩塊 board 看的是同一批資料，只是節奏與呈現不同；舊的 Kanban board 可以留著也可以之後刪掉。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>考試作答：CMP 想換打法是「再建一個 board」；官方頁未明寫「不能互轉」，但 Board settings 無切換選項。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/create-a-board/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/create-a-board-based-on-filters/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.2.1-008","sec":"620.2.1","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"On a team-managed Kanban board, when do issues in Done disappear from the board?","opts":["When a version is released","They never disappear","Every time the page is refreshed","They are cleared automatically 14 days after being moved to the Done column, and a project administrator can also clear them manually"],"zh":"TMP 的 Kanban board 上，Done 的 issue 什麼時候會從 board 消失？","zo":["Release 版本時","永遠不會消失","每次重新整理","移到 Done 欄 14 天後自動清除，project admin 也可手動清"],"ans":"D","why":{"C":"跟重新整理畫面無關，它是依照時間自動觸發的。","D":"正解。官方說明：TMP 的 Done work item 在移入 Done 欄 <strong>14 天後會自動被清除</strong>（從 board 上移除，資料不會刪除）；<strong>project admin 或 Jira admin 也可以隨時手動執行 Clear Done work items</strong> 提前清掉。要注意這只適用於<strong>沒有啟用 Sprints</strong> 的 TMP。","A":"靠 Release 版本來清 Done，是 <strong>CMP Kanban 的 sub-filter 機制</strong>（預設只顯示未發佈的版本），不是 TMP 的行為。","B":"會消失。TMP 有自動清除機制，所以 Done 欄不會無限累積。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/get-started-with-team-managed-projects/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.2.1-009","sec":"620.2.1","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"After the Sprints feature is enabled in a team-managed project, which statement about manually clearing done work is correct?","opts":["Done work cannot be cleared manually; when a sprint is completed, done work is cleared from the board and does not return to the backlog","Done work returns to the backlog","Only a Jira administrator can clear done work manually","Clear Done work items can be run manually at any time"],"zh":"TMP 開啟了 Sprints 功能後，關於手動清除 Done 工作，何者正確？","zo":["不能手動清除；sprint 完成時 Done 的工作會被清掉且不回 backlog","Done 的工作會回到 backlog","只有 Jira admin 能手動清除","隨時可以手動 Clear Done work items"],"ans":"A","why":{"D":"正好相反，官方明寫在 Sprints 啟用的情況下無法手動清除。手動 Clear Done work items 只存在於未啟用 Sprints 的 TMP。","A":"正解。官方明寫：<strong>啟用 Sprints 之後就無法手動清除 Done 工作</strong>，取而代之的是靠「完成 sprint」這個動作——sprint 結束時，落在最右欄的工作會被清出 board，而且<strong>不會回到 backlog</strong>（未完成的才會回去或轉到下一個 sprint）。","B":"完成的工作<strong>不會</strong>回到 backlog；會回 backlog 的是 sprint 結束時仍未完成的那些。","C":"啟用 Sprints 之後，<strong>連 Jira admin 也沒有手動清除的選項</strong>——這個功能整個消失，不是權限問題。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/get-started-with-team-managed-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.2.1-010","sec":"620.2.1","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"On a team-managed Kanban board, a parent issue is cleared while it still has incomplete sub-tasks. What is the result?","opts":["The sub-tasks remain on the board","The sub-tasks are cleared along with the parent, regardless of their status","Jira refuses to clear the parent","The sub-tasks are automatically converted to standard issues"],"zh":"TMP Kanban 清除一張 parent 時，它底下還有未完成的 sub-task。結果？","zo":["sub-task 留在 board 上","sub-task 不論狀態一起被清除","Jira 拒絕清除","sub-task 自動轉成 standard issue"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"官方明寫 parent 被清除時 sub-task 會一併被清除，<strong>不會留在 board 上</strong>。","B":"正解。官方原句：<strong>當一個 parent work item 被清除時，它的 subtask 也會一併被清除，不論每個 subtask 各自是什麼狀態</strong>。所以未完成的 sub-task 也會從 board 上消失——這常讓團隊以為工作不見了。要強調的是<strong>這只是從 board 移除，資料完全沒有被刪除</strong>，用 Done 欄的 See all Done work items 或 JQL 都找得回來。","C":"Jira 不會因為底下有未完成的 sub-task 就拒絕清除，它會直接連帶清掉——這正是需要事先知道的行為。","D":"清除動作<strong>完全不會改變 issue type</strong>，sub-task 仍然是 sub-task，只是不顯示在 board 上。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/get-started-with-team-managed-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.2.1-011","sec":"620.2.1","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Two teams share a company-managed Scrum board, and each team runs its own sprint (parallel sprints). Which statement about the Velocity chart is correct?","opts":["Each sprint generates its own Velocity chart","The Velocity chart is automatically split into two lines by team","The Velocity chart still reports figures for the whole board and is not automatically split by team","The Velocity chart is disabled after parallel sprints are enabled"],"zh":"兩個團隊共用一個 CMP Scrum board 並各跑自己的 sprint（parallel sprints）。關於 Velocity chart，何者正確？","zo":["每個 sprint 各自產生一張 Velocity","Velocity 會自動依團隊拆成兩條線","Velocity 仍是整塊 board 的數字，不會按團隊自動拆開","啟用 parallel sprints 後 Velocity 會停用"],"ans":"C","why":{"B":"官方<strong>沒有提供</strong>按團隊或按 sprint 自動拆分 velocity 的功能。想分開看，只能讓兩個團隊各自使用自己的 board（各自的 filter）。","C":"正解。<strong>Velocity chart 是 board-specific 的</strong>——它統計的是整塊 board 的數字，不會自動按團隊拆開。官方還特別提醒：使用 parallel sprints 時<strong>假設各團隊的估算方式是一致的</strong>，如果兩組團隊的點數尺度不同，把它們加總比較是沒有意義的。","D":"啟用 parallel sprints 不會停用任何報表，Velocity 照常運作，只是數字混合了兩個團隊。","A":"Velocity chart 是<strong>以 board 為單位</strong>統計的，不會因為同時有兩個 active sprint 就產生兩張圖。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>Parallel sprints：CMP 與 TMP 現行都支援（JSWCLOUD-17195 已 Fixed），不要把它當 CMP 專屬。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/create-sprints-in-company-managed-projects/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-velocity-chart/"],"lvl":3,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.2.1-012","sec":"620.2.1","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A sprint ends with incomplete work, and the PM wants to move that work directly into another sprint that is already in progress. What is the official process?","opts":["Use bulk change to edit the Sprint field and bypass the backlog","Create a new sprint to receive the work; this is the only option","When completing the sprint, select the other active sprint as the destination","Move the work back to the backlog first, then drag it into the target sprint"],"zh":"Sprint 結束時有未完成工作，PM 想把它直接放進另一個正在進行的 sprint。官方流程是？","zo":["用 bulk change 改 sprint 欄位即可跳過 backlog","只能建新 sprint 承接","完成 sprint 時直接選另一個 active sprint 當目的地","先退回 backlog，再拖進目標 sprint"],"ans":"D","why":{"C":"Complete Sprint 對未完成工作提供的去處只有三個：<strong>Backlog、任一既有的 future sprint、或新建一個 sprint</strong>，<strong>不包含其他正在進行中的 active sprint</strong>。這正是本題的陷阱。","D":"正解。依官方 Complete a sprint 的說明，未完成的工作只能送到 backlog、future sprint 或新 sprint。所以要把它放進<strong>另一個 active sprint</strong>，必須分兩步走：<strong>先退回 backlog，再從 backlog 拖進那個 active sprint</strong>。這也對應到 parallel sprints 那一節的規則——不能在兩個 active sprint 之間直接互拖。","A":"這不是官方提供的流程。而且 bulk change 修改 sprint 欄位一樣需要對應的權限（Schedule Issues 等），並不會比較省事。","B":"不一定要新建 sprint——未完成的工作也可以送回 backlog 或放進一個既有的 future sprint。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/create-sprints-in-company-managed-projects/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/complete-a-sprint/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.2.2-001","sec":"620.2.2","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A shared board's location is set to WEBLAB, and its saved filter includes WEBLAB and APILAB. Where do the cards on the board come from?","opts":["Issues from both projects that match the filter and that the user has permission to view","APILAB issues are moved to WEBLAB","The swimlane names determine them","WEBLAB only"],"zh":"一塊共用 board 的 location 掛在 WEBLAB，saved filter 包含 WEBLAB 與 APILAB。board 上的卡片來自哪裡？","zo":["兩個 project 中使用者可讀且符合 filter 的 issue","APILAB 的 issue 會被搬到 WEBLAB","由 swimlane 名稱決定","只有 WEBLAB"],"ans":"A","why":{"D":"這是最容易誤選的一個。<strong>location 只決定這塊 board 掛在哪個 project 的側欄底下方便找</strong>，跟它顯示哪些資料完全無關——資料來源永遠是 filter。","A":"正解。board 的內容是<strong>兩道門</strong>共同決定的：<strong>filter 決定候選範圍</strong>（這裡是 WEBLAB 與 APILAB 兩個 project 的 issue），<strong>每位使用者自己的 Browse Projects 權限與 issue security 再決定他實際看得到哪幾張</strong>。所以同一塊 board，不同人看到的卡片數可能不一樣，這是正常的。","B":"建立 board <strong>不會搬動任何 issue</strong>。board 只是一個讀取資料的視窗，issue 仍然待在自己原本的 project 裡。","C":"swimlane 只負責把已經在 board 上的卡片<strong>橫向分組</strong>，它不會決定哪些 issue 進得來，也不會過濾掉任何東西。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/create-a-board-based-on-filters/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/change-the-location-of-a-board/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.2.2-002","sec":"620.2.2","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A colleague can open a shared board but cannot see the APILAB work. What should be checked first?","opts":["Renaming the board","The colleague's Browse Projects permission and the issue security for APILAB","Deleting APILAB","Adding card colors"],"zh":"同事打得開共用 board，卻看不到 APILAB 的工作。優先查什麼？","zo":["把 board 改名","同事對 APILAB 的 Browse Projects 與 issue security","刪除 APILAB","增加 card colors"],"ans":"B","why":{"D":"card colors 只是替卡片上色的呈現設定，<strong>不會授予任何人存取權限</strong>。","A":"board 的名稱純粹是顯示文字，改名不會改變任何人的權限。","B":"正解。這題考的是「兩道門」的分工：他打得開 board，代表<strong>第一道門（filter 分享）已經通過</strong>；看不到 APILAB 的卡片，問題就在<strong>第二道門</strong>——他缺少 APILAB 的 <strong>Browse Projects</strong> 權限，或是那些 issue 被 <strong>issue security level</strong> 擋住了。優先檢查這兩項。","C":"刪除 project 會摧毀資料，而且完全沒有解決權限問題——這是最不該做的選項。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/space-access-and-configuration-permissions/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/create-a-board-based-on-filters/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.2.2-003","sec":"620.2.2","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"You want to change the data scope of only one board, but the saved filter it uses is shared by two other boards. What is the more appropriate approach?","opts":["Move the board's location","Move all the issues to another project","Use Save as to create a new filter, and switch the target board to the new filter","Overwrite the JQL of the original filter directly"],"zh":"只想改一塊 board 的資料範圍，但它用的 saved filter 已被另外兩塊 board 共用。較適合的作法？","zo":["把 board 的 location 搬走","把所有 issue 改到另一個 project","Save as 存成新 filter，讓目標 board 改用新 filter","直接覆寫原 filter 的 JQL"],"ans":"C","why":{"C":"正解。正確做法是<strong>用 Save as 另存一份新的 filter，改好 JQL 之後，把目標 board 的 filter 換成新的那一份</strong>。這樣其他兩塊 board 仍然指向原本的 filter，範圍完全不受影響，兩邊從此脫鉤。","D":"直接改原 filter 的 JQL，會<strong>同時波及所有依賴這份 filter 的 board、dashboard gadget 與 filter 訂閱</strong>——另外兩個團隊會突然發現自己的 board 少了一堆卡片，卻不知道發生什麼事。","A":"location 只決定 board 掛在哪裡，<strong>完全不影響它讀取的查詢</strong>，搬走 location 資料範圍一點也不會變。","B":"把 issue 搬到另一個 project 是動到真實資料的重大操作，可能連帶改變它們適用的 scheme 與設定——為了調整一塊 board 的顯示範圍而搬資料，是嚴重的殺雞用牛刀。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-filters/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/manage-filters/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.2.2-004","sec":"620.2.2","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"On a cross-project board, the in-progress statuses of the two projects are named Developing and Implementing, and you want them to appear in the same column. What should you do?","opts":["Delete one of the statuses","Create two copies of each issue","Change only the card colors","Map both statuses to the same column"],"zh":"跨 project board 上，兩個 project 的進行中 status 分別叫 Developing 與 Implementing，想在同一欄呈現。應該？","zo":["刪掉其中一個 status","為每張 issue 建兩份","只改卡片顏色","把兩個 status 都對應到同一個 column"],"ans":"D","why":{"D":"正解。<strong>一個 column 可以對應多個 status</strong>，這正是 CMP 中 column 與 status 分離設計的價值所在：把 Developing 與 Implementing 兩個 status 都拖進同一個「In Progress」欄，兩個 project 各自保留原本的 workflow 與用語，board 上卻能統一呈現。這是跨 project board 最常用的技巧。","A":"刪除 status 會動到 workflow（要 Jira admin），還會影響那些 issue 的歷史與流程，<strong>完全沒有必要</strong>——board 本來就支援多對一的映射。","B":"為了顯示而複製資料，會造成兩份資料各自更新、互相分歧，是資料治理上的大忌。","C":"卡片顏色只是視覺標示，<strong>不能把兩個欄位合併成一個</strong>。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-columns/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.2.2-005","sec":"620.2.2","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A team using a team-managed project wants an additional cross-project board. Which statement is correct?","opts":["Create a new board from a saved filter; the management model of the source projects does not change","Adding the board automatically makes the two projects share a workflow","The team must switch to Scrum before the board can be created","The project must first be converted to company-managed"],"zh":"Team-managed project 的團隊想要一塊額外的跨 project board。何者正確？","zo":["用 saved filter 建立一塊新 board，來源 project 的管理方式不變","新增 board 會讓兩個 project 自動共用 workflow","一定要改成 Scrum 才能建","只能先把 project 轉成 company-managed"],"ans":"A","why":{"B":"board 只是視圖，<strong>不會讓兩個 project 共用或轉換 workflow</strong>。各 project 的 workflow 仍然各自獨立，board 上只是把不同的 status 對應到同樣的欄位而已。","C":"Scrum 或 Kanban <strong>都可以</strong>用 saved filter 建立，board 類型與這件事無關。","D":"不需要把 project 轉成 company-managed。TMP 雖然不能在 project 內部再加 board，但走 saved filter 這條路完全行得通。","A":"正解。官方提供 <strong>Create a board based on filters</strong> 這條路徑：先存一份涵蓋多個 project 的 saved filter，再用它建立新 board。<strong>來源 project 的管理方式完全不需要改變</strong>——TMP 本身只有一塊內建 board，但透過 saved filter 建的額外 board 不受這個限制。要注意的是這塊 board 的可見度跟著 filter 的分享設定走。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/create-a-board-based-on-filters/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.2.2-006","sec":"620.2.2","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"You created a cross-project Scrum board, and a colleague says, \"When I open it, I only see a blank page. I can't even find the board.\" What is the most likely cause?","opts":["The board's location is set to your personal profile","The underlying saved filter has not been shared with the colleague","The colleague does not have Jira app access","The board is not a Kanban board"],"zh":"你建了一塊跨 project 的 Scrum board，同事說「我打開只看到空白，連 board 都找不到」。最可能的原因？","zo":["board 的 location 設在你的個人 profile","底層 saved filter 沒有分享給他","他沒有 Jira app access","board 不是 Kanban"],"ans":"B","why":{"B":"正解。官方原句：新 board 會<strong>對所有能存取你所選 filter 的使用者可見</strong>。換句話說 <strong>board 沒有自己的分享設定，可見度完全跟著 filter 走</strong>；filter 若是 private，別人連 board 的存在都察覺不到，這正好對應題目「連 board 都找不到」的症狀。","C":"沒有 Jira app access 的人根本進不了 Jira，不會出現「打開後看到空白」的情境；題目已經隱含他能正常登入使用。","D":"board 是 Scrum 還是 Kanban，跟誰看得到它完全沒有關係。","A":"board 的 location 設在個人 profile 並不會讓別人看不到它——<strong>只要 filter 有分享，別人一樣搜尋得到、打得開</strong>。location 只影響它出現在哪裡比較好找。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/create-a-board-based-on-filters/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/manage-filters/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.2.2-007","sec":"620.2.2","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"To share a saved filter with a team so that the board is visible to them, what does the person performing the action need?","opts":["Board administrator","Administer Jira","The Share dashboards and filters global permission","Manage Sprints"],"zh":"要把 saved filter 分享給團隊，讓 board 對他們可見，操作者需要什麼？","zo":["Board admin","Administer Jira","全域權限 Share dashboards and filters","Manage Sprints"],"ans":"C","why":{"B":"不需要 Administer Jira。分享 filter 是一般使用者層級的動作，只要有對應的全域權限即可。","C":"正解。分享 filter 與 dashboard 需要全域權限 <strong>Share dashboards and filters</strong>。它由 Jira admin 授予，而且跟所有全域權限一樣<strong>只能授予群組</strong>。缺了它的人建得出 filter，但分享的選單會是空的。","D":"Manage Sprints 管的是 sprint 的建立、開始與結束，跟分享完全無關。","A":"board admin 管的是 board 本身的設定（columns、swimlanes 等），<strong>他沒有權力代替 filter owner 去分享那份 filter</strong>——這是兩個不同層級的物件。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/manage-filters/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/space-access-and-configuration-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.2.2-008","sec":"620.2.2","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A PM wants to copy an existing board for a new team. Which statement about Copy board is correct?","opts":["Only a Jira administrator can copy a board","The original board is disabled after it is copied","The copy creates a new saved filter","The copy uses the same saved filter, and the person who copies the board becomes an administrator of the copy"],"zh":"PM 想複製一塊既有的 board 給新團隊用。關於 Copy board，何者正確？","zo":["只有 Jira admin 能複製 board","複製後原 board 會被停用","副本會建立一個新的 saved filter","副本沿用同一個 saved filter，複製者成為副本的 administrator"],"ans":"D","why":{"B":"複製是新增一塊 board，<strong>原本那塊完全不受影響</strong>，照常運作。","C":"這正是最常被誤解的地方——官方明寫<strong>副本使用的是「同一份」saved filter，不會自動幫你複製出一份新的</strong>。所以改副本的 JQL 等於改原 board。","D":"正解。官方 Copy an existing board 頁寫了兩件事：<strong>副本沿用同一份 work item filter</strong>，而且<strong>執行複製的人會成為新 board 的 administrator</strong>。要留意官方<strong>沒有</strong>交代原本的管理員名單會不會一起帶過去，所以不要推論成「只有複製者」——這是教材刻意保留的證據界線，實機比對 Board settings → Administrators 才算數。","A":"不限 Jira admin。<strong>board admin 或該 board location 所在 project 的 project admin</strong> 都可以執行複製。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>不採信第三方題庫「複製一律需要 Create Shared Objects」或「一定複製出新 filter」。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/copy-an-existing-board/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.2.2-009","sec":"620.2.2","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"On a cross-project Scrum board, a colleague cannot start a sprint. The colleague is already a board administrator. What is still missing?","opts":["The Manage Sprints permission in every project included in the board filter","A permission named Create and Reorder Sprints","Administer Jira","Schedule Issues"],"zh":"跨 project Scrum board 上，某位同事無法開始 sprint。他已經是 board admin。還缺什麼？","zo":["board filter 涵蓋的每個 project 都要有 Manage Sprints 權限","一個名為 Create and Reorder Sprints 的權限","Administer Jira","Schedule Issues"],"ans":"A","why":{"C":"不需要 Administer Jira。這是 project 層級的權限問題，補齊 Manage Sprints 即可。","D":"Schedule Issues 管的是 due date 與 backlog／board 的拖曳排序，<strong>它管不到「開始 sprint」這個動作</strong>——那是 Manage Sprints 的範圍。（反過來說，把 issue 拖進 sprint 才是 Schedule Issues 管的。）","A":"正解。官方原文：當一個 sprint 包含<strong>多個 board／project</strong> 的工作時，要更新這個 sprint 必須擁有<strong>所有相關 space 的 Manage sprints 權限</strong>，缺任何一個都會被擋。這是跨 project Scrum board 最常見的卡關點——解法是請 Jira admin 在缺的那個 project 的 permission scheme 裡把 Manage Sprints 補上。","B":"官方的權限清單裡<strong>沒有</strong>叫做 Create and Reorder Sprints 的獨立權限。CMP 的清單上只有一項 <strong>Manage sprints</strong>，它涵蓋建立、開始、完成與調整。這是把「操作描述」誤當成「權限名稱」的典型陷阱。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/space-access-and-configuration-permissions/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/create-sprints-in-company-managed-projects/"],"lvl":3,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.2.2-010","sec":"620.2.2","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"On a cross-project board, you want to add a status directly from the board (simplified workflow). Why is this not possible?","opts":["Statuses can only be created by a Jira administrator","The simplified workflow can only be used on a board whose filter includes a single project","Cross-project boards cannot have columns","It requires a paid plan"],"zh":"跨 project board 想直接在 board 上新增 status（simplified workflow）。為什麼做不到？","zo":["status 只能由 Jira admin 建","simplified workflow 只能用在 filter 只含一個 project 的 board","跨 project board 不能有 column","需要付費方案"],"ans":"B","why":{"D":"跟方案完全無關，這是功能條件的限制。","A":"這個說法不完全正確——當 project 符合 simplified workflow 的條件時，<strong>project admin 是可以在 board 的 Columns 頁直接新增 status 的</strong>，不必每次都找 Jira admin。","B":"正解。simplified workflow 有四個必要條件，而<strong>「board 的 filter 只包含一個 project」正是其中之一</strong>，跨 project board 直接違反這一條。另外三個條件是：該 project 的所有 issue type 共用同一個 workflow、這個 workflow 只使用 Atlassian 內建的 post function／validator／condition、每個 status 至少有一條出去的 transition。四個缺一個，Add status 按鈕就不會出現。","C":"跨 project board 當然有 column，而且正是靠 column 把不同 project 的 status 對應在一起，這個敘述本身就不成立。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/use-the-simplified-workflow/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-columns/"],"lvl":3,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.2.2-011","sec":"620.2.2","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Two projects each have a version named \"Autumn Release\". How do the Releases and other version-related filters on a cross-project board treat them?","opts":["Only the first project's version is shown","As the same version","As two different versions","They are merged automatically"],"zh":"兩個 project 各自有一個叫「Autumn Release」的 version。跨 project board 上的 Releases／version 相關篩選會怎麼看它們？","zo":["只顯示第一個 project 的","視為同一個 version","兩個不同的 version","自動合併"],"ans":"C","why":{"C":"正解。<strong>同名但分屬不同 project 的 version 是兩個完全獨立的物件</strong>，各有自己的 ID、日期與發佈狀態。所以在跨 project board 上做版本相關的篩選或發佈時，必須<strong>各自指定、各自 release</strong>，不能當成一個來處理。","D":"Jira <strong>不會</strong>自動合併同名的 version，也沒有提供這種功能。","A":"兩個 version 都會出現，不會只顯示其中一個。","B":"version 是<strong>屬於各自 project</strong> 的物件，名字一樣不代表是同一個東西——這跟「兩個 TMP 有同名 custom field」的道理完全一樣。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/create-a-board-based-on-filters/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.2.2-012","sec":"620.2.2","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A board's location was set to a colleague's personal profile. After the colleague leaves the company and the account is deactivated, where does the board appear?","opts":["It is deleted automatically","It is transferred to a Jira administrator","It is moved to a project automatically","It cannot be found; a board administrator or project administrator must reassign its location"],"zh":"board 的 location 原本掛在某位同事的個人 profile，他離職帳號被停用後，board 出現在哪裡？","zo":["自動刪除","轉給 Jira admin","自動搬到 project","找不到，需由 board admin 或 project admin 重新指定 location"],"ans":"D","why":{"C":"不會自動搬到 project——location 就是停在那個已停用的帳號上，形成「孤兒 board」。","D":"正解。官方說明：board 的 location 若掛在<strong>已停用的使用者或已停用的 project</strong> 上，這塊 board 就會失聯、一般人再也找不到入口。解法是由 <strong>board admin 或 project admin</strong> 到 Board settings → General 把 Location 重新指定到一個有效的 project（或自己的 profile）。這也是人員離職交接時很容易漏掉的一項。","A":"board <strong>不會被自動刪除</strong>，它仍然存在，只是失去了一個有效的入口。","B":"Jira <strong>不會</strong>自動把 board 轉移給任何人，需要有人手動處理。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/change-the-location-of-a-board/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.2.3-001","sec":"620.2.3","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"When a column is deleted from a company-managed board, what happens to the statuses that were mapped to it?","opts":["They return to Unmapped statuses, and their issues no longer appear on the board","They are automatically changed to Done","They are moved to another project","They are permanently deleted along with all their issues"],"zh":"刪除 company-managed board 上的一個 column，原本對應到它的 status 會怎樣？","zo":["回到 Unmapped，issue 不再顯示於 board","自動改成 Done","移到另一個 project","連同所有 issue 一起永久刪除"],"ans":"A","why":{"C":"column 只是 board 上的呈現單位，<strong>跟 issue 屬於哪個 project 毫無關係</strong>。","D":"這是最需要澄清的誤解：<strong>刪 column 既不會刪 issue，也不會刪 status</strong>，它是一個相對安全、隨時可還原的操作。","A":"正解。官方說明：刪除 column 之後，原本對應到它的 <strong>status 會退回 Unmapped statuses 面板</strong>，而這些 status 的 issue 就<strong>不再顯示在 board 上</strong>。要強調的是資料完全沒有損失——issue、status、歷史紀錄全在，用 JQL 或直接開連結都找得到，只要把 status 重新對應到某一欄，卡片就會回來。","B":"status 完全不會被改變，更不會自動變成 Done。刪 column 只影響「顯示在哪裡」，不影響 issue 的實際狀態。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-columns/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.2.3-002","sec":"620.2.3","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Two statuses need to appear in the same column. What is the correct approach?","opts":["Delete one of the statuses","Drag both statuses into the same column","Copy the board","Merge all the workflows"],"zh":"兩個 status 想在同一欄顯示，正確作法？","zo":["刪掉其中一個 status","把兩個 status 都拖到同一個 column","複製 board","合併所有 workflow"],"ans":"B","why":{"B":"正解。<strong>把兩個 status 都拖進同一個 column</strong> 就是官方設計的用法。這正是 CMP 中 column 與 status 分離的價值：<strong>workflow 可以維持精細（多個狀態），board 卻能保持簡潔（少數幾欄）</strong>。跨 project board 更是非靠它不可。","C":"複製 board 只是多一塊視圖，兩塊 board 的映射問題依然存在，什麼也沒解決。","D":"為了「畫面上看起來合併」而去改造 workflow，是本末倒置——顯示的問題就在顯示層解決。","A":"完全不必刪。board <strong>原生就支援一欄對應多個 status</strong>，刪除 status 反而會動到 workflow、影響歷史紀錄，是不必要的破壞。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-columns/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.2.3-003","sec":"620.2.3","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A status named Done is mapped to the second-to-last column. What does a Scrum board use to determine whether work is complete when a sprint is completed?","opts":["Whether the card is green","Who the assignee is","The mapping of the rightmost column","The English name of the status"],"zh":"某個 status 名稱叫 Done，卻對應在倒數第二欄。Scrum 的 sprint 完成判斷會看什麼？","zo":["卡片是不是綠色","assignee 是誰","最右欄的映射","status 的英文名稱"],"ans":"C","why":{"D":"名稱只是給人看的文字。這正是本題的陷阱——很多人看到「Done」就直覺認定它算完成。","A":"卡片的顏色來自 card colors 設定（依 issue type、priority、assignee 或 JQL），<strong>跟完成判定毫無關係</strong>。","B":"負責人是誰不影響工作完成與否的判定。","C":"正解。<strong>Scrum board 判定完成的唯一依據是「issue 落在最右邊那一欄」</strong>，跟 status 叫什麼名字無關。所以一個名叫 Done 卻被對應在倒數第二欄的 status，在完成 sprint 時會被視為<strong>未完成</strong>並帶到下一個 sprint。（順帶對照：Kanban 的 Hide completed work 剛好相反，它看的是 status category。）"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-columns/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-burndown-chart/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.2.3-004","sec":"620.2.3","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"The In Progress column has a Maximum of 3, but a fourth issue can still be dragged into it. What does this indicate?","opts":["Jira is malfunctioning","The filter is broken","The user must be missing the Browse permission","Column constraints are only visual warnings"],"zh":"In Progress 欄設了 Maximum 3，第四筆仍然可以拖進去。代表什麼？","zo":["Jira 故障","filter 已壞","一定缺少 Browse 權限","Column constraint 只是視覺警示"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"這完全是設計行為，不是故障。","B":"跟 filter 沒有任何關係。filter 決定的是哪些 issue 出現在 board 上，不管欄位上限。","C":"能夠成功把卡片移進去，正好證明<strong>權限是正常的</strong>——如果缺 Transition Issues，動作會直接被擋下來。","D":"正解。<strong>column constraint 只是視覺警示，沒有強制力</strong>：超過上限時欄位標題會變紅（低於下限則變黃），但 Jira 完全不會阻止你把第四張卡拖進去。這是刻意的設計——WIP 限制是團隊自律的工具，不是系統的鎖。真的要擋住轉換，得靠 workflow 的 condition 或 validator。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-columns/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.2.3-005","sec":"620.2.3","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A Review column was added and a status was mapped to it, but cards cannot be dragged into it. What should be checked first?","opts":["Whether the workflow has an available transition to that status, and the Transition Issues permission","Changing the board's Working days settings","Adding card fields","Changing the card colors"],"zh":"新增了 Review 欄並映射好 status，卡片卻拖不進去。優先檢查？","zo":["workflow 是否有可用的 transition 到該 status，以及 Transition 權限","改 working days","增加 card fields","換卡片顏色"],"ans":"A","why":{"D":"顏色純粹是視覺標示，<strong>不會建立任何 transition</strong>。","A":"正解。這題考的是<strong>「顯示」與「移動」是兩件事</strong>：column 映射只決定 issue 出現在哪一欄，但能不能把卡片拖過去，取決於三個條件——<strong>workflow 裡存在一條通往該 status 的 transition</strong>、<strong>那條 transition 的 condition 通過</strong>（例如沒有被 Subtask Blocking Condition 擋住）、以及使用者<strong>擁有 Transition Issues 權限</strong>。少任何一個，卡片就拖不動。","B":"working days 只影響報表的天數計算（burndown、control chart 等），跟能不能拖卡片毫無關係。","C":"card layout 的欄位只是讓卡片顯示更多資訊，不會改變任何流程限制。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-columns/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.2.3-006","sec":"620.2.3","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A Jira administrator created a new status named \"Waiting\", but it does not appear in the board's Unmapped statuses panel. Why?","opts":["The board must be refreshed first","The Unmapped statuses panel lists only the statuses actually used by the workflows of the projects included in the board filter","Board administrator permissions are required","The status name contains a space"],"zh":"Jira admin 建了一個新 status「Waiting」，但 board 的 Unmapped statuses 面板裡看不到它。為什麼？","zo":["要先重新整理 board","Unmapped 只列出 board filter 涵蓋 project 的 workflow 真的用到的 status","需要 board admin 權限","status 名稱有空白"],"ans":"B","why":{"D":"status 名稱有沒有空白不影響它會不會出現在 Unmapped 面板。","A":"這不是快取問題，重新整理再多次也不會出現。","B":"正解。官方說明：<strong>Unmapped statuses 面板只列出「board filter 涵蓋的 project，其 workflow 實際使用到」的 status</strong>。Jira admin 建立一個 status，只是產生了一個物件；除非有人把它加進某個 workflow、而那個 workflow 又被這個 project 使用，否則 board 根本不知道它存在。解法是請 Jira admin 先把 Waiting 加進對應的 workflow。","C":"能夠打開 Columns 設定頁，就代表已經具備管理這塊 board 的權限，不是權限問題。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-columns/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.2.3-007","sec":"620.2.3","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Which options are officially available for the Hide completed issues older than setting on a company-managed Kanban board?","opts":["Any number of days","Only 14 days","1, 2, or 4 weeks, or do not hide","1, 2, 3, or 5 weeks"],"zh":"CMP Kanban board 的 Hide completed work 設定，官方提供哪些選項？","zo":["任意天數","只有 14 天","1、2、4 週或不隱藏","1、2、3、5 週"],"ans":"C","why":{"C":"正解。官方 KB 原文列出的選項是：<strong>1 week、2 weeks、4 weeks，或是完全不隱藏</strong>，就這四個。值得直接背下來，因為考題常拿「3 週」「5 週」這種看起來很合理的數字來設陷阱。","D":"沒有 3 週也沒有 5 週這兩個選項。","A":"<strong>不能自訂天數</strong>，這是一個固定選項的下拉選單，不是輸入框。","B":"14 天自動清除是 <strong>TMP（未啟用 Sprints）</strong>的規則，跟 CMP Kanban 的 Hide completed work 是完全不同的兩個機制，考題很愛把它們混在一起。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira/kb/kanban-board-shows-or-hides-completed-work-unexpectedly-in-jira-cloud/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.2.3-008","sec":"620.2.3","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"On a company-managed Kanban board, an issue that was completed long ago reappears on the board the day after someone edits its Description. What is the cause?","opts":["The sub-filter was changed.","The sort order of the board filter changed.","The issue was reopened.","The Hide completed work timer counts from the last updated time, so editing any field resets it."],"zh":"CMP Kanban 上一張早就完成的 issue，因為有人改了它的 Description，隔天又出現在 board 上。原因？","zo":["sub-filter 被改掉","board filter 排序改變","issue 被 reopen","Hide completed work 的計時以「最後更新時間」起算，編輯欄位會重設"],"ans":"D","why":{"D":"正解。官方 KB 說明了兩個關鍵行為：<strong>Kanban 是用 Done status category 判定完成的</strong>（跟對應到哪一欄無關），而<strong>隱藏的計時是以「最後更新時間」起算的，任何欄位的編輯都會把計時器重設</strong>——連改一下 Description 這種無關緊要的動作都算。所以一張半年前就完成的 issue，只要昨天有人補了一句說明，今天就會重新出現在 board 上，要等設定的區間再次經過才會消失。","A":"題目沒有任何人動過 sub-filter，而且 sub-filter 管的是「已發佈版本的 issue 要不要隱藏」，跟這個現象無關。","B":"排序只改變卡片<strong>出現的先後順序</strong>，不會決定它出不出現。","C":"issue 的 status 完全沒有變動，它仍然是完成狀態——這正是讓人困惑的地方：明明沒重開，卻又冒出來了。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira/kb/kanban-board-shows-or-hides-completed-work-unexpectedly-in-jira-cloud/"],"lvl":3,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.2.3-009","sec":"620.2.3","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Which statement correctly describes how a company-managed Kanban board and a Scrum board determine that an issue is completed?","opts":["Kanban's Hide completed work uses the Done status category; Scrum uses the rightmost column.","Both use the status category.","Kanban uses the resolution; Scrum uses the status.","Both use the rightmost column."],"zh":"CMP Kanban 判斷「已完成」與 Scrum board 判斷「已完成」的依據，何者正確？","zo":["Kanban 的 Hide completed work 看 Done status category；Scrum 看最右欄","兩者都看 status category","Kanban 看 resolution，Scrum 看 status","兩者都看最右欄"],"ans":"A","why":{"D":"只有 Scrum 看最右欄；<strong>Kanban 的隱藏規則跟欄位位置無關</strong>，看的是 category。","A":"正解。這兩個判定機制不一樣，是很容易混淆的一組對照。官方 KB：<strong>Kanban 的 Hide completed work 以「status 屬不屬於 Done category」判斷</strong>，跟它被對應到哪一欄無關；而 <strong>Scrum 完成 sprint 時只認「issue 有沒有落在最右欄」</strong>。所以同一張 issue 在兩種 board 上可能有不同表現。","B":"Scrum 看的是<strong>最右欄的位置</strong>，不是 status category。一個屬於 Done category 但被放在中間欄的 status，在 Scrum 完成 sprint 時仍算未完成。","C":"兩者都不是以 resolution 判定。resolution 是另一個獨立的欄位，它會影響 JQL 查詢與部分報表，但 board 的完成判定不看它。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira/kb/kanban-board-shows-or-hides-completed-work-unexpectedly-in-jira-cloud/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-columns/"],"lvl":3,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.2.3-010","sec":"620.2.3","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A board for a single project uses the simplified workflow. The project administrator wants to delete a status. According to Atlassian documentation, what is the condition for deleting it?","opts":["The status can be deleted at any time.","No issues are in that status; if other workflows also use the status, it is removed only from this workflow.","Only a Jira administrator can delete it.","The status's column must be deleted first."],"zh":"單一 project 的 board 用 simplified workflow。project admin 想刪除一個 status，官方條件是？","zo":["隨時可刪","該 status 底下沒有 issue；若別的 workflow 也用它，只會從本 workflow 移除","只有 Jira admin 可刪","要先刪掉 column"],"ans":"B","why":{"D":"沒有這種先後順序的要求。真正的前提是「該 status 底下沒有 issue」。","A":"不是隨時可刪。<strong>只要該 status 底下還有任何 issue，刪除按鈕就是灰的</strong>——Jira 不允許讓 issue 變成沒有狀態的孤兒。","B":"正解。官方列出的條件是：<strong>該 status 底下沒有任何 issue 才能刪除</strong>（先用 JQL 找出來把它們轉走）。還有一個容易誤解的行為要一起記：<strong>如果站台上別的 workflow 也在使用這個 status，刪除動作只是把它從「目前這個 workflow」移除，status 物件本身不會從全站消失</strong>。","C":"題目已經指明是 simplified workflow 的情境——在這個條件下 <strong>project admin 自己就能新增與刪除 status</strong>，不必找 Jira admin。這正是 simplified workflow 的價值。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/use-the-simplified-workflow/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-columns/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.2.3-011","sec":"620.2.3","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Can the same status be mapped to two columns at the same time?","opts":["Only a Jira administrator can configure this.","Yes, so that the status is displayed in both columns.","No, a status can belong to only one column.","Only on Kanban boards."],"zh":"同一個 status 能否同時映射到兩個 column？","zo":["只有 Jira admin 可以設定","可以，用於在兩欄都顯示","不可以，一個 status 只能屬於一個 column","只有 Kanban 可以"],"ans":"C","why":{"D":"Kanban 與 Scrum 的規則完全一樣，沒有差別。","A":"這不是權限問題，而是產品的結構限制——連 Jira admin 也做不到。","B":"Jira <strong>不支援</strong>把同一個 status 重複映射到多個 column，設定介面上也不會讓你這樣拖。","C":"正解。官方規定：<strong>在同一塊 board 上，一個 status 只能對應到一個 column</strong>。反過來則沒有限制——<strong>一個 column 可以裝很多個 status</strong>，這正是把細緻的 workflow 收斂成簡潔 board 的方法。記法：<strong>多對一可以，一對多不行</strong>。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-columns/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.2.3-012","sec":"620.2.3","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"When a board is created for a project that uses a standard Jira workflow (Open / In Progress / Resolved / Closed), what is the default column mapping?","opts":["All statuses are Unmapped.","Statuses are mapped in alphabetical order of their names.","All statuses are mapped to To Do.","Open and Reopened → To Do; In Progress → In Progress; Resolved and Closed → Done."],"zh":"一般 Jira workflow（Open／In Progress／Resolved／Closed）的 board 建立時，官方預設映射是？","zo":["全部 Unmapped","依 status 名稱字母序","全部進 To Do","Open、Reopened → To Do；In Progress → In Progress；Resolved、Closed → Done"],"ans":"D","why":{"C":"不會全部塞進同一欄，那樣 board 就失去意義了。","D":"正解。官方 Configure columns 頁列出的預設映射表就是：<strong>Open 與 Reopened → To Do；In Progress → In Progress；Resolved 與 Closed → Done</strong>。如果 project 用的是 simplified workflow，則是 To Do／In Progress／Done 三個 status 一對一對應到三個同名欄位。要注意官方也提醒：<strong>自訂的 status 不在這張預設表裡，建好 board 之後要自己檢查並拖進適當的欄位</strong>。","A":"預設<strong>會</strong>建立映射，不會全部丟在 Unmapped 讓你自己拖。真正需要手動處理的是後來新增的自訂 status。","B":"映射依據的是 status 的<strong>語意類別</strong>，不是名稱的字母順序。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-columns/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.2.3-013","sec":"620.2.3","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A team-managed project wants to use a workflow rule to restrict who can move issues to Done. Which statement about transition rules in team-managed projects is explicitly stated in Atlassian documentation?","opts":["Each transition can have up to 10 groups of Restrict transition rules, with 50 rules per group; removing the role that a rule is tied to prevents the team from making that transition.","Only a Jira administrator can add workflow rules.","Restrict who can move a work item can specify only a single user.","Each transition can have at most one rule."],"zh":"TMP 想限制「誰可以把工作移進 Done」，要用 workflow rule。關於 team-managed 的 transition rules，官方明列的是？","zo":["每個 transition 最多 10 組 Restrict transition rules，每組 50 條；移除 rule 綁定的 role 會讓團隊無法轉換","只有 Jira admin 能新增 workflow rule","Restrict who can move a work item 只能指定單一使用者","每個 transition 最多只能有 1 條 rule"],"ans":"A","why":{"D":"每個 transition <strong>可以加多條 rule</strong>，而且 Restrict 類還另有分組上限（10 組、每組 50 條），遠不只 1 條。","A":"正解。官方 Add or remove workflow rules 頁明列每個 transition 的上限：<strong>最多 10 組 Restrict transition rules（每組 50 條）、50 條 Validate details、50 條 Perform actions</strong>。另外官方特別提醒一個實務陷阱：<strong>如果把 rule 所綁定的那個 role 移除掉，團隊就會卡在這個 transition 動不了</strong>——所以調整 role 之前要先檢查有沒有 rule 依賴它。","B":"不需要 Jira admin。在 TMP，設定 workflow rule 需要的是<strong>該 space 的 Administrator role</strong> 或 <strong>Administer spaces</strong> 權限，project admin 自己就能做——這正是 TMP 把設定權下放的特性。","C":"官方頁面<strong>並沒有</strong>把可選對象限縮成單一使用者。實際下拉能選哪些對象（指定使用者、role、group、特定權限）以站台畫面為準——這是教材刻意保留的證據界線，不要照舊教材的斷言作答。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>官方頁未逐項列出 Restrict who can move a work item 的可選對象（使用者／role／group／assignee／reporter…），要斷言清單請以實機畫面驗證。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/add-or-remove-workflow-rules-in-team-managed-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.2.4-001","sec":"620.2.4","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"During a meeting, a user wants to temporarily view only their own issues. What should they do first?","opts":["Use a quick filter.","Change the board's location.","Delete other people's issues.","Change the base filter shared by all boards."],"zh":"開會時只想臨時看自己的工作，應優先用？","zo":["Quick filter","改 board 的 location","刪除別人的工作","改所有 board 共用的 base filter"],"ans":"A","why":{"D":"改 board 共用的 base filter 會<strong>改變所有使用者的資料範圍</strong>，也會波及其他共用同一份 filter 的 board。為了開會五分鐘的方便而動到共用設定，是典型的錯誤操作。","A":"正解。<strong>quick filter 是「臨時聚焦」的正確工具</strong>：一鍵開、一鍵關，勾選狀態只存在自己的瀏覽器裡，<strong>完全不會影響其他人看到的畫面</strong>。內建的 Only My Issues 就是為這個情境準備的。","B":"location 只決定 board 掛在哪裡好找，<strong>它完全不是篩選工具</strong>。","C":"為了自己看得清楚而刪別人的工作，是破壞資料——視圖的問題永遠在視圖層解決。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-quick-filters/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.2.4-002","sec":"620.2.4","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A board's base filter includes only the WEBLAB project. A quick filter uses <code>project = APILAB</code>. What is the result when the quick filter is enabled?","opts":["All APILAB issues are displayed.","No issues are displayed.","APILAB issues are moved into WEBLAB.","The two projects are merged automatically."],"zh":"Base filter 只含 WEBLAB，一個 quick filter 寫 project = APILAB。啟用後結果？","zo":["顯示全部 APILAB","空集合","APILAB 的工作被搬進 WEBLAB","自動合併兩個 project"],"ans":"B","why":{"C":"filter 只是查詢條件，<strong>不會搬動任何 issue</strong>。","D":"quick filter 的作用是在 board filter 的<strong>結果之上再篩一次</strong>，永遠不會把新的 project 合併進來。","A":"quick filter <strong>沒有能力擴充 base filter 的範圍</strong>——三層過濾是一個只能往下收窄的漏斗。","B":"正解。三層過濾的規則是層層取交集：base filter 只給出 WEBLAB 的 issue，quick filter 再要求 <code>project = APILAB</code>，<strong>兩個條件互斥、沒有交集，結果就是空白</strong>。這也是實務上「勾了 quick filter 之後 board 整個空掉」最常見的原因——條件寫到了 board filter 範圍之外。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-quick-filters/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-filters/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.2.4-003","sec":"620.2.4","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A team wants to view Bug or Task issues at the same time. Which quick filter is most appropriate?","opts":["<code>assignee = currentUser()</code>","<code>ORDER BY priority</code>","<code>issuetype in (Bug, Task)</code>","Create separate Bug and Task quick filters and enable both at the same time."],"zh":"想一次看到 Bug 或 Task，最適合的 quick filter？","zo":["assignee = currentUser()","ORDER BY priority","issuetype in (Bug, Task)","分別建 Bug 與 Task 兩個 quick filter 同時啟用"],"ans":"C","why":{"C":"正解。<strong>用一個 quick filter 搭配 <code>IN</code> 來表達聯集</strong>：<code>issuetype in (Bug, Task)</code>。因為 IN 等同於「多個等於用 OR 串起來」，正好符合「Bug 或 Task」的需求。","D":"這是本題最重要的陷阱：<strong>同時啟用多個 quick filter 之間是 AND 而不是 OR</strong>。同時勾選「Bug」與「Task」等於要求「既是 Bug 又是 Task」，兩者互斥，結果會是空白。要 OR 就必須把 OR（或 IN）寫在同一句 JQL 裡。","A":"這是篩選<strong>負責人</strong>，跟 issue 的類型完全無關，答非所問。","B":"ORDER BY 是排序子句，<strong>不表達任何篩選條件</strong>；而且 quick filter 裡寫 ORDER BY 是無效的，排序永遠由 board filter 決定。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-quick-filters/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.2.4-004","sec":"620.2.4","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"On a company-managed Kanban board, a team wants to exclude issues in released versions but keep issues that have no version. Which sub-filter meets this requirement?","opts":["<code>fixVersion is not EMPTY</code>","<code>resolution = Unresolved</code>","<code>assignee is EMPTY</code>","<code>fixVersion in unreleasedVersions() OR fixVersion is EMPTY</code>"],"zh":"CMP Kanban 想排除已 release 的版本、但保留沒有版本的工作。哪個 sub-filter 符合？","zo":["fixVersion is not EMPTY","resolution = Unresolved","assignee is EMPTY","fixVersion in unreleasedVersions() OR fixVersion is EMPTY"],"ans":"D","why":{"B":"resolution（解決結果）與 fixVersion（在哪一版釋出）是兩個不同的欄位，<strong>issue 已解決不代表它所屬的版本已發佈</strong>，兩者不能互換。","C":"assignee 跟版本完全無關。","D":"正解。這正是 Kanban board 的<strong>預設 sub-filter</strong>：<code>fixVersion in unreleasedVersions() OR fixVersion is EMPTY</code>。它的兩段分別對應題目的兩個需求——<strong>前半段保留「版本尚未發佈」的工作</strong>（等於排除已 release 的），<strong>後半段保留「根本沒填版本」的工作</strong>。這也是為什麼 CMP Kanban 一發佈版本，Done 欄的卡片就會自動消失。","A":"這只挑出「有填版本」的 issue，<strong>完全沒有判斷該版本發佈了沒</strong>，方向不對；而且它會把沒有版本的工作全部排除掉，與題目要求相反。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>現行 Cloud 的 sub-filter 說明頁不再逐字列出這句 JQL，行為敘述在 KB；作答仍以這個預設語意為準。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/add-a-sub-filter-to-a-company-managed-kanban-board/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira/kb/kanban-board-shows-or-hides-completed-work-unexpectedly-in-jira-cloud/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/advanced-search-reference-jql-functions/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.2.4-005","sec":"620.2.4","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A board administrator cannot edit a saved filter owned by someone else but needs to change the board's scope. What is the most appropriate approach?","opts":["Use Save as to create a new filter, and then set the board to use it in Board settings → General.","Change all issue types.","Change the working days.","Keep refreshing the page."],"zh":"Board admin 無法編輯別人擁有的 saved filter，但需要改 board 範圍。最適合？","zo":["Save as 另存新 filter，並在 Board settings → General 指定 board 改用它","變更所有 issue type","改 working days","一直重新整理"],"ans":"A","why":{"D":"重新整理不會授予任何權限，這只是白費力氣。","A":"正解。這是最安全也最標準的做法：<strong>用 Save as 另存一份自己擁有的新 filter，改好 JQL 之後到 Board settings → General 把 board 指過去</strong>。原本那份 filter 完全不動，其他共用它的 board 與 gadget 也不受影響。要記住 <strong>board admin 不等於 filter editor</strong>，這兩個是不同物件的權限。","B":"變更 issue type 是動到真實資料的重大操作，跟「沒有 filter 編輯權」這個問題毫無關係。","C":"working days 只影響報表的天數計算，處理不了 filter 的問題。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-filters/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/manage-filters/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.2.4-006","sec":"620.2.4","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"<code>ORDER BY Rank ASC</code> was removed from a board's filter. Which of the following can still be done?","opts":["Rank issues by dragging them in the backlog.","Filter cards by using quick filters.","Display sub-tasks grouped under their parent.","Drag issues from the Kanban backlog onto the board."],"zh":"board filter 拿掉了 ORDER BY Rank ASC。以下哪一件事仍然可以做？","zo":["在 backlog 拖曳排序","用 quick filter 篩選卡片","把 sub-task 歸在 parent 底下顯示","把 Kanban backlog 的工作拖進 board"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"拖曳排序<strong>正是需要 Rank</strong> 的功能——Jira 靠 Rank 這個欄位記住人工排序的結果，沒有它就沒有地方可以儲存新順序。","B":"正解。<strong>quick filter 純粹是加上額外的篩選條件，跟排序機制無關</strong>，所以就算 filter 沒有 ORDER BY Rank，quick filter 照樣能用。這題要建立的是「Rank 到底影響哪些功能」的清單：<strong>會失效的是拖曳排序、建立與規劃 sprint、sub-task 歸到 parent 底下、從 Kanban backlog 拖進 board；不受影響的是篩選、顯示、報表</strong>。","C":"sub-task 歸在 parent 底下顯示<strong>依賴 Rank</strong>，少了它 sub-task 會散落各處。","D":"從 Kanban backlog 把工作拖進 board <strong>也依賴 Rank</strong>，同樣會失效。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/enable-ranking/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/rank-an-issue/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.2.4-007","sec":"620.2.4","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A board shows that issues cannot be ranked by dragging, and the board administrator clicks Add Rank. What is the scope of this action?","opts":["A new filter is created.","Only the administrator's own view is affected.","The saved filter is modified, so other boards that use the same filter are also affected.","Only the current board is affected."],"zh":"board 顯示「無法拖曳排序」，board admin 按下 Add Rank。這個動作的影響範圍？","zo":["會建立新 filter","只影響自己的畫面","會修改 saved filter，使用同一 filter 的其他 board 也受影響","只影響目前 board"],"ans":"C","why":{"B":"這不是個人偏好設定，它動到的是共用的 saved filter 物件，<strong>所有人都會受影響</strong>。","C":"正解。<strong>Add Rank 會直接在 saved filter 的 JQL 結尾加上 <code>ORDER BY Rank ASC</code></strong>，而 filter 是共用物件——所以<strong>其他使用同一份 filter 的 board 也會跟著改變排序</strong>。還有一個更深的影響要知道：<strong>Rank 是全站共用的排序資料</strong>，你在這塊 board 上重排，另一塊以 Rank 排序的 board 也會看到新順序，不是每塊 board 各留一份優先順序。動正式的共用 filter 之前，建議先另存一份測試。","D":"影響範圍不只目前這塊 board，因為 filter 是共用的。","A":"Add Rank 是<strong>就地修改現有的 filter</strong>，不會另外建立一份新的。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/enable-ranking/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.2.4-008","sec":"620.2.4","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"In Board settings → Quick Filters on a company-managed board, which two quick filters does Jira provide by default?","opts":["Bugs and Tasks","Unassigned and Overdue","Current Sprint and Backlog","Only My Issues and Recently Updated"],"zh":"company-managed board 的 Board settings → Quick Filters 裡，Jira 預設就給的兩個 quick filter 是？","zo":["Bugs 與 Tasks","Unassigned 與 Overdue","Current Sprint 與 Backlog","Only My Issues 與 Recently Updated"],"ans":"D","why":{"B":"Unassigned 與 Overdue 也不是預設，同樣要自己建立。","C":"Current Sprint 與 Backlog 不是 quick filter，它們是 board 的不同畫面。","D":"正解。Jira 預設提供的兩個 quick filter 是 <strong>Only My Issues</strong>（<code>assignee = currentUser()</code>）與 <strong>Recently Updated</strong>（<code>updatedDate >= -1d</code>），而且它們<strong>只出現在 company-managed space</strong>。兩個都可以自由編輯或刪除。（另外那組 Assignee／Epic／Label／Work type 的下拉篩選則是兩種 project 都有的，不要跟 quick filter 搞混。）","A":"Bugs 與 Tasks 不是預設的 quick filter，那是常見的自訂範例。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-quick-filters/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/show-or-hide-issues-on-your-board/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.2.4-009","sec":"620.2.4","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"On a company-managed Kanban board, all issues of one issue type have disappeared, while other issue types display normally. Investigation shows that the Fix Version field is hidden for that issue type by the field configuration. Why did the issues disappear?","opts":["For JQL, the fixVersion of that issue type is neither unreleased nor EMPTY, so the issues are excluded by the default sub-filter.","Hiding the field causes the issues to lose the Browse Projects permission.","Kanban boards do not support issues without a version.","Hiding a field deletes the issues."],"zh":"CMP Kanban 上，某個 issue type 的所有工作都不見了，其他 type 正常。排查後發現該 type 的 Fix Version 欄位被 field configuration 隱藏。為什麼會消失？","zo":["對 JQL 而言該 type 的 fixVersion 既不是 unreleased 也不是 EMPTY，被預設 sub-filter 排除","隱藏欄位讓 issue 失去 Browse 權限","Kanban 不支援沒有版本的工作","隱藏欄位會刪除工作"],"ans":"A","why":{"D":"隱藏欄位<strong>絕對不會刪除任何 issue</strong>，資料完好，用 JQL 或直接連結都找得到。","A":"正解。官方 KB 說明了這個機制：<strong>如果 board filter 或 sub-filter 的 JQL 引用了某個被 field configuration 隱藏的欄位，那個 issue type 的工作就不會顯示在 board 上</strong>。具體來說，欄位被隱藏之後對 JQL 而言等於「不存在」——它既不符合 <code>fixVersion in unreleasedVersions()</code>，也不符合 <code>fixVersion is EMPTY</code>，於是被預設 sub-filter 整組排除。修法是把欄位設回可見並重建索引，或是清空 sub-filter。","B":"隱藏欄位是<strong>顯示層</strong>的設定，跟 Browse Projects 這種存取權限完全無關。","C":"正好相反——預設 sub-filter 的 <code>OR fixVersion is EMPTY</code> 那一段，就是<strong>刻意保留</strong>沒有版本的工作。這題的狀況是欄位被隱藏後連 EMPTY 都判定不成立。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira/kb/specific-issue-type-is-not-visible-on-the-board-for-the-jira-kanban-project/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/add-a-sub-filter-to-a-company-managed-kanban-board/"],"lvl":3,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.2.4-010","sec":"620.2.4","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Which statement about the effect of a Kanban board sub-filter on reports best matches Atlassian documentation?","opts":["All reports always apply the sub-filter.","The sub-filter changes only what the board displays; reports use the board's saved filter, so issues hidden by the sub-filter are still counted in reports.","It affects only the Burndown Chart.","The sub-filter narrows the data scope of both the board and the Cumulative Flow Diagram (CFD)."],"zh":"關於 Kanban sub-filter 對報表的影響，最符合官方文件的說法？","zo":["所有報表一定都套用 sub-filter","Sub-filter 只改變 board 顯示；報表依 board 的 saved filter，被 sub-filter 藏掉的 issue 報表照樣算","只影響 Burndown","Sub-filter 會同時縮小 board 與 CFD 的資料範圍"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。這正是常見誤解。官方 Data Center 版明講：預設 sub-filter 讓已 release 的 issue 從 board 消失，<em>although the reports in Reports will continue to show them</em>，報表並沒有套用 sub-filter。","B":"正解。官方原句是 sub-filter 讓 Kanban board <strong>顯示和 Reports 不同的資料</strong>：board 被 sub-filter 縮小，報表仍以 board 的 <strong>saved filter</strong> 為範圍（CFD 官方頁：只包含 match your board's saved filter 的 issue）。所以被藏掉的 issue，報表照樣算。","C":"錯。Kanban board 根本沒有 Burndown 報表（那是 Scrum 的），這個選項本身就不成立；而且 sub-filter 不會縮小任何報表。","D":"錯。CFD 官方頁寫的是只包含符合 board <strong>saved filter</strong> 的 issue，並沒有套 sub-filter；sub-filter 只改變 board 上看得到哪些卡片。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/add-a-sub-filter-to-a-company-managed-kanban-board/","https://confluence.atlassian.com/jirasoftwareserver/configuring-filters-938845268.html","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-cumulative-flow-diagram/"],"lvl":3,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.2.4-011","sec":"620.2.4","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"In Board settings → General, there are two actions: selecting a different Saved Filter, and Edit Filter Query. What is the difference between them?","opts":["The latter creates a new filter.","They perform the same function.","The former makes the board use a different existing filter; the latter modifies the JQL of the current filter, which affects everyone who shares it.","Only a Jira administrator can use the former."],"zh":"在 Board settings → General 看到兩個動作：換一個 Saved Filter，以及 Edit Filter Query。差別是？","zo":["後者會建立新 filter","一樣的功能","前者讓 board 改用另一個既有 filter；後者修改目前 filter 的 JQL（影響所有共用者）","前者只有 Jira admin 能用"],"ans":"C","why":{"B":"這兩個動作差很多，而且風險等級完全不同，絕不能混為一談。","C":"正解。<strong>換一個 Saved Filter</strong>：只是讓這塊 board 改去讀另一份既有的 filter，<strong>原本那份 filter 一點都沒動</strong>，其他使用它的 board 完全不受影響。<strong>Edit Filter Query</strong>：修改的是<strong>目前這份 filter 本身</strong>，所有共用它的 board、dashboard gadget 與訂閱都會同時改變。實務建議是：沒有把握時一律走「Save as 另存 → 換 filter」這條安全路線。","D":"換 filter 是 board 層級的設定，<strong>board admin 就能做</strong>，不需要 Jira admin。（反倒是 Edit Filter Query 需要那份 filter 的編輯權。）","A":"Edit Filter Query 是<strong>就地修改現有 filter 的 JQL</strong>，不會建立新的 filter。想要新的一份得自己用 Save as。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-filters/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.2.4-012","sec":"620.2.4","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A board filter returns three cards: A, B, and C. The sub-filter keeps only B and C, and a quick filter keeps only A and C. When all of them are applied, what does the board display?","opts":["No cards (an empty set)","A, B, and C","B and C","C"],"zh":"board filter 有 A、B、C 三張卡片；sub-filter 只保留 B、C；quick filter 只保留 A、C。全部啟用後 board 顯示？","zo":["空集合","A、B、C","B、C","C"],"ans":"D","why":{"D":"正解。三層之間都是 <strong>AND</strong>（取交集），逐層計算：<strong>base filter 給出 {A,B,C} → sub-filter 保留 {B,C} → quick filter 保留 {A,C}</strong>，三者的交集只剩下 <strong>C</strong>。這題就是三層漏斗的算術驗收：能分別說出每一層各排除了哪一張，才算真的懂了。","A":"不是空集合——C 這一張同時通過了三層條件。","B":"三層過濾是<strong>逐層縮小</strong>的漏斗，不可能全部保留。","C":"這只算到第二層（sub-filter 之後剩 B、C），忘了第三層的 quick filter 會再把 B 排除掉。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-quick-filters/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/add-a-sub-filter-to-a-company-managed-kanban-board/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.2.4-013","sec":"620.2.4","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Which statement about the Rank field is correct?","opts":["A site should have only one Rank field with a global context; in JQL, Rank can be used only in <code>ORDER BY</code>.","Each board has its own separate Rank.","Rank is case-insensitive.","JQL can use <code>Rank &gt; 5</code> to return the top-ranked issues."],"zh":"Rank 欄位相關的正確描述？","zo":["站台只應有一個 global context 的 Rank 欄位；JQL 中 Rank 只能用來 ORDER BY","Rank 是每個 board 各自一份","Rank 大小寫不敏感","JQL 可以寫 Rank &gt; 5 取前幾名"],"ans":"A","why":{"B":"Rank 是<strong>全站共用的欄位</strong>，不是每塊 board 各存一份。這也是為什麼在一塊 board 上重排，另一塊以 Rank 排序的 board 也會看到新順序。","C":"在 JQL 中 <strong>Rank 這個欄位名稱是大小寫敏感的</strong>，寫錯大小寫會找不到欄位。","D":"<strong>不能做數值比較</strong>。Rank 儲存的是相對位置而非數字，寫 <code>Rank &gt; 5</code> 是無效的語法。","A":"正解。官方 Enable ranking 頁的兩個重點：<strong>站台上只應該存在一個 global context 的 Rank 欄位</strong>（有多個會讓排序錯亂），而且 <strong>Rank 在 JQL 中只能用於 <code>ORDER BY</code></strong>，因為它記錄的是「相對順序」而不是一個可比較的數值。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/enable-ranking/"],"lvl":3,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.2.5-001","sec":"620.2.5","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Are 5 story points equal to 5 hours?","opts":["No. They are different scales and cannot be converted directly.","Only on Kanban boards.","It depends on the card color.","Yes, always."],"zh":"Story points 5 是否等於 5 小時？","zo":["兩者是不同尺度，不能直接換算","只在 Kanban 上等於","取決於卡片顏色","一定等於"],"ans":"A","why":{"D":"points 不是時間單位，兩者永遠不會相等。實務上有些團隊會統計「平均一點大約幾小時」當參考，但那是團隊自己的經驗值，不是 Jira 的規則。","A":"正解。<strong>story points 與時間是兩種不同的尺度，沒有固定換算率</strong>。story points 衡量的是相對的複雜度、工作量與不確定性，時間則是實際耗用的小時數；同樣 5 點的工作，不同人、不同情況花的時間都不同。這也是為什麼 board 的 estimation 設定把「用什麼估」與「用什麼追蹤進度」拆成兩個獨立的旋鈕——它們可以並存，但不會互相換算。","B":"board 的類型（Scrum 或 Kanban）<strong>不會建立任何換算率</strong>。","C":"卡片顏色只是視覺標示，跟估算單位毫無關係。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-estimation-and-tracking/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.2.5-002","sec":"620.2.5","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"What does selecting None for Time Tracking in Board settings mean?","opts":["Logging work is disabled across the entire site.","The estimation statistic is used to track sprint progress.","Sprints are canceled.","All worklogs are deleted."],"zh":"Board settings 的 Time tracking 選 None 代表什麼？","zo":["全站禁止記錄工時","沿用 estimation statistic 來追蹤 sprint 進度","取消 sprint","刪除所有 worklog"],"ans":"B","why":{"D":"既有的 worklog 完全不會被刪除，它們只是不再被 burndown 拿來當進度依據。","A":"這個設定是 <strong>board 層級</strong>的，跟站台的 time tracking 全域開關完全是兩回事。選了 None 之後，使用者照樣可以在 issue 上 Log work。","B":"正解。Time tracking 選 <strong>None</strong> 的意思是「<strong>不另外選一種追蹤方法</strong>」，於是 burndown 直接沿用 <strong>estimation statistic</strong>（例如 story points）當縱軸——issue 進到最右欄被視為完成時，曲線才一次往下掉那幾點。反過來選 Remaining estimate and time spent 的話，縱軸會換成剩餘時間，每次 log work 就往下掉一些。","C":"這個設定跟 sprint 的存廢毫無關係，sprint 照常運作。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-estimation-and-tracking/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.2.5-003","sec":"620.2.5","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An issue has an original estimate of 10h, time spent of 4h, and a remaining estimate of 8h. What is the current forecast of the total effort?","opts":["10h, which never changes","4h","12h","6h"],"zh":"原估 10h、已花 4h、剩餘 8h。目前對總投入的預測是？","zo":["10h，永遠不變","4h","12h","6h"],"ans":"C","why":{"B":"4h 只是<strong>已經花掉的時間（time spent）</strong>，它回答不了「總共會花多少」這個問題。","C":"正解。目前對總投入的預測 ＝ <strong>已花（4h）＋ 剩餘（8h）＝ 12h</strong>。而原估是 10h，所以這張 issue 目前預測會超支 2 小時——這正是 time tracking 面板要傳達的資訊。要提醒一個實務上的壞習慣：<strong>不要為了讓數字好看，硬把 Remaining 填成 6h</strong>；remaining 應該反映最新的真實預測，而不是拿來湊平原估。","D":"6h 是「原估 10 減去已花 4」的算術結果，但那只是<strong>假設原估完全準確</strong>時的推論。實際的 remaining 是使用者自己填的 8h，要以它為準。","A":"原估（Original estimate）記錄的是<strong>當初的預測</strong>，它不會隨進度改變，也<strong>不是成本上限</strong>——實際超支是很常見的事，Jira 只是如實呈現。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-estimation-and-tracking/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.2.5-004","sec":"620.2.5","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A Scrum board's estimation statistic is changed from Story points to Original time estimate. How should the velocity trend be interpreted?","opts":["Treat the data before and after the change as directly comparable.","All points are automatically multiplied by 8.","Delete the old sprints.","Recheck the field, unit, and report scale, and accept a break in the historical data."],"zh":"Scrum board 的 estimation 從 Story points 改成 Original time estimate 之後，怎麼看 velocity 趨勢？","zo":["直接視為可比較","所有 points 自動乘 8","刪除舊 sprint","重新確認欄位、單位與報表尺度，接受歷史斷層"],"ans":"D","why":{"C":"刪掉舊 sprint 只會讓歷史消失，既不能解決比較的問題，還損失了資料。","D":"正解。更換 estimation statistic 的代價是：<strong>報表會即時用「目前設定的欄位」重算歷史，舊 sprint 的 issue 沒填新欄位就會變成 0，造成 velocity 的歷史斷層</strong>。所以正確做法是重新確認欄位、單位與報表的尺度，明確告訴團隊「這條線的前後段量的不是同一件事」，並接受斷層。官方的建議很直接——<strong>statistic 一旦選定就不要再換</strong>。","A":"story points 與時間是<strong>兩種不同的尺度</strong>，直接把兩段歷史畫在一起比較是沒有意義的，會得出錯誤的結論。","B":"<strong>沒有任何通用的換算率</strong>可以把 points 乘上一個係數變成小時，Jira 也不會幫你換算。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-estimation-and-tracking/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-velocity-chart/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.2.5-005","sec":"620.2.5","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A board uses Story points as its estimation statistic, but the field is not available to fill in on issues. What should be done first?","opts":["Check the field context, issue type, screen/layout, and permissions.","Increase the WIP limit.","Share a dashboard.","Check the board name."],"zh":"board 設了 Story points 為 statistic，但 issue 上沒有這個欄位可填。先查？","zo":["欄位 context、issue type、screen／layout 與權限","提高 WIP limit","分享 dashboard","Board 名稱"],"ans":"A","why":{"D":"board 的名稱純粹是顯示文字。","A":"正解。欄位能不能填，有一整條配置鏈要逐段檢查：<strong>custom field 的 context 有沒有涵蓋這個 project 與 issue type → 欄位有沒有被加進該 issue type 的 screen → project 的 issue layout 有沒有把它藏起來 → 使用者有沒有 Edit Issues 權限</strong>。board 的 estimation 設定只決定「報表要用哪個欄位算」，它<strong>不會自動把欄位放到畫面上</strong>——這是兩件獨立的事。","B":"WIP limit 只是欄位上方的數量提醒，跟欄位顯示毫無關係。","C":"dashboard 是呈現資料的地方，<strong>不會替 issue 補上缺少的欄位</strong>。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-estimation-and-tracking/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.2.5-006","sec":"620.2.5","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"When no estimation statistic is selected in Board settings, what does the burndown chart use for its calculation?","opts":["Original time estimate","Issue count (work item count)","The burndown chart is not displayed.","Story points"],"zh":"Board settings 沒有選任何 estimation statistic 時，burndown 用什麼算？","zo":["Original time estimate","Issue count（work item count）","不顯示 burndown","Story points"],"ans":"B","why":{"D":"沒有選擇的情況下不會用 story points——那需要明確設定。","A":"沒有選擇任何 statistic 時，系統<strong>不會</strong>自作主張改用時間估算。","B":"正解。官方原句：<strong>如果你沒有選擇 estimation statistic，工作量會以「work item count」（issue 張數）來衡量</strong>。也就是說 burndown 與 velocity 照常運作，只是每一張 issue 都算 1，不管大小。這種模式適合工作顆粒度相當平均的團隊，缺點是失去對「大小」的敏感度。","C":"burndown <strong>仍然會顯示</strong>，只是縱軸的單位換成張數。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-estimation-and-tracking/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/enable-estimation/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.2.5-007","sec":"620.2.5","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"After Time Tracking is set to Remaining estimate and time spent, how are the remaining estimates of sub-tasks included in the burndown chart?","opts":["Only story points are counted.","They are completely ignored.","They roll up to the parent and are counted with it.","They are counted as separate cards."],"zh":"Time tracking 選 Remaining estimate and time spent 後，sub-task 的 remaining estimate 會怎麼進入 burndown？","zo":["只計 story points","完全忽略","捲上 parent 一起計入","以獨立卡片計入"],"ans":"C","why":{"B":"正好相反：<strong>切換到 time tracking 模式的最大差別，就是 sub-task 的工時開始被計入</strong>。（不被計入的永遠是 sub-task 的 story points。）","C":"正解。官方說明：在 Remaining estimate and time spent 模式下，<strong>sub-task 的 remaining estimate 會捲上（roll-up）parent</strong>，parent 顯示的是所有 sub-task 剩餘時間的總和，burndown 也是以此計算。這也帶來一個附帶效果：<strong>sprint 進行中新增 sub-task，圖上會看得到 scope change</strong>（紅線往上跳），而在 None 模式下則看不出來。","D":"sub-task <strong>不會</strong>以獨立項目的身分被計入，它的數字是彙總到 parent 身上的。","A":"這個模式下 burndown 的縱軸已經換成<strong>剩餘時間</strong>，不再使用 story points。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-estimation-and-tracking/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-burndown-chart/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.2.5-008","sec":"620.2.5","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A sub-task has 3 story points, and its parent has 5 story points. How many points do the Scrum burndown chart and velocity chart count?","opts":["3","It depends on the board settings.","8","5"],"zh":"sub-task 填了 3 個 story points，parent 填 5。Scrum burndown 與 velocity 會算多少？","zo":["3","依 board 設定","8","5"],"ans":"D","why":{"B":"這不是由 board 設定決定的可變行為，而是<strong>一條固定規則</strong>：估點統計永遠只看 standard 層。","C":"8 是把 5 與 3 相加的直覺答案，但 <strong>sub-task 的 story points 不會被加總上去</strong>。","D":"正解。答案是 <strong>5</strong>，只算 parent 的估點。官方在 Velocity chart 的說明頁直接寫了「Estimates from sub-tasks are not included」——<strong>sub-task 的 story points 永遠不計入 burndown 與 velocity</strong>，就算填了也一樣。這也是為什麼實務上建議<strong>估點只估在 story 這一層</strong>，免得團隊誤以為有算到。","A":"不會只算 sub-task，這個方向完全相反。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-burndown-chart/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-velocity-chart/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.2.5-009","sec":"620.2.5","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"After a sprint starts, the burndown chart does not show the grey guideline. Which of the following is NOT a cause listed in Atlassian documentation?","opts":["The Story points field was not added to the board's card layout.","There were no issues or estimates on the board when the sprint started.","The sprint start time was set in the past, or the time zones are inconsistent.","The done status is not mapped to the rightmost column."],"zh":"Sprint 開始後 burndown 沒有灰色 guideline。哪個不是官方列出的原因？","zo":["board 的 card layout 沒加 Story points 欄位","sprint 開始時 board 上沒有任何 issue 或估點","sprint 開始時間被設在過去或時區不一致","完成的 status 沒對到最右欄"],"ans":"A","why":{"D":"這<strong>是</strong>官方列出的原因：完成的 status 沒有對應到最右欄，Jira 就不認為那些工作完成了。","A":"正解（本題問的是「哪一個<strong>不是</strong>原因」）。<strong>card layout 只決定卡片正面顯示哪些欄位，純粹是視覺設定，跟 burndown 怎麼計算完全無關</strong>。burndown 讀的是 issue 的欄位值本身，不管那個欄位有沒有出現在卡片上。","B":"這<strong>是</strong>官方列出的原因，而且是最常見的一個：sprint 開始當下 board 上沒有 issue、或 issue 都沒估點，起始總量為 0，guideline 自然畫不出來。","C":"這<strong>是</strong>官方列出的原因：sprint 的開始時間被設成過去，或使用者的時區與站台不一致，都會讓 guideline 異常。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-burndown-chart/"],"lvl":3,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.2.5-010","sec":"620.2.5","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"What determines the unit of the vertical axis on the velocity chart?","opts":["The board's time tracking setting","The board's estimation statistic","The Original estimate of each issue","A site-wide setting configured by the Jira administrator"],"zh":"Velocity chart 的縱軸單位由什麼決定？","zo":["board 的 time tracking 設定","board 的 estimation statistic","每張 issue 的 Original estimate","Jira admin 的全站設定"],"ans":"B","why":{"B":"正解。官方明訂 <strong>velocity chart 以 board 設定的 estimation statistic 為單位</strong>（story points、issue count 或時間估算）。所以要改變 velocity 的單位，只能去改 Board settings → Estimation，而不是動 time tracking。","C":"不是逐張 issue 決定的。整塊 board 統一使用一種 statistic，這也是為什麼跨 project board 上兩個團隊必須先講好同一套估點尺度。","D":"這是 <strong>board 層級</strong>的設定，不是站台的全域設定；同一個 project 的兩塊 board 甚至可以各用不同的 statistic。","A":"<strong>velocity 永遠使用 estimation statistic</strong>，完全不受 time tracking 設定影響——後者只改變 burndown 追蹤進度的方式。這是兩個旋鈕最重要的分工。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-velocity-chart/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-estimation-and-tracking/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.2.5-011","sec":"620.2.5","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Which statement about Story point estimate in team-managed projects and Story Points in company-managed projects is correct?","opts":["Company-managed projects cannot use story points.","They are the same field and stay consistent across boards automatically.","They are two different fields, so their values must be verified before comparing across boards.","Team-managed projects cannot use story points."],"zh":"TMP 的 Story point estimate 與 CMP 的 Story Points，以下何者正確？","zo":["CMP 不能用 story points","是同一個欄位，跨 board 自動一致","是兩個不同的欄位，跨 board 比較前要先確認","TMP 不能用 story points"],"ans":"C","why":{"B":"這正是最危險的誤解——它們<strong>不是</strong>同一個欄位，跨 board 或搬移 issue 時數值不會自動對應過去。","C":"正解。官方文件裡兩者的名稱就不同：<strong>TMP 用的是「Story point estimate」，CMP 用的是「Story Points」，這是兩個不同的欄位</strong>。所以把 issue 從 TMP 搬到 CMP（或做跨 board 報表）之前，一定要先確認數值有沒有帶過去，不要假設會自動對應——這也是 TMP 遷移到 CMP 時 story points 會遺失的原因之一。","D":"TMP 也可以用 story points，只是要先到 Project settings → Features 把 Estimation 打開（預設是關閉的）。","A":"CMP 當然可以用 story points，它的欄位名稱叫 <strong>Story Points</strong>。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-estimation-and-tracking/"],"lvl":3,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.2.5-012","sec":"620.2.5","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A project has two Scrum boards. Which statement about the estimation statistic setting is correct?","opts":["It is determined by the project.","It is determined by the workflow.","Both boards must use the same statistic.","The estimation statistic is configured separately for each board and can differ between them."],"zh":"同一個 project 有兩塊 Scrum board。關於 estimation statistic 的設定，何者正確？","zo":["由 project 決定","由 workflow 決定","兩塊 board 必須相同","statistic 是每塊 board 各自的設定，可以不同"],"ans":"D","why":{"B":"跟 workflow 完全無關，workflow 管的是狀態流轉。","C":"<strong>沒有任何強制一致的機制</strong>——這正是需要留意的地方。","D":"正解。官方明訂 <strong>estimation 是 board 層級的設定</strong>，所以同一個 project 的兩塊 board 可以一塊用 Story points、另一塊用 Issue count。這帶來一個實務上的陷阱：<strong>兩塊 board 的 velocity 尺度不同，數字不能互相比較</strong>，看報表前要先確認自己在看哪一塊 board 的設定。","A":"不是 project 層的設定，所以同一個 project 底下的兩塊 board 可以各行其是。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-estimation-and-tracking/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.2.6-001","sec":"620.2.6","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A cross-project board needs to display issues in separate sections by their source project. What is the most direct setting?","opts":["Swimlanes by Projects","Copy the Rank field.","Change the issue security.","Working days"],"zh":"跨 project board 想依來源 project 分區顯示，最直接的設定？","zo":["Swimlanes by Projects","複製 Rank 欄位","改 issue security","Working days"],"ans":"A","why":{"B":"Rank 是用來記錄手動排序的欄位，<strong>它沒有分組的功能</strong>。","C":"issue security 控制的是「誰看得到哪些 issue」，屬於權限範疇，<strong>跟畫面怎麼分區完全無關</strong>。","D":"working days 只影響報表的天數計算，跟卡片來自哪個 project 毫無關係。","A":"正解。<strong>Swimlanes 的分組方式裡有一個 Projects 選項，就是專為跨 project board 設計的</strong>——每個來源 project 各佔一條泳道，一眼就能分辨工作來自哪裡。想要更彈性的分組（例如依團隊或依 label）也可以改用 Queries 自己寫 JQL。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-swimlanes/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.2.6-002","sec":"620.2.6","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A card matches two queries in Card colors. Which color is used?","opts":["A random one","The color of the first matching query, from top to bottom","Always the priority color","The color of the last matching query"],"zh":"一張卡片同時符合兩條 Card colors 的 Query，會用哪個顏色？","zo":["隨機","由上到下第一個符合的","一定用 priority 顏色","最後一個符合的"],"ans":"B","why":{"B":"正解。card colors 的 Queries 模式跟 swimlane 一樣，<strong>由上而下逐條比對，套用第一個符合的 query 的顏色</strong>，比中之後就不再往下看。所以設計規則時要把<strong>最需要被一眼看到的條件排在最上面</strong>（例如「快到期」應該排在「是 Bug」之前）。順帶一提，如果一張卡<strong>所有 query 都不符合，它會顯示成灰色</strong>。","C":"既然已經選擇了 Queries 模式，上色就完全依 query 判定，不會回頭去用 priority 的顏色。","D":"是第一個符合的，不是最後一個。","A":"順序是有意義的，Jira 不會隨機挑選。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/customize-cards/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.2.6-003","sec":"620.2.6","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"What is the maximum number of additional fields that can be added to the card layout of a company-managed board?","opts":["There is no limit.","As many as there are custom fields","3","1"],"zh":"company-managed board 的 Card layout 最多可以加幾個額外欄位？","zo":["沒有上限","等於所有 custom field","3 個","1 個"],"ans":"C","why":{"D":"不只一個，是三個。","A":"是<strong>刻意設有上限</strong>的——卡片空間有限，塞太多欄位會讓 board 難以閱讀。","B":"不會把所有 custom field 都列出來，那樣卡片會變成一張表格。","C":"正解。官方規定 card layout <strong>最多只能額外加 3 個欄位</strong>（Summary、issue key、type、priority、assignee 頭像是本來就有的，不佔額度）。有一個實用技巧：<strong>Scrum board 可以替 Backlog 與 Active sprints 各設一組不同的 3 個欄位</strong>，規劃時看估點、執行時看到期日，等於變相多了幾個位置；Kanban board 則只有一組。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/customize-cards/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.2.6-004","sec":"620.2.6","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"What does setting weekends as non-working days do?","opts":["Users cannot log in on weekends.","Issues cannot be moved on weekends.","Worklogs recorded on weekends are automatically deleted.","The calendars of related reports and gadgets skip weekends."],"zh":"把週末設成 non-working days 代表？","zo":["週末不能登入","週末禁止移動 issue","自動刪除週末的 worklog","相關報表與 gadget 的日曆會略過週末"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"跟登入完全無關，這只是報表的日曆設定。","B":"<strong>不會限制任何操作</strong>——週末照樣可以移動 issue、更新狀態，只是這些日子不列入報表的天數計算。","C":"<strong>不會刪除任何資料</strong>，週末記錄的工時完好保留。","D":"正解。working days 的作用是讓相關報表與 gadget 在計算天數時<strong>略過週末與指定的假日</strong>。受影響的清單要記起來：<strong>Burndown、Sprint／Epic／Version report、Control chart，以及 Sprint Health 與 Burndown 這兩個 gadget</strong>。最直接的好處是 burndown 的 guideline 會在非工作日走平，團隊不會因為週末沒進度而被畫成落後。另外要注意這是<strong>每塊 board 各自的設定</strong>，包含時區在內。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-working-days/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.2.6-005","sec":"620.2.6","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A field was added to the card layout, but no value appears on the cards. What should be done?","opts":["Check the issue's actual value and the field's applicability and display configuration.","Change the project name.","Conclude that the data was deleted.","Keep adding more fields."],"zh":"Card layout 加了欄位，卡片上卻沒顯示值。應該？","zo":["查 issue 的實際值與該欄位的適用／顯示配置","改 project 名稱","認定資料被刪","一直加更多欄位"],"ans":"A","why":{"C":"卡片上空白<strong>完全不能證明資料被刪</strong>——最常見的原因就是那張 issue 本來就沒填這個欄位。開 issue 詳細頁看一眼就知道了。","D":"再加更多欄位只會讓卡片更擠，<strong>不會讓原本沒有的資料冒出來</strong>。","A":"正解。要從兩個方向查：<strong>第一，那張 issue 的這個欄位到底有沒有值</strong>（很可能真的是空的）；<strong>第二，這個欄位的配置</strong>——custom field 的 context 有沒有涵蓋這個 project 與 issue type、欄位有沒有被 field configuration 隱藏。card layout 只負責「把值秀出來」，它<strong>不會憑空產生資料</strong>。","B":"project 名稱跟欄位值毫無關係。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/customize-cards/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.2.6-006","sec":"620.2.6","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"When Swimlanes are based on Queries, what is the first swimlane that Jira provides by default?","opts":["Everything Else","Expedite: <code>priority = Blocker</code>","Bugs: <code>issuetype = Bug</code>","Mine: <code>assignee = currentUser()</code>"],"zh":"Swimlanes 選 Queries 時，官方預設的第一條泳道是？","zo":["Everything Else","Expedite：priority = Blocker","Bugs：issuetype = Bug","Mine：assignee = currentUser()"],"ans":"B","why":{"D":"「Mine」也不是預設泳道。（Only My Issues 是預設的 <strong>quick filter</strong>，不是 swimlane，兩者不要混淆。）","A":"Everything Else 是<strong>刪不掉、永遠固定在最下面</strong>的收尾泳道，不是第一條。","B":"正解。選擇 Queries 模式時，Jira 預設就給一條 <strong>Expedite</strong> 泳道，它的 JQL 是 <code>priority = Blocker</code>，用意是把最緊急的工作固定拉到 board 最上方。這條泳道可以修改也可以刪除。","C":"「Bugs」不是預設的泳道，那是常見的自訂範例。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-swimlanes/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.2.6-007","sec":"620.2.6","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Which statement about Everything Else in Swimlanes based on Queries is correct?","opts":["It can be deleted.","It can be dragged to the top.","It cannot be deleted, always stays at the bottom, and collects all cards that do not match any other query.","It appears only on Kanban boards."],"zh":"Swimlanes by Queries 裡的 Everything Else，何者正確？","zo":["可以刪除","可以拖到最上面","刪不掉，永遠在最下，收所有不符合其他 query 的卡片","只在 Kanban 出現"],"ans":"C","why":{"B":"位置固定在最下面，<strong>不能拖到別的位置</strong>。","C":"正解。<strong>Everything Else 是一條 catch-all（收尾）泳道</strong>：所有不符合任何一條 query 的卡片都會落到這裡，所以它<strong>刪不掉、也永遠固定在最下方</strong>。它的存在保證了一件重要的事——<strong>swimlane 只做分組，不會讓任何卡片消失</strong>。","D":"Scrum 與 Kanban board 都有，不分類型。","A":"刪不掉。它是系統保留的泳道，設定介面上不會提供刪除選項。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-swimlanes/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.2.6-008","sec":"620.2.6","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Days in column is enabled on the cards. An issue spends 2 days in In progress, moves to Code review for 1 day, and then moves back to In progress for 1 more day. How many days does the indicator show for the In progress column?","opts":["0 days (the count resets when the issue leaves the column)","1 day (only the most recent stay is counted)","2 days (only the first stay is counted)","3 days (cumulative)"],"zh":"卡片上啟用了 Days in column。一張工作先在 In progress 待 2 天，移到 Code review 1 天，又移回 In progress 待 1 天。In progress 欄的指示器會顯示幾天？","zo":["0 天（移出就歸零）","1 天（只算最後一次）","2 天（只算第一次）","3 天（累計）"],"ans":"D","why":{"B":"不是只算最後一次進入之後的天數。","C":"也不是只算第一次待的那 2 天。","D":"正解。官方原文說明：如果一張工作曾經<strong>回到同一個欄位</strong>，指示器顯示的是它在該欄的<strong>累計</strong>天數，官方舉的例子正好是 2＋1＝<strong>3 天</strong>。這個設計是刻意的——它要凸顯的是「這張卡在這個階段總共耗掉多少時間」，來回擺盪的工作反而更值得被看見。順帶記一下：這個指示器 <strong>Kanban 預設開啟、Scrum 預設關閉</strong>。","A":"移出該欄<strong>不會歸零</strong>。這是本題最容易誤選的答案，直覺上會以為計時重新開始。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>官方對照表只列天數級距（1、2、3、5、8、12、20 天以上），圓點顏色以畫面為準，不要背顏色組合。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/customize-cards/"],"lvl":3,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.2.6-009","sec":"620.2.6","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Which report is NOT affected by the Working days setting?","opts":["Cumulative flow diagram","Version report","Burndown","Control chart"],"zh":"哪一個報表「不」受 working days 設定影響？","zo":["Cumulative flow diagram","Version report","Burndown","Control chart"],"ans":"A","why":{"C":"Burndown <strong>會</strong>受影響，guideline 會在非工作日走平。","D":"Control chart <strong>會</strong>受影響，它甚至有一個獨立的 Non-working days 開關可以排除週末假日。","A":"正解（本題問的是「不受影響」的那一個）。官方受 working days 影響的清單裡<strong>沒有 CFD</strong>——<strong>Cumulative flow diagram 一律按日曆日連續計算</strong>，所以週末那兩天在圖上會是平的一段，那是真實情況而不是設定沒生效。","B":"Version report <strong>會</strong>受影響，這也是它的預測日期會隨 working days 設定改變的原因。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-working-days/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.2.6-010","sec":"620.2.6","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"The Card colors drop-down has no Status option, but the team wants cards in In Review to be a different color. How can this be done?","opts":["It cannot be done.","Select Queries and enter <code>status = \"In Review\"</code>.","Change the workflow.","Use swimlanes instead."],"zh":"Card colors 的下拉裡沒有「Status」選項，但團隊想讓 In Review 的卡片變色。怎麼做？","zo":["做不到","選 Queries，寫 status = &quot;In Review&quot;","改 workflow","用 swimlane 代替"],"ans":"B","why":{"D":"swimlane 做的是<strong>分組</strong>（改變卡片的位置），card color 做的是<strong>上色</strong>（改變外觀），兩者用途不同不能互相取代。不過兩者可以同時使用。","A":"做得到，只是不能用下拉直選，要繞一下。","B":"正解。<strong>Card colors 選 Queries 模式，就可以用任何一段 JQL 來決定顏色</strong>，包含 <code>status = \"In Review\"</code>。這題的價值在於建立一個通則：<strong>只要下拉選單裡沒有你要的依據，就改用 Queries 自己寫</strong>——swimlane 也是同樣的道理。記得多條 query 時是「第一個符合的勝出」，順序要排好。","C":"完全不需要動 workflow。這只是顯示需求，改 workflow 是動到流程本身，風險與影響範圍都大得多。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/customize-cards/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.2.6-011","sec":"620.2.6","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Which statement about configuring the fields in the issue detail view (the right-hand panel on the board) is correct?","opts":["This setting is available only in team-managed projects.","The Summary field can be removed.","Summary is always displayed; Description can't be deleted from the default layout but can be hidden, depending on the field scheme; all other fields are configured by the project administrator.","Only a Jira administrator can change it."],"zh":"Issue detail view（board 右側面板）的欄位設定，何者正確？","zo":["TMP 才有這個設定","Summary 可以移除","Summary 永遠顯示；Description 不能從預設版面刪除，但可依 field scheme 隱藏；其餘由 project admin 設定","只有 Jira admin 能改"],"ans":"C","why":{"D":"有 <strong>Administer Projects</strong> 權限的 project admin 就能調整，不必是 Jira admin。","A":"這是 <strong>CMP board</strong> 的設定。（補充一個現行變化：官方文件已把設定路徑指向 Project settings → Screens 的 View issue screen，但考試仍以 board 設定的說法作答。）","B":"Summary 是 issue 最基本的識別資訊，<strong>不可移除</strong>。","C":"正解。官方表格：<strong>Summary</strong> 一定顯示；<strong>Description</strong> Can't be deleted from the default layout，但 <em>can be hidden, depending on the field scheme being used</em>。其餘欄位有的永遠顯示但可調整，有的是有值才出現（例如 Work item links）。可調整的部分由 project admin 設定。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>考綱時代路徑是 Board settings → Issue detail view；現行官方頁指到 Project settings → Screens → View issue screen。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-the-issue-detail-view/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.2.6-012","sec":"620.2.6","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Which statement about Swimlanes by Stories is correct?","opts":["Issues without a parent are listed at the top.","It is supported only on Kanban boards.","Each epic has its own swimlane.","Sub-tasks are shown under their parent; issues without sub-tasks are grouped below all the swimlanes."],"zh":"關於 Swimlanes by Stories，何者正確？","zo":["沒有 parent 的工作排在最上面","只有 Kanban 支援","每個 epic 一條泳道","sub-task 掛在 parent 底下；沒有 sub-task 的工作集中顯示在所有泳道下方"],"ans":"D","why":{"D":"正解。Swimlanes by Stories 的規則是：<strong>每一個有 sub-task 的 parent 各佔一條泳道，它的 sub-task 顯示在底下</strong>；官方原句說明<strong>沒有 sub-task 的工作會集中顯示在所有泳道的下方</strong>。這個模式很適合用來看「每張 story 內部的分工進度」。","A":"沒有 sub-task 的工作是排在<strong>下方</strong>，不是最上面。","B":"Scrum 與 Kanban <strong>都支援</strong>這種泳道模式。","C":"每個 epic 一條泳道那是 <strong>Swimlanes by Epics</strong>，是另一個選項。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-swimlanes/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.2.7-001","sec":"620.2.7","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A user can open an issue directly, and the board's base filter also returns it, but there is no card for it on the board. What is the next step?","opts":["Check the sub-filter, the column mapping, and the current view (sprint or backlog).","Make the user a Jira administrator.","Delete the project.","Re-create the issue."],"zh":"使用者可以直接打開 issue，base filter 也搜得到它，但 board 上沒有卡片。下一步？","zo":["查 sub-filter、column 映射與目前視圖（sprint／backlog）","直接給他 Jira admin","刪除 project","重新建立 issue"],"ans":"A","why":{"D":"重新建立會造成資料重複，原本那張 issue 也不會因此消失。","A":"正解。題目已經幫你排除了兩個層次——<strong>使用者打得開 issue（權限沒問題），base filter 也搜得到（母體有包含）</strong>。所以接下來要查的是剩下的三件事：<strong>Kanban 的 sub-filter 是不是把它濾掉了、它的 status 有沒有對應到某一欄（unmapped 的不顯示）、以及目前的視圖對不對</strong>（Scrum board 只顯示 active sprint，工作可能還在 backlog；或它落在 Kanban backlog 那一欄）。按這個順序查，幾乎所有「卡片不見了」都能定位。","B":"給 Jira admin 是過度授權，而且<strong>完全沒有定位問題的原因</strong>——就算他變成管理員，卡片一樣不會出現。","C":"刪除 project 與這個問題毫無關係，而且是災難性的操作。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-columns/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/add-a-sub-filter-to-a-company-managed-kanban-board/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.2.7-002","sec":"620.2.7","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A team wants to reorder the backlog manually by dragging issues. Which ordering should the board filter use?","opts":["<code>ORDER BY priority DESC</code>","<code>ORDER BY Rank ASC</code>","Order by card color","<code>ORDER BY created DESC</code>"],"zh":"想手動拖曳 backlog 順序，board filter 應該用哪個排序？","zo":["ORDER BY priority DESC","ORDER BY Rank ASC","依 card color","ORDER BY created DESC"],"ans":"B","why":{"C":"card color 是視覺設定，<strong>根本不是排序欄位</strong>。","D":"依建立時間排序同樣是系統決定的固定順序，一樣拖不動。","A":"依 priority 排序是<strong>系統決定的固定順序</strong>，使用者無法手動調整某一張的位置，拖曳會直接彈回。","B":"正解。<strong>只有 <code>ORDER BY Rank ASC</code> 才支援拖曳排序</strong>，因為 Jira 是靠 Rank 這個特殊欄位記住人工排序的結果；換成任何其他排序依據，都沒有地方可以儲存新順序。而且 Rank 影響的不只排序——<strong>建立與規劃 sprint、sub-task 歸到 parent 底下、從 Kanban backlog 拖進 board 也都依賴它</strong>。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/enable-ranking/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.2.7-003","sec":"620.2.7","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Is sharing a saved filter with a colleague enough to let them read every issue that matches it?","opts":["All matching issues are readable as long as the board is public.","It depends only on the Working days setting.","No. Access is still restricted by the Browse Projects permission and the issue security of each issue.","Yes. Sharing a filter grants access to its issues."],"zh":"分享 saved filter 給同事，是否足以讓他讀到所有符合的 issue？","zo":["只要 board 公開就全部可讀","只看 working days","否，仍受各 issue 的 Browse 與 issue security 約束","是，分享就等於授權"],"ans":"C","why":{"C":"正解。<strong>「能存取這份查詢」與「能讀到查詢結果裡的資料」是兩件分開的事</strong>。分享 filter 只給了對方使用這段 JQL 的權利；實際回傳哪些 issue，仍然由他自己對<strong>每一個 project 的 Browse Projects 權限</strong>與各張 issue 的 <strong>issue security level</strong> 決定。所以「看得到 filter、結果卻是空的」是完全正常的現象。","D":"<strong>分享不等於授權</strong>——這是本題的核心觀念，也是實務上最常見的誤解。","A":"board 可見<strong>不會繞過 issue security</strong>，也不會補上 Browse Projects。可見度與資料存取是兩層獨立的檢查。","B":"working days 只影響報表的天數計算，跟這題毫無關係。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/manage-filters/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/space-access-and-configuration-permissions/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.2.7-004","sec":"620.2.7","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Two custom quick filters, Bugs and Tasks, are turned on at the same time, and the board becomes empty. What is the cause?","opts":["All the data was deleted.","The workflow is broken.","The browser language is different.","The two mutually exclusive issue type conditions are intersected."],"zh":"Bugs 與 Tasks 兩個自訂 quick filter 同時開啟，board 變空。原因？","zo":["所有資料被刪","workflow 壞掉","瀏覽器語言不同","互斥的類型條件取交集"],"ans":"D","why":{"C":"瀏覽器的語言設定不影響任何查詢邏輯。","D":"正解。<strong>同時啟用多個 quick filter 之間是 AND（取交集）</strong>，所以同時勾「Bugs」與「Tasks」等於要求「既是 Bug 又是 Task」——兩個條件互斥，交集當然是空的。要表達「任一種類型」，必須做成<strong>一個</strong> quick filter，把 OR 或 IN 寫在同一句 JQL 裡：<code>issuetype in (Bug, Task)</code>。","A":"資料完全沒有被刪除，<strong>把 quick filter 取消勾選，卡片就會全部回來</strong>。","B":"跟 workflow 毫無關係，workflow 管的是狀態流轉。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-quick-filters/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.2.7-005","sec":"620.2.7","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"What is affected when Add Rank is used?","opts":["Other boards that use the same saved filter are also affected.","It only changes the card colors.","It creates a new project.","Only your own view is affected."],"zh":"Add Rank 的影響範圍？","zo":["使用同一 saved filter 的其他 board 也會受影響","只改卡片顏色","會建立新 project","只有自己的畫面"],"ans":"A","why":{"D":"影響範圍不只自己——它改的是共用的 filter 物件，不是個人偏好設定。","A":"正解。<strong>Add Rank 修改的是 saved filter 本身</strong>（在 JQL 結尾加上 ORDER BY Rank），而 filter 是共用物件，所以<strong>其他使用同一份 filter 的 board 也會跟著改變排序</strong>。還有一個更深的影響：<strong>Rank 是全站共用的排序資料</strong>，你在這塊 board 上重排，另一塊以 Rank 排序的 board 也會看到新順序。動正式的共用 filter 前，建議先另存一份測試 filter 驗證。","B":"Rank 是排序機制，<strong>跟卡片顏色毫無關係</strong>。","C":"不會建立任何 project。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/enable-ranking/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.2.7-006","sec":"620.2.7","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"In Atlassian's troubleshooting steps for an issue that does not appear on a board, what is the first step?","opts":["Check the Jira administrator permissions.","Check whether the board filter includes the issue.","Check the Working days setting.","Check the card layout."],"zh":"「issue 不在 board 上」的官方排查順序，第一步是？","zo":["檢查 Jira admin 權限","檢查 board filter 是否包含它","檢查 working days","檢查 card layout"],"ans":"B","why":{"B":"正解。官方的排查順序是由外而內：<strong>① board filter 有沒有包含它（母體）→ ② status 有沒有對應到某一欄（unmapped 的不顯示）→ ③ Backlog feature 與 Kanban backlog 的設定 → ④ Kanban 的 sub-filter → ⑤ Scrum 的話它在不在 active sprint</strong>。從最外層的母體查起最有效率，因為不在母體裡的話，後面所有設定都救不回來。","C":"working days 只影響報表的天數計算，跟卡片顯示與否完全無關。","D":"card layout 決定卡片上「顯示哪些欄位」，<strong>不決定卡片本身出不出現</strong>。","A":"權限問題確實要查，但<strong>不是第一步</strong>；而且要查的是 Browse Projects，不是 Jira admin。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-columns/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.2.7-007","sec":"620.2.7","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"The Done column on a company-managed Kanban board keeps filling up with old cards. What is the most likely configuration problem?","opts":["There are no quick filters.","Working days have not been configured.","No versions are being released, the sub-filter has been changed, or the Hide completed issues older than setting is configured not to hide completed issues.","The board filter does not include Rank."],"zh":"CMP Kanban 的 Done 欄一直堆滿舊卡片。最可能的設定問題？","zo":["沒有 quick filter","working days 沒設","沒有 Release 版本，或 sub-filter 被改掉、Hide completed work 設成不隱藏","board filter 沒有 Rank"],"ans":"C","why":{"B":"working days 只影響報表計算，跟 Done 欄堆積毫無關係。","C":"正解。CMP Kanban 清 Done 有兩個機制，兩個都可能出問題：<strong>① 靠發佈 release</strong>——預設 sub-filter <code>fixVersion in unreleasedVersions() OR fixVersion is EMPTY</code> 會把已發佈版本的 issue 藏起來，所以沒有人在用 version、或 sub-filter 被清空，Done 就會一直堆；<strong>② Hide completed work</strong>——如果被設成「不隱藏」，完成的卡片也會一直留著。兩個都檢查一遍就能定位。","D":"Rank 影響的是能不能拖曳排序，<strong>跟 Done 欄會不會被清理無關</strong>。","A":"quick filter 是使用者臨時的檢視工具，<strong>它不負責清理 board</strong>，而且勾選狀態是個人的。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/add-a-sub-filter-to-a-company-managed-kanban-board/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira/kb/kanban-board-shows-or-hides-completed-work-unexpectedly-in-jira-cloud/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.2.7-008","sec":"620.2.7","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A product manager says, \"The Kanban board should show only work completed in the last week.\" What is the difference between setting Hide completed issues older than to 1 week and using the sub-filter <code>resolved &gt;= startOfWeek()</code>?","opts":["Only a Jira administrator can configure the latter.","The former requires Rank.","There is no difference.","The former is a rolling 7-day window (and its timer is affected by updates), whereas the latter is the current calendar week, counted from Monday."],"zh":"PM 說「Kanban 只顯示最近一週完成的工作」。用 Hide completed work 選 1 週，與寫 sub-filter resolved &gt;= startOfWeek() 有什麼差別？","zo":["後者只有 Jira admin 能設","前者需要 Rank","沒有差別","前者是滾動 7 天（且計時受更新影響），後者是本曆週從週一起算"],"ans":"D","why":{"C":"語意差很多，這正是本題的重點。","D":"正解。兩者的時間定義完全不同：<strong>Hide completed work 選 1 週，是「滾動的最近 7 天」</strong>，而且計時起點是 <strong>issue 的最後更新時間</strong>——任何欄位的編輯都會把計時重設，讓早就完成的卡片重新出現。<strong>而 <code>resolved &gt;= startOfWeek()</code> 是「本曆週」</strong>，從這週的第一天算起，到了下週一整批就一起消失，跟有沒有人編輯完全無關。想要穩定的週報視圖用後者，想要「最近完成的都還看得到」用前者。","A":"sub-filter 是 board 層級的設定，<strong>board admin 或 project admin 就能改</strong>，不需要 Jira admin。","B":"兩者都跟 Rank 沒有關係。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira/kb/kanban-board-shows-or-hides-completed-work-unexpectedly-in-jira-cloud/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/advanced-search-reference-jql-functions/"],"lvl":3,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.2.7-009","sec":"620.2.7","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A colleague has the Manage Sprints permission but cannot drag issues to reorder them in the backlog. What is missing?","opts":["Schedule Issues and Edit Issues","Browse users and groups","Board administrator rights","Administer Jira"],"zh":"同事有 Manage Sprints 卻無法在 backlog 拖曳排序 issue。缺什麼？","zo":["Schedule Issues 與 Edit Issues","Browse users and groups","Board admin","Administer Jira"],"ans":"A","why":{"D":"完全不需要 Administer Jira，補上 project 層的 Schedule Issues 就解決了。","A":"正解。這是 620 最典型的組合題。<strong>Manage Sprints 管的是「sprint 這個容器」</strong>（建立、開始、結束、改期間與目標）；而在 backlog 拖曳排序，本質上是<strong>修改那些 issue 的 Rank 欄位</strong>，需要的是 <strong>Schedule Issues</strong>（Jira 把 due date 與 rank 都劃給它）搭配 <strong>Edit Issues</strong>。記住這句話：<strong>能管 sprint ≠ 能改 sprint 裡的每一張 issue</strong>。","B":"Browse users and groups 是全域權限，影響的是 @提及與 user picker 看得到誰，跟排序無關。","C":"board admin 管的是 board 的設定（columns、swimlanes、quick filters），<strong>它不授予任何 issue 層級的權限</strong>。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/space-access-and-configuration-permissions/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/rank-an-issue/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.2.7-010","sec":"620.2.7","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"In a Scrum backlog, sub-tasks cannot be dragged into a sprint on their own. What does this indicate?","opts":["It is a bug.","It is expected behavior: sub-tasks move with their parent and are not items that can be planned independently.","The filter is missing Rank.","The sub-tasks are blocked by a hidden field."],"zh":"Scrum backlog 裡看不到 sub-task 可以獨立拖進 sprint。這是？","zo":["bug","正常：sub-task 跟著 parent，不是可獨立規劃的項目","filter 少了 Rank","sub-task 被隱藏欄位擋住"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"這是<strong>設計行為</strong>，不是缺陷。","B":"正解。官方在 Rank a work item 與 Scrum backlog 的說明中都寫明：<strong>sub-task 只能在同一個 parent 底下的兄弟之間排序，而且 parent 移動時 sub-task 跟著移動</strong>——它<strong>不是一個可以獨立規劃進 sprint 的項目</strong>。官方對 backlog 顯示條件的敘述裡也直接列了一條「the work item isn’t a subtask」。這個設計是刻意的：sub-task 是 parent 的一部分，把它們拆到不同 sprint 在邏輯上說不通。","C":"跟 Rank 沒有關係——就算 filter 有 ORDER BY Rank，sub-task 一樣不會出現在 backlog 供你獨立規劃。","D":"不是欄位被隱藏的問題，而是產品的階層設計。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/rank-an-issue/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.2.7-011","sec":"620.2.7","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"The owner of the saved filter used by a board has left the company, and the team needs to modify the filter. Who can resolve this?","opts":["The filter is automatically transferred to the project lead.","Any board administrator can edit the filter directly.","A Jira administrator can change the filter's owner.","The board must be re-created."],"zh":"filter owner 離職後，團隊需要修改 board 用的 saved filter。誰能處理？","zo":["filter 會自動轉給 project lead","任何 board admin 可直接編輯","Jira admin 可變更 filter 的 owner","必須重建 board"],"ans":"C","why":{"B":"<strong>board admin 不等於 filter editor</strong>，非 owner（也非被加為 editor 的人）不能編輯別人的 filter。","C":"正解。<strong>Jira admin 可以在 Manage filters 頁面變更任何 filter 的 owner</strong>，把它轉給現任的負責人，之後團隊就能正常編輯。這是處理「owner 離職」最正規的做法。（另一條退路是自己 Save as 另存一份新 filter 再把 board 指過去，但那樣會失去原 filter 的所有分享設定。）","D":"完全不必重建 board——board 沒有壞，只是它讀的那份 filter 沒人有權編輯而已。","A":"Jira <strong>不會</strong>自動把離職者的 filter 轉給任何人，它會一直掛在那個已停用的帳號底下——這是離職交接很容易漏掉的一項。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/manage-filters/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.2.7-012","sec":"620.2.7","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"When the Epics panel is enabled, how are epics displayed on a Scrum board and backlog?","opts":["They are completely hidden.","They are shown only on the timeline.","They appear as cards in the board columns.","They appear in the Epics panel in the backlog, not as cards."],"zh":"Epics panel 開啟時，epic 在 Scrum board／backlog 怎麼呈現？","zo":["完全隱藏","只在 Timeline 顯示","以卡片出現在 board 欄位裡","出現在 backlog 的 Epic panel，不以卡片出現"],"ans":"D","why":{"B":"Timeline 上確實也看得到 epic（畫成長條），但題目問的是 board 與 backlog 的呈現。","C":"開啟 Epics panel 時，<strong>epic 不會以卡片形式出現在 board 的欄位裡</strong>——這正是很多人以為「epic 不見了」的原因。","D":"正解。Epics panel 開啟時，<strong>epic 會集中呈現在 backlog 左側的 Epic panel 裡</strong>，用途是依 epic 篩選 backlog、以及把 issue 拖進某個 epic 來設定歸屬。它<strong>不會以卡片形式出現在 board 上</strong>。想讓 epic 變成一般卡片，把 Epics panel 關掉即可。","A":"epic 沒有被隱藏，它只是<strong>換了一個位置</strong>顯示。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/customize-your-view-of-the-board-and-backlog/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.2.7-013","sec":"620.2.7","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"During a meeting, a colleague says, \"My board looks different from yours.\" The board filter contains <code>assignee = currentUser()</code>. What is the cause?","opts":["<code>currentUser()</code> returns different results for each user; this is how the filter is designed.","The board has not synced.","The page needs to be refreshed.","The colleague has fewer permissions."],"zh":"開會時同事說「我的 board 跟你的不一樣」。board filter 含 assignee = currentUser()。原因？","zo":["currentUser() 讓每個人看到的結果不同，這是 filter 設計","board 沒同步","需要重新整理","他的權限較少"],"ans":"A","why":{"B":"board 沒有「同步」這個機制，它每次都是即時查詢。","C":"重新整理不會改變結果，因為兩個人的登入身分本來就不同。","D":"權限差異確實也可能造成看到的卡片不同，但題目已經明白指出 filter 裡有 <code>currentUser()</code>，那才是這裡的直接原因。","A":"正解。<strong><code>currentUser()</code> 這個函數會依「目前登入的人」動態回傳不同的值</strong>，所以同一塊 board 每個人看到的結果本來就不一樣——這是 filter 的設計，不是故障。實務上的正確做法是：<strong>共用 board 的 base filter 不要寫 <code>currentUser()</code></strong>，把它放進 <strong>quick filter</strong>（例如內建的 Only My Issues），讓每個人自己決定要不要收斂到自己的工作。順帶一提，這個函數也<strong>不能用在要分享給匿名使用者的 filter</strong>。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-quick-filters/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-filters/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.3.1-001","sec":"620.3.1","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Sam has the Make bulk changes global permission. He can bulk change issues in project A but not issues in project B. What is the most reasonable next step?","opts":["Check whether Sam has Browse Projects and Edit Issues in project B.","Grant Sam Make bulk changes again.","Rename the board in project B and try again.","Reinstall the browser and clear the cache."],"zh":"Sam 有 Make bulk changes 全域權限，能批次修改 project A 的 issue，卻不能批次修改 project B 的 issue。最合理的下一步是？","zo":["檢查 Sam 在 project B 是否有 Browse Projects 與 Edit Issues","再授予一次 Make bulk changes","把 project B 的 board 改名後重試","重新安裝瀏覽器並清除快取"],"ans":"A","why":{"D":"這是權限設定的差異，跟瀏覽器或快取無關。","A":"正解。<strong>bulk change 需要兩層權限</strong>：全域的 Make bulk changes 只是「讓選單出現」的入口，實際執行時還要在<strong>每一個受影響的 project</strong> 具備對應權限。Sam 在 A 能用、在 B 不能，代表全域那層沒問題，缺口一定在 <strong>project B 的 Browse Projects 與 Edit Issues</strong>。跨 project 批次操作時更要注意——只要其中一個 project 缺權限，那批 issue 就會被跳過。","B":"Sam 已經能在 project A 使用批次功能，這證明<strong>全域權限完全正常</strong>，再授予一次不會有任何作用。","C":"board 的名稱跟 issue 的權限毫無關係。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/edit-multiple-issues-at-the-same-time/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/what-are-global-permissions-and-what-do-they-do/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.3.1-002","sec":"620.3.1","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"The team wants other users to be able to assign issues to Eva. Which project permission does Eva herself most directly need?","opts":["Manage Sprints","Assignable User","Share dashboards and filters","Assign Issues"],"zh":"團隊希望其他人能把 issue 指派給 Eva。Eva 本人最直接需要哪一項 project 權限？","zo":["Manage Sprints","Assignable User","Share dashboards and filters","Assign Issues"],"ans":"B","why":{"D":"這是最容易誤選的一個。<strong>Assign Issues 是「執行指派動作的人」需要的權限</strong>（去修改 Assignee 欄位），而題目問的是 Eva 本人——她要的是被動的 Assignable User。","A":"Manage Sprints 管的是 sprint 的建立、開始與結束，<strong>跟指派完全無關</strong>。","B":"正解。Jira 把「指派」拆成方向相反的兩個權限，這題問的是<strong>被指派者</strong>需要什麼——答案是 <strong>Assignable User</strong>：它定義了「誰可以出現在 Assignee 欄位的候選清單裡」。Eva 沒有這一項，別人打開下拉選單時根本找不到她。（順帶一提，TMP 沒有這個獨立權限，改用「有沒有 Work on issues 群組任一權限」來判定。）","C":"Share dashboards and filters 是分享查詢與儀表板用的全域權限，跟指派毫無關係。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/work-item-permissions/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.3.1-003","sec":"620.3.1","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Mei, a project administrator, finds that her project uses a permission scheme that is shared with five other projects. She wants to give the QA role the Delete Issues permission as well. What is the correct approach?","opts":["Create a new quick filter for QA.","Add the permission directly to the scheme, since it affects only her own project.","Ask a Jira administrator to assess which projects share the scheme and, if necessary, copy the scheme for this project and modify the copy.","Add herself to the QA role so that she can make the change."],"zh":"Project admin 小美發現 project 使用的是與其他五個 project 共用的 permission scheme，她想讓 QA role 多一個 Delete Issues。正確做法是？","zo":["新增一個 quick filter 給 QA 用","直接在 scheme 加，反正只影響自己的 project","請 Jira admin 評估共用範圍，必要時複製一份 scheme 給本 project 再修改","把自己加進 QA role 就能改"],"ans":"C","why":{"B":"這句話有兩個錯：<strong>project admin 根本沒有編輯 permission scheme 的權限</strong>；而且 scheme 是共用物件，<strong>改一次六個 project 全部都變</strong>，絕不會「只影響自己的 project」。","C":"正解。標準流程是：<strong>請 Jira admin 先評估這份 scheme 被哪些 project 共用</strong>，如果六個 project 的需求一致，就直接改；如果只有小美這個 project 需要，正確做法是<strong>複製一份 scheme、指派給本 project，再在副本上修改</strong>——這樣其他五個 project 完全不受影響。這個「共用就先複製」的模式在 CMP 到處都是（workflow、screen、field configuration 都一樣）。","D":"把自己加進某個 role，得到的是那個 role 的<strong>操作權限</strong>，跟「能不能編輯 scheme 這個設定物件」是完全不同的層級。","A":"quick filter 只影響 board 上顯示哪些卡片，<strong>跟權限完全是兩回事</strong>。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/what-are-permission-schemes-in-jira/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/grant-or-revoke-permissions-in-a-scheme/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.3.1-004","sec":"620.3.1","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"You share a filter with a colleague, but when they open it, they see no results. Which statement is correct?","opts":["The colleague must have Administer Jira to search.","Setting all the issues to Done will make them visible.","The sharing must have failed, so the filter needs to be shared again.","Sharing a filter does not grant Browse Projects or bypass issue security; data access must be checked separately."],"zh":"你把一個 filter 分享給同事，他打開卻看到空結果。何者正確？","zo":["對方必須有 Administer Jira 才能搜尋","把所有 issue 設成 Done 就看得到","分享一定失敗了，要重新分享","分享 filter 不會給對方 Browse Projects 或穿透 issue security，資料存取要另外檢查"],"ans":"D","why":{"C":"正好相反：<strong>「filter 打得開、結果卻是空的」正是分享成功、但資料權限不足的典型表現</strong>。如果分享失敗，他連這個 filter 都找不到。","D":"正解。<strong>分享 filter 只分享了「這段查詢」，不會給對方任何資料存取權</strong>。查詢結果仍然會依照他自己對各 project 的 <strong>Browse Projects</strong> 權限與各張 issue 的 <strong>issue security level</strong> 逐筆過濾。所以要檢查的是他在那些 project 的權限，而不是重新分享一次。","A":"執行搜尋不需要 Administer Jira，任何使用者都能搜尋自己有權存取的資料。","B":"issue 的狀態跟可見性毫無關係——Done 的 issue 一樣要有權限才看得到。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/manage-filters/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/space-access-and-configuration-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.3.1-005","sec":"620.3.1","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"After Ben is removed from the Developers role, he can still edit issues. What is the most likely reason?","opts":["Another grant (for example, a group) still gives him Edit Issues.","Only site administrators can edit issues.","Project roles are deny lists, so removing him grants access instead.","Jira permanently retains previous permissions."],"zh":"把 Ben 從 Developers role 移除後，他仍然能編輯 issue。最合理的原因是？","zo":["另一條授權路徑（例如某個群組）仍給他 Edit Issues","只有 site admin 能編輯 issue","Project role 是拒絕清單，移除反而放行","Jira 會永久保留舊權限"],"ans":"A","why":{"D":"權限是<strong>即時依目前的授權狀態計算</strong>的，沒有任何殘留或快取延遲的問題。","A":"正解。Jira 的權限是<strong>多條授權路徑取聯集</strong>：同一個權限可能同時來自 project role、group、Reporter、Current assignee、User custom field value 等好幾個來源。<strong>移除其中一條，其他來源依然有效</strong>——最常見的就是他所屬的某個 group 也被授予了 Edit Issues。排查時要把所有授權路徑逐一列出來檢查，而不是只看 role。","B":"這與現實矛盾——一般使用者只要有 Edit Issues 就能編輯，不需要 site admin。","C":"<strong>Jira 沒有「拒絕型（deny）」的權限</strong>，所有權限都是「授予」，移除某個授權絕不會反而放行。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/how-permissions-interact-with-each-other/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.3.1-006","sec":"620.3.1","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"In the permission scheme, Edit Issues is granted to Developers, but Assign Issues is not granted to anyone. Can Developers change the Assignee field?","opts":["No. Without Assign Issues, the Assignee field can never be changed.","Yes. When Assign Issues is not configured, Edit Issues covers the Assignee field.","Only a Jira administrator can change it.","Only if they also have Manage Sprints."],"zh":"Permission scheme 裡 Edit Issues 給了 Developers，但 Assign Issues 完全沒有設定任何對象。Developers 能改 Assignee 欄位嗎？","zo":["不能，沒有 Assign Issues 就一定不能改 Assignee","能，Assign Issues 未配置時 Edit Issues 涵蓋 Assignee 欄位","只有 Jira admin 能改","要同時有 Manage Sprints 才行"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"這是很常見的誤解。<strong>只有在 Assign Issues「有被配置給某些對象」的情況下，Assignee 欄位才會被它專屬接管</strong>；沒有配置時，這個欄位仍然歸比較籠統的 Edit Issues 管。","B":"正解。官方的「最具體者勝」規則是雙向的：<strong>當更具體的權限沒有被配置時，Edit Issues 就涵蓋該欄位</strong>；<strong>一旦 Jira admin 把 Assign Issues 明確配置出來，管轄權立刻轉移，從此只有拿到 Assign Issues 的人能改 Assignee</strong>。這也解釋了實務上常見的抱怨——「昨天還能改 assignee，今天突然不行了」，通常就是 admin 剛剛把 Assign Issues 加進 scheme。同樣的邏輯也適用於 Modify Reporter 與 Schedule Issues。","C":"跟是不是 Jira admin 無關，這是權限模型的運作方式。","D":"Manage Sprints 管的是 sprint 這個容器，跟能不能改 Assignee 毫無關係。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/how-permissions-interact-with-each-other/"],"lvl":3,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.3.1-007","sec":"620.3.1","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Amy needs to move MOB-12 from project MOB to project WEB. In addition to Browse Projects and Move Issues in MOB, what else does she need?","opts":["No permissions in WEB","Edit Issues in WEB","Create Issues in WEB","Administer Projects in WEB"],"zh":"Amy 要把 MOB-12 從 project MOB 搬到 project WEB。除了在 MOB 有 Browse 與 Move Issues 之外，她還需要什麼？","zo":["不需要任何 WEB 的權限","在 WEB 有 Edit Issues","在 WEB 有 Create Issues","在 WEB 有 Administer Projects"],"ans":"C","why":{"B":"Edit Issues 是「修改既有 issue」的權限，<strong>不是搬入的條件</strong>。","C":"正解。<strong>Move 到目的地 project，本質上等於「在那裡建立一張 issue」</strong>，所以官方明列需要<strong>目的地 project 的 Create Issues 權限</strong>。這也體現了跨 project 動作的通則：<strong>兩邊的權限都要有</strong>。額外提醒一個容易忽略的後果：如果 Amy 在 WEB 沒有 Browse Projects，她搬成功之後就再也打不開那張 issue 了。","D":"Administer Projects 是管理整個 project 的權限，為了搬一張 issue 而要求這個是嚴重的過度授權。","A":"沒有目的地的權限，搬移一定會失敗——目的地 project 甚至不會出現在下拉清單裡。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/work-item-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.3.1-008","sec":"620.3.1","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A Jira administrator turns off Issue linking globally. Developers in a project have the Link Issues permission. Can they still create links?","opts":["Yes, but only between issues in the same project.","Only Jira administrators can create links.","Yes. Project permissions take precedence over global settings.","No. When a feature is turned off globally, the project permission has no effect."],"zh":"Jira admin 把全域的 Issue linking 停用。某 project 的 Developers 有 Link Issues 權限，他們現在能建立連結嗎？","zo":["能，但只能連結同 project 的 issue","只有 Jira admin 能連結","能，project 權限優先於全域設定","不能，全域功能關閉時 project 權限沒有作用"],"ans":"D","why":{"C":"方向完全相反。正確的層次關係是：<strong>全域開關決定「這個功能存不存在」，project 權限決定「誰可以使用它」</strong>——功能都不存在了，權限自然無從發揮。","D":"正解。<strong>Issue linking、time tracking、attachments 這類全域開關一旦關閉，整個站台都沒有該功能</strong>，permission scheme 給了 Link Issues 也沒有任何作用，issue 上根本不會出現 Link 的入口。所以排查「做不了某件事」時，<strong>要先問全域功能開了沒，再查權限</strong>——順序反過來會浪費很多時間。","A":"沒有這種折衷方案——功能被全域關閉時，<strong>連同 project 內的連結也一併消失</strong>。","B":"連 Jira admin 也一樣沒有這個功能可用。全域開關關閉的是<strong>功能本身</strong>，不是某些人的權限。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-issue-linking/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/work-item-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.3.1-009","sec":"620.3.1","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A user has Create Issues but not Browse Projects in a project. What happens after the user creates an issue?","opts":["The issue is created, but the user cannot open it afterward.","The issue is created, and the user can view the issues they created.","The user can create only sub-tasks.","The creation is rejected because Browse Projects is a prerequisite for all permissions."],"zh":"某使用者在 project 有 Create Issues 卻沒有 Browse Projects。他建立 issue 後會發生什麼？","zo":["可以建立，但建完後自己打不開那張 issue","可以建立，也能瀏覽自己建的 issue","只能建立 sub-task","建立會被拒絕，因為 Browse 是所有權限的前提"],"ans":"A","why":{"D":"建立<strong>不會</strong>被拒絕。這正是本題的重點——Create Issues 不需要 Browse 當前提。","A":"正解。這是 Jira 權限模型裡最反直覺的一條：<strong>Create Issues 是少數不以 Browse Projects 為前提的權限</strong>，官方明列它可以授予任何站台使用者。所以確實會出現「<strong>建得出來，卻打不開自己剛建的那張</strong>」這種看似壞掉、其實完全正常的結果。這個設計有實際用途——例如讓全公司都能提報需求，但只有團隊看得到內容。要注意的是：<strong>Reporter 身分也不會自動帶來 Browse 權限</strong>，除非 scheme 另外把可見性授予 Reporter。","B":"瀏覽 issue 需要 <strong>Browse Projects</strong>，這一點對「自己建的」也不例外。","C":"沒有這種限制，他可以建立任何被允許的 issue type。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/work-item-permissions/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/space-access-and-configuration-permissions/"],"lvl":3,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.3.1-010","sec":"620.3.1","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A permission scheme grants Transition Issues only to Current assignee. In the same project, Amy is the assignee of ACL-1 but not of ACL-2. What is the result?","opts":["Amy can transition both issues because they are in the same project and use the same scheme.","Amy can transition only ACL-1.","Amy cannot transition either issue because dynamic grantees cannot be used for transitions.","Amy must first become a project administrator."],"zh":"Permission scheme 把 Transition Issues 只授予「Current assignee」。同一個 project 裡，Amy 是 ACL-1 的 assignee，但不是 ACL-2 的 assignee。結果是？","zo":["Amy 兩張都能轉換，因為同一 project 同一 scheme","Amy 只能轉換 ACL-1","Amy 兩張都不能轉換，動態對象不能用於 transition","Amy 需要先成為 project admin"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"動態對象是<strong>逐張 issue 判定</strong>的，不是「同一個 project 就一視同仁」。這正是本題要打破的直覺。","B":"正解。<strong>Current assignee、Reporter、User custom field value 這類動態對象，會依「每一張 issue 當下的欄位值」來判定</strong>。Amy 是 ACL-1 的 assignee，所以她對 ACL-1 有 Transition Issues；她不是 ACL-2 的 assignee，對 ACL-2 就沒有。<strong>同一個 project、同一份 scheme，權限卻可以逐張不同</strong>。排查時的重要提醒：<strong>不能用「這個 project 有一張成功」推論全部都會成功</strong>，要逐張看。","C":"Transition Issues <strong>可以</strong>授予動態對象，這正是 permission scheme 的 11 種授權對象的價值——它讓「只有被指派的人能推動流程」這種規則得以實現。","D":"跟 project admin 完全無關，補上這個身分也不會改變逐張判定的結果。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/grant-or-revoke-permissions-in-a-scheme/"],"lvl":3,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.3.1-011","sec":"620.3.1","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Which of the following is a project permission rather than a global permission?","opts":["Browse users and groups","Make bulk changes","Manage Sprints","Share dashboards and filters"],"zh":"以下哪一個是 project 權限而不是全域權限？","zo":["Browse users and groups","Make bulk changes","Manage Sprints","Share dashboards and filters"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"<strong>Browse users and groups 是全域權限</strong>，它決定 @提及與 user picker 的候選名單看得到誰。","B":"<strong>Make bulk changes 是全域權限</strong>，它是批次操作選單出現的入口。","C":"正解。<strong>Manage Sprints 是寫在 permission scheme 裡的 project 權限</strong>，可以逐 project 授予不同對象。分辨方法很簡單：<strong>全域權限只有 8 個、只能授予群組、由 Jira admin 在站台層設定；project 權限則寫在 permission scheme 裡，可以給 role、group、user 或動態對象</strong>。","D":"<strong>Share dashboards and filters 是全域權限</strong>，缺了它連分享的選單都是空的。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/what-are-global-permissions-and-what-do-they-do/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/space-access-and-configuration-permissions/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.3.1-012","sec":"620.3.1","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A project administrator wants Developers to be able to change due dates and reorder issues in the backlog. Which permission must the permission scheme include?","opts":["Manage Sprints","Set Issue Security","Modify Reporter","Schedule Issues"],"zh":"Project admin 想讓 Developers 能改 due date 與 backlog 的排序。permission scheme 需要包含哪一項？","zo":["Manage Sprints","Set Issue Security","Modify Reporter","Schedule Issues"],"ans":"D","why":{"D":"正解。Jira 把兩件事一起劃給了 <strong>Schedule Issues</strong>：<strong>修改 Due date</strong>，以及<strong>在 board 與 backlog 拖曳排序（rank）</strong>。很多人以為排序屬於 Edit Issues，其實它被獨立出來了——所以會出現「有 Edit Issues 卻拖不動卡片」這種狀況。","A":"Manage Sprints 管的是 sprint 這個容器（建立、開始、結束、改期間），<strong>它管不到 issue 的排序</strong>——這是最經典的組合題陷阱。","B":"Set Issue Security 控制的是「能不能在 issue 上設定 security level」，跟日期與排序無關。","C":"Modify Reporter 只控制 Reporter 這一個欄位。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/work-item-permissions/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.3.1-013","sec":"620.3.1","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"You want to bulk change the Components of 20 issues to \"Payments\", but the Components field is not available on the Bulk edit screen. Which of the following is NOT a likely reason?","opts":["You do not have the Make bulk changes global permission.","The 20 issues belong to different projects.","The target project has no components.","The Components field is hidden in the field configuration."],"zh":"你要批次把 20 張 issue 的 Components 改成「Payments」，但 Bulk edit 畫面沒有 Components 欄位可選。最可能的原因不包含哪一項？","zo":["你沒有 Make bulk changes 全域權限","這 20 張 issue 分屬不同 project","目的 project 沒有任何 component","Components 欄位在 field configuration 被隱藏"],"ans":"A","why":{"B":"這<strong>是</strong>可能原因。Components 是<strong>各 project 私有的物件</strong>，跨 project 批次時 Jira 無法判斷該用哪個 project 的清單，所以這個欄位不會出現。同樣的限制也適用於 Fix versions 與 Affects versions。","C":"這<strong>是</strong>可能原因。如果目的 project 根本沒有建立任何 component，就沒有選項可選，欄位自然不會出現。","D":"這<strong>是</strong>可能原因。被 field configuration 隱藏的欄位，不但不會出現在 issue 畫面上，也不會出現在 bulk edit 的可改欄位清單裡。","A":"正解（本題問的是「<strong>不</strong>包含哪一項」）。<strong>沒有 Make bulk changes 的話，搜尋結果頁根本不會出現 Bulk change 選項，連進都進不去</strong>，不會出現「有畫面但缺某個欄位」這種情況。所以它不可能是本題的原因。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/edit-multiple-issues-at-the-same-time/"],"lvl":3,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.3.2-001","sec":"620.3.2","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Two projects share the same permission scheme, but different people must manage the sprints in each project. What is the best configuration?","opts":["In the scheme, grant Manage Sprints to a project role, and add different members to that role in each project.","Add both leads to the jira-administrators group.","Rename one of the projects to tell them apart.","In the scheme, grant Manage Sprints directly to Amy."],"zh":"兩個 project 共用同一份 permission scheme，但要由不同的人管理各自的 sprint。最佳設定是？","zo":["在 scheme 裡把 Manage Sprints 授予一個 project role，各 project 自己填不同成員","把兩位負責人都加進 jira-administrators","把其中一個 project 改名以區分","在 scheme 裡把 Manage Sprints 直接授予 Amy"],"ans":"A","why":{"D":"<strong>在 scheme 裡直接指定個人是官方不建議的做法</strong>：這份 scheme 被兩個 project 共用，Amy 會在<strong>兩邊</strong>都能管 sprint；而且日後換人一定要請 Jira admin 改 scheme，一改又是兩邊一起變。","A":"正解。這正是 <strong>project role 存在的意義——它是一個「佔位符」</strong>：Jira admin 在共用的 scheme 裡只寫下「Manage Sprints 給 Scrum Master 這個 role」，至於每個 project 的 Scrum Master 是誰，交給各自的 project admin 在 People 頁填。<strong>權限規則共用，人員各自獨立</strong>，兩個 project 從此互不干擾，日後換人也不必驚動 Jira admin。","B":"把人加進 jira-administrators 等於給了他管理整個站台的權力，只為了讓他能管自己的 sprint——這是嚴重的過度授權。","C":"project 的名稱跟權限毫無關係。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/how-to-use-space-roles/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.3.2-002","sec":"620.3.2","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Who can create a new site-wide project role, such as \"QA Lead\"?","opts":["Any reporter","A Jira administrator","Anyone with Assignable User","A project administrator"],"zh":"誰能建立一個新的全站 project role（例如「QA Lead」）？","zo":["任何 Reporter","Jira admin","有 Assignable User 的人","Project admin"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"Reporter 是 issue 層級的身分（誰開的單），跟建立 role 這種站台層級的動作毫無關係。","B":"正解。<strong>project role 是全站物件</strong>，由 <strong>Jira admin</strong> 在 ⚙ → System →（Security 區）Project roles（現行可能稱 Space roles）建立，需要 <strong>Administer Jira</strong> 權限。要記住這組分工：<strong>Jira admin 建立 role 並在 scheme 裡授權，project admin 只負責把人填進去</strong>。","C":"Assignable User 只是「可以被指派 issue」的權限，跟角色管理完全無關。","D":"<strong>project admin 只能把人填進既有的 role，不能建立新的 role</strong>。官方在「想要一個限縮權限的新角色」這個情境下的建議，正是請 Jira admin 建立。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/create-a-new-space-role/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.3.2-003","sec":"620.3.2","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A Jira administrator changed the default members of a role, but the new members do not appear in existing projects. Why?","opts":["Roles can contain only groups, not individual users.","The cache needs to be cleared.","Default members apply only to projects created afterward.","All issues must be re-created."],"zh":"Jira admin 修改了某個 role 的 default members，但既有 project 沒有出現新成員。原因是？","zo":["Role 不能包含個人，只能包含群組","需要清快取","Default members 只套用到之後新建的 project","必須重建所有 issue"],"ans":"C","why":{"B":"不是快取問題，重新整理再多次也不會出現。","C":"正解。官方說明 <strong>default members 只在「建立新 project」時套用</strong>，它設定的是新 project 的初始成員名單，<strong>不會回頭補進既有的 project</strong>。這是很常見的誤解，也是考題愛問的點。既有的 project 只能由各自的 project admin 到 People 頁手動加（好消息是 group 可以整包加進去）。","D":"跟 issue 完全無關。","A":"role 的成員<strong>可以是個人也可以是群組</strong>，這個敘述本身就不正確。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/create-a-new-space-role/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.3.2-004","sec":"620.3.2","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Besides permissions, what else can be affected when a user is removed from a project role?","opts":["All the issues the user created are deleted.","The user's access to the Jira product is revoked.","Only the colors on the screen.","Notifications (notification scheme), issue security levels, workflow conditions, and other settings that reference the role."],"zh":"把一個人從某個 project role 移除，除了權限之外還可能影響什麼？","zo":["他建立的所有 issue 會被刪除","他的 Jira 產品存取會被取消","只有畫面顏色","通知（notification scheme）、issue security level、workflow condition 等引用該 role 的設定"],"ans":"D","why":{"C":"這個答案太狹窄，完全低估了 role 的影響範圍。","D":"正解。<strong>同一個 role 會被好幾種設定引用</strong>：permission scheme（能做什麼）、notification scheme（收哪些通知）、issue security level（看得到哪些受限 issue）、workflow condition（能不能執行某個 transition），以及 filter 與 dashboard 的分享對象。所以把人從 role 移除，他可能不只是少了編輯按鈕，還會<strong>突然收不到通知、過不了某個 transition、或看不到原本看得到的 issue</strong>。這也是為什麼刪除 role 之前一定要先跑 View Usage。","A":"移除 role 成員<strong>不會刪除任何資料</strong>，他建立的 issue 完好無缺。","B":"<strong>project 的成員資格與站台的產品存取（app access）是兩個不同層級</strong>，把人從 role 移除不會影響他的 Jira 授權席次。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/how-to-use-space-roles/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/view-space-role-usage/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.3.2-005","sec":"620.3.2","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A project administrator removes Kevin as a direct member of the Developers role, but the People page still shows Kevin in Developers. What is a possible reason?","opts":["Kevin is still a member of the role through a group.","Anyone who has ever been a reporter is permanently a member.","The project must be deleted to remove him.","Kevin must reset his password for the change to take effect."],"zh":"Project admin 把 Kevin 從 Developers role 的直接成員移除，但 People 頁仍顯示 Kevin 在 Developers。可能原因是？","zo":["Kevin 透過某個群組仍是該 role 成員","曾經是 Reporter 就永久是成員","必須刪除 project 才能移除","要 Kevin 重設密碼才生效"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"正解。<strong>role 的成員可以是個人，也可以是整個群組</strong>——這是兩條獨立的來源。把 Kevin 的<strong>個人</strong>指派移除，並不會影響他透過某個 group 取得的成員資格，所以 People 頁仍然顯示他在裡面。要真正移除，得<strong>請 Jira admin 把他從那個 group 拿掉</strong>（但那會影響所有使用該 group 的地方），或改變 role 的授權方式。這也是排查權限時最容易漏掉的路徑。","B":"沒有這種規則。Reporter 是 issue 層級的動態身分，跟 role 的成員資格無關。","C":"完全不需要刪除 project，那是災難性的過度反應。","D":"密碼跟權限計算毫無關係。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/add-users-to-space-roles-in-your-space/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.3.2-006","sec":"620.3.2","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Company-managed projects include a project role named <code>atlassian-addons-project-access</code> by default. What is it used for?","opts":["It is a read-only role for contractors.","It allows Marketplace apps and integrations (for example, Slack and Automation) to perform actions in the project.","It is a backup role for Jira administrators.","It is deprecated and can be safely deleted."],"zh":"CMP 預設就有一個名為 atlassian-addons-project-access 的 project role。它的用途是？","zo":["給外包人員用的唯讀角色","給 Marketplace app 與整合（例如 Slack、Automation）在 project 內執行動作用","給 Jira admin 的備用角色","已廢棄，可安全刪除"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"這個 role <strong>不是給人使用的</strong>，它是保留給程式的。","B":"正解。<strong><code>atlassian-addons-project-access</code> 是 Atlassian 保留給 Marketplace app 與各種整合（Slack、Automation for Jira 等）使用的特殊 role</strong>——這些程式是「以這個角色的身分」在 project 裡執行動作的。所以 automation 規則失敗時，其中一個典型原因就是這個 role 在該 project 的 permission scheme 裡缺少對應權限。<strong>絕對不要刪除它，也不要拿掉它的權限</strong>，否則所有整合會一起失效。","C":"跟 Jira admin 沒有關係，它不是任何人的備用角色。","D":"完全沒有廢棄，<strong>刪除它會讓所有 app 與整合失去在該 project 動作的權限</strong>——常見的意外正是有人整理權限時覺得「這個角色沒人在裡面」而把它刪掉。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/how-to-use-space-roles/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.3.2-007","sec":"620.3.2","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Mei, a project administrator, wants to make Hong, a new teammate, an administrator of this project as well. What can she do?","opts":["Add Hong to the jira-administrators group.","Nothing. Only a Jira administrator can assign project administrators.","Add Hong to the Administrators role in Project settings → People.","Ask a Jira administrator to create a new permission scheme first."],"zh":"Project admin 小美想把新同事阿宏也設為本 project 的 admin。她可以怎麼做？","zo":["把阿宏加進 jira-administrators 群組","不行，只有 Jira admin 能指派 project admin","在 Project settings → People 把阿宏加進 Administrators role","要先請 Jira admin 建立新的 permission scheme"],"ans":"C","why":{"B":"這個說法不正確。官方明講<strong>把人加進 Administrators role，跟加進其他任何 role 是同一個流程</strong>，project admin 自己就能做。","C":"正解。到 <strong>Project settings → People</strong> 把阿宏加進 <strong>Administrators</strong> role 即可——因為 permission scheme 通常把 <strong>Administer Projects</strong> 這個權限授予了 Administrators role，人一填進去就生效。這也提醒一件事：<strong>正因為 project admin 可以自由調整 role 成員（包含把人加成 admin），Administer Projects 這個權限本身就該謹慎授予</strong>。","D":"完全不需要動 scheme。scheme 定義的是「哪個 role 有哪些權限」，而這裡要做的只是「把人填進既有的 role」。","A":"把人加進 <code>jira-administrators</code> 會讓他成為<strong>整個站台的 Jira admin</strong>，能改所有 project 的 scheme——為了讓他管一個 project 而給這種權力，是嚴重的過度授權。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/add-users-to-space-roles-in-your-space/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.3.2-008","sec":"620.3.2","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"In which situation should permissions be granted to a group rather than a project role?","opts":["Only one project needs this permission.","Project administrators should maintain the list of users themselves.","Each project needs different people to perform the same task.","The same set of people applies across every project that uses the scheme (for example, <code>jira-administrators</code>)."],"zh":"什麼情況下應該用 group 而不是 project role 來授權？","zo":["只有一個 project 需要這個權限","想讓 project admin 自己維護名單","每個 project 需要不同的人做同一件事","跨所有使用該 scheme 的 project 都是同一批人（例如 jira-administrators）"],"ans":"D","why":{"C":"「每個 project 需要不同的人」正是 <strong>role 的典型場景</strong>，這個選項描述的是 role 而不是 group。","D":"正解。判斷準則是：<strong>全站都是同一批人、而且希望集中維護，就用 group</strong>（成員由 org／site admin 統一管理，新人入職加進群組就一次涵蓋所有 project）；<strong>各 project 人不同、需要下放給 PM 自己換人，才用 role</strong>。實務上還有一招兩全其美——<strong>把 group 放進某個 role</strong>，平常靠 group 自動涵蓋，日後某個 project 需要例外時再調整 role 成員。","A":"只有一個 project 需要時，<strong>用 role 反而更省事</strong>——project admin 自己就能維護名單，不必請 org admin 動群組。","B":"想讓 project admin 自己維護名單，正是<strong>選 role</strong> 的理由；group 的成員只有 org／site admin 能改。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/how-to-use-space-roles/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.3.2-009","sec":"620.3.2","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A Jira administrator wants to delete a custom project role. What should the administrator do first?","opts":["Use View project role usage to check which projects, schemes, and configurations reference the role.","Transition all issues to Done.","Nothing. Deleting the role only affects its name.","Rename the role."],"zh":"Jira admin 想刪除一個自訂 project role。刪除前最該做什麼？","zo":["用 View project role usage 檢查哪些 project、scheme 與設定引用它","先把所有 issue 改成 Done","不需要檢查，刪除只影響名稱","先把 role 改名"],"ans":"A","why":{"D":"改名<strong>不能避免引用失效</strong>——而且改名之後，引用它的設定看起來還在，實際上更難察覺問題。","A":"正解。官方提供了 <strong>View project role usage</strong>（⚙ → System → Project roles → View Usage）這個入口，它會列出<strong>使用這個 role 的 permission scheme、email notification scheme、work item security level 與 workflow condition</strong>。因為同一個 role 可能被這麼多種設定引用，<strong>刪除之前一定要先查清楚</strong>，否則會造成通知失效、transition 卡住、受限 issue 看不到等連鎖問題——而且這些症狀出現時，往往很難聯想到是刪 role 造成的。","B":"issue 的狀態跟 role 的刪除毫無關係。","C":"這正好是最危險的想法。<strong>刪除 role 會讓所有引用它的 permission、notification、issue security 與 workflow condition 設定失效</strong>，影響遠遠不只是一個名稱。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/view-space-role-usage/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.3.2-010","sec":"620.3.2","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"What is the main difference between a role in a team-managed project and a project role in a company-managed project?","opts":["Team-managed roles are global objects, while company-managed roles exist only within a project.","A team-managed role is tied directly to a set of selected permissions and exists only in that project; a company-managed role is a global placeholder whose permissions are determined by the permission scheme.","They are exactly the same.","Team-managed projects do not have roles."],"zh":"Team-managed project 中，「role」與 company-managed 的 project role 最大差別是？","zo":["TMP 的 role 是全站物件，CMP 的 role 是 project 內物件","TMP 的 role 直接綁一組權限勾選、只存在於該 project；CMP 的 role 是全站佔位符，權限由 permission scheme 決定","兩者完全相同","TMP 沒有 role"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"方向剛好相反：<strong>CMP 的 role 才是全站物件，TMP 的 role 只存在於該 project</strong>。","B":"正解。兩者的模型完全不同：<strong>TMP 的 role 由 project admin 自己建立，並且直接在 role 上勾選一組權限，這個 role 只存在於該 project</strong>；<strong>CMP 的 role 則是 Jira admin 建立的全站「佔位符」，它本身不帶任何權限，權限是由 permission scheme 賦予的</strong>，各 project 只負責填人。一句話記法：<strong>TMP 的 role 自帶權限，CMP 的 role 只是名字</strong>。","C":"兩者的模型差異很大，不能混為一談——這正是考題喜歡對照的地方。","D":"TMP 有 role，而且有三個內建的（Administrator／Member／Viewer），還可以用 Duplicate 建立自訂 role。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/next-gen-permissions/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/how-to-use-space-roles/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.3.3-001","sec":"620.3.3","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A bug was found in version 1.0 and is expected to be fixed in version 1.1. How should the version fields be set?","opts":["Affects Version: 1.0; Fix Version: 1.1","Add only the label <code>1.1</code>.","Each field can hold only one version, so both cannot be recorded.","Affects Version: 1.1; Fix Version: 1.0"],"zh":"一個 bug 在 1.0 版被發現，預計在 1.1 修好。版本欄位應該怎麼填？","zo":["Affects Version 1.0、Fix Version 1.1","只要加 label「1.1」","兩個欄位都只能填一個版本，所以無法同時記錄","Affects Version 1.1、Fix Version 1.0"],"ans":"A","why":{"D":"把兩個欄位的意義反過來了：問題發生在 1.0（Affects），修復釋出在 1.1（Fix）。","A":"正解。兩個欄位的分工是：<strong>Affects Version 記錄「哪個版本有這個問題」</strong>（可以多選，因為好幾個舊版可能都有），<strong>Fix Version 記錄「這個工作會在哪一版釋出」</strong>。而<strong>只有 Fix Version 會把 issue 納入該版本的 release 範圍</strong>，release page、Version report 與 Release burndown 看的都是它。記法：<strong>Affects 是「哪裡壞了」，Fix 是「哪一版修好出貨」</strong>。","B":"label 只是一串沒有屬性的文字，<strong>不會讓 issue 進入任何版本的 release 範圍</strong>，release page 上找不到它，報表也算不到。","C":"這個敘述不正確——<strong>兩個版本欄位都可以多選</strong>，一個 bug 影響三個舊版、修在兩個版本都寫得出來。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/manage-versions/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.3.3-002","sec":"620.3.3","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"After a user clicks Release, one issue in the version is still In Progress. Which statement is correct?","opts":["The Affects Versions field must have been set incorrectly.","Releasing a version does not automatically complete its issues; during release, Jira asks whether to ignore them or move them to another version.","Jira must be malfunctioning.","The issue must be deleted before the version can be released."],"zh":"按下 Release 之後，版本裡有一張 issue 仍是 In Progress。何者正確？","zo":["Affects Versions 一定填錯","Release 版本不會自動把 issue 完成；release 時會問要忽略還是搬到別的版本","Jira 一定壞了","必須刪除該 issue 才能 release"],"ans":"B","why":{"B":"正解。<strong>Release 改變的是「版本」的狀態，不會去改任何 issue 的狀態</strong>——這是兩個不同層級的東西。Jira 在你按下 Release 時<strong>會偵測到未解決的 issue 並跳出對話框</strong>，讓你選擇「忽略」或「移到另一個版本」。實務上的正確選擇通常是<strong>移到下一個版本</strong>，這樣 v1.0 的內容才與實際交付一致，Version report 也不會失真。","C":"這是<strong>正常且刻意</strong>的設計行為——Jira 不會擋住你發佈一個有未完成工作的版本，它只會問你怎麼處理。","D":"完全不需要刪除任何 issue，那會損失資料。把它移到下一個版本即可。","A":"跟 Affects Versions 完全無關，那個欄位不影響 release 的內容判定。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/manage-versions/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/use-the-release-page-to-check-the-progress-of-a-version/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.3.3-003","sec":"620.3.3","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A team wants to create a long-term plan across four projects and view the dependencies between them. What should they do?","opts":["Rename the Done status to Released.","Use the Timeline of one of the projects, because it covers all of them.","Evaluate Plans (Premium/Enterprise), because Timeline shows only a single project.","Change the color of the Timeline."],"zh":"團隊想跨四個 project 排長期計畫並看依賴關係。應該？","zo":["把 Done 狀態改名為 Released","用其中一個 project 的 Timeline，它會涵蓋全部","評估 Plans（Premium／Enterprise），Timeline 只能看單一 project","把 Timeline 換個顏色"],"ans":"C","why":{"B":"<strong>Timeline（roadmap）只能顯示單一 project</strong>，這是硬性限制，沒有任何設定可以打開讓它涵蓋四個 project。","C":"正解。<strong>跨多個 project 的長期規劃與依賴管理，是 Plans（前身 Advanced Roadmaps）的守備範圍，需要 Premium 或 Enterprise 方案</strong>。Plans 才具備跨 board／跨 project 建立計畫、容量規劃、情境模擬與依賴視圖的能力。三個層級要一起記：<strong>單一 project 用 Timeline（免費）、跨 project 用 Plans（Premium）、企業級 portfolio 用 Jira Align（另一個產品）</strong>。","D":"顏色是純視覺設定，解決不了範圍限制。","A":"把 status 改名跟跨 project 規劃毫無關係，這只是換個顯示文字。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/what-is-the-roadmap/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.3.3-004","sec":"620.3.3","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A version's scope increases from 20 to 30 story points, while completed work remains at 10 points. Which statement is correct?","opts":["Velocity will drop to zero.","The newly added work should be hidden so that progress looks better.","The amount of completed work has gone backward.","The percentage complete drops, but the completed work does not disappear; the reports show the scope increase."],"zh":"版本 scope 從 20 點增加到 30 點，完成量仍是 10 點。何者正確？","zo":["Velocity 一定歸零","應該隱藏新加的工作讓進度好看","完成量倒退了","完成比例下降，但已完成的工作沒有消失；報表會顯示 scope 增加"],"ans":"D","why":{"C":"這是混淆了「比例」與「數量」：<strong>完成的 10 點一點都沒有少</strong>，只是分母變大了。","D":"正解。<strong>完成比例從 10/20（50%）掉到 10/30（33%），但已完成的工作沒有消失</strong>——變的是分母。而且 <strong>Release burndown 與 Version report 會用不同的顏色標示出「scope added」的部分</strong>（Epic／Release burndown 用深藍段，Burnup 則是紅線往上跳），正是為了讓這種範圍膨脹一目了然，而不是把它藏起來。","A":"velocity 是依<strong>過去幾個 sprint 的實際完成量</strong>計算的，不會因為某個版本的 scope 增加就歸零。","B":"隱藏新加的工作會<strong>扭曲資訊、誤導決策</strong>——報表存在的目的正是要讓範圍變動被看見，讓利害關係人知道交付日期為何往後推。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-release-burndown-report/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.3.3-005","sec":"620.3.3","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A project administrator wants to keep the data of a historical version but no longer have it appear in the version drop-down list. What is the preferred action?","opts":["Archive the version.","Delete the permission scheme.","Clear the release date.","Delete all issues in the version."],"zh":"想保留一個歷史版本的資料，但不要再出現在版本下拉選單。首選動作是？","zo":["Archive 版本","刪除 permission scheme","把 release date 清空","Delete 版本裡所有 issue"],"ans":"A","why":{"D":"刪除 issue 是破壞資料的行為，而且題目要的正好相反——他要<strong>保留</strong>歷史資料。","A":"正解。<strong>Archive（封存）版本</strong>正好符合這兩個需求：版本會<strong>從 Fix version 的下拉選單與報表中隱藏、不能再被指派新的 issue</strong>，但<strong>資料完整保留，隨時可以 Unarchive 還原</strong>。這跟 Delete 是完全不同的操作——後者會強迫你處理底下 issue 的版本值。","B":"permission scheme 跟版本管理毫無關係。","C":"release date 只是一個日期欄位，<strong>清空它不會讓版本從下拉選單消失</strong>。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/manage-versions/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.3.3-006","sec":"620.3.3","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"What happens after version v1.1 is merged into v2.0?","opts":["v1.1 is kept, and its issues belong to both versions.","The Fix Version of the issues in v1.1 changes to v2.0, and v1.1 is removed irreversibly.","Only released versions can be merged.","Merging copies only the version name."],"zh":"把版本 v1.1 Merge 進 v2.0 之後會發生什麼？","zo":["v1.1 保留，issue 同時屬於兩個版本","v1.1 的 issue 的 Fix Version 改成 v2.0，v1.1 被移除且不可逆","只有 Released 的版本能合併","Merge 只複製名稱"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"來源版本<strong>會消失</strong>，issue 不會同時屬於兩個版本。","B":"正解。Merge 的行為是：<strong>把來源版本（v1.1）底下所有 issue 的 Fix Version 改成目標版本（v2.0），然後移除來源版本</strong>。官方的操作步驟是選要併入的版本 → 選目標 → Merge。要特別注意<strong>官方頁面沒有提供任何還原步驟，實務上要當成不可逆的操作</strong>——併錯方向只能一張張手動改回去，所以動手前先確認清楚。它的好處是省下逐張編輯 Fix Version 的工夫。","C":"沒有這種限制，Unreleased 的版本一樣可以合併。","D":"Merge 搬動的是<strong>issue 的版本歸屬</strong>，不是只複製一個名稱。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>官方 Manage versions 頁只描述「合併並移動 work item」，未明文說不可逆；教材以「無還原步驟」表述。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/manage-versions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.3.3-007","sec":"620.3.3","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"No warnings (such as open pull requests or failing builds) appear on the release page. Which of the following is NOT a prerequisite for warnings to appear?","opts":["The viewer has the View Development Tools permission.","Warnings are enabled on the release page.","The version has already been released.","The site is connected to development tools (such as Bitbucket or GitHub)."],"zh":"Release page 上沒有出現任何 warnings（例如 open pull request、failing build）。要讓 warnings 出現，下列哪一項不是前提？","zo":["查看者有 View Development Tools 權限","Release page 的 warnings 功能已啟用","版本必須已經 Released","站台已連接開發工具（Bitbucket、GitHub 等）"],"ans":"C","why":{"D":"這<strong>是</strong>前提之一。沒有連接 Bitbucket、GitHub 這類開發工具，Jira 根本收不到 PR 與 build 的資料，也就無從產生警示。","A":"這<strong>是</strong>前提之一。沒有 <strong>View Development Tools</strong> 權限的人，看不到任何開發資訊，warnings 自然也不會出現——這也是「同事看不到 warnings、我卻看得到」最常見的原因。","B":"這<strong>是</strong>前提之一。warnings 是可以開關的功能（在 Work items 區的 ••• 裡由 project admin 設定），被關掉就不會顯示。","C":"正解（本題問的是「<strong>不是</strong>前提」的那一項）。<strong>warnings 存在的目的正是在 release「之前」提醒你有風險</strong>——還有未合併的 PR、未 review 的 commit、失敗的 build。要是非得等版本 Released 才顯示，這個功能就毫無意義了。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/use-the-release-page-to-check-the-progress-of-a-version/"],"lvl":3,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.3.3-008","sec":"620.3.3","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A team has enabled the Releases feature in a team-managed project and wants to record on issues which version contains a bug. Which statement is correct?","opts":["Team-managed projects have no version fields at all.","The project must first be converted to company-managed to have Fix versions.","Team-managed projects have both the Fix versions and Affects versions fields.","Releases in team-managed projects provide only Fix versions; the feature request for Affects Version/s (JRACLOUD-85690) has not been implemented."],"zh":"Team-managed project 開啟 Releases 功能後，team 想在 issue 上記錄「哪個版本有這個 bug」。何者正確？","zo":["TMP 沒有任何版本欄位","要先轉成 CMP 才有 Fix versions","TMP 有 Fix versions 與 Affects versions 兩個欄位","TMP 的 Releases 只提供 Fix versions；Affects Version/s 的功能請求（JRACLOUD-85690）仍未實作"],"ans":"D","why":{"C":"這正是本題要打破的推論：<strong>有 Releases 不代表兩個版本欄位都有</strong>。","D":"正解。<strong>TMP 開啟 Releases 之後只提供 Fix versions，沒有 Affects versions</strong>。官方的功能請求 <strong>JRACLOUD-85690（Affects Version/s in team-managed projects）截至 2026-09 查核時仍是 Gathering Interest、尚未實作</strong>。這裡要提醒一個常見的錯誤補救方式：<strong>自己新增一個同名的文字 custom field 是沒有用的</strong>——它不具備系統版本欄位的語意與關聯，不會進入 release 範圍，Version report 也認不得它。","A":"TMP 在 Features 裡開啟 Releases 之後，<strong>是有 Fix versions 欄位可用的</strong>。","B":"不必轉成 CMP——<strong>Fix versions 在 TMP 就可以用</strong>，只要先開啟 Releases 功能。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>現行狀態（2026-09）；考試若問 TMP 版本欄位，答「只有 Fix versions」。","src":["https://jira.atlassian.com/browse/JRACLOUD-85690","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/manage-versions/"],"lvl":3,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.3.3-009","sec":"620.3.3","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Some issues do not appear on the Timeline (roadmap). What is the most likely reason?","opts":["They have no parent (epic), and the Timeline is currently displayed in the hierarchy view.","Their assignee is empty.","They have no Fix Version.","The Timeline shows only Done issues."],"zh":"Timeline（roadmap）上看不到某些 issue。下列何者最可能？","zo":["它們沒有 parent（epic），而 Timeline 目前以階層檢視顯示","它們的 assignee 是空的","它們沒有 Fix Version","Timeline 只顯示 Done 的 issue"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"正解。Timeline 預設以 <strong>epic → child 的階層方式</strong>呈現（Show inline hierarchy 開啟），在這個模式下 <strong>child 必須縮排在自己的 parent 底下，所以沒有 parent 的 issue 沒有位置可以放、不會顯示</strong>；sub-task 也同樣不會出現。解法有兩個：把它掛到某個 epic 底下，或是<strong>關閉 Show inline hierarchy 切換成平面清單</strong>（官方原文說這時會顯示沒有 parent 的工作）。答題時記得預設是開啟的。","B":"assignee 是不是空的<strong>完全不影響</strong> Timeline 的顯示。","C":"版本（Fix Version）不是 Timeline 的顯示條件，沒填一樣看得到。","D":"Timeline 會顯示<strong>各種狀態</strong>的工作，不是只有 Done。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>作答用考試版：沒有 parent 的 issue 不出現在 Timeline；現行：取決於 Show inline hierarchy 開關。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/what-is-the-roadmap/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/customize-your-view-on-the-timeline/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.3.3-010","sec":"620.3.3","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Which permission does a project administrator need to create and manage versions?","opts":["Browse Projects only","Administer Projects (or Manage Versions)","Administer Jira","Manage Sprints"],"zh":"Project admin 要建立與管理 versions，需要哪些權限？","zo":["只要 Browse Projects","Administer Projects（或 Manage Versions）","Administer Jira","Manage Sprints"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"Browse Projects 只能看，<strong>建立與管理 version 需要更高的權限</strong>。","B":"正解。versions 屬於 project 層級的設定，由 <strong>Administer Projects</strong> 管理；官方的 Manage versions 頁另外列出了細分的 <strong>Manage Versions</strong> 權限。實務上 project admin 就能建立、發布、封存、合併與刪除版本，<strong>不需要 Jira admin</strong>。（另外提醒：TMP 要先在 Features 開啟 Releases 才有這個功能。）","C":"不需要 Administer Jira——這是 project 層級的工作，project admin 自己就能做。","D":"Manage Sprints 管的是 sprint，<strong>sprint 與 version 是兩個完全不同的物件</strong>：sprint 屬於 board、是時間框架；version 屬於 project、是交付的包裹。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/space-access-and-configuration-permissions/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/manage-versions/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.3.3-011","sec":"620.3.3","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"What does Jira do when a user deletes a version that still has issues?","opts":["It automatically archives the version.","It deletes the version and all of its issues.","It asks the user to change the issues' version value to another version or clear it.","It does not allow versions with issues to be deleted."],"zh":"Delete 一個還有 issue 的版本時，Jira 會怎麼處理？","zo":["自動改成 Archived","直接刪除版本與所有 issue","要求你把 issue 的版本值改到另一個版本或清空","不允許刪除有 issue 的版本"],"ans":"C","why":{"B":"<strong>絕對不會刪除 issue</strong>。刪除 version 只是移除這個「包裹」的定義，裡面的工作完好無缺。","C":"正解。Jira 會跳出對話框，要求你決定<strong>那些 issue 的 Fix／Affects 版本值該怎麼處理——換成另一個版本，還是直接移除版本關聯（欄位變空白）</strong>。這道提問是刻意的保護機制，避免資料悄悄斷掉。順帶對照 Merge：<strong>Merge 是把 issue 全部搬到目標版本，Delete 則讓你選擇搬走或斷開</strong>。","D":"<strong>可以刪除</strong>，只是必須先回答上面那個問題。Jira 不會因為版本底下有 issue 就拒絕。","A":"Archive 是另一個獨立的動作，Jira <strong>不會</strong>在你按 Delete 時自作主張改成封存。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/manage-versions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.3.4-001","sec":"620.3.4","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A team needs to categorize the work in its project by module and wants each module's owner to be assigned automatically. Which should they use?","opts":["Components","Project category","A prefix in the Summary","Dashboard titles"],"zh":"團隊需要把本 project 的工作依模組分類，並希望各模組負責人自動被指派。優先選哪個？","zo":["Components","Project category","在 Summary 加前綴","Dashboard 標題"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"正解。<strong>component 是唯一能做到自動指派的分類方式</strong>：每個 component 可以指定 <strong>Component lead</strong> 並把 <strong>Default assignee</strong> 設成 Component lead，新 issue 一掛上該 component、Assignee 留 Automatic，就會自動指派給對應的負責人。label 與 custom field 都沒有這個能力（要另外寫 automation）。前提是這必須是 <strong>company-managed project</strong>。","B":"<strong>project category 分類的是「project」，不是「issue」</strong>——它讓你在專案目錄裡把相似的 project 分群，跟 issue 的模組歸屬完全是兩回事。","C":"在 Summary 加前綴不是結構化資料：<strong>無法可靠地篩選與統計</strong>（打錯字就漏了），更不可能自動指派。","D":"dashboard 的標題只是顯示文字。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/organize-work-with-components/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.3.4-002","sec":"620.3.4","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"All issues across the company must be tagged with a customer tier. Only Gold or Silver can be selected, and typos must not be possible. What is the most appropriate approach?","opts":["Free-text labels","A select list custom field with controlled options","A separate project for each tier","Writing the tier in the Description"],"zh":"全公司的 issue 都要標記客戶等級，且只能選 Gold 或 Silver，不能打錯字。最合適的做法？","zo":["自由輸入的 Labels","受控選項的 select list custom field","每個等級建一個 project","把等級寫在 Description"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"<strong>label 任何有 Edit Issues 的人打字就能新建，完全無法限制拼字</strong>——最後一定會長出 Gold、gold、GOLD 三種寫法，報表被拆散。","B":"正解。<strong>select list 型別的 custom field 由 Jira admin 定義固定選項</strong>，使用者只能從清單挑，所以不會有拼字問題；而且它是全站物件，<strong>跨 project 一致、報表也能可靠地分群統計</strong>。這正是官方點名「選項型欄位勝過 label」的理由。","C":"為了兩個等級而建兩個 project 是嚴重的過度設計，會讓 backlog 被切開、設定與權限都要維護兩套。","D":"寫在 Description 裡的文字<strong>無法被結構化地搜尋與統計</strong>，做不出可靠的報表。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/custom-fields-types-in-company-managed-projects/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.3.4-003","sec":"620.3.4","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A team using a team-managed project wants to use components. Which statement is correct?","opts":["A sprint must be started first.","Copying the screen from a company-managed project makes components available.","Components are available only in company-managed projects; team-managed projects can use labels or custom fields instead.","All projects share the same components."],"zh":"Team-managed project 的團隊想使用 Components。何者正確？","zo":["要先開始一個 sprint","複製 CMP 的 screen 就能用","Components 只有 company-managed 有；TMP 可改用 labels 或自訂欄位","所有 project 都有相同的 components"],"ans":"C","why":{"B":"screen 決定的是「issue 畫面上顯示哪些欄位」，<strong>它不會讓一個 project 型態獲得它本來沒有的功能</strong>。","C":"正解。<strong>components 是 company-managed project 專屬功能</strong>，官方原文明講它的範圍限定在建立它的那個 space，TMP 完全沒有這個東西。替代方案是用 <strong>label</strong>（全站共用、無管控）或由 project admin <strong>自建一個 select 欄位</strong>（選項受控，但只存在於該 project）。<strong>兩種替代方案都做不到自動指派</strong>，那部分只能靠 automation 補；如果自動指派是硬需求，正確答案其實是改用 CMP。","D":"<strong>component 是 project 內的物件</strong>，每個 project 各自建立、互不相通，不會全站一致。","A":"sprint 跟 components 毫無關係。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/organize-work-with-components/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.3.4-004","sec":"620.3.4","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A Jira administrator created a custom field as Short text and later realized it should have been Number. What should the administrator do?","opts":["Change the field's color.","Rename the board.","Change the field type directly to Number; no data will be lost.","Create a new Number field and plan a data migration, because a custom field's type cannot be changed after it is created."],"zh":"Jira admin 把一個 custom field 建成 Short text，後來發現應該是 Number。怎麼辦？","zo":["改欄位顏色即可","改 board 名稱即可","直接把型別改成 Number，資料不會遺失","建新的 Number 欄位並規劃資料遷移；custom field 建立後不能改型別"],"ans":"D","why":{"C":"這個敘述是錯的——<strong>官方明列 custom field 一旦建立就不能更改型別</strong>，設定介面上根本沒有這個選項。","D":"正解。正確做法是走一套遷移流程：<strong>建立一個新的 Number 欄位 → 把它加進對應的 screen → 用 bulk edit 依舊欄位的值分批填進新欄位 → 確認報表與 JQL 都改用新欄位之後，再把舊的 text 欄位從 screen 隱藏</strong>（先別急著刪，保留一段時間以防需要核對）。這也是為什麼建立 custom field 前值得多想一下型別——事後補救的成本相當高。","A":"顏色跟欄位型別毫無關係。","B":"board 名稱跟欄位型別毫無關係。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/custom-fields-types-in-company-managed-projects/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.3.4-005","sec":"620.3.4","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An issue has two components selected. What does this mean?","opts":["The issue has one assignee, but its categorization can have multiple values.","Jira automatically splits it into two issues.","Both components must have the same lead.","The issue has two assignees."],"zh":"同一張 issue 選了兩個 components。這代表什麼？","zo":["一張 issue、一位 assignee，但分類可以多值","系統會自動拆成兩張 issue","兩個 components 必須是同一個 lead","這張 issue 有兩位 assignee"],"ans":"A","why":{"D":"<strong>Assignee 欄位永遠是單值</strong>，一張 issue 只能有一位負責人。","A":"正解。<strong>Components 是多值欄位，一張 issue 可以同時屬於好幾個模組</strong>；但 <strong>Assignee 永遠只有一個值</strong>。這正是「多 component 自動指派」需要一套優先序規則的原因——分類可以多值，指派卻只能挑一個人（先比 default assignee 類型優先序，同級再比 component 名稱字母序）。","B":"Jira <strong>不會</strong>因為選了兩個 component 就自動把 issue 拆成兩張。","C":"沒有這種限制，兩個 component 的 lead 可以完全不同——這正是自動指派需要優先序規則的原因。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/organize-work-with-components/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.3.4-006","sec":"620.3.4","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A Jira administrator wants to prevent an old select list option, Legacy, from being selected while keeping the value on historical issues. What should the administrator do?","opts":["Delete the option.","Disable the option.","Rename it to a blank value.","Delete the entire field."],"zh":"Jira admin 想讓某個 select list 的舊選項「Legacy」不再被選到，但保留歷史 issue 上的值。應該？","zo":["刪除該選項","Disable 該選項","改名成空白","刪除整個欄位"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"<strong>刪除選項會影響已經填了該值的 issue</strong>，這正好違反題目「保留歷史值」的要求。","B":"正解。<strong>Disable 與 Delete 是兩個不同層次的操作</strong>：Disable 只是讓這個選項<strong>不再出現在新的選取清單裡</strong>，<strong>既有 issue 上的值完整保留、JQL 也還查得到</strong>；Delete 才是移除選項的定義。退役舊代碼時就該用 Disable。但要提醒一件事：<strong>停用不代表已經批次清掉歷史值</strong>，舊 issue 上那個值還在，做報表時仍會出現。","C":"改名會讓<strong>所有歷史 issue 上顯示的值一起改變</strong>，等於竄改了歷史紀錄。","D":"刪除整個欄位是嚴重的過度反應，會連帶失去所有其他選項的資料。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>停用選項是現行 Cloud 介面的行為；官方 context 說明頁只寫「為使用者建立另一組可選選項」，未逐字說明 Disable 與歷史值保留，實機以站台為準。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/edit-a-custom-fields-options/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/field-types-you-can-create-as-a-jira-admin/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.3.4-007","sec":"620.3.4","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Consider this statement: \"A component named Backend exists in two projects, so it is the same component.\" Which assessment is correct?","opts":["Incorrect, because components cannot share a name.","Correct, because components are global objects.","Incorrect, because components are project-level objects; components with the same name are still different components.","Correct, as long as they have the same lead."],"zh":"「同一個 component 在兩個 project 都叫 Backend，所以是同一個 component」。這個說法？","zo":["錯誤，因為 component 不能同名","正確，component 是全站物件","錯誤，component 是 project 內物件，同名也是不同的 component","正確，只要 lead 相同"],"ans":"C","why":{"B":"<strong>component 不是全站物件</strong>，它屬於單一 project——這是它與 label 最大的差別。","C":"正解。<strong>component 是 project 內的物件，同名也是兩個完全獨立的東西</strong>：各有自己的 ID、lead 與 default assignee，值不互通、報表也不會合併。這跟「兩個 TMP 有同名 custom field」「兩個 project 有同名 version」是完全一樣的道理。<strong>要做跨 project 一致的分類，該用 label 或全站的 custom field</strong>。","D":"lead 是誰完全不影響 component 的歸屬——就算兩個同名 component 的 lead 是同一個人，它們仍然是兩個物件。","A":"不同 project <strong>可以</strong>有同名的 component，Jira 完全允許。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/organize-work-with-components/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.3.4-008","sec":"620.3.4","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Which custom field type lets users select multiple people on the same issue?","opts":["Group picker (single group)","Short text","User picker (single user)","User picker (multiple users)"],"zh":"以下哪一種 custom field 型別能讓使用者在同一張 issue 選多個人？","zo":["Group picker (single group)","Short text","User picker (single user)","User picker (multiple users)"],"ans":"D","why":{"C":"User picker 的 <strong>single user</strong> 版本只能選一個人。","D":"正解。<strong>User picker (multiple users)</strong> 就是為了在同一張 issue 選多個人而設計的。順帶記兩個相關重點：user picker 型的欄位<strong>可以用 context 的 Edit User Filtering 限定候選範圍</strong>（例如只顯示某個 group 或 project role 的人），而且它<strong>可以當作 permission scheme 的授權對象</strong>（User custom field value），做出「這張 issue 各自指定的審核者才能 resolve」這種動態授權。","A":"Group picker 選的是<strong>群組</strong>，不是個別的人，而且 single 版本只能選一個群組。","B":"Short text 是純文字欄位，打進去的名字<strong>只是字串</strong>，不是結構化的使用者資料，無法用來授權或篩選。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/custom-fields-types-in-company-managed-projects/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.3.4-009","sec":"620.3.4","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A team wants to prioritize issues in Jira as Urgent, High, Medium, or Low, and wants different projects to be able to have different lists of priorities. What should they use in Jira Cloud today?","opts":["Priority schemes (assign different sets of priorities to different projects)","Components","Nothing. Jira Cloud has no priority schemes, so the whole site must use a single set.","Labels"],"zh":"團隊想在 Jira 依「緊急／高／中／低」排優先順序，且希望不同 project 能有不同的優先級清單。現行 Jira Cloud 應該用什麼？","zo":["Priority scheme（把不同的 priority 集合指派給不同 project）","Components","Jira Cloud 沒有 priority scheme，只能全站同一套","Labels"],"ans":"A","why":{"D":"label 只是一串文字，<strong>沒有先後順序的語意</strong>，也無法拿來排序。","A":"正解。<strong>Jira Cloud 現行已經提供 priority scheme</strong>：可以定義不同的 priority 集合，指派給不同的 project，並設定各自的預設值；多個 project 也能共用同一份 scheme，沒有指定的 project 則使用內含全站所有 priority 的預設 scheme。入口在 ⚙ → Work items → Priorities／Priority schemes（需要 Jira app admin）。要注意它處理的是 <strong>Priority 這個系統欄位的選項</strong>，不等於新增一個 custom field。","B":"component 是用來分類「工作屬於哪個模組」的，<strong>沒有優先順序的語意</strong>。","C":"這是<strong>過時的說法</strong>。舊資料常說 Jira Cloud 沒有 priority scheme，但官方現行文件已經提供這個功能——這也是本教材特別標注的更新點之一。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>現行版（2026）：Cloud 已有 priority scheme；2023 考綱時代文件未強調，若題目沿用舊說法以官方現行為準並註明。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/manage-priority-schemes/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.3.4-010","sec":"620.3.4","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Which statement about the Labels field is correct?","opts":["A label can have a default assignee.","Labels cannot contain spaces, and labels that differ only in letter case are different labels.","Only Jira administrators can create labels.","Labels are project-level objects."],"zh":"Labels 欄位的行為，何者正確？","zo":["Label 可以設定 default assignee","Label 不能含空白，且大小寫不同即是不同 label","Label 只能由 Jira admin 建立","Label 是 project 內物件"],"ans":"B","why":{"B":"正解。這三條規則要一起記：<strong>label 不能包含空白</strong>（要用連字號或底線代替）、<strong>大小寫不同就是不同的 label</strong>（<code>UX</code> 與 <code>ux</code> 是兩個），而且<strong>它是全站共用的</strong>——不同 project 打同一個字就是同一個 label，這正是它適合做跨 project 標記的原因，也是它容易失控的原因。","C":"<strong>任何有 Edit Issues 權限的人打字就能建立新的 label</strong>，完全沒有審核，這正是它難以管控的根源。","D":"<strong>label 是全站共用的</strong>，不是 project 內物件——這一點跟 component 剛好相反。","A":"<strong>只有 component 有 default assignee</strong>。label 沒有任何屬性可以設定。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/update-an-issues-details/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.3.4-011","sec":"620.3.4","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"What is the relationship between the default value set in a custom field context and a component's default assignee?","opts":["Both can be set only by project administrators.","They are the same thing.","They are unrelated: the former is the field's default value when an issue is created, and the latter is a rule for automatic assignment.","Setting one automatically synchronizes the other."],"zh":"Custom field 的 context 設定「預設值」與 component 的「default assignee」，關係是？","zo":["都只能由 project admin 設","兩者是同一件事","兩者無關：前者是欄位建立時的預設值，後者是自動指派人的規則","設定其中一個會自動同步另一個"],"ans":"C","why":{"B":"兩者是完全不同的物件與行為，只是中文都用了「預設」兩個字，很容易混淆。","C":"正解。兩者只是名稱相似，行為完全不同：<strong>context 的 default value 是「建立 issue 時自動預先填入這個欄位的值」</strong>（使用者仍可改）；<strong>component 的 default assignee 則是「Assignee 留 Automatic 時，這張 issue 該指派給誰」的規則</strong>。而且 <strong>custom field 沒有 component lead 那一套內建的指派規則</strong>——雖然它可以拿來當 automation 的判斷條件。","D":"兩者<strong>完全不會互相同步</strong>，各自獨立設定。","A":"兩者的設定者不同：<strong>custom field 的 context 由 Jira admin 管理</strong>（它是全站物件的設定），<strong>component 的 default assignee 則由 project admin 設定</strong>。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/custom-fields-types-in-company-managed-projects/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-jira-components/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.3.5-001","sec":"620.3.5","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"The component Payments has Amy as its lead, but its default assignee is set to Project default. The project's default assignee is Unassigned. A new issue is created with only Payments selected and the Assignee left as Automatic. What is the result?","opts":["Unassigned (if the site allows unassigned issues)","Always the creator of the issue","Amy and the project lead share responsibility.","Always Amy"],"zh":"Component「Payments」的 lead 是 Amy，但它的 default assignee 設為 Project default；project 的 default assignee 是 Unassigned。新 issue 只選 Payments、Assignee 留 Automatic，結果是？","zo":["Unassigned（站台允許未指派時）","一定是建立者","Amy 與 project lead 共同負責","一定是 Amy"],"ans":"A","why":{"D":"這是最容易誤選的一個——看到 component 有 lead 就直覺認為會指派給他。<strong>lead 只是一個欄位，要它生效必須把 default assignee 設成「Component lead」</strong>；這裡設的是 Project default，所以 Amy 不會被指派。","A":"正解。關鍵在於<strong>要看的是 component 的「default assignee 設定」，而不是它的 lead 是誰</strong>。Payments 雖然有 lead（Amy），但它的 default assignee 明確設成了 <strong>Project default</strong>，意思是「我不做決定，回去用 project 的設定」——而 project 的設定是 Unassigned，所以結果就是 Unassigned（前提是站台的 Allow unassigned issues 是開啟的）。","B":"Jira <strong>沒有「預設指派給建立者」</strong>這種規則。","C":"<strong>Assignee 永遠是單值</strong>，不可能兩個人共同持有。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/who-does-the-automatic-assignee-option-assign-an-issue-to/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-jira-components/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.3.5-002","sec":"620.3.5","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An issue has two components selected: Zebra (default assignee = Component lead) and Alpha (default assignee = Project default). According to the official Atlassian knowledge base, to whom is the issue assigned when the Assignee is left as Automatic?","opts":["The Alpha setting, because alphabetical order always takes precedence","The component lead of Zebra","The setting of the component selected last","The reporter"],"zh":"Issue 同時選了 Zebra（default assignee = Component lead）與 Alpha（default assignee = Project default）。依官方 KB，Automatic 會指派給誰？","zo":["Alpha 的設定，因為字母順序永遠優先","Zebra 的 component lead","最後一個被選取的 component 的設定","Reporter"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"這是最常見的誤解。<strong>字母順序只在「default assignee 類型相同、分不出高下」時才用得上</strong>；類型不同時要先比優先序，根本輪不到比字母。","B":"正解。判斷分兩步：<strong>第一步比 default assignee 的類型優先序——Component lead（1）＞ Project lead（2）＞ Unassigned（3）＞ Project default（4）</strong>。Zebra 是 Component lead（第 1 級），Alpha 是 Project default（第 4 級），<strong>Zebra 直接勝出</strong>，不必比字母序。所以答案是 Zebra 的 component lead（前提是他有 Assignable User 權限）。","C":"選取的先後順序<strong>不是任何判定依據</strong>。","D":"Reporter 跟自動指派的決策鏈毫無關係。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira/kb/manage-components-default-assignee-jira-software/"],"lvl":3,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.3.5-003","sec":"620.3.5","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Two components both have default assignee = Component lead, and their leads are different. How does Jira decide who to assign?","opts":["It selects the lead with fewer logged hours.","It compares the two leads' names alphabetically.","It compares the two component names alphabetically and uses the first one.","It looks at the last digit of the issue key."],"zh":"兩個 components 都設定 default assignee = Component lead，且 lead 不同。Jira 怎麼決定？","zo":["選工時較少的 lead","比較兩位 lead 的姓名字母順序","比較兩個 component 名稱的字母順序，取第一個","看 issue key 的最後一碼"],"ans":"C","why":{"B":"比較的是 <strong>component 的名稱</strong>，不是 lead 的姓名——這是很容易記反的一組。","C":"正解。官方 KB 明訂：<strong>當多個 component 的 default assignee 類型相同、分不出優先序時，依「component 名稱」的字母順序取第一個</strong>。所以要記牢兩件事：<strong>比的是 component 名稱（不是 lead 的名字、不是建立順序），而且這是第二關——第一關永遠是先比 default assignee 的類型優先序</strong>。（附帶一提，這一項官方 KB 與部分第三方題庫說法不同，教材以官方 KB 為準，站台實測項目另列在 SITE-VERIFY 清單。）","D":"完全沒有這種規則。","A":"依工作量分派是 <strong>automation 的 Balanced workload</strong> 才有的能力，<strong>component 的自動指派完全不看工作量</strong>。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira/kb/manage-components-default-assignee-jira-software/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.3.5-004","sec":"620.3.5","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"You manually assign an issue to Amy, and a few seconds later the Assignee changes to Ben. What should you do first to investigate?","opts":["Delete Amy's account immediately.","Rename the component.","Turn off all Jira features.","Check the issue's History and the automation audit log."],"zh":"你手動把 issue 指派給 Amy，幾秒後 Assignee 變成 Ben。應該優先查什麼？","zo":["立刻刪除 Amy 的帳號","改 component 名稱","關閉所有 Jira 功能","Issue 的 History 與 automation audit log"],"ans":"D","why":{"D":"正解。<strong>第一步永遠是開 issue 的 History</strong>，它會顯示「誰在什麼時間把 assignee 從 Amy 改成 Ben」。這一步的價值在於<strong>分辨是「一開始就指錯」還是「後來被改掉」</strong>——你是手動選的 Amy，代表初始指派完全正確，幾秒後的變更是<strong>另一個獨立事件</strong>。第二步再去比對同時段的 <strong>automation audit log</strong>，找出是哪一條規則（也可能是 workflow 的 post function）動的手。","A":"刪除帳號是極端且不可逆的操作，<strong>對找出原因毫無幫助</strong>。","B":"改 component 名稱是在動「字母序」那條規則，但<strong>手動指派根本沒有走 component 決策鏈</strong>（決策鏈只在 Assignee 留 Automatic 時才啟動），完全不對症。","C":"這不是合理的排查手段。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/jira-automation-actions/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.3.5-005","sec":"620.3.5","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"You use an automation rule to assign issues automatically when they are created, but you do not want to overwrite an assignee manually selected by the creator. What should you add to the rule?","opts":["Issue fields condition: Assignee is empty","Clear the Assignee before every assignment.","Add the manually selected person as a watcher.","Change the version date."],"zh":"你用 automation 在 issue 建立時自動指派，但不想覆蓋建立者手動選的人。規則應加什麼？","zo":["Issue fields condition：Assignee is empty","每次先清空 Assignee 再指派","把手動選的人設為 watcher","改版本日期"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"正解。在 Assign issue 這個 action 之前加一個 <strong>Issue fields condition：Assignee is empty</strong>，規則就只會在「沒有人被指派」時才動作，<strong>完整保留建立者手動選擇的結果</strong>。這是撰寫 automation 的一個重要習慣——<strong>讓規則具備冪等性、只在該做的時候才做</strong>，而不是無條件覆蓋。","B":"「先清空再指派」正好是<strong>最糟的做法</strong>：它保證每次都會覆蓋掉人工指派，完全違反題目要求。","C":"把人設成 watcher 只是讓他收到通知，<strong>完全不影響 Assignee 欄位</strong>。","D":"版本日期跟指派毫無關係。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/jira-automation-conditions/","https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/jira-automation-actions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.3.5-006","sec":"620.3.5","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Which options are available for the project's Default assignee on the Details page?","opts":["Any project member","Unassigned or Project lead","Reporter or Unassigned","Component lead or Project lead"],"zh":"Project 的 Default assignee 在 Details 頁只能選哪些？","zo":["任何 project 成員","Unassigned 或 Project lead","Reporter 或 Unassigned","Component lead 或 Project lead"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"這是最常見的誤解——<strong>它不是一個可以自由挑人的 user picker</strong>。","B":"正解。官方文件明訂 Details 頁的 Default assignee <strong>只有兩個選項：Unassigned 或 Project lead（現行稱 Space owner）</strong>。想讓新 issue 預設指派給其他人，有三條路：<strong>把那個人改設為 project lead</strong>、<strong>用 component 的 default assignee</strong>（可以依模組分流），或<strong>寫一條 automation</strong>（最彈性）。","C":"下拉裡<strong>沒有 Reporter 這個選項</strong>。（不過 automation 倒是可以做到「指派給 reporter」。）","D":"Component lead 是 <strong>component 層級</strong>的設定選項（在 Project settings → Components 裡），不會出現在 project 的 Details 頁。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>作答用考試版：只有 Unassigned／Project lead；現行部分介面可能允許指定特定使用者，以實機為準。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/edit-a-projects-details/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.3.5-007","sec":"620.3.5","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Unassigned is not available in the project's Default assignee drop-down list. What is the most likely cause?","opts":["The reporter does not have the Browse Projects permission.","The project has no lead.","A Jira administrator has turned off Allow unassigned issues in General configuration.","The project is team-managed."],"zh":"Project 的 Default assignee 下拉選單裡沒有「Unassigned」可選。最可能的原因？","zo":["Reporter 沒有 Browse 權限","Project 沒有 lead","Jira admin 在 General configuration 關閉了 Allow unassigned issues","Project 是 team-managed"],"ans":"C","why":{"B":"就算 project 目前沒有指定 lead，<strong>也不會讓 Unassigned 這個選項消失</strong>——兩者是獨立的選項。","C":"正解。<strong>站台層級的開關「Allow unassigned issues」（⚙ → System → General configuration）被關閉時，整個站台都不允許存在沒有 assignee 的 issue</strong>，所以任何地方的 Unassigned 選項都會消失——不只 project 的 Details 頁，component 的 default assignee 也一樣。這個開關只有 <strong>Jira admin</strong> 能改，而且影響全站。","D":"TMP 也可以選 Unassigned，這跟 project 的類型無關。","A":"Reporter 的權限跟這個下拉選單的內容毫無關係。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/edit-a-projects-details/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.3.5-008","sec":"620.3.5","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Component lead Ahong is set as the default assignee, but Ahong does not have the Assignable User permission in the project. What happens?","opts":["Jira automatically grants Ahong the permission.","The issue cannot be created.","Jira still forces the assignment to Ahong.","Ahong is not assigned; grant Ahong the Assignable User permission first, and verify the actual fallback behavior on the site."],"zh":"Component lead 阿宏被指定為 default assignee，但阿宏沒有該 project 的 Assignable User 權限。結果會怎樣？","zo":["Jira 會自動把權限給阿宏","Issue 無法建立","Jira 仍會強制指派給阿宏","阿宏不會被指派；請先給他 Assignable User，實際 fallback 行為以站台驗證為準"],"ans":"D","why":{"C":"<strong>沒有 Assignable User 權限的人，在任何情況下都不能成為 assignee</strong>，Jira 不會強制指派。","D":"正解。官方 KB 明確說明<strong>被指派者必須具備 Assignable User 權限</strong>，否則 Jira 無法把 issue 指派給他（KB 原文舉的例子正是「Jupiter 雖然是 Component Lead，但她沒有 Assignable user 權限，所以 Jira 無法指派」）。<strong>正確的處理是補上這個權限</strong>。至於他被跳過之後系統改指派給誰，官方並未逐一列出所有混合情境的 fallback，所以<strong>不要背一套固定的 fallback 順序</strong>——教材把它列為需要站台實測的項目。","A":"Jira <strong>不會自動幫任何人補上權限</strong>，權限一律要由管理員明確授予。","B":"issue <strong>照常會被建立</strong>，只是 assignee 欄位不會填上阿宏。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>官方未明列失效時的 fallback 對象；教材標「實機驗證」。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira/kb/manage-components-default-assignee-jira-software/"],"lvl":3,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.3.5-009","sec":"620.3.5","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A team wants new bugs to be assigned to three engineers in turn. What is the most direct approach?","opts":["Select Round robin or Balanced workload in the automation Assign issue action.","Set all three people as the project lead.","Change the default assignee to Unassigned.","Create three components, each with a different lead."],"zh":"團隊要「輪流」把新進 bug 指派給三位工程師。哪個做法最直接？","zo":["Automation 的 Assign issue action 選 Round robin 或 Balanced workload","把三個人都設成 project lead","改 default assignee 為 Unassigned","建三個 components 各設不同 lead"],"ans":"A","why":{"D":"component 的自動指派是<strong>依分類（掛哪個 component）決定指派給誰</strong>，它指向的永遠是同一個固定的人，<strong>做不出輪流的效果</strong>。","A":"正解。<strong>automation 的 Assign issue action 內建了 Round robin（依序輪流）與 Balanced workload（指給手上未完成 issue 最少的人）</strong>，正好對應「輪流」這個需求，還可以排除特定人或限定群組。選擇建議：工作大小相近就用 Round robin，工作大小差異大就用 Balanced workload。","B":"<strong>project lead 只能有一個人</strong>，三個人設不進去；而且 lead 也不會輪流。","C":"設成 Unassigned 是「不指派任何人」，跟輪流指派完全相反。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/jira-automation-actions/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.3.5-010","sec":"620.3.5","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"How does selecting Automatic in the automation Assign issue action differ from Automatic on the issue creation form?","opts":["They are exactly the same.","The automation documentation describes Automatic as the project's default assignee, while Automatic on the form also applies component default logic; when troubleshooting, check the actual action configuration and the audit log.","Automatic in automation always assigns the issue to the reporter.","Automatic on the form always leaves the issue unassigned."],"zh":"Automation 的 Assign issue action 選擇「Automatic」，與建立 issue 表單裡的「Automatic」有何不同？","zo":["完全相同","Automation 文件把 Automatic 描述為 project 的 default assignee；表單的 Automatic 另有 component default 邏輯——排查時要看實際 action 設定與 audit log","Automation 的 Automatic 一定指派給 reporter","表單的 Automatic 一定 Unassigned"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"兩處的官方文件描述並不相同，不能假設一致——這正是本題的重點。","B":"正解。這是一組同名但行為不同的陷阱：<strong>automation 的 Assign work item action 裡的「Automatic」，官方文件描述為「指派給 project 的 default assignee」</strong>；而<strong>建立 issue 表單上 Assignee 欄位的「Automatic」，走的是完整的 component → project default 決策鏈</strong>。實務上常見的災情就是團隊以為 automation 會照 component 分流，結果全部落到 project lead 身上。<strong>排查時要看實際的 action 設定與 audit log，不要憑名稱假設兩個入口行為一致</strong>；要按 component 分流就加條件搭配指定人或欄位複製。","C":"沒有這種規則，指派給 reporter 要另外用「從欄位複製」的方式設定。","D":"表單的 Automatic 結果取決於 component 與 project 的設定，<strong>不一定是 Unassigned</strong>。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/jira-automation-actions/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/who-does-the-automatic-assignee-option-assign-an-issue-to/"],"lvl":3,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.3.6-001","sec":"620.3.6","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A field is not visible on an issue, but it appears after a value is entered. What is the most likely reason?","opts":["The field is placed below the Hide when empty divider.","The issue was deleted and then restored.","The user lost their account.","Jira automatically added a new scheme."],"zh":"某個欄位在 issue 上看不到，填了值之後就出現。最可能的原因？","zo":["欄位放在 Hide when empty 分隔線之下","Issue 被刪除又還原","使用者失去帳號","系統自動新增了 scheme"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"正解。issue layout 的 <strong>Context fields 區有一條「Hide when empty」分隔線</strong>：放在它下方的欄位，<strong>沒有值時會被收進「Show x more fields」摺疊區，一旦填了值就自動升到 Details 區顯示出來</strong>。這個設計讓不常用的欄位平常不佔版面，有資料時又不會被埋起來。所以「同一份 layout 底下不同 issue 的欄位排列不太一樣」是正常的，不是設定錯亂。","B":"刪除又還原不會造成這種「填了值才出現」的行為。","C":"使用者的帳號狀態跟欄位顯示邏輯無關。","D":"Jira <strong>不會自動新增 scheme</strong>，這不是系統會做的事。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-field-layout-in-the-issue-view/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.3.6-002","sec":"620.3.6","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A field is visible when viewing an issue but does not appear when creating an issue. What should be checked first?","opts":["The sprint goal","Whether the Create screen includes the field","The project avatar","The watcher list"],"zh":"欄位在 issue 檢視畫面看得到，但建立 issue 時沒有這個欄位。先查什麼？","zo":["Sprint goal","Create screen 是否包含該欄位","Project avatar","Watcher 名單"],"ans":"B","why":{"B":"正解。<strong>screen scheme 會針對三種 operation（Create、Edit、View）分別指定要用哪一張 screen</strong>，所以完全可能出現「檢視畫面有這個欄位、建立畫面卻沒有」的情況——那代表這個欄位被加進了 View screen，卻沒有加進 Create screen。要修得請 Jira admin 把欄位補到 Create screen 上。這也是「建立時填不到 Original estimate，既有 issue 卻能 Log work」那類問題的成因。","C":"project 的圖示跟欄位毫無關係。","D":"watcher 名單跟欄位顯示無關。","A":"sprint goal 跟欄位顯示毫無關係。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-field-layout-in-the-issue-view/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.3.6-003","sec":"620.3.6","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Is confidential data secure after a field is dragged to the Hidden section of the issue layout?","opts":["Yes, as long as a quick filter is enabled.","Yes, and it is also hidden from all APIs.","No. The issue layout controls only presentation and is not a permission boundary; use issue security or field configuration instead.","Yes, as long as the field is also renamed."],"zh":"把一個機密欄位拖到 layout 的 Hidden 區，資料就安全了嗎？","zo":["只要開 quick filter 就安全","是，所有 API 也會隱藏","否，layout 只是呈現，不是權限邊界；要用 issue security 或 field configuration","是，只要再改個名字"],"ans":"C","why":{"B":"<strong>layout 完全不影響 API 與搜尋</strong>——資料照樣讀得到、JQL 照樣查得到。","C":"正解。這是一個重要的安全觀念：<strong>issue layout 只是「呈現層」，不是權限邊界</strong>。把欄位拖到 Hidden 只是讓它不顯示在這個 project 的 issue 畫面上，<strong>資料完好、JQL 查得到、API 讀得到、報表也算得到</strong>。真的要限制誰能看到機密資料，得用<strong>權限模型</strong>——issue security level（控制整張 issue 的可見度）或 field configuration（在更底層隱藏欄位，連 JQL 都認不得）。","D":"改名字對存取控制毫無作用。","A":"quick filter 只是篩選畫面上顯示哪些卡片，<strong>它完全不是授權機制</strong>。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-field-layout-in-the-issue-view/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.3.6-004","sec":"620.3.6","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"After the issue layout for Task is modified, the Sub-task view changes as well. What is the likely cause?","opts":["All projects always share the same layout","Sub-tasks have no fields","Permissions have stopped working","Both issue types use the same View screen"],"zh":"修改 Task 的 issue layout 後，Sub-task 的畫面也跟著變。可能原因是？","zo":["所有 project 永遠共用 layout","Sub-task 沒有欄位","權限失效","兩個 issue type 使用同一個 View screen"],"ans":"D","why":{"D":"正解。<strong>issue layout 是掛在 screen 上的，不是掛在 issue type 上</strong>——當 Task 與 Sub-task 共用同一個 View screen 時，改動當然會同時反映在兩者身上。所以動手之前要先確認<strong>你正在調整的是哪一張 screen、它涵蓋了哪些 issue type</strong>。真的需要分開，得請 Jira admin 複製一份 screen 與 screen scheme 給其中一種專用。改完之後養成用另一個共用同 screen 的 type 開一張 issue 驗證的習慣。","A":"layout 是 <strong>per project、per screen</strong> 的設定，不會全站永遠共用。","B":"sub-task 當然有欄位，這個敘述本身就錯了。","C":"跟權限毫無關係。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-field-layout-in-the-issue-view/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.3.6-005","sec":"620.3.6","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A user can see the Assignee field but cannot change it. What should be checked first?","opts":["The Assign Issues permission of the user making the change and the Assignable User permission of the target user","The background image","Whether the field is placed on the left side","Whether the user is watching the issue"],"zh":"使用者看得到 Assignee 欄位，卻不能修改它。先查什麼？","zo":["操作者的 Assign Issues 與目標人的 Assignable User","背景圖","欄位是否放在左邊","是否已收藏 issue"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"正解。要分兩個方向查：<strong>操作者本身有沒有 Assign Issues 權限</strong>（沒有的話欄位會是唯讀的），以及<strong>他想指派的那個人有沒有 Assignable User 權限</strong>（沒有的話那個人不會出現在候選清單裡）。這題的核心觀念是：<strong>欄位出現在 layout 上，不代表使用者有權修改它</strong>——layout 決定「顯不顯示」，permission scheme 決定「能不能改」。同一組邏輯也適用於 Reporter（Modify Reporter）與 Due date（Schedule Issues）。","B":"背景圖跟權限毫無關係。","C":"欄位放在畫面的哪個位置<strong>完全不影響權限</strong>。","D":"有沒有收藏（watch）這張 issue 跟能不能編輯無關。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/work-item-permissions/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-field-layout-in-the-issue-view/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.3.6-006","sec":"620.3.6","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A project administrator opens the issue layout but cannot drag any fields, and a message indicates that the screen is used by other projects. What is the cause?","opts":["Project administrators can never change the layout","The screen is shared by multiple projects, and project administrators cannot change the layout of a shared screen","All issues must be closed first","The layout can only be changed in team-managed projects"],"zh":"Project admin 打開 issue layout 卻無法拖動任何欄位，畫面提示 screen 被其他 project 使用。原因是？","zo":["Project admin 永遠不能改 layout","該 screen 被多個 project 共用，project admin 不能改共用 screen 的 layout","需要先把 issue 全部關閉","Layout 只能在 team-managed 改"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"這句話太絕對了——<strong>screen 沒有被共用時，project admin 是可以自由調整 layout 的</strong>。","B":"正解。Jira 為了避免一個 project 的調整波及其他 project，<strong>當 screen 被多個 project 共用時，會把 layout 鎖住，只有 Jira admin 能改</strong>。解法是請 Jira admin <strong>複製一份 screen 與 screen scheme 給這個 project 專用</strong>，脫離共用之後就解鎖了。這個模式在 CMP 反覆出現——<strong>只要物件是共用的，權限就會被拉高到 Jira admin</strong>，workflow 與 field configuration 也是同樣的道理。","C":"issue 的狀態跟能不能改 layout 毫無關係。","D":"CMP 也能改 layout（只要 screen 沒被共用）；TMP 則是連欄位本身都能自己建。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-field-layout-in-the-issue-view/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.3.6-007","sec":"620.3.6","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Which option correctly lists the three sections of the issue layout?","opts":["Create, Edit, View","Left, Right, Bottom","Description fields, Context fields, Hidden fields","Summary, Comments, Attachments"],"zh":"Issue layout 的三個區域，何者正確？","zo":["Create、Edit、View","Left、Right、Bottom","Description fields、Context fields、Hidden fields","Summary、Comments、Attachments"],"ans":"C","why":{"C":"正解。issue layout 分成三個可設定的區域：<strong>Description fields</strong>（左側的多行 rich text 區，放 Description、Environment 等）、<strong>Context fields</strong>（右側，內部又分成永遠顯示的 Details 與空值收合的 More fields）、以及 <strong>Hidden fields</strong>（不顯示，但資料仍在）。另外還有一個 <strong>Pinned fields</strong>，但它是<strong>每位使用者自己的偏好</strong>，不屬於 project 的 layout。","D":"這些是具體的欄位或功能區塊，不是 layout 的區域分類。","A":"Create、Edit、View 是 <strong>screen 的三種 operation</strong>（決定各種操作用哪一張畫面），不是 layout 的區域。","B":"這不是官方的分類方式。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-field-layout-in-the-issue-view/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.3.6-008","sec":"620.3.6","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A project administrator wants to create a new field tab in the issue layout and reorder the fields within the tab. Which statement is correct?","opts":["Tabs are managed by the board administrator","Only team-managed projects have tabs","Project administrators can freely create tabs","Only a Jira administrator can create tabs, and project administrators cannot reorder fields within a tab either"],"zh":"Project admin 想在 issue layout 建立一個新的 field tab 並重排 tab 內欄位。何者正確？","zo":["Tab 由 board admin 管","TMP 才有 tab","Project admin 可以自由建 tab","Tab 只有 Jira admin 能建，且 project admin 也不能在 tab 內重排欄位"],"ans":"D","why":{"C":"這正是本題要澄清的誤解——project admin <strong>不能</strong>建立 tab。","D":"正解。官方明列：<strong>建立與編輯 field tab 是 Jira admin 的權責</strong>（因為 tab 屬於 screen 這個全站物件），而且更容易被忽略的是——<strong>連「在 tab 內重新排列欄位」project admin 也做不到</strong>。project admin 能做的只有在 Description／Context／Hidden 三個區域之間拖曳欄位、移動分隔線。","A":"field tab 跟 board 完全無關，board admin 管的是 board 的設定。","B":"tab 是 <strong>CMP 的 screen 功能</strong>；TMP 沒有 screen 這種物件。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-field-layout-in-the-issue-view/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.3.6-009","sec":"620.3.6","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A project administrator has configured a layout and wants to apply it to other projects. Which statement is correct?","opts":["It can only be copied to projects that use the same screen, and the copies are not kept in sync afterward","Layouts are automatically synchronized across the site","A Jira administrator must rebuild it","Copy to other projects can copy it to any project"],"zh":"Project admin 調好一個 layout，想套到其他 project。何者正確？","zo":["只能複製到使用相同 screen 的 project，且複製後不會同步","Layout 自動全站同步","要請 Jira admin 重做","Copy to other projects 可以複製到任何 project"],"ans":"A","why":{"D":"<strong>受 screen 限制</strong>，不能複製到任何 project——目標 project 必須使用相同的 screen。","A":"正解。官方：可以把 layout 複製到<strong>使用相同 screen 的其他 project</strong>，而且只能一個 screen 一個 screen 地複製；複製是一次性動作，之後兩邊各自獨立。補充：執行複製的人必須是 <strong>Jira admin</strong>（只有 Jira admin 看得到 Copy 按鈕）。","B":"layout <strong>不會自動全站同步</strong>，它是各 project 各自的設定。","C":"錯。不必「重做」，用 Copy 功能就能把 layout 複製過去。但要注意：官方規定 <strong>You must be a Jira admin to copy a work item layout</strong>，只有 Jira admin 看得到 Copy 按鈕，所以 project admin 要請 Jira admin 幫忙複製，而不是重做。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/copy-an-issue-layout-to-other-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.3.6-010","sec":"620.3.6","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Who configures which fields appear in the issue detail view on the right side of a board, and where?","opts":["A Jira administrator, in the permission scheme","A project administrator (Administer Projects), in the Issue detail view of the board settings; the current entry point has moved to the View issue screen under Project settings → Screens","Anyone can configure it for themselves","It can only be controlled with quick filters"],"zh":"Board 右側的 issue detail view 要顯示哪些欄位，由誰在哪裡設定？","zo":["Jira admin 在 permission scheme","Project admin（Administer Projects）在 board settings 的 Issue detail view；現行入口改到 Project settings → Screens 的 View issue screen","任何人都能自行設定","只能用 quick filter 控制"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"permission scheme 決定的是「誰能做什麼」，<strong>不決定畫面上顯示哪些欄位</strong>。","B":"正解。這一項有<strong>新舊兩個版本</strong>要一起記：<strong>考綱時代（2023 V2）它是 board settings 底下的一個分頁</strong>，由 project admin 設定；<strong>現行官方文件則把設定路徑改到 Project settings → Screens →（該 issue type 的 scheme）→ View issue screen</strong>。<strong>兩個版本所需的權限都是 Administer Projects</strong>。考試若問「board 設定裡的 issue detail view 由誰管」，答 project admin／board admin 即可；實務操作時要走現行的 screen 路徑。另外提醒：欄位要先在該 issue type 的 screen 上、而且沒有被 field configuration 隱藏。","C":"一般使用者<strong>只能 pin（釘選）欄位</strong>，那是個人偏好；共用的顯示設定要有管理權限才能改。","D":"quick filter 是篩選卡片的工具，跟詳細面板顯示哪些欄位完全無關。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>作答用考試版：board settings → Issue detail view；現行：Project settings → Screens → View issue screen。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-the-issue-detail-view/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.3.7-001","sec":"620.3.7","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Issue A “blocks” issue B. Does this necessarily prevent B from being started?","opts":["No. A link only describes a relationship; enforcing a block requires a separate workflow rule or automation","Only if B has an attachment","Only if both issues have the same assignee","Yes. Every link acts as a workflow validator"],"zh":"Issue A「blocks」issue B。這是否一定禁止 B 開始？","zo":["否，link 只是關聯；要強制阻擋需另外用 workflow 規則或 automation","只要 B 有附件就禁止","必須同一個 assignee 才會禁止","是，任何 link 都是 workflow validator"],"ans":"A","why":{"D":"<strong>link 不會自動變成任何 workflow 元件</strong>，兩者是完全獨立的機制。","A":"正解。<strong>issue link 純粹是一種「關聯的敘述」，它本身沒有任何強制力</strong>——Jira 不會因為 A blocks B 就阻止 B 被開始或完成。要真的擋住，得另外設定：CMP 用 <strong>workflow 的 condition 或 validator</strong>，或是用 <strong>automation</strong> 在條件不符時把 issue 轉回去。這是實務上常見的誤解，團隊以為建了連結就有約束力，結果流程照樣被跳過。","B":"附件跟 link 的行為毫無關係。","C":"assignee 是不是同一個人不影響 link 的行為。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/link-an-issue/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.3.7-002","sec":"620.3.7","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A user has the Edit Issues permission but cannot log work. Which two things should be checked first?","opts":["Change only the Description","The Work On Issues permission, and whether the Time Tracking field is on the screen","Rename the component","Clone the issue ten times"],"zh":"使用者能 Edit Issues 卻不能 Log work。先查哪兩件事？","zo":["只改 Description","Work On Issues 權限，以及 Time Tracking 欄位是否在 screen 上","改 component 名稱","複製 issue 十次"],"ans":"B","why":{"B":"正解。要查的是兩個不同層次：<strong>① 權限——記錄工時需要獨立的 Work On Issues 權限</strong>（它歸在 permission scheme 的 Time tracking 群組，<strong>Edit Issues 不涵蓋它</strong>）；<strong>② 欄位——Time Tracking 欄位要真的在該 issue type 的 screen 上</strong>，欄位不在畫面上就沒有入口。順帶一提還有第三種可能：目前的 status 被設了 <code>jira.permission.work.denied</code> 這個 workflow property。","C":"component 名稱跟工時毫無關係。","D":"複製 issue 不會解決任何權限或欄位問題。","A":"改 Description 跟記工時毫無關係。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/time-tracking-permissions/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-time-tracking/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.3.7-003","sec":"620.3.7","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An issue has an Original estimate of 8h, and 3h has been logged. Can the Remaining estimate be 7h?","opts":["That means 10h has already been spent","No. Remaining always equals Original minus Time spent","Yes. Remaining is the current re-estimate of the work left and can be adjusted independently","Only if the estimate is changed to Story points"],"zh":"Original estimate 8h，已記錄 3h，Remaining estimate 能是 7h 嗎？","zo":["代表已經花了 10h","不可能，Remaining 永遠等於 Original 減 Time spent","可以，Remaining 是目前重新估算的剩餘量，可獨立調整","只有改成 Story points 才行"],"ans":"C","why":{"B":"這個公式是錯的。<strong>Remaining estimate 是可以手動調整的獨立欄位</strong>，它代表「以現在的認知，還要花多久」，不是「原估減已花」的算術結果。","C":"正解。<strong>Remaining estimate 是目前重新評估的剩餘量，可以獨立填寫</strong>。所以 3h（已花）＋ 7h（剩餘）＝ <strong>目前預估總投入 10h</strong>，比原估的 8h 多了 2h——這正是它要傳達的資訊：這張工作被低估了。實務上要提醒團隊：<strong>不要為了讓數字好看，硬把 Remaining 填成 5h 來湊平原估</strong>，那會讓 burndown 失去預警價值。","D":"跟估算單位無關，story points 與 time tracking 是兩套並行的資料。","A":"已花的時間仍然是 <strong>3h</strong>，這個數字不會因為 Remaining 填多少而改變。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-time-tracking/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.3.7-004","sec":"620.3.7","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A user adds a Confluence page link to an issue and shares the issue with a colleague. Can the colleague read that Confluence page?","opts":["Yes, as long as the colleague is added as a watcher","Yes, as long as the link is blue","Yes, because permissions are consistent across Atlassian products","No. Access to Confluence is checked separately"],"zh":"在 issue 上加了 Confluence 頁面連結並分享 issue 給同事，同事就能讀那個 Confluence 頁面嗎？","zo":["只要加他為 watcher 就會","只要連結是藍色就會","會，Atlassian 產品權限一致","不會，Confluence 的存取要各自檢查"],"ans":"D","why":{"C":"這是很常見的誤解。<strong>Jira 與 Confluence 是兩個獨立的產品，各自有自己的權限體系</strong>，在 Jira 有權限不代表在 Confluence 也有。","D":"正解。<strong>不論是 Confluence page link、web link 還是 smart link，它們都只是「連結」</strong>——能不能打開那個頁面，完全由 <strong>Confluence 自己的空間與頁面權限</strong>決定。所以分享 issue 給同事之後，還要另外確認他有沒有那個 Confluence 頁面的存取權。這也是跨產品協作時最常被忽略的一環。","A":"watcher 只是<strong>接收通知</strong>的名單，完全不授予任何存取權——這一點在 Jira 內部也一樣（沒有 Browse 權限的 watcher 收到通知也打不開 issue）。","B":"連結的顏色跟權限毫無關係。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/link-an-issue/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.3.7-005","sec":"620.3.7","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"After Bitbucket is connected, how can developers associate commits with an issue?","opts":["Include the issue key in the commit message or branch name","Write only “done”","Change the Jira avatar to the repository image","Every issue requires a Jira administrator to be visible"],"zh":"連接 Bitbucket 後，開發者要怎麼讓 commit 關聯到 issue？","zo":["在 commit message 或 branch 名稱放 issue key","只寫「done」","把 Jira avatar 改成 repo 圖","每張 issue 都要 Jira admin 才看得到"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"正解。<strong>issue key 就是 Jira 與 Bitbucket 之間唯一的膠水</strong>：把 key 放進 <strong>commit message、branch 名稱或 PR 標題</strong>，Jira 就能自動把這些開發資訊關聯到對應的 issue 上。格式要求是<strong>全大寫</strong>（兩個以上大寫字母＋連字號＋數字，例如 <code>MOB-12</code>），寫成小寫完全不會被辨識。","B":"只寫「done」<strong>沒有任何可辨識的資訊</strong>，Jira 無從知道這筆 commit 屬於哪張 issue。","C":"avatar 是純視覺設定，跟關聯機制毫無關係。","D":"看開發面板需要的是 <strong>View Development Tools</strong> 這個 project 權限，<strong>不需要 Jira admin</strong>。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/use-jira-cloud-with-bitbucket/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.3.7-006","sec":"620.3.7","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A user has the Work On Issues permission, and the Time Tracking field is on the screen, but the user still cannot log work while the issue is in the Closed status. What is a third possible cause?","opts":["The issue has no Fix Version","The Closed status in the workflow has the <code>jira.permission.work.denied</code> property set","The user does not have the Browse Projects permission","The attachment is too large"],"zh":"使用者有 Work On Issues，時間追蹤欄位也在 screen 上，但在「Closed」狀態時仍無法記工時。第三種可能原因是？","zo":["Issue 沒有 Fix Version","Closed 狀態的 workflow status 設了 jira.permission.work.denied 屬性","他沒有 Browse Projects","附件太大"],"ans":"B","why":{"B":"正解。這是 permission scheme <strong>之外</strong>的第三種限制：<strong>workflow 可以在特定的 status 上設定 <code>jira.permission.work.denied</code> 這個 property（值留空即代表全面禁止），讓該狀態不能記錄工時</strong>。官方文件提到它常被加在 Epic 的狀態上（避免有人把工時記在容器層）。同系列的還有 <code>jira.permission.edit.denied</code>、<code>jira.permission.comment.denied</code>、<code>jira.permission.attach.denied</code>。這些只有 <strong>Jira admin</strong> 能設定，而且不會出現在 permission scheme 裡，排查時很容易漏掉。","C":"如果沒有 Browse Projects，他連這張 issue 都打不開，不會走到「想記工時卻失敗」這一步。","D":"附件大小跟記工時無關。","A":"Fix Version 跟能不能記工時毫無關係。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/use-workflow-properties/"],"lvl":3,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.3.7-007","sec":"620.3.7","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A Jira administrator creates a custom link type named “Problem/Incident” with the outward description “causes” and the inward description “is caused by.” On issue A, a user selects “causes” and links it to issue B. What is displayed on B?","opts":["relates to A","causes A","is caused by A","Problem/Incident A"],"zh":"Jira admin 建立自訂 link type「Problem/Incident」，outward 描述「causes」、inward 描述「is caused by」。在 issue A 上選「causes」連到 B，B 上會顯示什麼？","zo":["relates to A","causes A","is caused by A","Problem/Incident A"],"ans":"C","why":{"B":"「causes」是 <strong>outward 描述</strong>，它顯示在<strong>發起連結的那一端</strong>（也就是 A 上面）。","C":"正解。每一種 link type 由三個字串組成：<strong>type 名稱（Problem/Incident）、outward 描述（causes）、inward 描述（is caused by）</strong>。你只建立了<strong>一條</strong>連結，Jira 在兩端各用適合的方向敘述來呈現它——<strong>A 上顯示「causes B」，B 上顯示「is caused by A」</strong>。理解這一點也才看得懂為什麼自訂 link type 要同時填兩個描述。","D":"type 的<strong>名稱</strong>只是管理介面上的分類標籤，<strong>不會顯示在 issue 上</strong>；issue 上顯示的是 outward／inward 描述。","A":"「relates to」是內建的 <strong>Relates</strong> link type 的描述，跟自訂的 Problem/Incident 無關。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-issue-linking/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.3.7-008","sec":"620.3.7","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A user cannot upload a 30 MB file to an issue. What is the most likely cause?","opts":["The user does not have the Browse Projects permission","Attachments are only available in team-managed projects","Attachments in Jira Cloud can never exceed 10 MB","A Jira administrator set a lower per-file limit in Configure file attachments (the current default is 1 GB, and the maximum is 2 GB)"],"zh":"使用者無法上傳 30 MB 的檔案到 issue。最可能的原因？","zo":["使用者沒有 Browse Projects","附件功能只在 TMP 可用","Jira Cloud 附件一律不能超過 10 MB","Jira admin 在 Configure file attachments 把單檔上限設得較低（現行預設 1 GB、最大 2 GB）"],"ans":"D","why":{"C":"<strong>10 MB 是舊版文件的敘述</strong>，現行以管理頁為權威來源。","D":"正解。<strong>單檔大小上限由 Jira admin 在 ⚙ → System → Attachments（Configure file attachments）設定，現行預設是 1 GB、最大可設到 2 GB</strong>，但管理員可能刻意把它調低。要提醒的是這裡其實有<strong>兩層不同的限制</strong>：一層是單檔大小，另一層是<strong>整個站台的儲存容量</strong>（Free 每個 app 2 GB、Standard 250 GB、Premium 無上限），後者連 Jira admin 也調不了。另外也要確認使用者有 <strong>Create Attachments</strong> 權限。","A":"如果沒有 Browse Projects，他連這張 issue 都打不開，不會走到上傳這一步。","B":"<strong>CMP 與 TMP 都有附件功能</strong>，這個敘述不正確。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>現行預設 1 GB／最大 2 GB；舊使用者頁曾寫 10 MB。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-file-attachments/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.3.7-009","sec":"620.3.7","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"The smart commit <code>MOB-12 #time 2h #comment Fixed login #done</code> did not take effect. Which of the following is NOT a common cause?","opts":["The issue key uses uppercase letters","The commit author's email address does not map to exactly one Jira user","The user lacks a required project permission (for example, Work On Issues)","The “done” transition has a required field"],"zh":"Smart commit「MOB-12 #time 2h #comment 修好登入 #done」沒有生效。以下哪一項不是常見原因？","zo":["Issue key 用了大寫字母","Commit 作者的 email 沒有對應到剛好一個 Jira 使用者","該使用者缺少 project 權限（例如 Work On Issues）","「done」transition 有必填欄位"],"ans":"A","why":{"B":"這<strong>是</strong>官方列出的第一個原因：<strong>commit 的作者 email 必須對應到「剛好一個」Jira 使用者</strong>，對不到人或對到多個帳號，smart commit 一律不執行。","C":"這<strong>是</strong>原因之一。smart commit 是「以那個使用者的身分」執行的，<strong>權限不會因為走 commit 這條路而放寬</strong>——要記工時就得有 Work On Issues，要轉狀態就得有 Transition Issues。","D":"這<strong>是</strong>官方列出的原因：<strong>transition 若有必填欄位（或 validator），smart commit 無法完成它</strong>，因為 commit message 裡沒辦法提供那些欄位的值。","A":"正解（本題問的是「<strong>不是</strong>常見原因」的那一項）。<strong>issue key 本來就必須全大寫</strong>——用大寫是正確的寫法，當然不會是失效的原因。反過來說，<strong>寫成小寫（mob-12）才會失效</strong>。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/process-issues-with-smart-commits/"],"lvl":3,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.3.7-010","sec":"620.3.7","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"In a permission scheme, what is the purpose of Edit All Worklogs?","opts":["It allows users to add worklogs","It allows users to edit anyone's existing worklogs; adding worklogs still requires Work On Issues","It allows users to delete issues","It allows users to view the development panel"],"zh":"在 permission scheme 裡，Edit All Worklogs 的用途是？","zo":["允許新增工時紀錄","允許修改任何人既有的工時紀錄；新增工時仍靠 Work On Issues","允許刪除 issue","允許看開發面板"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"<strong>新增工時紀錄靠的是 Work On Issues</strong>，這是最常見的混淆。","B":"正解。工時相關的權限要分成三類記：<strong>新增（Add）＝ Work On Issues；修改別人既有的紀錄 ＝ Edit All Worklogs；刪除別人的紀錄 ＝ Delete All Worklogs</strong>（另有對應的 Own 版本只管自己的）。所以<strong>擁有「All」的權限不代表就能新增工時</strong>——會出現「改得了別人的舊紀錄，自己卻加不了新的」這種狀況。排錯時先問清楚：<strong>是誰的紀錄、要做的是新增、修改還是刪除</strong>，再去對權限。","C":"刪除 issue 是 Delete Issues 權限，跟工時無關。","D":"看開發面板是 View Development Tools，跟工時無關。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/time-tracking-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.3.7-011","sec":"620.3.7","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A user wants to see the Development panel (branches, pull requests, builds) on an issue. What is required?","opts":["The user must be a Jira administrator","The user must be the assignee of the issue","The site must be connected to development tools, and the user must have the View Development Tools permission","The Browse Projects permission alone is sufficient"],"zh":"使用者想看 issue 的 Development 面板（branch、PR、build）。需要什麼？","zo":["必須是 Jira admin","必須是 issue 的 assignee","站台已連接開發工具，且他有 View Development Tools 權限","只要有 Browse Projects"],"ans":"C","why":{"C":"正解。<strong>兩個條件缺一不可</strong>：<strong>① 站台已經連接了開發工具</strong>（Bitbucket、GitHub、GitLab、Jenkins 等，沒連接就沒有資料來源）；<strong>② 這位使用者擁有 View Development Tools 這個 project 權限</strong>（缺了它整個面板都不會顯示，不是只有部分資料看不到）。這也是「同事看不到 release warnings、我卻看得到」最常見的原因。","D":"Browse Projects 只讓他看得到 issue 本體，<strong>開發資訊需要額外的權限</strong>。","A":"<strong>不需要 Jira admin</strong>，這是一個一般的 project 權限。","B":"跟他是不是 assignee 完全無關。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/use-jira-cloud-with-bitbucket/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/space-access-and-configuration-permissions/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.3.7-012","sec":"620.3.7","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A manager who is not a member of the project needs to receive update notifications for a specific issue. What is the most direct approach?","opts":["Set the manager as the reporter","Move the issue to the manager's project","Change the priority of the issue","Add the manager as a watcher (requires the Manage Watchers permission)"],"zh":"要讓非 project 成員的主管收到某張 issue 的更新通知，最直接的做法？","zo":["把他設為 reporter","把 issue 搬到他的 project","改 issue 的 priority","把他加為 watcher（需 Manage Watchers 權限）"],"ans":"D","why":{"D":"正解。<strong>把他加為 watcher</strong> 就會收到這張 issue 的更新通知；替別人加 watcher 需要 <strong>Manage Watchers</strong> 權限（替自己按 Watch 則人人都可以）。但有一個關鍵前提常被忽略：<strong>這位主管本身必須有該 project 的 Browse Projects 權限、並且通過 issue security level 的檢查</strong>——官方明訂通知只會寄給看得到那張 issue 的人，<strong>加了 watcher 也不會授予任何存取權</strong>。所以如果他根本沒有權限，正確做法是先解決權限，而不是硬加 watcher。","A":"把人設成 reporter 會<strong>竄改 issue 的語意</strong>（reporter 代表「誰提報的」），為了通知而改這個欄位是錯誤的做法。","B":"搬移 issue 是嚴重的過度反應，會改變 issue key 與所屬設定。","C":"priority 跟通知對象毫無關係。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/watch-share-and-comment-on-an-issue/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/voters-watchers-comment-and-attachment-permissions/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-notification-schemes/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.3.1-014","sec":"620.3.1","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A user who has the Administer Jira global permission is not a member of a team-managed project and wants to add themselves to that project. What is the result?","opts":["They can. Administer Jira covers every operation in all projects","They cannot. An administrator of that project or an organization admin must add them","They cannot, because no one can add themselves to a project","They can, as long as they are also a user access admin"],"zh":"一位擁有 Administer Jira 全域權限的管理員，不是某個 team-managed space 的成員。他想把自己加進那個 space。結果是？","zo":["可以，Administer Jira 涵蓋所有 project 的一切操作","不行；要由該 space 的 admin 或 org admin 把他加進去","不行，任何人都不能把自己加進 space","可以，只要他同時具備 user access admin"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"這是最常見的誤解。官方對 Jira admin 的保證只有兩句，<strong>兩句都只講「看得到」與「進得去設定」</strong>：<em>always have access to your space's <strong>settings</strong></em>、以及 Private space 時 <em>only Jira admins and people you add to the space can <strong>see it</strong></em>。<strong>沒有一句賦予他該 space 的 Administrator role。</strong>他的權限範圍確實比一般人以為的寬（改得動 project 設定、加得了別人），但不是「一切操作」。","B":"正解。實機驗證（2026-09-09）：他<strong>加不了自己</strong>，要由該 space 的 admin 或 org admin 出手。官方在 Add people 那頁把所需身分寫死成 <strong>Role: Administrator</strong>——那是<strong>該 space 內的角色</strong>，屬於 project 層，<strong>Administer Jira 這個產品層的全域權限不會自動換來它</strong>。<strong>但要注意一個很細的差別：同一位 Jira admin 加得了「別人」進那個 space，只是加不了「自己」。</strong>官方沒有解釋這個差別，合理推測是防止管理員自我提權，但未經證實。","C":"說得太絕對。<strong>該 space 的 admin 與 org admin 都可以把人（含這位 Jira admin）加進去</strong>，這位 Jira admin 自己也加得了別人——不能自己加自己的，只有他本人這個對象。","D":"<strong>user access admin 完全不碰 project 內部</strong>——它管的是組織層的產品存取（誰能使用 Jira、席次、群組）。多這個身分一點幫助也沒有。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>實機驗證 2026-09-09：Jira admin 不在該 space 時，<strong>加得了別人、加不了自己</strong>。官方文件只寫 Add people 需要 <em>Role: Administrator</em>，未描述這個差別；考試作答以官方原句為準。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/add-people-to-team-managed-projects/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/manage-how-people-access-your-team-managed-project/"],"lvl":3,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.3.1-015","sec":"620.3.1","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A project administrator wants to add a new company employee to their project, but cannot find the person in the Add people search box. Whom should the project administrator contact?","opts":["A Jira administrator, because Administer Jira covers user management","A board administrator, who can add users in the board settings","An administrator with user management rights: an organization admin, a user access admin, or a site admin (in the original user management model)","No one. The project administrator can enter the person's email address directly to add them to the project"],"zh":"Project admin 要新增一位公司新同事到自己的 project，但在 Add people 搜尋框裡找不到這個人。他應該去找誰？","zo":["Jira admin，因為 Administer Jira 涵蓋使用者管理","board admin，由他在 board settings 新增使用者","有使用者管理權的管理員：org admin、user access admin，或舊制的 site admin","不用找人，直接輸入對方的 email 就能把他加進 project"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"這是很常被口語帶過、但嚴格說錯誤的一項。官方明講 <em>An app admin can manage settings for a specific app. <strong>They can't access Atlassian Administration.</strong></em>——而<strong>邀請使用者是在 admin.atlassian.com 做的</strong>，Jira admin 進不去那裡。實務上大家會說「找 Jira admin」，是因為這些身分常由同一人兼任。","B":"board admin 管的是 board 的設定（columns、swimlanes、quick filters），<strong>跟站台的使用者管理毫無關係</strong>。","C":"正解。<strong>把人邀請進 Atlassian 站台屬於組織層的使用者管理</strong>，要 <strong>org admin</strong>、<strong>user access admin</strong>（它的職責官方定義就是 managing access to the app they administer），或舊制的 <strong>site admin</strong>。對方在站台上有帳號之後，project admin 才搜尋得到並加進 project。若是外部廠商或客戶，請他們邀請成 <strong>guest</strong>——只能存取指定的那一個 project，也不佔正式授權席次。","D":"做不到。<strong>Add people 的搜尋框只找得到「已經在這個站台上有帳號」的人</strong>，不能直接用 email 把外面的人拉進來。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/user-management/docs/give-users-admin-permissions/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/add-people-to-team-managed-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.4.1-001","sec":"620.4.1","dom":"620.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A team wants to receive an email every Monday that lists unfinished work, without modifying any data. What is the simplest approach?","opts":["Create a filter subscription for a saved filter","Use Bulk Move to move the issues to a reporting project","Use the Delete issue action in automation","Manually export a CSV file every week"],"zh":"團隊希望每週一收到一封「未完成工作清單」的 email，但不需要修改任何資料。最省事的做法？","zo":["為 saved filter 設定 filter subscription","用 Bulk Move 把 issue 搬到報表 project","用 automation 的 Delete issue action","每週手動匯出 CSV"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"正解。<strong>filter subscription 依排程把查詢結果寄成 email，而且完全不會修改任何資料</strong>，正好對應題目的兩個條件。做法是先把查詢存成 saved filter，再到 Filter → Details → New subscription 設定收件人與排程（每日／每週／每月或 cron）。附帶一個好處：<strong>信件內容是以「收件人自己的權限」執行 filter 的</strong>，不會意外把他無權查看的 issue 寄出去。","B":"Bulk Move 會實際<strong>搬動 issue 到另一個 project</strong>，是重大的資料變更，完全不符合「不需要修改任何資料」的要求。","C":"刪除資料跟需求完全相反。","D":"手動匯出 CSV 確實做得到，但<strong>那不是自動化</strong>——每週都要有人記得做，正是這個需求想避免的事。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/save-your-search-as-a-filter/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.4.1-002","sec":"620.4.1","dom":"620.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A user has been granted the Make bulk changes global permission. Can the user now bulk edit any issue on the site?","opts":["Yes. A global permission applies to all projects","No. Each issue still requires the corresponding permission in its project (for example, Edit Issues)","Yes, as long as the user knows the issue key","No. The Administer Jira permission is also required"],"zh":"使用者已獲得 Make bulk changes 全域權限，就能批次編輯站台上任何 issue 嗎？","zo":["可以，全域權限涵蓋所有 project","不行，每張 issue 仍需該 project 對應的權限（例如 Edit Issues）","可以，只要知道 issue key","不行，還需要 Administer Jira"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"<strong>全域權限只開啟「批次操作」這個入口</strong>，它不會讓你獲得任何 project 的資料操作權。","B":"正解。官方明訂 bulk change 需要<strong>兩層權限</strong>：全域的 <strong>Make bulk changes</strong>（決定選單出不出現），加上<strong>每一個受影響 project 中對應該操作的權限</strong>——bulk edit 要 Edit Issues、bulk move 要 Move Issues（外加目的地的 Create Issues）、bulk transition 要 Transition Issues、bulk delete 要 Delete Issues。跨 project 批次時<strong>每一個 project 都要有</strong>，缺一個那批 issue 就會被跳過。","C":"知道 issue key 只代表找得到它，<strong>跟有沒有權限完全是兩回事</strong>。","D":"<strong>Administer Jira 不是 bulk change 的條件</strong>，一般使用者拿到兩層權限就能執行。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/edit-multiple-issues-at-the-same-time/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/manage-global-permissions/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.4.1-003","sec":"620.4.1","dom":"620.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"The Resolution field is not available on the Bulk Edit screen. How can Resolution be set for multiple issues at once?","opts":["Change the Summary to Fixed","Ask a Jira administrator to increase the bulk limit","Use Bulk Transition instead, and set Resolution through an appropriate workflow transition","Delete the Resolution field from the field configuration and add it back"],"zh":"在 Bulk Edit 畫面找不到 Resolution 欄位，想批次設定 Resolution 應該怎麼做？","zo":["把 Summary 改成 Fixed","請 Jira admin 加大 bulk 上限","改用 Bulk Transition，透過合適的 workflow transition 設定 Resolution","把 Resolution 欄位從 field configuration 刪除再加回"],"ans":"C","why":{"C":"正解。<strong>Resolution 不在 bulk edit 可改的欄位清單裡</strong>（這是刻意的設計——Resolution 應該由流程來設定，而不是被人隨手改掉）。正確做法是改用 <strong>Bulk Transition</strong>：挑一個會設定 Resolution 的 transition（透過它的 transition screen 或 post function），讓整批 issue 走過去。順帶記一組對照：<strong>要改 Resolution 走 bulk transition，要換 project 走 bulk move</strong>。","D":"把欄位刪掉再加回來會影響所有既有資料，而且<strong>完全無法解決問題</strong>——Resolution 本來就不能 bulk edit。","A":"Summary 是標題文字，<strong>跟 Resolution 這個結案欄位完全是兩回事</strong>。","B":"1,000 張的上限跟「某個欄位能不能編輯」毫無關係。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/edit-multiple-issues-at-the-same-time/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-advanced-issue-workflows/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.4.1-004","sec":"620.4.1","dom":"620.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Before a status changes, the fields entered by the user must be checked for validity (for example, required fields). Which workflow component should be used?","opts":["Post function","Condition","Filter subscription","Validator"],"zh":"轉換狀態前必須檢查使用者輸入的欄位是否有效（例如必填），該用哪個 workflow 元件？","zo":["Post function","Condition","Filter subscription","Validator"],"ans":"D","why":{"D":"正解。<strong>validator 的執行時機正是「使用者按下 transition、送出表單之後」</strong>，它檢查輸入的欄位是否有效（例如必填有沒有填），不通過就<strong>擋住轉換並顯示錯誤訊息</strong>。三者的分工要一起記：<strong>condition 事前隱藏按鈕、validator 送出時檢查並擋下、post function 成功之後才做事</strong>。考題最愛把 condition 與 validator 互換。","A":"<strong>post function 是在轉換「完成之後」才執行的</strong>，它負責做事（設欄位、發事件），<strong>沒有能力擋下轉換</strong>。","B":"<strong>condition 決定的是「這個轉換按鈕要不要顯示」</strong>，它在使用者動作之前就生效，<strong>但它不檢查使用者輸入的內容</strong>。","C":"filter subscription 是排程寄信的功能，跟 workflow 毫無關係。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-advanced-issue-workflows/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.4.1-005","sec":"620.4.1","dom":"620.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"After a label was added using a bulk change, a fourth issue created the next day does not have the label. Why?","opts":["A bulk change is a one-time operation on the set of issues selected at that moment and does not affect issues created later","The permission must have been revoked","A dashboard gadget must be added for the change to take effect","The Labels field is hidden"],"zh":"用 bulk change 補上 label 後，隔天新建的第四張 issue 沒有這個 label。原因？","zo":["Bulk change 是對「當下選定集合」的一次性操作，不影響之後建立的 issue","一定是權限被撤銷了","必須新增一個 dashboard gadget 才會生效","Label 欄位被隱藏了"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"正解。<strong>bulk change 是對「當下選定的那一批 issue」執行的一次性操作</strong>，它不會留下任何規則，當然也不會影響之後新建的 issue。要達成「每次新建都自動加上」的效果，得改用<strong>持續生效的機制</strong>：automation 規則（Issue created → Edit issue 加 label）或 workflow 的 post function。這題要建立的是選型直覺——<strong>一次性的清理用 bulk change，持續性的規則用 automation</strong>。","B":"沒有任何依據支持這個推論，而且權限被撤銷的話會是「無法執行」而不是「新 issue 沒有 label」。","C":"gadget 只負責呈現資料，<strong>不會修改任何 issue</strong>。","D":"如果 Label 欄位被隱藏，當初的 bulk edit 就會失敗了；而且欄位隱藏不會造成「舊的有、新的沒有」這種現象。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/edit-multiple-issues-at-the-same-time/","https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/create-and-edit-jira-automation-rules/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.4.1-006","sec":"620.4.1","dom":"620.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A user wants to create a filter subscription for an entire group (not just for themselves) that periodically emails the query results to the group members. What is required?","opts":["The Make bulk changes global permission","The Manage group filter subscriptions global permission; group members receive only the issues they have permission to view","Being the owner of the filter is sufficient, and recipients see the complete results","The Administer Jira global permission; otherwise, no subscriptions can be created"],"zh":"想為整個群組（而不是只有自己）建立一個 filter subscription，定期把查詢結果寄給組員。需要什麼條件？","zo":["Make bulk changes 全域權限","Manage group filter subscriptions 全域權限；且組員只會收到自己有權看到的 issue","只要是 filter 的擁有者就可以，收件者會看到完整結果","Administer Jira 全域權限，否則無法建立任何訂閱"],"ans":"B","why":{"B":"正解。官方 What are global permissions 明列：<strong>擁有 Manage group filter subscriptions 權限的使用者，才能建立與刪除「群組」的 filter 訂閱</strong>（寄給自己則不需要這一項）。同時要記住另一半：<strong>訂閱不會繞過資料權限</strong>——官方在 Share dashboards and filters 也載明分享對象仍須有檢視權限，所以<strong>每位組員收到的信裡，只會有他自己有權看到的 issue</strong>，內容可能人人不同。","C":"身為 filter 的擁有者，確實可以建立<strong>給自己</strong>的訂閱，但<strong>群組訂閱另外需要 Manage group filter subscriptions</strong>；而且收件者看得到多少，仍受各自的 Browse Projects 與 issue security 限制，不會看到「完整結果」。","D":"<strong>Administer Jira 不是建立訂閱的條件</strong>，群組訂閱有自己專屬的全域權限。","A":"Make bulk changes 管的是批次編輯、搬移與刪除，<strong>跟訂閱毫無關係</strong>。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/what-are-global-permissions-and-what-do-they-do/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/manage-filters/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.4.1-007","sec":"620.4.1","dom":"620.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A workflow shared by company-managed projects needs to set Resolution automatically on the Done transition. What is a reasonable approach?","opts":["Only rename the Done column on the board","Ask everyone to fill in Resolution manually","Work with a Jira administrator to verify the Update Issue Field post function in a test workflow, and publish it after confirming the scope of impact","Remove all essential post functions yourself and then reorder them"],"zh":"Company-managed project 共用的 workflow，Done transition 要自動設定 Resolution。合理做法？","zo":["只把 board 的 Done column 改名","請每個人手動填 Resolution","與 Jira admin 在測試用 workflow 驗證 Update Issue Field post function，確認影響範圍後再發布","自行移除所有必要的 post function 後重新排列"],"ans":"C","why":{"C":"正解。這個做法有三個關鍵點：<strong>① 用 Update Issue Field 這個 post function 在 Done transition 上自動設定 Resolution</strong>（post function 是同步且必然執行的，比 automation 更適合「每次轉換都必須發生」的事）；<strong>② workflow 是全站物件，改一次會影響所有引用它的 project</strong>，所以要先確認影響範圍；<strong>③ 應該先在測試用的 workflow 上驗證，確認無誤再發布</strong>。另外別忘了在 Reopen 的 transition 加一個清除 Resolution 的 post function。","D":"<strong>每個 transition 上的五個系統必要 post function 順序固定、不可刪除也不可重排</strong>——它們負責更新欄位、寫歷史、存資料庫、重建索引、發送事件，順序被破壞會讓 automation 與 app 讀到不完整的資料。","A":"改 board 上 column 的名稱<strong>完全不會設定 Resolution</strong>，那只是顯示文字。","B":"靠每個人記得手動填，正是這個需求想消除的問題——<strong>只要有人忘記，資料就不一致</strong>，而且報表會受影響。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-advanced-issue-workflows/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.4.1-008","sec":"620.4.1","dom":"620.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Which of the following fields CANNOT be modified with Bulk Edit?","opts":["Fix Version","Priority","Labels","Description"],"zh":"下列哪一個欄位「不能」用 Bulk Edit 修改？","zo":["Fix Version","Priority","Labels","Description"],"ans":"D","why":{"B":"<strong>Priority 可以 bulk edit</strong>，這是最常見的批次操作之一。","C":"<strong>Labels 可以 bulk edit</strong>，而且提供「加入」與「取代」兩種模式，記得選對以免洗掉既有標籤。","D":"正解。官方 Edit multiple work items 頁的 <strong>Unavailable operations</strong> 明列不能 bulk edit 的欄位：<strong>Attachments、Summary、Description、Environment、Project、Resolution，以及 time tracking 相關欄位</strong>。其中兩個有替代路徑值得記：<strong>Resolution 走 bulk transition，Project 走 bulk move</strong>。","A":"<strong>Fix Version 可以 bulk edit</strong>，但有條件——這批 issue 必須屬於同一個 project（因為 version 是 project 私有物件）。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/edit-multiple-issues-at-the-same-time/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.4.1-009","sec":"620.4.1","dom":"620.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"What is the maximum number of issues that a single bulk change can process?","opts":["1,000","There is no limit","100","500"],"zh":"Bulk change 一次最多可以處理多少張 issue？","zo":["1,000","沒有上限","100","500"],"ans":"A","why":{"C":"太少了。100 這個數字容易跟 <strong>Lookup issues 的 100 筆上限</strong>混淆——那是 automation 的限制，不是 bulk change。","D":"太少了。500 是<strong>單一 parent 底下 child 的顯示上限</strong>，跟 bulk change 無關。","A":"正解。官方 Edit multiple work items 明訂：<strong>一次 bulk operation 最多處理 1,000 張 issue</strong>（原句是 You can only edit 1000 work items at once），超過就得分批進行。這個數字值得直接記起來，考題常拿它跟其他上限混在一起問。","B":"是有上限的，官方明列一次最多 1,000 張。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/edit-multiple-issues-at-the-same-time/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.4.1-010","sec":"620.4.1","dom":"620.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"By default, how many essential post functions does each workflow transition have? Can they be deleted or reordered?","opts":["3, and they can be deleted","5, and they can be neither deleted nor reordered; other post functions can only be inserted between them","5, and they can be deleted but not reordered","There are no essential post functions"],"zh":"每個 workflow transition 預設有幾個「必要」post function？它們可以刪除或重新排序嗎？","zo":["3 個，可以刪除","5 個，不可刪除也不可重排，只能在其間插入其他 post function","5 個，可以刪除但不可重排","沒有必要的 post function"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"數量與可刪性都錯：是 5 個，而且不可刪除。","B":"正解。官方在 advanced workflows 列出每個 transition 上的<strong>五個必要 post function</strong>：<strong>Set issue status（更新狀態）、Add comment（若有填寫則加入留言）、Update change history（寫入變更歷史）、Re-index（重建索引）、Fire event（發送事件）</strong>。它們<strong>既不可刪除也不可重新排序</strong>，只能在其間的允許位置插入自訂的 post function。這個順序是有道理的——<strong>事件必須在資料真正寫入且索引完成之後才發出</strong>，否則 automation 或 app 收到通知去讀 issue 時，可能讀到還沒更新的舊資料。","C":"數量對了，但<strong>不可刪除</strong>這點寫反了——它們既不能刪也不能重排。","D":"每個 transition 都有這五個，它們是系統運作的基礎。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-advanced-issue-workflows/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.4.1-011","sec":"620.4.1","dom":"620.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A team wants each issue to be assigned to a reviewer automatically every time it transitions to In Review, and wants this to be synchronous, reliable, and unaffected by automation usage limits. What is the most suitable option?","opts":["Bulk change","Filter subscription","A workflow post function (Assign to… / Update Issue Field)","A scheduled automation rule that scans every minute"],"zh":"團隊想在 issue 每次轉到 In Review 時自動指派給 reviewer，並希望「同步、可靠、不受 automation 配額影響」。最適合？","zo":["Bulk change","Filter subscription","Workflow post function（Assign to…／Update Issue Field）","Scheduled automation 每分鐘掃描"],"ans":"C","why":{"C":"正解。題目給的三個條件（<strong>同步、可靠、不受 automation 配額影響</strong>）正好完整描述了 post function 的特性：它是 <strong>transition 動作的一部分，在轉換當下同步執行</strong>，沒有延遲；它<strong>必然執行</strong>，不會因為額度用完或 actor 權限不足而失敗；而且<strong>完全不佔用 automation 的用量</strong>。所以「每次轉換都必須發生、而且要立即生效」的事情，優先考慮 post function。代價是要請 Jira admin 改 workflow，而且共用的 workflow 改動會影響其他 project。","D":"每分鐘排程掃描是最糟的做法：<strong>有延遲（最多慢一分鐘）、大量浪費 automation 配額</strong>，而且掃描期間的中間狀態可能被漏掉。","A":"bulk change 是<strong>人工發動的一次性操作</strong>，不會在每次轉換時自動執行。","B":"filter subscription 只會按排程<strong>寄出清單</strong>，一個欄位都不會改。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-advanced-issue-workflows/","https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/create-and-edit-jira-automation-rules/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.4.1-012","sec":"620.4.1","dom":"620.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"During a bulk change, what is the purpose of clearing the Send mail for this update checkbox?","opts":["To make the operation run faster","To bypass project permissions","To prevent the changes from being recorded in the history","To avoid sending a large number of notifications to watchers and assignees because of the bulk changes"],"zh":"Bulk change 時勾選取消「Send mail for this update」的目的？","zo":["加快執行速度","繞過 project 權限","讓變更不寫入 history","避免批次修改對 watcher 與 assignee 造成大量通知"],"ans":"D","why":{"D":"正解。官方提供這個選項的目的正是<strong>避免通知轟炸</strong>：一次改 200 張 issue，如果每一張都寄信給它的 watcher 與 assignee，收件匣會被灌爆，重要的通知反而被淹沒。這也是 bulk change 相較 automation 的一個優勢——<strong>它讓你明確決定這批變更要不要送通知</strong>。","A":"跟執行速度沒有關係。","B":"<strong>絕對不能繞過權限</strong>——通知與權限是兩件完全獨立的事。","C":"<strong>變更歷史照常記錄</strong>，取消通知不影響 issue 的 History。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/edit-multiple-issues-at-the-same-time/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.4.1-013","sec":"620.4.1","dom":"620.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A set of issues is moved to a team-managed project with Bulk Move. Which statement is correct?","opts":["The destination has no components or versions, so these values are lost; statuses must be mapped to the destination workflow","The Create Issues permission in the destination is not required","Moving issues does not require the Make bulk changes permission","Components and versions are carried over unchanged"],"zh":"把一批 issue 用 Bulk Move 搬到 team-managed project，下列何者正確？","zo":["目的地沒有 components／versions，這些值會遺失；status 需對應到目的地 workflow","不需要目的地的 Create 權限","Move 不需要 Make bulk changes","Components 與 versions 會原樣帶過去"],"ans":"A","why":{"D":"這正是本題的重點——<strong>components 與 versions 不會帶過去，而且是永久移除</strong>。","A":"正解。官方 Edit multiple work items 明文：<strong>從 company-managed 搬到 team-managed 時，issue 的 component 與 version 資訊不會被保留，搬移之後這些資訊會被永久移除</strong>——因為 TMP 根本沒有 components，version 也不是同一個物件。另外還有一個必要的步驟：<strong>兩邊 workflow 不同時，要在搬移精靈裡把來源的 status 一一對應到目的地的 status</strong>，否則 issue 會落在錯誤的狀態。搬移前務必先確認這些資料是否需要另外備份。","B":"<strong>搬移一定需要目的地的 Create Issues 權限</strong>——搬入的本質就是在那裡建立。","C":"批次搬移<strong>仍然需要 Make bulk changes 全域權限，外加來源的 Move Issues 與目的地的 Create Issues</strong>。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/edit-multiple-issues-at-the-same-time/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.4.1-014","sec":"620.4.1","dom":"620.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Which of the following four methods is most suitable for automatically assigning an issue based on its component and sending a Slack notification when the issue is created?","opts":["Workflow post function","Automation rule (Issue created trigger)","Filter subscription","Bulk change"],"zh":"下列四種手段中，哪一個最適合「當 issue 被建立時，依 component 自動指派並發 Slack 通知」？","zo":["Workflow post function","Automation rule（Issue created trigger）","Filter subscription","Bulk change"],"ans":"B","why":{"D":"bulk change 是人工發動的一次性操作，<strong>不會在每次建立 issue 時自動跑</strong>。","A":"post function 綁在 <strong>transition</strong> 上，而「建立 issue」在概念上雖有 Create transition，但這個需求還包含<strong>依 component 判斷</strong>與<strong>發送 Slack 通知</strong>——條件分支與跨系統動作都是 automation 的強項，post function 做起來相當彆扭。","B":"正解。這個需求同時用到 automation 的三個獨門能力：<strong>事件觸發（Issue created）、條件判斷（依 component 分流）、以及跨系統動作（Send Slack message）</strong>。組法是 <code>Issue created</code> → <code>Issue fields condition</code> 判斷 component → <code>Assign issue</code> ＋ <code>Send Slack message</code>。其他三種手段沒有一個能同時滿足這三件事。","C":"filter subscription 只能按排程寄出查詢結果，<strong>不會修改任何 issue，也不能依條件分流</strong>。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/create-and-edit-jira-automation-rules/","https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/jira-automation-actions/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.4.2-001","sec":"620.4.2","dom":"620.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A rule should run only when a new Bug is created. Which trigger should be selected?","opts":["Issue created (with a condition of issue type = Bug)","Scheduled, scanning the entire site every minute","Issue deleted","Issue transitioned"],"zh":"規則需要在「新建 Bug」時才執行，該選哪個 trigger？","zo":["Issue created（搭配 issue type = Bug 的 condition）","Scheduled 每分鐘掃全站","Issue deleted","Issue transitioned"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"正解。<strong>事件驅動的 trigger 最精確也最省資源</strong>：用 <code>Issue created</code> 在 issue 一建立就觸發，再加一個 <code>Issue fields condition</code> 限定 issue type = Bug 即可。要提醒一個官方列出的例外——<strong>CSV 匯入建立的 issue 不會觸發這個 trigger</strong>，大量匯入資料時別指望自動化會跟著跑。","B":"每分鐘排程掃全站有三個問題：<strong>有延遲、大量浪費 automation 配額，而且語意不同</strong>（排程掃的是「目前符合條件的」，不是「剛剛新建的」，同一張 issue 會被重複處理）。","C":"Issue deleted 是刪除事件，跟建立完全相反。","D":"<strong>建立 issue 不是一次 transition</strong>，用 Issue transitioned 抓不到新建事件。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/jira-automation-triggers/","https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/jira-automation-conditions/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.4.2-002","sec":"620.4.2","dom":"620.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"After a Related issues condition passes, will the following Edit issue action automatically modify all sub-tasks?","opts":["Yes","No. A condition only performs a check; modifying sub-tasks requires a branch to switch the target","Only when Priority is changed","Only for rules created by a Jira administrator"],"zh":"Related issues condition 通過後，接著的 Edit issue action 會自動修改所有 sub-task 嗎？","zo":["會","不會，condition 只做檢查；要改 sub-task 需要 branch 切換對象","只有改 Priority 時會","只有 Jira admin 建的 rule 會"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"condition <strong>不會改變 rule 的執行對象</strong>，這是本題要澄清的核心誤解。","B":"正解。要分清楚兩種元件的職責：<strong>condition 只做「檢查」——判斷條件成不成立，決定要不要繼續往下走，它完全不改變 rule 目前作用的對象</strong>；<strong>branch 才是「切換對象」——For sub-tasks 分支會把後續 action 裡的 <code>{{issue}}</code> 逐一切換成每一個 sub-task</strong>。所以想修改 sub-task，一定要開 branch。（順帶一提，Related issues condition 的好處是：只想「檢查」相關 issue 而不想改它們時，不必為此開一個分支。）","C":"欄位的種類完全不影響執行的上下文。","D":"跟 rule 由誰建立毫無關係。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/jira-automation-conditions/","https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/jira-automation-branches/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.4.2-003","sec":"620.4.2","dom":"620.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Inside a For sub-tasks branch, what does <code>{{issue.key}}</code> refer to?","opts":["The number of sub-tasks","The key of the parent issue","The sub-task currently being processed in the iteration","Always the issue that originally triggered the rule"],"zh":"在 For sub-tasks 的 branch 內，{{issue.key}} 代表什麼？","zo":["所有 sub-task 的數量","parent 的 key","目前迭代到的那張 sub-task","永遠是原本觸發的 issue"],"ans":"C","why":{"C":"正解。<strong>在 branch 內部，<code>{{issue}}</code> 指的是「這一輪正在處理的那一張相關 issue」</strong>——因為 branch 會對每個 sub-task 各跑一次後續的 action，每一輪的 <code>{{issue}}</code> 都不同。這正是 branch 的運作方式。要在任何位置都穩定指向觸發 rule 的那一張，請用 <code>{{triggerIssue}}</code>。","D":"這個說法只在 branch <strong>外面</strong>成立；<strong>一旦進入 branch，<code>{{issue}}</code> 就被換掉了</strong>。這是最容易寫錯的一組 smart value。","A":"要取得數量得用 list 的 <code>.size</code>（例如 <code>{{triggerIssue.subtasks.size}}</code>），不是 <code>{{issue.key}}</code>。","B":"要取得 parent 要明確寫 <code>{{issue.parent}}</code>。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/jira-automation-branches/","https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/jira-smart-values-issues/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.4.2-004","sec":"620.4.2","dom":"620.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A rule needs to add a value to the Labels field while keeping the existing labels. How should the Edit issue action be configured?","opts":["Replace the entire Labels field","Clear all labels first, then write the new value","Add a note by using the Comment on issue action","Use the Add option of Add/remove values"],"zh":"想在 Labels 欄位加一個值，同時保留既有 label。Edit issue action 該怎麼設？","zo":["直接替換整個 Labels 欄位","先清空所有 Labels 再寫入","用 Comment action 加註","使用 Add／remove values 的「新增」"],"ans":"D","why":{"D":"正解。官方在 Edit issue fields 說明：<strong>多值欄位（Labels、Components、Fix versions 等）可以透過該欄位的 ••• 選單切換成「Add／remove values」模式，明確指定要新增或移除哪些值，保留原本的集合</strong>。要記住 <strong>Edit issue 對多值欄位的預設行為是「整組取代」</strong>，不改成 add 模式就會覆蓋——而且 issue 歷史雖有紀錄，要一張張還原非常痛苦。","A":"<strong>直接替換會把原本的 label 全部洗掉</strong>，這正是實務上最常造成資料損失的自動化錯誤。","B":"先清空再寫入的效果<strong>等同於替換</strong>，一樣會丟掉原有的 label。","C":"Comment 只是加一則留言，<strong>完全不會修改 Labels 欄位</strong>。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/edit-issue-fields-with-jira-automation/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.4.2-005","sec":"620.4.2","dom":"620.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A rule has a Create issue action followed directly by a Comment on issue action, with no branch. On which issue is the comment added?","opts":["The issue that triggered the rule","A random issue","Both issues","The newly created issue"],"zh":"規則在 Create issue action 之後直接接 Comment on issue（沒有 branch）。留言會加在哪張 issue？","zo":["觸發 rule 的 issue","隨機一張","兩張都會","剛建立的 issue"],"ans":"A","why":{"D":"這是最直覺但錯誤的答案——<strong>建立不等於切換對象</strong>，要切換必須明確用 branch 或 smart value。","A":"正解。<strong>建立新 issue 並不會把 rule 的作用對象切換過去</strong>，主路徑的上下文自始至終都是<strong>觸發 rule 的那一張 issue</strong>，所以留言會加在它身上。要對新建的 issue 動作，有兩種寫法：<strong>加一個 branch 選 For most recently created issue（或 All created issues）</strong>，或是<strong>直接在 action 裡用 smart value <code>{{createdIssue}}</code> 指名它</strong>。","B":"執行對象是確定的，不會隨機。","C":"action 一次<strong>只作用在當前的上下文</strong>，不會兩張都改。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/jira-automation-actions/","https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/jira-automation-branches/","https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/jira-smart-values-issues/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.4.2-006","sec":"620.4.2","dom":"620.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Which action is most suitable for first verifying what a smart value outputs?","opts":["Transition issue","Log action","Send email to the entire company","Delete issue"],"zh":"最適合用來先驗證 smart value 輸出內容的 action？","zo":["Transition issue","Log action","Send email 給全公司","Delete issue"],"ans":"B","why":{"B":"正解。<strong>Log action 會把指定的文字寫進 audit log</strong>，可以安全地觀察 smart value 實際輸出了什麼，<strong>完全不會修改任何資料、也不會發出任何通知</strong>。官方推薦的除錯組合是 <strong>Manual trigger ＋ Log action</strong>：把 trigger 暫時改成手動，在一張測試 issue 上按一下，再去 audit log 讀結果。另一個更省事的技巧是把值包在 <code>{{#debug}}…{{/}}</code> 裡，它會照常參與運算並同時印進 log。","C":"寄信給全公司會造成大量無謂的通知，是非常糟糕的除錯方式。","D":"Delete issue 會破壞資料，絕不能拿來測試。","A":"Transition issue 會實際改變 issue 的狀態，<strong>而且看不到 smart value 的字串輸出</strong>。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/debug-an-automation-rule/","https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/jira-automation-actions/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.4.2-007","sec":"620.4.2","dom":"620.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"In what order does a branch run for multiple related issues?","opts":["In order of creation time","One by one, guaranteed to complete in issue key order","In parallel, with no guaranteed completion order","All branches always finish before the next step in the main path"],"zh":"多筆 related issues 的 branch 執行順序如何？","zo":["依建立時間排序","保證依 issue key 排序逐筆完成","平行執行且不保證完成順序","一定在主路徑下一步前全部結束"],"ans":"C","why":{"B":"官方<strong>沒有</strong>提供依 issue key 排序的保證。","C":"正解。官方在 branches 的說明中明訂：<strong>對多筆 issue 的 branch 是平行執行的，完成順序不保證</strong>。實務上的三個推論要記住：<strong>① 不要在分支之間依賴彼此寫入的結果</strong>（分支 A 改的值，分支 B 不一定讀得到）；<strong>② 不要假設分支一定在主路徑的下一步之前全部結束</strong>；<strong>③ 需要彙總資訊時，把它算在 branch 外面</strong>（例如用 <code>{{triggerIssue.subtasks.size}}</code>）。","D":"branch 與主路徑的完成順序<strong>同樣不保證</strong>，不能假設分支一定先跑完。","A":"官方<strong>沒有</strong>提供依建立時間排序的保證，順序不可依賴。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/jira-automation-branches/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.4.2-008","sec":"620.4.2","dom":"620.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"What is the difference between a rule's Owner and its Actor?","opts":["They are always the same person","The Owner automatically gets all project permissions","The Actor only receives notifications","The Owner maintains the rule and receives error notifications; the Actor is the identity and permissions used when the rule makes changes"],"zh":"Rule 的 Owner 與 Actor 有什麼差別？","zo":["兩者永遠是同一人","Owner 自動取得所有 project 權限","Actor 只負責接收通知","Owner 維護規則並接收錯誤通知；Actor 是執行變更時使用的身分與權限"],"ans":"D","why":{"D":"正解。兩者的分工是：<strong>Owner 是「誰負責維護這條規則」——規則出錯時收 email 的人，而且可以批次轉移</strong>；<strong>Actor 是「rule 執行變更時所使用的身分」——rule 是以 actor 的權限執行的，issue 歷史紀錄上顯示的也是 actor</strong>，而且只能逐條修改。所以 rule 因為權限失敗時，<strong>要檢查的是 actor 的權限，不是 owner 的</strong>。另外記住：project admin 只能把 actor 設成自己或 Automation for Jira。","A":"兩者<strong>可以是不同人</strong>，這正是本題要區分的重點。","B":"<strong>擁有一條規則不等於獲得任何資料授權</strong>——owner 不會因此取得 project 權限。","C":"說反了：接收錯誤通知的是 <strong>owner</strong>，不是 actor。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/what-is-a-rule-actor/","https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/what-are-rule-details-in-atlassian-automation/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.4.2-009","sec":"620.4.2","dom":"620.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Which of the following events fires the Issue updated trigger?","opts":["The Summary is edited","The issue is assigned to someone else","The issue is linked to another issue","Someone logs work"],"zh":"Issue updated trigger 會被下列哪個事件觸發？","zo":["Summary 被編輯","Issue 被指派給別人","Issue 被連結到另一張 issue","有人記錄工時"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"正解。<strong>編輯一般欄位（例如 Summary）確實會觸發 Issue updated</strong>。但更重要的是記住它<strong>不包含</strong>的三種操作，那才是考點。","B":"官方明列 <strong>Issue updated 不包含指派（assign）</strong>——它有專屬的 <code>Issue assigned</code> trigger。這是最常見的踩雷點：用 Issue updated 想抓 assignee 變更，結果永遠不觸發。","C":"官方明列 <strong>Issue updated 不包含建立連結（link）</strong>——它有專屬的 <code>Issue linked</code> trigger。","D":"官方明列 <strong>Issue updated 不包含記錄工時（log work）</strong>——它有專屬的 <code>Work logged</code> trigger。（實務建議：與其用 Issue updated 這種涵蓋範圍模糊的 trigger，不如用 <code>Field value changed</code> 指定要監看的欄位，既精準又省執行次數。）"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/jira-automation-triggers/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.4.2-010","sec":"620.4.2","dom":"620.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A rule needs to assign the issue to the lead if the priority is Highest, and otherwise assign it using Round-robin. Which condition structure should be used?","opts":["Advanced compare condition, which cannot branch","If/else block","Two separate rules, each with a JQL condition","User condition"],"zh":"規則裡需要「若 priority 是 Highest 就指派給 lead，否則指派給 round robin」。用哪個 condition 結構？","zo":["Advanced compare condition 不能分支","If／else block","JQL condition 兩條分開的 rule","User condition"],"ans":"B","why":{"B":"正解。<strong>If／else block 可以在同一條 rule 內做條件分流</strong>：if 分支放「指派給 lead」，else 分支放「round robin」，兩條路徑各自執行不同的 action。它最多支援兩層巢狀。這比拆成兩條 rule 好維護——邏輯集中在一處，日後修改不會漏改其中一條。","C":"拆成兩條 rule 技術上可行，但<strong>要維護兩份幾乎相同的邏輯</strong>，而且兩條的條件必須互斥，否則會重複執行；在同一條 rule 內用 if／else 更清楚。","D":"User condition 判斷的是<strong>使用者</strong>（例如觸發者是不是某個 group 的成員），跟 priority 的值無關。","A":"Advanced compare condition 只能做<strong>判斷</strong>（成立就往下、不成立就停），<strong>沒有分支到兩條不同路徑的能力</strong>。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/jira-automation-conditions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.4.2-011","sec":"620.4.2","dom":"620.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Which smart value returns the key of the issue that triggered the rule, even inside a branch?","opts":["<code>{{parent.key}}</code>","<code>{{issue.key}}</code>","<code>{{triggerIssue.key}}</code>","<code>{{createdIssue.key}}</code>"],"zh":"下列哪個 smart value 可取得「觸發本 rule 的 issue」的 key，即使目前在 branch 內？","zo":["{{parent.key}}","{{issue.key}}","{{triggerIssue.key}}","{{createdIssue.key}}"],"ans":"C","why":{"B":"這是本題的陷阱：<strong>在 branch 內部，<code>{{issue}}</code> 會被換成當前迭代的那張相關 issue</strong>，不再指向觸發的 issue。","C":"正解。<strong><code>{{triggerIssue}}</code> 永遠指向觸發這條 rule 的那一張 issue，不論你身在 branch 內或外</strong>。這是撰寫含 branch 的規則時最重要的一個習慣——<strong>凡是要引用觸發 issue 的地方，一律寫 <code>{{triggerIssue}}</code>，不要賭 <code>{{issue}}</code> 當下指向誰</strong>。","D":"<code>{{createdIssue}}</code> 指的是本次 rule 執行中<strong>最近建立的那張新 issue</strong>，跟觸發的 issue 是兩回事。","A":"<code>{{parent}}</code> 不是有效的頂層 smart value，要取得 parent 得寫 <code>{{issue.parent}}</code>。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/jira-smart-values-issues/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.4.2-012","sec":"620.4.2","dom":"620.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A project administrator wants to create a rule that applies to three projects at the same time. Which statement is correct?","opts":["Anyone can create a global rule","Multi-project rules can only be created by Atlassian Support","The project administrator can create a multi-project rule in Project settings &gt; Automation","Multi-project and global rules must be created by a Jira administrator in Global automation"],"zh":"Project admin 想建一條規則同時作用於三個 project。下列何者正確？","zo":["任何人都能建 global rule","Multi-project rule 只能由 Atlassian 支援建立","Project admin 可在 Project settings → Automation 建 multi-project rule","Multi-project 與 global rule 需要 Jira admin 在 Global automation 建立"],"ans":"D","why":{"C":"<strong>Project settings → Automation 只能建立範圍限於「這一個 project」的規則</strong>，沒有跨 project 的選項。","D":"正解。官方的權限規定是：<strong>單一 project 的 rule 由 project admin 建立</strong>（CMP 需 Administer Projects ＋ Browse Projects，TMP 需 Administrator role）；<strong>multi-project 與 global scope 的 rule 需要 Administer Jira，由 Jira admin 在 ⚙ → System → Global automation 建立</strong>。道理很直接——跨 project 的規則會影響別人的資料，不該由單一 project 的管理者決定。務實做法是把觸發、條件、動作寫清楚後開單給 Jira admin。","A":"不是任何人都能建。<strong>global rule 需要 Administer Jira</strong>。","B":"完全不需要 Atlassian 支援介入，Jira admin 自己就能建。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/permissions-required-for-jira-cloud-automation-rules/","https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/what-are-rule-details-in-atlassian-automation/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.4.2-013","sec":"620.4.2","dom":"620.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A rule uses a Scheduled trigger with JQL to add the label \"overdue\" every day to issues that are past due and not yet done. Which statement is correct?","opts":["A Scheduled trigger can include JQL and run the subsequent actions on each matching issue","A Scheduled trigger can run only once","A Lookup issues action must be added to get the issues","A Scheduled trigger cannot modify issues"],"zh":"Scheduled trigger 搭配 JQL，每天把逾期未完成的 issue 加上 label「overdue」。下列何者正確？","zo":["Scheduled trigger 可帶 JQL，並對每張符合的 issue 執行後續 action","Scheduled trigger 只能執行一次","必須再加 Lookup issues 才能取得 issue","Scheduled trigger 不能修改 issue"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"正解。官方在 triggers 說明：<strong>Scheduled trigger 可以設定 cron 排程並附帶一段 JQL，勾選「對每個結果執行」之後，就會對查詢到的每一張 issue 各跑一次後續的 action</strong>。有兩個實務重點：<strong>① 別忘了勾「對每個結果執行」</strong>（不勾的話 rule 只會整體跑一次）；<strong>② JQL 是以 actor 的權限執行的</strong>，actor 看不到的 issue 不會被處理。另外提醒 <strong>Scheduled rule 連續失敗 10 次會被自動停用</strong>。","B":"Scheduled trigger 就是為了<strong>重複執行</strong>而設計的，可以設定間隔或 cron 運算式。","C":"<strong>Scheduled 的 JQL 本身就提供了 issue 上下文</strong>，不需要再加 Lookup issues；後者是用來<strong>額外查一批 issue 做彙總</strong>的（而且最多只取 100 筆）。","D":"當然可以修改 issue，這正是它最常見的用途。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/jira-automation-triggers/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.4.2-014","sec":"620.4.2","dom":"620.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A rule needs to update the Due date of the parent epic after an issue is completed. What should be used?","opts":["JQL condition","A For parent branch followed by an Edit issue action","A For sub-tasks branch","An Edit issue action directly, with the field set to <code>{{issue.parent.duedate}}</code>"],"zh":"rule 想在 issue 完成後，把 parent epic 的 Due date 更新。該用什麼？","zo":["JQL condition","For parent branch，接 Edit issue","For sub-tasks branch","直接 Edit issue，欄位寫 {{issue.parent.duedate}}"],"ans":"B","why":{"B":"正解。官方在 branches 說明：<strong>For parent（或 For epic）分支會把後續 action 的上下文切換到 parent 身上</strong>，所以要在分支<strong>內部</strong>接一個 Edit issue，才會改到 epic 的 Due date。這也提醒一個對照——如果 Edit issue 被放在 branch <strong>外面</strong>，改到的會是觸發的那張 issue。","C":"For sub-tasks 的方向剛好相反，它是往下走到子項目。","D":"主路徑上的 Edit issue <strong>只會修改觸發的 issue 本身</strong>；在欄位裡寫 <code>{{issue.parent.duedate}}</code> 只是「讀取」parent 的值，並不會把修改寫到 parent 身上——<strong>讀取與寫入的對象是兩回事</strong>。","A":"condition 只做檢查，<strong>不會改變 rule 作用的對象</strong>。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/jira-automation-branches/","https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/edit-issue-fields-with-jira-automation/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.4.3-001","sec":"620.4.3","dom":"620.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"When you click Validate to check the JQL query yourself, it returns results, but when the rule runs, no issues match. What is the most likely cause?","opts":["Validate uses your permissions, but the rule runs with the Actor's permissions, and the Actor cannot see those issues","JQL cannot be used in automation","The dashboard is not shared","The rule has no Owner"],"zh":"你自己 Validate JQL 有結果，但 rule 執行時卻沒有任何 issue 符合。最可能的原因？","zo":["Validate 用你的權限，執行時用 Actor 的權限，Actor 看不到那些 issue","JQL 不能用在 automation","Dashboard 沒有分享","Rule 沒有 Owner"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"正解。這是 automation 排查中最容易忽略的一組差異：<strong>你在編輯畫面按 Validate 是用「你自己的權限」執行的，但 rule 實際跑起來是用「actor 的權限」</strong>。如果 actor（預設是 Automation for Jira）缺少那些 project 的 <strong>Browse Projects</strong> 權限，同一段 JQL 就查不到任何 issue——而且不會報錯，只會顯示沒有符合的結果。要檢查 <code>atlassian-addons-project-access</code> 這個 role 在該 project 有沒有足夠權限。同樣的邏輯也適用於 JQL condition 與 Lookup issues。","B":"JQL <strong>可以</strong>用在 automation（Scheduled trigger、JQL condition、Lookup issues、JQL branch 都用得到）。","C":"dashboard 的分享跟 automation 執行毫無關係。","D":"owner 只影響「出錯時誰收信」，<strong>不影響執行結果</strong>。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/what-is-a-rule-actor/","https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/permissions-required-for-jira-cloud-automation-rules/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.4.3-002","sec":"620.4.3","dom":"620.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"You expected a rule to run, but the audit log has no entries at all. What should you check first?","opts":["Change the Actor to yourself","Whether the rule is enabled, whether the trigger event matches, and whether the rule's scope includes the project","Edit every field once","Delete the rule and re-create it"],"zh":"期待 rule 有執行，但 audit log 完全沒有紀錄。先查什麼？","zo":["把 Actor 換成自己","Rule 是否 Enabled、trigger 事件是否符合、scope 是否涵蓋該 project","先把所有欄位改一遍","刪掉 rule 重建"],"ans":"B","why":{"B":"正解。<strong>audit log 完全沒有紀錄，代表 rule 根本沒有被觸發</strong>——這是排查的第一個分岔點，跟「跑了但失敗」要走完全不同的方向。官方 debug 頁建議依序確認三件事：<strong>① rule 是不是 Enabled</strong>（也可能是 Scheduled rule 連續失敗 10 次被自動停用）；<strong>② trigger 選對了嗎</strong>（最典型的是用 Issue updated 想抓指派變更，但它不含 assign／link／log work）；<strong>③ scope 有沒有涵蓋這個 project</strong>。另外還要看變更是不是由另一條 rule 造成的（那需要開 Allow rule trigger）。","C":"亂改欄位不會定位問題，還可能造成資料混亂。","D":"刪掉重建會失去所有設定，而且<strong>如果原因是 trigger 選錯，重建一次還是一樣不會跑</strong>。","A":"換 actor 是「有紀錄但失敗」時才要做的事；<strong>現在連紀錄都沒有，代表根本沒觸發，換 actor 沒有意義</strong>。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/debug-an-automation-rule/","https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/what-is-the-automation-audit-log/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.4.3-003","sec":"620.4.3","dom":"620.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"The audit log shows \"NO ACTIONS PERFORMED\". What does this mean?","opts":["All conditions should be removed immediately","The Actor does not have permission","The rule was triggered, but a condition was not met, so no actions were performed; this may be a correct exclusion","A system failure occurred"],"zh":"Audit log 顯示「NO ACTIONS PERFORMED」，代表什麼？","zo":["應立即移除所有 condition","Actor 沒有權限","Rule 被觸發但 condition 不符，所以沒有執行 action；可能是正確的排除","系統故障"],"ans":"C","why":{"C":"正解。<strong>NO_ACTIONS_PERFORMED 是官方列出的正常執行狀態之一</strong>（官方定義：這個步驟有執行，但沒有造成任何變更），代表 <strong>rule 確實被觸發、也正常跑完，只是某個 condition 判定不符，所以後面的 action 全部跳過</strong>。它<strong>不是錯誤</strong>。看到這個狀態要做的是對照需求判斷：這是不是我原本就想排除的情況？如果不是，再去檢查 condition 的邏輯（若用的是 JQL condition，記得它以 actor 權限執行）。","D":"完全不是故障，這是設計中的正常狀態。","A":"這是危險的做法——<strong>condition 存在是有理由的，移除它可能讓不該被修改的 issue 全部被改到</strong>。要先確認這個排除是不是預期行為。","B":"權限問題會顯示為 <strong>Some errors 或 Failure</strong>，並附上錯誤訊息，不會是這個狀態。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/what-is-the-automation-audit-log/","https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/how-is-my-usage-calculated/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.4.3-004","sec":"620.4.3","dom":"620.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A single-project rule in the FOOD project needs to modify a linked issue in the OPS project. Is adding an OPS condition to the JQL enough?","opts":["No; the link type just needs to be correct","Yes, as long as a Related issues branch is used","Yes","No; the rule's scope must include OPS (multi-project or global), and the Actor must have permissions in OPS"],"zh":"FOOD project 的單一 project rule 要修改被 link 的 OPS issue。只在 JQL 加上 OPS 條件就夠嗎？","zo":["不夠，只要 link type 正確就好","夠，只要用 Related issues branch","夠","不夠，rule 的 scope 要涵蓋 OPS（multi-project／global），且 Actor 要有 OPS 的權限"],"ans":"D","why":{"C":"<strong>JQL 只是查詢條件，不是授權</strong>。寫得出來不代表跑得動。","D":"正解。跨 project 操作要同時滿足兩個條件：<strong>① rule 的 scope 必須涵蓋目標 project</strong>——單一 project rule 只能動自己 project 的資料，要動 OPS 就得改成 multi-project 或 global rule，<strong>而那需要 Jira admin 在 Global automation 建立</strong>；<strong>② actor 必須具備 OPS 的對應權限</strong>。兩者缺一不可，只加 JQL 條件完全沒用。","A":"<strong>link 只是一種關聯敘述，它不會授予 rule 任何跨 project 的權限</strong>。","B":"<strong>branch 一樣受 scope 限制</strong>——分支能不能走到 OPS 的 issue，前提是這條 rule 的 scope 涵蓋 OPS。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/permissions-required-for-jira-cloud-automation-rules/","https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/jira-automation-branches/"],"lvl":3,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.4.3-005","sec":"620.4.3","dom":"620.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"After an Edit issue action, smart values later in the same rule still show the old value. What is the appropriate fix?","opts":["Add a Re-fetch issue data action before the steps that depend on the new value","Add ten Delay actions in a row","Change the Owner to someone else","Use bulk change instead"],"zh":"Edit issue 之後，同一條 rule 內的 smart value 仍顯示舊值。適合的處理？","zo":["在依賴新值之前加 Re-fetch issue data action","連續加十個 Delay","把 Owner 換人","改用 Bulk change"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"正解。官方說明 <strong><code>{{issue}}</code> 在整條 rule 執行期間是「觸發當下的快照」，不會自動更新</strong>——所以你在中途用 Edit issue 改了某個欄位，後續的 smart value 讀到的仍是舊值。解法是<strong>在需要新值的那一步「之前」插入 Re-fetch issue data 這個 action</strong>，它會重新載入 issue，讓之後的 smart value 拿到最新資料。把「需要最新值的步驟放在 re-fetch 之後」變成肌肉記憶，可以省掉很多除錯時間。","B":"加 Delay <strong>完全沒有處理問題的根源</strong>——快照不會因為等久一點就自己更新。","C":"owner 只影響通知，跟資料讀取毫無關係。","D":"bulk change 是人工的一次性操作，跟這條 rule 內部的資料流無關。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/jira-automation-actions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.4.3-006","sec":"620.4.3","dom":"620.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"When an Assign issue action fails, which two capabilities need to be distinguished?","opts":["The trigger user's Browse Projects permission","The Actor's Assign Issues permission and the target user's Assignable User permission","The Owner's name and the project color","Whether the Creator is an administrator"],"zh":"Assign issue action 失敗時，要區分哪兩種能力？","zo":["Trigger user 的 Browse 權限","Actor 的 Assign Issues 權限，與目標使用者的 Assignable User 權限","Owner 的名字與 project 顏色","Creator 是否為 admin"],"ans":"B","why":{"B":"正解。指派這件事需要<strong>兩個方向的能力同時成立</strong>：<strong>① actor 要有 Assign Issues 權限</strong>（它才能去修改 Assignee 欄位）；<strong>② 目標使用者要有 Assignable User 權限</strong>（他才可以被填進那個欄位）。缺任何一個，Assign issue action 都會失敗。這跟人工指派的規則完全一致，automation 不會放寬。","C":"跟 owner 的名字或 project 顏色毫無關係。","D":"issue 的建立者不是 rule 的執行身分，權限檢查跟他無關。","A":"trigger user（觸發事件的人）<strong>不等於 actor</strong>——除非規則刻意設定成以觸發者身分執行，否則權限檢查看的是 actor。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/permissions-required-for-jira-cloud-automation-rules/","https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/what-is-a-rule-actor/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.4.3-007","sec":"620.4.3","dom":"620.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Editing a field manually triggers rule B, but when rule A edits the same field, rule B is not triggered. What should you check first?","opts":["Schedule rule A to run every second","Delete rule A","Whether \"Allow rule trigger\" is enabled on rule B (it is disabled by default)","Make all users administrators"],"zh":"手動改欄位會觸發 rule B，但由 rule A 修改同一欄位卻不觸發 B。先查什麼？","zo":["把 A 排程成每秒","刪除 rule A","Rule B 的「Allow rule trigger」是否開啟（預設關閉）","把所有使用者改成 admin"],"ans":"C","why":{"C":"正解。官方在 rule details 說明：<strong>預設情況下，rule 不會被「其他 rule 造成的變更」觸發</strong>——這是刻意的安全設計，避免規則之間意外連鎖。要讓 B 能被 A 的變更觸發，必須到 <strong>rule B 的 details 打開「Allow rule trigger」</strong>。打開之後要留意兩件事：<strong>A 改 B、B 又改回 A 這種互相觸發會形成迴圈</strong>（連續 10 次會被判 LOOP 並中止），而且<strong>每一次連鎖觸發都會消耗執行次數</strong>。所以最好同時加上適當的 condition 讓規則能停下來。","D":"把所有使用者改成 admin 是嚴重的過度授權，而且這根本不是權限問題。","A":"把排程改成每秒只會大量消耗配額，<strong>完全不解決問題</strong>。","B":"刪除 rule A 等於放棄它的功能，不是解法。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/what-are-rule-details-in-atlassian-automation/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.4.3-008","sec":"620.4.3","dom":"620.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A Lookup issues action returns 100 issues. Can this number be used directly as the total number of bugs across the site?","opts":["The results are complete as long as the audit log shows SUCCESS","Yes, as long as the rule is global","Yes","No; Lookup issues returns at most 100 issues, so the query scope and the limit must be checked"],"zh":"Lookup issues 回傳 100 筆，可以直接當作全站 Bug 總數嗎？","zo":["只要 audit log 是 SUCCESS 就完整","可以，只要 rule 是 global","可以","不能，Lookup issues 最多回傳 100 筆，要確認查詢範圍與上限"],"ans":"D","why":{"C":"這個答案忽略了上限的存在，正是本題的陷阱。","D":"正解。官方 service limits 明訂 <strong>Lookup issues 最多只回傳 100 筆</strong>。所以看到剛好 100 這個數字時要特別警覺——<strong>很可能是被截斷了，真實總數更多</strong>。要統計全站數量，應該縮小 JQL 範圍分批查，或改用其他方式（例如 dashboard gadget）。順帶對照另外兩個數字：<strong>單次執行處理的相關 issue 上限是 5,000，bulk change 一次上限是 1,000</strong>。","A":"<strong>SUCCESS 只代表 action 順利執行完畢，不保證資料是完整的</strong>——它不會告訴你有沒有被上限截斷。","B":"rule 的 scope 決定它能作用在哪些 project，<strong>不會改變 Lookup issues 的筆數上限</strong>。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/automation-service-limits/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.4.3-009","sec":"620.4.3","dom":"620.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A rule execution shows \"THROTTLED\". What is the cause?","opts":["A service limit was exceeded (for example, 60 minutes of processing time per 12 hours), so the rule was paused","The Actor does not have permission","The JQL has a syntax error","The rule is disabled"],"zh":"Rule 執行結果顯示「THROTTLED」，原因是？","zo":["超過 service limit（例如每 12 小時 60 分鐘的處理時間）而被暫停","Actor 沒有權限","JQL 語法錯誤","Rule 被停用"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"正解。官方 Automation service limits 表列 <strong>Daily processing time：每 12 小時 60 分鐘</strong>，超過就會被 <strong>throttle（暫時擋下）</strong>。常見的成因是 trigger 設得太寬（每次更新都跑）、分支數量太多，或是 Send web request 等外部呼叫回應太慢，這些都會吃掉處理時間額度。有一個附帶重點值得記：<strong>THROTTLED 的執行不計入每月用量</strong>（因為實際上沒有任何步驟被執行）。","B":"權限問題會顯示 <strong>Some errors 或 Failure</strong> 並附上明確的錯誤訊息。","C":"JQL 語法錯誤在<strong>儲存規則時</strong>就會被擋下來，不會等到執行才報 THROTTLED。","D":"<strong>被停用的 rule 根本不會產生任何執行紀錄</strong>。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/automation-service-limits/","https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/how-is-my-usage-calculated/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.4.3-010","sec":"620.4.3","dom":"620.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"After how many consecutive failures is a scheduled rule automatically disabled?","opts":["5","10","It is never automatically disabled","3"],"zh":"Scheduled rule 連續失敗多少次後會被自動停用？","zo":["5 次","10 次","不會自動停用","3 次"],"ans":"B","why":{"D":"3 次不是官方的數字，官方明列的是 10 次。","A":"5 次不是官方的數字。","B":"正解。官方 service limits 明訂：<strong>Scheduled trigger 連續失敗 10 次之後，Jira 會自動停用這條 rule，並通知 owner</strong>。這是保護機制，避免一條壞掉的排程規則持續消耗資源。所以看到「上週還在跑、這週卻被停用了」，正確的處理順序是<strong>先看 audit log 找出那 10 次為什麼失敗、把根因修掉，再重新啟用</strong>——直接啟用不修原因，很快又會被停用。","C":"<strong>會</strong>自動停用，這正是本題的重點。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/automation-service-limits/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.4.3-011","sec":"620.4.3","dom":"620.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"How long are audit log entries retained?","opts":["7 days","30 days","90 days","Permanently"],"zh":"Audit log 的紀錄保留多久？","zo":["7 天","30 天","90 天","永久"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"7 天太短，不是官方數字。","B":"30 天太短，不是官方數字。","C":"正解。官方明訂 <strong>automation 的 audit log 保留 90 天，逾期會自動刪除且無法復原</strong>。這個限制有實務意義：<strong>需要長期追溯的紀錄（例如稽核用途）必須自己另外匯出保存</strong>，不能指望 Jira 幫你留著。另外要區分——這是 automation 的 audit log，跟 issue 本身的 History 是兩回事，後者會一直保留。","D":"不是永久保存。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/what-is-the-automation-audit-log/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.4.3-012","sec":"620.4.3","dom":"620.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Two rules trigger each other in a loop: rule A changes a label, which triggers rule B, and rule B changes it back, which triggers rule A. How does Jira handle this?","opts":["The rules run indefinitely until they are stopped manually","This cannot happen, because a rule cannot trigger another rule","The Actor is locked","After Jira detects the loop (when consecutive triggers reach the limit), it automatically stops execution and marks it as LOOP in the audit log"],"zh":"兩條 rule 互相觸發（A 改 label 觸發 B，B 又改回來觸發 A）形成迴圈，Jira 如何處理？","zo":["無限執行直到手動停止","不會發生，因為 rule 不能觸發 rule","Actor 會被鎖定","Jira 偵測到迴圈後（連續觸發達上限）會自動停止並在 audit log 標示 LOOP"],"ans":"D","why":{"D":"正解。官方 service limits 說明：<strong>rule 之間連續觸發達到上限（10 次）時，Jira 會判定為迴圈並自動停止該次執行，audit log 顯示 LOOP</strong>。修法有三種，由好到壞排序：<strong>① 在其中一條加 condition 讓它有機會停下來</strong>（例如「label 已存在就不做」，讓規則具備冪等性，這是最正確的做法）；<strong>② 關掉其中一條的 Allow rule trigger</strong>；<strong>③ 重新檢視這兩條規則是不是本來就該合併成一條</strong>。","A":"<strong>有保護機制</strong>，不會無限執行下去——否則單一個錯誤設定就能拖垮整個站台的自動化資源。","B":"rule <strong>可以</strong>觸發 rule，只要目標 rule 打開了 Allow rule trigger。","C":"<strong>不會鎖定任何帳號</strong>，被停止的是那次執行。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/automation-service-limits/","https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/what-are-rule-details-in-atlassian-automation/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.4.3-013","sec":"620.4.3","dom":"620.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A team on the Standard plan finds that after automation usage reaches 100%, multi-project rules stop running, but single-project rules continue to run normally. What is the reason?","opts":["In the exam-era model, single-project rules do not count toward the monthly limit and only multi-project and global rules do; the current model instead counts steps against an organization-wide shared pool","Single-project rules have an unlimited allowance","Multi-project rules require Premium","The Actor's permissions were revoked"],"zh":"Standard 方案的團隊發現 automation「用量」達到 100% 後 multi-project rule 停跑，但單一 project rule 照常。原因？","zo":["考試版模型：單一 project rule 不計入月配額，只有 multi-project／global rule 計入；現行模型改為以步驟計入 org 共用池","單一 project rule 有無限配額","Multi-project rule 需要 Premium","Actor 權限被撤"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"正解。這是<strong>考試版與現行版並存</strong>的一題，兩個模型都要知道。<strong>考試版（2023 考綱時代）</strong>：以「rule 執行次數／月」計算，<strong>單一 project 的 rule 不限量，只有 multi-project 與 global rule 計入每月配額</strong>——這正好解釋了題目描述的現象。<strong>現行版（2025 起）</strong>：官方已改成<strong>以「步驟」計算</strong>（trigger／condition／action／branch 各算一步），整個 organization 共用一個池，單一 project 的 rule 也一樣計入。作答時依題目情境判斷是哪一版。","B":"在<strong>現行模型</strong>下，單一 project 的 rule 也會計入步驟用量，不是無限的。","C":"<strong>Standard 方案就能建 multi-project rule</strong>（需要 Jira admin 在 Global automation 建立），不需要 Premium。","D":"權限問題會顯示明確的錯誤訊息，而不是整批規則停跑到下個計費日。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>作答用考試版：single-project rule 不計入月配額，multi-project／global 才計；現行：依步驟計、org 共用池。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/how-is-my-usage-calculated/","https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/automation-service-limits/"],"lvl":3,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.4.3-014","sec":"620.4.3","dom":"620.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"What is the maximum number of components a rule can have, not counting the trigger?","opts":["64","65","There is no limit","50"],"zh":"一條 rule 最多可有幾個元件（trigger 不計）？","zo":["64","65","沒有上限","50"],"ans":"B","why":{"D":"50 不是官方數字，太少了。","A":"64 是<strong>舊文件與部分第三方題庫</strong>的說法，官方現行數字不是這個。","B":"正解。官方 Automation service limits 的 Summary 表列 <strong>Steps per flow：65</strong>（進階 flow 則是 500）。要注意計算方式：<strong>condition、branch、action 都算進去，If／else block 內部的元件也一併計入</strong>。規則長到接近上限時，通常代表它做了太多事，應該考慮拆成幾條各司其職的規則——除了避開上限，也比較好維護與除錯。","C":"<strong>有上限</strong>，而且相當容易在複雜規則裡撞到。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>作答提醒：舊題庫可能寫 64，現行官方 KB 為 65。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/automation-service-limits/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira/kb/automation-rule-message-youve-reached-the-maximum-number-of-65-components-allowed-per-rule/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.5.1-001","sec":"620.5.1","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"You want to find issues that are assigned to someone else as well as issues that are not yet assigned. Which JQL query is correct?","opts":["<code>assignee != currentUser() OR assignee IS EMPTY</code>","<code>assignee = EMPTY AND assignee = currentUser()</code>","<code>assignee NOT IN (currentUser(), EMPTY)</code>","<code>assignee != currentUser()</code>"],"zh":"你想找出「指派給別人」以及「還沒指派」的 issue。哪個 JQL 正確？","zo":["assignee != currentUser() OR assignee IS EMPTY","assignee = EMPTY AND assignee = currentUser()","assignee NOT IN (currentUser(), EMPTY)","assignee != currentUser()"],"ans":"A","why":{"D":"這正是本題要打破的直覺——它<strong>會漏掉所有未指派的 issue</strong>，只找到「有指派、但不是我」的那些。","A":"正解。這是 JQL 最經典的空值陷阱：<strong><code>!=</code> 只會匹配「有值、而且不等於它」的 issue，完全不會涵蓋沒有值的</strong>。所以「指派給別人」用 <code>assignee != currentUser()</code> 沒問題，但「還沒指派」必須<strong>另外用 <code>OR assignee IS EMPTY</code> 明確補上</strong>。凡是用到 <code>!=</code> 或 <code>NOT IN</code> 的地方，都要先問自己：<strong>那些沒填值的要不要算進來？</strong>","B":"這兩個條件<strong>互斥</strong>——一張 issue 不可能同時「沒有 assignee」又「assignee 是我」，用 AND 串起來永遠是空結果。","C":"<strong>EMPTY 不能放進 <code>IN</code> 的清單裡</strong>，這是語法上不成立的寫法；EMPTY 只能搭配 <code>IS</code> 與 <code>IS NOT</code>。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/advanced-search-reference-jql-operators/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/advanced-search-reference-jql-keywords/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.5.1-002","sec":"620.5.1","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"You need to find issues that have both the web and payment labels. Which JQL query is correct?","opts":["<code>labels IN (web, payment)</code>","<code>labels = web AND labels = payment</code>","<code>summary ~ \"web payment\"</code>","<code>labels = \"web payment\"</code>"],"zh":"要找同時有 web 與 payment 兩個 labels 的 issue。哪個正確？","zo":["labels IN (web, payment)","labels = web AND labels = payment","summary ~ &quot;web payment&quot;","labels = &quot;web payment&quot;"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"<code>IN</code> 的語意是「<strong>任一</strong>」（等同多個 <code>=</code> 用 OR 串起來），所以這句找到的是「有 web <strong>或</strong> payment」的 issue，範圍太寬。","B":"正解。<strong>對多值欄位（labels、components、fix versions）而言，要求「同時具備多個值」的寫法就是用 AND 串接多個等式</strong>：<code>labels = web AND labels = payment</code>。這看起來有點反直覺（同一個欄位怎麼會同時等於兩個值），但因為 labels 是多值欄位，每個等式各自檢查「這個集合裡有沒有包含它」，所以成立。","C":"這是在搜尋 <strong>summary 的文字內容</strong>，跟 labels 欄位完全是兩回事。","D":"<strong>label 不能包含空白</strong>，所以 <code>\"web payment\"</code> 是一個根本不存在的 label，查不到任何東西。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/advanced-search-reference-jql-operators/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.5.1-003","sec":"620.5.1","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Which JQL query means \"transitioned to Done at some point this month\" without requiring the issue to still be Done?","opts":["<code>status = Done</code>","<code>updated &gt;= startOfMonth()</code>","<code>status CHANGED TO Done AFTER startOfMonth()</code>","<code>resolution = Done</code>"],"zh":"哪個 JQL 表示「本月曾經轉成 Done」，但不要求現在仍是 Done？","zo":["status = Done","updated &gt;= startOfMonth()","status CHANGED TO Done AFTER startOfMonth()","resolution = Done"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"這只查<strong>目前的狀態</strong>，會漏掉「本月轉成 Done、後來又被重開」的那些，也無法限定發生的時間。","B":"<code>updated</code> 只告訴你這張 issue 本月有被更新過，<strong>完全不知道改的是什麼</strong>——可能只是有人加了一則留言。","C":"正解。<strong><code>CHANGED TO Done</code> 描述的是「發生過這個轉換事件」，搭配 <code>AFTER startOfMonth()</code> 限定時段</strong>，正好對應題目要的「本月曾經轉成 Done、但不要求現在仍是」。順帶對照另一個歷史運算子：<code>status WAS Done</code> 的語意是「<strong>現在是或曾經是</strong>」，涵蓋範圍不同。記得 <strong>WAS／CHANGED 只支援六個欄位</strong>：Assignee、Fix Version、Priority、Reporter、Resolution、Status。","D":"<strong>resolution 是「結案的結果」欄位，不是狀態轉換事件</strong>，兩者概念不同（而且 Done 通常是 status 的名字，不見得是 resolution 的值）。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/advanced-search-reference-jql-operators/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.5.1-004","sec":"620.5.1","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"You shared a filter that contains <code>currentUser()</code>, and Alex and Bea see different results. What is the most reasonable explanation?","opts":["The filter must be broken","Only the owner can run functions","Sharing failed","The function is evaluated for whichever user is logged in, and the two users may also have different permissions to view issues"],"zh":"你分享了一個含 currentUser() 的 filter，Alex 和 Bea 看到的結果不同。最合理的解釋？","zo":["Filter 一定損壞","只有 owner 可以執行函數","分享失敗","函數依各自的登入身分求值，加上兩人的可見權限可能不同"],"ans":"D","why":{"D":"正解。有兩層原因疊在一起：<strong>① <code>currentUser()</code> 是動態函數，它依「目前登入的人」求值</strong>，所以 Alex 看到的是 Alex 的工作、Bea 看到的是 Bea 的；<strong>② 就算沒有這個函數，兩人的 Browse Projects 權限與 issue security 也可能不同</strong>，結果一樣會有差異。實務上的建議：<strong>共用的 filter 不要把 <code>currentUser()</code> 寫死在裡面</strong>，把它留給 quick filter 讓每個人自己決定；而且<strong>要分享給匿名使用者的 filter 絕對不能用它</strong>。","A":"沒有任何跡象顯示 filter 損壞——這是完全正常的行為。","B":"<strong>任何登入的使用者都能使用 <code>currentUser()</code></strong>，不限 owner。（真正不能用的是<strong>匿名使用者</strong>。）","C":"兩人都<strong>看得到這個 filter</strong>，就代表分享是成功的。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/advanced-search-reference-jql-functions/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.5.1-005","sec":"620.5.1","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"What is the correct way to search for issues in currently active sprints?","opts":["<code>sprint IN openSprints()</code>","<code>status = openSprints()</code>","<code>sprint ~ open</code>","<code>sprint = openSprints()</code>"],"zh":"要搜尋目前進行中 sprint 的 issue，正確寫法是？","zo":["sprint IN openSprints()","status = openSprints()","sprint ~ open","sprint = openSprints()"],"ans":"A","why":{"D":"函數回傳的是一個<strong>集合</strong>，用 <code>=</code> 拿單一值去比對集合是不成立的，必須用 <code>IN</code>。","A":"正解。<strong><code>openSprints()</code> 這個函數回傳的是「一組」目前進行中的 sprint，所以要用 <code>IN</code> 而不是 <code>=</code></strong>。相關的三個函數一起記：<code>openSprints()</code>（進行中）、<code>closedSprints()</code>（已完成）、<code>futureSprints()</code>（尚未開始）。有一個細節值得注意——<strong>同一張 issue 可能同時屬於已完成與未完成的 sprint</strong>（被從上個 sprint 拉到下一個時），所以 <code>sprint in closedSprints()</code> 查到的不一定都做完了。","B":"欄位用錯了：sprint 的資訊在 <code>sprint</code> 欄位，不是 <code>status</code>。","C":"<code>~</code> 是<strong>文字包含</strong>運算子，只能用在 Summary、Description 這類文字欄位，不能用在 sprint。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/advanced-search-reference-jql-functions/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.5.1-006","sec":"620.5.1","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"To find issues created in September 2026, which date boundary is the clearest?","opts":["<code>created &gt;= startOfMonth(-1)</code>","<code>created &gt;= \"2026-09-01\" AND created &lt; \"2026-10-01\"</code>","<code>created = \"2026-09-01\"</code>","<code>created &lt;= \"2026-09-30\"</code>"],"zh":"要找 2026 年 9 月建立的 issue，哪種邊界最清楚？","zo":["created &gt;= startOfMonth(-1)","created &gt;= &quot;2026-09-01&quot; AND created &lt; &quot;2026-10-01&quot;","created = &quot;2026-09-01&quot;","created &lt;= &quot;2026-09-30&quot;"],"ans":"B","why":{"B":"正解。<strong>用明確的日期加上「大於等於起點、小於下個月起點」的半開區間，是表達整個月份最乾淨的寫法</strong>：<code>created &gt;= \"2026-09-01\" AND created &lt; \"2026-10-01\"</code>。用 <code>&lt;</code>（而不是 <code>&lt;= \"2026-09-30\"</code>）的理由很重要——<strong>JQL 的日期若沒有指定時間，一律當成當天 00:00</strong>，寫 <code>&lt;= \"2026-09-30\"</code> 會漏掉 9 月 30 日當天 00:00 之後建立的所有 issue。","C":"<code>=</code> 只比對<strong>某一天</strong>（而且是那天的 00:00），涵蓋不到整個月。","D":"<strong>沒有起點</strong>，會把 9 月之前的所有 issue 都撈進來；而且如同上面說的，<code>&lt;= \"2026-09-30\"</code> 還會漏掉 9 月 30 日當天的資料。","A":"<code>startOfMonth(-1)</code> 是<strong>相對日期</strong>，它的結果會隨著執行時間而變動——這個月跑是八月，下個月跑就變成九月，無法穩定表達「2026 年 9 月」這個固定區間。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/advanced-search-reference-jql-operators/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.5.1-007","sec":"620.5.1","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Your JQL query returns results, but after you add it to a dashboard, a colleague cannot see the content. What should you check first?","opts":["Rename the dashboard","Change the query to an empty string","Whether the filter is shared with the colleague, and whether the colleague has Browse Projects permission for the relevant projects","Delete all labels"],"zh":"你的 JQL 有結果，放到 dashboard 後同事看不到內容。首先檢查？","zo":["改 dashboard 名稱","把 query 改成空字串","Filter 是否分享給他，以及他對相關 project 的 Browse 權限","刪掉所有 labels"],"ans":"C","why":{"B":"把查詢改成空的只會讓大家都看不到資料，<strong>完全沒有補上任何權限</strong>。","C":"正解。這裡有<strong>三層獨立的權限</strong>要逐一確認：<strong>① dashboard 有沒有分享給他</strong>（決定他打不打得開這個頁面）；<strong>② gadget 所使用的 saved filter 有沒有分享給他</strong>（決定 gadget 能不能執行查詢）；<strong>③ 他對相關 project 有沒有 Browse Projects 權限、以及 issue security 有沒有擋住</strong>（決定查詢會回傳哪些資料）。「dashboard 打得開、gadget 卻空白」通常卡在第二或第三層。","D":"刪除 labels 是破壞資料，跟權限問題毫無關係。","A":"dashboard 的名稱跟權限毫無關係。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/manage-filters/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.5.1-008","sec":"620.5.1","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Which of the following can built-in JQL do directly?","opts":["JOIN the data tables of two projects","<code>SELECT SUM(storyPoints) GROUP BY assignee</code>","<code>assignee = reporter</code> (comparing two fields on each issue)","<code>project = FOOD ORDER BY created DESC</code>"],"zh":"內建 JQL 能直接做到哪一項？","zo":["JOIN 兩個 project 的資料表","SELECT SUM(storyPoints) GROUP BY assignee","assignee = reporter（逐筆比較兩個欄位）","project = FOOD ORDER BY created DESC"],"ans":"D","why":{"B":"<strong>JQL 沒有聚合函數</strong>（SUM、COUNT、GROUP BY 都沒有）。要做這種統計得用 dashboard gadget（例如 Two Dimensional Filter Statistics）或報表。","C":"<strong>JQL 不支援欄位對欄位的逐筆比較</strong>——寫不出 <code>assignee = reporter</code> 或 <code>timeSpent &gt; originalEstimate</code>。遇到這種需求，先找有沒有現成的<strong>衍生欄位</strong>（<code>workRatio</code> 就是把 timeSpent／originalEstimate 算好的一個），真的沒有才考慮匯出資料或用 app。","D":"正解。<strong>JQL 的能力範圍就是「篩選 ＋ 排序」</strong>：<code>project = FOOD</code> 是合法的欄位比較，<code>ORDER BY created DESC</code> 是合法的排序子句（而且放在最後面，位置正確）。這題的價值在於劃清 JQL 的邊界——<strong>它擅長找出「哪些 issue」，不擅長「算出什麼數字」</strong>。","A":"<strong>JQL 不是 SQL，它沒有 JOIN</strong>——官方明講它只是語法看起來相似的查詢語言，不是資料庫查詢語言。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/what-is-advanced-searching-in-jira-cloud/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.5.1-009","sec":"620.5.1","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Which fields can history operators such as WAS, WAS IN, and CHANGED be used with?","opts":["Assignee, Fix Version, Priority, Reporter, Resolution, and Status","Status only","Custom fields only","Any field"],"zh":"WAS、WAS IN、CHANGED 這類歷史運算子，只能用在哪些欄位？","zo":["Assignee、Fix Version、Priority、Reporter、Resolution、Status","只有 Status","只有自訂欄位","任何欄位"],"ans":"A","why":{"D":"<strong>限定六個欄位</strong>，不是任何欄位都可以。要追蹤其他欄位的變更，只能開 issue 的 History 逐張看，或用 automation 在變更時把資料寫到別的地方。","A":"正解。官方原句明列：<strong>這類歷史運算子只能用在 Assignee、Fix Version、Priority、Reporter、Resolution 與 Status 這六個欄位</strong>。這六個值得直接背下來，因為考題常拿 component、labels、sprint 這些「看起來也該有歷史」的欄位來設陷阱。另外還有一個官方提到的限制：<strong>當某張 issue 的變更筆數超過 10,000 時，WAS 只會搜尋最近的那些變更</strong>。","B":"不只 Status，總共有六個欄位。","C":"<strong>自訂欄位完全不支援</strong>歷史運算子。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/advanced-search-reference-jql-operators/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.5.1-010","sec":"620.5.1","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"What does <code>resolved &gt;= -3m</code> mean?","opts":["Resolved within the last three months","Resolved within the last three minutes","Resolved three months ago","It is a syntax error"],"zh":"「resolved &gt;= -3m」的意思是？","zo":["最近三個月內解決","最近三分鐘內解決","三個月前解決","語法錯誤"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"這正是最容易誤選的答案——<strong><code>m</code> 是分鐘（minutes），不是月份</strong>。要表達三個月可以寫 <code>-12w</code>（約略）或用 <code>startOfMonth(-3)</code>（精確到曆月）。","B":"正解。<strong>JQL 相對時間的單位是：<code>w</code>（週）、<code>d</code>（天）、<code>h</code>（小時）、<code>m</code>（分鐘）</strong>，所以 <code>-3m</code> 的意思是「最近三分鐘」。這是很常見的踩雷點——寫 <code>-3m</code> 想查三個月，結果查到幾乎空白的結果還以為資料有問題。要表達曆月請用 <code>startOfMonth()</code> 系列函數。","C":"方向反了。<code>&gt;=</code> 搭配負值代表「從那個時間點<strong>到現在</strong>」，不是「在那個時間點之前」。","D":"語法完全合法，只是語意跟寫的人想的不一樣——這比語法錯誤更危險，因為不會有任何錯誤提示。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/advanced-search-reference-jql-fields/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.5.1-011","sec":"620.5.1","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"What is the correct way to find issues that are assigned to members of a group?","opts":["<code>assignee ~ \"dev-team\"</code>","<code>assignee IS membersOf(\"dev-team\")</code>","<code>assignee IN membersOf(\"dev-team\")</code>","<code>assignee = membersOf(\"dev-team\")</code>"],"zh":"要找某個群組成員被指派的 issue，正確寫法是？","zo":["assignee ~ &quot;dev-team&quot;","assignee IS membersOf(&quot;dev-team&quot;)","assignee IN membersOf(&quot;dev-team&quot;)","assignee = membersOf(&quot;dev-team&quot;)"],"ans":"C","why":{"B":"<strong><code>IS</code> 只能搭配 <code>EMPTY</code> 或 <code>NULL</code></strong>，不能拿來比對集合。","C":"正解。<strong><code>membersOf(\"dev-team\")</code> 回傳的是「一組使用者」，所以要用 <code>IN</code> 來判斷 assignee 是不是其中之一</strong>。這是 JQL 裡的通則——<strong>凡是回傳集合的函數（<code>membersOf()</code>、<code>openSprints()</code>、<code>unreleasedVersions()</code>、<code>subtaskIssueTypes()</code>）一律搭配 <code>IN</code></strong>。順帶提醒官方的一個限制：群組成員超過 10,000 人時 <code>membersOf</code> 會報錯。","D":"<code>=</code> 是拿單一值做比較，<strong>不能用來比對一個集合</strong>。","A":"<code>~</code> 是<strong>文字包含</strong>運算子，只能用在 Summary、Description 這類文字欄位；assignee 是使用者欄位，用它會出錯。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/advanced-search-reference-jql-functions/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.5.1-012","sec":"620.5.1","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Which of the following JQL functions exists?","opts":["<code>unreleasedVersion()</code>","<code>versionsReleased()</code>","<code>releasedVersion()</code>","<code>releasedVersions()</code>"],"zh":"以下哪一個是存在的 JQL 函數？","zo":["unreleasedVersion()","versionsReleased()","releasedVersion()","releasedVersions()"],"ans":"D","why":{"C":"<strong>少了 s</strong>——這是考題最愛的細節陷阱，單複數差一個字母就是不存在的函數。","D":"正解。<strong><code>releasedVersions()</code> 是官方的版本函數之一</strong>，同族的還有 <code>unreleasedVersions()</code>、<code>latestReleasedVersion(project)</code> 與 <code>earliestUnreleasedVersion(project)</code>。注意<strong>回傳多個版本的用複數形、要搭配 <code>IN</code>；回傳單一版本的用單數形、可以用 <code>=</code></strong>。Kanban board 的預設 sub-filter 就用到了其中一個：<code>fixVersion in unreleasedVersions() OR fixVersion is EMPTY</code>。","A":"不存在。正確的是複數形的 <code>unreleasedVersions()</code>。","B":"不存在，這是憑空造出來的名稱。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/advanced-search-reference-jql-functions/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.5.1-013","sec":"620.5.1","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Which of the following can basic search (as opposed to JQL) NOT do?","opts":["Combine conditions with OR or NOT","Filter by status","Filter by project","Filter by assignee"],"zh":"Basic search（非 JQL）做不到下列哪一項？","zo":["用 OR 或 NOT 組合條件","依 status 篩選","依 project 篩選","依 assignee 篩選"],"ans":"A","why":{"C":"Basic search <strong>可以</strong>依 project 篩選。（附帶一提：<strong>沒有先選 project 時，component、version 這類 project 專屬欄位不會出現在篩選器上</strong>。）","D":"Basic search <strong>可以</strong>依 assignee 篩選。","A":"正解。<strong>Basic search 的 clause 之間永遠是 AND，沒有 OR 也沒有 NOT</strong>，值也只能是「等於」。要用到 <strong>OR、NOT、<code>!=</code>、EMPTY、比較運算子（<code>&gt;</code> <code>&lt;</code>）、<code>~</code> 文字搜尋、ORDER BY、以及 WAS／CHANGED 歷史查詢</strong>，就必須切換到 JQL。而且要有心理準備——<strong>用了這些之後就切不回 Basic 了</strong>，因為 Basic 表達不出來。","B":"Basic search <strong>可以</strong>依 status 篩選，而且同一個欄位可以複選多個值（效果等同 <code>IN</code>）。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/what-is-advanced-searching-in-jira-cloud/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.5.1-014","sec":"620.5.1","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"What is the difference between <code>status WAS \"In Progress\"</code> and <code>status CHANGED FROM \"In Progress\"</code>?","opts":["They are identical.","<code>WAS</code> matches issues that had the value at any point in their history, including now; <code>CHANGED FROM</code> matches issues that changed from that value to another value.","<code>WAS</code> only checks the current value.","<code>CHANGED FROM</code> only checks the current value."],"zh":"status WAS &quot;In Progress&quot; 與 status CHANGED FROM &quot;In Progress&quot; 的差別？","zo":["完全相同","WAS：歷史上任一時刻曾是該值（含現在）；CHANGED FROM：曾從該值變成別的值","WAS 只看現在","CHANGED FROM 只看現在"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"兩者的語意<strong>明顯不同</strong>，這正是本題的重點。","B":"正解。<strong><code>WAS</code>：歷史上任一時刻曾經是這個值——而且「包含現在仍然是」</strong>；<strong><code>CHANGED FROM</code>：曾經發生過「從這個值變成別的值」的轉換事件</strong>。差別最明顯的例子是一張<strong>目前正在 In Progress、從來沒離開過</strong>的 issue：它符合 <code>WAS</code>，但不符合 <code>CHANGED FROM</code>。要表達「曾經進行中但現在不是」，常見寫法是 <code>status WAS \"In Progress\" AND status != \"In Progress\"</code>。","C":"<code>WAS</code> 查的是<strong>歷史紀錄</strong>，不是只看現在（雖然它也涵蓋現在）。","D":"<code>CHANGED</code> 查的也是<strong>歷史上的轉換事件</strong>，跟現在的狀態無關。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/advanced-search-reference-jql-operators/"],"lvl":3,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.5.1-015","sec":"620.5.1","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Which rule applies to the <code>ORDER BY</code> clause in JQL?","opts":["It cannot be used together with <code>AND</code>.","It can be placed anywhere in the query.","It must be placed at the end of the entire query.","It can sort by only one field."],"zh":"ORDER BY 子句在 JQL 裡的規則？","zo":["不能與 AND 同時使用","可以放在任何位置","必須在整個查詢的最後","只能排序一個欄位"],"ans":"C","why":{"B":"位置是<strong>固定的</strong>，不能隨意擺放。","C":"正解。<strong><code>ORDER BY</code> 必須放在整個查詢的最後面，後面不能再接任何 clause</strong>，否則整句語法錯誤。它<strong>可以排序多個欄位</strong>並各自指定 ASC 或 DESC，例如 <code>ORDER BY priority DESC, created ASC</code>（先依優先度由高到低，同優先度再依建立時間由舊到新）。","D":"<strong>可以排序多個欄位</strong>，用逗號分隔即可。","A":"<strong>可以同時使用</strong>——先用 AND 串接條件，最後再接 ORDER BY，這是最常見的寫法。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/advanced-search-reference-jql-keywords/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.5.1-016","sec":"620.5.1","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Which JQL query correctly finds issues created during the previous full calendar week?","opts":["<code>created &gt;= startOfWeek()</code>","<code>created = startOfWeek(-1)</code>","<code>created &gt;= -7d</code>","<code>created &gt;= startOfWeek(-1) AND created &lt; startOfWeek()</code>"],"zh":"要找上一個完整曆週建立的 issue，正確寫法？","zo":["created &gt;= startOfWeek()","created = startOfWeek(-1)","created &gt;= -7d","created &gt;= startOfWeek(-1) AND created &lt; startOfWeek()"],"ans":"D","why":{"C":"<code>-7d</code> 是<strong>從現在往前推 7 天的滾動區間</strong>——今天是星期三的話，它涵蓋上週三到今天，跟「上週一到上週日」完全是兩回事。","D":"正解。<strong><code>created &gt;= startOfWeek(-1) AND created &lt; startOfWeek()</code></strong>：起點是上一週的第一天，終點是本週的第一天（用 <code>&lt;</code> 排除本週），精確涵蓋整個上一個曆週。這裡有一個容易忽略的設定要一併知道——<strong>一週從星期幾開始，是由站台 Look and feel 的 ISO8601 設定決定的</strong>。","A":"<code>startOfWeek()</code>（不帶參數）是<strong>本週</strong>的第一天，這句查到的是本週建立的。","B":"<code>=</code> 只比對<strong>一個時間點</strong>（上週第一天的 00:00），涵蓋不到整週。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/advanced-search-reference-jql-functions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.5.1-017","sec":"620.5.1","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"What is the difference between <code>summary ~ \"login\"</code> and <code>summary = \"login\"</code>?","opts":["<code>~</code> performs a text search (including stemming and partial matching); <code>=</code> cannot be used with text fields.","<code>=</code> is less strict than <code>~</code>.","<code>~</code> can be used only with custom fields.","They are identical."],"zh":"summary ~ &quot;login&quot; 與 summary = &quot;login&quot; 的差別？","zo":["~ 是文字搜尋（含詞幹與部分比對）；文字欄位不能用 =","= 比 ~ 更寬鬆","~ 只能用在自訂欄位","兩者相同"],"ans":"A","why":{"D":"兩者完全不同——一個是合法的文字搜尋，一個是不成立的寫法。","A":"正解。<strong>Summary、Description、Environment、Comments 以及 Free Text 類型的 custom field 這些文字欄位，只支援 <code>~</code>（包含）與 <code>!~</code>（不包含），不能用 <code>=</code></strong>。而且 <code>~</code> 的行為比單純的字串比對聰明：<strong>它支援詞幹比對（搜 win 也會找到 wins）與萬用字元</strong>，要精確比對一個片語則用跳脫引號把它包起來。","B":"文字欄位<strong>根本不支援 <code>=</code></strong>，談不上寬鬆或嚴格。","C":"<code>~</code> 適用於<strong>所有文字型欄位</strong>，包含系統欄位 Summary、Description 等，不限自訂欄位。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/advanced-search-reference-jql-operators/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.5.1-018","sec":"620.5.1","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"What is the current JQL syntax for finding all child issues of a specific epic?","opts":["<code>issue in epic(MOB-100)</code>","<code>parent = MOB-100</code>","<code>epic = MOB-100</code>","<code>\"Epic Link\" ~ MOB-100</code>"],"zh":"要找某個 epic 底下的所有 child issue，現行寫法？","zo":["issue in epic(MOB-100)","parent = MOB-100","epic = MOB-100","&quot;Epic Link&quot; ~ MOB-100"],"ans":"B","why":{"B":"正解。<strong>現行 Jira 用 <code>Parent</code> 欄位來表示階層關係，它取代了舊的 Epic Link</strong>，所以查某個 epic 底下的 child 就寫 <code>parent = MOB-100</code>。這個寫法在 CMP 與 TMP 都適用。（要一次涵蓋更深的層級，另有 <code>parentEpic()</code> 之類的函數可用。）","C":"<strong>沒有 <code>epic</code> 這個欄位</strong>可以直接比對。","D":"<strong>Epic Link 已經被 Parent 欄位取代</strong>，而且 <code>~</code> 是文字搜尋運算子，用在這裡也不對。","A":"這不是有效的 JQL 語法，<code>epic()</code> 這個函數並不存在。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>考綱時代可能用 \"Epic Link\"；現行用 parent／parentEpic()。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/advanced-search-reference-jql-fields/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.5.1-019","sec":"620.5.1","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"According to the current official documentation, which JQL query finds all work at the sub-task hierarchy level?","opts":["<code>issuetype IN subtaskIssueTypes()</code>","<code>parent IS NOT EMPTY</code>","<code>hierarchyLevel = -1</code>","<code>hierarchyLevel = 0</code>"],"zh":"要用 JQL 找出所有「sub-task 層級」的工作，現行官方文件記載的寫法是？","zo":["issuetype IN subtaskIssueTypes()","parent IS NOT EMPTY","hierarchyLevel = -1","hierarchyLevel = 0"],"ans":"C","why":{"C":"正解。<strong>官方的 JQL fields 頁記載了 <code>hierarchyLevel</code> 這個欄位：standard 層（story／task／bug）是 0，sub-task 層是 -1</strong>（官方的範例 <code>hierarchyLevel &gt; -1</code> 意思正是「高於 subtask 層」）。所以要精確找出所有 sub-task 層級的工作，現行寫法是 <code>hierarchyLevel = -1</code>。","D":"<strong>0 是 standard 層</strong>（Story、Task、Bug），不是 sub-task。","A":"<code>subtaskIssueTypes()</code> 與 <code>standardIssueTypes()</code> 是<strong>舊有的寫法</strong>，<strong>現行 Cloud 的 JQL 函數參考頁已經沒有列出它們</strong>，所以不能當成官方答案（雖然部分站台可能還吃得下去）。","B":"<code>parent IS NOT EMPTY</code> 的範圍<strong>太寬了</strong>——掛在 epic 底下的 story 也有 parent，會被一併撈進來，並非只有 sub-task。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>現行官方 JQL 函數頁未列 subtaskIssueTypes()／standardIssueTypes()；hierarchyLevel 有官方欄位說明與範例。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/advanced-search-reference-jql-fields/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/advanced-search-reference-jql-functions/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.5.1-020","sec":"620.5.1","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Does <code>priority != High</code> return issues whose priority is empty?","opts":["Only when a Jira administrator runs the query.","It depends on the <code>ORDER BY</code> clause.","Yes.","No. <code>!=</code> does not match empty values; to include them, add <code>OR priority IS EMPTY</code>."],"zh":"「priority != High」會不會找到 priority 為空的 issue？","zo":["只有 Jira admin 執行時會","取決於 ORDER BY","會","不會，!= 不匹配空值；要含空值需加 OR priority IS EMPTY"],"ans":"D","why":{"C":"這正是本題要打破的直覺——<strong>不會</strong>找到空值的。","D":"正解。官方明列 <strong><code>!=</code> 與 <code>NOT IN</code> 都不匹配 EMPTY</strong>：<code>priority != High</code> 的實際意思是「<strong>有</strong> priority，而且不是 High」，完全沒填 priority 的 issue 一張都不會出現。要涵蓋它們必須明確補上 <code>OR priority IS EMPTY</code>。這是 JQL 最經典也最常出現在考題裡的陷阱——<strong>凡是用到 <code>!=</code> 的地方都要先問：沒填值的要不要算進來？</strong>","A":"跟執行者是誰完全無關，這是 JQL 運算子本身的行為。","B":"ORDER BY 只影響結果的<strong>排列順序</strong>，不會改變結果的<strong>集合內容</strong>。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/advanced-search-reference-jql-operators/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.5.2-001","sec":"620.5.2","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A user wants a two-way table showing the number of issues for each combination of Assignee and Status. Which gadget should they use?","opts":["Two Dimensional Filter Statistics","Activity Stream","Assigned To Me","Pie Chart"],"zh":"要看「每個 Assignee × 每個 Status 的件數」交叉表，選哪個 gadget？","zo":["Two Dimensional Filter Statistics","Activity Stream","Assigned To Me","Pie Chart"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"正解。題目要的是「Assignee」與「Status」<strong>兩個維度的交叉</strong>，這正是 <strong>Two Dimensional Filter Statistics</strong> 的功能——X 軸與 Y 軸各設一個欄位，交叉出一張數字表格。它是唯一能回答這種問題的內建 gadget。","B":"Activity Stream 顯示的是<strong>活動事件流</strong>（誰在什麼時候做了什麼），不做任何統計。","C":"Assigned To Me 只列出<strong>查看者本人</strong>的工作，看不到整個團隊。","D":"<strong>Pie Chart 只有一個維度</strong>，一次只能依單一欄位分群（例如只看 status 分佈或只看 assignee 分佈），做不出交叉表。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/use-dashboard-gadgets/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.5.2-002","sec":"620.5.2","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A dashboard has been shared successfully, but in the Filter Results gadget on it, a colleague sees a message saying they do not have access. What should be done next?","opts":["Share the dashboard again.","Check whether the saved filter used by the gadget is shared with the colleague.","Edit the Summary of every card.","Delete the gadget and add it again."],"zh":"Dashboard 已分享成功，但 Filter Results gadget 對同事顯示無存取權。下一步？","zo":["再分享一次 dashboard","檢查 gadget 用的 saved filter 是否分享給他","修改每張卡的 Summary","刪掉 gadget 重加"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"問題不在 dashboard 這一層——他<strong>已經打得開 dashboard</strong> 了，代表第一層分享是成功的。","B":"正解。<strong>dashboard 與 filter 是兩個獨立的物件，各自有各自的分享設定</strong>。分享 dashboard 只是給了他「容器」的存取權；<strong>gadget 實際要跑的那份 saved filter 必須另外分享給他</strong>，否則 gadget 會顯示無存取權。這正是「dashboard 打得開、gadget 卻空白或報錯」最典型的成因。查完 filter 分享之後，還要確認他對相關 project 有 Browse Projects 權限。","C":"修改 issue 的 Summary 跟權限毫無關係。","D":"刪掉重加的 gadget <strong>仍然會指向同一份沒有分享的 filter</strong>，問題完全沒解決。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/create-and-edit-dashboards/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/manage-filters/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.5.2-003","sec":"620.5.2","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A Pie Chart shows that one person accounts for half of the issues. Can you conclude that this person is carrying half of the workload?","opts":["Yes, as long as a Resolution Time gadget is added.","Yes, always.","No. The number of issues is not the same as time spent or story point estimates.","Yes, if the dashboard layout is changed to three columns."],"zh":"Pie Chart 顯示某人佔一半的 issue。可以推論他承擔一半的工作量嗎？","zo":["只要加上 Resolution Time 就可以","一定可以","不能，件數不等於工時或估點","改成三欄版面就可以"],"ans":"C","why":{"B":"<strong>單位不同就不能直接推論</strong>，這正是本題的重點。","C":"正解。<strong>Pie Chart 統計的是「件數」，而件數不等於工作量</strong>——一個人可能接了 20 張五分鐘的小事，另一個人扛了 2 張橫跨兩週的大工程。要衡量真正的負擔，應該看<strong>估點</strong>（例如把 Two Dimensional 的統計類型改成 story points）或用 <strong>Workload Pie Chart Report</strong>、<strong>User Workload Report</strong> 這類以工時為基礎的報表。這也是讀所有圖表的通則：<strong>先確認它統計的單位是什麼</strong>。","D":"版面配置只影響排版，<strong>不會改變統計的內容</strong>。","A":"Resolution Time 看的是「<strong>已解決的 issue 平均花多久解決</strong>」，它一樣不會告訴你工作量的大小。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/use-dashboard-gadgets/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.5.2-004","sec":"620.5.2","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A team wants each member to see their own unresolved work on the same dashboard. Which gadget should they use?","opts":["A Filter Results gadget whose filter is fixed to a specific manager as the assignee","Road Map","Labels","Assigned To Me"],"zh":"想讓每位同事在同一個 dashboard 上各自看到自己未完成的工作。用哪個 gadget？","zo":["固定 assignee = 某主管的 Filter Results","Road Map","Labels","Assigned To Me"],"ans":"D","why":{"D":"正解。<strong>Assigned To Me 會依「查看者自己的身分」動態顯示指派給他、且尚未完成的工作</strong>，而且跨所有 project、不需要設定任何來源。所以同一張 dashboard 分享給十個人，每個人看到的都是自己的清單，不必為每個人各做一份 filter。同一類的個人型 gadget 還有 Issues in Progress、Watched Issues 與 Voted Issues。","A":"把 assignee 寫死成某一個人，<strong>所有人看到的都是同一個人的工作</strong>，完全不符合需求。","B":"Road Map gadget 顯示的是<strong>版本的發佈進度</strong>，跟個人工作無關。","C":"Labels gadget 列出的是某個 project 用過的標籤。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/use-dashboard-gadgets/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.5.2-005","sec":"620.5.2","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A team wants to know whether their backlog is aging (how long unresolved issues have been open). Which gadget should they use?","opts":["Average Age","Resolution Time","Days Remaining in Sprint","Created vs Resolved"],"zh":"想知道 backlog 是否老化（未解決 issue 放了多久），用哪個 gadget？","zo":["Average Age","Resolution Time","Days Remaining in Sprint","Created vs Resolved"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"正解。<strong>Average Age gadget 統計的正是「目前未解決的 issue 平均放了多久」</strong>（從建立到現在的天數），數字持續上升就代表 backlog 在老化、舊案子沒人處理。這正好對應題目的需求。","B":"Resolution Time 算的是「<strong>已解決</strong>的 issue 從建立到解決花了多久」——它衡量的是處理效率，不是<strong>還沒被處理</strong>的工作放了多久，兩者的對象完全不同。","C":"Days Remaining in Sprint 只是 sprint 的倒數天數。","D":"Created vs Resolved 呈現的是<strong>建立與解決的數量趨勢</strong>（backlog 是漲是跌），它回答的是「進出是否平衡」，不是「留下來的那些放了多久」。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/use-dashboard-gadgets/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.5.2-006","sec":"620.5.2","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"What is the effect of starring a dashboard (adding it as a favorite)?","opts":["It grants the Browse Projects permission to all colleagues.","It makes the dashboard appear in your own sidebar and Dashboards menu so you can find it easily.","It makes the data refresh every minute.","It makes the dashboard public."],"zh":"把 dashboard 加星號（favourite）有什麼效果？","zo":["授予所有同事 Browse Projects","讓它出現在自己的側欄與 Dashboards 選單，方便找","讓資料每分鐘更新","把 dashboard 公開"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"加星號是<strong>個人的書籤行為</strong>，完全不涉及任何權限授予。","B":"正解。<strong>Star（加星）純粹是個人的導覽便利功能</strong>——加了之後這張 dashboard 會出現在自己側欄的「Starred and recent」與 Dashboards 選單裡，方便快速找到。它<strong>不影響任何人的權限，也不改變資料</strong>。（順帶一提，filter 也有同樣的加星機制。）","C":"自動刷新是另一個獨立的設定（••• → Configure automatic refresh），跟加星無關。","D":"分享是另一個獨立的設定（••• → Rename or share），跟加星無關。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/what-is-a-jira-dashboard/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.5.2-007","sec":"620.5.2","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A Filter Results gadget shows only 10 issues, but the same filter returns 37 issues on the search page. What should be checked first?","opts":["Make the filter public.","Conclude that the data has been lost.","The gadget's settings for the number of results displayed, pagination, and sorting","Add another project."],"zh":"Filter Results gadget 只顯示 10 筆，但同一 filter 在搜尋頁有 37 筆。先檢查？","zo":["把 filter 改成 public","認定資料消失","Gadget 的顯示筆數、分頁與排序設定","新增另一個 project"],"ans":"C","why":{"B":"沒有任何依據——同一份 filter 在搜尋頁明明查得到 37 筆，資料好好的。","C":"正解。<strong>Filter Results gadget 有自己的「顯示筆數」設定</strong>（預設通常是 10），它只是把 filter 結果的前幾筆呈現出來，不是資料不見了。到 gadget 的設定裡把筆數調高即可。順帶一提，這也提醒一件事：<strong>gadget 上看到的數字不見得是全部，做判斷前要先確認它的顯示上限</strong>。","D":"新增 project 跟顯示筆數毫無關係。","A":"分享設定影響的是「誰看得到」，<strong>完全不影響顯示幾筆</strong>。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/use-dashboard-gadgets/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.5.2-008","sec":"620.5.2","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A user created a dashboard, but the share dialog does not offer anyone to share it with. What is the cause?","opts":["The user does not have the Browse Projects permission.","The dashboard must be starred first.","Dashboards cannot be shared.","The user does not have the Share dashboards and filters global permission."],"zh":"使用者建立了 dashboard，但分享對話框沒有出現任何可分享的對象。原因是？","zo":["沒有 Browse Projects","Dashboard 必須先加星號","Dashboard 不能分享","缺少 Share dashboards and filters 全域權限"],"ans":"D","why":{"C":"dashboard <strong>當然可以分享</strong>，只是需要對應的全域權限。","D":"正解。<strong>分享 dashboard 與 filter 都需要全域權限「Share dashboards and filters」</strong>。缺了它的人建得出 dashboard 與 filter，但<strong>分享對話框裡的選單會是空的</strong>——這正是題目描述的症狀。這是全域權限，只有 Jira admin 能授予，而且跟所有全域權限一樣<strong>只能授予群組</strong>。","A":"Browse Projects 是<strong>資料層</strong>的權限（決定看得到哪些 issue），跟能不能分享 dashboard 是兩回事。","B":"加星號純粹是個人的書籤功能，<strong>跟分享毫無關係</strong>。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/create-and-edit-dashboards/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/what-are-global-permissions-and-what-do-they-do/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.5.2-009","sec":"620.5.2","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A dashboard used by the whole team was accidentally deleted. Which statement is correct?","opts":["It is moved to the trash, and a Jira administrator can restore it within 60 days.","Any viewer can restore it.","It can only be recreated.","It is permanently lost."],"zh":"不小心刪掉一個團隊共用的 dashboard。何者正確？","zo":["進入 trash，60 天內 Jira admin 可還原","任何 viewer 都能還原","只能重建","永久消失"],"ans":"A","why":{"D":"不會永久消失，<strong>有 60 天的緩衝期</strong>。","A":"正解。<strong>被刪除的 dashboard 會進入 trash 保留 60 天，期間可以還原，但只有 Jira admin 有權執行</strong>。所以誤刪時要立刻找 Jira admin，不要拖過期限。這組規則跟 project 的 trash 很像，可以一起記：<strong>丟進去相對容易，救出來一律要站台管理員</strong>。","B":"<strong>只有 Jira admin 能還原</strong>，一般的 viewer 甚至原本的擁有者都不行。","C":"<strong>可以還原</strong>，不必重建（重建還會失去原本的分享設定與 gadget 配置）。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/create-and-edit-dashboards/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.5.2-010","sec":"620.5.2","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A team wants to see the versions that are due to be released within a specified period. Which gadget should they use?","opts":["Heat Map","Road Map","Sprint Health","Created vs Resolved"],"zh":"想看「即將在指定期間內 release 的版本」，用哪個 gadget？","zo":["Heat Map","Road Map","Sprint Health","Created vs Resolved"],"ans":"B","why":{"B":"正解。<strong>Road Map gadget 會顯示指定期間內即將到期（release）的版本與它們的進度</strong>，正好對應題目的需求。它接的來源是 <strong>project</strong>。","C":"Sprint Health 看的是<strong>目前 sprint</strong> 的健康狀況（進度、工作分配、scope 變動），跟版本無關。","D":"Created vs Resolved 呈現的是建立與解決的<strong>數量趨勢</strong>，跟版本發佈時程無關。","A":"Heat Map 呈現的是分佈密度，跟版本發佈毫無關係。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/use-dashboard-gadgets/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.5.2-011","sec":"620.5.2","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A team wants to see whether issues are being created faster than they are being resolved. Which gadget should they use?","opts":["Labels","Voted Issues","Created vs Resolved","Average Age"],"zh":"想看「建立速度是否超過解決速度」，用哪個 gadget？","zo":["Labels","Voted Issues","Created vs Resolved","Average Age"],"ans":"C","why":{"C":"正解。<strong>Created vs Resolved 把一段期間內「新建立」與「已解決」的數量畫在同一張圖上</strong>，兩條線的落差就直接回答了「進得比出得快嗎」——<strong>建立線持續高於解決線，就代表 backlog 在膨脹</strong>。這是回答「趨勢」類問題的標準 gadget。","D":"Average Age 看的是「<strong>未解決的 issue 平均放了多久</strong>」，它回答的是老化程度，不是進出速度的比較。（兩者常一起看：Created vs Resolved 說明為什麼會積，Average Age 說明積了多久。）","A":"Labels gadget 只列出某個 project 用過的標籤。","B":"Voted Issues 列出的是自己投過票的 issue。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/use-dashboard-gadgets/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.5.2-012","sec":"620.5.2","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"With whom can a dashboard be shared?","opts":["Project roles only","The public only","Individual users only","Users, groups, projects, project roles, any logged-in user, or the public"],"zh":"Dashboard 的分享對象可以是哪些？","zo":["只能給 project role","只能公開","只能給個人","User、group、project、project role、任何登入者或 public"],"ans":"D","why":{"C":"不只個人，也可以給群組與整個 project。","D":"正解。分享對話框的 <strong>Viewers 與 Editors 可以分別指定：使用者、群組、project（還可以再限定該 project 的某個 role）</strong>；站台允許時另可開放給<strong>任何登入者</strong>或 <strong>public</strong>。要記住兩件事：<strong>Viewers 與 Editors 是分開設定的</strong>（能看不等於能改），而且<strong>不論分享給誰，收件者實際看到的資料仍然受他自己的 Browse Projects 與 issue security 過濾</strong>——分享不等於授權。","A":"不只 project role，可選的對象種類相當多。","B":"分享範圍<strong>可以精確限縮</strong>，不是只有公開一種選擇。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/create-and-edit-dashboards/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.5.2-013","sec":"620.5.2","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"What data source must be specified for a Sprint Burndown gadget on a dashboard?","opts":["A Scrum board","A project category","A version","A saved filter"],"zh":"Dashboard 上的 Sprint Burndown gadget 需要指定什麼資料來源？","zo":["一個 Scrum board","一個 project category","一個 version","一個 saved filter"],"ans":"A","why":{"D":"這是最容易誤選的答案——<strong>大多數 gadget 確實接 saved filter，但 sprint 類的例外，它們接 board</strong>。","A":"正解。<strong>Sprint 類的 gadget（Sprint Burndown、Sprint Health、Days Remaining in Sprint）都是以「board」為資料來源</strong>，而且必須是 Scrum board——因為 sprint 這個概念本身就屬於 board。這是它們與大多數 gadget（接 filter 或 project）最不一樣的地方，也是考題愛問的細節。","B":"project category 是用來分群 project 的標籤，不能當 sprint gadget 的來源。","C":"version 是交付的包裹，跟 sprint 是不同的概念；以 version 為來源的是 Road Map 那類 gadget。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/use-dashboard-gadgets/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.5.2-014","sec":"620.5.2","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"What is the difference between the system dashboard and a personal dashboard?","opts":["Gadgets cannot be added to the system dashboard.","The system dashboard is managed by Jira administrators and is shown to everyone by default; a personal dashboard is managed by its creator.","They are identical.","A personal dashboard can contain only one gadget."],"zh":"System dashboard 與個人 dashboard 的差別？","zo":["System dashboard 不能加 gadget","System dashboard 由 Jira admin 管理、所有人預設看到；個人 dashboard 由建立者管理","兩者完全相同","個人 dashboard 只能有一個 gadget"],"ans":"B","why":{"B":"正解。<strong>System dashboard 是使用者登入後預設看到的那一張，由 Jira admin 管理</strong>，改動會影響站台上所有沒有自訂首頁的人，所以要相當謹慎。<strong>個人 dashboard 則由建立者自己管理與分享</strong>。有一點可以放心：<strong>System dashboard 上的 gadget 內容仍然依照每個人自己的權限顯示</strong>，不會因為放在公用首頁就洩漏資料（例如 Administration gadget 只有管理員看得到內容）。","C":"兩者的管理者與影響範圍都不同。","D":"個人 dashboard <strong>可以放很多個 gadget</strong>，沒有這種限制。","A":"System dashboard <strong>當然可以加 gadget</strong>，那正是 Jira admin 用來佈置全站首頁的方式。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-custom-dashboards/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.5.2-015","sec":"620.5.2","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A team wants to display dashboards in rotation on a large screen in a meeting room, with the data updating automatically. What should they use?","opts":["Share the dashboard with the public.","Change the dashboard to a single-column layout.","Wallboard mode with automatic refresh configured","Star the dashboard."],"zh":"想在會議室大螢幕輪播 dashboard 且自動更新，該用什麼？","zo":["分享給 public","改成單欄版面","Wallboard 模式並設定自動刷新","把 dashboard 加星號"],"ans":"C","why":{"C":"正解。官方說明：<strong>wallboard 是 dashboard 的全螢幕顯示模式，會隱藏導覽列、放大 gadget，適合投在電視螢幕上</strong>；要輪播多個 dashboard 則用 <strong>wallboard slide show</strong>（可設定每張停留幾秒）。搭配 <strong>••• → Configure automatic refresh</strong> 設定自動刷新間隔，數字就會自己更新。設計上的建議是<strong>每張 wallboard 少放 gadget、放大字</strong>，因為那是給人幾公尺外掃一眼的。","D":"加星號只是把它加進自己的書籤清單，跟顯示方式無關。","A":"分享給 public 是<strong>權限</strong>設定，跟大螢幕的顯示方式毫無關係（而且會有資安疑慮）。","B":"版面配置只是欄位排列，<strong>不會進入全螢幕或自動輪播</strong>。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/create-and-edit-dashboards/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/set-up-a-wallboard/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.5.2-016","sec":"620.5.2","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A Filter Results gadget on a dashboard uses a filter that contains <code>currentUser()</code>, and the dashboard is shared with the whole team. What is the result?","opts":["Only the owner can see the content.","The gadget displays an error.","Everyone sees the same content.","Each person sees content evaluated based on their own identity."],"zh":"Dashboard 的 Filter Results gadget 用了含 currentUser() 的 filter，並分享給整個團隊。結果？","zo":["只有 owner 看得到內容","Gadget 會顯示錯誤","每個人看到相同內容","每個人看到依自己身分計算的內容"],"ans":"D","why":{"C":"正好相反，<strong><code>currentUser()</code> 會依查看者的身分動態求值</strong>，所以每個人看到的內容不同。","D":"正解。<strong><code>currentUser()</code> 是動態函數，它依「目前登入的人」求值</strong>，所以同一個 gadget 每位團隊成員看到的都是自己的工作。這其實可以是刻意的設計（就像 Assigned To Me 那樣），但也常造成困惑——<strong>開會時「你的畫面跟我的不一樣」多半就是這個原因</strong>。如果希望所有人看到同一份資料，就不要在共用的 filter 裡用這個函數；另外要記得<strong>分享給匿名使用者的 filter 絕對不能用它</strong>。","A":"<strong>任何有這份 filter 存取權的人都看得到內容</strong>，不限 owner。","B":"<strong>不會出現錯誤</strong>——這是完全正常的行為。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/advanced-search-reference-jql-functions/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.5.2-017","sec":"620.5.2","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"When a dashboard is shared with a project, who can see it?","opts":["Everyone who has the Browse Projects permission in that project (or a specified project role)","Only the project lead","All users on the site","Only Jira administrators"],"zh":"Dashboard 分享給某個 project，代表誰能看到？","zo":["該 project 的所有 Browse Projects 持有者（或指定 role）","只有 project lead","所有站台使用者","只有 Jira admin"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"正解。<strong>以 project 為對象分享時，該 project 中擁有 Browse Projects 權限的人就能看到這張 dashboard</strong>，而且分享時<strong>還可以進一步限定成該 project 的某個 role</strong>（例如只給 Developers）。要記住的是：<strong>能打開 dashboard 不代表看得到所有資料</strong>——每個 gadget 的內容仍然依照查看者自己的權限與 issue security 過濾。","B":"<strong>不只 project lead</strong>，範圍是整個 project 的可瀏覽者（或指定的 role）。","C":"那是選「<strong>任何登入者</strong>」時的效果，跟分享給某個 project 是不同的選項。","D":"完全不對，一般使用者也看得到。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/create-and-edit-dashboards/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.5.3-001","sec":"620.5.3","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A sprint started with 20 story points. The team completed 5 points, and then 5 more points were added. The burndown chart still shows 20 points remaining. What is the most reasonable explanation?","opts":["The 5 points added offset the 5 points completed.","Jira must have calculated it incorrectly.","The burndown chart counts only sub-tasks.","The team did not complete any work."],"zh":"Sprint 開始 20 點，完成 5 點，之後又加入 5 點；burndown 剩餘仍是 20 點。最合理的解釋？","zo":["新增的 5 點抵銷了完成的 5 點","Jira 一定算錯","Burndown 只算 sub-task","團隊沒有完成任何工作"],"ans":"A","why":{"D":"團隊<strong>已經完成了 5 點</strong>，只是被新增的 5 點抵銷掉，數字上看不出來。這正是為什麼要區分「剩餘量」與「完成量」兩種視角。","A":"正解。算式是 <strong>20 − 5（完成）＋ 5（新增）＝ 20</strong>，所以剩餘量看起來沒有變動。但這不代表團隊沒做事——<strong>burndown 在新工作加入的那個時間點會有一個明顯的往上跳</strong>，仔細看曲線就分辨得出來。想更清楚地看到範圍變動，改看 <strong>Burnup</strong>（紅色的 scope 線會往上跳）或 <strong>Sprint report</strong>（中途加入的 issue 旁邊會有星號）會更直觀。","B":"沒有必要假設系統算錯——這個數字完全符合預期，只是需要理解 scope change 的影響。","C":"正好相反：<strong>burndown 只算 parent（standard 層）的估點，sub-task 的 story points 完全不計入</strong>。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-burndown-chart/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.5.3-002","sec":"620.5.3","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A team wants to see two lines at the same time: total scope and completed work. Which report should they choose?","opts":["Average Age","Burnup chart","Assigned To Me","Activity Stream"],"zh":"想同時看到「總範圍」與「完成量」兩條線，選哪個報表？","zo":["Average Age","Burnup chart","Assigned To Me","Activity Stream"],"ans":"B","why":{"B":"正解。<strong>Burnup chart 把「總範圍（scope）」與「已完成量（completed）」分成兩條線</strong>：紅線是 scope、綠線是完成。這樣的好處是<strong>範圍變動一目了然——紅線往上跳就是 scope creep</strong>。相較之下 burndown 只有一條剩餘量的線，範圍增加與進度落後在圖上看起來很像，不容易區分。","C":"Assigned To Me 是個人的工作清單，不是趨勢圖。","D":"Activity Stream 是活動事件流，不做任何統計。","A":"Average Age 看的是未解決 issue 的年齡，只有一條線。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-burnup-chart/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.5.3-003","sec":"620.5.3","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A sprint started with 8 story points. After the sprint started, 2 more points were added, and all of the work was completed. What is the Commitment on the Velocity chart?","opts":["2","10","8","0"],"zh":"Sprint 開始時 8 點，開始後又加 2 點且全部完成。Velocity chart 的 Commitment 是多少？","zo":["2","10","8","0"],"ans":"C","why":{"B":"<strong>10 是 Completed（實際完成量）</strong>——中途加入的 2 點雖然不算進 commitment，但因為做完了，所以會計入 completed。","C":"正解。<strong>Velocity chart 的 Commitment 固定為「sprint 開始當下」的總估算量</strong>，也就是 <strong>8</strong>。<strong>sprint 開始之後才加入的 issue、或是中途被調高的估點，都不會回頭改變 commitment，但會計入 Completed</strong>。所以這個 sprint 的兩根柱子會是 commitment 8、completed 10。這組定義正是 velocity 能反映「承諾 vs 實際」的關鍵——如果 commitment 會隨時被改，這張圖就失去意義了。","D":"sprint 開始時明明有 8 點的工作，commitment 不會是 0。","A":"2 是後來新增的量，不是 commitment。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-velocity-chart/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.5.3-004","sec":"620.5.3","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"The Done status is not mapped to the rightmost column of the board, so agile reports do not treat these issues as completed. What should be done first?","opts":["Change only the Resolution.","Rename the issue to Completed.","Delete the sprint.","Check the board's column mapping."],"zh":"Done 狀態沒有對到 board 最右欄，agile 報表不把它當完成。先做什麼？","zo":["只改 Resolution","把 issue 改名為 Completed","刪掉 sprint","檢查 board 的 column mapping"],"ans":"D","why":{"D":"正解。<strong>Scrum 的 agile 報表判定「完成」的唯一依據是 issue 落在 board 的最右欄</strong>，跟 status 叫什麼名字、屬於哪個 category 都無關。所以第一步就是到 <strong>Board settings → Columns</strong> 檢查 column mapping，把 Done、Closed、Cancelled 這些代表結束的 status 通通拖到最右欄。（附帶對照：<strong>Kanban 的 Hide completed work 剛好相反，它看的是 status category</strong>。）","A":"<strong>Resolution 影響的是通用型報表與 JQL 查詢，它不能取代 board 的 column mapping</strong>——agile 報表（burndown、velocity、sprint report）判定完成的依據是欄位位置，不是 resolution。","B":"改 issue 的名稱不會改變任何判定邏輯。","C":"刪掉 sprint 會損失資料，而且完全不對症。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-columns/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.5.3-005","sec":"620.5.3","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A Kanban team wants to find out which stage of their workflow is a bottleneck. Which report is most appropriate?","opts":["Cumulative flow diagram","Velocity chart","Version report","Sprint report"],"zh":"Kanban 團隊想找出流程卡在哪一個階段。最適合的報表？","zo":["Cumulative flow diagram","Velocity chart","Version report","Sprint report"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"正解。<strong>Cumulative flow diagram（CFD）把各狀態的數量隨時間堆疊起來，哪一個色帶持續垂直變寬，就代表工作在那個階段堆積——那就是瓶頸</strong>。它是 Kanban 團隊找瓶頸的標準工具（Kanban 只有 CFD 與 Control chart 兩張報表）。判讀時要注意：<strong>色帶的「厚度」才是該狀態的件數，累積線的「高度」是含底下所有狀態的上界</strong>。","B":"Velocity chart 以 sprint 為基礎，<strong>Kanban 沒有 sprint，根本沒有這張報表</strong>。","C":"Version report 是版本的完成預測，跟流程瓶頸無關，而且它只在 CMP Scrum board 上有。","D":"Sprint report 是 Scrum 專用的回顧報表，Kanban 沒有。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-cumulative-flow-diagram/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.5.3-006","sec":"620.5.3","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"In a Control chart, only the In Progress and Review columns are selected. Does the time shown automatically include time spent waiting in To Do?","opts":["Yes.","No. Only time spent in the selected columns is counted (cycle time).","Yes, as long as the issue has an assignee.","It depends on the Working days setting."],"zh":"Control chart 只勾選 In Progress 與 Review 兩個欄位。它的時間會自動包含 To Do 的等待時間嗎？","zo":["會","不會，時間只計算所選欄位（cycle time）","只要 issue 有 assignee 就會","取決於 working days"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"<strong>不會</strong>——這正是本題要澄清的重點。","B":"正解。<strong>Control chart 只計算「你所勾選的那些欄位」的停留時間</strong>，所以勾了 In Progress 與 Review，算出來的就是這兩段的總和，<strong>不包含 To Do 的排隊等待時間</strong>。這正好對應兩個不同的指標：<strong>只算實際處理階段 ＝ cycle time；從建立到完成、含所有等待 ＝ lead time</strong>。要看哪一種，就靠 Columns 的勾選來決定。跟客戶或主管報數字之前，一定要先講清楚<strong>你算的是哪一段</strong>。","C":"有沒有 assignee 跟時間計算毫無關係。","D":"working days 影響的是<strong>天數怎麼計算</strong>（要不要跳過週末），<strong>不影響「計算哪些欄位」</strong>，兩者是不同的設定。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-control-chart/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.5.3-007","sec":"620.5.3","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"The Epic burndown predicts that one more sprint is needed, but most issues in the epic have not been estimated. What should be done?","opts":["Switch to a Pie chart.","Commit to finishing the epic in one sprint.","Explain that the forecast does not include the unestimated work, and estimate that work before reviewing the forecast again.","Delete all of the unestimated work."],"zh":"Epic burndown 預測還要一個 sprint，但 epic 裡多數 issue 尚未估點。應該？","zo":["改用 Pie chart","直接承諾一個 sprint 完成","說明預測缺少未估點工作，先補估點再看","把未估點的工作全部刪除"],"ans":"C","why":{"B":"這正是最危險的做法——<strong>官方明訂未估點的工作超過 30% 時報表會標示預測不可靠</strong>，拿一個已知不可信的數字去對外承諾，等於埋下延期的地雷。","C":"正解。<strong>Epic burndown 的預測算法是「剩餘工作量 ÷ 最近三個 sprint 的平均 velocity」</strong>——問題在於<strong>未估點的工作在分子裡等於 0</strong>，所以剩餘量被嚴重低估，預測自然過度樂觀。官方在<strong>未估點超過 30% 時會主動顯示警告</strong>。正確的處理是先向主管說明這個預測的前提有缺陷，讓團隊把估點補齊之後再看一次。","D":"刪除工作是竄改範圍，會讓數字更失真，而且損失了真實的需求。","A":"Pie chart 呈現的是分佈比例，回答不了「還要幾個 sprint」的問題。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-epic-burndown-report/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.5.3-008","sec":"620.5.3","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Unresolved issues are staying open longer and longer. Which report should be reviewed first?","opts":["Resolution Time report","Sprint report","Version report","Average Age report"],"zh":"未解決的 issue 愈放愈久，要先看哪個報表？","zo":["Resolution Time report","Sprint report","Version report","Average Age report"],"ans":"D","why":{"D":"正解。<strong>Average Age report 統計的正是「目前未解決的 issue 平均放了多久」</strong>，完全對應「愈放愈久」這個症狀。這題的重點是分辨兩個相似報表的對象：<strong>Average Age 看的是「還沒解決的」，Resolution Time 看的是「已經解決的」</strong>。","A":"Resolution Time 算的是「<strong>已解決</strong>的 issue 從建立到解決花了多久」——它的對象是已經處理完的工作，不是還沒被處理的。","B":"Sprint report 呈現的是某個 sprint 的完成／未完成清單，範圍限於那個 sprint。","C":"Version report 是版本的完成趨勢與發佈日期預測。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/generate-a-report/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.5.3-009","sec":"620.5.3","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"For the same project, project insights and the board's reports show different issue counts. What is a possible reason?","opts":["Project insights covers the entire project, while board reports are limited to the scope of the board's filter.","Someone must have deleted data.","The two should always match.","Board reports count only sub-tasks."],"zh":"同一 project 的 project insights 與 board 報表件數不同。可能原因？","zo":["前者涵蓋整個 project，後者受 board filter 範圍限制","一定有人刪資料","兩者永遠應相同","Board 報表只算 sub-task"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"正解。兩者的資料範圍定義不同：<strong>project insights 涵蓋整個 project 的資料，而 board 上的報表則受該 board 的 saved filter 限制</strong>——filter 可能排除了某些 issue type、某些狀態，或是只涵蓋部分工作。另外還有兩個相關差異值得一起記：<strong>CMP 有多個 board 時，報表以「目前顯示的 board」為準</strong>；而且 <strong>board 報表的完成判定看的是最右欄</strong>，跟 insights 的統計基準未必一致。看到數字對不起來，先比對兩邊的資料範圍定義，而不是懷疑資料出錯。","B":"沒有任何依據支持「有人刪資料」這個推論。","C":"<strong>兩者的資料定義本來就不同</strong>，不應該預期它們永遠一致。","D":"board 報表<strong>不是只算 sub-task</strong>——正好相反，多數 agile 報表的估點統計是<strong>排除</strong> sub-task 的。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/generate-a-report/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.5.3-010","sec":"620.5.3","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"An issue has an Original Estimate of 8h, 5h of time logged, and a Remaining Estimate of 6h. What is the current projected total time for the issue?","opts":["3h","11h","8h","6h"],"zh":"原估 8h，已記錄 5h，Remaining 6h。目前預計總耗時是？","zo":["3h","11h","8h","6h"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"3h 是「原估 8 減去已花 5」的算術結果，但那只是<strong>假設原估完全準確</strong>時的推論；實際的剩餘量是使用者自己重新評估後填的 6h。","B":"正解。<strong>目前預計總耗時 ＝ 已花（5h）＋ 剩餘（6h）＝ 11h</strong>，比原估的 8h 多了 3 小時，代表這張工作被低估了——這正是 time tracking 面板要傳達的資訊。要提醒團隊一個常見的壞習慣：<strong>不要為了讓數字好看，硬把 Remaining 填成 3h 來湊平原估</strong>，remaining 應該反映最新的真實預測，那才是它的價值所在。","C":"8h 是<strong>當初的原始估算</strong>，它不會隨進度改變，也沒有反映後來取得的新資訊。","D":"6h 只是<strong>剩下要花的</strong>，沒有把已經投入的 5 小時算進去。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-time-tracking/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.5.3-011","sec":"620.5.3","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"In a Sprint report, what does an asterisk (*) next to an issue indicate?","opts":["The issue was removed.","The issue has no estimate.","The issue was added after the sprint started.","The issue is a bug."],"zh":"Sprint report 裡某張 issue 前面有星號（*），代表什麼？","zo":["它被移除了","它沒有估點","它是 sprint 開始後才加入的","它是 bug"],"ans":"C","why":{"C":"正解。<strong>Sprint report 用星號（*）標示「sprint 開始之後才被加入」的 issue</strong>，也就是不在原本承諾範圍內的工作。這是 retro 時很有價值的線索——它把「這個 sprint 沒做完」的原因區分成「中途被塞了工作」與「原本就低估」兩類。同一份報表裡另一個相關標記是「<strong>3 → 5</strong>」，代表估點在 sprint 進行中被改過。順帶記住：<strong>這些後來加入的工作不計入 Velocity 的 Commitment，但會計入 Completed</strong>。","D":"跟 issue 是不是 bug 完全無關。","A":"被移除的 issue 列在 Sprint report 的另一個區塊（<strong>Removed</strong>），不是用星號標示。","B":"未估點的工作另有標示方式，跟星號無關。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-sprint-report/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.5.3-012","sec":"620.5.3","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A Version report never shows a predicted release date. What is the most likely cause?","opts":["The version has already been released.","There are no issues with a Fix Version.","The board is not a Kanban board.","Less than 10% of the estimated work in the version has been completed."],"zh":"Version report 一直沒有預測完成日。最可能的原因？","zo":["版本已 Released","沒有 Fix Version 的 issue","Board 不是 Kanban","版本裡估算工作完成不到 10%"],"ans":"D","why":{"D":"正解。官方明訂：<strong>版本裡的估算工作至少要完成 10%，Version report 才會產生預測</strong>。道理很直觀——完成量太少時，平均日進度的樣本不足，算出來的預測沒有意義。另外兩個相關的前提也一併記住：<strong>版本要設 Start date</strong>（否則會拿建立時間當起點，把沒動工的空窗期也算進去），而且<strong>預測會受 board 的 working days 設定影響</strong>。","A":"版本已經 Released 之後<strong>仍然可以檢視報表</strong>，不影響預測的產生。","B":"「版本裡的 issue」定義上就是<strong>有填 Fix Version 的那些</strong>，這個選項在邏輯上不成立。","C":"<strong>Version report 本來就是 Scrum board 的報表</strong>（而且是 CMP 專屬），board 不是 Kanban 正好是它能出現的前提。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-version-report/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.5.3-013","sec":"620.5.3","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"How are the optimistic and pessimistic prediction lines in the Version report calculated?","opts":["The average daily rate of progress ±10%","The average daily rate of progress ±50%","From the fastest and slowest sprints","Randomly"],"zh":"Version report 的樂觀與悲觀預測線是怎麼算的？","zo":["平均日進度 ±10%","平均日進度 ±50%","最快與最慢 sprint","隨機"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"正解。官方定義：<strong>藍線是依「平均日進度」推算的預測日期，樂觀線是平均速度 +10%，悲觀線是 −10%</strong>，兩條線在圖上形成預測日期的區間（左灰帶樂觀、右灰帶悲觀）。要注意這個區間<strong>只是依歷史速度的簡單外推，不是信心區間</strong>——範圍持續增加或團隊產能變動時，它會失準。","B":"±50% 不是官方的數字，區間也不會這麼寬。","C":"用最快與最慢的 sprint 當上下界，是 Release burndown 那類以 sprint 為單位的邏輯，<strong>不是 Version report 的算法</strong>（後者是以「日進度」為基礎）。","D":"完全不是隨機，它有明確的計算規則。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-version-report/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.5.3-014","sec":"620.5.3","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"How is the rolling average in the Control chart sampled?","opts":["Every 7 days, at fixed intervals","20% of the total number of issues displayed, with a minimum of 5, and always an odd number of issues","Only the 3 most recent issues","The average of all issues"],"zh":"Control chart 的 rolling average 是怎麼取樣的？","zo":["固定每 7 天","取顯示總數的 20%，最少 5 個，且永遠取奇數個 issue","只取最近 3 個 issue","取全部 issue 的平均"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"<strong>不是固定天數</strong>——這是最容易誤選的答案，因為「rolling average」聽起來很像時間窗。","B":"正解。官方定義：<strong>rolling average 依「issue 的數量」取樣，每一個點取自己加上前後各 X 個 issue 來平均，而 X 是目前顯示總數的 20%，最少 5 個，且永遠取奇數</strong>。這樣設計的用意是<strong>讓單一離群點不會把整條線拉歪</strong>，也讓工作量忽多忽少的期間不會產生假訊號。取奇數則是為了讓每個點的前後樣本對稱。","C":"不是固定取最近 3 個，樣本數會隨顯示的總數而變。","D":"取全部的平均是<strong>整體平均</strong>，那樣就畫不出「隨時間變化的趨勢線」了——rolling 的意義正是每個點各自取鄰近樣本。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-control-chart/"],"lvl":3,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.5.3-015","sec":"620.5.3","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Some issues are completely excluded from the Release burndown report. What is the most likely cause?","opts":["They are bugs.","They have attachments.","Their statuses are not mapped to any board column.","They have no assignee."],"zh":"Release burndown 顯示某些 issue 完全不計入。最可能的原因？","zo":["它們是 bug","它們有附件","它們的 status 沒有對應到任何 board column","它們沒有 assignee"],"ans":"C","why":{"C":"正解。官方明訂：<strong>status 沒有對應到任何 board column 的工作，在 Release burndown 中「完全不列入」</strong>——它們不會進 sprint bar、不算進未估點的百分比，也不算進剩餘 story points，等於整批從報表上消失。所以看到「報表少了一批卡」，<strong>第一個要查的就是 Board settings → Columns 的 Unmapped statuses 面板</strong>。這也再次呼應那條通則：<strong>board 類報表的資料範圍與判定，全都建立在 column mapping 上</strong>。","D":"有沒有 assignee 跟報表計算無關。","A":"issue type 是什麼跟計不計入毫無關係。","B":"附件跟報表計算毫無關係。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-release-burndown-report/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.5.3-016","sec":"620.5.3","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"What determines the unit of the Y-axis on the Velocity chart?","opts":["The Time tracking setting","Working days","It is always story points.","The board's Estimation statistic"],"zh":"Velocity chart 的 Y 軸單位由什麼決定？","zo":["Time tracking 設定","Working days","永遠是 story points","Board 的 estimation statistic"],"ans":"D","why":{"C":"<strong>不一定是 story points</strong>——也可以是 issue count（張數）或 original time estimate（時間），取決於 board 的設定。","D":"正解。<strong>Velocity chart 的 Y 軸單位由 board 的 estimation statistic 決定</strong>（Board settings → Estimation）。附帶兩個重點：<strong>sub-task 的估算永遠不計入</strong>（官方原句 Estimates from sub-tasks are not included），而且<strong>這是 board 層級的設定</strong>——同一個 project 的兩塊 board 可以用不同的 statistic，數字不能互相比較。","A":"<strong>velocity 完全不受 time tracking 設定影響</strong>——那個旋鈕只改變 burndown 追蹤進度的方式。這是兩個設定最重要的分工。","B":"working days 影響的是<strong>天數怎麼計算</strong>（要不要跳過週末），跟縱軸的單位無關。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-velocity-chart/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.5.3-017","sec":"620.5.3","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"What is the difference between the Epic report and the Epic burndown?","opts":["The Epic report lists completed, incomplete, and unestimated issues at a point in time; the Epic burndown tracks progress sprint by sprint and forecasts how many more sprints are needed.","The Epic report is available only on Kanban boards.","The Epic burndown does not require estimates.","They are exactly the same."],"zh":"Epic report 與 Epic burndown 的差別？","zo":["Epic report 是某時點的完成／未完成／未估點清單；Epic burndown 是依 sprint 看進度並預測還要幾個 sprint","Epic report 只在 Kanban 有","Epic burndown 不需要估點","完全相同"],"ans":"A","why":{"D":"兩者的用途明顯不同，不能互相取代。","A":"正解。兩者的視角不同：<strong>Epic report 呈現的是「某個時間點的快照」</strong>——這個 epic 底下哪些已完成、哪些未完成、哪些還沒估點，適合盤點現況；<strong>Epic burndown 則是「隨 sprint 演進的趨勢」</strong>，以 sprint 為單位畫出剩餘量，並用<strong>最近三個 sprint 的 velocity</strong> 推估還要幾個 sprint 才做得完，適合回答「什麼時候能完成」。","B":"<strong>兩者都是 Scrum 的報表</strong>（而且是 CMP 專屬）；Kanban 只有 Control chart 與 CFD。","C":"<strong>沒有估點就無法預測</strong>——Epic burndown 的預測就是靠估點與 velocity 算出來的，官方還會在未估點超過 30% 時標示預測不可靠。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-epic-report/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-epic-burndown-report/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.5.3-018","sec":"620.5.3","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A band on the cumulative flow diagram (CFD) becomes narrower. Can you directly conclude that the team is overstaffed?","opts":["Yes.","No; the width of a band reflects only the amount of WIP in that status, and the cause must be investigated separately.","Yes, but only on a Kanban board.","This conclusion can be drawn only on a Scrum board."],"zh":"CFD 上某個色帶「變窄」，可以直接推論人力過剩嗎？","zo":["可以","不能；帶寬只反映該狀態的 WIP 數量，原因要另外查","可以，只要 Kanban","只有 Scrum 才能推論"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"這是<strong>過度斷言</strong>——從一張圖的形狀直接跳到人力配置的結論，中間缺了太多推理。","B":"正解。<strong>CFD 只描述「各狀態的數量隨時間如何變化」，它不解釋原因</strong>。某個色帶變窄可以有很多種解釋：團隊確實處理得更快了、上游流入減少了、工作被移出這個 board、或者只是那批工作剛好比較小。<strong>正確的做法是把 CFD 當成「提問的起點」而不是「結論」</strong>——看到異常再去查流入流出、訪談團隊。同樣的道理也適用於變寬（不能直接說某人偷懶）。","C":"是不是 Kanban 不影響這個推理上的限制。","D":"Scrum 也一樣不能從 CFD 的形狀直接推論人力配置。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-cumulative-flow-diagram/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.5.3-019","sec":"620.5.3","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"The Burndown chart does not display the grey guideline. What is the most likely cause?","opts":["The board is a Kanban board.","The issues have no assignee.","When the sprint was started, there were no estimated issues on the board.","Working days have not been configured."],"zh":"Burndown chart 沒有灰色 guideline。最可能的原因？","zo":["Board 是 Kanban","Issue 沒有 assignee","Sprint 開始時 board 上沒有任何有估算的 issue","Working days 沒設"],"ans":"C","why":{"C":"正解。<strong>guideline 是依「sprint 開始當下的總估算量」從起點直直畫到 0 的參考線</strong>，所以只要那個起始總量是 0，這條線就畫不出來——最常見的操作順序錯誤就是<strong>先按 Start sprint、才把 issue 拉進去</strong>，或是 issue 全都沒有填估點。其他官方列出的原因還有：sprint 日期被設在過去、時區不一致、完成的 status 沒對到最右欄，以及使用了 burndown 不認得的自訂估算欄位。","D":"working days 影響的是 guideline 在非工作日會不會走平（<strong>形狀</strong>），<strong>不影響它存不存在</strong>。","A":"<strong>Kanban board 根本沒有 burndown 這張報表</strong>，所以不會出現「有圖但缺 guideline」的情況。","B":"assignee 是誰跟 guideline 毫無關係。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-burndown-chart/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.5.3-020","sec":"620.5.3","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Which of the following reports is affected by the Working days setting?","opts":["Pie Chart gadget","Two Dimensional Filter Statistics","Cumulative flow diagram","Burndown chart"],"zh":"Working days 設定會影響下列哪個報表？","zo":["Pie chart gadget","Two Dimensional Filter Statistics","Cumulative flow diagram","Burndown chart"],"ans":"D","why":{"C":"<strong>CFD 一律按日曆日連續計算，不受 working days 影響</strong>——這是最常被考的例外，週末在圖上會是平的一段，那是真實情況而不是設定沒生效。","D":"正解。受 working days 影響的報表清單值得整組記起來：<strong>Burndown chart、Sprint report、Epic report、Version report、Control chart，以及 Sprint Health 與 Burndown 這兩個 gadget</strong>。最直接的好處是 burndown 的 guideline 會在非工作日走平，團隊不會因為週末沒進度而被畫成落後。要記住這是<strong>每塊 board 各自的設定</strong>（包含時區在內），跨時區團隊要各自處理。","A":"Pie chart gadget 統計的是欄位的分佈比例，<strong>不涉及任何天數計算</strong>，所以不受影響。","B":"Two Dimensional Filter Statistics 是交叉統計表，<strong>同樣不涉及天數計算</strong>。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-working-days/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.5.3-021","sec":"620.5.3","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Darcy wants to know how long a single issue, or a group of issues, has spent in a particular workflow status. Which report should she open?","opts":["Burndown Chart","Control Chart","Cumulative Flow Diagram","Average Age Report"],"zh":"Darcy 想知道「某一張 issue，或一群 issue，在某個 workflow status 停留了多久」。該開哪張報表？","zo":["Burndown Chart","Control Chart","Cumulative Flow Diagram","Average Age Report"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"Burndown 看的是 sprint 還剩多少工作，<strong>沒有單張 issue 的停留時間</strong>。","B":"正解。Control Chart 的 Columns 只勾那個狀態，就是在算 issue 在該狀態待了多久；<strong>圖上每個點是一張 issue</strong>，點下去就能看單張。","C":"CFD 看的是各狀態的<strong>數量</strong>隨時間怎麼累積，用來找瓶頸，看不到某一張卡待了多久。","D":"Average Age 看的是未解決 issue 從建立到現在的平均天數，<strong>不分狀態</strong>。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-control-chart/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.5.3-022","sec":"620.5.3","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Darcy needs a report that includes both a chart and a table to confirm that the backlog is being kept up to date. It must show the total number of unresolved issues and the average number of days those issues have been unresolved. Which report should she choose?","opts":["Created vs Resolved Issues","Resolution Time Report","Average Age Report","Time Since Issues Report"],"zh":"Darcy 要一份「圖加表」的報表，確認 backlog 有在更新：要看得到未解決 issue 的總數，以及這些 issue 平均已經放了幾天。該選哪張？","zo":["Created vs Resolved Issues","Resolution Time Report","Average Age Report","Time Since Issues Report"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"Created vs Resolved 比較的是建立與解決的數量，<strong>沒有「平均放了幾天」</strong>。","B":"Resolution Time 看的是<strong>已解決</strong>的 issue 花多久解決，題目要的是<strong>未解決</strong>的。","C":"正解。Average Age 是長條圖加資料表，呈現<strong>未解決</strong> issue 的數量與平均年齡；官方說它用來看「backlog 有沒有保持更新」。","D":"Time Since 是依你選的日期欄位，統計每天有幾張被設定，跟「平均放多久」無關。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/generate-a-report/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.5.3-023","sec":"620.5.3","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A Scrum board has time tracking set to Remaining Estimate and Time Spent. Bailey adds a sub-task to an issue that is already in the active sprint. How does Jira handle this?","opts":["It is counted as a scope change and is shown on the Burndown chart.","It is counted as a scope change but is not shown on the Burndown chart.","It is not counted as a scope change but is shown on the Burndown chart.","It is not counted as a scope change and is not shown on the Burndown chart."],"zh":"Scrum board 開了 Remaining estimate and time spent。Bailey 在一張已經在 active sprint 裡的 issue 底下新增 sub-task，Jira 會怎麼處理？","zo":["算 scope change，Burndown 上也會顯示","算 scope change，但 Burndown 不顯示","不算 scope change，但 Burndown 會顯示","不算 scope change，Burndown 也不顯示"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"正解。官方的對照表：開了 Remaining estimate and time spent 時，sub-task 的時間會 roll-up 到 parent，所以<strong>既算 scope change，也畫在 Burndown 上</strong>。","B":"這是<strong>沒開</strong> Remaining estimate and time spent 時的行為：一樣算 scope change，但 Burndown 不會畫出這筆。","C":"中途加 sub-task <strong>一律算 scope change</strong>，不管 board 怎麼設定。","D":"同上，中途加入一定算 scope change。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-burndown-chart/"],"lvl":3,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.5.3-024","sec":"620.5.3","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Again, a sub-task is added to an issue in the active sprint, but this board does not have time tracking set to Remaining Estimate and Time Spent. What is the result?","opts":["It is counted as a scope change and is shown on the Burndown chart.","It is counted as a scope change but is not shown on the Burndown chart.","It is not counted as a scope change but is shown on the Burndown chart.","It is not counted as a scope change and is not shown on the Burndown chart."],"zh":"同樣是在 active sprint 的 issue 底下新增 sub-task，但這個 board 沒有開 Remaining estimate and time spent。結果是？","zo":["算 scope change，Burndown 上也會顯示","算 scope change，但 Burndown 不顯示","不算 scope change，但 Burndown 會顯示","不算 scope change，Burndown 也不顯示"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"這是<strong>有開</strong> Remaining estimate and time spent 時的行為。","B":"正解。官方原文：沒開時 sub-task 一樣被視為 scope change，<strong>但 Burndown 不會標出這筆</strong>；時間估計則在 sub-task 與 parent 各自記錄。","C":"中途加 sub-task 一律算 scope change。","D":"中途加 sub-task 一律算 scope change。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-burndown-chart/"],"lvl":3,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.5.3-025","sec":"620.5.3","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Which of the following reports can be opened on a Kanban board in a company-managed project?","opts":["Burnup Chart","Velocity Chart","Control Chart","Sprint Report"],"zh":"CMP 的 Kanban board 上，下列哪張報表打得開？","zo":["Burnup Chart","Velocity Chart","Control Chart","Sprint Report"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"Burnup 以 sprint 為單位，<strong>只有 Scrum board 有</strong>。","B":"Velocity 比較每個 sprint 的完成量，Kanban 沒有 sprint，所以沒有這張。","C":"正解。CMP 的 Kanban board 只有兩張報表：<strong>Control Chart 與 Cumulative Flow Diagram</strong>。","D":"Sprint Report 是 Scrum 專屬，拿來開 retro。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/generate-a-report/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.5.3-026","sec":"620.5.3","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Which of the following reports is NOT available on the Reports page of a team-managed software project?","opts":["Burnup","Velocity","Cumulative flow diagram","Control Chart"],"zh":"TMP 軟體團隊的 Reports 分頁裡，下列哪張報表「看不到」？","zo":["Burnup","Velocity","Cumulative flow diagram","Control Chart"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"TMP 有 Burnup（要開 Sprints 功能）。","B":"TMP 有 Velocity（要開 Sprints 功能）。","C":"TMP 有 CFD，而且不需要 Sprints 功能。","D":"正解。TMP 只有四張：Burnup、Sprint burndown、Velocity、CFD。<strong>Control Chart 只在 CMP</strong>，Epic 與 Version 系列也都沒有。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/enable-reports/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.5.3-027","sec":"620.5.3","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"In a team-managed project, the project administrator has already added Reports to the navigation, but the Burnup and Velocity reports cannot be found. What is the most likely cause?","opts":["The Sprints feature is not enabled.","Time tracking is not enabled.","The board is not a Kanban board.","Working days have not been configured."],"zh":"TMP 團隊的 space admin 已經把 Reports 加進導覽列，卻找不到 Burnup 和 Velocity。最可能的原因是？","zo":["沒有開 Sprints 功能","沒有開 time tracking","board 不是 Kanban","沒設 working days"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"正解。官方說明：Burnup、Velocity、Sprint burndown <strong>都需要開 Sprints 功能</strong>；TMP 的報表資料不足時根本不會出現。","B":"time tracking 跟這兩張報表無關；TMP 的縱軸看的是 Estimation 功能，沒開就用張數。","C":"方向相反：這兩張是 sprint 類報表，要的是 sprints，不是 Kanban。","D":"working days 是 CMP board 的設定，而且不會讓報表消失。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/enable-reports/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.5.3-028","sec":"620.5.3","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A manager wants to know whether the team is keeping up with incoming work: how many issues were created in each period, and how many of those have already been resolved. Which report shows this most directly?","opts":["Created vs Resolved Issues","Recently Created Issues","Resolution Time Report","Pie Chart Report"],"zh":"主管想知道「團隊跟不跟得上新進來的工作」：每一期新建立了多少，其中又已經解決了多少。哪張報表最直接？","zo":["Created vs Resolved Issues","Recently Created Issues","Resolution Time Report","Pie Chart Report"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"Created vs Resolved 是兩條線比較同期建立與解決的總量，看 backlog 淨增減；<strong>不會拆出「這期建立的有幾張解決了」</strong>。","B":"正解。Recently Created 一期一根長條，<strong>綠色段＝其中已解決、紅色段＝還沒解決</strong>，官方用途就是看團隊跟不跟得上進件。","C":"Resolution Time 看已解決的平均花多久，沒有建立量。","D":"Pie Chart 是依欄位分組的比例，沒有時間軸。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/generate-a-report/"],"lvl":3,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.5.3-029","sec":"620.5.3","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Of the two bars at the top of the Time Tracking Report, the Progress bar is longer than the Accuracy bar. What does this indicate?","opts":["The work is ahead of the original estimate.","The work is on track with the original estimate.","The work is behind the original estimate.","The report does not have enough data yet."],"zh":"Time Tracking Report 上方的兩條橫條中，Progress 比 Accuracy 長。代表什麼？","zo":["工作比原估超前","工作跟原估一樣","工作比原估落後","報表資料還不夠"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"超前的樣子是反過來的：<strong>Accuracy 比 Progress 長</strong>，灰色段代表原本高估的時間。","B":"準時的樣子是兩條一樣長，Accuracy 條整條藍色。","C":"正解。官方說明：Progress 比 Accuracy 長＝<strong>落後原估</strong>，灰色段是落後的時間。另外記得這張報表要開 time tracking，而且<strong>一定要有 Fix Version</strong>。","D":"資料不足會直接沒有資料，不會畫出長短不同的兩條。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/generate-a-report/"],"lvl":3,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.5.3-030","sec":"620.5.3","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A project manager wants to know how much work time each person has remaining before a particular version can be completed. Which report should be used?","opts":["User Workload Report","Version Workload Report","Workload Pie Chart Report","Version Report"],"zh":"PM 想知道某個版本要完成之前，每個人手上還剩多少工時。該用哪張報表？","zo":["User Workload Report","Version Workload Report","Workload Pie Chart Report","Version Report"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"User Workload 是以<strong>一個人</strong>為主角，跨 project 列他的工作量，不是以版本為主角。","B":"正解。Version Workload 以<strong>一個版本</strong>為主角，先列每人依 issue type 的彙總，再逐人列出，最後是未指派的。要開 time tracking。","C":"Workload Pie 是所有 assignee 的相對比例，沒有綁定版本。","D":"Version Report 是預測版本的 release 日，不是逐人的工時。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/generate-a-report/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.5.3-031","sec":"620.5.3","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A team estimates only in story points and does not use time estimates. However, the Workload Pie Chart Report is completely empty. What is the most likely cause?","opts":["It is calculated from time fields and does not use story points.","It accepts only a filter, not a project.","It can be generated only on a Scrum board.","It can display a maximum of 1,000 issues at a time."],"zh":"團隊只填 story points、沒有用時間估計。Workload Pie Chart 卻一片空白，最可能的原因是？","zo":["它依時間欄位計算，不看 story points","它只接受 filter，不接受 project","它只在 Scrum board 上開得出來","它一次最多只能顯示 1,000 筆"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"正解。Workload Pie 算的是<strong>剩餘工時</strong>，依賴 Original estimate、Time spent、Remaining 這些欄位，<strong>不看 story points</strong>；而且要開 time tracking。","B":"它 project 和 filter 都能用。","C":"Issue analysis 報表不綁 board 類型。","D":"1,000 筆上限是 Single Level Group By 與 Time Tracking Report 的限制。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/generate-a-report/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/add-and-customize-gadgets/"],"lvl":3,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.5.3-032","sec":"620.5.3","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Darcy wants to list the results of a filter grouped by Assignee and see the completion progress of each group. Which report should she use?","opts":["Pie Chart Report","Single Level Group By Report","Time Since Issues Report","Created vs Resolved Issues"],"zh":"Darcy 想把一個 filter 的搜尋結果依 Assignee 分組列出，並看到每一組的完成進度。該用哪張報表？","zo":["Pie Chart Report","Single Level Group By Report","Time Since Issues Report","Created vs Resolved Issues"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"Pie Chart 只有比例圖，<strong>不列出 issue、也沒有每組進度</strong>。","B":"正解。Single Level Group By 是<strong>表格</strong>：每組標題旁有進度條，底下列出 issue；只能用 filter，最多顯示 1,000 筆。","C":"Time Since 是依日期欄位畫長條，沒有分組。","D":"Created vs Resolved 是兩條趨勢線，沒有分組。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/generate-a-report/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.5.3-033","sec":"620.5.3","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"The Epic burndown uses the last three sprints to forecast how many more sprints are needed. Is the sprint currently in progress included in those three sprints?","opts":["Yes, always.","No, never.","Usually not, unless its completed work already exceeds the forecast.","Only after the sprint is more than halfway through."],"zh":"Epic Burndown 用「最近三個 sprint」預測還要幾個 sprint。目前進行中的 sprint 會被算進這三個嗎？","zo":["一律會算進去","一律不會算進去","通常不算，除非已經做超過預測","只有 sprint 過半才算"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"官方說目前的 sprint 通常不算，所以不是一律。","B":"有例外，所以不是一律不算。","C":"正解。官方原文：目前 sprint 通常不計入；<strong>例外是它的完成量已經超過預測量</strong>，這時才拿它當三個之一，柱子也會改成綠／藍色。","D":"官方沒有「過半」這個條件。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-epic-burndown-report/"],"lvl":3,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.5.3-034","sec":"620.5.3","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"When a user clicks Reports in a project, the Team overview dashboard (project insights) opens first. What is the scope of its data?","opts":["The currently selected board","The entire project","Only the viewer's own issues","The sprint currently in progress"],"zh":"在 space 點 Reports，先打開的 Team overview 儀表板（space insights），資料範圍是？","zo":["目前選的那個 board","整個 space","看的人自己的 issue","目前進行中的 sprint"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"這是<strong>傳統報表</strong>的範圍：Burndown、Velocity 這些要先確認選對 board。","B":"正解。官方說 space insights 用<strong>整個 space</strong> 的資料，不受選定的 board 或 board filter 限制。要看傳統報表得按 More reports；要跨多個 space 則改用 Jira dashboard。","C":"那是 Assigned to Me 這類 gadget 的邏輯。","D":"space insights 可以篩選，但範圍不只一個 sprint。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/generate-a-report/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/what-are-space-insights/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.5.3-035","sec":"620.5.3","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"In the board's Insights, under Issues for attention, when is an issue automatically marked as stuck?","opts":["When it has been in the same status for more than 7 days","When its time in the current status exceeds the 85th percentile for that status","When someone else has flagged it","When it has a Blocked by link"],"zh":"Board 上 Insights 的 Work items for attention，什麼情況會自動把 issue 標成 stuck？","zo":["在同一狀態超過 7 天","超過該狀態的第 85 百分位","被別人加了 Flag","有 Blocked by 連結"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"官方沒有固定天數的規則。","B":"正解。issue 在目前狀態停留的時間<strong>超過第 85 百分位</strong>，就自動標為 stuck。","C":"被 flag 的會出現在 <strong>Flagged</strong> 分頁，那是另一類。","D":"有 Blocked by 連結的會出現在 <strong>Blocked</strong> 分頁。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/understand-insights-on-the-board-in-company-managed-projects/"],"lvl":3,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.5.3-036","sec":"620.5.3","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Which of the following CANNOT be used as the Estimation statistic for the Velocity Chart in a company-managed project?","opts":["Story points","Original time estimate","A numeric custom field","A text custom field"],"zh":"下列哪一個「不能」當 CMP Velocity Chart 的 estimation statistic？","zo":["Story points","Original time estimate","數字型自訂欄位","文字型自訂欄位"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"story points 是最常見的選擇。","B":"可以用 original time（分鐘、小時、天、週）。","C":"官方寫明<strong>任何數字型自訂欄位</strong>都可以。","D":"正解。estimation statistic 要能加總，文字欄位沒辦法。可用的是 story points、original time、issue count，或任何數字型欄位。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-velocity-chart/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.5.3-037","sec":"620.5.3","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"The Control Chart shows several outliers. After investigating, you find that they are caused by human error: the issues were left in In Progress long after work on them had stopped. How does Atlassian recommend excluding them?","opts":["Delete those issues.","Add a label to them and exclude them with a quick filter.","Change the board filter.","Change the Working days setting."],"zh":"Control Chart 上有幾個離群點，查了之後發現是人為錯誤（卡在 In Progress 卻早就不做了）。官方建議怎麼把它們排除？","zo":["直接刪掉那幾張 issue","貼 label 再用 quick filter 排除","把 board filter 改掉","把 working days 改掉"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"刪 issue 會把紀錄一起毀掉，官方沒有這樣建議。","B":"正解。幫它們貼 label（例如 outlier），建一個 quick filter：<code>labels is EMPTY or labels not in (outlier)</code>，Control Chart 套用這個 quick filter 就好。","C":"改 board filter 會影響整個 board 上所有東西，範圍太大。","D":"working days 只影響非工作日怎麼算，排除不了特定 issue。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-control-chart/"],"lvl":3,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.5.3-038","sec":"620.5.3","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"The CFD currently shows To Do = 5, In Progress = 2, and Done = 1. If the card in Done is dragged back to To Do, what will the CFD show?","opts":["To Do 6, In Progress 2, Done 0","To Do 5, In Progress 1, Done 0","To Do 5, In Progress 2, Done 1","To Do 6, In Progress 1, Done 0"],"zh":"CFD 上目前 To Do＝5、In Progress＝2、Done＝1。這時把那張 Done 的卡拖回 To Do，CFD 會變成？","zo":["To Do 6、In Progress 2、Done 0","To Do 5、In Progress 1、Done 0","To Do 5、In Progress 2、Done 1","To Do 6、In Progress 1、Done 0"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"To Do 不會加 1：沒有新卡進來。","B":"正解。這是官方原文的例子：Done 與 In Progress 各扣 1，<strong>To Do 維持 5</strong>。累積圖不是只升不降，卡片往回走時下游的數字會減少。","C":"卡片確實移動了，數字一定會變。","D":"To Do 不會加 1。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-cumulative-flow-diagram/"],"lvl":3,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.5.2-018","sec":"620.5.2","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"During a sprint, someone adds an unestimated issue to the sprint. What happens to the Scope change percentage in the Sprint Health gadget?","opts":["It stays the same.","It increases.","It decreases.","It becomes 100%."],"zh":"Sprint 進行中，有人把一張「沒有估點」的 issue 加進 sprint。Sprint Health gadget 的 Scope change 百分比會怎樣？","zo":["不變","上升","下降","變成 100%"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"正解。Sprint Health 的 scope change 依 board 的 estimation statistic 計算；<strong>沒估點的 issue 加入或移出都不影響</strong>。","B":"要有估點才會讓 scope change 上升，例如 50 點的 sprint 加 5 點＝10%。","C":"移出有估點的 issue 才會影響，而且也是算進 scope change。","D":"不會有這種計算方式。"},"note":"","src":["https://confluence.atlassian.com/agile064/jira-agile-user-s-guide/using-the-jira-agile-gadgets/using-the-sprint-health-gadget"],"lvl":3,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.5.2-019","sec":"620.5.2","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A team estimates in story points, but the Sprint Burndown gadget on a dashboard displays hours on its vertical axis. What is the most likely cause?","opts":["The board's Time tracking is set to Remaining Estimate and Time Spent.","The gadget's source is set to a filter.","The dashboard is not shared with the team.","Working days have not been configured for the board."],"zh":"團隊用 story points 估點，但 dashboard 上的 Sprint Burndown gadget 縱軸顯示的卻是工時。最可能的原因是？","zo":["board 的 Time tracking 設成 Remaining estimate and time spent","gadget 的來源選成 filter","dashboard 沒有分享給團隊","board 沒設 working days"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"正解。Sprint Burndown gadget 的縱軸看 board 設定；<strong>Time tracking 設成 Remaining estimate and time spent 時會蓋過 estimation statistic</strong>。要看 story points，就把 Time tracking 設成 None。","B":"Sprint Burndown gadget 的來源是 board＋sprint，不是 filter。","C":"分享設定只影響誰看得到，不影響縱軸單位。","D":"working days 只影響非工作日，不影響單位。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira/kb/how-to-set-estimation-statistics-and-time-tracking-estimation-in-the-sprint-burndown-gadget/"],"lvl":3,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.5.2-020","sec":"620.5.2","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"You need to add a gadget to a dashboard that requires no source configuration and automatically lists the issues that are assigned to the current viewer and are currently in progress. Which gadget should you choose?","opts":["Assigned to Me","Issues in Progress","Filter Results","Two Dimensional Filter Statistics"],"zh":"dashboard 要放一個 gadget，「不用設定來源」，自動列出「指派給正在看的人、而且目前進行中」的 issue。該選哪個？","zo":["Assigned to Me","Issues in Progress","Filter Results","Two Dimensional Filter Statistics"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"Assigned to Me 列的是指派給我、<strong>所有還沒完成</strong>的 issue，不限於進行中。","B":"正解。Issues in Progress（Work items in Progress）只列指派給觀看者本人、<strong>進行中</strong>的 issue，不需要設定來源。","C":"Filter Results 要指定 filter，每個人看到的內容都一樣。","D":"Two Dimensional 是兩個欄位的交叉統計表。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/use-dashboard-gadgets/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.5.2-021","sec":"620.5.2","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Which two settings must be configured for the Road Map gadget?","opts":["Projects and Days","Board and Sprint","Filter and Statistic Type","Version and Assignee"],"zh":"Road Map gadget 要設定哪兩項？","zo":["Projects 與 Days","Board 與 Sprint","Filter 與 Statistic Type","Version 與 Assignee"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"正解。選 <strong>Projects</strong>（可多選或 All）與 <strong>Days</strong>（未來幾天內），它就列出這段期間內要 release 的版本，以及各版本的完成進度。","B":"Board 與 Sprint 是 Sprint Health、Sprint Burndown、Days Remaining 這類 sprint gadget 的設定。","C":"Filter 與 Statistic Type 是 Pie Chart、Issue Statistics 的設定。","D":"沒有 gadget 用這組設定。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/use-dashboard-gadgets/","https://confluence.atlassian.com/jira061/jira-user-s-guide/customizing-the-dashboard/adding-the-road-map-gadget"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.5.2-022","sec":"620.5.2","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Which of the following dashboard gadgets skips non-working days based on the board's Working days setting?","opts":["Sprint Health","Created vs Resolved","Pie Chart","Average Age"],"zh":"下列哪個 dashboard gadget 會依 board 的 working days 設定跳過非工作日？","zo":["Sprint Health","Created vs Resolved","Pie Chart","Average Age"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"正解。官方 working days 頁的 gadget 清單只有 <strong>Sprint Health 與 Burndown gadget</strong>。","B":"Created vs Resolved 依期間統計建立與解決，不看 board 的設定。","C":"Pie Chart 是欄位比例，不涉及天數。","D":"Average Age 不看 board 的 working days。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-working-days/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.5.2-023","sec":"620.5.2","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"The Average Number of Times in Status gadget shows that issues entered a particular status 2.8 times on average. What is the most reasonable interpretation?","opts":["Issues are frequently sent back to that status for rework.","Issues stay in that status for an average of 2.8 days.","That status contains an average of 2.8 issues.","The WIP limit for that status is 2.8."],"zh":"Average Number of Times in Status 顯示某個狀態平均進入了 2.8 次。最合理的解讀是？","zo":["工作在那個狀態常被退回重做","那個狀態平均停留 2.8 天","那個狀態平均有 2.8 張卡","那個狀態的 WIP limit 是 2.8"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"正解。這個 gadget 算的是<strong>進入次數</strong>；明顯大於 1，代表 issue 在那裡來回好幾次，通常是被退回重做。","B":"停留天數要看 <strong>Average Time in Status</strong>，是另一個 gadget。","C":"張數是 Issue Statistics 或 Pie Chart 的範疇。","D":"WIP limit 是 board column 的設定，不是這個 gadget 的輸出。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/use-dashboard-gadgets/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":0},{"id":"620.1.1-n01","sec":"620.1.1","dom":"620.1","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Which features are unavailable in team-managed projects? (Choose two.)","zh":"下列哪些功能在 team-managed project 裡無法使用？（選兩個）","zo":["建立自訂 issue type","在 issue type 加上 Affects versions 欄位","更改通知信的寄件者 email","加上 Fix versions 欄位","在 workflow transition 加上 screen"],"fig":"","opts":["Creating a custom issue type","Adding an Affects versions field to an issue type","Changing the notification sender email","Adding a Fix versions field","Adding a screen to a workflow transition"],"ans":"BE","why":{"A":"錯。TMP 的 project admin 可以在 Project settings → Issue types 直接建立自訂 issue type，不必找 Jira admin；這是 TMP 做得到的事。","B":"對。TMP 開了 Releases 功能也只有 Fix versions，沒有系統的 Affects versions 欄位；官方需求 JRACLOUD-85690 目前仍是 Gathering Interest、尚未實作。","C":"錯。TMP 的 project admin 可以在 Project settings → Notifications 設定通知信的寄件 email，每個 TMP 各自設定，所以這是做得到的。","D":"錯。Fix versions 在 TMP 做得到：開啟 Releases 功能後就能建立版本並使用 Fix versions。常見誤解：以為 TMP 完全沒有版本功能。","E":"對。考試版的 TMP 沒有 screen 這個設定物件，無法替 transition 掛 screen；Map a screen to a workflow transition 是 CMP 的做法。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>現行官方「Map a screen to a workflow transition」頁多了一句 TMP 可從 Space settings → Work types → Edit workflow 進入編輯；考試仍以「TMP 不能替 transition 加 screen」為準。","src":["https://jira.atlassian.com/browse/JRACLOUD-85690","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/map-a-screen-to-a-workflow-transition/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/customize-notifications-in-team-managed-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.1.1-n02","sec":"620.1.1","dom":"620.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Ruth, a Jira administrator at Coralis, wants all engineering projects to share the same workflow and permission rules, maintained centrally. Which project type fits?","zh":"Ruth 是 Coralis 公司的 Jira administrator，她希望所有工程類 project 共用同一套 workflow 與權限規則，並集中維護。哪一種 project 類型最適合？","zo":["Team-managed","兩種都可以，因為兩者都會共用 scheme","Company-managed","Team-managed，並使用 Open access level"],"fig":"","opts":["Team-managed","Either, because both share schemes","Company-managed","Team-managed with the Open access level"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。TMP 的設定長在每個 project 自己裡面，改動只影響該 project，無法讓多個 project 共用同一套 workflow 與權限。","B":"錯。只有 CMP 使用可共用的 scheme；TMP 沒有 scheme，每個 project 的 workflow 與權限都是各自獨立的設定。","C":"對。CMP 的 workflow、permission 等設定都是 scheme，Jira admin 改一次，所有套用同一 scheme 的 project 會一起變，正好符合跨 project 標準化、集中維護的需求。","D":"錯。Open access level 只是讓站上所有使用者自動取得 Member role，決定的是誰能進來，不會讓 workflow 或權限跨 project 共用。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/what-are-team-managed-and-company-managed-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.1.1-n03","sec":"620.1.1","dom":"620.1","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Which statements about team-managed projects are correct? (Choose two.)","zh":"下列關於 team-managed project 的敘述，哪些正確？（選兩個）","zo":["在 project 裡用 Create field 建立的 custom field，可以被其他 project 重複使用","支援 components","Project administrator 不需要 Jira administrator 就能修改 workflow","支援匿名的公開存取","設定只影響這個 project"],"fig":"","opts":["Custom fields created in the project with Create field can be reused by other projects","They support components","Project administrators can change the workflow without a Jira administrator","They support anonymous public access","Their settings affect only that project"],"ans":"CE","why":{"A":"錯。用 Create field 建的欄位只存在於這個 project，官方寫明不能被其他 project 重複使用。","B":"錯。官方寫明 Jira components 只在 company-managed project 提供，是 CMP 專屬功能；TMP 要分類只能改用 label 或自訂欄位。","C":"對。TMP 的 workflow 由擁有 Administrator role 的 project admin 在 Project settings 直接編輯，不需要 Jira admin 改 scheme；這正是 TMP「團隊自主」的設計。","D":"錯。官方寫明 TMP 目前無法開放匿名存取；要讓未登入的人也看得到，官方建議請 Jira admin 改建 company-managed project。","E":"對。TMP 的 issue type、欄位、workflow、權限都屬於這個 project 自己，改了不會波及其他 project；相對地，CMP 改 scheme 會影響所有共用它的 project。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>現行 TMP 可以加入 Jira admin 建立的全站欄位，但 TMP 自己建的欄位仍不能共用。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/what-are-team-managed-and-company-managed-projects/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/customize-an-issues-fields-in-team-managed-projects/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/what-are-jira-components/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/next-gen-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.1.2-n04","sec":"620.1.2","dom":"620.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"The team-managed project HARBOR uses the Open access level. Tomás, who has Jira product access, is added to the project with only the Viewer role. What can Tomás do?","zh":"team-managed project HARBOR 使用 Open access level。Tomás 有 Jira 的產品存取權，被加入 project 時只指派了 Viewer role。Tomás 能做什麼？","zo":["只能檢視 issue，因為指派的 role 會取代 Member","只能在 issue 上留言","什麼都不能做，因為 Viewer role 會覆蓋 access level","建立、編輯並轉換 issue 狀態"],"fig":"","opts":["View issues only, because the assigned role replaces Member","Only comment on issues","Nothing, because the Viewer role overrides the access level","Create, edit, and transition issues"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。額外指派的 role 是疊加、不會取代 access level 給的 role；Open 下 Member 是地板，指派 Viewer 無法把權限往下調。常見誤解：以為指派 Viewer 就變唯讀。","B":"錯。Viewer 本身能留言、加附件，但 Tomás 同時還有 Open 給的 Member，疊加後能做的遠比留言多。要讓人只能看，應先把 access 改成 Limited。","C":"錯。Role 只會疊加、不會覆蓋，Viewer 不會抵銷 Open 給的 Member；而且 Viewer 本身也能瀏覽與留言，不是什麼都不能做。","D":"對。Open 會自動給站上每位使用者 Member role，額外指派的 Viewer 是疊加上去、不會取代它；Tomás 有 Jira 產品存取，所以能建立、編輯、轉換 issue。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/manage-how-people-access-your-team-managed-project/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/next-gen-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.1.2-n05","sec":"620.1.2","dom":"620.1","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Omar sets the access level of the team-managed project WAVE to Limited. What can site users who were not added to WAVE do? (Choose two.)","zh":"Omar 把 team-managed project WAVE 的 access level 設為 Limited。沒有被加入 WAVE 的站台使用者能做什麼？（選兩個）","zo":["建立 issue","檢視 issue","轉換 issue 狀態","新增留言","修改 project 設定"],"fig":"","opts":["Create issues","View issues","Transition issues","Add comments","Change project settings"],"ans":"BD","why":{"A":"錯。建立 issue 需要 Create work items 權限，Member 以上的 role 才有；Limited 給的是 Viewer，官方寫明他們不能建立新 issue。","B":"對。Limited 會自動給每位登入站台的使用者 Viewer role，Viewer 可以搜尋與檢視這個 project 的 issue；只有 Private 才會讓沒被加入的人完全看不到。","C":"錯。轉換狀態屬於 Work on issues 這類權限，Member 才有；Limited 下未被加入的人只有 Viewer，無法移動 issue 的 status。","D":"對。官方對 Limited 的描述是站台使用者可以 view and comment，Viewer role 預設就有 Add comments 與 Add attachments。常見誤解：以為 Viewer 是純唯讀。","E":"錯。修改 project 設定需要 Administrator role 才有的 Administer project 權限；Viewer 與 Member 都沒有，Limited 更不會給。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/next-gen-permissions/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/manage-how-people-access-your-team-managed-project/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.1.2-n06","sec":"620.1.2","dom":"620.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Joaquín is added as a Member to the team-managed project RIVET. He can view issues but cannot edit them. What is the most likely cause?","zh":"Joaquín 以 Member 身分被加入 team-managed project RIVET，他能檢視 issue 卻無法編輯。最可能的原因是什麼？","zo":["Member 本來就不能編輯 issue","Joaquín 沒有 Jira 的產品存取權","這個 project 是 Private","Joaquín 需要 Browse Projects 權限"],"fig":"","opts":["Members cannot edit issues","Joaquín does not have product access to Jira","The project is Private","Joaquín needs the Browse Projects permission"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。官方寫明 Member 可以建立、編輯、留言並轉換 issue 狀態，是團隊的主力 role；問題不在 role 本身的權限。","B":"對。Member 的建立、編輯、轉換等權限需要 Jira 產品存取（授權席次）才能完整生效；沒有席次的人只能像 Viewer 一樣瀏覽。只有 site admin 能授予產品存取。","C":"錯。Private 只決定沒被加入的人看不到 project；Joaquín 已被加入為 Member，會取得 Member 的全部權限，不受 Private 影響。","D":"錯。TMP 沒有另外授予的 Browse Projects；被加入的人會自動取得 Browse space 與 View work items。而且他已看得到 issue，瀏覽不是問題。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/manage-how-people-access-your-team-managed-project/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/next-gen-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.1.3-n07","sec":"620.1.3","dom":"620.1","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Hana, the scrum master for project KOI, is teaching new team members how sub-tasks behave. Which two statements should she include? (Choose two.)","zh":"Hana 是 project KOI 的 scrum master，正在教新成員 sub-task 的特性。她應該講哪兩個敘述？（選兩個）","zo":["Sub-task 上的 story points 會計入 velocity chart","Sub-task 會繼承 parent 的 sprint","Sub-task 會繼承 parent 的 components","Sub-task 會繼承 parent 的 fix version","Sub-task 會繼承 parent 的 issue security level"],"fig":"","opts":["Story points on sub-tasks are included in the velocity chart","A sub-task inherits its parent's sprint","A sub-task inherits its parent's components","A sub-task inherits its parent's fix version","A sub-task inherits its parent's issue security level"],"ans":"BE","why":{"A":"錯。官方 Velocity chart 頁寫明 sub-task 的估計值不計入計算，只算 parent 的估計值；所以團隊應該在 standard issue 層級估點。","B":"對。官方寫明 sub-task 會從 parent 繼承 project、security level 與 sprint（software project）；sub-task 不能單獨排進 sprint，一定跟 parent 同進同出。","C":"錯。Components 不在繼承清單內，官方只列 project、security level 與 sprint；sub-task 的 components 要自己設。","D":"錯。Fix version 不在繼承清單內（官方只列 project、security level、sprint），sub-task 要自己設。常見誤解：parent 有 fix version，sub-task 就自動跟著。","E":"對。Sub-task 建立時會繼承 parent 的 issue security level，可見範圍與 parent 一致；要調整誰看得到，應該去改 parent 的 security level。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/create-an-issue-and-a-sub-task/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-velocity-chart/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.1.3-n08","sec":"620.1.3","dom":"620.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Rafael, a Jira administrator at Quillon, wants to prevent stories in the company-managed project QUILL from moving to Done until all their sub-tasks are done. What should he configure?","zh":"Rafael 是 Quillon 公司的 Jira administrator，他想讓 company-managed project QUILL 的 story 在所有 sub-task 完成前無法被移到 Done。他應該設定什麼？","zo":["用 automation rule 轉換 parent 的狀態","在 sub-task 的 workflow 加上要求填 resolution 的 validator","在 story 的 Done transition 加上 Sub-task Blocking Condition","在 story 的 Done transition 加上會結掉未完成 sub-task 的 post function"],"fig":"","opts":["An automation rule that transitions the parent","A validator on the sub-task workflow that requires a resolution","A Sub-task Blocking Condition on the story's Done transition","A post function on the story's Done transition that resolves open sub-tasks"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。Automation rule 是事件發生後自動去做事，例如 sub-task 全完成時幫 parent 轉 Done；它只能事後補動作，無法事前阻止別人手動轉換 story。","B":"錯。這個 validator 掛在 sub-task 的 workflow 上，只檢查 sub-task 自己轉換時有沒有填 resolution；它管不到 story 的 transition，story 仍可先被移到 Done。","C":"對。Sub-task Blocking Condition 會依 sub-task 的狀態擋住 parent 的 transition；條件不成立時按鈕根本不會出現，使用者事前就無法把 story 移到 Done。","D":"錯。Post function 在 transition 完成之後才執行，只能事後處理；就算它去結掉 sub-task，story 也已經被移到 Done，無法事前阻止。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-advanced-issue-workflows/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.1.3-n09","sec":"620.1.3","dom":"620.1","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Emeka, a Jira administrator, is asked to add issue types to the company-managed project DELTA. In which two situations is a new issue type justified? (Choose two.)","zh":"Emeka 是 Jira administrator，有人請他在 company-managed project DELTA 新增 issue type。哪兩種情況值得建立新的 issue type？（選兩個）","zo":["團隊只是想標記需求的來源","團隊想評定嚴重程度","這類工作要走不同的 workflow","這類工作在建立時需要不同的必填欄位","團隊想在 sprint 內把工作分給多人"],"fig":"","opts":["The team only wants to tag the source of a request","The team wants to rate severity","The work follows a different workflow","The work needs different required fields on creation","The team wants to split work among people in a sprint"],"ans":"CD","why":{"A":"錯。只是標記來源屬於分類需求，用 component 或 label 就夠了；多建 issue type 反而讓 scheme 變複雜，也不會帶來不同行為。","B":"錯。評定嚴重程度是一種屬性，用 Priority 或自訂的 select list 欄位即可；不需要為每個嚴重度建一個 issue type。","C":"對。CMP 的 workflow scheme 以 issue type 為單位對應 workflow，要讓某類工作走自己的流程，就需要一個獨立的 issue type 來對應。","D":"對。欄位的顯示與必填可以依 issue type 分別設定（field configuration 或 field scheme），需要不同必填欄位時，拆成新的 issue type 才能分開控制。","E":"錯。在 sprint 內把一張工作拆給多人，應該用 sub-task；sub-task 會跟 parent 同進同出 sprint，不必新建 standard issue type。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-issue-workflow-schemes/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/change-the-way-fields-behave-for-different-work-types/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/what-are-issue-types/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.1.4-n10","sec":"620.1.4","dom":"620.1","type":"multi","n":3,"stem":"Lucía is the project administrator of the company-managed project MAPLE. On the project's Details page, which details can she update? (Choose three.)","zh":"Lucía 是 company-managed project MAPLE 的 project administrator。在這個 project 的 Details 頁，她可以修改哪些資料？（選三個）","zo":["Project key","Project 名稱","Default assignee（預設經辦人）","Project category","Avatar（頭像）"],"fig":"","opts":["Project key","Project name","Default assignee","Project category","Avatar"],"ans":"BCE","why":{"A":"錯。Project key 雖然也在 Details 頁，但官方寫明只有 organization、site、Jira admin 能改；CMP 的 project admin 看到的欄位是灰的。","B":"對。Name 屬於 project 的外觀資料，有 Administer Projects 權限的 project admin 可以在 Details 頁直接修改；改名後，站上 filter 裡的名稱也會自動更新。","C":"對。Default assignee 可由 project admin 在 Details 頁修改，但只有 Unassigned 或 Project lead 兩種值；想指定某人，要先把他設成 project lead。","D":"錯。Category 由 Jira admin 建立，CMP 要指派 category 時官方要求找 Jira admin。常見誤解：以為 project admin 能在 Details 頁自己選。","E":"對。Avatar 是 project 的外觀，project admin 可以在 Details 頁選內建圖示或上傳自己的圖；它會顯示在側欄與 project 清單裡。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/edit-a-projects-details/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/add-assign-and-delete-project-categories/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.1.4-n11","sec":"620.1.4","dom":"620.1","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. Nadia, the project administrator of the team-managed project DT, opens the Details page shown. Which two statements are correct? (Choose two.)","zh":"請參考附圖。Nadia 是 team-managed project DT 的 project administrator，她打開了圖中的 Details 頁。下列哪兩個敘述正確？（選兩個）","zo":["Nadia 可以為 project 設定 URL","Nadia 可以撰寫 project 描述（description）","更改 key 會讓所有既有連結失效","Nadia 可以更改 key","Nadia 可以選擇由 Jira administrator 建立的 category"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 372\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Details\"><rect x=\"0.5\" y=\"0.5\" width=\"379\" height=\"371\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"380\" height=\"34\" rx=\"0\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"34\" width=\"106\" height=\"338\" rx=\"0\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><line x1=\"106\" y1=\"34\" x2=\"106\" y2=\"372\" class=\"gl\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Project settings</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Details</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Name</text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"95\" width=\"250\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"128\" y=\"113\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Design Team</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"144\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Key</text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"150\" width=\"250\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"128\" y=\"168\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">DT</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"199\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Category</text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"205\" width=\"250\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"128\" y=\"223\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Marketing</text><path d=\"M350,216 l5,5 l5,-5\" class=\"ln ink\" style=\"stroke-width:1.6\"/><text x=\"118\" y=\"254\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Default assignee</text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"260\" width=\"250\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"128\" y=\"278\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Unassigned</text><path d=\"M350,271 l5,5 l5,-5\" class=\"ln ink\" style=\"stroke-width:1.6\"/><text x=\"118\" y=\"309\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s tf-violet\" style=\"font-weight:700\">Signed in as Nadia (Administrator role)</text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"322\" width=\"46.0\" height=\"26\" rx=\"6\" class=\"fl-brand\"/><text x=\"141.0\" y=\"339\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"w\">Save</text><rect x=\"6\" y=\"39\" width=\"94\" height=\"22\" rx=\"6\" class=\"sf-brand\"/><text x=\"14\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Details</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"80\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Access</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"106\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Features</text></svg>","opts":["Nadia can set a URL for the project","Nadia can write a project description","Changing the key breaks all existing links","Nadia can change the key","Nadia can select a category created by a Jira administrator"],"ans":"DE","why":{"A":"錯。Project URL 是連到外部文件的欄位，官方寫明只有 company-managed project 才有；TMP 的 Details 頁只有 Name、Key、Category 等欄位，沒有 URL 可填。","B":"錯。Description 目前只有 CMP 有，TMP 加描述的需求 JSWCLOUD-17584 仍是 Gathering Interest，圖上也沒有這個欄位。常見誤解：以為 TMP 的 Details 和 CMP 一樣。","C":"錯。改 key 後舊 key 會存成 previous key，舊連結仍會導向新 key；只有刪掉 previous key，引用舊 key 的連結才會失效。","D":"對。TMP 的 key 由 project admin 自己在 Details 頁修改，不必找 Jira admin；這和 CMP 只能由 org、site、Jira admin 改 key 正好相反。","E":"對。Category 要由 Jira admin 先建立，但 TMP 的 project admin 可以自己在 Details 頁的 Category 下拉選單挑一個指派；CMP 則要請 Jira admin 代為指派。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>現行 UI 把 Project settings 改叫 Space settings，TMP 的 Details 另外列了 Space owner；本題選項沒有用到這個欄位，答案不受影響。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/create-edit-and-delete-team-managed-projects/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/edit-a-projects-details/","https://jira.atlassian.com/browse/JSWCLOUD-17584"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.1.4-n12","sec":"620.1.4","dom":"620.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Aiko, a Jira administrator, changes the key of the company-managed project ORCHID from ORC to ORH. A Confluence page still links to ORC-12. What happens when a user opens that link?","zh":"Aiko 是 Jira administrator，她把 company-managed project ORCHID 的 key 從 ORC 改成 ORH。某個 Confluence 頁面仍然連到 ORC-12。使用者打開這個連結時會發生什麼事？","zo":["出現找不到頁面的錯誤","以唯讀模式開啟 ORC-12","要等 board filter 重建後才能用","導向 ORH-12"],"fig":"","opts":["It returns a not-found error","It opens ORC-12 in read-only mode","It works only after the board filter is recreated","It redirects to ORH-12"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。改 key 時舊 key ORC 會自動存成 previous key，指向 ORC-12 的連結不會失效；要等有人刪掉 previous key，舊連結才會壞。常見誤解：把「改 key」和「刪 previous key」搞混。","B":"錯。Jira 沒有「用舊 key 唯讀開啟」這種模式；issue 本身已經變成 ORH-12，ORC 只是保留下來的 previous key，打開後就是一般的 ORH-12。","C":"錯。舊 key 會自動存成 previous key，使用舊 key 的連結、filter、查詢會繼續運作，所以不必重建。官方仍要求之後把 board filter 等查詢更新成新 key，以免日後刪除 previous key 時失效。","D":"對。改 key 後每張 issue 都換成新前綴，ORC-12 變成 ORH-12；舊 key 自動存成 previous key，所以 Confluence 上指向 ORC-12 的連結仍會帶到 ORH-12。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/edit-a-projects-details/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.1.4-n13","sec":"620.1.4","dom":"620.1","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Ingrid, a Jira administrator, moves the company-managed project FERN to the trash. Which statements are correct? (Choose two.)","zh":"Ingrid 是 Jira administrator，她把 company-managed project FERN 移到了 trash。下列哪些敘述正確？（選兩個）","zo":["Project admin 可以還原它","Jira administrator 可以在 60 天內還原它","它的 issue 仍然搜尋得到","60 天後會被永久刪除","它的 issue 仍可透過直接連結編輯"],"fig":"","opts":["The project admin can restore it","A Jira administrator can restore it within 60 days","Its issues remain searchable","It is permanently deleted after 60 days","Its issues can still be edited through direct links"],"ans":"BD","why":{"A":"錯。官方寫明從 trash 還原需要 Administer Jira 全域權限；project admin 只有 Administer Projects 這個 project 權限，無法還原 company-managed project。","B":"對。從 trash 還原需要 Administer Jira 全域權限，Jira admin 在 60 天內可以到 Settings → Projects → Trash 還原；但 Jira admin 也可能提早永久刪除，所以不是保證。","C":"錯。Project 在 trash 期間，它的 issue 不會出現在基本或進階搜尋結果中；要等 project 還原後，issue 才會重新出現在搜尋結果裡。","D":"對。Project 連同 issue、components、附件、versions 會在 trash 保留 60 天，期滿後永久刪除、無法復原；期間內 Jira admin 也可以提早永久刪除。","E":"錯。Project 在 trash 期間，issue 仍可用直接連結開啟，但只能讀、不能編輯，要還原後才能修改。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/trash-for-jira-cloud-projects/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/restore-a-project-from-trash/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.4.1-n14","sec":"620.4.1","dom":"620.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Beatriz, a support manager, wants a weekly email listing overdue issues in project HELIX, without changing any issues. What is the simplest option?","zh":"Beatriz 是客服主管，她想每週收到一封列出 project HELIX 逾期 issue 的 email，而且不修改任何 issue。最簡單的做法是什麼？","zo":["Workflow post function","Filter subscription","Bulk change","Board sub-filter"],"fig":"","opts":["A workflow post function","A filter subscription","Bulk change","A board sub-filter"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。Post function 掛在 workflow transition 上，要有人轉換狀態才會執行，通常用來改欄位；它不會照排程寄出清單，還得先動 workflow 設定，不是最簡單的做法。","B":"對。把逾期條件存成 filter 後，在 Details → New subscription 設定收件人與每週排程，Jira 就會定期寄出結果；它只寄通知、不改 issue，最符合需求。","C":"錯。Bulk change 是人手一次修改、轉換、搬移或刪除多張 issue 的工具，會改動 issue，而且不會定期寄出任何 email。","D":"錯。Sub-filter 是 company-managed Kanban board 用來再篩選 board 上要顯示哪些 issue 的設定，只影響 board 顯示、不會影響報表，也不會寄 email。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/manage-filters/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.4.1-n15","sec":"620.4.1","dom":"620.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Farida needs to set the Resolution of 300 bugs in project LUMEN to Won't Fix. Bulk edit does not list the field. What should she do?","zh":"Farida 需要把 project LUMEN 裡 300 張 bug 的 Resolution 改成 Won't Fix，但 bulk edit 沒有列出這個欄位。她該怎麼做？","zo":["把 Resolution 加到 edit screen，再用一次 bulk edit","請 Jira administrator 授予 Make bulk changes 權限","改用 bulk transition，在轉換時設定 Resolution","把 bug 拆成每批 100 張以內，再重試 bulk edit"],"fig":"","opts":["Add Resolution to the edit screen, then use bulk edit again","Ask a Jira administrator to grant the Make bulk changes permission","Use a bulk transition and set Resolution during the transition","Split the bugs into batches of 100 or fewer and retry bulk edit"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。官方把 Resolution 列為 bulk edit 不能用的系統欄位，這是固定限制，跟 edit screen 放不放這個欄位無關；改了 screen，bulk edit 還是不會列出它。","B":"錯。Make bulk changes 是進入 bulk change 的全域權限；Farida 已經進到 bulk edit，代表她有這個權限，問題出在 Resolution 本身不能批次編輯。","C":"對。官方寫明要改 Resolution 請用 Bulk Workflow Transitions：選一個會設定 Resolution 的 transition，在轉換畫面填入 Won't Fix，300 張一次處理完。","D":"錯。Bulk change 一次上限是 1,000 張 issue，300 張本來就在範圍內；分批也改變不了 Resolution 不能用 bulk edit 修改的限制。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/edit-multiple-issues-at-the-same-time/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.4.1-n16","sec":"620.4.1","dom":"620.4","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Tariq, a team lead at Veltro, plans to clean up about 800 stale issues with bulk change. Which statements are correct? (Choose two.)","zh":"Tariq 是 Veltro 公司的 team lead，他打算用 bulk change 清掉大約 800 張停滯的 issue。下列敘述哪些正確？（選兩個）","zo":["只能在單一 project 內使用","一定會寄出 email 通知，而且無法關閉","一次最多可以修改 1,000 張 issue","可以編輯 Summary 欄位","需要全域的 Make bulk changes 權限"],"fig":"","opts":["It only works within a single project","It always sends email notifications, and this cannot be turned off","Up to 1,000 issues can be changed at once","It can edit the Summary field","It requires the global Make bulk changes permission"],"ans":"CE","why":{"A":"錯。Bulk change 可以一次選取跨多個 project 的 issue；只有少數欄位（例如 Components、Fix versions）要求選到的 issue 屬於同一個 project。","B":"錯。執行 bulk change 時可以取消勾選 Send mail for this update，避免一次發出大量通知；所以通知並不是一定寄出、無法關閉。","C":"對。官方寫明一次最多只能編輯 1,000 張 issue；Tariq 的 800 張在上限內，超過時就要分批，或先用 JQL 把範圍縮小。","D":"錯。Summary 在官方「無法批次編輯」的系統欄位清單中，同一清單還有 Description 與 Resolution；Summary 只能逐張修改。","E":"對。Make bulk changes 是全域權限，缺了它就不能 bulk change；此外還要有每個 project 對應動作的權限，例如搬移要 Move Issues。常見誤解：以為它是 project 權限。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/edit-multiple-issues-at-the-same-time/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/what-are-global-permissions-and-what-do-they-do/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.4.1-n17","sec":"620.4.1","dom":"620.4","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Yusuf, a Jira administrator, is explaining workflow transitions to new project administrators. Which statements about conditions, validators, and post functions are correct? (Choose two.)","zh":"Yusuf 是 Jira administrator，正在向新的 project administrator 說明 workflow transition。下列關於 condition、validator 與 post function 的敘述，哪些正確？（選兩個）","zo":["Validator 在 transition 之後執行，用來更新欄位","Condition 不成立時會把 transition 藏起來","Post function 會把按鈕藏起來","Post function 在 transition 之後執行，用來更新 issue","Condition 只在使用者送出後才檢查輸入內容"],"fig":"","opts":["A validator runs after the transition to update fields","A condition hides the transition when it is not met","A post function hides the button","A post function runs after the transition to update the issue","A condition checks input only after the user submits"],"ans":"BD","why":{"A":"錯。Validator 是在 transition 執行之前檢查使用者輸入是否有效，不通過就擋下；在 transition 之後更新欄位的是 post function。","B":"對。Condition 決定使用者能不能執行這個 transition；不成立時，issue 畫面上根本看不到這個 transition 按鈕，使用者事前就被擋下。","C":"錯。把按鈕藏起來是 condition 的工作；post function 在轉換完成後才執行，不會影響按鈕顯不顯示。","D":"對。Post function 在 transition 完成之後執行額外處理，例如設定 Resolution、指派給 reporter；它不擋人，只負責事後自動做事。","E":"錯。官方寫明 condition 不能驗證使用者在 transition 畫面輸入的參數；送出後檢查輸入內容的是 validator。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-advanced-issue-workflows/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.4.2-n18","sec":"620.4.2","dom":"620.4","type":"multi","n":4,"stem":"Wen, a Jira administrator, is creating an automation rule in the global automation settings. Which scopes can she select? (Choose four.)","zh":"Wen 是 Jira administrator，正在全域 automation 設定裡建立一條 automation rule。她可以選哪些 scope？（選四個）","zo":["Multiple issue types","Single project","Multiple projects","Single board","Project type","Global"],"fig":"","opts":["Multiple issue types","Single project","Multiple projects","Single board","Project type","Global"],"ans":"BCEF","why":{"A":"錯。Scope 沒有 issue type 選項；要只對某些 issue type 生效，要加 Issue fields condition，例如 Issue type = Bug。常見誤解：以為 scope 能選 issue type。","B":"對。Single project 讓 rule 只在一個指定的 project 執行，也是 project admin 在 Project settings → Automation 建立 rule 時唯一能用的 scope。","C":"對。Multiple projects 讓 rule 在自選的幾個 project 執行，適合少數 project 共用同一條 rule；建立這種跨 project 的 rule 需要 Jira admin。","D":"錯。Scope 的單位是 project、project 類型或全站，沒有以 board 為單位的 scope；要限定範圍可以改用 JQL condition 篩選。","E":"對。Project type 讓 rule 套用到某一類型的所有 project，例如全部 software、service 或 business project 其中一類；這種 scope 需要 Jira admin 設定。","F":"對。Global 讓 rule 在站上所有 Jira project 執行，不必逐一挑選；官方寫明 Global scope 只能由 Jira admin（app admin）設定。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>現行文件把 rule 改稱 flow，scope 另外多了 Single team、Multi-team（給 Operations 團隊用），不在考試範圍。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/what-are-rule-details-in-atlassian-automation/","https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/permissions-required-for-jira-cloud-automation-rules/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.4.2-n19","sec":"620.4.2","dom":"620.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Chidi's rule in project NOVA is triggered when a story is transitioned to Done, and then a branch runs for each sub-task. Inside the branch, which smart value refers to the story?","zh":"Chidi 在 project NOVA 的 rule 會在 story 轉到 Done 時觸發，接著用 branch 對每個 sub-task 各跑一次。在 branch 裡，哪個 smart value 指的是這張 story？","zo":["{{issue}}","{{triggerIssue}}","{{createdIssue}}","{{lookupIssues}}"],"fig":"","opts":["{{issue}}","{{triggerIssue}}","{{createdIssue}}","{{lookupIssues}}"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。{{issue}} 指的是目前這一輪正在處理的 issue；在 sub-task branch 裡，它代表當下這張 sub-task，而不是觸發 rule 的 story。","B":"對。{{triggerIssue}} 永遠指向最初觸發 rule 的那張 issue，官方說明它就是在 branch 裡使用的；所以在 sub-task branch 裡要引用 story 時用它。","C":"錯。{{createdIssue}} 指的是這次 rule 用 Create issue 等 action 最近建立的那張 issue，與觸發 rule 的 story 無關。","D":"錯。{{lookupIssues}} 是 Lookup issues action 用 JQL 查回來的 issue 清單（最多 100 筆），不是觸發 rule 的那張 story。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/jira-smart-values-issues/","https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/jira-automation-branches/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.4.2-n20","sec":"620.4.2","dom":"620.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Marisol's rule in project TERRA runs, but the audit log shows “No actions performed”. What does this mean?","zh":"Marisol 在 project TERRA 的 rule 執行了，但 audit log 顯示「No actions performed」。這代表什麼？","zo":["Actor 缺少權限","這條 rule 已停用","這條 rule 陷入迴圈","有 condition 沒有成立"],"fig":"","opts":["The actor lacks permission","The rule is disabled","The rule hit a loop","A condition was not met"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。Actor 權限不足時，audit log 會出現錯誤並附上 Actor does not have permission 之類的訊息，而不是 No actions performed。","B":"錯。停用的 rule 根本不會被觸發，audit log 也就不會有新的執行紀錄，更不會出現 No actions performed 這種執行結果。","C":"錯。Rule 在短時間內互相觸發太多次會被中止，狀態標成 LOOP；No actions performed 則是 condition 不符，兩者是不同狀態。","D":"對。No actions performed 表示 rule 被觸發、也跑了，但 condition 判斷不成立，後面的 action 被跳過；這不是錯誤，應該回頭檢查 condition 或 JQL 條件。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/what-is-the-automation-audit-log/","https://support.atlassian.com/automation/kb/a-rule-fails-with-the-error-no-fields-or-field-values-to-edit-for-issues/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira/kb/automation-error-actor-does-not-have-permission-to-view/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.4.2-n21","sec":"620.4.2","dom":"620.4","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Leilani is a project administrator for PORT. The project lead is Mateo. She edits a rule's actor. Which actors can she choose? (Choose two.)","zh":"Leilani 是 PORT 的 project administrator，project lead 是 Mateo。她編輯一條 rule 的 actor。她可以選哪些 actor？（選兩個）","zo":["站上任何使用者","Project lead Mateo","她自己","某位 Jira administrator","Automation for Jira"],"fig":"","opts":["Any user on the site","Mateo, the project lead","Herself","A Jira administrator","Automation for Jira"],"ans":"CE","why":{"A":"錯。只有 Jira admin（全域或 app admin）才能把 actor 設成任意使用者；project admin 沒有這個能力，只能選自己或 Automation for Jira。","B":"錯。Mateo 是另一個人，把 actor 設成別人需要 Jira admin（app admin）的權限；Leilani 只是 project admin，不能把 actor 設成 project lead。","C":"對。官方寫明 project admin 只能把 actor 設成自己或 Automation for Jira；設成自己後，rule 做的修改會在 History 顯示為 Leilani 做的。","D":"錯。把 actor 設成某位 Jira admin 也屬於「選別人」，只有 Jira admin 才能這樣設定；project admin 無法借用 Jira admin 的身分執行 rule。","E":"對。Automation for Jira 是預設 actor，project admin 隨時可以把 actor 設回它；它不是真人帳號，靠 add-ons role 取得 project 權限。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/what-is-a-rule-actor/","https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/run-jira-rules-as-another-user/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.4.3-n22","sec":"620.4.3","dom":"620.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Olumide notices that an automation rule in project BRISK shows LOOP in the audit log. What is the likely cause, and what should be checked first?","zh":"Olumide 發現 project BRISK 的一條 automation rule 在 audit log 顯示 LOOP。最可能的原因是什麼？應該先檢查什麼？","zo":["Rule 互相重複觸發；檢查 Allow rule trigger","Rule 超過每月用量；購買更多額度","有 condition 沒有成立；檢查 JQL","Actor 被刪除；更換 owner"],"fig":"","opts":["Rules trigger each other repeatedly; check Allow rule trigger","The rule exceeded monthly usage; buy more","A condition was not met; check the JQL","The actor was deleted; change the owner"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。LOOP 表示 rule 在短時間內觸發自己或其他 rule 達 10 次而被中止；先檢查哪些 rule 勾了 Allow rule trigger，或加 condition 打斷互相觸發的連鎖。","B":"錯。每月用量和服務上限是兩回事；LOOP 是 loop detection 這個服務上限觸發的狀態，買更多額度解決不了 rule 互相觸發的連鎖。","C":"錯。Condition 不成立時，audit log 的狀態是 No actions performed，不是 LOOP；檢查 JQL 無法解決 rule 互相觸發的問題。","D":"錯。Actor 出問題通常會出現權限錯誤；而 owner 只是接收錯誤通知信的人，改 owner 不會改變 rule 以誰的身分執行，也解不了迴圈。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/automation-service-limits/","https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/what-are-rule-details-in-atlassian-automation/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.4.3-n23","sec":"620.4.3","dom":"620.4","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Keanu, a project administrator for GLACIER, is troubleshooting a rule that stopped updating issues. Which statements about the automation audit log are correct? (Choose two.)","zh":"Keanu 是 GLACIER 的 project administrator，正在排查一條不再更新 issue 的 rule。下列關於 automation audit log 的敘述，哪些正確？（選兩個）","zo":["Rule 失敗時，它是第一個該檢查的地方","被 throttle 的執行會計入用量","No actions performed 代表 rule 失敗了","紀錄保留 90 天","只有 Jira administrator 看得到"],"fig":"","opts":["It is the first place to check when a rule fails","Throttled executions count toward usage","No actions performed means the rule failed","Entries are kept for 90 days","It is only available to Jira administrators"],"ans":"AD","why":{"A":"對。官方 Debug an automation flow 頁的第一步就是檢查 audit log：看有沒有錯誤訊息、有沒有執行紀錄，再比對 issue 的 History 找出問題。","B":"錯。官方用量說明寫明，沒有任何步驟真正執行的 THROTTLED 執行不計入 automation 用量；THROTTLED 代表超過服務上限。","C":"錯。No actions performed 表示 rule 有被觸發，只是 condition 不成立所以沒做事，屬於正常結果，不是失敗；真正失敗會顯示錯誤狀態。","D":"對。官方寫明 audit log 只保存最近 90 天的活動，較舊的紀錄會自動刪除、無法復原；需要長期留存時要另外自己保存。","E":"錯。Audit log 不只 Jira admin 能看；project admin 也能看自己 project 裡單一 rule 或整個 project 的 audit log，Jira admin 則另外能看全站。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/what-is-the-automation-audit-log/","https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/debug-an-automation-rule/","https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/how-is-my-usage-calculated/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.4.3-n24","sec":"620.4.3","dom":"620.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Sven's rule in project KITE edits the Priority of new bugs. It fails with a permission error only on bugs that have a security level set. What is the most likely cause?","zh":"Sven 在 project KITE 的 rule 會修改新 bug 的 Priority。它只在設了 security level 的 bug 上出現權限錯誤而失敗。最可能的原因是什麼？","zo":["Rule actor 看不到該 security level 的 issue","Rule owner 不在該 security level 的名單內","觸發 rule 的使用者缺少 Edit Issues 權限","Rule scope 必須是 Global 才能編輯有 security level 的 issue"],"fig":"","opts":["The rule actor cannot see issues at that security level","The rule owner is not in the security level","The trigger user lacks the Edit Issues permission","The rule scope must be Global to edit secured issues"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。Rule 的動作都以 actor 的身分執行；issue 有 security level 時，actor 也必須在該 level 允許的名單內才看得到、改得動，否則出現權限錯誤。沒設 level 的 bug 不受影響，正好符合症狀。","B":"錯。Owner 只是 rule 的負責人，執行出錯時收到 email 通知；rule 執行時檢查的是 actor 的權限，owner 在不在 security level 裡都不影響。","C":"錯。建立 bug 的人只是觸發 rule；實際編輯 Priority 的是 actor，檢查的也是 actor 的權限。而且觸發者缺權限不會只在有 security level 的 bug 上出錯。","D":"錯。Scope 決定 rule 在哪些 project 執行；這條 rule 已在 KITE 正常處理沒設 level 的 bug，改成 Global 也解決不了 security level 擋住 actor 的問題。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/what-is-a-rule-actor/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira/kb/automation-error-actor-does-not-have-permission-to-view/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.1-n01","sec":"620.2.1","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Lucía's support team in project HELPDK pulls requests as they arrive, does not plan work in fixed iterations, and wants to measure the cycle time of each request. Which board type fits best?","zh":"Lucía 的支援團隊在 project HELPDK 裡隨到隨做，不以固定的迭代規劃工作，並且想衡量每一筆請求的 cycle time。哪一種 board 類型最適合？","zo":["開啟 Sprints 功能的 team-managed Scrum board","以 saved filter 建立的跨 project Scrum board","company-managed Scrum board","company-managed Kanban board"],"fig":"","opts":["A team-managed Scrum board with sprints enabled","A cross-project Scrum board based on a saved filter","A company-managed Scrum board","A company-managed Kanban board"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。Team-managed board 開了 Sprints 功能，就是以 sprint 為單位規劃工作，和 company-managed Scrum 一樣是固定迭代，不符合「隨到隨做、不排迭代」。","B":"錯。用 saved filter 建的跨 project board 仍然是 Scrum board，工作要排進 sprint；這個團隊只有一個 project、也不排迭代，跨 project 的能力用不上。","C":"錯。Scrum board 以固定長度的 sprint 規劃一批工作，適合有迭代節奏的團隊；這個團隊隨到隨做、不排迭代，硬套 sprint 只會多一層負擔。","D":"對。Kanban 是連續流，工作隨到隨拉，不需要 sprint。它的 Control chart 會顯示每張 issue 的 cycle time（從開始做到完成花了多久），正好回答「每筆請求要多久」。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/what-are-the-project-templates/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-control-chart/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.1-n02","sec":"620.2.1","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A team creates a new Scrum board and says the board shows no issues, although the backlog has many. What is the most likely reason?","zh":"某個團隊建了一塊新的 Scrum board，回報說 board 上一張 issue 都沒有，但 backlog 裡明明有很多。最可能的原因是什麼？","zo":["還沒設定 working days","board 的 filter 沒有 ORDER BY Rank","還沒有開始任何 sprint","團隊缺少 Browse Projects 權限"],"fig":"","opts":["The working days are not configured","The board filter has no ORDER BY Rank","No sprint has been started","The team lacks Browse Projects"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。Working days 只影響 burndown、sprint report 等報表與 gadget 怎麼跳過非工作日，和 board 上顯示哪些 issue 無關。","B":"錯。缺 ORDER BY Rank 會讓卡片拖不動、也建不了 sprint，但不會讓已經撈到的 issue 從 board 上消失。","C":"對。Scrum board 的 Active sprints 只顯示「在 active sprint 裡」、status 有對到 column、又符合 saved filter 的 issue。還沒開始 sprint 時，工作全留在 backlog，board 自然是空的。","D":"錯。Browse Projects 決定看不看得到 project 的 issue；真的缺這個權限，連 backlog 也會看不到，和題目說 backlog 有很多 issue 矛盾。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/use-active-sprints/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/use-your-scrum-backlog/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.1-n03","sec":"620.2.1","dom":"620.2","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Ngozi runs two teams on one company-managed Scrum board in project KESTREL and wants to use parallel sprints. Which statements are correct? (Choose two.)","zh":"Ngozi 在 project KESTREL 的同一塊 company-managed Scrum board 上帶兩個團隊，想使用 parallel sprints。哪些敘述正確？（選兩個。）","zo":["由 Jira administrator 在 Jira configuration 開啟這個功能","可以一次完成所有 active sprint","Velocity Chart 會分別顯示每個團隊的 velocity","要先選定一個 sprint，Complete sprint 按鈕才會出現","只有 team-managed project 支援 parallel sprints"],"fig":"","opts":["A Jira administrator enables the feature in Jira configuration","All active sprints can be completed at once","The Velocity Chart shows velocity separately for each team","A sprint must be selected before Complete sprint appears","Only team-managed projects support parallel sprints"],"ans":"AD","why":{"A":"對。開啟 parallel sprints 需要 Administer Jira 權限，路徑是 Settings → Jira apps → Jira configuration 裡的開關。它是全站設定，board admin 或 project admin 無法在自己的 board 上打開。","B":"錯。常見誤解：以為能一次完成全部。Active sprints 裡有多個 sprint 時，要先從下拉選單選一個，Complete sprint 才會出現，一次只能完成一個。","C":"錯。官方列出的限制正是 Velocity Chart 不會按團隊顯示 velocity，並假設各團隊估算方式相同。圖上仍是每個 sprint 一組長條，只是不分團隊。","D":"對。官方 Complete a sprint 說明：Active sprints 裡有多個 sprint 時，要先選其中一個，Complete Sprint 按鈕才會出現。所以平行的 sprint 只能一個一個完成。","E":"錯。官方的 parallel sprints 說明頁就是寫給 company-managed project 的；team-managed 後來也支援，但啟用方式不同，所以「只有 TMP 支援」不成立。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/use-parallel-sprints/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/what-are-parallel-sprints/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/complete-a-sprint/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.1-n04","sec":"620.2.1","dom":"620.2","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Keanu's company-managed Kanban board for project DRIFT still uses the default sub-filter, and its Done column holds two months of cards. Which actions clear them from the board? (Choose two.)","zh":"Keanu 在 project DRIFT 的 company-managed Kanban board 仍使用預設的 sub-filter，Done 欄累積了兩個月的卡片。哪些做法可以把它們從 board 上清掉？（選兩個。）","zo":["把「Hide completed work items older than」設為 2 weeks","等 14 天讓它自動清除","替 Done 欄設定 column constraint 的最大值","Release 這些已完成 issue 所屬的 version","Complete sprint（完成 sprint）"],"fig":"","opts":["Set “Hide completed work items older than” to 2 weeks","Wait 14 days for automatic clearing","Set a maximum column constraint on the Done column","Release a version that the done issues belong to","Complete the sprint"],"ans":"AD","why":{"A":"對。Hide completed work items older than 可選 1、2、4 週，在 Done 類別 status、而且最後一次更新已超過設定時間的卡會自動隱藏（完成後再編輯任何欄位，計時會重來）。資料沒有刪除，只是不顯示在 board 上。","B":"錯。「Done 滿 14 天自動清除」是沒開 Sprints 的 team-managed board 的行為；company-managed Kanban 不會自己清，要靠 release 或 Hide completed。","C":"錯。Column constraint 只在超過上限時把欄頭變紅提醒，官方明說它不影響欄裡顯示幾張 issue，卡片不會因此消失。","D":"對。官方 KB 說預設的 Kanban sub-filter 會移除 Fix version 已 release 的 issue（DC 文件列出預設條件是 <code>fixVersion in unreleasedVersions() OR fixVersion is EMPTY</code>）。Version 一 release，這些卡就從 board 消失。","E":"錯。Complete sprint 是 Scrum board 清掉完成工作的方式：最右欄的 issue 算完成並離開 board。Kanban board 沒有 sprint，根本沒有這個按鈕可按。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/add-a-sub-filter-to-a-company-managed-kanban-board/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira/kb/kanban-board-shows-or-hides-completed-work-unexpectedly-in-jira-cloud/","https://confluence.atlassian.com/jirasoftwareserver/configuring-filters-938845268.html","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/what-is-a-jira-software-board/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-columns/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.1-n05","sec":"620.2.1","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. What happens after the Backlog status is dragged into the Kanban backlog panel?","zh":"請看圖。把 Backlog 這個 status 拖進 Kanban backlog 面板之後，會發生什麼事？","zo":["Backlog 狀態的 issue 留在第一欄，但不能再排序","Backlog 狀態的 issue 在 board 與 JQL 搜尋結果中都被藏起來","Backlog 狀態的 issue 可以在 board 上排進 sprint","Backlog 狀態的 issue 移到獨立的 backlog 畫面，離開 board"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 170\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Columns\"><rect x=\"0.5\" y=\"0.5\" width=\"379\" height=\"169\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"380\" height=\"34\" rx=\"0\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"34\" width=\"106\" height=\"136\" rx=\"0\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><line x1=\"106\" y1=\"34\" x2=\"106\" y2=\"170\" class=\"gl\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Board settings</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Columns</text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"78\" width=\"58\" height=\"66\" rx=\"7\" class=\"bx amber\"/><text x=\"124\" y=\"93\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:11.5px\">Kanban…</text><rect x=\"123\" y=\"114\" width=\"48\" height=\"18\" rx=\"4\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><text x=\"128\" y=\"127\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Backl…</text><rect x=\"182\" y=\"78\" width=\"58\" height=\"66\" rx=\"7\" class=\"bx plain\"/><text x=\"188\" y=\"93\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:11.5px\">Select…</text><rect x=\"187\" y=\"114\" width=\"48\" height=\"18\" rx=\"4\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><text x=\"192\" y=\"127\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Selec…</text><rect x=\"246\" y=\"78\" width=\"58\" height=\"66\" rx=\"7\" class=\"bx brand\"/><text x=\"252\" y=\"93\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:11.5px\">In Pro…</text><rect x=\"251\" y=\"114\" width=\"48\" height=\"18\" rx=\"4\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><text x=\"256\" y=\"127\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">In Pr…</text><rect x=\"310\" y=\"78\" width=\"58\" height=\"66\" rx=\"7\" class=\"bx green\"/><text x=\"316\" y=\"93\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:11.5px\">Done</text><rect x=\"315\" y=\"114\" width=\"48\" height=\"18\" rx=\"4\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><text x=\"320\" y=\"127\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Done</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">General</text><rect x=\"6\" y=\"65\" width=\"94\" height=\"22\" rx=\"6\" class=\"sf-brand\"/><text x=\"14\" y=\"80\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Columns</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"106\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Swimlanes</text></svg>","opts":["Backlog issues stay in the first column but can no longer be ranked","Backlog issues are hidden from both the board and JQL search results","Backlog issues can now be planned into sprints on the board","Backlog issues move to a separate backlog screen and leave the board"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。開了 Kanban backlog 後，Backlog 狀態的 issue 不會留在 board 第一欄，而是移到 Backlog 畫面；在那裡照樣可以拖曳排序，再拖到下一欄開始做。","B":"錯。Kanban backlog 只是換個地方顯示這些 issue，資料完整保留；它們仍在 board 的 Backlog 畫面裡，用 JQL 搜尋也照樣找得到。","C":"錯。Kanban backlog 不會帶來 sprint。Sprint 只屬於 Scrum board；Kanban board 開了 backlog 仍是連續流，工作一張張從 backlog 拉進下一欄。","D":"對。把 status 拖進 Kanban backlog 面板就是啟用 Kanban backlog。對到這個面板的 issue 改在獨立的 Backlog 畫面建立與排序，board 上只留下正在進行的工作。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-columns/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/use-your-kanban-backlog/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.1-n06","sec":"620.2.1","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Yusuf, the project administrator of project QUARRY, is asked to switch the team's existing company-managed Kanban board to Scrum. What should he do?","zh":"Yusuf 是 project QUARRY 的 project administrator，團隊要他把現有的 company-managed Kanban board 改成 Scrum。他該怎麼做？","zo":["在 Board settings &gt; General 修改 board 類型","用同一個 saved filter 另建一塊 Scrum board","在 Kanban board 的 Columns 設定裡開啟 sprint","請 Jira administrator 幫忙轉換這塊 board"],"fig":"","opts":["Change the board type in Board settings &gt; General","Create a new Scrum board using the same saved filter","Enable sprints in the Kanban board's Columns settings","Ask a Jira administrator to convert the board"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。Board settings 的 General 頁可以改名稱、saved filter、location 等，但沒有「board 類型」選項。官方功能建議單 JRACLOUD-86355（原 JSWCLOUD-6656）仍在 Future Consideration，代表目前做不到。","B":"對。官方建議單 JRACLOUD-86355（原 JSWCLOUD-6656）仍在 Future Consideration，代表 board 類型目前不能互轉。但 board 內容由 saved filter 決定，用同一份 filter 另建 Scrum board，就能看到同一批 issue。","C":"錯。Columns 頁管的是 column 與 status 的對應、column constraint 和 Kanban backlog，沒有開 sprint 的選項；sprint 只存在於 Scrum board。","D":"錯。這不是權限問題。轉換 board 類型還只是建議單 JRACLOUD-86355（原 JSWCLOUD-6656），Jira administrator 一樣沒有這個功能，最後還是得用 filter 另建一塊 Scrum board。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/create-a-board-based-on-filters/","https://jira.atlassian.com/browse/JRACLOUD-86355"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.2-n07","sec":"620.2.2","dom":"620.2","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"A user copies a board. Which statements are correct? (Choose two.)","zh":"一位使用者複製（copy）了一塊 board。哪些敘述正確？（選兩個。）","zo":["複製 board 需要 Administer Jira 權限","新 board 使用和原 board 相同的 filter","系統會自動建立一份 filter 的副本","執行複製的使用者會成為新 board 的 administrator","副本在另外分享之前都是私人的"],"fig":"","opts":["Copying requires the Administer Jira permission","The new board uses the same filter as the original board","A new copy of the filter is created automatically","The user who copies the board becomes an administrator of the new board","The copy is private until it is shared separately"],"ans":"BD","why":{"A":"錯。Administer Jira 是全站管理權限。官方複製 board 的步驟只是在 Boards 清單選 Copy，並沒有列出這個權限前提。","B":"對。官方原文：新 board 會以和原 board 相同的 filter 為基礎。常見誤解：以為 Copy board 會連 filter 一起複製；其實兩塊 board 共用同一份，改 filter 兩邊一起變。","C":"錯。Copy board 不會產生新的 filter。要讓副本有獨立範圍，得自己把 filter 用 Save as 另存一份，再到副本的 Board settings 換過去。","D":"對。官方說執行複製的人會成為新 board 的 administrator，可以改 columns、swimlanes 等 board 設定；但如果 filter 不是他建立的，他可能改不動那份 filter。","E":"錯。Board 沒有自己的分享設定，誰看得到 board 取決於 filter 分享給誰。副本沿用同一份已分享的 filter，所以不是私人的。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/copy-an-existing-board/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/create-a-board-based-on-filters/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.2-n08","sec":"620.2.2","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Mateo has Browse Projects in project FERN, but he cannot open Chiara's board, which shows issues from FERN and MOSS. What is the most likely cause?","zh":"Mateo 在 project FERN 有 Browse Projects 權限，卻打不開 Chiara 那塊同時顯示 FERN 與 MOSS issue 的 board。最可能的原因是什麼？","zo":["Mateo 在 FERN 缺少 Manage Sprints 權限","board 的 saved filter 沒有分享給 Mateo","Mateo 不在這塊 board 的 administrator 名單上","board 的 location 設在 project MOSS"],"fig":"","opts":["Mateo lacks the Manage Sprints permission in FERN","The board's saved filter is not shared with Mateo","Mateo is not listed as an administrator of the board","The board location is set to project MOSS"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。Manage Sprints 管的是建立、開始、完成 sprint 等 sprint 操作；只是打開 board 瀏覽卡片不需要它，缺了也不會讓 board 打不開。","B":"對。Board 沒有自己的分享設定，官方說 board 對「能存取該 filter 的所有使用者」開放。filter 沒分享給他，就算有 project 權限也打不開 board。","C":"錯。Board administrator 是管理 board 設定的角色；只是檢視 board 不需要是 admin，只要看得到它用的 filter 就行。","D":"錯。Location 只決定 board 掛在哪個 project 底下、由哪個 project 的 admin 管理，不會限制誰能打開 board。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/create-a-board-based-on-filters/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/manage-filters/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.2-n09","sec":"620.2.2","dom":"620.2","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Jonas builds a board whose saved filter includes projects NOVA and PIKE. Which capabilities remain limited to a single project? (Choose two.)","zh":"Jonas 建了一塊 saved filter 同時包含 NOVA 與 PIKE 的 board。哪些功能仍然只能限於單一 project？（選兩個。）","zo":["Card colors","Versions","Swimlanes","Quick filters","Simplified workflow（直接在 board 上新增 status）"],"fig":"","opts":["Card colors","Versions","Swimlanes","Quick filters","Simplified workflow (adding statuses from the board)"],"ans":"BE","why":{"A":"錯。Card colors 是 board 層級設定，依 issue type、priority、assignee 或 query 上色，套用到 board 上所有卡片，不分 project。","B":"對。Version 屬於各自的 project，兩個 project 就算有同名 version 也是兩個不同物件。官方說跨 project 的 release 只能在 Plans 裡規劃，無法存回 project。","C":"錯。Swimlane 是 board 層級的設定，對 board 上所有 issue 都有效；跨 project board 還能選 Projects 方式，一個 project 一條 lane。","D":"錯。Quick filter 屬於 board 本身，寫一條 JQL 就能套用到 board 上所有 project 的 issue，跨 project 照樣可用。","E":"對。官方列出 simplified workflow 的前提：board 的 filter 只能包含一個 project，而且該 project 所有 issue type 共用一個 workflow。跨 project board 不符合，所以不能在 board 上直接加 status。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/how-do-single-project-and-cross-project-releases-differ/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/use-the-simplified-workflow/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-swimlanes/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/customize-cards/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.2-n10","sec":"620.2.2","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A product manager has Manage Sprints only in Project A. The sprint contains issues from Projects A and B. What happens when she tries to start the sprint?","zh":"一位產品經理只在 Project A 有 Manage Sprints 權限，而這個 sprint 同時包含 Project A 與 Project B 的 issue。她嘗試開始這個 sprint 時會怎樣？","zo":["無法開始，因為所有相關 project 都需要 Manage Sprints","可以開始，但只會納入 Project A 的 issue","無法開始，因為只有 Jira administrator 能開始跨 project 的 sprint","可以開始，因為她在其中一個 project 有 Manage Sprints"],"fig":"","opts":["It fails, because Manage Sprints is needed in all related projects","It starts, but only Project A's issues are included","It fails, because only Jira administrators can start cross-project sprints","It starts, because she has Manage Sprints in one project"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。官方：要更新含多個 project 工作的 sprint，使用者必須在 issue 所在的每個 project 都有 Manage Sprints。開始、完成 sprint 都受這條規則限制。","B":"錯。Jira 不會把 sprint 拆開、只放一個 project 的 issue；sprint 是一個整體，權限不夠就整個動作失敗。","C":"錯。Jira admin 確實能管理任何 sprint，但不是「只有」他能；在每個相關 project 都有 Manage Sprints 的一般使用者也能開始。","D":"錯。只在一個 project 有權限不夠。官方說 sprint 含有多個 project 的工作時，要在所有相關 project 都有 Manage Sprints 才能更新這個 sprint。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/how-permissions-interact-with-each-other/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/space-access-and-configuration-permissions/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira/kb/cant-complete-the-sprint/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.2-n11","sec":"620.2.2","dom":"620.2","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Leilani creates a company-managed board and sets its location to project CORAL. What does this location control? (Choose two.)","zh":"Leilani 建了一塊 company-managed board，把 location 設為 project CORAL。這個 location 決定哪些事？（選兩個。）","zo":["board 列在哪個 project 的側欄","board 上顯示哪些 issue","哪個 project 的 administrator 能管理這塊 board","board 的 estimation statistic","哪些使用者看得到這塊 board"],"fig":"","opts":["Which project's sidebar lists the board","Which issues appear on the board","Which project administrators can manage the board","The board's estimation statistic","Which users can see the board"],"ans":"AC","why":{"A":"對。建立 board 時要選一個 project 或個人 profile 當 location，board 就掛在那個 project 底下，從它的側欄找得到。location 掛在停用的 project 時，要重新指定才找得回來。","B":"錯。Board 顯示哪些 issue 完全由 saved filter 的 JQL 決定；location 只是掛的位置，換 location 不會改變 board 上的卡片。","C":"對。官方設定頁寫明，能改 board 設定的是 board admin，或 board location 所在 project 的 admin。所以 location 決定哪個 project 的 admin 能管這塊 board。","D":"錯。Estimation statistic 決定 velocity、burndown 用什麼單位，是在 Board settings 的 Estimation 頁另外設定的（只有 company-managed Scrum board 有），和 location 無關。","E":"錯。誰看得到 board 由 filter 的分享設定決定；board 本身沒有分享設定，location 也不控制可見度。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/change-the-location-of-a-board/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-filters/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/create-a-board-based-on-filters/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.3-n12","sec":"620.2.3","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"When a sprint is completed, issues in the Cancelled status are moved to the next sprint instead of being treated as done. What should be fixed?","zh":"完成 sprint 時，Cancelled 狀態的 issue 被帶到下一個 sprint，而不是被當成已完成。應該修正什麼？","zo":["把 Cancelled 加進 board filter","把 column constraint 改成 Issue count","把 Cancelled 對到 board 最右邊的 column","替 Cancelled 的 issue 設定 resolution"],"fig":"","opts":["Add Cancelled to the board filter","Change the column constraint to Issue count","Map Cancelled to the rightmost column of the board","Set a resolution on Cancelled issues"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。這些 issue 會被帶到下一個 sprint，表示它們本來就在 board filter 的範圍內；問題出在 column 對應，不在 filter。","B":"錯。Column constraint 是 WIP 上下限的提醒，只會讓欄頭變色；選 Issue count 只是改計數方式，不影響 sprint 完成時的判定。","C":"對。官方：Jira 只把 board 最右欄的 issue 視為完成。Cancelled、Blocked 這類代表結束的 status 沒放最右欄，就會被當成未完成，完成 sprint 時被帶到下一個 sprint。","D":"錯。Resolution 影響搜尋時算 resolved 還是 unresolved；但 Scrum board 完成 sprint 時只看 issue 是否在最右欄，有沒有 resolution 不改變判定。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-columns/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/complete-a-sprint/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.3-n13","sec":"620.2.3","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. Issues in the Blocked status cannot be found on the board, but a JQL search returns them. Why?","zh":"請看圖。Blocked 狀態的 issue 在 board 上找不到，但用 JQL 搜尋找得到。為什麼？","zo":["Blocked 沒有對到任何 column","Blocked 超過了 column constraint","Blocked 的 issue 被 quick filter 藏起來了","Blocked 屬於 Done 這個 status category"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 221\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Columns\"><rect x=\"0.5\" y=\"0.5\" width=\"379\" height=\"220\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"380\" height=\"34\" rx=\"0\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"34\" width=\"106\" height=\"187\" rx=\"0\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><line x1=\"106\" y1=\"34\" x2=\"106\" y2=\"221\" class=\"gl\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Board settings</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Columns</text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"78\" width=\"79\" height=\"66\" rx=\"7\" class=\"bx plain\"/><text x=\"124\" y=\"93\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:11.5px\">To Do</text><rect x=\"123\" y=\"114\" width=\"69\" height=\"18\" rx=\"4\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><text x=\"128\" y=\"127\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">To Do</text><rect x=\"203\" y=\"78\" width=\"79\" height=\"66\" rx=\"7\" class=\"bx brand\"/><text x=\"209\" y=\"93\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:11.5px\">In Progre…</text><text x=\"209\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s tf-rose\" style=\"font-weight:700\">≤3</text><rect x=\"208\" y=\"114\" width=\"69\" height=\"18\" rx=\"4\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><text x=\"213\" y=\"127\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">In Progr…</text><rect x=\"289\" y=\"78\" width=\"79\" height=\"66\" rx=\"7\" class=\"bx green\"/><text x=\"295\" y=\"93\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:11.5px\">Done</text><rect x=\"294\" y=\"114\" width=\"69\" height=\"18\" rx=\"4\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><text x=\"299\" y=\"127\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Done</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"169\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Unmapped statuses</text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"175\" width=\"61.6\" height=\"20\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx rose\"/><text x=\"148.8\" y=\"189\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:11.5px\">Blocked</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">General</text><rect x=\"6\" y=\"65\" width=\"94\" height=\"22\" rx=\"6\" class=\"sf-brand\"/><text x=\"14\" y=\"80\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Columns</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"106\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Swimlanes</text></svg>","opts":["Blocked is not mapped to any column","Blocked exceeds the column constraint","Blocked issues are hidden by the quick filter","Blocked is in the Done status category"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。圖中 Blocked 在 Unmapped statuses。官方：沒對到 column 的 status，其 issue 在 board 與 backlog 都會被藏起來，但搜尋不受影響。修法是把它拖進某一欄。","B":"錯。Column constraint 超過上限只會讓欄頭變紅，官方說它不影響欄裡顯示的 issue 數；何況圖中只有 In Progress 設了上限 3。","C":"錯。Quick filter 確實能暫時藏卡，但圖上的設定明確顯示 Blocked 在 Unmapped statuses，這才是它完全不出現的原因。","D":"錯。Status category 影響的是 Kanban 的 Hide completed 怎麼判定完成；不論屬於哪個類別，status 沒對到 column 就不會顯示，圖中問題在對應。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-columns/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.3-n14","sec":"620.2.3","dom":"620.2","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Farida administers the company-managed boards for project SABLE and plans to add column constraints. Which statements are correct? (Choose two.)","zh":"Farida 管理 project SABLE 的 company-managed board，打算加上 column constraint。哪些敘述正確？（選兩個。）","zo":["超過最大值時欄頭會變紅","只計算套用 quick filter 後看得到的 issue","只有 team-managed board 才有","Scrum board 和 Kanban board 都可以設定","column 滿了之後會阻止使用者再把 issue 拖進去"],"fig":"","opts":["The column header turns red when the maximum is exceeded","They count only issues visible after quick filters","They are only available on team-managed boards","They can be set on both Scrum and Kanban boards","They stop users from moving an issue into a full column"],"ans":"AD","why":{"A":"對。官方：超過最大值時欄頭變紅，未達最小值時變黃。設定的數值顯示在 column 頂端，但不影響欄裡顯示幾張 issue。","B":"錯。這個選項把顯示和計數混在一起了。官方寫明 constraint 算的是整欄的 issue 總數，不管有沒有被 quick filter 藏起來，所以篩選後看到的數字可能比計數少。","C":"錯。Company-managed board 在 Board settings → Columns 本來就有 column constraint，而且能設上下限；team-managed board 反而只能從 column 選單設上限。","D":"對。官方說 column constraint 是 Kanban 的核心，但在 Scrum 也很好用，能及早看出瓶頸、調整 sprint 範圍。常見誤解：以為 Scrum board 不能設。","E":"錯。Column constraint 只是視覺提醒：超過上限欄頭變紅、低於下限變黃，卡片照樣拖得進去，不會被擋下。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>考試與現行官方文件都是 team-managed board 只能設上限；Atlassian 已在 Community 公告 team-managed board 將開放同時設最小值與最大值，上線後以新文件為準。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-columns/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/manage-columns-with-multiple-statuses-in-a-team-managed-project/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.3-n15","sec":"620.2.3","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Bruno's team needs WIP limits with both a minimum and a maximum for each board column. Which project type supports this?","zh":"Bruno 的團隊需要每個 board column 都能設定 WIP 的最小值與最大值。哪一種 project 支援？","zo":["兩者都不支援；Jira 只能設最大值","Company-managed","Team-managed","Company-managed 與 team-managed 都支援"],"fig":"","opts":["Neither; Jira supports only maximum limits","Company-managed","Team-managed","Both company-managed and team-managed"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。Company-managed board 的 column constraint 明確提供最小值與最大值兩個輸入框，並不是只能設最大值。","B":"對。Company-managed board 在 Board settings → Columns 可替每欄填最小值與最大值，未達最小值欄頭變黃、超過最大值變紅，Scrum 與 Kanban 都適用。","C":"錯。Team-managed board 從 column 選單的 Set column limit 只能設最大值，超過時 column 變色，沒有最小值。常見誤解：記成 TMP 完全不能設。","D":"錯。兩種 project 都能設 WIP limit，但只有 company-managed 同時有上下限；team-managed 只能設上限，所以「兩者都支援最小值與最大值」不成立。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>考試與現行官方文件都是 team-managed board 只能設上限；Atlassian 已在 Community 公告 team-managed board 將開放同時設最小值與最大值，上線後以新文件為準。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-columns/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/manage-columns-with-multiple-statuses-in-a-team-managed-project/","https://community.atlassian.com/forums/Jira-articles/Upcoming-Changes-to-Software-Boards-in-Team-Managed-Spaces/ba-p/3240014"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.3-n16","sec":"620.2.3","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"On a Kanban board with “Hide completed work items older than 2 weeks”, a card completed three months ago suddenly reappears. What is the most likely reason?","zh":"某塊 Kanban board 設了「Hide completed work items older than 2 weeks」，一張三個月前就完成的卡突然又出現了。最可能的原因是什麼？","zo":["board filter 少了 ORDER BY Rank","working days 被修改了","有人編輯了這張 issue，重設了完成計時","Done 欄的 column constraint 最大值被超過了"],"fig":"","opts":["The board filter lost its ORDER BY Rank","Working days were changed","Someone edited the issue, which reset the completed timer","The maximum column constraint on the Done column was exceeded"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。ORDER BY Rank 管的是能不能拖曳排序；少了它卡片拖不動，但不會改變哪些已完成的卡被隱藏。","B":"錯。Working days 是給 Burndown、Control Chart 等報表與兩個 gadget 用的設定，官方清單裡沒有 board 的顯示或隱藏，和卡片重新出現無關。","C":"對。官方 KB：任何欄位的編輯（例如 Description、Fix version）都會重設「完成」計時。卡片會重新出現，直到又超過 2 週才再被藏起來。","D":"錯。Column constraint 超過上限只會讓欄頭變紅，官方說它不影響欄裡顯示的 issue 數量，不會讓被隱藏的卡重新出現。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira/kb/kanban-board-shows-or-hides-completed-work-unexpectedly-in-jira-cloud/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-columns/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-working-days/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.4-n17","sec":"620.2.4","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Hamid needs one board that shows issues from projects ARC, BLT, and CRV and automatically hides issues resolved as Won't Fix more than 48 hours ago. Which setup meets this?","zh":"Hamid 需要一塊 board 顯示 ARC、BLT、CRV 三個 project 的 issue，並自動隱藏以 Won't Fix 解決、而且超過 48 小時的 issue。哪一種設定符合需求？","zo":["加上 sub-filter 的 company-managed Scrum board","搭配 quick filter 的 team-managed Scrum board","加上 sub-filter 的 team-managed Kanban board","加上 sub-filter 的 company-managed Kanban board"],"fig":"","opts":["Company-managed Scrum board with a sub-filter","Team-managed Scrum board with quick filters","Team-managed Kanban board with a sub-filter","Company-managed Kanban board with a sub-filter"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。Company-managed 雖然能跨 project，但 sub-filter 只存在於 Kanban board 的 General 設定頁；Scrum board 沒有這個欄位，無法依條件自動藏卡。","B":"錯。Team-managed board 只看自己的 project，撈不到另外兩個 project；quick filter 又得每個人自己點選才生效，不是「自動」隱藏。","C":"錯。Team-managed board 只顯示自己 project 的 issue，不能用 filter 撈其他 project，也沒有 sub-filter 設定，兩個需求都做不到。","D":"對。Company-managed board 的 saved filter 可以跨三個 project；Kanban board 的 sub-filter 能寫任意 JQL 條件，把 Won't Fix 且解決超過 48 小時的 issue 自動排除。Hide completed 只有 1、2、4 週，做不到。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/add-a-sub-filter-to-a-company-managed-kanban-board/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/create-a-board-based-on-filters/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.4-n18","sec":"620.2.4","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Rafael manages the company-managed Kanban board for project KELP. Cards finished about a month ago should drop off the board on their own, and nobody on the team wants to write or maintain JQL for it. Which option meets this with the least effort?","zh":"Rafael 管理 project KELP 的 company-managed Kanban board。大約一個月前完成的卡片應該自己從 board 上消失，而且團隊沒有人想為此撰寫或維護 JQL。哪一個做法最省事就能達成？","zo":["建立 quick filter，排除解決超過 4 週的 issue","建立排程 automation rule，轉換已完成的舊 issue 的狀態","加上 board sub-filter，排除解決超過 4 週的 issue","把 Hide completed work items older than 設為 4 weeks"],"fig":"","opts":["Create a quick filter that excludes issues resolved over 4 weeks ago","Create a scheduled automation rule that transitions old done issues","Add a board sub-filter that excludes issues resolved over 4 weeks ago","Set Hide completed work items older than to 4 weeks"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。Quick filter 一樣要寫 JQL，而且是每個使用者自己點選才生效的臨時篩選，不點就不作用，做不到「自己從 board 消失」。","B":"錯。Automation 要自己寫 JQL 找出舊 issue、再設計動作，還會真的改動 issue 資料；這正是團隊不想維護的東西，遠不如內建設定省事。","C":"錯。Sub-filter 確實能用 JQL 把舊卡從 board 藏起來，但得自己寫、自己維護那段條件，不符合「不想寫 JQL」；內建的下拉選單更省事。","D":"對。Hide completed work items older than 是 Kanban board General 頁的內建下拉選單，可選 1、2、4 週；在 Done 類別 status、而且最後一次更新已超過設定時間的卡會自動隱藏（完成後再編輯任何欄位，計時會重來），不必寫任何 JQL。"},"note":"<b>補充：</b>sub-filter 與 Hide completed 都只影響 board 上顯示哪些卡；報表的範圍仍由 board 的 saved filter 決定（DC 文件：預設 sub-filter 讓已 release 的 issue 從 board 消失，報表照樣顯示它們）。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira/kb/kanban-board-shows-or-hides-completed-work-unexpectedly-in-jira-cloud/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/add-a-sub-filter-to-a-company-managed-kanban-board/","https://confluence.atlassian.com/jirasoftwareserver/configuring-filters-938845268.html"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.4-n19","sec":"620.2.4","dom":"620.2","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"A QA lead wants a company-managed Scrum board to display only issues assigned to her team. Which board features can she use? (Choose two.)","zh":"一位 QA lead 想讓 company-managed Scrum board 只顯示指派給她團隊的 issue。她可以用哪些 board 功能？（選兩個。）","zo":["編輯 board filter","建立 quick filter","設定 issue security level","加上 Kanban sub-filter","修改 card layout"],"fig":"","opts":["Edit the board filter","Create a quick filter","Set issue security levels","Add a Kanban sub-filter","Change the card layout"],"ans":"AB","why":{"A":"對。Board filter 決定 board 上所有 issue 的範圍；在 JQL 加上團隊條件，例如 <code>assignee in membersOf(\"qa-team\")</code>，board、backlog、報表就只剩她團隊的 issue。","B":"對。Quick filter 是 board 功能，官方就舉「在共用的 backlog 上顯示特定團隊的檢視」為例。點一下只看自己團隊，不點時其他人照常看全部。","C":"錯。常見誤解：issue security level 是權限機制，讓沒權限的人完全看不到那張 issue，影響所有地方，不是 board 的顯示設定。","D":"錯。Sub-filter 是在 board filter 結果上再加一層 JQL 的設定，但只存在於 company-managed Kanban board；這是 Scrum board，設定頁根本沒有這個欄位。","E":"錯。Card layout 只是在卡片上多顯示最多三個欄位，改變卡片上的資訊，不會減少 board 上出現的 issue。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-filters/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-quick-filters/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/customize-cards/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/what-are-work-item-security-schemes/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.4-n20","sec":"620.2.4","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A user selects the quick filters “Only My Issues” and “Bugs”. What does the board show?","zh":"使用者同時選了「Only My Issues」和「Bugs」兩個 quick filter。board 會顯示什麼？","zo":["指派給這位使用者，或者是 bug 的 issue","指派給這位使用者，而且是 bug 的 issue","只顯示最後選的那個 quick filter 的結果","全部 issue，因為 quick filter 不能組合"],"fig":"","opts":["Issues that are assigned to the user OR are bugs","Issues that are assigned to the user AND are bugs","Only the result of the last selected quick filter","All issues, because quick filters cannot be combined"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。常見誤解：以為勾越多看越多。同時選取的 quick filter 是交集，不是聯集；要 OR 的效果，得在同一個 quick filter 的 JQL 裡寫 OR。","B":"對。同時選取的 quick filter 以 AND 疊加，只剩「指派給自己」而且「是 Bug」的 issue。官方建議單 JRACLOUD-85995（原 JSWCLOUD-23979）說明目前多選只用 AND，想改成 OR 還在徵求需求。","C":"錯。後選的 quick filter 不會取代先選的，兩個條件同時生效；要取消某個條件，得再點一次把它關掉。","D":"錯。Quick filter 可以同時選取多個，而且會一起生效；不是不能組合，只是組合方式是 AND。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>現行 UI 把 issue 改稱 work item，預設 quick filter 叫 Only My Work items；新版 board 另把 quick filters 改名為 Custom filters。多選時的 AND 行為不變。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-quick-filters/","https://jira.atlassian.com/browse/JRACLOUD-85995"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.4-n21","sec":"620.2.4","dom":"620.2","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Aarav reviews the backlog of the company-managed Scrum board for project WREN. Which statements about how the board filter affects the backlog are correct? (Choose two.)","zh":"Aarav 在檢查 project WREN 那塊 company-managed Scrum board 的 backlog。關於 board filter 如何影響 backlog，哪些敘述正確？（選兩個。）","zo":["Backlog 中 epic 的 issue 數只計算符合 board filter 的 issue","Backlog 中 epic 的計數只在開始 sprint 時重新計算","Backlog 中的 versions 只顯示符合 board filter 的 issue","Quick filter 可以把被 board filter 排除的 issue 加回來","修改 board filter 只影響之後新建的 issue"],"fig":"","opts":["Epic counts in the backlog include only issues matching the board filter","Epic counts in the backlog are recalculated only when a sprint is started","Versions in the backlog show only issues that match the board filter","Quick filters can add issues excluded by the board filter","Changing the board filter affects only new issues"],"ans":"AC","why":{"A":"對。官方 KB：board 上的 issue 計數只包含出現在這塊 board 上的 issue。常見誤解：以為 epic 計數是它全部的 child；沒被 board filter 撈到的 child 不會計入。","B":"錯。Epic 面板的計數依 board filter 撈到的 issue 計算，issue 一進出 filter 範圍，數字就跟著變，和有沒有開始 sprint 無關。","C":"對。Versions 面板和 Epics 面板一樣屬於 board 的 backlog；官方說 issue 必須符合 board 的 saved filter 才會出現在 backlog，版本裡的 issue 也只算這些。","D":"錯。三層篩選只會越篩越少：quick filter 只能在 board filter 的結果裡再縮小範圍，不能讓被 board filter 排除的 issue 或其他 project 的 issue 出現。","E":"錯。改 board filter 立即生效，board、backlog、報表全部改用新範圍，既有 issue 也一樣；共用這份 filter 的其他 board 也會一起變。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira/kb/epic-panel-under-scrum-board-backlog-is-showing-incorrect-number-of-child-issues/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/use-your-scrum-backlog/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/enable-ranking/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.4-n22","sec":"620.2.4","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. Which board type is being configured?","zh":"請看圖。圖中正在設定的是哪一種 board？","zo":["Team-managed Kanban board","Team-managed Scrum board","Company-managed Kanban board","Company-managed Scrum board"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 271\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"General\"><rect x=\"0.5\" y=\"0.5\" width=\"379\" height=\"270\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"380\" height=\"34\" rx=\"0\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"34\" width=\"106\" height=\"237\" rx=\"0\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><line x1=\"106\" y1=\"34\" x2=\"106\" y2=\"271\" class=\"gl\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Board settings</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">General</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Saved filter</text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"95\" width=\"250\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"126\" y=\"113\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t mono\" style=\"font-size:11px\">project = HALCYON ORDER BY Rank ASC</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"144\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">(?) board sub-filter</text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"150\" width=\"250\" height=\"44\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx brand\"/><text x=\"126\" y=\"168\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t mono\" style=\"font-size:11px\">fixVersion in unreleasedVersions()</text><text x=\"126\" y=\"184\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t mono\" style=\"font-size:11px\">OR fixVersion is EMPTY</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"215\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Hide completed work items older than</text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"221\" width=\"250\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx brand\"/><text x=\"128\" y=\"239\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">2 weeks</text><path d=\"M350,232 l5,5 l5,-5\" class=\"ln ink\" style=\"stroke-width:1.6\"/><rect x=\"6\" y=\"39\" width=\"94\" height=\"22\" rx=\"6\" class=\"sf-brand\"/><text x=\"14\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">General</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"80\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Columns</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"106\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Swimlanes</text></svg>","opts":["Team-managed Kanban board","Team-managed Scrum board","Company-managed Kanban board","Company-managed Scrum board"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。Team-managed board 沒有 Board settings 裡的 saved filter、sub-filter 或 Hide completed；沒開 Sprints 時，Done 的卡是滿 14 天自動從 board 清除。","B":"錯。Team-managed Scrum board 同樣沒有 saved filter、sub-filter 或 Hide completed 設定；開了 Sprints 之後，Done 的卡要等完成 sprint 才會清掉，不能手動清。","C":"對。圖中同時有 board sub-filter 與 Hide completed work items older than 兩個設定，這兩個只出現在 company-managed Kanban board 的 General 頁；Scrum 與 team-managed board 都沒有。","D":"錯。Company-managed Scrum board 的 General 頁也有 saved filter，但沒有 sub-filter 與 Hide completed 兩個欄位；Scrum 是靠 Complete sprint 把完成的工作清出 board。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/add-a-sub-filter-to-a-company-managed-kanban-board/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira/kb/kanban-board-shows-or-hides-completed-work-unexpectedly-in-jira-cloud/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/what-is-a-jira-software-board/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.5-n23","sec":"620.2.5","dom":"620.2","type":"multi","n":3,"stem":"Inés wants her team to record how long work actually takes in project TERRA. Which fields are used specifically for time tracking? (Choose three.)","zh":"Inés 希望團隊在 project TERRA 記錄工作實際花了多少時間。哪些欄位是專門用來追蹤時間的？（選三個。）","zo":["Due date","Time spent","Sprint","Original estimate","Story points","Remaining estimate"],"fig":"","opts":["Due date","Time spent","Sprint","Original estimate","Story points","Remaining estimate"],"ans":"BDF","why":{"A":"錯。Due date 只是這張 issue 的截止日期，改它需要 Schedule Issues 權限，但它不記錄花了或剩下多少時間。","B":"對。Time spent 是已經花掉的時間，由使用者每次 Log work 累加。常見誤解：把 story points 也算進來，其實時間欄位只有這三個。","C":"錯。Sprint 欄位記錄 issue 被排進哪個 sprint，是規劃用的欄位；sprint 雖然有起訖日期，但這個欄位不記錄任何人花了或剩下多少時間。","D":"對。Original estimate 是開工前預估要花多少時間，是 time tracking 的起點；開啟時間追蹤後，進度就用它扣掉 Time spent 來計算。","E":"錯。Story points 是相對大小的估算單位，拿來當 estimation statistic 算 velocity，不代表時數，也不是 time tracking 欄位。","F":"對。Remaining estimate 記錄還剩多少時間；log work 之後會自動扣減，也可以手動修改。它和 Original estimate、Time spent 三個一組。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-estimation-and-tracking/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/work-item-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.5-n24","sec":"620.2.5","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Wanjiru's Scrum board for project MANGO uses Story Points as its estimation statistic, and Time tracking is set to None. During the sprint, she adds a sub-task to a story. What happens?","zh":"Wanjiru 在 project MANGO 的 Scrum board 以 Story Points 作為 estimation statistic，Time tracking 設為 None。Sprint 進行中，她在一張 story 底下新增了 sub-task。會發生什麼事？","zo":["不算 scope change","sub-task 的 story points 會加進 burndown","算 scope change，但 burndown 上看不到","算 scope change，而且會顯示在 burndown 上"],"fig":"","opts":["It is not a scope change","The story points on the sub-task are added to the burndown","It is a scope change, but it is not shown on the burndown","It is a scope change and appears on the burndown"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。常見誤解：以為 sub-task 不算範圍變動。官方明說，不論有沒有開時間追蹤，sprint 中新增 sub-task 都算 scope change。","B":"錯。官方：sub-task 上的 Story Points 不計入 burndown，只算 parent 的估點，所以總量不會因為 sub-task 估點而改變。","C":"對。官方：active sprint 中新增 sub-task 一律視為 scope change；但沒開 Remaining Estimate and Time Spent 時，burndown 不會畫出這個變化。記法：帳本一定記，圖上不一定畫。","D":"錯。這是開了時間追蹤才有的結果。只有 Time tracking 選 Remaining Estimate and Time Spent 時，sub-task 造成的 scope change 才會畫在 burndown 上；題目是 None。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-burndown-chart/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.5-n25","sec":"620.2.5","dom":"620.2","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Sven is the board administrator of the company-managed Scrum board for project ORCA. He wants the board to estimate with Original Time Estimate instead of Story Points. Which statements are correct? (Choose two.)","zh":"Sven 是 project ORCA 那塊 company-managed Scrum board 的 board administrator。他想讓這塊 board 改用 Original Time Estimate 估算，而不是 Story Points。哪些敘述正確？（選兩個。）","zo":["在 Board settings &gt; Estimation 修改","在 Project settings &gt; Features 修改","他身為 board administrator，自己就能修改","只有 Jira administrator 能修改","在 Global settings &gt; Time tracking 修改"],"fig":"","opts":["He makes the change in Board settings &gt; Estimation","He makes the change in Project settings &gt; Features","He can make the change himself as a board administrator","Only a Jira administrator can make the change","He makes the change in Global settings &gt; Time tracking"],"ans":"AC","why":{"A":"對。官方步驟：Board settings → 左側選 Estimation，用 Estimation method 下拉選單改成 story points、時間或 issue 數等。官方註明這個設定只給 company-managed Scrum board，Kanban board 沒有這一頁。","B":"錯。Project settings → Features 是 team-managed project 開啟 Estimation 並選擇 Story points 或 Time 的地方；company-managed Scrum board 的估算方式不在這裡設定。","C":"對。官方：要設定 board 的任何設定，必須是這塊 board 的 board administrator，或 board location 所在 project 的 administrator，estimation 也包含在內，不需要 Jira admin。","D":"錯。Jira administrator 當然改得動，但不是「只有」他能。Estimation 是 board 層級設定，board admin 或 location 所在 project 的 admin 就能改。","E":"錯。全站的 time tracking 由 Jira admin 決定能不能記工時；但每塊 board 用哪種 estimation statistic，要在該 board 的 Estimation 頁設定。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-estimation-and-tracking/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.5-n26","sec":"620.2.5","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. After switching Time tracking to “Remaining Estimate and Time Spent”, what changes on the burndown?","zh":"請看圖。把 Time tracking 改成「Remaining Estimate and Time Spent」之後，burndown 會有什麼變化？","zo":["sub-task 的 story points 會加到縱軸上 parent 的總數","Velocity Chart 的縱軸也從 story points 改成小時","改用剩餘時間追蹤進度，有人記錄工時線就往下降","只有 issue 進到最右邊的 column，burndown 才會下降"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 245\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Estimation\"><rect x=\"0.5\" y=\"0.5\" width=\"379\" height=\"244\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"380\" height=\"34\" rx=\"0\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"34\" width=\"106\" height=\"211\" rx=\"0\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><line x1=\"106\" y1=\"34\" x2=\"106\" y2=\"245\" class=\"gl\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Board settings</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Estimation</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Estimation statistic</text><circle cx=\"125\" cy=\"102\" r=\"7\" class=\"bx\"/><circle cx=\"125\" cy=\"102\" r=\"3.5\" class=\"fl-brand\"/><text x=\"140\" y=\"106\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Story Points</text><circle cx=\"125\" cy=\"123\" r=\"7\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"140\" y=\"127\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Original Time Estimate</text><circle cx=\"125\" cy=\"144\" r=\"7\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"140\" y=\"148\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Issue Count</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"177\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Time tracking</text><circle cx=\"125\" cy=\"190\" r=\"7\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"140\" y=\"194\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">None</text><circle cx=\"125\" cy=\"211\" r=\"7\" class=\"bx\"/><circle cx=\"125\" cy=\"211\" r=\"3.5\" class=\"fl-brand\"/><text x=\"140\" y=\"215\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\">Remaining Estimate and Time Spent</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">General</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"80\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Columns</text><rect x=\"6\" y=\"91\" width=\"94\" height=\"22\" rx=\"6\" class=\"sf-brand\"/><text x=\"14\" y=\"106\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Estimation</text></svg>","opts":["Sub-task story points are added to the parent's total on the y-axis","The Velocity Chart also switches its y-axis from story points to hours","Progress is tracked by remaining time and drops as work is logged","The burndown drops only when an issue reaches the rightmost column"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。官方：sub-task 上的 Story Points 不計入 burndown，只算 parent 的估點；開了時間追蹤也不會把 sub-task 的估點加到 parent。","B":"錯。官方說 Velocity Chart 的縱軸是 estimation statistic（圖中是 Story Points），比較每個 sprint 承諾與完成的量；time tracking 設定不會把它改成小時。","C":"對。官方：選 Remaining estimate and time spent 時，進度改用 Original estimate 扣掉 Time spent 來追蹤。所以 burndown 追的是剩餘工時，有人 log work，線就往下降。","D":"錯。「issue 進到最右欄才下降」是 Time tracking 選 None、沿用 estimation statistic 追進度時的行為；圖中已改成 Remaining Estimate and Time Spent，記工時線就會下降。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-estimation-and-tracking/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-burndown-chart/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-velocity-chart/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.6-n27","sec":"620.2.6","dom":"620.2","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"A product owner changes the working days on a board. Which dashboard gadgets reflect the change? (Choose two.)","zh":"產品負責人修改了某塊 board 的 working days。哪些 dashboard gadget 會反映這個變更？（選兩個。）","zo":["Created vs Resolved","Road Map","Filter Results","Sprint Health","Burndown gadget"],"fig":"","opts":["Created vs Resolved","Road Map","Filter Results","Sprint Health","Burndown gadget"],"ans":"DE","why":{"A":"錯。Created vs Resolved 是依 filter 或 project 比較建立數與解決數的 gadget，不在官方的 working days 清單裡，不受 board 設定影響。","B":"錯。Road Map 是另一種 dashboard gadget，官方 working days 頁列出的 gadget 只有 Sprint Health 與 Burndown，它不在清單內。","C":"錯。Filter Results 只是把 saved filter 的查詢結果列成表格，沒有時間軸可以跳過非工作日，和 working days 無關。","D":"對。官方 Configure working days 頁列出受影響的 gadget 只有兩個：Sprint Health gadget 與 Burndown gadget。報表則有 Burndown、Sprint、Epic、Version、Control Chart 五張。","E":"對。官方清單的另一個 gadget 就是 Burndown gadget。常見誤解：只記得 Burndown Chart 報表會吃 working days，其實報表和 gadget 兩個都會。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-working-days/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.6-n28","sec":"620.2.6","dom":"620.2","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"The company-managed Kanban board for project LUMEN needs its working days updated for a public holiday. Who can make this change? (Choose two.)","zh":"project LUMEN 的 company-managed Kanban board 要因應國定假日更新 working days。誰可以做這項修改？（選兩個。）","zo":["任何看得到這塊 board 的使用者","只有 organization admin","filter 的擁有者","board administrator","board location 所在 project 的 project administrator"],"fig":"","opts":["Any user who can view the board","Only an organization admin","The filter owner","A board administrator","A project administrator of the board's location"],"ans":"DE","why":{"A":"錯。看得到 board 只代表 filter 有分享給你、能瀏覽卡片；修改任何 board 設定都需要 board admin 或 location 所在 project 的 admin。","B":"錯。Organization admin 管的是組織層級的使用者與產品存取；working days 是 board 層級設定，board admin 就能改，不必找 org admin。","C":"錯。Filter 的擁有者能編輯 filter 的 JQL 與分享對象，但不會因此成為 board administrator，也不能改 board 的 working days。","D":"對。官方：要設定 board 及其任何設定，必須是這塊 board 的 board administrator，或 location 所在 project 的 admin。Working days 是每塊 board 各自的設定，不是全站設定。","E":"對。官方列出的另一種身分是 board location 所在 project 的 admin。board 掛在哪個 project，那個 project 的 admin 就能改它的 working days。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-working-days/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.6-n29","sec":"620.2.6","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"A manager wants to see at a glance how many issues each person has in progress. Which configuration is most suitable?","zh":"主管想一眼看出每個人手上各有幾張進行中的 issue。哪一種設定最合適？","zo":["依 Assignees 設定 card colors","在 card layout 顯示 assignee 欄位","替每個人各建一個 quick filter","依 Assignees 分 swimlane"],"fig":"","opts":["Card colors based on Assignees","Card layout showing the assignee field","A quick filter for each person","Swimlanes based on Assignees"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。依 Assignees 設 card colors 只改變卡片左緣的色條，不改位置；人一多顏色很難分辨，還得一張張數。","B":"錯。Card layout 只是在卡片上多顯示欄位的值，卡片仍混在同一欄裡，看不出每個人各有幾張。","C":"錯。Quick filter 一次只看一個人的結果，主管得一個一個點、自己記數字，做不到「一眼看出」。","D":"對。Swimlanes 選 Assignees 時，每位經辦人一條橫向 lane，卡片依人分組；每條 lane 在 In Progress 欄有幾張，一眼就數得出來。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-swimlanes/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/customize-cards/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.6-n30","sec":"620.2.6","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. A Blocker bug matches both Expedite and Bugs. Where does it appear?","zh":"請看圖。一張 priority 為 Blocker 的 bug 同時符合 Expedite 與 Bugs 兩條 swimlane。它會出現在哪裡？","zo":["兩條 swimlane 都會出現，因為兩個 query 都符合","Everything Else，因為它符合不只一個 query","Expedite，因為這是第一個符合的 query","Bugs，因為它的 query 比較具體"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 260\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Swimlanes\"><rect x=\"0.5\" y=\"0.5\" width=\"379\" height=\"259\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"380\" height=\"34\" rx=\"0\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"34\" width=\"106\" height=\"226\" rx=\"0\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><line x1=\"106\" y1=\"34\" x2=\"106\" y2=\"260\" class=\"gl\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Board settings</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Swimlanes</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Base swimlanes on</text><circle cx=\"125\" cy=\"102\" r=\"7\" class=\"bx\"/><circle cx=\"125\" cy=\"102\" r=\"3.5\" class=\"fl-brand\"/><text x=\"140\" y=\"106\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Queries</text><circle cx=\"125\" cy=\"123\" r=\"7\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"140\" y=\"127\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Assignees</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"156\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Queries</text><line x1=\"118\" y1=\"186\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"186\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"118\" y=\"178\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Expedite</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"178\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">priority = Blocker</text><line x1=\"118\" y1=\"212\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"212\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"118\" y=\"204\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Bugs</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"204\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">type = Bug</text><line x1=\"118\" y1=\"238\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"238\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"118\" y=\"230\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Everything Else</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"230\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\"></text><text x=\"14\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">General</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"80\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Columns</text><rect x=\"6\" y=\"91\" width=\"94\" height=\"22\" rx=\"6\" class=\"sf-brand\"/><text x=\"14\" y=\"106\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Swimlanes</text></svg>","opts":["In both swimlanes, because it matches both queries","In Everything Else, because it matches more than one query","In Expedite, because it is the first matching query","In Bugs, because its query is more specific"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。一張 issue 在 board 上只會出現一次。Atlassian 的 Cloud 建議單 JSWCLOUD-15264 說明目前 issue 只會出現在第一條符合的 swimlane。","B":"錯。Everything Else 永遠在最下面、不能刪除，只收「不符合上方任何 query」的 issue；符合多條 query 不會讓 issue 掉到這裡。","C":"對。以 Queries 分 swimlane 時，issue 只會出現在由上而下第一條符合的 lane。圖中 Expedite 排在 Bugs 上面，所以這張 bug 落在 Expedite。","D":"錯。Jira 不會比較哪個條件比較具體，只看 swimlane 的排列順序；想讓 bug 優先進 Bugs，就要把 Bugs 拖到 Expedite 上面。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-swimlanes/","https://jira.atlassian.com/browse/JSWCLOUD-15264"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.6-n31","sec":"620.2.6","dom":"620.2","type":"multi","n":3,"stem":"Olu wants to color the cards on the company-managed board for project PERCH. Which options are available for card colors? (Choose three.)","zh":"Olu 想替 project PERCH 的 company-managed board 設定卡片顏色。card colors 可以依據哪些項目設定？（選三個。）","zo":["Statuses","Priorities","Queries","Components","Issue types"],"fig":"","opts":["Statuses","Priorities","Queries","Components","Issue types"],"ans":"BCE","why":{"A":"錯。Card colors 的內建依據只有 issue types、priorities、assignees 與 queries，沒有「依 status」。要依 status 上色，可以改用 Queries，寫 <code>status = Blocked</code> 這類 JQL。","B":"對。Priorities 是內建的上色依據之一，預設顏色和 Jira 全站的 priority 顏色一致，也可以重設回全站顏色。","C":"對。Queries 可以替任何 JQL 指定顏色；每張卡依第一個符合的 query 上色，不符合任何 query 的卡顯示為灰色。","D":"錯。Component 是 issue 上用來分模組的欄位，但不是 card colors 的內建選項；真的要依 component 上色，一樣得透過 Queries 寫 <code>component = UI</code> 這類 JQL。","E":"對。官方：card colors 可依 issue types（現行叫 work types）、priorities、assignees 或 JQL 設定。選 Issue types 時每種類型一個顏色，例如 Bug 一律紅色。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/customize-cards/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.7-n32","sec":"620.2.7","dom":"620.2","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Chen can see the backlog of the company-managed Scrum board for project BIRCH but cannot drag issues to reorder them. Which permissions does he need to rank issues? (Choose two.)","zh":"Chen 看得到 project BIRCH 那塊 company-managed Scrum board 的 backlog，卻無法拖曳 issue 來重新排序。他需要哪些權限才能排序（rank）issue？（選兩個。）","zo":["Manage Sprints","Administer Projects","Transition Issues","Schedule Issues","Edit Issues"],"fig":"","opts":["Manage Sprints","Administer Projects","Transition Issues","Schedule Issues","Edit Issues"],"ans":"DE","why":{"A":"錯。常見誤解：以為排 backlog 要 Manage Sprints。它管的是 sprint 本身的建立、開始、完成與期間、目標，官方說它不能修改 sprint 裡的工作。","B":"錯。Administer Projects 是管理 project 設定的權限，範圍太大，也不在官方列的排序條件裡；排序看的是 Schedule Issues 與 Edit Issues。","C":"錯。Transition Issues 讓使用者變更 issue 的 status（在 column 之間移動），和在同一欄或 backlog 裡調整先後順序是兩回事。","D":"對。官方：Schedule Issues 允許修改 due date，以及在 board 與 backlog 上變更排序。它還要搭配 Edit Issues，而且 board filter 要有 ORDER BY Rank。","E":"對。官方 Rank a work item 頁寫明，要對該 issue 同時有 Schedule Issues 與 Edit Issues 才能排序，前提是 board 已啟用 ranking。少了其中一個，看得到 backlog 也拖不動。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/rank-an-issue/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/work-item-permissions/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/how-permissions-interact-with-each-other/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.7-n33","sec":"620.2.7","dom":"620.2","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"On the company-managed Scrum board for project DUNE, all statuses are mapped to columns, but some issues are missing from the board. Which are likely causes? (Choose two.)","zh":"project DUNE 的 company-managed Scrum board 所有 status 都已對到 column，但有些 issue 沒出現在 board 上。可能的原因有哪些？（選兩個。）","zo":["這些 issue 設了使用者看不到的 issue security level","這些 status 沒有對到 column","board 使用了 Kanban sub-filter","這些 issue 沒有估 story point","saved filter 沒有包含這些 issue"],"fig":"","opts":["The issues have an issue security level the user cannot see","The statuses are unmapped","The board uses a Kanban sub-filter","The issues have no story point estimate","The saved filter does not include those issues"],"ans":"AE","why":{"A":"對。Issue security level 讓沒權限的人完全看不到那張 issue，board、backlog、搜尋都一樣。所以同一塊 board，不同人看到的卡片數可能不同。","B":"錯。題目已經說所有 status 都對到 column，這一層可以先排除。常見誤解：沒看清題幹就選 mapping；排查題要先用題幹排除哪一層。","C":"錯。Sub-filter 會在 board filter 之外再藏掉一部分 issue，但它只存在於 company-managed Kanban board；這是 Scrum board，沒有 sub-filter 可以藏卡。","D":"錯。Estimation 只決定卡片上顯示的估算值與報表怎麼計量；沒有估點的 issue 照樣會出現在 board 上，不會因此被藏起來。","E":"對。Board 只顯示符合 saved filter 的 issue。JQL 若限制了 assignee、issue type 或 component，這些 issue 根本沒被撈進來，board 和 backlog 都看不到。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-filters/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/use-active-sprints/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-columns/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/what-are-work-item-security-schemes/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.7-n34","sec":"620.2.7","dom":"620.2","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"When Oksana runs the saved filter of the company-managed Scrum board for project QUILL, issue QUILL-42 is returned, and it is in the active sprint. However, Oksana does not see it on the Active sprints board. Which are likely causes? (Choose two.)","zh":"Oksana 執行 project QUILL 那塊 company-managed Scrum board 的 saved filter 時，撈得到 issue QUILL-42，而且它在 active sprint 裡。但 Oksana 在 Active sprints 的 board 上看不到它。可能的原因有哪些？（選兩個。）","zo":["它的 status 沒有對到任何 column","有 quick filter 把它藏起來","saved filter 排除了它","Oksana 缺少 Browse Projects 權限","board 的 swimlane 太多"],"fig":"","opts":["Its status is not mapped to a column","A quick filter is hiding it","The saved filter excludes it","Oksana lacks Browse Projects","The board has too many swimlanes"],"ans":"AB","why":{"A":"對。官方：issue 要出現在 Active sprints，必須 status 對到 column、在 active sprint 裡、而且符合 saved filter。後兩個題目已成立，剩下 column 對應最可疑。","B":"對。Quick filter 會在 board filter 的結果裡再縮小顯示範圍；使用者選了某個 quick filter，不符合的 issue 就暫時被藏起來，官方也說它們不計入 swimlane 數量。","C":"錯。Oksana 執行 saved filter 撈得到這張 issue，代表 filter 沒有排除它，這一層可以直接排除。","D":"錯。Oksana 自己在搜尋中看得到這張 issue，代表她有 Browse Projects 權限；權限不足時連搜尋都找不到。","E":"錯。Swimlane 只是把卡片橫向分組，每張 issue 都會落在某一條 lane，最差也在 Everything Else；lane 多寡不會讓 issue 消失。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/use-active-sprints/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-columns/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-quick-filters/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.7-n35","sec":"620.2.7","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Nadia created a company-managed Scrum board from a saved filter for project GLINT. Issues on the board cannot be dragged, and no sprints can be created. What is the most likely cause?","zh":"Nadia 用 project GLINT 的 saved filter 建了一塊 company-managed Scrum board。board 上的 issue 拖不動，也建不了 sprint。最可能的原因是什麼？","zo":["board filter 包含一個以上的 project","board filter 沒有 ORDER BY Rank","Nadia 缺少 Manage Sprints 權限","Nadia 缺少 Schedule Issues 權限"],"fig":"","opts":["The board filter includes more than one project","The board filter does not include ORDER BY Rank","Nadia lacks the Manage Sprints permission","Nadia lacks the Schedule Issues permission"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。跨 project 的 board 照樣能拖曳排序、建立 sprint，只是操作 sprint 時要在每個相關 project 都有權限；filter 含幾個 project 不會關掉這兩個功能。","B":"對。官方：啟用 ranking 才能拖曳排序、在 Scrum board 建立 sprint。修法是在 Board settings 的 General 頁按 Add Rank，filter 會加上 ORDER BY Rank，所有用這份 filter 的 board 都受影響。","C":"錯。缺 Manage Sprints 確實建不了 sprint，但不會讓卡片拖不動；兩個症狀同時出現，指向的是 filter 缺 ORDER BY Rank。","D":"錯。缺 Schedule Issues 確實不能拖曳排序，但它和建立 sprint 無關；只有缺 ranking 能同時解釋拖不動與建不了 sprint 兩個症狀。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/enable-ranking/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/rank-an-issue/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/work-item-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.7-n36","sec":"620.2.7","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Dmitri is a board administrator of the RIVET board, but he cannot edit the board's saved filter. Why?","zh":"Dmitri 是 RIVET board 的 board administrator，卻無法編輯這塊 board 的 saved filter。為什麼？","zo":["只有 Jira administrator 能編輯 board 的 saved filter","這塊 board 是用 Kanban 範本建立的","這份 filter 含有 ORDER BY Rank","board administrator 不會自動成為 filter 的編輯者"],"fig":"","opts":["Only Jira administrators can edit a board's saved filter","The board is on a Kanban template","The filter contains ORDER BY Rank","Board administrators are not automatically filter editors"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。Filter 的 owner 和被授予編輯權的 editor 都能修改 filter；Jira admin 能管理別人的共用 filter，但不是唯一能編輯的人。","B":"錯。Board 用 Scrum 或 Kanban 範本建立，都不影響 filter 的編輯權；filter 能不能改只看你是不是 owner 或 editor。","C":"錯。ORDER BY Rank 是啟用拖曳排序的正常設定，按 Add Rank 就會加上；它不會鎖住 filter，也不影響誰能編輯。","D":"對。Board admin 和 filter 的編輯權是兩回事。官方說不是 filter 建立者時只能用 Save as 另存新 filter；要直接修改，得請 owner 在分享設定裡把他加為 editor。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/manage-filters/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/edit-a-board-filter-on-a-company-managed-board/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/copy-an-existing-board/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.1-n01","sec":"620.3.1","dom":"620.3","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Keoni can view all issues in project MAKANI but cannot reorder the backlog on the team's Scrum board. Which project permissions does he need to rank issues? (Choose two.)","zh":"Keoni 看得到 MAKANI project 裡所有的 issue，卻無法在團隊的 Scrum board 上重新排序 backlog。他需要哪些 project 權限才能 rank issue？（選兩個）","zo":["Manage Sprints","Schedule Issues","Administer Projects","Edit Issues","Assign Issues"],"fig":"","opts":["Manage Sprints","Schedule Issues","Administer Projects","Edit Issues","Assign Issues"],"ans":"BD","why":{"A":"錯。Manage Sprints 管 sprint 本身的建立、開始、完成與目標；官方說它不能改 sprint 裡的 issue。常見誤解：以為排序 backlog 靠它。","B":"對。官方 Rank 頁寫明：要同時有 Schedule Issues 與 Edit Issues，才能在 board 和 backlog 拖曳排序。Schedule Issues 同時也管 Due date。","C":"錯。Administer Projects 讓人管理 role 成員、versions、components 等 project 設定，不是排序 backlog 需要的權限。","D":"對。排序會改寫 issue 上的 Rank 值，屬於編輯 issue，所以除了 Schedule Issues，還要 Edit Issues 才拖得動。","E":"錯。Assign Issues 只管能不能修改 Assignee 欄位，和 issue 在 backlog 裡的先後順序無關，不影響能不能拖曳排序。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/rank-an-issue/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/how-permissions-interact-with-each-other/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.1-n02","sec":"620.3.1","dom":"620.3","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Farida, a project administrator of company-managed project LYNX, needs to set the Components field on 60 resolved issues at once. Which two permissions must she have? (Choose two.)","zh":"Farida 是 company-managed project LYNX 的 project administrator，她要一次替 60 張已解決的 issue 設定 Components 欄位。她必須具備哪兩個權限？（選兩個）","zo":["Make bulk changes","Resolve Issues","Administer Jira","Edit Issues","Manage Watchers"],"fig":"","opts":["Make bulk changes","Resolve Issues","Administer Jira","Edit Issues","Manage Watchers"],"ans":"AD","why":{"A":"對。一次改多張 issue 要用 Bulk change，入口由 Make bulk changes 控制。常見誤解：它不是 project 權限，而是全域權限，只能由 Jira admin 授予。","B":"錯。Resolve Issues 管 Resolution 欄位與 Fix version，和 Components 欄位無關；issue 已解決也不需要它才能改其他欄位。","C":"錯。Administer Jira 是 Jira admin 的全站管理權限，用來建 scheme、custom field 等；批次改欄位不需要這麼大的權限。","D":"對。官方說 Make bulk changes 還要搭配對應的 project 權限；批次改欄位等於編輯每一張 issue，所以要有 Edit Issues。","E":"錯。Manage Watchers 只管替別人加入或移除 watcher，和批次修改 Components 欄位沒有關係。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/manage-global-permissions/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/work-item-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.1-n03","sec":"620.3.1","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"In project ORCA, the permission scheme grants Create Issues to the Compliance role and Browse Projects only to the Analysts and Delivery roles. Mateo is in the Compliance role only. What happens when he tries to log a new issue in ORCA?","zh":"ORCA project 的 permission scheme 把 Create Issues 給 Compliance role，Browse Projects 則只給 Analysts 和 Delivery 兩個 role。Mateo 只在 Compliance role 裡。他在 ORCA 建立新 issue 時會發生什麼事？","zo":["他打不開 ORCA 的 Create 對話框","他必須先請 Jira admin 補上 Browse Projects","他能建立 issue，但建完後打不開它","他能建立 issue，而且只看得到自己回報的 issue"],"fig":"","opts":["He cannot open the Create dialog for ORCA","He needs a Jira admin to add Browse Projects first","He can create the issue but cannot open it afterwards","He can create and view only issues he reported"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。這是常見誤解：多數 issue 權限要先有 Browse Projects，但 Create Issues 是官方點名的例外，沒有 Browse 也能建立。","B":"錯。官方寫明 Create Issues 不需要 Browse Projects；Compliance 給的 Create Issues 就足以建立，不必先補 Browse。","C":"對。官方說 Create Issues 即使沒有 Browse Projects 也能建立 issue；但看 issue 要 Browse Projects，所以他建完後打不開自己建的那張。","D":"錯。Reporter 身分不會自動給他瀏覽權；他在 ORCA 沒有 Browse Projects，連自己回報的 issue 也看不到。"},"note":"這題之前容易答錯：Create 是「幾乎所有 issue 權限都要 Browse」的例外。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/work-item-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.1-n04","sec":"620.3.1","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. In company-managed project TIGA, Haruto has both Schedule Issues and Edit Issues. When he drags issues in the Scrum backlog, Jira says the issues can't be manually ranked, and his teammates see the same message. What is the most likely fix?","zh":"請看附圖。在 company-managed project TIGA 裡，Haruto 同時有 Schedule Issues 與 Edit Issues。他在 Scrum backlog 拖曳 issue 時，Jira 顯示這些 issue 無法手動排序，隊友也看到同樣的訊息。最可能的解法是什麼？","zo":["給 Haruto Manage Sprints 權限","把查詢改成 ORDER BY Rank ASC, priority DESC","把 Rank 欄位加到 project 的編輯畫面（edit screen）","讓 Haruto 成為 TIGA project 的 administrator"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 290\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"TIGA board filter\"><rect x=\"0.5\" y=\"0.5\" width=\"379\" height=\"289\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"380\" height=\"34\" rx=\"0\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"34\" width=\"106\" height=\"256\" rx=\"0\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><line x1=\"106\" y1=\"34\" x2=\"106\" y2=\"290\" class=\"gl\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Board settings</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">General</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Board name</text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"95\" width=\"250\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"128\" y=\"113\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">TIGA board</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"144\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Filter query</text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"150\" width=\"250\" height=\"44\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx brand\"/><text x=\"126\" y=\"168\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t mono\" style=\"font-size:11px\">project = TIGA</text><text x=\"126\" y=\"184\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t mono\" style=\"font-size:11px\">ORDER BY priority DESC, Rank ASC</text><rect x=\"6\" y=\"39\" width=\"94\" height=\"22\" rx=\"6\" class=\"sf-brand\"/><text x=\"14\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">General</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"80\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Columns</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"106\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Swimlanes</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"132\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Quick filters</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"158\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Card colors</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"184\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Card layout</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"210\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Estimation</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"236\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Working days</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"262\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Issue detail</text></svg>","opts":["Grant Haruto the Manage Sprints permission","Change the query to ORDER BY Rank ASC, priority DESC","Add the Rank field to the project's edit screen","Make Haruto an administrator of project TIGA"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。Manage Sprints 管 sprint 的建立、開始與完成，不管排序；而且全隊都看到同一個訊息，指向 board 設定而不是個人權限。","B":"對。官方說要能手動 rank，Rank 必須是 board filter 的主要排序；圖中 Rank 排在 priority 之後，改成 ORDER BY Rank ASC 放最前面即可。","C":"錯。Rank 不是要放上 screen 才能用的欄位；排序是在 board 與 backlog 拖曳完成，和編輯畫面上有哪些欄位無關。","D":"錯。Haruto 已經有 Schedule Issues 與 Edit Issues，權限齊全；升成 project admin 也改變不了 board filter 的排序方式。"},"note":"原題考「TMP 的 Member 不能 rank → 缺 Jira Software 產品授權」，Cloud 官方文件查無依據（只有 Server／DC 的 KB），已改考 rank 的另一個前提：board filter 必須以 Rank 為主要排序。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/rank-an-issue/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/enable-ranking/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira/kb/issues-cant-be-manually-ranked-error-when-ranking-issues-in-the-backlog/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.1-n05","sec":"620.3.1","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. It shows part of the permission scheme used by project DUNE. Lina is in the Developers role but not in the Leads role. What can she do on DUNE issues?","zh":"請看附圖，這是 DUNE project 所用 permission scheme 的一部分。Lina 在 Developers role 裡，不在 Leads role 裡。她在 DUNE 的 issue 上能做什麼？","zo":["能改 Summary 等欄位，但不能改 Assignee","能改 Assignee，因為 Edit Issues 涵蓋所有欄位","什麼都不能做，因為編輯需要 Assign Issues","只能在自己回報的 issue 上改 Assignee"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 219\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"DUNE permission scheme\"><rect x=\"0.5\" y=\"0.5\" width=\"379\" height=\"218\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"380\" height=\"34\" rx=\"0\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Project settings · DUNE</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Permissions</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Permission — granted to</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"119\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"119\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Browse Projects</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Developers, Leads</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"145\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"145\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"137\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Edit Issues</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"137\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Developers</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"171\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"171\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"163\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Assign Issues</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"163\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Leads</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"197\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"197\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"189\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Assignable User</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"189\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Developers, Leads</text></svg>","opts":["Edit fields such as Summary, but not change the Assignee","Change the Assignee, because Edit Issues covers all fields","Nothing, because Assign Issues is required for editing","Change the Assignee only on issues she reported"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。官方規則：權限重疊時，由最具體的那個決定。Scheme 把 Assign Issues 授予 Leads，改 Assignee 就只看它；Lina 的 Edit Issues 仍可改其他欄位。","B":"錯。只有 scheme 完全沒把 Assign Issues 授予任何人時，Edit Issues 才涵蓋 Assignee；圖中已授予 Leads，所以不成立。","C":"錯。Assign Issues 只管 Assignee 這一個欄位，不是編輯的前提；有 Edit Issues 就能改其他一般欄位。","D":"錯。身為 Reporter 不會讓她多出改 Assignee 的權利；除非 scheme 把 Assign Issues 授予 Reporter，否則一律不能改。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/work-item-permissions/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/how-permissions-interact-with-each-other/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.1-n06","sec":"620.3.1","dom":"620.3","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Ngozi is a project administrator of project BAOBAB. All of her permissions come from project roles, and she has no global permissions. Which two tasks will fail until a Jira administrator grants her a global permission? (Choose two.)","zh":"Ngozi 是 BAOBAB project 的 project administrator。她的權限全部來自 project role，沒有任何全域權限。在 Jira administrator 授予她全域權限之前，哪兩件工作會做不到？（選兩個）","zo":["把 filter 分享給某個 group","在 issue 上記錄工時","一次批次修改 30 張 issue","連結同一個 project 裡的兩張 issue","新增留言"],"fig":"","opts":["Sharing a filter with a group","Logging work on an issue","Bulk changing 30 issues","Linking two issues in the same project","Adding a comment"],"ans":"AC","why":{"A":"對。分享 filter 或 dashboard 要有全域權限 Share dashboards and filters；沒有它，建得出 filter 卻分享不出去。它只能由 Jira admin 授予。","B":"錯。記工時靠 project 權限 Work On Issues（屬於 time tracking 權限），不需要任何全域權限。","C":"對。批次修改要有全域權限 Make bulk changes，再搭配每張 issue 對應的 project 權限，例如 Edit Issues。","D":"錯。連結 issue 靠 project 權限 Link Issues；全站的 issue linking 開關只是功能設定，不是全域權限。","E":"錯。新增留言靠 project 權限 Add Comments，只要在該 project 被授予即可，不牽涉全域權限。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/manage-global-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.1-n07","sec":"620.3.1","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Omar has Edit Issues in project KITE and can change Summary and Priority, but the Fix versions field is not shown when he edits an issue. Which permission is missing?","zh":"Omar 在 KITE project 有 Edit Issues，能改 Summary 與 Priority，但編輯 issue 時看不到 Fix versions 欄位。他缺少哪個權限？","zo":["Edit Issues","Resolve Issues","Manage Versions","Schedule Issues"],"fig":"","opts":["Edit Issues","Resolve Issues","Manage Versions","Schedule Issues"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。Omar 已經有 Edit Issues，Summary、Priority 都改得了；Fix versions 另外受 Resolve Issues 控制，光有 Edit 不夠。","B":"對。官方 KB 說 Resolve Issues 除了解決與重開 issue，也包含設定 Fix version 欄位；沒有它，編輯時連這個欄位都看不到。","C":"錯。Manage Versions 管 version 本身：建立、release、archive、merge、刪除；把 issue 放進某個版本靠的是 Resolve Issues。","D":"錯。Schedule Issues 管 Due date 與 board 上的排序，和 Fix version 欄位無關；有它仍看不到、改不了 Fix versions。"},"note":"<b>官方頁用語差異：</b>Work item permissions 頁寫 Resolve 權限可「view」Fix version 欄位；KB 寫明可「set」Fix version。考試以 Resolve Issues 控制 Fix version 為準。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/work-item-permissions/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira/kb/unable-to-see-fix-version-field-in-jira-issue/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.2-n08","sec":"620.3.2","dom":"620.3","type":"multi","n":3,"stem":"Farah, a Jira administrator, wants her teams to rely on project roles instead of groups wherever Jira allows it. In which of these places can a project role be selected? (Choose three.)","zh":"Jira administrator Farah 希望團隊在 Jira 允許的地方，一律用 project role 取代 group。下列哪些地方可以選擇 project role？（選三個）","zo":["分享 dashboard","已儲存 filter 的訂閱（subscription）","Permission scheme 裡的 Browse Projects 權限","透過全域權限設定的產品存取（application access）","Issue security levels"],"fig":"","opts":["Dashboard sharing","A saved filter subscription","The Browse Projects permission in a permission scheme","Application access through global permissions","Issue security levels"],"ans":"ACE","why":{"A":"對。官方列出 project role 可用來授予 filter 與 dashboard 的存取；分享 dashboard 時，可以選某個 project 裡的某個 role。","B":"錯。Filter subscription 的收件人只能是自己或一個 group，而且要有 Manage group filter subscriptions。常見誤解：以為能選 project role。","C":"對。Permission scheme 是 role 最主要的用途：scheme 寫「某 role 有 Browse Projects」，各 project 再自己決定誰在這個 role 裡。","D":"錯。全域權限與產品存取是授予 group（全域權限也可給個別使用者），不能授予 project role，因為它們是全站層級、不屬於任何一個 project。","E":"對。Issue security level 的成員可以指定 project role，讓各 project 裡這個 role 的成員看得到受限的 issue，不同 project 的成員可以不同。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/how-to-use-space-roles/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/manage-filters/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.2-n09","sec":"620.3.2","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Chidi, a project administrator of company-managed project MANGO, wants a new role called Reviewer. Who can create it?","zh":"Chidi 是 company-managed project MANGO 的 project administrator，他想新增一個叫 Reviewer 的 role。誰能建立它？","zo":["Project administrator，在 Project settings > People 建立","Jira administrator，在系統的 project roles 設定中建立","任何有 Browse Projects 的使用者","Project lead"],"fig":"","opts":["The project administrator in Project settings > People","A Jira administrator in the system project roles settings","Any user with Browse Projects","The project lead"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。Project settings > People 只能把人或 group 放進既有的 role，不能新增 role；CMP 的 role 是全站共用的。","B":"對。官方步驟是 ⚙ → System → Security → Project roles 新增，這是 Jira admin 的工作；建好後各 project admin 再自己填成員。","C":"錯。Browse Projects 只讓人看得到 project 與 issue，和建立全站的 project role 完全無關，他們連 project 設定都進不去。","D":"錯。Project lead 是 project 的負責人欄位，本身沒有建立 role 的權限；CMP 的 role 一律由 Jira admin 建立。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/create-a-new-space-role/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.2-n10","sec":"620.3.2","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Imani, a Jira administrator, adds the group qa-team as a default member of the Testers role. The site already has 25 projects. What happens to those existing projects?","zh":"Jira administrator Imani 把 group qa-team 設為 Testers role 的 default member（預設成員）。站上已經有 25 個 project。這些既有的 project 會發生什麼事？","zo":["qa-team 會立刻被加進每個 project 的 Testers","既有的 project 必須先重新索引（re-index）","沒有變化；default members 只套用到之後新建的 project","只有使用預設 permission scheme 的 project 會被更新"],"fig":"","opts":["qa-team is added to Testers in every project immediately","Existing projects must be re-indexed first","Nothing; default members apply only to projects created afterwards","Only projects using the default permission scheme are updated"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。這是常見誤解：default members 不會回頭更新既有 project，只影響設定之後才建立的 project。","B":"錯。Re-index 是重建搜尋索引，和 role 成員無關；既有 project 就算重新索引，也不會多出 qa-team。","C":"對。官方寫明 default members 只會加進之後新建 project 的 role，既有 project 不會變；要加進舊 project，得由各 project admin 手動加。","D":"錯。Default members 和 project 用哪一份 permission scheme 無關，只看 project 是不是在設定之後才建立。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/create-a-new-space-role/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.2-n11","sec":"620.3.2","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Kaito, a Jira administrator at Brightwave, maintains one permission scheme shared by 40 projects. Why should he grant permissions to project roles rather than to individual users?","zh":"Brightwave 的 Jira administrator Kaito 維護一份由 40 個 project 共用的 permission scheme。為什麼他應該把權限授予 project role，而不是授予個別使用者？","zo":["當兩者同時適用時，role 的授予優先於 group 的授予","Project admin 可以替自己 project 的 role 額外加權限","每個 project 不必另建 scheme，就能使用不同的權限組合","Project admin 不必修改共用的 scheme，就能更換 role 成員"],"fig":"","opts":["Role grants take priority over group grants when both apply","Project admins can grant extra permissions to a role for their own project","Each project can use a different set of permissions without a separate scheme","Project admins can change who is in a role without editing the shared scheme"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。權限是各自疊加的，role 和 group 的授予沒有誰優先；使用者只要符合任何一項授予就擁有該權限。","B":"錯。哪個 role 有哪些權限寫在 scheme 裡，改它要 Jira admin 編輯 scheme；project admin 只能管 role 裡有誰。","C":"錯。共用同一份 scheme 的 project，權限清單完全相同；role 讓各 project 的「成員」不同，而不是讓權限內容不同。","D":"對。Role 是佔位符：scheme 只寫 role 名稱，各 project admin 自己決定誰在裡面。換人不用找 Jira admin 改 scheme，也不影響共用的其他 project。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/how-to-use-space-roles/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.3-n12","sec":"620.3.3","dom":"620.3","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Nadia archives version 3.1 in project PIKE. Which two statements are true? (Choose two.)","zh":"Nadia 把 PIKE project 的 version 3.1 archive 了。下列哪兩個敘述正確？（選兩個）","zo":["這個 version 被刪除，而且無法還原","原本已經用到它的 issue，Fix versions 欄位仍保留它","仍然可以把新 issue 的 Fix version 設成它","仍然可以用 JQL 搜尋到它的 issue","它的 issue 會被移到下一個尚未發布的 version"],"fig":"","opts":["The version is deleted and cannot be restored","Issues that already use it keep it in their Fix versions field","New issues can still have it set as their Fix version","Its issues can still be found with a JQL search","Its issues are moved to the next unreleased version"],"ans":"BD","why":{"A":"錯。Archive 可逆，隨時能在 ••• 選 Unarchive 還原，issue 與版本資料都還在；不可逆的是 Delete 與 Merge。","B":"對。Archive 不會改動 issue 上的值；官方寫明 archived version 不能從既有 issue 的 Fix version／Affects version 欄位移除，所以原本的 issue 保留它。","C":"錯。官方寫明不能再把 archived version 加到 issue 的版本欄位；Cloud 也會把它從報表與版本相關的下拉選單隱藏，要用得先 Unarchive。","D":"對。Issue 上的 Fix version 值還在，所以用 JQL 搜尋這個 version 仍然查得到；Atlassian 公開 issue 也指出 archived version 會出現在版本相關的查詢結果裡。","E":"錯。把 issue 移到另一版是 Release（處理未完成 issue）、Delete 或 Merge 時的選項；Archive 不會搬動 issue。"},"note":"「不能再把 archived version 加到 issue、也不能從 issue 移除」的明文在 Data Center 的 Managing versions 頁；Cloud 頁只寫 archive 會把版本從報表等處隱藏。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/manage-versions/","https://confluence.atlassian.com/adminjiraserver/managing-versions-938847201.html","https://jira.atlassian.com/browse/JRACLOUD-41610","https://jira.atlassian.com/browse/JRACLOUD-92868"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.3-n13","sec":"620.3.3","dom":"620.3","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Which statements about the Timeline are incorrect? (Choose two.)","zh":"關於 Timeline，下列哪些敘述是錯誤的？（選兩個）","zo":["使用者可以把檢視切換成週、月或季","使用者可以直接在 timeline 上修改 epic 的顏色","Timeline 上方的篩選會改動 board 的 saved filter","Scrum 與 Kanban 團隊都能排程子 issue","所有已完成的 epic 都會自動被移除"],"fig":"","opts":["Users can switch the view to weeks, months or quarters","Users can change an epic's color from the timeline","Filters at the top of the timeline change the board's saved filter","Child issues can be scheduled for both Scrum and Kanban teams","All completed epics are automatically removed"],"ans":"CE","why":{"A":"正確敘述（不選）。官方說可用時間刻度切換 Weeks、Months、Quarters，放大或縮小檢視範圍。","B":"正確敘述（不選）。可在側邊欄點色塊，或在 schedule bar 按右鍵選顏色；父層的顏色會套用到它的子 issue。","C":"錯誤敘述（要選）。官方說 timeline 上方的篩選和 JQL filter 不同，只是把 issue 從 timeline 畫面隱藏，不會改動 board 的 saved filter。","D":"正確敘述（不選）。Scrum 的子 issue 可依所屬 sprint 或起訖日排程；Kanban 用 Start date 與 Due date，需先啟用子層規劃。","E":"錯誤敘述（要選）。已完成的 epic 不會全部自動消失；考試版由 view settings 的 completed 選項決定顯示多久，現行版是 Hide done items 開關。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>考試版在 View settings 用 completed 選項決定已完成 issue 顯示多久；現行版改成 Hide done items 開關，只作用在父層 issue。另外，現行版把 timeline 的排程方式（依 sprint 或依日期）與子 issue 的顯示方式，從 space settings 移到了 View settings。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/customize-your-roadmaps-view-settings/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/schedule-work-for-scrum-teams-on-your-roadmap/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/schedule-work-for-kanban-teams-on-your-roadmap/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.3-n14","sec":"620.3.3","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. The team's board uses this filter, and the Timeline is unavailable. What should they use to plan epics across these projects?","zh":"請看附圖。團隊的 board 使用這個 filter，而 Timeline 無法使用。他們應該用什麼來規劃這幾個 project 的 epic？","zo":["每個 project 各建第二個 board","Plans（Advanced Roadmaps）","改用 Kanban board，不用 Scrum","放了 Road Map gadget 的 dashboard"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 290\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Cross-project board filter\"><rect x=\"0.5\" y=\"0.5\" width=\"379\" height=\"289\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"380\" height=\"34\" rx=\"0\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"34\" width=\"106\" height=\"256\" rx=\"0\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><line x1=\"106\" y1=\"34\" x2=\"106\" y2=\"290\" class=\"gl\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Board settings</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">General</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Board name</text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"95\" width=\"250\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"128\" y=\"113\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Mobile program board</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"144\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Filter query</text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"150\" width=\"250\" height=\"44\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx brand\"/><text x=\"126\" y=\"168\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t mono\" style=\"font-size:11px\">project in (MOB, PAY, WEB)</text><text x=\"126\" y=\"184\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t mono\" style=\"font-size:11px\">ORDER BY Rank ASC</text><rect x=\"6\" y=\"39\" width=\"94\" height=\"22\" rx=\"6\" class=\"sf-brand\"/><text x=\"14\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">General</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"80\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Columns</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"106\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Swimlanes</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"132\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Quick filters</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"158\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Card colors</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"184\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Card layout</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"210\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Estimation</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"236\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Working days</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"262\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Issue detail</text></svg>","opts":["A second board for each project","Plans (Advanced Roadmaps)","A Kanban board instead of Scrum","A dashboard with a Road Map gadget"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。每個 project 各建一個 board，各自的 timeline 只看得到自己的 project，仍然無法在同一個畫面規劃跨 project 的 epic。","B":"對。官方 Timeline limits 寫明 timeline 的 issue 必須來自同一個 project；圖中 filter 跨了三個 project，跨 project 規劃要用 Plans，Premium 以上才有。","C":"錯。Scrum 與 Kanban board 都能用 timeline，而且同樣只支援單一 project；換 board 類型解決不了跨 project 的問題。","D":"錯。Road Map gadget 只列出即將到期的 versions，不能排程或規劃 epic，不是 timeline 的跨 project 替代方案。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/set-up-the-roadmap/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.3-n15","sec":"620.3.3","dom":"620.3","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Solvanta moved to Jira Cloud Premium and wants to use Advanced Roadmaps (Plans). Which statements are accurate? (Choose two.)","zh":"Solvanta 改用 Jira Cloud Premium，想使用 Advanced Roadmaps（Plans）。下列哪些敘述正確？（選兩個）","zo":["任何 project administrator 都能在 epic 之上加一層 Initiative","它只能用在單一 project","它包含在 Jira Premium 裡","只有 Jira administrator 能建立 plan","在 plan 裡做的變更，要檢視（review）並儲存後才會寫回 issue"],"fig":"","opts":["Any project administrator can add an Initiative level above epics","It is limited to a single project","It is included with Jira Premium","Plans can be created only by Jira administrators","Changes in a plan are written to issues only after they are reviewed and saved"],"ans":"CE","why":{"A":"錯。在 epic 之上加 Initiative 等層級，要 Jira admin 設定 issue type hierarchy；project admin 沒有這個權限。","B":"錯。Plans 的重點正是跨範圍，可合併多個 board、project 與 filter；只能看單一 project 的是 Timeline。","C":"對。官方說 Plans 包含在 Jira Premium 與 Enterprise 裡，升級後就能用，不必另外安裝 app；Standard 方案沒有這個功能。","D":"錯。建立 plan 不限 Jira admin，有 Plans user 權限的使用者都能建立；Jira admin 預設是 Plans administrator，會受限的是 hierarchy 設定。","E":"對。Plan 像沙盒，裡面的變更只存在 plan 中；要在 Review changes 確認並儲存後，才會寫回 Jira 的 issue。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/what-is-advanced-roadmaps/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-custom-hierarchy-levels-in-advanced-roadmaps/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/set-permissions-in-advanced-roadmaps/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.3-n16","sec":"620.3.3","dom":"620.3","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Paulo, a release manager in project KORU, is training new team members on version fields. Which statements correctly describe the difference between Fix versions and Affects versions? (Choose two.)","zh":"KORU project 的 release manager Paulo 正在教新成員認識版本欄位。下列哪些敘述正確描述了 Fix versions 與 Affects versions 的差別？（選兩個）","zo":["Affects versions 會把 issue 加進該次發布","Fix versions 會把 issue 加進該 version 的發布範圍","Team-managed project 兩個欄位都有","Version report 依據 Affects versions 計算","Affects versions 記錄哪些版本有這個問題"],"fig":"","opts":["Affects versions adds the issue to the release","Fix versions adds the issue to the version's release scope","Both fields are available in team-managed projects","Version reports use Affects versions","Affects versions records which versions have the problem"],"ans":"BE","why":{"A":"錯。官方明說填 Affects versions 不會把 issue 加進該版本，它只讓人能搜尋影響特定版本的 issue。","B":"對。官方說在 Fix versions 填入某個版本，就等於把 issue 加進該 release；Release page 與 Version report 都依它計算。","C":"錯。Team-managed project 開啟 Releases 後只有 Fix versions；Affects versions 仍是 JRACLOUD-85690 的功能請求，尚未提供。","D":"錯。Version report 追蹤某個版本的出貨進度，依據的是 Fix versions；Affects versions 不會把 issue 加進版本，只用來搜尋受影響的版本。","E":"對。Affects versions 記錄問題出現在哪些版本；例如一個 bug 在好幾個舊版都有，可以一次填多個，方便搜尋。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/manage-versions/","https://jira.atlassian.com/browse/JRACLOUD-85690"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.3-n17","sec":"620.3.3","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. Which version can no longer be set as the Fix version of new issues?","zh":"請看附圖。哪一個 version 已經不能再被設為新 issue 的 Fix version？","zo":["v2.4","v2.3","v2.2","v2.0"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 240\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Releases 頁示意\"><rect x=\"0.5\" y=\"0.5\" width=\"379\" height=\"239\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"380\" height=\"34\" rx=\"0\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><text x=\"14\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\">Releases</text><text x=\"16\" y=\"56\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\">v2.4</text><rect x=\"62\" y=\"44\" width=\"84\" height=\"18\" rx=\"9\" class=\"bx brand\"/><text x=\"104\" y=\"57\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"s\" style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:700\">UNRELEASED</text><rect x=\"160\" y=\"48\" width=\"140\" height=\"10\" rx=\"5\" class=\"sf-gray\"/><rect x=\"160\" y=\"48\" width=\"35.0\" height=\"10\" rx=\"5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"364\" y=\"57\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">10/20</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"72\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"72\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"16\" y=\"98\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\">v2.3</text><rect x=\"62\" y=\"86\" width=\"84\" height=\"18\" rx=\"9\" class=\"bx brand\"/><text x=\"104\" y=\"99\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"s\" style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:700\">UNRELEASED</text><rect x=\"160\" y=\"90\" width=\"140\" height=\"10\" rx=\"5\" class=\"sf-gray\"/><rect x=\"160\" y=\"90\" width=\"98.0\" height=\"10\" rx=\"5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"364\" y=\"99\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">10/02</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"114\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"114\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"16\" y=\"140\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\">v2.2</text><rect x=\"62\" y=\"128\" width=\"84\" height=\"18\" rx=\"9\" class=\"bx green\"/><text x=\"104\" y=\"141\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"s\" style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:700\">RELEASED</text><rect x=\"160\" y=\"132\" width=\"140\" height=\"10\" rx=\"5\" class=\"sf-gray\"/><rect x=\"160\" y=\"132\" width=\"140\" height=\"10\" rx=\"5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"364\" y=\"141\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">09/10</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"156\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"156\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"16\" y=\"182\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\">v2.0</text><rect x=\"62\" y=\"170\" width=\"84\" height=\"18\" rx=\"9\" class=\"bx gray\"/><text x=\"104\" y=\"183\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"s\" style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:700\">ARCHIVED</text><rect x=\"160\" y=\"174\" width=\"140\" height=\"10\" rx=\"5\" class=\"sf-gray\"/><rect x=\"160\" y=\"174\" width=\"140\" height=\"10\" rx=\"5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"364\" y=\"183\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">07/01</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"198\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"198\" class=\"gl\"/></svg>","opts":["v2.4","v2.3","v2.2","v2.0"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。v2.4 是 Unreleased，代表還在進行中的版本，下拉選單裡看得到，可以把新 issue 的 Fix version 設成它。","B":"錯。v2.3 也是 Unreleased，只是進度比較多；尚未發布的版本都可以繼續設為新 issue 的 Fix version。","C":"錯。v2.2 是 Released；已發布的版本在下拉選單中歸到另一區，但仍可選取，所以還能設成新 issue 的 Fix version。","D":"對。v2.0 是 Archived。Cloud 的 Fix versions 下拉選單不會列出 archived version（能選到它曾被當成 bug 修掉，見 JRACLOUD-92868），DC 文件也寫明不能再加到 issue 上；原本的 issue 仍保留它。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/manage-versions/","https://confluence.atlassian.com/adminjiraserver/managing-versions-938847201.html","https://jira.atlassian.com/browse/JRACLOUD-92868"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.3-n18","sec":"620.3.3","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Keala, a developer in project SURF, cannot see warnings on the release page for version 2.1, although Bitbucket is connected and her teammates can see them. What should be checked first?","zh":"SURF project 的開發者 Keala 在 version 2.1 的 release 頁面上看不到 warnings；Bitbucket 已經連上，隊友也看得到。應該先檢查什麼？","zo":["Manage Versions 權限","Browse Projects 權限","View Development Tools 權限","View Read-Only Workflow 權限"],"fig":"","opts":["The Manage Versions permission","The Browse Projects permission","The View Development Tools permission","The View Read-Only Workflow permission"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。Manage Versions 管建立、release、archive version，不影響能不能看到 release 頁上的 warnings；看 warnings 要的是 View Development Tools。","B":"錯。她已經打得開 release 頁，代表有 Browse Projects；warnings 要看的是 View Development Tools。","C":"對。官方列出 warnings 出現的條件：已連開發工具、有 View Development Tools 權限、warnings 已開。工具已連、隊友看得到，就先查她的權限。","D":"錯。View Read-Only Workflow 只讓人透過 View workflow 連結看 workflow 圖，和 release 頁顯示開發警告無關。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/use-the-release-page-to-check-the-progress-of-a-version/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/space-access-and-configuration-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.4-n19","sec":"620.3.4","dom":"620.3","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Ayesha, a project administrator of company-managed project DELTA, is deciding between the Components field and a new custom field for grouping work. Which requirements can be met only by Components? (Choose two.)","zh":"Ayesha 是 company-managed project DELTA 的 project administrator，她在考慮要用 Components 欄位，還是新建 custom field 來替工作分組。哪些需求只有 Components 做得到？（選兩個）","zo":["欄位要能讓每張 issue 填多個值","欄位本身就能自動決定 issue 的 assignee，不需要 automation rule","不需額外設定，就有現成的 project 頁面列出每個值與它的 issue","建立 issue 時要自動帶入預設值","欄位的值要能用 JQL 搜尋"],"fig":"","opts":["The field must allow multiple values per issue","The field itself must set the issue's assignee automatically, without automation rules","A built-in project page must list every value and show its issues, with no extra setup","A default value must be applied when an issue is created","The field values must be searchable with JQL"],"ans":"BC","why":{"A":"錯。多選不是 Components 的專利；custom field 有 Select list（multiple choices）與 Checkboxes，同樣能填多個值。","B":"對。Component 本身就能設 default assignee（例如 component lead），建立 issue 時自動指派；custom field 沒有這項原生能力，要另建 automation rule 依欄位值指派才做得到。","C":"對。官方說 project 的 Components 頁會列出所有 component，點名稱就看到相關 issue；custom field 沒有這種現成的專屬頁面。","D":"錯。Custom field 的 context 可以設定預設值，建立 issue 時自動帶入；這不是 Components 獨有的能力。","E":"錯。Custom field 和 Components 都能用 JQL 搜尋，例如 <code>component = Backend</code>；能被搜尋是所有欄位的共同能力，不是 Components 獨有的。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/what-are-jira-components/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-a-projects-components/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-jira-components/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/field-types-you-can-create-as-a-jira-admin/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.4-n20","sec":"620.3.4","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Aroha, a Jira administrator, wants to group 12 projects under a Mobile category, and also tag 3 of them as Regulated. Which statement is true?","zh":"Jira administrator Aroha 想把 12 個 project 歸到 Mobile category，並把其中 3 個再標成 Regulated。下列哪個敘述正確？","zo":["一個 category 只能放一個 project","Project admin 在 Project settings 裡建立 category","一個 project 可以同時屬於 Mobile 與 Regulated","每個 project 只能有一個 category"],"fig":"","opts":["A category can hold only one project","Project admins create categories in Project settings","A project can be in both Mobile and Regulated","Each project can have only one category"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。Category 的用途就是把多個相關 project 歸在一起，方便搜尋與報表；12 個 project 都可以放進 Mobile。","B":"錯。Category 是 Jira admin 在 ⚙ → Projects → Project categories 全站建立，再到各 project 的 Details 指派，不是 project admin 在 project 裡建立。","C":"錯。Project details 的 Category 欄位只能選一個；那 3 個 project 不能同時屬於 Mobile 與 Regulated，要另想標記方式。","D":"對。一個 category 可給多個 project，但每個 project 只能選一個 category；所以 Mobile 能收 12 個 project，卻不能再疊一個 Regulated。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/add-assign-and-delete-project-categories/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/edit-a-projects-details/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.4-n21","sec":"620.3.4","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Lucía, a Jira administrator at Tidewell, needs issues to capture a product and then a sub-product from a two-level menu. Which field type should she create?","zh":"Tidewell 的 Jira administrator Lucía 需要讓 issue 透過兩層選單，先選產品、再選子產品。她應該建立哪一種欄位類型？","zo":["Select list（cascading）","Labels","Select list（multiple choices）","Short text"],"fig":"","opts":["Select list (cascading)","Labels","Select list (multiple choices)","Short text"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。Cascading select list 可以先建父選項，再在底下放子選項，正好是「產品 → 子產品」兩層選單；注意欄位建好後型別不能改。","B":"錯。Labels 讓使用者自由輸入標籤，沒有固定選項，也沒有父子層級，做不出兩層選單。","C":"錯。Multiple choices 讓人從同一層選項中選多個，選項之間沒有父子關係，做不出「先選產品、再選子產品」的兩層選單。","D":"錯。Short text 是 255 字以內的純文字輸入，沒有選項可選，更沒有兩層結構。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/field-types-you-can-create-as-a-jira-admin/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.4-n22","sec":"620.3.4","dom":"620.3","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Mele, a team lead in project REEF, is deciding whether her team should tag issues with labels. Which two statements about labels are true? (Choose two.)","zh":"REEF project 的 team lead Mele 正在考慮要不要讓團隊用 labels 標記 issue。關於 labels，下列哪兩個敘述正確？（選兩個）","zo":["Labels 有 lead 與 default assignee","任何有 Edit Issues 的使用者，都能直接輸入來建立新 label","Labels 只有 company-managed project 能用","新 label 必須經過 Jira administrator 核准","在某個 project 建立的 label，可以在其他 project 重複使用"],"fig":"","opts":["Labels have a lead and a default assignee","Any user with Edit Issues can create a new label by typing it","Labels are only available in company-managed projects","A Jira administrator must approve new labels","A label created in one project can be reused in other projects"],"ans":"BE","why":{"A":"錯。Lead 與 default assignee 是 components 的設定，可自動指派 issue；labels 只是自由標籤，沒有負責人。","B":"對。在 issue 的 Labels 欄位輸入新名稱按 Enter 就建立了，只要能編輯 issue 即可；沒有管控，拼錯一個字就是另一個 label。","C":"錯。Team-managed project 也能用 labels，只要 project admin 把系統的 Labels 欄位加到 issue type 上即可使用。","D":"錯。Labels 沒有任何審核流程，使用者輸入就建立；想要受控的選項，應改用 custom field。","E":"對。官方 KB 說 labels 是全站的：在一個 company-managed project 建的 label，其他 project 也看得到、能選用，輸入時 Jira 會提示既有的 label。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira/kb/how-to-create-and-use-labels-in-jira-cloud/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira/kb/unable-to-add-a-label-to-issues-in-a-team-managed-project/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.5-n23","sec":"620.3.5","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"In project OKAPI, an issue is created with two components: Backend (default assignee: Component lead Ana) and Alpha (default assignee: Component lead Ben). Both have Assignable User. Who is assigned automatically?","zh":"在 OKAPI project 裡，有一張 issue 建立時帶了兩個 components：Backend（default assignee：Component lead Ana）與 Alpha（default assignee：Component lead Ben）。兩人都有 Assignable User。系統會自動指派給誰？","zo":["Ana，因為 Backend 比較早加上去","Project lead","Ben，因為 Alpha 的字母順序在前","沒有人；有多個 components 時 issue 會保持未指派"],"fig":"","opts":["Ana, because Backend was added first","The project lead","Ben, because Alpha comes first alphabetically","Nobody; multiple components leave the issue unassigned"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。Jira 不看 component 加入的先後順序；同級時比的是 component 名稱的字母順序，Alpha 在 Backend 之前。","B":"錯。Project lead 的優先序低於 Component lead；兩個 component 都設了 Component lead，而且兩人都能被指派，輪不到 project lead。","C":"對。兩個都是 Component lead，屬同一級，Jira 就依 component 名稱的字母順序決定；Alpha 排在 Backend 前面，所以指派給 Ben。","D":"錯。有多個 components 時，Jira 會依優先序挑出一位，不會因此留空；只有 Unassigned 勝出時才會未指派。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira/kb/manage-components-default-assignee-jira-software/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-jira-components/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.5-n24","sec":"620.3.5","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"In project HALO, an issue is created with components Zeta (default assignee: Project default) and Docs (default assignee: Unassigned). The Assignee is left as Automatic. Who is the issue assigned to?","zh":"在 HALO project 裡，有一張 issue 建立時帶了 components Zeta（default assignee：Project default）與 Docs（default assignee：Unassigned），Assignee 保持 Automatic。這張 issue 會指派給誰？","zo":["Zeta 的 component lead","沒有人；保持未指派","Project lead","Reporter（回報人）"],"fig":"","opts":["The Zeta component lead","Nobody; it stays unassigned","The project lead","The reporter"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。Zeta 設的是 Project default，會沿用 project 層級的預設，而不是 Component lead；而且它的優先序在四種類型裡最低。","B":"對。多個 components 時先比 default assignee 的類型：Component lead＞Project lead＞Unassigned＞Project default，所以 Docs 的 Unassigned 勝出，issue 保持未指派。","C":"錯。兩個 component 都沒有設 Project lead；Zeta 的 Project default 優先序低於 Docs 的 Unassigned，輪不到沿用 project 的預設。","D":"錯。Reporter 不是 component default assignee 的選項；可選的是 Component lead、Project lead、Project default、Unassigned（現行版另可指定某位使用者）。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira/kb/manage-components-default-assignee-jira-software/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.5-n25","sec":"620.3.5","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Leilani leads the support team in project CARE and wants each new issue assigned in turn to three agents. What should she use?","zh":"Leilani 帶領 CARE project 的支援團隊，希望每張新 issue 都依序輪流指派給三位客服人員。她應該用什麼？","zo":["Component 的 default assignee","Project 的 default assignee","Workflow 的 post function","Automation rule"],"fig":"","opts":["A component default assignee","The project default assignee","A workflow post function","An automation rule"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。Component default assignee 只能指到一個固定對象，例如 component lead，無法在三個人之間輪流。","B":"錯。Project default assignee 只能設 Unassigned 或 Project lead，是固定的一個人，做不到輪流指派。","C":"錯。內建的指派類 post function 只有 Assign to Current User、Assign to Lead Developer、Assign to Reporter，都是固定對象，沒有輪流指派。","D":"對。Automation 的 Assign issue 動作可以從指定名單用 Round-robin 依序指派，另有 Balanced workload 與 Random；搭配 Issue created 觸發即可。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/jira-automation-actions/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-advanced-issue-workflows/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.5-n26","sec":"620.3.5","dom":"620.3","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. Tavita, the project lead of HARB, opens the Default assignee list on the project's Details page. Which two values can she choose from? (Choose two.)","zh":"請看附圖。HARB 的 project lead Tavita 在 project 的 Details 頁打開 Default assignee 清單。她可以從哪兩個值中選擇？（選兩個）","zo":["Developers role 裡的任何成員","Component lead","Reporter（回報人）","Unassigned（未指派）","Project lead"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 348\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"HARB project details\"><rect x=\"0.5\" y=\"0.5\" width=\"379\" height=\"347\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"380\" height=\"34\" rx=\"0\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Project settings · HARB</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Details</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Name</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"95\" width=\"356\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"113\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Harbor Ops</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"144\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Key</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"150\" width=\"356\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"168\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">HARB</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"199\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Project lead</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"205\" width=\"356\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"223\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Tavita Fuimaono</text><path d=\"M350,216 l5,5 l5,-5\" class=\"ln ink\" style=\"stroke-width:1.6\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"254\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Default assignee</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"260\" width=\"356\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx brand\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"278\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Select…</text><path d=\"M350,271 l5,5 l5,-5\" class=\"ln ink\" style=\"stroke-width:1.6\"/><rect x=\"12\" y=\"298\" width=\"46.0\" height=\"26\" rx=\"6\" class=\"fl-brand\"/><text x=\"35.0\" y=\"315\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"w\">Save</text></svg>","opts":["Any member of the Developers role","Component lead","The reporter","Unassigned","Project lead"],"ans":"DE","why":{"A":"錯。Project default 不能指定某個 role 或任意成員；想依規則指派給特定人，要用 automation 的 Assign issue。","B":"錯。Component lead 是 component 層級 default assignee 的選項之一，只在 issue 掛了該 component 時生效，不能設在 project 層級。","C":"錯。Reporter 不是 project default assignee 的選項；想把 issue 指派給建立者，可以用 automation 的 Assign issue 動作。","D":"對。Project default assignee 只有 Unassigned 與 Project lead 兩種；要選 Unassigned，前提是全站的 Allow unassigned issues 已開啟，關閉時預設就變成 project lead。","E":"對。另一個選項就是 Project lead；想讓特定的人當預設，要把他設成 project lead，或改用 automation。"},"note":"現行 UI 把 Project lead 改叫 Space owner；Allow unassigned issues 預設是開啟的。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/edit-a-projects-details/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-jira-application-options/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.6-n27","sec":"620.3.6","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Ingrid can edit the Description of issues in project FJORD, but the Due date field is read-only for her. Which permission is she missing?","zh":"Ingrid 能編輯 FJORD project 裡 issue 的 Description，但 Due date 欄位對她是唯讀的。她缺少哪個權限？","zo":["Schedule Issues","Edit Issues","Assign Issues","Administer Projects"],"fig":"","opts":["Schedule Issues","Edit Issues","Assign Issues","Administer Projects"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。官方說日期欄位可由 Schedule Issues 另外限制；Due date 屬於排程，有 Edit Issues 也改不了。欄位看得到卻是灰色，是權限問題。","B":"錯。她能改 Description，代表已經有 Edit Issues；問題出在 Due date 需要更具體的權限。","C":"錯。Assign Issues 只管能不能修改 Assignee 欄位，和 Due date 能不能編輯沒有關係；Due date 歸 Schedule Issues 管。","D":"錯。Administer Projects 管 project 設定，例如 role 成員、versions、components，不會讓 Due date 變成可編輯。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/work-item-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.6-n28","sec":"620.3.6","dom":"620.3","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"A Jira administrator has just created a custom field called Vendor ID. Kofi, the project administrator of company-managed project ACORN, wants to show it on the issue layout for Bugs, but the field is not listed. What are the likely reasons? (Choose two.)","zh":"Jira administrator 剛建立了一個叫 Vendor ID 的 custom field。Kofi 是 company-managed project ACORN 的 project administrator，他想把這個欄位顯示在 Bug 的 issue layout 上，但清單裡找不到它。可能的原因是什麼？（選兩個）","zo":["Kofi 缺少 Browse Projects","Issue layout 最多只能放五個欄位","這個欄位不在 ACORN 的 Bug 所使用的 screen 上","這個欄位的 context 沒有包含 ACORN 或 Bug 這個 issue type","欄位不能在區塊之間移動"],"fig":"","opts":["Kofi lacks Browse Projects","The issue layout is limited to five fields","The field is not on the screen used by Bugs in ACORN","The field's context does not include ACORN or the Bug issue type","Fields cannot be moved between sections"],"ans":"CD","why":{"A":"錯。沒有 Browse Projects 連 project 都進不去，更不可能打開 layout 設定；題目中他已經在設定 layout。","B":"錯。Issue layout 沒有五個欄位的上限；能放多少欄位，取決於 screen 上放了哪些欄位。","C":"對。Layout 只能排列 screen 上已有的欄位；新欄位要先由 Jira admin 加到 Bug 使用的 screen，才會出現在清單裡。","D":"對。Custom field 的 context 決定哪些 project 與 issue type 能用這個欄位；沒套用到 ACORN 或 Bug，就算在 screen 上也不會出現，要請 Jira admin 修改 context。","E":"錯。Layout 的用途正是在 Description、Context、Hidden 等區塊之間拖曳欄位，沒有不能移動的限制。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-field-layout-in-the-issue-view/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/edit-a-custom-field-context/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira/kb/fields-not-visible-or-missing-on-issue-types/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.6-n29","sec":"620.3.6","dom":"620.3","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Rangi is the admin of team-managed project WAKA. Which two features can he NOT configure? (Choose two.)","zh":"Rangi 是 team-managed project WAKA 的管理員。下列哪兩項功能他無法設定？（選兩個）","zo":["建立自訂的 issue type","加入 Affects versions 欄位","修改 project 通知信的寄件者 email","加入 Fix versions 欄位","替 workflow transition 加上 screen"],"fig":"","opts":["Creating a custom issue type","Adding an Affects versions field","Changing the project's notification sender email","Adding a Fix versions field","Adding a screen to a workflow transition"],"ans":"BE","why":{"A":"錯。TMP 的 project admin 可以在 Project settings → Issue types 自己建立新的 issue type，這項功能可以用。","B":"對。TMP 開啟 Releases 後只會加入 Fix versions；Affects versions 至今仍是 JRACLOUD-85690 的功能請求，尚未提供，所以無法使用。","C":"錯。TMP 的 Notifications 設定裡可以修改寄出通知的 email 地址，這項功能可以用。","D":"錯。TMP 在 Features 開啟 Releases 後，會自動把 Fix versions 欄位加到 issue type 上，可以使用。","E":"對。考試版的 TMP 沒有 screen 與 screen scheme，transition 無法掛畫面；現行版的變化見下方說明。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>考試版的 TMP 沒有 screen，transition 不能掛畫面；現行版可以在 transition 加 Request input → Show a screen 規則。","src":["https://jira.atlassian.com/browse/JRACLOUD-85690","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/map-a-screen-to-a-workflow-transition/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/set-up-issue-types-in-team-managed-projects/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/customize-notifications-in-team-managed-projects/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/enable-releases-and-versions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.7-n30","sec":"620.3.7","dom":"620.3","type":"multi","n":3,"stem":"Siosaia, a project administrator of project TAPA, is adding time tracking to the Task screen. Which fields belong to Jira's time tracking? (Choose three.)","zh":"TAPA project 的 project administrator Siosaia 要把工時追蹤加到 Task 的 screen 上。下列哪些欄位屬於 Jira 的 time tracking（工時追蹤）？（選三個）","zo":["Original estimate","Story points","Remaining estimate","Time spent","Due date"],"fig":"","opts":["Original estimate","Story points","Remaining estimate","Time spent","Due date"],"ans":"ACD","why":{"A":"對。Original estimate 記錄工作一開始估計要花多少時間，是 Time tracking 欄位的一部分，要放上 screen 才能填寫。","B":"錯。Story points 是 Scrum 用來估算相對大小的欄位，不是時間。常見誤解：把它當成 time tracking 欄位。","C":"對。Remaining estimate 記錄還剩多少時間，記工時後會自動遞減，是 Time tracking 欄位之一，可在記工時時手動調整。","D":"對。Time spent 是已記錄工時的總和，每次 Log work 都會累加上去；記工時需要 Work On Issues 權限。","E":"錯。Due date 是到期日，屬於排程欄位，修改它要 Schedule Issues，不屬於 time tracking。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-time-tracking/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/log-time-on-an-issue/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.7-n31","sec":"620.3.7","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Ines has the Link Issues permission in project CORAL, but the Link option is missing on every issue in every project she opens. What is the most likely cause?","zh":"Ines 在 CORAL project 有 Link Issues 權限，但她打開的每個 project、每張 issue 上都沒有 Link 選項。最可能的原因是什麼？","zo":["全站的 issue linking 被停用","Ines 缺少 Edit Issues","Project 沒有任何 components","Issue type 沒有 screen"],"fig":"","opts":["Issue linking is deactivated globally","Ines lacks Edit Issues","The project has no components","The issue type has no screen"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。官方說 issue linking 要由 Jira admin 在全站啟用；被停用時，就算有 Link Issues 權限也用不了。「每張」都沒有，指向全站開關。","B":"錯。連結 issue 靠的是 Link Issues 權限，不需要 Edit Issues；而且 Ines 已經有 Link Issues。","C":"錯。Components 只是分類欄位，project 有沒有 components，不影響 issue 能不能互相連結；連結看的是全站開關與 Link Issues。","D":"錯。Issue type 一定會透過 screen scheme 對應到 screen；Link 是 issue 上的動作，不是靠 screen 欄位顯示。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-issue-linking/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.7-n32","sec":"620.3.7","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Tomasz, working in project NOVA, cannot find a colleague from Finance, who does not work in NOVA, when typing an @mention in a comment. What is the most likely cause?","zh":"在 NOVA project 工作的 Tomasz 在留言裡輸入 @mention 時，找不到財務部一位不在 NOVA 工作的同事。最可能的原因是什麼？","zo":["Tomasz 缺少 Browse Projects","那位同事缺少 Assignable User","Tomasz 缺少 Manage Watchers","Tomasz 缺少 Browse users and groups"],"fig":"","opts":["Tomasz lacks Browse Projects","The colleague lacks Assignable User","Tomasz lacks Manage Watchers","Tomasz lacks Browse users and groups"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。沒有 Browse Projects，Tomasz 根本打不開 NOVA 的 issue，更不可能留言；他已經在留言，代表有這個權限。","B":"錯。Assignable User 決定誰能出現在 Assignee 欄位的候選名單，和 @mention 找不找得到人無關。","C":"錯。Manage Watchers 只管替別人加入或移除 watcher，不影響 @mention 時看得到哪些使用者。","D":"對。官方說沒有 Browse users and groups 的人，在 @mention 或 user picker 只看得到在該 project 有 Browse Projects 的人，不在 NOVA 的同事就找不到。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/manage-global-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.7-n33","sec":"620.3.7","dom":"620.3","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Tane, a developer on project MOB, pushes a commit with the message “MOB-10 #time 2h #comment fixed login”. What happens in Jira if everything is configured correctly? (Choose two.)","zh":"MOB project 的開發者 Tane 推送了一則 commit，訊息是「MOB-10 #time 2h #comment fixed login」。如果一切都設定正確，Jira 會發生什麼事？（選兩個）","zo":["在 MOB-10 記錄 2 小時工時","MOB-10 轉換到 Done","建立一張新的 issue MOB-10","把這個 commit 以附件形式加到 issue 上","在 MOB-10 新增一則留言"],"fig":"","opts":["2 hours are logged on MOB-10","MOB-10 is transitioned to Done","A new issue MOB-10 is created","The commit is attached as a file","A comment is added to MOB-10"],"ans":"AE","why":{"A":"對。<code>#time 2h</code> 是 smart commit 的記工時指令，會在 MOB-10 記 2 小時；前提是 commit 作者的 email 對得上一位有記工時權限的 Jira 使用者。","B":"錯。要轉狀態得寫 transition 名稱，例如 <code>#done</code> 或 <code>#resolve</code>；這則訊息裡沒有任何 transition 指令。","C":"錯。Smart commit 只處理已存在的 issue；MOB-10 是被引用的 issue key，不會因此建立新 issue。","D":"錯。Commit 會顯示在 issue 的 Development 面板，不會變成附件；smart commit 只有留言、記工時、轉狀態三種指令。","E":"對。<code>#comment</code> 指令會把後面的文字加成 MOB-10 的留言；同一行可以放多個指令，會依序執行。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/bitbucket-cloud/docs/use-smart-commits/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.3-n01","sec":"620.5.3","dom":"620.5","type":"multi","n":3,"stem":"Dmitri, a product owner on the HALO Scrum board, changes the board's working days to exclude a public holiday. Which reports on that board will reflect the change? (Choose three.)","zh":"Dmitri 是 HALO Scrum board 的 product owner，他修改 board 的 working days，把一個國定假日排除在外。這個 board 上的哪些報表會反映這項變更？（選三個）","zo":["Burndown Chart（燃盡圖）","Velocity Chart（速度圖）","Version Report（版本報表）","Cumulative Flow Diagram（累積流量圖）","Control Chart（控制圖）","Burnup Chart（燃起圖）"],"fig":"","opts":["Burndown Chart","Velocity Chart","Version Report","Cumulative Flow Diagram","Control Chart","Burnup Chart"],"ans":"ACE","why":{"A":"對。Burndown Chart 在官方 working days 清單裡；排除假日後，guideline 在非工作日維持水平，不算該燒掉工作的日子。","B":"錯。Velocity Chart 以整個 sprint 為單位比較 Commitment 與 Completed，不看每一天，不在官方清單裡。","C":"對。Version Report 在官方 working days 清單裡。它依平均每日速度推算 Predicted Release Date，所以會吃工作日設定。","D":"錯。Cumulative Flow Diagram 按日曆日畫各狀態的件數，不在官方 working days 清單裡，改了假日也不會變。","E":"對。Control Chart 也在官方清單裡（5 張：Burndown、Sprint、Epic、Version、Control）。常見誤解：以為所有報表都吃。","F":"錯。Burnup Chart 名字很像 Burndown，但不在官方清單裡。常見誤解：把 Burndown 的特性套到 Burnup。"},"note":"清單：Burndown、Sprint report、Epic report、Version report、Control chart ＋ Sprint Health、Burndown gadget。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-working-days/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.3-n02","sec":"620.5.3","dom":"620.5","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Obinna leads a Kanban team whose company-managed board tracks project RIVET. Which two reports can he open from the board? (Choose two.)","zh":"Obinna 帶領一個 Kanban 團隊，他們的 company-managed board 追蹤 RIVET project。他可以從 board 打開哪兩張報表？（選兩個）","zo":["Sprint Report","Control Chart","Velocity Chart","Epic Burndown","Cumulative Flow Diagram"],"fig":"","opts":["Sprint Report","Control Chart","Velocity Chart","Epic Burndown","Cumulative Flow Diagram"],"ans":"BE","why":{"A":"錯。Sprint Report 列出每個 sprint 完成或退回 backlog 的工作，必須有 sprint，只有 Scrum board 才有。","B":"對。官方列給 Kanban 的報表是 Control Chart 和 CFD；Control Chart 顯示 cycle time，不需要 sprint。","C":"錯。Velocity Chart 比較每個 sprint 承諾與完成的工作量，以 sprint 為單位，Kanban board 沒有。","D":"錯。Epic Burndown 用最近三個 sprint 的完成量預測 epic 還要幾個 sprint，是 Scrum 專屬報表。","E":"對。Cumulative Flow Diagram 是 Kanban 能用的另一張，顯示各狀態的件數隨時間變化，用來找瓶頸，不需要 sprint。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/generate-a-report/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.3-n03","sec":"620.5.3","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit, which shows the burnup chart for a sprint in project MAPLE. What happened on the days when the red line steps up?","zh":"請看圖，這是 MAPLE project 某個 sprint 的 burnup chart。紅線往上跳的那幾天發生了什麼事？","zo":["團隊完成的工作比計畫多","Sub-task 的估點被加總到 parent 上","Sprint 的結束日期被延後","Sprint 開始後又有工作被加進來"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 200\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Burnup chart 示意\"><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"116.66666666666666\" x2=\"306\" y2=\"116.66666666666666\" class=\"gl\"/><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"71.33333333333333\" x2=\"306\" y2=\"71.33333333333333\" class=\"gl\"/><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"26.0\" x2=\"306\" y2=\"26.0\" class=\"gl\"/><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"162\" x2=\"306\" y2=\"162\" class=\"ax\"/><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"162\" x2=\"40\" y2=\"20\" class=\"ax\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"16\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">故事點</text><polyline points=\"48,77 148,77 148,54 223,54 223,37 298,37\" class=\"ln rose w3\"/><polyline points=\"48,162 98,145 148,128 198,105 248,83 298,63\" class=\"ln green w3\"/><text x=\"152.0\" y=\"48.33333333333334\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s tf-rose\" style=\"font-weight:700\"></text><text x=\"227.0\" y=\"31.333333333333343\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s tf-rose\" style=\"font-weight:700\"></text><line x1=\"44\" y1=\"188\" x2=\"58\" y2=\"188\" class=\"ln rose w3\"/><text x=\"62\" y=\"192\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Work scope</text><line x1=\"180.0\" y1=\"188\" x2=\"194.0\" y2=\"188\" class=\"ln green w3\"/><text x=\"198.0\" y=\"192\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Completed</text></svg>","opts":["The team completed more work than planned","Sub-task estimates were rolled up into the parent","The sprint end date was extended","Work was added to the sprint after it started"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。完成量是綠線（Completed），不是紅線；紅線代表 sprint 的工作總量，做得多不會讓它往上跳。","B":"錯。官方說 Burnup chart 只算 parent 的 story points，sub-task 的估點不列入，所以不會讓紅線上升。","C":"錯。延後結束日只會拉長橫軸的天數，不會增加 sprint 的工作總量，紅線不會因此往上跳。","D":"對。紅線是 Work scope（sprint 的工作總量）。官方說紅線在 sprint 中上升就是 scope creep，代表中途加了工作。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-burnup-chart/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.3-n04","sec":"620.5.3","dom":"620.5","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"During the sprint review for project MAPLE, Leilani sees an issue in the Sprint Report marked with an asterisk (*) and an estimate of “3 → 5”. What do these indicate? (Choose two.)","zh":"在 MAPLE project 的 sprint review 上，Leilani 看到 Sprint Report 裡某個 issue 旁邊有星號（*），估點顯示為「3 → 5」。這兩個標記代表什麼？（選兩個）","zo":["這個 issue 是在 sprint 以外完成的","這個 issue 是在 sprint 開始後才加入的","這個 issue 已從 sprint 中移除","這個估點在 sprint 進行中被修改過","這個 issue 有兩個 sub-task"],"fig":"","opts":["The issue was completed outside the sprint","The issue was added after the sprint started","The issue was removed from the sprint","The estimate was changed during the sprint","The issue has two sub-tasks"],"ans":"BD","why":{"A":"錯。「在 sprint 以外完成」和星號無關；星號只表示這張 issue 加入 sprint 的時間在 sprint 開始之後。","B":"對。官方 Sprint Report 說明：sprint 開始後才加入的 issue 會標上星號。這類工作也不算進 Velocity 的 Commitment。","C":"錯。被移出 sprint 的 issue 不會標星號；官方說移出的變動會反映在紅線上。星號只代表中途加入。","D":"對。官方說明：估點欄出現兩個數字、中間夾箭頭（例如 3 → 5），代表 story point 在 sprint 進行中被調整過。","E":"錯。Sprint Report 不計 sub-task 的估點；兩個數字加箭頭是估點被改過，跟 sub-task 的數量無關。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-sprint-report/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.3-n05","sec":"620.5.3","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Sione's Scrum board for project PIXEL estimates with Story Points and does not use time tracking. During an active sprint, he adds a sub-task to a story that is already in the sprint. What is the effect?","zh":"Sione 的 PIXEL project Scrum board 用 Story Points 估算，沒有使用時間追蹤。在 active sprint 進行中，他在一張已經在 sprint 裡的 story 底下新增了一個 sub-task。結果會怎樣？","zo":["不算 scope change，也不會出現在 burndown 上","算 scope change，而且會出現在 burndown 上","算 scope change，但不會顯示在 burndown 上","不算 scope change，但 burndown 會反映它的估點"],"fig":"","opts":["It is not a scope change and does not appear on the burndown","It is a scope change, and it appears on the burndown","It is a scope change, but it is not shown on the burndown","It is not a scope change, but the burndown reflects its estimate"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。常見誤解：以為用 story points 就不算。官方寫明沒開時間追蹤時，sub-task 一樣算 scope change。","B":"錯。這是 board 開了 Remaining Estimate and Time Spent 時的情況；只有那種設定，burndown 才畫得出這個變化。","C":"對。官方：時間追蹤關閉時，新增的 sub-task 仍算 scope change，只是 burndown 不顯示。記法：帳本一定記，圖上不一定畫。","D":"錯。前半就錯了：不論有沒有開時間追蹤，一律算 scope change；而且 sub-task 的 story points 不計入 Burndown。"},"note":"記法：帳本一定記，圖上不一定畫。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-burndown-chart/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.3-n06","sec":"620.5.3","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. Anouk, a Kanban team lead, reviews the Cumulative Flow Diagram for her board. What does the widening In Review band indicate?","zh":"請看圖。Kanban 團隊負責人 Anouk 正在看她 board 的 Cumulative Flow Diagram。In Review 那條越來越寬的色帶代表什麼？","zo":["In Review 是瓶頸：流進來的工作比流出去的多","團隊在 In Review 完成了更多工作","這張圖只計算工作日","In Review 裡的 issue 正在被刪除"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 200\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Cumulative flow diagram 示意\"><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"116.66666666666666\" x2=\"306\" y2=\"116.66666666666666\" class=\"gl\"/><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"71.33333333333333\" x2=\"306\" y2=\"71.33333333333333\" class=\"gl\"/><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"26.0\" x2=\"306\" y2=\"26.0\" class=\"gl\"/><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"162\" x2=\"306\" y2=\"162\" class=\"ax\"/><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"162\" x2=\"40\" y2=\"20\" class=\"ax\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"16\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">issue 數（累積）</text><polygon points=\"48,162 84,158 119,154 155,145 191,141 227,132 262,124 298,115 298,162 262,162 227,162 191,162 155,162 119,162 84,162 48,162\" class=\"sf-green\"/><polyline points=\"48,162 84,158 119,154 155,145 191,141 227,132 262,124 298,115\" class=\"ln green thin\"/><polygon points=\"48,158 84,145 119,136 155,124 191,115 227,107 262,98 298,90 298,115 262,124 227,132 191,141 155,145 119,154 84,158 48,162\" class=\"sf-brand\"/><polyline points=\"48,158 84,145 119,136 155,124 191,115 227,107 262,98 298,90\" class=\"ln brand thin\"/><polygon points=\"48,158 84,141 119,128 155,107 191,90 227,73 262,60 298,43 298,90 262,98 227,107 191,115 155,124 119,136 84,145 48,158\" class=\"sf-amber\"/><polyline points=\"48,158 84,141 119,128 155,107 191,90 227,73 262,60 298,43\" class=\"ln amber thin\"/><polygon points=\"48,120 84,107 119,94 155,77 191,64 227,52 262,43 298,30 298,43 262,60 227,73 191,90 155,107 119,128 84,141 48,158\" class=\"sf-gray\"/><polyline points=\"48,120 84,107 119,94 155,77 191,64 227,52 262,43 298,30\" class=\"ln ink thin\"/><text x=\"262.2857142857143\" y=\"81.25\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s tf-amber\" style=\"font-weight:700\"></text><rect x=\"10\" y=\"186\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"28\" y=\"196\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Done</text><rect x=\"62.8\" y=\"186\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\" class=\"fl-brand\"/><text x=\"80.8\" y=\"196\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">In Progress</text><rect x=\"159.0\" y=\"186\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><text x=\"177.0\" y=\"196\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">In Review</text><rect x=\"242.8\" y=\"186\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\" class=\"fl-gray\"/><text x=\"260.8\" y=\"196\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">To Do</text></svg>","opts":["In Review is a bottleneck: more work flows in than out","The team finished more work in In Review","The chart counts working days only","Issues are being deleted from In Review"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。官方說 CFD 上某塊區域隨時間垂直變寬，對應的那一欄通常就是瓶頸：卡片進來的速度比離開的快。","B":"錯。CFD 的完成量要看 Done 那一塊；In Review 變寬代表卡片堆在那裡等待，不是完成得更多。","C":"錯。CFD 按日曆日畫，不在官方 working days 清單（5 張報表＋2 個 gadget）裡，不會只算工作日。","D":"錯。刪除 issue 只會讓總數變少，不會讓某條色帶越來越寬；變寬是件數在那個狀態累積。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-cumulative-flow-diagram/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.3-n07","sec":"620.5.3","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Mei-Ling's board has To Do, In Progress and Done columns. She drags a card from Done back to To Do. How do the cumulative lines on the Cumulative Flow Diagram change?","zh":"Mei-Ling 的 board 有 To Do、In Progress、Done 三欄。她把一張卡片從 Done 拖回 To Do。Cumulative Flow Diagram 上的累積線會怎麼變？","zo":["To Do 加 1；Done 減 1","只有 Done 減 1","三條線都不變，因為 CFD 永遠不會下降","Done 和 In Progress 各減 1；To Do 不變"],"fig":"","opts":["To Do increases by 1; Done decreases by 1","Only Done decreases by 1","All three lines stay the same because CFD never goes down","Done and In Progress each decrease by 1; To Do stays the same"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。常見誤解：以為卡片回到 To Do，To Do 就加 1。To Do 線記的是經過 To Do 的總數，沒有新卡進來就不變。","B":"錯。In Progress 的累積線也包含已經流到 Done 的那張卡，卡片退回時它同樣要扣 1，不是只有 Done 變。","C":"錯。官方例子就顯示卡片往回拖時，Done 與 In Progress 的數字都會下降，CFD 的線是可以往下的。","D":"對。官方 CFD 頁的例子：卡片從 Done 移回 To Do，Done 和 In Progress 各扣 1，To Do 不變，因為沒有新的 issue 進來。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-cumulative-flow-diagram/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.3-n08","sec":"620.5.3","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Beatriz, a team lead for project ONYX, wants to see how long issues spend in the “In Review” status and how predictable that time is. Which report and setting should she use?","zh":"Beatriz 是 ONYX project 的團隊負責人，她想知道 issue 在「In Review」狀態停留多久，以及這段時間有多穩定、多好預測。她應該用哪張報表、怎麼設定？","zo":["Cumulative Flow Diagram，只選 In Review","Control Chart，Columns 只勾 In Review","Velocity Chart，依狀態篩選","Average Age 報表"],"fig":"","opts":["Cumulative Flow Diagram with only In Review selected","Control Chart with only the In Review column selected","Velocity Chart filtered by status","Average Age report"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。常見誤解：用 CFD 看停留時間。CFD 只顯示各狀態的件數隨時間變化，看不到單張卡待了多久。","B":"對。Control Chart 計算 issue 在所選 Columns 裡花的時間，只勾 In Review 就是看在那裡待多久；藍色帶（標準差）顯示穩不穩定。","C":"錯。Velocity Chart 比較每個 sprint 的 Commitment 與 Completed 估點，看的是產能，不看停留時間。","D":"錯。Average Age 報表顯示未解決 issue 平均放了幾天，看的是整體年齡，不是某個狀態的停留時間。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-control-chart/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.3-n09","sec":"620.5.3","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. Kwame, a Scrum master, reviews his team's Control Chart. What does the blue shaded band represent, and what does it mean when it becomes wider?","zh":"請看圖。Scrum master Kwame 正在看團隊的 Control Chart。藍色陰影帶代表什麼？它變寬時又代表什麼意思？","zo":["Rolling average；團隊越做越快","非工作日；加入了更多假日","標準差；cycle time 越來越難預測","Sprint 中途加入的工作；scope creep 在增加"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 200\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Control chart 示意\"><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"116.66666666666666\" x2=\"306\" y2=\"116.66666666666666\" class=\"gl\"/><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"71.33333333333333\" x2=\"306\" y2=\"71.33333333333333\" class=\"gl\"/><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"26.0\" x2=\"306\" y2=\"26.0\" class=\"gl\"/><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"162\" x2=\"306\" y2=\"162\" class=\"ax\"/><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"162\" x2=\"40\" y2=\"20\" class=\"ax\"/><text x=\"173.0\" y=\"190\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"s\">issue 完成的日期 →</text><text x=\"34\" y=\"16\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">經過天數</text><polygon points=\"50,102 134,94 162,68 218,94 302,107 302,145 218,141 162,149 134,145 50,145\" class=\"sf-brand\"/><polyline points=\"50,124 106,121 148,111 190,120 246,123 302,125\" class=\"ln brand w3\"/><circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"136\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-ink\"/><circle cx=\"78\" cy=\"120\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-ink\"/><circle cx=\"92\" cy=\"145\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-ink\"/><circle cx=\"112\" cy=\"111\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-ink\"/><circle cx=\"134\" cy=\"128\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-ink\"/><circle cx=\"148\" cy=\"43\" r=\"6\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"168\" cy=\"120\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-ink\"/><circle cx=\"190\" cy=\"136\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-ink\"/><circle cx=\"204\" cy=\"102\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-ink\"/><circle cx=\"226\" cy=\"128\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-ink\"/><circle cx=\"246\" cy=\"111\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-ink\"/><circle cx=\"257\" cy=\"136\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-ink\"/><circle cx=\"280\" cy=\"120\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-ink\"/><circle cx=\"302\" cy=\"128\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-ink\"/><text x=\"138.0\" y=\"47.0\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s tf-rose\" style=\"font-weight:700\">離群點</text><text x=\"306\" y=\"16\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s tf-brand\"></text></svg>","opts":["The rolling average; the team is getting faster","Non-working days; more holidays were added","The standard deviation; cycle time is becoming less predictable","Work added mid-sprint; scope creep is increasing"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。Rolling average 是圖上的藍色線，不是陰影帶；而且團隊變快要看藍線往下走，不是帶子變寬。","B":"錯。Control Chart 會依 working days 計算，但非工作日不會畫成藍色帶；官方定義藍色陰影就是標準差。","C":"對。官方：藍色陰影代表標準差，也就是實際資料偏離 rolling average 的程度。帶子窄代表有把握，變寬代表越來越難預測。","D":"錯。中途加工作（scope creep）要看 Burnup chart 的紅線往上跳；Control Chart 的點是每張 issue 的經過時間。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-control-chart/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.3-n10","sec":"620.5.3","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Ravi notices that the blue rolling-average line on his team's Control Chart changes shape when he narrows the timeframe. How does the Control Chart calculate this rolling average?","zh":"Ravi 發現，把 Control Chart 的時間範圍縮小後，藍色的 rolling average（移動平均）線形狀跟著變了。Control Chart 的 rolling average 是怎麼算的？","zo":["以時間為準：最近 7 個日曆日內完成的所有 issue 的平均","目前 sprint 所有 issue 的平均 cycle time，每天重算","最近三個 sprint 完成的 issue 的 cycle time 中位數","以工作量為準：每張 issue 連同它前後相鄰的 issue 一起平均"],"fig":"","opts":["A time-based average of all issues completed in the previous 7 calendar days","The average cycle time of all issues in the current sprint, recalculated each day","The median cycle time of the issues completed in the last three sprints","A work-based average of each issue and its neighboring issues"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。常見誤解：以為是「過去 7 天平均」。官方說 rolling average 是 work-based（依 issue 數），不是 time-based。","B":"錯。Rolling average 沿著時間軸逐點計算，每點只取鄰近幾張 issue，不是把整個 sprint 平均成一個數。","C":"錯。「最近三個 sprint」是 Epic／Release Burndown 預測速度的算法；rolling average 取平均值，不是中位數。","D":"對。官方：每個點取該 issue 加前後各 X 張一起平均，張數是顯示總數的 20%，至少 5 張，而且一定是奇數。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-control-chart/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.3-n11","sec":"620.5.3","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. Chloé, a product owner, opened this report for version 2.0. Which report is it, and what does the shaded area around the vertical line show?","zh":"請看圖。Product owner Chloé 為 2.0 版打開了這張報表。這是哪張報表？垂直線兩側的陰影區代表什麼？","zo":["Release Burndown；依最近三個 sprint 算出還需要幾個 sprint","Version Report；樂觀與悲觀的預測 release 日","Version Report；board 設定排除掉的非工作日","Burnup Chart；版本被加入 scope 的日子"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 200\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Report 示意\"><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"116.66666666666666\" x2=\"306\" y2=\"116.66666666666666\" class=\"gl\"/><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"71.33333333333333\" x2=\"306\" y2=\"71.33333333333333\" class=\"gl\"/><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"26.0\" x2=\"306\" y2=\"26.0\" class=\"gl\"/><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"162\" x2=\"306\" y2=\"162\" class=\"ax\"/><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"162\" x2=\"40\" y2=\"20\" class=\"ax\"/><text x=\"173.0\" y=\"190\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"s\">Date →</text><text x=\"34\" y=\"16\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Story points</text><rect x=\"229.8181818181818\" y=\"26\" width=\"45.45454545454544\" height=\"136\" rx=\"0\" class=\"sf-gray\"/><polyline points=\"48,53 139,53 139,37 298,37\" class=\"ln ink\"/><polyline points=\"48,162 93,140 139,118 184,94 207,83\" class=\"ln green w3\"/><polyline points=\"207,83 253,37\" class=\"ln green d\"/><line x1=\"252.54545454545453\" y1=\"26\" x2=\"252.54545454545453\" y2=\"162\" class=\"ln brand w3\"/><text x=\"252.54545454545453\" y=\"20\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"s tf-brand\" style=\"font-weight:700\">Predicted date</text><text x=\"226.8181818181818\" y=\"154\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\"></text><text x=\"278.27272727272725\" y=\"154\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\"></text><text x=\"46\" y=\"30.879999999999995\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Total scope</text></svg>","opts":["Release Burndown; the number of sprints still needed, based on the last three sprints","Version Report; the optimistic and pessimistic predicted release dates","Version Report; the non-working days excluded by the board's settings","Burnup Chart; the days when scope was added to the version"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。Release Burndown 用最近三個 sprint 的完成量預測還要幾個 sprint，畫的是每個 sprint 的長條，沒有預測日期的陰影。","B":"對。Version Report 依平均每日速度畫出 Predicted Release Date；兩側陰影是樂觀（速度 +10%）與悲觀（−10%）的預測日。","C":"錯。報表認對了，但陰影意思錯了。Version Report 雖然吃 working days，兩側陰影卻是樂觀／悲觀的預測日期。","D":"錯。Burnup Chart 以單一 sprint 為範圍，用紅線表示工作總量增加，不會畫版本的預測 release 日。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-version-report/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.3-n12","sec":"620.5.3","dom":"620.5","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Freya, a product owner for project ONYX, uses the Epic Burndown report to forecast how many sprints are needed to finish an epic. Which statements about this forecast are correct? (Choose two.)","zh":"Freya 是 ONYX project 的 product owner，她用 Epic Burndown 報表預測完成一個 epic 需要幾個 sprint。下列關於這個預測的敘述，哪些正確？（選兩個）","zo":["使用 project 開始以來每一個 sprint 的速度","忽略 epic 開始後才加入的 scope","使用團隊最近三個 sprint 的平均速度","Kanban board 上也能使用","未估點的工作超過 30% 時會出現警告"],"fig":"","opts":["It uses the velocity of every sprint since the project started","It ignores scope added after the epic started","It uses the average velocity of the team's last three sprints","It is available on Kanban boards","A warning is shown when more than 30% of the work is unestimated"],"ans":"CE","why":{"A":"錯。它不看全部歷史，只取最近三個 sprint 的完成量；常見誤解就是以為用所有 sprint 平均。","B":"錯。中途加入的 scope 會以深藍色區段顯示；官方說它不算進 velocity，但會算進剩餘工作量。","C":"對。官方：預測的 sprint 數依最近三個 sprint 的完成量和 epic 剩餘工作量計算；目前 sprint 通常不算在內。","D":"錯。Epic Burndown 以 sprint 為單位，官方說它是為 Scrum 團隊最佳化的報表，Kanban board 沒有。","E":"對。官方：預測只根據有估點的 issue；未估點超過 30% 時，% unestimated 標籤會變紅，提醒預測不可靠。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-epic-burndown-report/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.3-n13","sec":"620.5.3","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. Gustavo, a support manager, reads it as “the team is keeping up with incoming work”. Is that correct?","zh":"請看圖。支援主管 Gustavo 的解讀是「團隊跟得上新進來的工作」。這個解讀正確嗎？","zo":["正確，因為綠線在上升","不正確，因為這張圖只顯示未解決的 issue","正確，因為有一個版本已經 release","不正確，因為這段期間建立的 issue 比解決的多"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 200\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Created vs Resolved 示意\"><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"116.66666666666666\" x2=\"306\" y2=\"116.66666666666666\" class=\"gl\"/><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"71.33333333333333\" x2=\"306\" y2=\"71.33333333333333\" class=\"gl\"/><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"26.0\" x2=\"306\" y2=\"26.0\" class=\"gl\"/><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"162\" x2=\"306\" y2=\"162\" class=\"ax\"/><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"162\" x2=\"40\" y2=\"20\" class=\"ax\"/><text x=\"173.0\" y=\"190\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"s\">時間 →</text><text x=\"34\" y=\"16\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">issue 數</text><polygon points=\"48,141 84,131 119,115 155,99 191,89 227,73 262,57 298,42 298,78 262,89 227,99 191,110 155,120 119,125 84,136 48,146\" class=\"sf-rose\"/><polyline points=\"48,141 84,131 119,115 155,99 191,89 227,73 262,57 298,42\" class=\"ln rose w3\"/><polyline points=\"48,146 84,136 119,125 155,120 191,110 227,99 262,89 298,78\" class=\"ln green w3\"/><line x1=\"156\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"170\" y2=\"12\" class=\"ln rose w3\"/><text x=\"174\" y=\"16\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Created</text><line x1=\"227.4\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"241.4\" y2=\"12\" class=\"ln green w3\"/><text x=\"245.4\" y=\"16\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Resolved</text><text x=\"48\" y=\"40\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s tf-rose\" style=\"font-weight:700\"></text><line x1=\"226.57142857142858\" y1=\"48\" x2=\"226.57142857142858\" y2=\"162\" class=\"ln ink d\"/><text x=\"230.57142857142858\" y=\"156\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">v2.0 release</text></svg>","opts":["Yes, because the green line is rising","No, because the chart only shows unresolved issues","Yes, because a version was released","No, because more issues are being created than resolved in the period"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。綠線是解決量，上升只代表有在解決；要和紅線（建立量）比較，才知道跟不跟得上。","B":"錯。這張報表同時畫建立和解決兩條線；只看未解決 issue 平均放多久的是 Average Age 報表。","C":"錯。圖上的虛線只是標出版本 release 的時間點，和 backlog 是增加還是減少沒有關係。","D":"對。Created vs Resolved 比較同一段時間建立與解決的 issue；官方說紅色區域代表建立多於解決，backlog 在增加。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/generate-a-report/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.3-n14","sec":"620.5.3","dom":"620.5","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Keanu's team estimates only in story points and has time tracking disabled. Which two reports will show no useful data for the team? (Choose two.)","zh":"Keanu 的團隊只用 story points 估算，而且關閉了時間追蹤。哪兩張報表對這個團隊來說會沒有可用的資料？（選兩個）","zo":["Pie Chart Report（圓餅圖報表）","Workload Pie Chart（工作量圓餅圖）","Average Age Report（平均年齡報表）","Time Tracking Report（時間追蹤報表）","Recently Created Issues（最近建立的 issue）"],"fig":"","opts":["Pie Chart Report","Workload Pie Chart","Average Age Report","Time Tracking Report","Recently Created Issues"],"ans":"BD","why":{"A":"錯。Pie Chart Report 依一個欄位把 issue 分組、算張數，不需要時間追蹤；常見誤解是和 Workload Pie 搞混。","B":"對。Workload Pie Chart 依工時欄位算各 assignee 的剩餘工作量，不看 story points；沒開 time tracking 就沒資料。","C":"錯。Average Age Report 顯示未解決 issue 平均放了幾天，依據的是日期，不是工時估算。","D":"對。Time Tracking Report 比較原估、剩餘估時與實際花費的工時，看估得準不準；沒開 time tracking 就沒資料。","E":"錯。Recently Created Issues 算每期新建幾張、其中幾張已解決，看的是數量，不需要時間追蹤。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/generate-a-report/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/add-and-customize-gadgets/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.3-n15","sec":"620.5.3","dom":"620.5","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Arjun's team works in a team-managed Scrum project (key ZEPHYR) with the Sprints feature turned on. They need sprint reporting. Which reports can they use? (Choose two.)","zh":"Arjun 的團隊使用 team-managed Scrum project（key 是 ZEPHYR），已經開啟 Sprints 功能，需要 sprint 相關的報表。他們可以使用哪些報表？（選兩個）","zo":["Control Chart","Version Report","Epic Burndown","Burnup","Velocity"],"fig":"","opts":["Control Chart","Version Report","Epic Burndown","Burnup","Velocity"],"ans":"DE","why":{"A":"錯。Control Chart 看 cycle time，只在 company-managed project 提供，team-managed 沒有。","B":"錯。Version Report 預測版本的 release 日，只在 company-managed Scrum board 提供。","C":"錯。Epic Burndown 預測 epic 還要幾個 sprint，只在 company-managed Scrum board 提供。","D":"對。官方列出 team-managed 的報表有 Burnup、Sprint burndown、Velocity、CFD；Burnup 要先開 Sprints 功能。","E":"對。Velocity 報表在 team-managed project 也有，用來看每段期間完成多少工作、規劃下一個 sprint；同樣要開 Sprints。"},"note":"TMP 只有 Burnup、Sprint burndown、Velocity、CFD；前三張要開 Sprints 功能。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/enable-reports/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.3-n16","sec":"620.5.3","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit, which shows the Velocity Chart for Hana's team on project MAPLE. What do the gray bars represent?","zh":"請看圖，這是 Hana 的團隊在 MAPLE project 的 Velocity Chart。灰色長條代表什麼？","zo":["每個 sprint 開始時承諾的工作量","每個 sprint 開始後才加入的工作","每個 sprint 完成的工作量","每個 sprint 結束時剩下的工作量"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 200\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Velocity chart 示意\"><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"116.66666666666666\" x2=\"306\" y2=\"116.66666666666666\" class=\"gl\"/><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"71.33333333333333\" x2=\"306\" y2=\"71.33333333333333\" class=\"gl\"/><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"26.0\" x2=\"306\" y2=\"26.0\" class=\"gl\"/><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"162\" x2=\"306\" y2=\"162\" class=\"ax\"/><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"162\" x2=\"40\" y2=\"20\" class=\"ax\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"16\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Story points</text><rect x=\"58\" y=\"75.86666666666667\" width=\"20\" height=\"86.13333333333333\" rx=\"2\" class=\"fl-gray\"/><rect x=\"80\" y=\"89.46666666666667\" width=\"20\" height=\"72.53333333333333\" rx=\"2\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"79\" y=\"176\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"s\">S4</text><rect x=\"122\" y=\"44.133333333333326\" width=\"20\" height=\"117.86666666666667\" rx=\"2\" class=\"fl-gray\"/><rect x=\"144\" y=\"53.19999999999999\" width=\"20\" height=\"108.80000000000001\" rx=\"2\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"143\" y=\"176\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"s\">S5</text><rect x=\"186\" y=\"80.4\" width=\"20\" height=\"81.6\" rx=\"2\" class=\"fl-gray\"/><rect x=\"208\" y=\"84.93333333333334\" width=\"20\" height=\"77.06666666666666\" rx=\"2\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"207\" y=\"176\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"s\">S6</text><rect x=\"250\" y=\"62.26666666666668\" width=\"20\" height=\"99.73333333333332\" rx=\"2\" class=\"fl-gray\"/><rect x=\"272\" y=\"66.80000000000001\" width=\"20\" height=\"95.19999999999999\" rx=\"2\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"271\" y=\"176\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"s\">S7</text><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"73.6\" x2=\"306\" y2=\"73.6\" class=\"ln ink d\"/><text x=\"306\" y=\"16\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Dashed line = average</text><rect x=\"44\" y=\"186\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\" class=\"fl-gray\"/><text x=\"62\" y=\"196\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Series 1</text><rect x=\"214.5\" y=\"186\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"232.5\" y=\"196\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Series 2</text></svg>","opts":["The work committed when each sprint started","Work added after each sprint started","The work completed in each sprint","The remaining work at the end of each sprint"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。灰色是 Commitment：sprint 開始當下所有 issue 的估算總和。開始後加入的工作或改過的估點都不算進去。","B":"錯。官方說 sprint 開始後加入的工作不算進 Commitment；這些工作若完成，會算在綠色的 Completed 裡。","C":"錯。完成量是綠色長條 Completed，會包含 sprint 開始後的 scope 變動；灰色是開始時的承諾量。","D":"錯。Velocity Chart 只畫每個 sprint 的 Commitment 與 Completed 兩根長條，外加平均線，不畫結束時的剩餘量。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-velocity-chart/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.2-n17","sec":"620.5.2","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. Rafael added this gadget to the SALT team dashboard. Which gadget is it, and what must he configure?","zh":"請看圖。Rafael 把這個 gadget 加到 SALT 團隊的 dashboard。這是哪個 gadget？他必須設定什麼？","zo":["Issue Statistics；一個 saved filter，加上一個用來分組的欄位","Pie Chart；一個 project 或 saved filter，加上一個 statistic type","Two Dimensional Filter Statistics；一個 saved filter，加上 X 軸與 Y 軸兩個欄位","Filter Results；一個 saved filter、要顯示的欄位與筆數"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 174\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Gadget 示意\"><rect x=\"10\" y=\"8\" width=\"300\" height=\"158\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx plain\"/><text x=\"20\" y=\"28\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\">Assignee × Status</text><rect x=\"16\" y=\"39\" width=\"288\" height=\"22\" rx=\"5\" class=\"sf-gray\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Assignee</text><text x=\"146\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">To Do</text><text x=\"204\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">In Prog</text><text x=\"252\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Done</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Total</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"62\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"62\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Adam</text><text x=\"146\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"t\">2</text><text x=\"204\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"t\">1</text><text x=\"252\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"t\">4</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"t\">7</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"86\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"86\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Emma</text><text x=\"146\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"t\">1</text><text x=\"204\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"t\">1</text><text x=\"252\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"t\">4</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"t\">6</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"110\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"126\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Max</text><text x=\"146\" y=\"126\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"t\">2</text><text x=\"204\" y=\"126\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"t\">0</text><text x=\"252\" y=\"126\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"t\">3</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"126\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"t\">5</text><text x=\"22\" y=\"150\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\">Total</text><text x=\"146\" y=\"150\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"b\">5</text><text x=\"204\" y=\"150\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"b\">2</text><text x=\"252\" y=\"150\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"b\">11</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"150\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"b\">18</text></svg>","opts":["Issue Statistics; a saved filter and a single field to break it down by","Pie Chart; a project or saved filter and one statistic type to group by","Two Dimensional Filter Statistics; a saved filter and X-axis and Y-axis fields","Filter Results; a saved filter, the columns to display and the number of results"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。Issue Statistics 把 filter 結果依一個欄位分組列出數量，是一維清單，做不出兩個欄位的交叉表。","B":"錯。Pie Chart 把 issue 依一個統計欄位分組畫成圓餅，一次只能選一個欄位，無法交叉 Assignee 和 Status。","C":"對。Two Dimensional Filter Statistics 依 saved filter 畫表格，用 X Axis、Y Axis 兩個欄位交叉統計。","D":"錯。Filter Results 把 saved filter 撈到的 issue 列成清單，可以選欄位和筆數，但不分組、不做交叉統計。"},"note":"X Axis／Y Axis 的設定步驟出自舊版官方文件（JIRA 6.1）；Cloud 的 gadget 說明頁只寫「Displays tabular data based on a filter」。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/use-dashboard-gadgets/","https://confluence.atlassian.com/spaces/JIRA061/pages/415370366/Adding+the+Two-Dimensional+Filter+Statistics+Gadget"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.2-n18","sec":"620.5.2","dom":"620.5","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Mateus shared the DUNE team dashboard with the Developers project role. Yuki, a developer in that role, opens it and sees gadgets that return no results. What are the likely causes? (Choose two.)","zh":"Mateus 把 DUNE 團隊的 dashboard 分享給 Developers project role。這個 role 裡的開發人員 Yuki 打開後，gadget 都沒有任何結果。可能的原因是什麼？（選兩個）","zo":["Yuki 沒有把 dashboard 加星號","gadget 沒有設定自動重新整理","gadget 使用的 saved filter 沒有分享給 Yuki","Yuki 不是 Jira administrator","Yuki 在 filter 查詢的 project 沒有 Browse Projects 權限"],"fig":"","opts":["Yuki has not starred the dashboard","The gadgets were not set to refresh automatically","The saved filter used by the gadgets is not shared with Yuki","Yuki is not a Jira administrator","Yuki lacks Browse Projects in the project the filter queries"],"ans":"CE","why":{"A":"錯。加星號只是讓 dashboard 出現在 Starred 選單、方便找，和能不能看到 gadget 的資料無關。","B":"錯。自動重新整理只決定多久更新一次畫面；手動重新載入一樣會顯示資料，不會造成沒有結果。","C":"對。官方 KB 說看到資料要三層權限：dashboard 分享、gadget 用的 filter 分享、filter 查的 project 開放給他。filter 沒分享就讀不到。","D":"錯。看 dashboard 不需要 Jira admin；dashboard、filter 有分享給他，又有 project 權限就夠了。","E":"對。同一篇 KB 的第三層：filter 查詢的 project 必須對他開放。沒有 Browse Projects，他就看不到那些 issue。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira/kb/gadget-on-shared-dashboard-returns-could-not-be-retrieved-error/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.2-n19","sec":"620.5.2","dom":"620.5","type":"multi","n":3,"stem":"Siddharth is building a wallboard for the PIXEL Scrum team. Which gadgets ask him to select a board and a sprint rather than a filter or project? (Choose three.)","zh":"Siddharth 正在替 PIXEL Scrum 團隊做一個 wallboard。哪些 gadget 會要他選 board 和 sprint，而不是 filter 或 project？（選三個）","zo":["Created vs Resolved","Sprint Health","Average Age","Days Remaining in Sprint","Assigned to Me","Sprint Burndown"],"fig":"","opts":["Created vs Resolved","Sprint Health","Average Age","Days Remaining in Sprint","Assigned to Me","Sprint Burndown"],"ans":"BDF","why":{"A":"錯。Created vs Resolved 比較一段期間建立與解決的 issue，來源是 project 或 saved filter，不綁 sprint。","B":"對。官方 Sprint Health gadget 文件的設定步驟是選 Board（列出所有 board）和 Sprint（列出 active sprint），不選 filter。","C":"錯。Average Age 顯示未解決 issue 平均放了幾天，來源是 project 或 saved filter，不是 board。","D":"對。官方 Days Remaining in Sprint 文件的設定是選 Board 和 Sprint，顯示該 sprint 還剩幾個工作日。","E":"錯。Assigned to Me 自動列出指派給觀看者的未完成 issue，不需要設定來源，也不接 board。","F":"對。官方 Sprint Burndown gadget 文件的設定同樣是 Board 和 Sprint，畫的是那個 sprint 的燃盡曲線。"},"note":"Board／Sprint 設定步驟出自 JIRA Agile 6.4 舊版官方文件；Cloud 的 gadget 說明頁只有一句簡介。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/use-dashboard-gadgets/","https://confluence.atlassian.com/agile064/jira-agile-user-s-guide/using-the-jira-agile-gadgets/using-the-sprint-health-gadget","https://confluence.atlassian.com/agile064/jira-agile-user-s-guide/using-the-jira-agile-gadgets/using-the-days-remaining-in-sprint-gadget","https://confluence.atlassian.com/agile064/jira-agile-user-s-guide/using-the-jira-agile-gadgets/using-the-sprint-burndown-gadget"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.2-n20","sec":"620.5.2","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Kofi, a project administrator, accidentally moved his team's dashboard to the trash. Who can restore it?","zh":"Project administrator Kofi 不小心把團隊的 dashboard 移到了 trash（垃圾桶）。誰可以還原它？","zo":["dashboard 擁有者，30 天內","任何 project administrator","Jira administrator，60 天內","沒有人；丟進 trash 的 dashboard 會立刻刪除"],"fig":"","opts":["The dashboard owner, within 30 days","Any project administrator","A Jira administrator, within 60 days","Nobody; trashed dashboards are deleted immediately"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。擁有者可以把 dashboard 移到 trash，但官方說只有 Jira admin 能還原；期限也是 60 天，不是 30 天。","B":"錯。Project administrator 管的是 project 設定；官方寫明只有 Jira admin 能還原 dashboard。","C":"對。官方：移到 trash 的 dashboard 只能由 Jira admin 還原，60 天後就會永久刪除。擁有者和 project admin 都救不回。","D":"錯。移到 trash 不是立刻刪除；dashboard 會在 trash 保留 60 天，這段期間 Jira admin 都能還原。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/create-and-edit-dashboards/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.2-n21","sec":"620.5.2","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. Aroha added this gadget to the PIXEL team's wallboard. Which gadget is this, and what does it show?","zh":"請看圖。Aroha 把這個 gadget 加到 PIXEL 團隊的 wallboard。這是哪個 gadget？它顯示什麼？","zo":["Sprint Health：sprint 進度、經過時間與 scope change","Burndown gadget：每天的剩餘工作量","Road Map：未來幾天內到期的版本","Issue Statistics：依狀態分組的 issue"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 200\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Gadget 示意\"><rect x=\"10\" y=\"8\" width=\"300\" height=\"184\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx plain\"/><text x=\"20\" y=\"30\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\">Sprint 7 · 4 days left</text><rect x=\"20\" y=\"40\" width=\"110\" height=\"16\" rx=\"0\" class=\"fl-gray\"/><rect x=\"130\" y=\"40\" width=\"90\" height=\"16\" rx=\"0\" class=\"fl-brand\"/><rect x=\"220\" y=\"40\" width=\"80\" height=\"16\" rx=\"0\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"75\" y=\"72\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"s\">To Do</text><text x=\"175\" y=\"72\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"s\">In Prog</text><text x=\"260\" y=\"72\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"s\">Done</text><text x=\"20\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Time elapsed</text><text x=\"20\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\">60%</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Work complete</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\">28%</text><text x=\"216\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Scope change</text><text x=\"216\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b tf-rose\">+15%</text><text x=\"20\" y=\"152\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Blockers</text><text x=\"20\" y=\"172\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b tf-rose\">1</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"152\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Flagged</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"172\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\">2</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"184\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s tf-violet\"></text></svg>","opts":["Sprint Health: sprint progress, time elapsed and scope change","Burndown gadget: remaining work by day","Road Map: versions due in the coming days","Issue Statistics: issues grouped by status"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。官方文件：Sprint Health 有依欄位上色的進度條，加上 Time elapsed、Work complete、Scope change 等數字。","B":"錯。Burndown gadget（Sprint Burndown）畫的是剩餘工作隨日子下降的曲線，不是進度條加百分比數字。","C":"錯。Road Map gadget 列出指定期間內要 release 的版本和各版本進度條，不會有 Time elapsed 或 Blockers。","D":"錯。Issue Statistics 把 filter 結果依一個欄位列出張數與百分比，沒有 sprint 的經過時間與 scope change。"},"note":"各指標名稱出自 JIRA Agile 6.4 舊版官方文件；Cloud 的 gadget 說明頁只寫「Visual snapshot of the health of a sprint」。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/use-dashboard-gadgets/","https://confluence.atlassian.com/agile064/jira-agile-user-s-guide/using-the-jira-agile-gadgets/using-the-sprint-health-gadget"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.2-n22","sec":"620.5.2","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. Olufemi sees this gadget on the release dashboard. Which gadget is it?","zh":"請看圖。Olufemi 在 release dashboard 上看到這個 gadget。這是哪個 gadget？","zo":["Road Map","Sprint Health","Version Report","Filter Results"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 200\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Gadget 示意\"><rect x=\"10\" y=\"8\" width=\"300\" height=\"184\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx plain\"/><text x=\"20\" y=\"28\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\">Next 30 days</text><text x=\"20\" y=\"50\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\">MOB</text><text x=\"32\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">v2.3　10/02</text><rect x=\"32\" y=\"76\" width=\"206\" height=\"11\" rx=\"5\" class=\"sf-gray\"/><rect x=\"32\" y=\"76\" width=\"144.2\" height=\"11\" rx=\"5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"300\" y=\"86\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">14/20</text><text x=\"32\" y=\"104\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">v2.4　10/20</text><rect x=\"32\" y=\"110\" width=\"206\" height=\"11\" rx=\"5\" class=\"sf-gray\"/><rect x=\"32\" y=\"110\" width=\"41.2\" height=\"11\" rx=\"5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"300\" y=\"120\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">3/15</text><text x=\"20\" y=\"150\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\">WEB</text><text x=\"32\" y=\"170\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">2026.10　10/15</text><rect x=\"160\" y=\"161\" width=\"78\" height=\"11\" rx=\"5\" class=\"sf-gray\"/><rect x=\"160\" y=\"161\" width=\"39\" height=\"11\" rx=\"5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"300\" y=\"170\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">8/16</text></svg>","opts":["Road Map","Sprint Health","Version Report","Filter Results"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。官方：Road Map gadget 顯示指定期間內到期要 release 的版本，以及各版本 issue 的完成進度摘要；圖上依 project 列出版本與進度條。","B":"錯。Sprint Health 也有進度條，但只看單一 sprint，外加經過時間等數字，不會依 project 列版本。","C":"錯。Version Report 是 board 的報表，不是 gadget；它一次只看一個版本，畫預測 release 日的折線圖。","D":"錯。Filter Results 只把 filter 的結果列成 issue 清單，不會依版本彙整，也不顯示進度條。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/use-dashboard-gadgets/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.2-n23","sec":"620.5.2","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Haruto, a team lead, created a dashboard for project SALT but cannot find any option to share it with the Developers project role. Which permission is he missing?","zh":"團隊負責人 Haruto 替 SALT project 建立了一個 dashboard，卻找不到任何能把它分享給 Developers project role 的選項。他缺少哪個權限？","zo":["Administer Projects 這個 project 權限","Share dashboards and filters 這個 global permission","Manage group filter subscriptions 這個 global permission","Browse users and groups 這個 global permission"],"fig":"","opts":["The Administer Projects project permission","The Share dashboards and filters global permission","The Manage group filter subscriptions global permission","The Browse users and groups global permission"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。Administer Projects 是 project 權限，管單一 project 的設定；分享 dashboard 要 global permission。","B":"對。建立 dashboard 不需要權限，但要分享給 project role 等對象，必須有 Share dashboards and filters。","C":"錯。Manage group filter subscriptions 管的是 group 的 filter 訂閱，和分享 dashboard 無關。","D":"錯。Browse users and groups 讓人在 user picker 看到所有使用者名稱，不控制分享 dashboard。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-custom-dashboards/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/manage-global-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.2-n24","sec":"620.5.2","dom":"620.5","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Camila wants one shared dashboard where each teammate automatically sees their own work, without configuring a filter. Which gadgets meet this requirement? (Choose two.)","zh":"Camila 想做一個共用的 dashboard，讓每位隊友打開時自動看到自己的工作，而且不必設定 filter。哪些 gadget 符合這個需求？（選兩個）","zo":["Filter Results","Assigned to Me","Issues in Progress","Two Dimensional Filter Statistics","Road Map"],"fig":"","opts":["Filter Results","Assigned to Me","Issues in Progress","Two Dimensional Filter Statistics","Road Map"],"ans":"BC","why":{"A":"錯。Filter Results 必須指定一個 saved filter，列出該 filter 的結果；每個人看到的是同一個 filter。","B":"對。官方：Assigned To Me 顯示所有 project 中指派給「正在看 dashboard 的使用者」的未完成 issue，不用設 filter。","C":"對。官方：Issues in Progress 顯示指派給觀看者、而且正在進行中的 issue，同樣跟著觀看者變、不用設 filter。","D":"錯。Two Dimensional Filter Statistics 要接一個 saved filter，再選兩個欄位交叉統計，必須設定 filter。","E":"錯。Road Map 要設定 project 和天數，列出期間內要 release 的版本，內容不會因觀看者不同而改變。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/use-dashboard-gadgets/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.2-n25","sec":"620.5.2","dom":"620.5","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Amara, a Scrum master for project QUILL, marks next Friday as a non-working day in the board's Working days settings. Which dashboard gadgets will reflect this change? (Choose two.)","zh":"Amara 是 QUILL project 的 Scrum master，她在 board 的 Working days 設定裡把下週五標成非工作日。哪些 dashboard gadget 會反映這項變更？（選兩個）","zo":["Pie Chart","Sprint Health","Created vs Resolved","Average Time in Status","Burndown gadget"],"fig":"","opts":["Pie Chart","Sprint Health","Created vs Resolved","Average Time in Status","Burndown gadget"],"ans":"BE","why":{"A":"錯。Pie Chart 依 project 或 filter 把 issue 分組畫圓餅，不接 board，不在 working days 清單裡。","B":"對。官方 Configure working days 頁寫明工作日會反映在 Sprint Health Gadget，它是清單上的兩個 gadget 之一。","C":"錯。Created vs Resolved 依 project 或 filter 畫建立與解決的趨勢，不接 board，不在清單裡。","D":"錯。Average Time in Status 依 project 或 filter 算各狀態的平均停留天數，不接 board，不在清單裡。","E":"對。Burndown Gadget 是官方清單上的另一個 gadget，和 board 上的 Burndown Chart 一樣會反映 working days。"},"note":"官方 Cloud 清單只列 Sprint Health Gadget 與 Burndown Gadget。Days Remaining in Sprint 顯示的也是工作日天數（舊版官方文件），但不在 Cloud 清單裡，所以本題不拿它當選項。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-working-days/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.2-n26","sec":"620.5.2","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. Nadia, a QA lead for project CEDAR, added this gadget to her dashboard. What does it indicate about the In Review status?","zh":"請看圖。CEDAR project 的 QA 負責人 Nadia 把這個 gadget 加到她的 dashboard。它顯示 In Review 狀態有什麼情況？","zo":["Issue 平均在 In Review 停留最久","In Review 沒有對應到任何 column","目前 In Review 裡的 issue 最多","Issue 反覆重新進入 In Review"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 200\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Gadget 示意\"><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"116.66666666666666\" x2=\"306\" y2=\"116.66666666666666\" class=\"gl\"/><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"71.33333333333333\" x2=\"306\" y2=\"71.33333333333333\" class=\"gl\"/><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"26.0\" x2=\"306\" y2=\"26.0\" class=\"gl\"/><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"162\" x2=\"306\" y2=\"162\" class=\"ax\"/><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"162\" x2=\"40\" y2=\"20\" class=\"ax\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"16\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Average Number of Times in Status</text><rect x=\"56\" y=\"117\" width=\"26\" height=\"45\" rx=\"3\" class=\"fl-violet\"/><text x=\"69\" y=\"178\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"s\">To Do</text><rect x=\"116\" y=\"108\" width=\"26\" height=\"54\" rx=\"3\" class=\"fl-violet\"/><text x=\"130\" y=\"178\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"s\">In Prog</text><rect x=\"177\" y=\"53\" width=\"26\" height=\"109\" rx=\"3\" class=\"fl-violet\"/><text x=\"190\" y=\"178\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"s\">In Review</text><rect x=\"238\" y=\"117\" width=\"26\" height=\"45\" rx=\"3\" class=\"fl-violet\"/><text x=\"250\" y=\"178\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"s\">Done</text><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"116.66666666666667\" x2=\"306\" y2=\"116.66666666666667\" class=\"ln ink d\"/><text x=\"306\" y=\"32\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s tf-rose\" style=\"font-weight:700\"></text></svg>","opts":["Issues stay in In Review the longest on average","In Review is not mapped to a column","In Review has the most issues right now","Issues re-enter In Review repeatedly"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。停留多久要看 Average Time in Status；這張是 Average Number of Times in Status，算的是進入次數。","B":"錯。圖上 In Review 有明確的數值，代表確實有 issue 進入過這個狀態；圖上也看不出 column 對應的設定。","C":"錯。這個 gadget 算的是歷史上平均進入的次數，不是目前停在各狀態的張數。","D":"對。Average Number of Times in Status 顯示 issue 平均進入某狀態幾次；In Review 明顯大於 1，代表工作常被退回、反覆進出。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/use-dashboard-gadgets/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.1-n27","sec":"620.5.1","dom":"620.5","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Aisha is reviewing JQL that a new teammate wrote for project FERN. Which of the functions used are NOT built-in JQL functions? (Choose two.)","zh":"Aisha 正在檢查新同事替 FERN project 寫的 JQL。其中用到的哪些函數不是 JQL 內建函數？（選兩個）","zo":["openSprints()","currentSprints()","futureSprints()","nextSprints()","closedSprints()"],"fig":"","opts":["openSprints()","currentSprints()","futureSprints()","nextSprints()","closedSprints()"],"ans":"BD","why":{"A":"正確敘述（不選）。openSprints() 是內建函數，找已開始、尚未完成的 sprint 裡的 issue，寫法是 sprint in openSprints()。","B":"錯誤敘述（要選）。沒有 currentSprints() 這個函數；要找進行中的 sprint，官方寫法是 sprint in openSprints()。","C":"正確敘述（不選）。futureSprints() 是內建函數，找排進尚未開始的 sprint 的 issue，同樣只能搭配 IN／NOT IN。","D":"錯誤敘述（要選）。沒有 nextSprints()；還沒開始的 sprint 要用 futureSprints()。Sprint 函數只有 open、future、closed 三個。","E":"正確敘述（不選）。closedSprints() 是內建函數，找屬於已完成 sprint 的 issue，寫法是 sprint in closedSprints()。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/advanced-search-reference-jql-functions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.1-n28","sec":"620.5.1","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Valentina, a Scrum master for project LUMA, needs a filter of all standard (non-sub-task) issues in the active sprint that are not yet resolved. Which JQL should she use?","zh":"Valentina 是 LUMA project 的 Scrum master，她需要一個 filter，列出目前 active sprint 中所有尚未解決的標準（非 sub-task）issue。她應該用哪個 JQL？","zo":["issuetype != sub-task AND sprint = currentSprint() AND project = LUMA AND status != Done","issuetype in standardIssueTypes() AND sprint in futureSprints() AND project = LUMA AND resolution = Unresolved","issuetype in standardIssueTypes() AND sprint in openSprints() AND project = LUMA AND resolution = Unresolved","issuetype != sub-task AND sprint = openSprints() AND project = LUMA AND status not in (Done)"],"fig":"","opts":["issuetype != sub-task AND sprint = currentSprint() AND project = LUMA AND status != Done","issuetype in standardIssueTypes() AND sprint in futureSprints() AND project = LUMA AND resolution = Unresolved","issuetype in standardIssueTypes() AND sprint in openSprints() AND project = LUMA AND resolution = Unresolved","issuetype != sub-task AND sprint = openSprints() AND project = LUMA AND status not in (Done)"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。JQL 沒有 currentSprint() 函數，查詢會報錯；status != Done 也會把 Won't Do 這類已解決的狀態算成未解決。","B":"錯。futureSprints() 找的是還沒開始的 sprint，不是進行中的；進行中要用 openSprints()。","C":"對。standardIssueTypes() 排除 sub-task，openSprints() 找進行中的 sprint，resolution = Unresolved 才是未解決。","D":"錯。官方說 openSprints() 只能搭配 IN、NOT IN，寫成 = 會報錯；只排除 Done 也會漏判其他已解決狀態。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>現行官方文件把這個函數列為 standardWorkTypes()；考試沿用 standardIssueTypes()，官方說既有的 JQL 不受改名影響。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/advanced-search-reference-jql-functions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.1-n29","sec":"620.5.1","dom":"620.5","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Tomasz runs <code>labels != hotfix</code> in project KITE to list work that is not a hotfix. Which two statements describe the results? (Choose two.)","zh":"Tomasz 在 KITE project 執行 <code>labels != hotfix</code>，想列出不是 hotfix 的工作。哪兩個敘述正確描述了結果？（選兩個）","zo":["會傳回有其他 label、但沒有 hotfix 的 issue","會傳回完全沒有任何 label 的 issue","會傳回同時有 hotfix 和其他 label 的 issue","傳回的 issue 和 labels NOT IN (hotfix) 相同","會出現錯誤訊息，因為 labels 不能用 !="],"fig":"","opts":["It returns issues that have other labels but not hotfix","It returns issues that have no labels at all","It returns issues that have hotfix together with other labels","It returns the same issues as labels NOT IN (hotfix)","It returns an error, because labels cannot use !="],"ans":"AD","why":{"A":"對。!= 會找出有 label、而且不是 hotfix 的 issue。它只比較有值的欄位，所以結果都是貼了其他 label 的 issue。","B":"錯。常見誤解：以為會連空的也找到。官方說 != 不匹配沒有值的欄位，要包含它們得加 OR labels IS EMPTY。","C":"錯。只要 issue 帶有 hotfix，就會被 != 排除，即使它還有其他 label，也不會出現在結果裡。","D":"對。官方說 NOT IN 等於多個 != 用 AND 串起來；只有一個值時，labels NOT IN (hotfix) 和 != 結果相同，也不含空值。","E":"錯。官方 JQL fields 頁列出 labels 支援 =、!=、IS、IS NOT、IN、NOT IN，所以 != 是合法寫法。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/advanced-search-reference-jql-operators/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/advanced-search-reference-jql-fields/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.1-n30","sec":"620.5.1","dom":"620.5","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Joaquín, a Jira administrator at Brightwell Foods, is cleaning up saved filters that check for empty fields. Which statements about EMPTY in JQL are correct? (Choose two.)","zh":"Joaquín 是 Brightwell Foods 的 Jira administrator，正在整理會檢查空欄位的 saved filter。下列關於 JQL 中 EMPTY 的敘述，哪些正確？（選兩個）","zo":["labels IS hotfix 是合法語法","EMPTY 和 NULL 會傳回不同的結果","assignee = EMPTY 等同於 assignee IS EMPTY","assignee != EMPTY 等同於 assignee IS NOT EMPTY","IS 可以搭配任何值使用"],"fig":"","opts":["labels IS hotfix is valid syntax","EMPTY and NULL return different results","assignee = EMPTY is equivalent to assignee IS EMPTY","assignee != EMPTY is equivalent to assignee IS NOT EMPTY","IS can be used with any value"],"ans":"CD","why":{"A":"錯。常見誤解：IS 可以接一般的值。官方說 IS 只能搭配 EMPTY 或 NULL；要找這個 label 應寫 labels = hotfix。","B":"錯。EMPTY 和 NULL 都用來找沒有值的欄位，官方兩者互相參照、例子也一樣，結果相同。","C":"對。官方 keywords 頁說 = EMPTY 與 IS EMPTY 都可以用，assignee = EMPTY 就是找沒有指派人的 issue。","D":"對。官方 operators 頁寫明 field != EMPTY 和 field IS NOT EMPTY 相同，找的都是有值的 issue。","E":"錯。官方寫明 IS 和 IS NOT 只能搭配 EMPTY 或 NULL，用來判斷欄位有沒有值，不能接一般的值。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/advanced-search-reference-jql-operators/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/advanced-search-reference-jql-keywords/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.1-n31","sec":"620.5.1","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Zanele, a team lead for project CEDAR, wants to find issues whose component is not Backend, including issues with no component. Which query should she use?","zh":"CEDAR project 的團隊負責人 Zanele 想找出 component 不是 Backend 的 issue，也要包括完全沒有 component 的 issue。她應該用哪個查詢？","zo":["component != Backend","component NOT IN (Backend, EMPTY)","NOT component = Backend","component != Backend OR component IS EMPTY"],"fig":"","opts":["component != Backend","component NOT IN (Backend, EMPTY)","NOT component = Backend","component != Backend OR component IS EMPTY"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。官方說 != 不匹配沒有值的欄位；component != Backend 只會找到有 component、而且不是 Backend 的 issue。","B":"錯。NOT IN 和 != 一樣不匹配空值；而且把 EMPTY 列進排除清單，正好和「要包含沒有 component」相反。","C":"錯。官方說 NOT field = value 和 field != value 相同，一樣不匹配空欄位，沒有 component 的 issue 仍會漏掉。","D":"對。官方範例：要找 component 不是某值、或根本沒有 component 的 issue，要寫 != 值 OR IS EMPTY，後半段把空值補回來。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/advanced-search-reference-jql-operators/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.1-n32","sec":"620.5.1","dom":"620.5","type":"multi","n":3,"stem":"Lars, a project administrator for QUILL, wants to audit how issue fields changed over time by using the WAS and CHANGED operators. Which fields can he query this way? (Choose three.)","zh":"QUILL 的 project administrator Lars 想用 WAS 和 CHANGED 運算子稽核 issue 欄位的歷次變更。他可以用這種方式查詢哪些欄位？（選三個）","zo":["Component","Status","Labels","Assignee","Sprint","Fix Version"],"fig":"","opts":["Component","Status","Labels","Assignee","Sprint","Fix Version"],"ans":"BDF","why":{"A":"錯。Component 可以用 =、!=、IN 等運算子，但官方明列它不支援 WAS、CHANGED 這類歷史運算子。","B":"對。Status 是官方列出支援 WAS、CHANGED 的 6 個欄位之一，可以查狀態的變更歷史。","C":"錯。Labels 支援 =、!=、IS、IN 等，但 WAS、CHANGED 被官方列在不支援的運算子中，查不到 label 的歷史。","D":"對。Assignee 在官方 6 個欄位裡，可以寫 assignee WAS 某人或 assignee CHANGED，查曾經指派給誰、何時換人。","E":"錯。Sprint 欄位支援 =、!=、IS、IN 等，但官方列出 WAS、CHANGED 為不支援，查不到 sprint 的歷史。","F":"對。Fix Version 也在官方 6 個欄位裡，可以用 WAS 查曾經排進哪個版本，或用 CHANGED 查何時被改過。"},"note":"六個：Assignee、Fix Version、Priority、Reporter、Resolution、Status。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/advanced-search-reference-jql-operators/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/advanced-search-reference-jql-fields/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.1-n33","sec":"620.5.1","dom":"620.5","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Farah is tracking issue RIVET-42, which moved To Do → In Progress → Done and has not changed since. Which queries will return RIVET-42? (Choose two.)","zh":"Farah 正在追蹤 RIVET-42，這張 issue 的狀態依序是 To Do → In Progress → Done，之後就沒再變過。哪些查詢會傳回 RIVET-42？（選兩個）","zo":["status = \"In Progress\"","status WAS \"In Progress\"","status WAS NOT \"Done\"","status CHANGED FROM \"Done\" TO \"In Progress\"","status WAS \"Done\""],"fig":"","opts":["status = \"In Progress\"","status WAS \"In Progress\"","status WAS NOT \"Done\"","status CHANGED FROM \"Done\" TO \"In Progress\"","status WAS \"Done\""],"ans":"BE","why":{"A":"錯。= 只看目前的值；這個 issue 現在是 Done，不是 In Progress，所以不會出現在結果裡。","B":"對。官方說 WAS 找「目前是或曾經是」某值的 issue；它曾經是 In Progress，雖然現在是 Done，仍會被找到。","C":"錯。WAS NOT 找「從來沒有過」某值的 issue；它目前就是 Done，所以不符合。","D":"錯。CHANGED FROM … TO … 要真的發生過那一次變更；這個 issue 從來沒有由 Done 改回 In Progress。","E":"對。WAS 包含目前的值，不是只看過去；它現在就是 Done，所以 WAS Done 也會找到它。常見誤解：WAS 只查過去。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/advanced-search-reference-jql-operators/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.1-n34","sec":"620.5.1","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Ingrid, a support lead for project HALO, needs every issue whose summary mentions the word crash. Which query should she use?","zh":"HALO project 的支援負責人 Ingrid 需要找出 summary 提到 crash 這個字的所有 issue。她應該用哪個查詢？","zo":["summary ~ crash","summary = crash","summary IS crash","summary IN (crash)"],"fig":"","opts":["summary ~ crash","summary = crash","summary IS crash","summary IN (crash)"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。~ 是 CONTAINS 運算子，專門用在 Summary、Description 等文字欄位，會找含有該字或簡單變化形（例如 crashes）的 issue。","B":"錯。官方說 = 不能用在文字欄位；summary 是文字欄位，要用 CONTAINS（~）才能搜尋其中的字詞。","C":"錯。IS 只能搭配 EMPTY 或 NULL，用來判斷欄位有沒有值，不能拿來比對 summary 裡的文字。","D":"錯。IN 等於多個 = 用 OR 串起來，而 = 不能用在文字欄位，所以 summary IN (crash) 也不行。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/advanced-search-reference-jql-operators/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.1-n35","sec":"620.5.1","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Hiroshi saves the filter <code>ORDER BY priority DESC AND project = FERN</code> and gets a syntax error. What should he change?","zh":"Hiroshi 儲存 filter <code>ORDER BY priority DESC AND project = FERN</code> 時出現語法錯誤。他應該怎麼改？","zo":["把 ORDER BY 換成 SORT BY","把 ORDER BY priority DESC 移到最後，放在 project = FERN 之後","用括號把 ORDER BY priority DESC 包起來","把 DESC 換成 ASC，因為 JQL 只能遞增排序"],"fig":"","opts":["Replace ORDER BY with SORT BY","Move ORDER BY priority DESC to the end, after project = FERN","Wrap ORDER BY priority DESC in parentheses","Replace DESC with ASC, because JQL sorts in ascending order only"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。JQL 的排序關鍵字是 ORDER BY，沒有 SORT BY；換掉關鍵字只會多一個語法錯誤。","B":"對。官方：ORDER BY 必須放在 JQL 查詢的最後，否則查詢無效。改成 project = FERN ORDER BY priority DESC 就能儲存。","C":"錯。括號用來控制 AND、OR 條件的執行順序，不能包 ORDER BY；問題在位置，ORDER BY 必須在最後。","D":"錯。官方說可以用 asc 或 desc 指定排序方向，DESC 本身合法；錯誤出在 ORDER BY 放在條件前面。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/advanced-search-reference-jql-keywords/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.1-n36","sec":"620.5.1","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Emeka will add a saved filter to a dashboard for the SPROUT project that is shared with anonymous users. Which function should he avoid in that filter?","zh":"Emeka 要把一個 saved filter 放到 SPROUT project 的 dashboard 上，而這個 dashboard 分享給匿名使用者。這個 filter 應該避免使用哪個函數？","zo":["openSprints()","currentUser()","startOfWeek()","unreleasedVersions()"],"fig":"","opts":["openSprints()","currentUser()","startOfWeek()","unreleasedVersions()"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。openSprints() 依 sprint 狀態找 issue，結果和是誰在看無關，官方也沒有限制只能給登入者用。","B":"對。官方：currentUser() 只能由登入的使用者使用；如果 saved filter 預期給匿名使用者看，就不要用這個函數。","C":"錯。startOfWeek() 依目前日期算出本週的開始時間，和觀看者身分無關，匿名使用者也能正常計算。","D":"錯。unreleasedVersions() 找排在尚未 release 版本裡的 issue，結果取決於版本狀態，不依賴登入身分。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/advanced-search-reference-jql-functions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.1.1-e01","sec":"620.1.1","dom":"620.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. Oluwaseun is the project administrator of NOVA, a team-managed software project at Tidewell Analytics. The exhibit shows the project's Features page. The QA engineers want every bug to record the versions in which the defect was found by using Jira's <b>Affects versions</b> field, while <b>Fix versions</b> keeps showing the release that will contain the fix. What should Oluwaseun do?","zh":"Oluwaseun 是 Tidewell Analytics 的 team-managed software project NOVA 的 project administrator。圖中是這個 project 的 Features 頁。QA 工程師希望每張 bug 都用 Jira 的 <b>Affects versions</b> 欄位記錄「在哪些版本發現這個缺陷」，同時 <b>Fix versions</b> 繼續顯示會包含修正的 release。Oluwaseun 該怎麼做？","zo":["把 Releases 先關掉再打開，讓 Jira 在 NOVA 的每個 issue type 都加上兩個版本欄位","請 Jira administrator 把系統的 Affects versions 欄位加到 NOVA 的 Bug issue type","改在 company-managed project 追蹤這些工作，那裡的 Affects versions 和 Fix versions 可以一起使用","在 Bug issue type 建一個名為 Affects versions 的自訂欄位；Jira 會自動把它連到系統欄位"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 345\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"NOVA 的 Features 頁：Releases 已開啟\"><rect x=\"0.5\" y=\"0.5\" width=\"379\" height=\"344\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"380\" height=\"34\" rx=\"0\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Project settings · NOVA (team-managed)</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Features</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Backlog</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"95\" width=\"34\" height=\"18\" rx=\"9\" class=\"fl-brand\"/><circle cx=\"37\" cy=\"104\" r=\"6.5\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><text x=\"54\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">On</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"136\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Sprints</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"142\" width=\"34\" height=\"18\" rx=\"9\" class=\"fl-brand\"/><circle cx=\"37\" cy=\"151\" r=\"6.5\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><text x=\"54\" y=\"155\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">On</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"183\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Estimation</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"189\" width=\"34\" height=\"18\" rx=\"9\" class=\"fl-brand\"/><circle cx=\"37\" cy=\"198\" r=\"6.5\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><text x=\"54\" y=\"202\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">On</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"230\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Releases</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"236\" width=\"34\" height=\"18\" rx=\"9\" class=\"fl-brand\"/><circle cx=\"37\" cy=\"245\" r=\"6.5\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><text x=\"54\" y=\"249\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">On</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"266\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s tf-violet\" style=\"font-weight:700\">↑ Adds the Fix versions field</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"297\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Reports</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"303\" width=\"34\" height=\"18\" rx=\"9\" class=\"fl-gray\"/><circle cx=\"21\" cy=\"312\" r=\"6.5\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><text x=\"54\" y=\"316\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Off</text></svg>","opts":["Turn Releases off and then on again, so that Jira adds both version fields to every issue type in NOVA","Ask a Jira administrator to add the system Affects versions field to the Bug issue type in NOVA","Track this work in a company-managed project, where Affects versions is available together with Fix versions","Create a custom field named Affects versions on the Bug issue type; Jira links it to the system field automatically"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。開關 Releases 只會加上 Fix versions 欄位與 Releases 頁，重開幾次結果都一樣，不會多出 Affects versions。","B":"錯。Jira admin 也加不進去：team-managed 目前根本不支援 Affects versions，官方需求 JRACLOUD-85690 仍在 Gathering Interest。常見誤解：以為找 Jira admin 就能補。","C":"對。Company-managed project 同時有 Fix versions 與 Affects versions 兩個系統版本欄位。Team-managed 開了 Releases 只會多出 Fix versions，所以要記錄「在哪個版本發現」就得用 company-managed。","D":"錯。Team-managed 自建的欄位只屬於這個 project，就算取名 Affects versions，也只是一般的自訂欄位，不會變成系統版本欄位。"},"note":"現行 UI 把 Features 頁放在 Space settings → Features；開啟 Releases 後官方只寫「A new Fix versions field will be added」。","src":["https://jira.atlassian.com/browse/JRACLOUD-85690","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/enable-releases-and-versions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.1.1-e02","sec":"620.1.1","dom":"620.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Ingrid manages HELIX, a team-managed software project at Northvale Robotics. Whenever someone moves a bug from <b>In Review</b> to <b>Done</b>, her team wants a pop-up form that collects a Root cause and a Resolution comment before the transition completes. The team is willing to move its work to another project if necessary. Which approach meets the requirement?","zh":"Ingrid 管理 Northvale Robotics 的 team-managed software project HELIX。每當有人把 bug 從 <b>In Review</b> 移到 <b>Done</b>，她的團隊希望跳出一個表單，在 transition 完成前填寫 Root cause 和 Resolution comment。必要時團隊願意把工作搬到別的 project。哪個做法符合需求？","zo":["把兩個欄位加到 HELIX 的 Bug layout；team-managed project 在 issue 移到 Done 狀態時，會自動跳出所有空白欄位","請 Jira administrator 替 HELIX 指定一個 screen scheme，讓它的 In Review → Done transition 使用新的 screen","把 bug 搬到用 Scrum template 新建的 team-managed project，它會替進入 Done 的 transition 加上 screen","改用 company-managed project，由 Jira administrator 把 screen 對應到 In Review → Done transition"],"fig":"","opts":["Add both fields to the Bug layout in HELIX; team-managed projects automatically pop up any empty fields when an issue moves to a Done status","Ask a Jira administrator to associate a screen scheme with HELIX so that its In Review → Done transition uses a new screen","Move the bugs to a new team-managed project created from the Scrum template, which adds a screen to the transition into Done","Use a company-managed project, where a Jira administrator can map a screen to the In Review → Done transition"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。Issue layout 只決定開啟 issue 時看到哪些欄位，移到 Done 時不會自動跳出空白欄位讓人填。","B":"錯。Screen scheme 是 company-managed 的共用設定物件，team-managed project 不使用 scheme，Jira admin 也沒辦法把它掛到 HELIX。","C":"錯。換到另一個 team-managed project 解決不了問題。Template 只決定 board、backlog 這類工作方式；考試版的 team-managed 不論用哪個 template，都不能替 transition 掛 screen。","D":"對。Company-managed 的 workflow 可以由 Jira admin 把事先建好的 screen 對應到指定 transition。常見誤解：team-managed 也能替 transition 掛 screen；考試版的答案是不行（JRACLOUD-83879）。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>考試版的答案是 team-managed 不能替 transition 掛 screen（官方需求 JRACLOUD-83879 仍是 Gathering Interest）。現行官方頁 Map a screen to a workflow transition 已列出 team-managed 入口（transition → Rules → Request input → Show a screen），但 screen 要先由 Jira admin 建好。作答以考試版為準。","src":["https://jira.atlassian.com/browse/JRACLOUD-83879","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/map-a-screen-to-a-workflow-transition/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.1.1-e03","sec":"620.1.1","dom":"620.1","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. Mateus is deciding whether the Payments team at Quillon Bank should use a team-managed or a company-managed software project. The exhibit lists the team's requirements. Which two requirements can be met only in a company-managed project? (Choose two.)","zh":"Mateus 正在決定 Quillon Bank 的 Payments 團隊要用 team-managed 還是 company-managed software project。圖中列出團隊的需求。哪兩項需求只有 company-managed project 做得到？（選兩個）","zo":["R1：名為 Incident 的自訂 issue type","R2：設有 default assignee 的 components","R3：用來規劃 release 的 Fix versions 欄位","R4：bug 上的 Affects versions 欄位","R5：project 通知使用自訂的寄件 email"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 198\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Payments 團隊的五項需求\"><rect x=\"10\" y=\"8\" width=\"300\" height=\"182\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx plain\"/><text x=\"20\" y=\"28\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\">Payments team requirements</text><rect x=\"16\" y=\"39\" width=\"288\" height=\"22\" rx=\"5\" class=\"sf-gray\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">ID</text><text x=\"64\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Requirement</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"62\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"62\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">R1</text><text x=\"64\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Custom Incident issue type</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"86\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"86\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">R2</text><text x=\"64\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Components + default assignee</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"110\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"126\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">R3</text><text x=\"64\" y=\"126\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Fix versions for releases</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"134\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"134\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"150\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">R4</text><text x=\"64\" y=\"150\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Affects versions on bugs</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"158\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"158\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"174\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">R5</text><text x=\"64\" y=\"174\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Custom notification sender</text></svg>","opts":["R1: a custom issue type named Incident","R2: components with a default assignee","R3: a Fix versions field for planned releases","R4: an Affects versions field on bugs","R5: a custom sender email for project notifications"],"ans":"BD","why":{"A":"錯。Team-managed 的 project admin 可以自己建自訂 issue type（上限 30 個，只能建 standard 層），不需要 company-managed。","B":"對。官方寫明 Jira components 只在 company-managed project 提供，component 的 default assignee 也跟著只在那裡。常見誤解：以為 team-managed 也能用 components 分組。","C":"錯。Team-managed 開啟 Releases 功能後就會加上 Fix versions 欄位，所以這項兩種 project 都做得到。","D":"對。Team-managed 開了 Releases 也只有 Fix versions；Affects versions 的官方需求 JRACLOUD-85690 仍未解決。要記錄受影響版本，只能用 company-managed。","E":"錯。官方的 team-managed 通知設定頁寫明，除了設定誰收到通知，也能設定通知的寄件 email，所以不必改用 company-managed。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/what-are-jira-components/","https://jira.atlassian.com/browse/JRACLOUD-85690","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/enable-releases-and-versions/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/set-up-issue-types-in-team-managed-projects/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/customize-notifications-in-team-managed-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.1.1-e04","sec":"620.1.1","dom":"620.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"During a design review at Ferncliff Studios, Yusuf lists four claims about the team-managed software project he plans to create for his game-tools team. Which claim is NOT true?","zh":"在 Ferncliff Studios 的設計審查會議上，Yusuf 列出四個關於他打算替遊戲工具團隊建立的 team-managed software project 的說法。哪個說法不正確？","zo":["開啟 Releases 功能後，團隊也能在 bug 上記錄 Affects versions","Project administrator 不必找 Jira administrator，就能新增自訂 issue type","在這個 project 新增的自訂欄位，無法和站台上其他 project 共用","Project administrator 可以更改 project 通知的寄件 email 地址"],"fig":"","opts":["Turning on the Releases feature also lets the team record Affects versions on bugs","A project administrator can add a custom issue type without asking a Jira administrator","Custom fields added in this project cannot be shared with other projects on the site","The project administrator can change the email address that the project's notifications are sent from"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"錯誤敘述（要選）。Releases 只會加上 Fix versions 欄位與 Releases 頁；team-managed 沒有 Affects versions，官方需求 JRACLOUD-85690 仍未解決。常見誤解：以為開 Releases 就兩個版本欄位都有。","B":"正確敘述（不選）。Team-managed 的 Administrator role 可以自己建 issue type，官方上限 30 個，只能自訂 standard 層。","C":"正確敘述（不選）。官方說 team-managed 加的自訂欄位只屬於這個 project，無法和站台上其他 project 共用。","D":"正確敘述（不選）。官方的 team-managed 通知設定頁寫明，project admin 可以設定通知從哪個 email 地址寄出，不需要 Jira admin。"},"note":"","src":["https://jira.atlassian.com/browse/JRACLOUD-85690","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/enable-releases-and-versions/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/set-up-issue-types-in-team-managed-projects/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/issue-types-how-do-team-managed-and-company-managed-projects-differ/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/customize-notifications-in-team-managed-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.1.1-e05","sec":"620.1.1","dom":"620.1","type":"multi","n":3,"stem":"Chiara leads the Growth team at Morrow &amp; Pike, which uses Jira on the Standard plan, and holds the Administrator role in GRO, a team-managed software project. Stakeholders have sent six requests. Which three can Chiara fulfill herself in GRO, without involving a Jira administrator? (Choose three.)","zh":"Chiara 帶領 Morrow &amp; Pike 的 Growth 團隊（公司使用 Jira Standard 方案），在 team-managed software project GRO 擔任 Administrator role。利害關係人送來六項需求。哪三項 Chiara 可以在 GRO 自己完成，不必找 Jira administrator？（選三個）","zo":["新增一個名為 Experiment 的 issue type","用 component 分組 issue，並替每個 component 設定 default assignee","在 Fix versions 欄位把 issue 指派到版本，用來規劃 release","在每張 bug 的 Affects versions 欄位記錄受影響的版本","建立一個自訂 project role，成員可以留言但不能編輯 issue","issue 轉到 Done 時，跳出含必填欄位的 screen"],"fig":"","opts":["Add a new issue type called Experiment","Group issues by component and give each component a default assignee","Plan releases by assigning issues to versions in the Fix versions field","Record on each bug the versions it affects, in the Affects versions field","Create a custom project role whose members can comment on issues but cannot edit them","Show a screen with required fields when an issue transitions to Done"],"ans":"ACE","why":{"A":"對。Team-managed 的 Administrator 可以直接在 Project settings 建自訂 issue type（上限 30 個），不需要 Jira admin 改 issue type scheme。","B":"錯。Components 與 component 的 default assignee 只在 company-managed project 提供，GRO 是 team-managed，做不到。","C":"對。Chiara 在 Features 開啟 Releases 後，issue type 就會多出 Fix versions 欄位，可以建立版本並把 issue 指派進去。","D":"錯。Team-managed 只有 Fix versions，沒有 Affects versions（JRACLOUD-85690 未解決）。常見誤解：以為開了 Releases 兩種版本欄位都有。","E":"對。Team-managed 的 Administrator 可以在 Project settings → Access → Manage roles 自建 role，並勾選這個 role 擁有哪些權限，不需要 Jira admin。","F":"錯。考試版中 team-managed 不能替 transition 掛 screen（JRACLOUD-83879）；就算現行版有入口，screen 也要 Jira admin 先建好，Chiara 自己做不到。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>F 的 transition screen 在考試版是 team-managed 沒有的功能；現行官方頁已列出 team-managed 的 Request input → Show a screen 入口，但仍需 Jira admin 先建 screen。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/set-up-issue-types-in-team-managed-projects/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/what-are-jira-components/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/enable-releases-and-versions/","https://jira.atlassian.com/browse/JRACLOUD-85690","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/manage-how-people-access-your-team-managed-project/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/next-gen-permissions/","https://jira.atlassian.com/browse/JRACLOUD-83879"],"lvl":3,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.1.1-e06","sec":"620.1.1","dom":"620.1","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Dmitri's team plans to bulk move 400 issues from ATLAS, a company-managed project, into a new team-managed project for a three-month pilot. Many issues have values in Component, Fix versions, Affects versions, and a global custom field named Customer tier. If the pilot fails, the issues will be moved back to ATLAS. Which two statements describe what happens? (Choose two.)","zh":"Dmitri 的團隊打算把 company-managed project ATLAS 裡的 400 張 issue 批次搬到一個新的 team-managed project，試行三個月。很多 issue 的 Component、Fix versions、Affects versions，以及名為 Customer tier 的全站自訂欄位都有值。如果試行失敗，這些 issue 會搬回 ATLAS。哪兩個敘述描述了實際會發生的事？（選兩個）","zo":["Component 的值會遺失且無法復原，即使 issue 搬回 ATLAS 也一樣","Customer tier 的值在搬移時被永久刪除，所以 issue 回到 ATLAS 後仍是空的","Fix versions 與 Affects versions 的值會遺失且無法復原，即使 issue 搬回去也一樣","Issue 換成新 key 之後，指向舊 ATLAS issue key 的連結就會失效","團隊從此不能使用 story point 估算，因為 team-managed project 不能存放估算資料"],"fig":"","opts":["Component values are lost and cannot be recovered, even after the issues are moved back to ATLAS","Customer tier values are permanently deleted during the move, so they stay empty after the issues return to ATLAS","Fix versions and Affects versions values are lost and cannot be recovered, even after the issues are moved back","Links that point to the old ATLAS issue keys stop working after the issues receive their new keys","The team can no longer use story point estimation, because estimation data cannot exist in team-managed projects"],"ans":"AC","why":{"A":"對。官方說 component 欄位每個 project 各自獨立，搬到 team-managed 會失去這些資料，搬回原 project 也救不回來。常見誤解：以為 team-managed 只是看不到、資料還在。","B":"錯。官方說全站自訂欄位的值仍存在 issue 上，只是在 team-managed 顯示為空白；搬回支援該欄位的 company-managed project 後會重新出現。","C":"對。官方說 version 資訊在這種搬移中會遺失，就算新 project 開了 Releases 也一樣，搬回原 project 也無法復原。","D":"錯。Issue key 會自動更新為新 project 的 key，而指向舊 key 的連結官方說會自動轉址，不會失效。","E":"錯。官方說原本的 story point 資料會遺失，但只要在 team-managed 開啟 Estimation 功能，就能重新開始用 story points 估算。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/migrate-between-team-managed-and-company-managed-projects/"],"lvl":3,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.1.1-e07","sec":"620.1.1","dom":"620.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Saltmarsh Freight's Harbor team is starting a software project today without a backlog or sprints. The team lead, Noa, expects to add a backlog, sprints, and estimation later, one at a time, and wants the team to switch each one on without recreating the project. Which statement about how features differ by project type is correct?","zh":"Saltmarsh Freight 的 Harbor 團隊今天要開始一個 software project，先不用 backlog 也不跑 sprint。Team lead Noa 預計之後會一項一項加上 backlog、sprints 和 estimation，希望團隊能自己逐一開啟，而不必重建 project。關於不同 project 類型的功能差異，哪個敘述正確？","zo":["在 company-managed project，project administrator 可以隨時開關個別功能；team-managed project 則被鎖在它的 template","在 team-managed project，個別功能在 project 建立後隨時都能從 Project settings 開啟或關閉","兩種 project 在建立時選的 template 都永遠不能改，所以每加一項功能都得重建 project","在 team-managed project，backlog、sprints 或 estimation 要先經 Jira administrator 核准，project administrator 才能開啟"],"fig":"","opts":["In a company-managed project, the project administrator can switch individual features on and off at any time, while a team-managed project is locked to its template","In a team-managed project, individual features can be turned on or off from Project settings at any point after the project is created","In both project types, the template chosen at creation can never change, so the team must create a new project for each added feature","In a team-managed project, a Jira administrator must approve the backlog, sprints, or estimation before the project administrator can turn them on"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。說反了。官方說 company-managed 的功能和建立時用的 template 綁在一起，選了 template 就被鎖在那組功能裡。","B":"對。官方說 team-managed 可以在 project 生命週期中的任何時候開關功能，例如 board 太擠時再加 backlog，路徑是 Project settings → Features。","C":"錯。Team-managed 不需要重建 project 就能開關功能；只有 company-managed 的功能組合才會跟著 template 固定。","D":"錯。Team-managed 的特色就是 project admin 不必找 Jira admin 就能調整設定，開關功能不需要 Jira admin 核准。"},"note":"現行 UI 把 project 叫 space，路徑是 Space settings → Features。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/how-do-features-differ-based-on-project-type/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/enable-agile-features-in-team-managed-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.1.1-e08","sec":"620.1.1","dom":"620.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Fatima is the Jira administrator at Brightwater Pharma. She discovers that dozens of team-managed projects have been created by employees who have no admin rights. A new compliance rule says that no one except Jira administrators and members of the <b>project-approvers</b> group may create a project of any type. What should she do?","zh":"Fatima 是 Brightwater Pharma 的 Jira administrator。她發現有幾十個 team-managed project 是由沒有管理權限的員工建立的。新的法遵規定：除了 Jira administrator 和 <b>project-approvers</b> 群組的成員之外，任何人都不能建立任何類型的 project。她該怎麼做？","zo":["除了 approvers 使用的那一個 permission scheme 以外，從其他所有 permission scheme 移除 Administer Projects 權限","把每個既有 team-managed project 的 access level 改成 Private，這樣就無法建立新 project","不用改任何設定，因為任何類型的 project 本來就只有 Jira administrator 能建立","只把 Create team-managed projects 這個 global permission 授予 project-approvers，並從其他群組移除"],"fig":"","opts":["Remove the Administer Projects permission from every permission scheme except the one used by the approvers","Change every existing team-managed project's access level to Private, so that new projects cannot be created","Leave the settings unchanged, because only Jira administrators can create projects of any type","Grant the Create team-managed projects global permission only to project-approvers and remove it from other groups"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。Administer Projects 是 project 層的權限，決定能不能管理某個既有 project 的設定，跟能不能建立新 project 無關。","B":"錯。Access level 只決定誰看得到、能不能編輯這個 project 的 issue，改成 Private 不會阻止任何人建立新的 project。","C":"錯。只有 company-managed 需要 Jira admin 才能建；官方說任何使用者都能建 team-managed project，除非 Jira admin 在 global permissions 收回。","D":"對。建立 team-managed project 靠的是 Create team-managed projects 這個 global permission；company-managed 本來就只有 Administer Jira 的人能建，所以只要收回其他群組的這項權限，其他人就一種 project 都建不了。"},"note":"現行 UI 把這個 global permission 叫 Create team-managed spaces。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/manage-global-permissions/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/what-are-global-permissions-and-what-do-they-do/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/create-a-new-project/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/get-started-with-team-managed-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.1.1-e09","sec":"620.1.1","dom":"620.1","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Ravi, a Jira administrator at Kestrel Mobility, is choosing a project type for 12 new projects. The security team wants one set of permission rules, maintained centrally, granted to groups, and applied to all 12 projects. Which two statements are true? (Choose two.)","zh":"Kestrel Mobility 的 Jira administrator Ravi 正在替 12 個新 project 選擇 project 類型。資安團隊希望只有一套集中維護的權限規則，授予群組，並套用到全部 12 個 project。哪兩個敘述正確？（選兩個）","zo":["在 team-managed project，Jira administrator 可以建一份 permission scheme，並套用到全部 12 個 project","在 company-managed project，權限透過 permission scheme 授予個人、群組或 project role，而且很多 project 可以共用同一份 scheme","在 company-managed project，每個 project administrator 都能只替自己的 project 修改共用的 permission scheme，不影響其他 project","在 access 設為 Open 的 team-managed project，人們不需要任何 project role 就能在 project 裡工作","在 team-managed project，權限綁在 project role 上，而 role 與權限設定每個 project 各自獨立"],"fig":"","opts":["In team-managed projects, a Jira administrator can build one permission scheme and associate it with all 12 projects","In company-managed projects, permissions are granted to individuals, groups, or project roles through a permission scheme that many projects can use","In company-managed projects, each project administrator can edit the shared permission scheme for their own project without affecting the others","In team-managed projects with Open access, people can work in the project without holding any project role","In team-managed projects, permissions are tied to project roles, and the role and permission settings are unique to each project"],"ans":"BE","why":{"A":"錯。Team-managed 不使用 permission scheme，權限設定只存在各自的 project 裡，無法用一份 scheme 套到 12 個 project。","B":"對。官方說 company-managed 由 Jira admin 透過 permission scheme 把權限授予個人、群組或 project role，同一份 scheme 通常給很多 project 共用，正好符合集中管理。","C":"錯。共用的 scheme 只有一份，改了會影響所有使用它的 project；而且 company-managed 的 scheme 要 Jira admin 才能改。","D":"錯。官方說能存取 team-managed project 的人都一定有 role；Open 其實是讓站台上所有登入的人自動拿到 Member role。","E":"對。官方說 team-managed 的權限綁在 project role 上，而且 role 與權限設定每個 project 各自獨立。常見誤解：以為 team-managed 也能跨 project 共用權限。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/what-are-next-gen-project-settings/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/manage-how-people-access-your-team-managed-project/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/what-are-team-managed-and-company-managed-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.1.2-e01","sec":"620.1.2","dom":"620.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. Keiko is the administrator of the team-managed project HALO at Northwind Robotics. Rafael can open HALO issues and add comments, but he cannot create issues, drag issues to rank them in the backlog, or change their status. Keiko has already confirmed Rafael's role on the Access page. Who can resolve the problem, and how?","zh":"Refer to the exhibit.（請看附圖。）Keiko 是 Northwind Robotics 的 team-managed project HALO 的管理者。Rafael 可以打開 HALO 的 issue 並留言，但他不能建立 issue、不能在 backlog 拖曳 issue 排序（rank），也不能改 issue 的狀態。Keiko 已經在 Access 頁確認過 Rafael 的 role。誰能解決這個問題？要怎麼做？","zo":["Keiko：把 Rafael 加進一個包含 Work on issues 權限組的自訂 role","Jira administrator：給 Rafael Jira 的 product access","Site admin：給 Rafael Jira 的 product access","Keiko：把 project 的 access level 從 Private 改成 Open"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 286\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"HALO 的 Access 設定頁\"><rect x=\"0.5\" y=\"0.5\" width=\"379\" height=\"285\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"380\" height=\"34\" rx=\"0\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Project settings</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Access</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Project access</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"95\" width=\"356\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"113\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Private</text><path d=\"M350,106 l5,5 l5,-5\" class=\"ln ink\" style=\"stroke-width:1.6\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"144\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">People</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"174\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"174\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"166\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Keiko Sato</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"166\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Administrator</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"200\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"192\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Rafael Ortiz</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"192\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Member</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"226\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"226\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"218\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Wen Li</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"218\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Viewer</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"236\" width=\"91.0\" height=\"26\" rx=\"6\" class=\"fl-brand\"/><text x=\"57.5\" y=\"253\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"w\">Add people</text></svg>","opts":["Keiko, by adding Rafael to a custom role that includes the Work on issues permission set","A Jira administrator, by granting Rafael product access to Jira","A site admin, by granting Rafael product access to Jira","Keiko, by changing the project access level from Private to Open"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。Work on issues 的權限 Member 本來就有。Rafael 缺的是授權不是權限，換成自訂 role 仍然動不了。","B":"錯。常見誤解：以為 Jira admin 能配授權。官方說只有 site admin 能給個人 Jira 產品存取。","C":"對。Member 已含建立、編輯、轉狀態，卻都動不了，代表他沒有 Jira 產品存取（授權席次）。官方說只有 site admin 能給個人產品存取。","D":"錯。Open 只是讓全站使用者自動得到 Member。Rafael 本來就是 Member，缺的不是 role，改成 Open 也沒用。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>考試寫 product access to Jira；現行官方頁改叫 app access，project 改叫 space、issue 改叫 work item，意思相同。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/manage-how-people-access-your-team-managed-project/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.1.2-e02","sec":"620.1.2","dom":"620.1","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Hana has just become a project administrator for several team-managed projects at Corvid Analytics. She is reviewing how product access to Jira relates to project roles. Which two statements are true? (Choose two.)","zh":"Hana 剛成為 Corvid Analytics 幾個 team-managed project 的 project administrator，她正在了解 Jira 的 product access 和 project role 之間的關係。下列哪兩個敘述正確？（選兩個。）","zo":["Project administrator 可以在 project 的 Access 頁給使用者 Jira 的 product access。","把使用者加進 Administrator role，就會自動給他一個 Jira 授權。","站上任何已註冊的使用者都可以被給予 Viewer role，不需要額外的 product access。","沒有 Jira product access 的 Member 仍然能建立和轉換 issue 狀態，因為 role 有給這些權限。","只有 site admin 能給個人 Jira 的 product access。"],"fig":"","opts":["A project administrator can grant a user product access to Jira from the project's Access page.","Adding a user to the Administrator role gives that user a Jira license automatically.","Any registered user on the site can be given the Viewer role without extra product access.","A Member without product access to Jira can still create and transition issues, because the role grants those permissions.","Only a site admin can grant individuals product access to Jira."],"ans":"CE","why":{"A":"錯。Access 頁只能加人、指派 role、改 access level，不能開授權。產品存取要到管理後台由 site admin 處理。","B":"錯。Role 只決定在這個 project 裡能做什麼，不會配發授權席次。沒有產品存取的 Administrator 一樣發揮不了作用。","C":"對。官方說 Viewer 可以給站上任何已註冊的使用者，不需額外產品存取；所以沒有 Jira 授權的人也能當 Viewer 瀏覽、留言。","D":"錯。常見誤解：以為有 Member role 就一定能動。官方說 Member 要有產品存取才能完整發揮，沒有授權就建不了、也轉不了狀態。","E":"對。官方明寫只有 site admin 能給個人 Jira 的產品存取。所以使用者有 role 卻動不了時，project admin 要去找 site admin。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>考試寫 product access to Jira；現行官方頁改叫 app access，project 改叫 space、issue 改叫 work item，意思相同。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/manage-how-people-access-your-team-managed-project/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.1.2-e03","sec":"620.1.2","dom":"620.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"RELAY is a Private team-managed software project at Pinecrest Health. Support agents have Jira Service Management access but no product access to Jira. Oluwaseun, the project administrator, wants the agents to view RELAY issues, add comments, and attach log files, without using any additional Jira licenses and without granting more permissions than the agents need. What should he do?","zh":"RELAY 是 Pinecrest Health 一個 Private 的 team-managed software project。客服 agent 有 Jira Service Management 的存取，但沒有 Jira 的 product access。Project administrator Oluwaseun 希望這些 agent 能查看 RELAY 的 issue、留言、附加 log 檔，而且不要用到任何額外的 Jira 授權，也不給超過需要的權限。他該怎麼做？","zo":["把 agent 加進 Member role。","把 agent 加進 Viewer role。","把 project 的 access level 改成 Open。","請 site admin 給 agent Jira 的 product access，再把他們加進 Member role。"],"fig":"","opts":["Add the agents to the Member role.","Add the agents to the Viewer role.","Change the project access level to Open.","Ask a site admin to grant the agents product access to Jira, then add them to the Member role."],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。Member 還包含建立、編輯、轉狀態，超出 agent 需要的範圍；而且官方說 Member 要有 Jira 產品存取才能完整發揮。","B":"對。預設 Viewer 就有瀏覽、Add comments、Add attachments，官方說可以給任何已註冊使用者、不需額外產品存取；權限也剛好夠用，不多不少。","C":"錯。Open 會讓全站使用者自動成為 Member，把 Private project 開放給整個站，而且 Member 仍需 Jira 產品存取，不符需求。","D":"錯。這樣做能用，但要替每位 agent 多佔一個 Jira 授權，違反「不使用額外授權」的限制。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>考試寫 product access to Jira；現行官方頁改叫 app access，project 改叫 space、issue 改叫 work item，意思相同。<br>官方也提到：Collaborate on issues 權限組可以給任何能登入站台的人，例如 Jira Service Management 的 agent。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/manage-how-people-access-your-team-managed-project/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/next-gen-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.1.2-e04","sec":"620.1.2","dom":"620.1","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. LUMA is a team-managed project at Saffron Travel with the access level set to Limited. The table lists five users, their role on the LUMA Access page, and whether they have product access to Jira (Product access column). Which two users can transition LUMA issues? (Choose two.)","zh":"Refer to the exhibit.（請看附圖。）LUMA 是 Saffron Travel 的 team-managed project，access level 設為 Limited。表格列出五位使用者、他們在 LUMA Access 頁上的 role，以及他們有沒有 Jira 的 product access（Product access 欄）。哪兩位使用者可以轉換 LUMA issue 的狀態？（選兩個。）","zo":["Bruno","Aiko","Chidi","Elif","Dana"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 198\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"LUMA 使用者、role 與 Jira product access 一覽\"><rect x=\"10\" y=\"8\" width=\"300\" height=\"182\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx plain\"/><text x=\"20\" y=\"28\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\">LUMA access (Limited)</text><rect x=\"16\" y=\"39\" width=\"288\" height=\"22\" rx=\"5\" class=\"sf-gray\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">User</text><text x=\"92\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Project role</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Product access</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"62\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"62\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Bruno</text><text x=\"92\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Member</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">No</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"86\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"86\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Aiko</text><text x=\"92\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Member</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Yes</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"110\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"126\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Chidi</text><text x=\"92\" y=\"126\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Viewer</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"126\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Yes</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"134\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"134\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"150\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Elif</text><text x=\"92\" y=\"150\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Administrator</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"150\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Yes</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"158\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"158\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"174\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Dana</text><text x=\"92\" y=\"174\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">(not added)</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"174\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Yes</text></svg>","opts":["Bruno","Aiko","Chidi","Elif","Dana"],"ans":"BD","why":{"A":"錯。Bruno 的 role 是 Member，但他沒有 Jira 產品存取。常見誤解：以為有 Member 就能動；沒有授權就無法轉狀態。","B":"對。Aiko 是 Member，Member 預設有 Transition any issue，而且她有 Jira 產品存取，兩個條件都滿足，所以能轉狀態。","C":"錯。Chidi 是 Viewer。Viewer 只有瀏覽、留言、加附件，沒有 Transition any issue，有授權也轉不了。","D":"對。Elif 是 Administrator，預設包含 Member 的全部工作權限，也有 Jira 產品存取，可以轉換 issue 狀態。","E":"錯。Dana 沒被加進 project。Limited 只會讓站內使用者自動成為 Viewer，只能看與留言，不能轉狀態。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>考試寫 product access to Jira；現行官方頁改叫 app access，project 改叫 space、issue 改叫 work item，意思相同。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/next-gen-permissions/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/manage-how-people-access-your-team-managed-project/"],"lvl":3,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.1.2-e05","sec":"620.1.2","dom":"620.1","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Olumide, a Jira administrator at Brightfern Foods, is writing a short guide for team leads about creating projects in Jira Cloud. Which two statements should he include? (Choose two.)","zh":"Olumide 是 Brightfern Foods 的 Jira administrator，他正在替各 team lead 寫一份「在 Jira Cloud 建立 project」的簡短指南。他應該寫進哪兩個敘述？（選兩個。）","zo":["除非 Jira administrator 在 global permissions 改掉，任何使用者都能建立 team-managed project。","建立 team-managed project 需要 Administer Jira 全域權限。","建立 team-managed project 時，可以勾選 Share settings with an existing project 來沿用另一個 project 的 workflow。","Create team-managed projects 全域權限也能讓使用者建立 company-managed project。","只有 Jira administrator 能建立和既有 project 共用設定的 project。"],"fig":"","opts":["Any user can create a team-managed project unless a Jira administrator changes this in global permissions.","Creating a team-managed project requires the Administer Jira global permission.","When creating a team-managed project, you can select Share settings with an existing project to reuse its workflows.","The Create team-managed projects global permission also lets users create company-managed projects.","Only Jira administrators can create a project that shares its configuration with an existing project."],"ans":"AE","why":{"A":"對。預設任何使用者都能建自己的 team-managed project，除非 Jira admin 在 global permissions 收回 Create team-managed projects。","B":"錯。Administer Jira 是建 company-managed project 的權限；建 team-managed project 只要 Create team-managed projects。","C":"錯。Share settings with an existing project 只在選 Company-managed 時出現，TMP 的設定各自獨立。","D":"錯。官方明寫這個權限只能建 team-managed project；建 company-managed project 要靠 Administer Jira。","E":"對。官方說只有 Jira admin 能建共用設定的 project，而且只能選 Company-managed。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>現行 UI 把 project 改叫 space，所以權限名稱顯示為 Create team-managed spaces。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/create-a-new-project/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/manage-global-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.1.2-e06","sec":"620.1.2","dom":"620.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Siobhan is the project administrator of ECHO, a team-managed project that tracks bugs in her company's open-source plugin. She wants anyone on the internet to browse ECHO issues without logging in to the Jira site. What should she do?","zh":"Siobhan 是 ECHO 的 project administrator，ECHO 是一個 team-managed project，用來追蹤公司開源外掛的 bug。她希望網路上任何人都能在不登入 Jira 站台的情況下瀏覽 ECHO 的 issue。她該怎麼做？","zo":["把 project 的 access level 改成 Open。","建立一個只有 Collaborate on issues 權限組的自訂 role，並把 Anyone 加進去。","請 Jira administrator 為這個 bug 追蹤建立一個 company-managed project。","把所有站內使用者加進 Viewer role，並把 project 連結公開分享出去。"],"fig":"","opts":["Change the project access level to Open.","Create a custom role that has only the Collaborate on issues permission set and add Anyone to it.","Ask a Jira administrator to create a company-managed project for the bug tracker.","Add every site user to the Viewer role and share the project link publicly."],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。Open 只把 Member 給「登入 Jira 站台的人」，沒登入的匿名訪客仍然進不來。","B":"錯。自建 role 只能指派給站上的使用者或群組。官方明寫 TMP 目前不能開匿名存取，所以不存在給未登入者的 role。","C":"對。官方明寫 team-managed project 目前不能開匿名存取；需要匿名瀏覽時，要請 Jira admin 建 company-managed project，再用 permission scheme 設定。","D":"錯。Viewer 只能給站內已註冊的使用者，匿名訪客不在其中；TMP 不支援匿名存取，分享連結給未登入者也一樣無法瀏覽。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/next-gen-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.1.2-e07","sec":"620.1.2","dom":"620.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Tanvir is the project administrator of QUILL, a team-managed project on the Standard plan. He needs a Contract QA role that has every permission of the default Member role except Manage sprints. Which option meets the requirement with the least effort?","zh":"Tanvir 是 QUILL 的 project administrator，QUILL 是 Standard 方案上的 team-managed project。他需要一個 Contract QA role，擁有預設 Member role 的所有權限，但不包含 Manage sprints。哪個做法用最少的工夫就能符合需求？","zo":["Duplicate（複製）Member role，把副本改名、取消勾選 Manage sprints，再把外包人員指派進去。","打開 Member role，取消勾選 Manage sprints 並儲存，讓這個變更套用到外包人員身上。","請 Jira administrator 把 QUILL 關聯到一個不給 Manage Sprints 的 permission scheme。","同時給外包人員 Viewer 與 Member 兩個 role，讓 Viewer 把 sprint 權限拿掉。"],"fig":"","opts":["Duplicate the Member role, rename the copy, clear Manage sprints, and assign the contractors to it.","Open the Member role, clear Manage sprints, and save so that the change applies to the contractors.","Ask a Jira administrator to associate QUILL with a permission scheme that does not grant Manage Sprints.","Assign the contractors both the Viewer role and the Member role so that Viewer removes sprint permissions."],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。預設 role 不能編輯，但可以 Duplicate 當起點，改名後只取消 Manage sprints，最省事。","B":"錯。官方說 Jira 內建的預設 role 不能編輯。就算能改，也會影響所有 Member，而不只是外包人員。","C":"錯。Permission scheme 只用於 company-managed project；TMP 的權限由 access level 加 role 決定。","D":"錯。Role 是疊加不是覆寫。同時有 Viewer 和 Member，得到的是兩者聯集，Member 的 Manage sprints 仍然在。"},"note":"Free 方案不能編輯 project 權限與 role，所以題目特別說是 Standard 方案。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/manage-how-people-access-your-team-managed-project/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.1.2-e08","sec":"620.1.2","dom":"620.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Ingrid, the project administrator of the team-managed project FJORD, wants to add Mateo, a freelance illustrator, as a Member. Mateo has never joined the company's Atlassian site. When Ingrid selects Add people on the Access page and types his email address, no match is found. What should she do?","zh":"Ingrid 是 team-managed project FJORD 的 project administrator，她想把自由接案的插畫家 Mateo 加成 Member。Mateo 從沒加入過公司的 Atlassian 站台。Ingrid 在 Access 頁點 Add people、輸入他的 email，結果找不到人。她該怎麼做？","zo":["把 FJORD 的 access level 改成 Open，讓 Mateo 透過分享連結進入 project。","建立一個給外部人員的自訂 role，把 Mateo 的 email 打進這個 role 的成員清單。","請 Jira administrator 在 FJORD 的 permission scheme 給 Mateo Browse Projects 權限。","請 Jira administrator 邀請 Mateo 加入 Atlassian 站台，然後再到 Access 頁把他加進來。"],"fig":"","opts":["Change the FJORD access level to Open so that Mateo can use a shared link to reach the project.","Create a custom role for external users and type Mateo's email address into the role's member list.","Ask a Jira administrator to grant Mateo the Browse Projects permission in FJORD's permission scheme.","Ask a Jira administrator to invite Mateo to the Atlassian site, and then add him on the Access page."],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。Open 只把 Member 給「登入這個 Jira 站台的人」。Mateo 還不是站上的使用者，開放也碰不到他。","B":"錯。自建 role 只決定權限組合，指派對象仍必須是站上已有的使用者或群組，不能直接塞外部 email。","C":"錯。TMP 沒有 permission scheme；而且 Mateo 還不是站上的使用者，給什麼權限都加不到他。","D":"對。官方說 Access 頁只能加已加入 Atlassian 站台的人；找不到時要請 Jira admin 先邀請他進站，之後再加進 project 並選 Member。"},"note":"官方也提到：外部合作者若只需要有限存取，可以請管理者以 guest 身分邀請。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/add-people-to-team-managed-projects/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.1.3-e01","sec":"620.1.3","dom":"620.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. Tomasz is a Jira administrator at Harborlight Freight, which uses Jira Software Cloud Premium. The exhibit shows the site's issue type hierarchy. He removes the Initiative level and saves the change. What happens to the Initiative issue type?","zh":"請參考附圖。Tomasz 是 Harborlight Freight 公司的 Jira administrator，公司使用 Jira Software Cloud Premium。附圖是站台的 issue type hierarchy。他把 Initiative 這一層移除並儲存。Initiative 這個 issue type 會怎麼樣？","zo":["它會被刪除，連同所有該類型的 issue 一起刪掉","它會移到 Story 層（level 0），成為一般的 standard issue type","它會移到 Epic 層（level 1），在 plans 和 timeline 上與 Epic 並列","它會變成 level -1 的 sub-task issue type"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 305\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Issue type hierarchy\"><rect x=\"0.5\" y=\"0.5\" width=\"379\" height=\"304\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"380\" height=\"34\" rx=\"0\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Jira settings / Issues</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Issue type hierarchy</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s tf-violet\" style=\"font-weight:700\">Changes apply to all company-managed projects</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"113\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Level name  /  Jira issue types</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"143\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"143\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"135\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Initiative (level 2)</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"135\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Initiative</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"169\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"169\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"161\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Epic (level 1)</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"161\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Epic</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"195\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"195\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"187\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Story (level 0)</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"187\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Story, Task, Bug</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"221\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"221\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"213\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Subtask (level -1)</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"213\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Sub-task</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"242\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s tf-rose\" style=\"font-weight:700\">Initiative level: Remove</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"255\" width=\"106.0\" height=\"26\" rx=\"6\" class=\"fl-brand\"/><text x=\"65.0\" y=\"272\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"w\">Save changes</text></svg>","opts":["It is deleted, together with every issue of that type","It moves to the Story level (level 0) and acts as a standard issue type","It moves to the Epic level (level 1) and appears next to Epic in plans and on the timeline","It becomes a sub-task issue type at level -1"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。移除的是 hierarchy 的「層級」，不是 issue type 本身，也不會刪掉任何 issue；要刪 issue type 得另外到 Issue types 頁操作。","B":"對。官方寫明：被移除層級所關聯的 issue type 會退回 Story 層（level 0）。要注意改動 hierarchy 會拆掉既有的 parent／child 關係，而且無法復原。","C":"錯。Level 1 是 Epic 層，要把其他 issue type 放進這一層必須由 Jira admin 主動設定；移除上層時 Jira 不會自動把它往下搬到 Epic 層。","D":"錯。Sub-task 層（level -1）只能放 sub-task 類型的 issue type；standard 與 sub-task 是建立時就選定的兩種類別，不會因移除層級而互換。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>現行 UI 叫 Work type hierarchy，路徑是 Settings → Work items → Work type hierarchy；新增層級與把其他類型放進 Epic 層都只有 Premium、Enterprise 才能用。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-the-issue-type-hierarchy/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.1.3-e02","sec":"620.1.3","dom":"620.1","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Refilwe is the project administrator of FERN, a team-managed software project at Quillstone Media. She is not a Jira administrator. Which two actions can she complete from the project's Issue types settings? (Choose two.)","zh":"Refilwe 是 Quillstone Media 公司 FERN 這個 team-managed software project 的 project administrator，但不是 Jira administrator。她可以在 project 的 Issue types 設定裡完成哪兩項操作？（選兩個）","zo":["自建一個位於 Epic 之上、叫 Initiative 的 parent 層 issue type","自建一個叫 Spike 的 issue type，並設定自己的 icon 和描述","自建一個叫 QA check 的 sub-task 層 issue type","新增自訂 issue type，讓 FERN 總共有 45 個 issue type","把 Environment 欄位設為 Bug 這個 issue type 的必填欄位"],"fig":"","opts":["Create a custom parent-level issue type called Initiative that sits above Epic","Create a custom issue type called Spike with its own icon and description","Create a custom sub-task-level issue type called QA check","Add custom issue types until FERN has a total of 45 issue types","Make the Environment field required for the Bug issue type"],"ans":"BE","why":{"A":"錯。官方寫明 TMP 目前只能自建「standard」層的 issue type，不能自建 parent 或 sub-task 層；Epic 之上的層級屬於 CMP 的 Premium hierarchy 設定。","B":"對。TMP 的 project admin 可以在 Issue types 按 Create issue type，自訂名稱、描述和 icon。自建的類型一律落在 standard 層，不需要 Jira admin。","C":"錯。TMP 只提供內建的 Subtask 類型，不能另外自建 sub-task 層的 issue type；官方也建議別自己建一個叫 Subtask 的類型，以免失去 swimlane 等功能。","D":"錯。官方寫明 TMP 最多只能加到 30 個 issue type，45 個遠超過上限；想再加新類型，得先刪掉用不到的類型。","E":"對。編輯 TMP 的 issue type 時，可以勾選欄位的 Required 核取方塊；儲存後，這類 issue 沒填該欄位就建立不了。這是 project admin 自己能做的設定。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>現行 UI 叫 Space settings → Work types；規則相同：只能自建 standard 類型、上限 30 個。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/set-up-issue-types-in-team-managed-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.1.3-e03","sec":"620.1.3","dom":"620.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Mateus is the scrum master for ORCA, a company-managed Scrum project at Tidewater Bank that uses the default workflow. From the epic panel in the backlog, he marks the epic Card Controls as done. Three stories in that epic are still In Progress. What happens to those three stories?","zh":"Mateus 是 Tidewater Bank 公司 ORCA 這個 company-managed Scrum project 的 scrum master，project 使用預設 workflow。他在 backlog 的 epic panel 把 Card Controls 這個 epic 標記為完成。這個 epic 底下還有三個 story 是 In Progress。這三個 story 會怎麼樣？","zo":["它們會被 transition 到 Done，讓 epic 顯示 100% 進度","它們會從 epic 移除，改列在 panel 的 No epic 區","它們維持目前狀態，仍然是這個 epic 的 child","Jira 會擋下這個操作，直到 epic 的所有 story 都是 Done"],"fig":"","opts":["They are transitioned to Done so that the epic shows 100% progress","They are removed from the epic and listed under No epic in the panel","They keep their current status and remain children of the epic","Jira blocks the change until all of the epic's stories are Done"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。完成 epic 不會替 child issue 做 transition；要自動把 child 一起關掉，得另外寫 automation rule，Jira 本身不會這樣做。","B":"錯。把 issue 拖到 No epic 區，或清掉它的 Parent 欄位，才會解除和 epic 的關係；完成 epic 不會改動 child 的 parent。","C":"對。官方寫明從 epic panel 完成 epic 時，epic 底下的 issue 完全不受影響：狀態不變、也仍掛在這個 epic 下。常見誤解：以為 epic 完成會連帶關掉 child。","D":"錯。預設 workflow 沒有擋住 epic 完成的限制；想在 child 未完成前擋住 parent，得自己在 transition 加 condition，Jira 不會自動檢查。"},"note":"官方頁說明：在 epic panel 完成 epic 只會把 epic 的 Epic Status 欄位設為 Done，不影響 epic 的 workflow 與 Status 欄位，epic 底下的 issue 也都不受影響。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/manage-epics-in-a-scrum-project/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.1.3-e04","sec":"620.1.3","dom":"620.1","type":"multi","n":3,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. Ananya opens story NOVA-42 in the company-managed NOVA project and creates a sub-task under it. She enters only a summary. Which three values does the new sub-task NOT inherit from NOVA-42? (Choose three.)","zh":"請參考附圖。Ananya 在 company-managed 的 NOVA project 打開 story NOVA-42，並在底下建立一個 sub-task，只填了 summary。新的 sub-task 不會從 NOVA-42 繼承哪三個值？（選三個）","zo":["Sprint：NOVA Sprint 7","Fix versions：2.4","Security level：Internal","Components：API","Assignee：Lior Ben-David"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 333\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"NOVA-42  Export audit log\"><rect x=\"0.5\" y=\"0.5\" width=\"379\" height=\"332\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"380\" height=\"34\" rx=\"0\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Projects / NOVA / NOVA-42</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">NOVA-42  Export audit log</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s tf-violet\" style=\"font-weight:700\">Company-managed project</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"113\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Details</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"143\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"143\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"135\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Issue type</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"135\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Story</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"169\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"169\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"161\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Sprint</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"161\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">NOVA Sprint 7</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"195\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"195\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"187\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Security level</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"187\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Internal</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"221\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"221\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"213\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Fix versions</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"213\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">2.4</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"247\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"247\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"239\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Components</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"239\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">API</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"273\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"273\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"265\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Assignee</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"265\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Lior Ben-David</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"283\" width=\"121.0\" height=\"26\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"72.5\" y=\"300\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"t\">Create subtask</text></svg>","opts":["Sprint: NOVA Sprint 7","Fix versions: 2.4","Security level: Internal","Components: API","Assignee: Lior Ben-David"],"ans":"BDE","why":{"A":"錯。Sprint 是官方列出的繼承項目，建立時就自動帶入 NOVA Sprint 7；所以 sub-task 永遠和 parent 在同一個 sprint，不能單獨排進別的 sprint。","B":"對。Fix version 不在官方的繼承清單（project、security level、sprint）裡，不會帶入。常見誤解：parent 有 fix version，sub-task 就會算進同一個版本。","C":"錯。Issue security level 是官方列出的三個繼承項目之一，建立時就自動帶入 Internal，sub-task 和 parent 套用同一個 security level。","D":"對。Component 不在官方的繼承清單裡，不會從 parent 帶入 API；要讓 sub-task 也有這個 component，得手動填或用 automation 複製欄位。","E":"對。Assignee 不在繼承清單裡，不會帶入 Lior；sub-task 本來就是為了把工作拆給不同的人。若 project 有預設 assignee，套用的是預設規則，不是 parent 的值。"},"note":"官方頁原文列出繼承的只有 project、security level、sprint 三項；fix version、component、assignee 都不在其中。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/create-an-issue-and-a-sub-task/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.1.3-e05","sec":"620.1.3","dom":"620.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. Dmitri is the scrum master for the KITE board in a company-managed Scrum project. The board estimates in Story Points, and the exhibit lists every issue in Sprint 12 when he completed the sprint. All of them were in the sprint from the start, and Done is the board's right-most column. Which value does the Velocity Chart show as Completed for Sprint 12?","zh":"請參考附圖。Dmitri 是某個 company-managed Scrum project 中 KITE board 的 scrum master。這個 board 用 Story Points 估算，附圖列出他完成 Sprint 12 時 sprint 裡的所有 issue。這些 issue 從 sprint 一開始就在裡面，而 Done 是 board 最右邊的欄。Velocity Chart 上 Sprint 12 的 Completed 會顯示多少？","zo":["7","10","12","15"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 198\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"KITE board Sprint 12 issue list\"><rect x=\"10\" y=\"8\" width=\"300\" height=\"182\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx plain\"/><text x=\"20\" y=\"28\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\">Sprint 12 on the KITE board</text><rect x=\"16\" y=\"39\" width=\"288\" height=\"22\" rx=\"5\" class=\"sf-gray\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Key</text><text x=\"92\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Type</text><text x=\"196\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Points</text><text x=\"216\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Status</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"62\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"62\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">KITE-1</text><text x=\"92\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Story</text><text x=\"196\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"t\">5</text><text x=\"216\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Done</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"86\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"86\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">KITE-2</text><text x=\"92\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Sub-task</text><text x=\"196\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"t\">3</text><text x=\"216\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Done</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"110\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"126\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">KITE-3</text><text x=\"92\" y=\"126\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Bug</text><text x=\"196\" y=\"126\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"t\">2</text><text x=\"216\" y=\"126\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Done</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"134\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"134\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"150\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">KITE-4</text><text x=\"92\" y=\"150\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Story</text><text x=\"196\" y=\"150\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"t\">3</text><text x=\"216\" y=\"150\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">In Progress</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"158\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"158\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"174\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">KITE-5</text><text x=\"92\" y=\"174\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Sub-task</text><text x=\"196\" y=\"174\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"t\">2</text><text x=\"216\" y=\"174\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Done</text></svg>","opts":["7","10","12","15"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。Velocity Chart 只算 parent 層（standard issue）的估點，sub-task 的估點不計入。完成的 standard issue 是 KITE-1（5）和 KITE-3（2），合計 7。","B":"錯。10 是把 KITE-2 這個 sub-task 的 3 點也加進去。官方寫明 sub-task 的估點不計入 velocity，就算它已經 Done 也一樣。","C":"錯。12 是把兩個已完成 sub-task（3＋2）都算進去。常見誤解：以為 sub-task 做完就會替團隊累積點數；估點應該估在 standard 層。","D":"錯。15 是把所有 issue 的估點全部加總，連未完成的 KITE-4 也算了；Completed 只算 sprint 結束時位於最右欄的 issue。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-velocity-chart/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.1.3-e06","sec":"620.1.3","dom":"620.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Keiko manages PAY, a company-managed Scrum project at Lanternway Payments. The marketing team tracks the epic Checkout Redesign in MKT, a team-managed project. Keiko can browse MKT and has full edit rights in both projects. She wants several PAY stories to become children of that epic, but the MKT epic never appears as a parent option. What is the reason?","zh":"Keiko 管理 Lanternway Payments 公司的 PAY，這是一個 company-managed Scrum project。行銷團隊在 team-managed project MKT 裡追蹤 Checkout Redesign 這個 epic。Keiko 看得到 MKT，在兩個 project 也都有完整的編輯權限。她想讓幾個 PAY 的 story 成為那個 epic 的 child，但 MKT 的 epic 從來沒有出現在 parent 選項中。原因是什麼？","zo":["全站的 Issue linking 設定被關掉，所以跨 project 的 parent 關係被擋下","只有 Premium 透過 Plans 才能設定其他 project 的 parent，所以站台必須先升級","PAY 的 backlog 關掉了 epic panel，所以其他 project 的 epic 不會出現在 Parent 欄位","Company-managed project 的 issue 只能以 company-managed project 裡的 issue 當 parent"],"fig":"","opts":["Issue linking is turned off in the global Jira settings, so parent links to another project are blocked","Parents from another project are available only on Premium through Plans, so the site must be upgraded first","The epic panel is turned off in the PAY backlog, so epics from other projects are hidden from the Parent field","Issues in a company-managed project can only have parents from company-managed projects"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。Issue linking 是 Jira admin 管的 issue link（如 blocks、relates to）開關；parent／child 是 Parent 欄位的階層關係，不是 issue link，不受它影響。","B":"錯。跨 project 設 parent 不需要 Premium：CMP 的 story 可以掛到另一個 CMP 的 epic。Plans 是用來跨 project 規劃，不是開啟 parent 的前提。","C":"錯。Epic panel 只是 backlog 上檢視與拖放 epic 的面板，開關它不影響 Parent 欄位能選哪些 epic；關閉它也不會把跨 project 的 epic 藏起來。","D":"對。官方寫明 CMP 的 issue 只能加到同一個或另一個 CMP 的 parent 底下，TMP 亦同。所以要把 epic 建在 company-managed project 裡，PAY 的 story 才掛得上去。"},"note":"官方頁原文：一個 issue 只能有一個 parent；CMP 的 issue 只能加到同一個或另一個 CMP 的 parent，TMP 的 issue 也只能加到 TMP 的 parent。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/manage-epics-in-team-managed-projects/"],"lvl":3,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.1.3-e07","sec":"620.1.3","dom":"620.1","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Yusuf, a team lead at Copperleaf Logistics, is training new members on issue types in company-managed software projects. Which two statements are true? (Choose two.)","zh":"Copperleaf Logistics 公司的 team lead Yusuf 正在教新成員認識 company-managed software project 的 issue type。下列哪兩項敘述正確？（選兩個）","zo":["一個 issue 可以同時有一個 epic 和一個 story 當 parent","把 Epic 這個 issue type 改名為 Feature，會關掉 epic panel 等 epic 功能","Sub-task 可以是 child issue，但永遠不能當 parent issue","一個 epic 可以包含來自多個 project 的 issue","有 sub-task 的 story 不能同時是某個 epic 的 child"],"fig":"","opts":["An issue can have an epic and a story as parents at the same time","Renaming the Epic issue type to Feature turns off epic features such as the epic panel","A sub-task can be a child issue, but it can never be a parent issue","An epic can contain issues from more than one project","A story that has sub-tasks cannot also be a child of an epic"],"ans":"CD","why":{"A":"錯。官方寫明一個 issue 只能指定一個 parent；story 掛 epic、sub-task 掛 standard issue，上層都只有一個。","B":"錯。官方寫明 Epic 只是預設名稱，改名後功能照舊；epic panel、epic 的 child 關係都還在，只是顯示的名字變成 Feature。","C":"對。Sub-task 在 hierarchy 的最底層（level -1），下面沒有任何層級，所以只能當 child。其他層的 issue type 都能同時當 parent 和 child。","D":"對。官方寫明 epic 可以跨多個 project，例如 board 的 filter 涵蓋多個 project 時，epic 底下可以有不同 project 的 issue；前提是 parent 與 child 同屬 company-managed（或同屬 team-managed）。","E":"錯。Story 可以一邊掛在 epic 底下當 child，一邊有自己的 sub-task 當 parent；除了 sub-task，每一層都能同時是 parent 和 child。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/what-are-issue-types/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/what-is-an-epic/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/manage-epics-in-team-managed-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.1.4-e01","sec":"620.1.4","dom":"620.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. Olga is a project administrator for the Lumen Portal project at Brightfold Labs. She is not a Jira administrator. She plans four changes on the Details page. Which change requires her to contact a Jira administrator?","zh":"請參考附圖。Olga 是 Brightfold Labs 公司 Lumen Portal 這個 project 的 project administrator，但不是 Jira administrator。她打算在 Details 頁做四項修改。哪一項修改需要她去找 Jira administrator？","zo":["在 URL 欄位填入團隊 Confluence space 的網址","把 Default assignee 從 Project lead 改成 Unassigned","把 project 指派到既有的 Customer Apps category","把 project 的 avatar 換成團隊的 logo"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 482\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Details\"><rect x=\"0.5\" y=\"0.5\" width=\"379\" height=\"481\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"380\" height=\"34\" rx=\"0\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Project settings</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Details</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s tf-violet\" style=\"font-weight:700\">Company-managed project</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"113\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Name</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"119\" width=\"356\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"137\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Lumen Portal</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"168\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Key</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"174\" width=\"356\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"192\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">LUMEN</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"223\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">URL</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"229\" width=\"356\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"247\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\"></text><text x=\"12\" y=\"278\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Category</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"284\" width=\"356\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"302\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">None</text><path d=\"M350,295 l5,5 l5,-5\" class=\"ln ink\" style=\"stroke-width:1.6\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"333\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Project lead</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"339\" width=\"356\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"357\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Olga Petrova</text><path d=\"M350,350 l5,5 l5,-5\" class=\"ln ink\" style=\"stroke-width:1.6\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"388\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Default assignee</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"394\" width=\"356\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"412\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Project lead</text><path d=\"M350,405 l5,5 l5,-5\" class=\"ln ink\" style=\"stroke-width:1.6\"/><rect x=\"12\" y=\"432\" width=\"106.0\" height=\"26\" rx=\"6\" class=\"fl-brand\"/><text x=\"65.0\" y=\"449\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"w\">Save details</text></svg>","opts":["Add the address of the team's Confluence space in the URL field","Change the default assignee from Project lead to Unassigned","Assign the project to the existing Customer Apps category","Replace the project avatar with the team logo"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。URL 欄位連到 project 以外的文件，例如 Confluence space；它是 CMP 專有欄位，project admin 可以自己填。","B":"錯。Default assignee 由 project admin 在 Details 頁修改，只能選 Unassigned 或 Project lead，不必找 Jira admin。","C":"對。圖上標明是 company-managed project，官方寫明 CMP 要指派 category 得找 Jira admin。常見誤解：看到 Category 下拉就以為 project admin 能自己選。","D":"錯。Avatar 屬於 project 的外觀，project admin 可以在 Details 頁選內建圖示或上傳自己的圖片，不需要 Jira admin。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>現行 UI 把 project 改叫 space、Project lead 改叫 Space owner，Details 頁也多了 Space background、Card covers；題目沿用考試時代的名詞。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/edit-a-projects-details/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/add-assign-and-delete-project-categories/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.1.4-e02","sec":"620.1.4","dom":"620.1","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Hamid is the project administrator of PIX, a team-managed software project at Pixelwright Studio. He is not a Jira administrator. Which two changes will he be unable to make from the project's Details page? (Choose two.)","zh":"Hamid 是 Pixelwright Studio 公司 PIX 這個 team-managed software project 的 project administrator，但不是 Jira administrator。他在 project 的 Details 頁「無法」做到哪兩項修改？（選兩個）","zo":["把 project key 從 PIX 改成 PIXL","加一個指向團隊 Confluence space 的 URL","選一個由 Jira administrator 建立的既有 category","上傳新的 project icon","為其他管理員填寫 project 描述（description）"],"fig":"","opts":["Change the project key from PIX to PIXL","Add a URL that points to the team's Confluence space","Select an existing category that a Jira administrator created","Upload a new project icon","Enter a project description for other administrators"],"ans":"BE","why":{"A":"做得到（不選）。TMP 的 project admin 可以在 Details 頁自己改 key，不必找 Jira admin；這點和 CMP 正好相反。","B":"做不到（要選）。官方寫明 project URL 只有 CMP 才有，TMP 的 Details 頁沒有 URL 欄位。常見誤解：以為 TMP 和 CMP 的 Details 欄位一樣。","C":"做得到（不選）。Category 由 Jira admin 建立，但 TMP 的 project admin 可以自己在 Details 頁的下拉選單挑一個指派。","D":"做得到（不選）。Icon（頭像）是 TMP Details 頁的欄位之一，project admin 可以選內建圖示或上傳自己的圖片。","E":"做不到（要選）。TMP 的 Details 沒有 Description 欄位，相關需求 JSWCLOUD-17584 仍未實作；Description 只在 CMP 出現。"},"note":"現行官方 TMP 頁列出的 Details 欄位是 Icon、Name、Key、Category、Space owner、Default assignee；不論新舊版，都沒有 URL 與 Description。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/create-edit-and-delete-team-managed-projects/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/edit-a-projects-details/","https://jira.atlassian.com/browse/JSWCLOUD-17584"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.1.4-e03","sec":"620.1.4","dom":"620.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Nkechi is a project administrator for the company-managed project CRM at Tallow &amp; Reed. The team wants the key changed to SALES, but she cannot edit the Key field on the Details page. Which option meets the requirement with the least effort?","zh":"Nkechi 是 Tallow &amp; Reed 公司 company-managed project CRM 的 project administrator。團隊想把 key 改成 SALES，但她無法編輯 Details 頁上的 Key 欄位。哪個做法能用最少的工夫達成需求？","zo":["請 Jira administrator 在 project 的 Details 頁修改 key","建一個 key 為 SALES 的新 project，再把 CRM 的所有 issue 用 bulk move 搬過去","在 project 的 permission scheme 裡，把她自己的帳號加到 Administer Projects 權限","先刪掉 project 的 previous keys，再重新編輯 key 欄位"],"fig":"","opts":["Ask a Jira administrator to change the key on the project's Details page","Create a new project with the key SALES and bulk move every CRM issue into it","Add her own account to the Administer Projects permission in the project's permission scheme","Delete the project's previous keys first, and then edit the key field again"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。官方寫明只有 organization、site、Jira admin 能改 key；請 Jira admin 在 Details 頁改掉即可，舊 key 會自動保留成 previous key。","B":"錯。新建 project 再 bulk move 也能換到新 key，但要搬全部 issue、重設 board，工作量遠大於請 Jira admin 直接改。","C":"錯。Nkechi 是 project admin，本來就有 Administer Projects；CMP 改 key 要 org、site 或 Jira admin，加 project 權限沒用。","D":"錯。在 CMP 刪 previous key 和改 key 需要同樣的 admin 身分，她一樣做不到；而且刪掉後舊 key 連結會失效。"},"note":"Team-managed project 的 project admin 可以自己改 key；本題是 company-managed，所以要找 Jira admin。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/edit-a-projects-details/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.1.4-e04","sec":"620.1.4","dom":"620.1","type":"multi","n":3,"stem":"Anika is a Jira administrator at Corvane Logistics. She is preparing guidance for project administrators about project categories. Which three statements should she include? (Choose three.)","zh":"Anika 是 Corvane Logistics 公司的 Jira administrator，正在替 project administrator 準備一份 project category 的說明。她應該寫進哪三項敘述？（選三個）","zo":["Jira administrator 從 Settings &gt; Projects &gt; Project categories 建立 category","Category 可以用來建立 project 的上下層（父子）階層","把 category 指派給 project，會把該 category 的 permission scheme 套用到 project","同一個 category 可以指派給多個 project，讓團隊一起檢視相關的工作","可以在 advanced search 中依 category 找 issue，例如 <code>category = \"Retail\"</code>","Team-managed project 的 administrator 可以從 project 的 Details 頁新增 category"],"fig":"","opts":["A Jira administrator creates categories from Settings &gt; Projects &gt; Project categories","Categories can be used to build a parent-child hierarchy of projects","Assigning a category to a project applies that category's permission scheme to the project","The same category can be assigned to many projects so teams can view related work together","Issues can be found by category in advanced search, for example <code>category = \"Retail\"</code>","A team-managed project administrator can create a new category from the project's Details page"],"ans":"ADE","why":{"A":"對。Category 由 Jira admin 在 ⚙ Settings → Projects → Project categories 輸入名稱與描述後按 Add 建立；project admin 只能挑選。","B":"錯。Category 只是一層平面的分組，官方明寫不能用來建立 project 階層，例如 parent project。常見誤解：以為可以做成父子分類。","C":"錯。Category 本身沒有任何 scheme，只用來分組、篩選與報表；permission scheme 要另外在 project 設定裡指定。","D":"對。Category 的用途就是把相關的多個 project 歸成一組，讓團隊在同一處看到跨 project 的工作；一個 category 可以給很多 project 用。","E":"對。JQL 有 category 欄位，支援 =、!=、IN 等運算子，可以在 advanced search、filter、報表中依 category 撈出 issue。","F":"錯。TMP 的 project admin 只能在 Details 頁挑選 Jira admin 建好的 category，不能自己新增。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>現行 UI 的路徑是 Settings → Spaces → Space categories。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/add-assign-and-delete-project-categories/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/create-edit-and-delete-team-managed-projects/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/jql-fields/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.1.4-e05","sec":"620.1.4","dom":"620.1","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Ravi is a project administrator, but not a Jira administrator, for the company-managed project HRX at Solvik Health. His team sends him five requests for the project's Details page. Which two requests must he forward to a Jira administrator? (Choose two.)","zh":"Ravi 是 Solvik Health 公司 company-managed project HRX 的 project administrator，但不是 Jira administrator。團隊向他提出五項關於 project Details 頁的修改需求。哪兩項需求他必須轉給 Jira administrator？（選兩個）","zo":["加一個連到 HR 團隊 Confluence space 的 URL","把 project key 從 HRX 改成 PEOPLE","把 project lead 換成接手團隊的同事","把 project 指派到 Corporate category","更新 project 描述，說明團隊的新業務範圍"],"fig":"","opts":["Add a URL that links to the HR team's Confluence space","Change the project key from HRX to PEOPLE","Change the project lead to a colleague who is taking over the team","Assign the project to the Corporate category","Update the project description to explain the team's new scope"],"ans":"BD","why":{"A":"錯。URL 是 CMP 專有欄位，project admin 自己就能在 Details 頁填入外部文件網址，例如 Confluence space，不必轉給 Jira admin。","B":"對。官方寫明只有 organization、site、Jira admin 能改 project key；CMP 的 project admin 看到的 Key 欄位不能編輯，只能轉給 Jira admin 處理。","C":"錯。Project lead（現行叫 Space owner）是 Details 頁欄位，project admin 可以自己換人；Default assignee 若設成 Project lead，新 issue 會改指派給新的人。","D":"對。官方寫明 company-managed project 要指派 category 得聯絡 Jira admin。常見誤解：以為 project admin 能在 Details 頁的 Category 下拉自己選；那是 team-managed 才有的權限。","E":"錯。Description 是 CMP Details 頁的欄位，project admin 自己就能填寫 project 摘要後按 Save details，不必轉給 Jira admin。"},"note":"Default assignee 只有兩種選擇：Unassigned 或 Project lead（現行叫 Space owner）。想讓某個人當預設負責人，就要把他設成 Project lead。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/edit-a-projects-details/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.1.4-e06","sec":"620.1.4","dom":"620.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Keiko, a project administrator at Ferrowind, renames her company-managed project from Atlas Mobile to Atlas Apps. Several shared filters on the site were written as <code>project = \"Atlas Mobile\"</code>. What happens to these filters?","zh":"Ferrowind 公司的 project administrator Keiko，把她的 company-managed project 從 Atlas Mobile 改名為 Atlas Apps。站上有好幾個共用 filter 寫的是 <code>project = \"Atlas Mobile\"</code>。這些 filter 會怎樣？","zo":["在每位 filter 擁有者修改查詢之前，它們都查不到任何結果","舊名稱會存成 previous name，查詢透過別名解析","Jira 會擋住改名，直到 filter 不再引用舊名稱","Filter 會自動更新成使用新的 project 名稱"],"fig":"","opts":["They return no results until each filter owner edits the query","The old name is stored as a previous name so the queries resolve through an alias","Jira blocks the rename until the filters no longer reference the old name","The filters are updated automatically to use the new project name"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。改名不會讓 filter 失效，也不用 filter 擁有者逐一修改；Jira 會自己更新 filter 裡的 project 名稱。","B":"錯。「保留舊值當別名」是改 key 時的 previous key 機制；改 project 名稱沒有 previous name。","C":"錯。Jira 不會因為 filter 引用舊名稱就擋住改名；在 Details 頁改完名稱按 Save 就生效。","D":"對。官方寫明改了 project 名稱後，新名稱會自動更新到站上所有 filter 裡，引用舊名稱的 filter 照常運作，不必手動改 JQL。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/edit-a-projects-details/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.1.4-e07","sec":"620.1.4","dom":"620.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Tomasz, a Jira administrator at Quillmark Freight, changes a company-managed project's key from LOGI to FLEET. A Confluence page shows LOGI-42 through a Jira issue macro, and another issue's description contains a link to LOGI-42. What happens after the change?","zh":"Quillmark Freight 公司的 Jira administrator Tomasz，把一個 company-managed project 的 key 從 LOGI 改成 FLEET。有一個 Confluence 頁面用 Jira issue macro 顯示 LOGI-42，另一張 issue 的描述裡也有指向 LOGI-42 的連結。改完 key 之後會怎樣？","zo":["Macro 照常運作，但描述裡的連結會失效，直到有人把它改成指向 FLEET-42","兩者都照常運作；連結會開啟 FLEET-42，macro 可能要一段時間才更新","兩者都會失效，直到有人把每個地方的 LOGI 換成 FLEET","連結照常運作，但 macro 必須用 FLEET-42 重新插入"],"fig":"","opts":["The macro keeps working, but the description link breaks until someone edits it to point to FLEET-42","Both keep working; the link opens FLEET-42 and the macro may take time to refresh","Both stop working until someone replaces LOGI with FLEET in each place","The link keeps working, but the macro must be inserted again with FLEET-42"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。Description 裡的連結不會壞：舊 key 會存成 previous key，LOGI-42 這個別名仍導向 FLEET-42。","B":"對。官方寫明改 key 後 Confluence 的 Jira macro 繼續運作，快取可能稍後才更新；含舊 key 的連結也會導向新 key。","C":"錯。改 key 不會讓兩者失效，舊 key 會自動保留成 previous key。常見誤解：把改 key 和刪 previous key 搞混。","D":"錯。官方明說 Confluence 的 Jira macro 在改 key 後繼續運作，不必重新插入；等快取更新即可。"},"note":"官方仍建議改 key 後通知使用者，並把 board filter、dashboard filter gadget 等全站查詢更新成新 key。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/edit-a-projects-details/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.1.4-e08","sec":"620.1.4","dom":"620.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Chen is a project administrator for a software project at Harbor &amp; Pine. In the project navigation, he renames the Timeline tab to Roadmap and removes the Calendar tab. Who will see these changes?","zh":"Chen 是 Harbor &amp; Pine 公司某個 software project 的 project administrator。他在 project 的導覽列把 Timeline tab 改名為 Roadmap，並移除了 Calendar tab。誰會看到這些變更？","zo":["只有 Chen，因為導覽的修改屬於個人偏好","只有這個 project 的其他 project administrator","所有能存取這個 project 的人","只有替這個 project 加了星號的使用者"],"fig":"","opts":["Only Chen, because navigation changes are personal preferences","Only other project administrators of the project","Everyone who has access to the project","Only users who have starred the project"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。Project 導覽的修改不是個人偏好；官方說所做的變更會套用到整個 project，不只改自己看到的畫面。","B":"錯。修改 tab 要有 project 或 board admin 身分，但改完之後的結果不限管理員看得到，一般成員也會看到新的導覽。","C":"對。官方寫明對 project 導覽做的任何修改，所有能存取這個 project 的人都看得到；所以改名、移除、排序 tab 前最好先和團隊溝通。","D":"錯。加星號是每個人自己的收藏動作；官方說導覽的變更對所有能存取 project 的人生效，和有沒有加星號無關。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>考綱寫 configure the project sidebar；現行 UI 改成 project（space）上方的導覽 tab，可改名、排序、移除、設 default。官方寫明這些導覽修改對所有能存取 project 的人生效，不是個人設定。<br>同一頁也說：設為 default 的 tab 不能移除，List 與 Apps tab 也不能移除。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/manage-and-customize-the-project-navigation/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.1.4-e09","sec":"620.1.4","dom":"620.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. At Marrowby Retail, a dashboard gadget uses a filter owned by a Jira administrator: <code>category = \"Retail\"</code>. Mateo is the project administrator of PIXEL and is not a Jira administrator. He wants PIXEL issues to appear in the gadget. Which option meets the requirement with the least effort?","zh":"請參考附圖。Marrowby Retail 公司有個 dashboard gadget 使用一位 Jira administrator 擁有的 filter：<code>category = \"Retail\"</code>。Mateo 是 PIXEL 的 project administrator，但不是 Jira administrator。他想讓 PIXEL 的 issue 出現在這個 gadget 裡。哪個做法能用最少的工夫達成需求？","zo":["請 Jira administrator 為 PIXEL 建一個 Retail 底下的子 category","在 PIXEL 的 Details 頁，把 Category 欄位選成 Retail","替每一張 PIXEL 的 issue 加上 Retail 這個 label","請 Jira administrator 把 PIXEL 關聯到 POS 使用的 permission scheme"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 174\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Marrowby Retail 的 project 清單\"><rect x=\"10\" y=\"8\" width=\"300\" height=\"158\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx plain\"/><text x=\"20\" y=\"28\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\">Projects at Marrowby Retail</text><rect x=\"16\" y=\"39\" width=\"288\" height=\"22\" rx=\"5\" class=\"sf-gray\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Project</text><text x=\"92\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Type</text><text x=\"222\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Category</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"62\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"62\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">SHOP</text><text x=\"92\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">team-managed</text><text x=\"222\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Retail</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"86\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"86\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">POS</text><text x=\"92\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">company-managed</text><text x=\"222\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Retail</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"110\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"126\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">PIXEL</text><text x=\"92\" y=\"126\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">team-managed</text><text x=\"222\" y=\"126\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">(none)</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"134\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"134\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"150\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">WMS</text><text x=\"92\" y=\"150\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">company-managed</text><text x=\"222\" y=\"150\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Logistics</text></svg>","opts":["Ask a Jira administrator to create a child category of Retail for PIXEL","Select Retail in the Category field on PIXEL's Details page","Add the label Retail to every PIXEL issue","Ask a Jira administrator to associate PIXEL with the permission scheme that POS uses"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。建立 category 只能填名稱與描述，沒有上層分類可選；另建的 category 名稱不是 Retail，<code>category = \"Retail\"</code> 撈不到。","B":"對。圖上 PIXEL 是 team-managed，TMP 的 project admin 能自己在 Details 頁指派 category，選 Retail 後就會被撈到。常見誤解：以為一律要 Jira admin。","C":"錯。Label 是 issue 的欄位；<code>category</code> 查的是 project 所屬的分類，加 label 不會被撈到。","D":"錯。Permission scheme 決定誰能做什麼，和 category 無關；換 scheme 不會讓 PIXEL 出現在 filter 裡。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/create-edit-and-delete-team-managed-projects/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/add-assign-and-delete-project-categories/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/jql-fields/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.1.4-e10","sec":"620.1.4","dom":"620.1","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Leilani is the project administrator of KIOSK, a team-managed project at Tidewell Markets. She is not a Jira administrator. Yesterday she moved KIOSK to the trash by mistake. Her team must be able to edit KIOSK issues again as soon as possible. What should she do?","zh":"Leilani 是 Tidewell Markets 公司 team-managed project KIOSK 的 project administrator，但不是 Jira administrator。昨天她不小心把 KIOSK 移到了 trash。她的團隊必須盡快恢復編輯 KIOSK 的 issue。她該怎麼做？","zo":["請 Jira administrator 從 Settings &gt; Projects &gt; Trash 還原 KIOSK","自己從 project 設定的 Details 頁還原 KIOSK","透過直接連結逐一開啟 KIOSK 的 issue，在那裡編輯","請 Jira administrator 從已封存 project 清單把 KIOSK 解除封存"],"fig":"","opts":["Ask a Jira administrator to restore KIOSK from Settings &gt; Projects &gt; Trash","Restore KIOSK herself from the Details page in its project settings","Open each KIOSK issue through its direct link and edit it there","Ask a Jira administrator to unarchive KIOSK from the archived projects list"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。Restore 需要 Administer Jira 全域權限，Jira admin 在 Settings → Projects → Trash 找到 KIOSK 按 Restore；還原後 project 回到目錄，issue 也能搜尋與編輯。","B":"錯。Project admin 能把 team-managed project 移到 trash，但還原要 Administer Jira 全域權限；Details 頁也沒有還原功能。","C":"錯。Trash 中的 project，issue 仍可透過直接連結開啟，但不能編輯；而且在基本與進階搜尋都找不到，要還原後才恢復正常。","D":"錯。Unarchive 是用在封存（Archive）的 project；KIOSK 是被移到 trash，不是封存，兩者是不同機制，要走 Trash 的 Restore。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>現行 UI 路徑是 Settings → Spaces → Trash。Trash 保留 60 天，期滿永久刪除。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/trash-for-jira-cloud-projects/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/restore-a-project-from-trash/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.1-e01","sec":"620.2.1","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"At Brightfield Logistics, two squads run parallel sprints on the company-managed Scrum board for project FLX. On Friday, Haruto, who has the Manage Sprints permission, opens Active sprints to close <b>Route Sprint 9</b>. Both active sprints are displayed together, and no <b>Complete sprint</b> button is visible. What is the most likely reason?","zh":"Brightfield Logistics 有兩個小組在 project FLX 的 company-managed Scrum board 上跑 parallel sprints。週五，擁有 Manage Sprints 權限的 Haruto 打開 Active sprints，要結束 <b>Route Sprint 9</b>。畫面上兩個 active sprint 一起顯示，而且看不到 <b>Complete sprint</b> 按鈕。最可能的原因是什麼？","zo":["他需要 Administer Jira 權限，因為開了 parallel sprints 之後，完成 sprint 需要這個權限","另一個 active sprint 比較早開始，parallel sprints 必須依照開始的順序完成","他還沒有在 Active sprints 畫面的 sprint 下拉選單選取 Route Sprint 9","必須先把 board 分成每個小組一條 swimlane，才能完成單一 sprint"],"fig":"","opts":["He needs the Administer Jira permission, because completing a sprint requires it once parallel sprints are enabled","The other active sprint started earlier, and parallel sprints must be completed in the order they were started","He has not yet selected Route Sprint 9 from the sprint drop-down on the Active sprints view","The board must first be grouped into one swimlane per squad before a single sprint can be completed"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。Administer Jira 是「開啟」parallel sprints 需要的權限；完成 sprint 只要 Jira admin 或 Manage Sprints 其一，Haruto 已經有了。","B":"錯。官方說每個 sprint 可以各自開始、各自完成，沒有「先開始的要先完成」這種順序限制。","C":"對。官方說 Active sprints 裡有多個 sprint 時，要先從 sprint 下拉選單選一個，Complete sprint 按鈕才會出現。常見誤解：以為可以一次把全部 active sprint 完成。","D":"錯。Swimlane 只是把卡片分列顯示的方式，跟 Complete sprint 按鈕出不出現無關；關鍵是先選 sprint。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/complete-a-sprint/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/use-parallel-sprints/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.1-e02","sec":"620.2.1","dom":"620.2","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Cobaltline's Mobile and Payments teams share one company-managed Scrum board and run parallel sprints from the same backlog. Their agile coach, Leilani, reviews the board's Velocity Chart after several sprints. Which two statements about the chart are true? (Choose two.)","zh":"Cobaltline 的 Mobile 與 Payments 兩個團隊共用一張 company-managed Scrum board，從同一個 backlog 跑 parallel sprints。敏捷教練 Leilani 在跑了幾個 sprint 之後查看這張 board 的 Velocity Chart。關於這張圖，哪兩個敘述正確？（選兩個）","zo":["同時進行的 sprint 會在該期間合併成一組長條","每個完成的 sprint 都各自顯示 Commitment 長條和 Completed 長條","只要團隊統一 sprint 名稱的前綴，Jira 就會分別顯示每個團隊的 velocity","Board 上有一個以上的 active sprint 時，Velocity Chart 就無法使用","這張圖假設兩個團隊估算工作的方式相同"],"fig":"","opts":["Sprints that ran at the same time are merged into one pair of bars for that period","Each completed sprint is shown with its own Commitment bar and Completed bar","Jira shows a separate velocity for each team when the teams prefix their sprint names consistently","The Velocity Chart becomes unavailable while the board has more than one active sprint","The chart assumes that both teams estimate their work in the same way"],"ans":"BE","why":{"A":"錯。Velocity Chart 是一個 sprint 一組長條，同時進行的 sprint 也各自一組，不會併成一組。","B":"對。官方說每個 sprint 都有灰色 Commitment 長條與綠色 Completed 長條，parallel sprints 也一樣。常見誤解：以為 parallel sprints 下不能按 sprint 分開看。","C":"錯。Sprint 名稱只是文字，Jira 不會依名稱前綴分組。官方明說 Velocity Chart 不會顯示每個團隊的 velocity。","D":"錯。開了 parallel sprints，Velocity Chart 照樣能用；它的限制是不分團隊，不是停用。","E":"對。官方列出的注意事項之一：目前的做法假設各團隊估算方式相同，但實務上不太可能。所以兩隊的點數會直接混在一起算。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/what-are-parallel-sprints/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-velocity-chart/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.1-e03","sec":"620.2.1","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. At Lumora Health, the Web and API teams share the company-managed Scrum board for project MED and run parallel sprints. The board has completed only these four sprints, and the exhibit lists all of them as they appear on the Velocity Chart, in story points. Tomasz, the Web team lead, asks what the chart reports as the velocity. Which statement is correct?","zh":"請看圖。Lumora Health 的 Web 與 API 兩個團隊共用 project MED 的 company-managed Scrum board，並跑 parallel sprints。這張 board 目前只完成過這四個 sprint，圖中列出它們在 Velocity Chart 上的數值，單位是 story point。Web 團隊負責人 Tomasz 問：這張圖顯示的 velocity 是多少？哪個敘述正確？","zo":["圖上顯示 23，因為它會依 sprint 名稱裡的團隊前綴分組","圖上顯示 30，也就是四個 sprint 不分團隊一起算的 Completed 平均，不是每個團隊各自的值","圖上顯示 38，因為它只用最近一個完成的 sprint","圖上顯示約 33，因為 velocity 是 Commitment 值的平均"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 174\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"MED Velocity Chart 數值\"><rect x=\"10\" y=\"8\" width=\"300\" height=\"158\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx plain\"/><text x=\"20\" y=\"28\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\">MED board – Velocity Chart</text><rect x=\"16\" y=\"39\" width=\"288\" height=\"22\" rx=\"5\" class=\"sf-gray\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Sprint</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Commitment</text><text x=\"296\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Completed</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"62\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"62\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Web S5</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"t\">25</text><text x=\"296\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"t\">22</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"86\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"86\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">API S5</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"t\">40</text><text x=\"296\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"t\">36</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"110\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"126\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Web S6</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"126\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"t\">24</text><text x=\"296\" y=\"126\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"t\">24</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"134\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"134\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"150\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">API S6</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"150\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"t\">42</text><text x=\"296\" y=\"150\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"t\">38</text></svg>","opts":["The chart reports 23, because it groups sprints by the team prefix in the sprint name","The chart reports 30, the average Completed value across all four sprints, not per team","The chart reports 38, because it uses only the most recently completed sprint","The chart reports about 33, because velocity is the average of the Commitment values"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。23 是 Web 兩個 sprint 的平均，但 Jira 不會依名稱前綴分團隊；要看單一團隊得自己另外算。","B":"對。Velocity 是圖上所有 sprint 的 Completed 平均，不分團隊、四個 sprint 一起平均：(22+36+24+38)÷4＝30。官方明說 parallel sprints 下不會顯示每個團隊的 velocity。","C":"錯。38 只是最後一個 sprint 的 Completed。Velocity 是最近幾個 sprint 的平均，不是只看最後一個。","D":"錯。約 33 是 Commitment 的平均。Velocity 算的是 Completed（綠色長條）的平均，不是開始時承諾的量。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/what-are-parallel-sprints/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-velocity-chart/"],"lvl":3,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.1-e04","sec":"620.2.1","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Nadia, a Jira administrator at Quillbrook, is preparing a short guide for teams that will use parallel sprints on company-managed Scrum boards. Which statement in her draft is NOT true?","zh":"Quillbrook 的 Jira administrator Nadia 正在為要在 company-managed Scrum board 使用 parallel sprints 的團隊寫一份簡短指南。她草稿裡哪一個敘述<b>不正確</b>？","zo":["開啟 parallel sprints 需要 Administer Jira 權限","每個平行的 sprint 都可以各自開始、各自完成","平行進行的 sprint 裡的 work item 來自同一個 backlog","一次 Complete sprint 動作就會結束 board 上所有 active sprint"],"fig":"","opts":["Turning on parallel sprints requires the Administer Jira permission","Each parallel sprint can be started and completed independently","The sprints running in parallel contain issues from the same backlog","One Complete sprint action closes every active sprint on the board"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"正確敘述（不選）。官方說開啟 parallel sprints 的流程需要 Administer Jira 權限，也就是 Jira admin 才能開。","B":"正確敘述（不選）。官方原意：兩個 sprint 都從同一個 backlog 拿工作，但每個 sprint 可以各自開始、各自完成。","C":"正確敘述（不選）。Parallel sprints 的定義就是從同一個 backlog 同時跑多個 active sprint，例如開發一個、設計一個。","D":"錯誤敘述（要選）。有多個 active sprint 時，必須先選一個 sprint，Complete sprint 按鈕才會出現，一次只能完成一個。常見誤解：以為可以一次全部完成。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>現行 UI 把 issue 叫 work item。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/use-parallel-sprints/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/complete-a-sprint/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.1-e05","sec":"620.2.1","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Kwame is the scrum master for the company-managed project HRB. When <b>Harbor 7</b> was completed, a story was accidentally moved to <b>Harbor 9</b>, a future sprint that has not started. <b>Harbor 8</b> is now active. Kwame has the Manage Sprints permission and wants the story back in Harbor 7. Parallel sprints are not enabled. What should be done?","zh":"Kwame 是 company-managed project HRB 的 scrum master。<b>Harbor 7</b> 完成時，一張 story 不小心被移到還沒開始的未來 sprint <b>Harbor 9</b>。現在 <b>Harbor 8</b> 正在進行。Kwame 有 Manage Sprints 權限，想把這張 story 放回 Harbor 7。目前沒有開啟 parallel sprints。應該怎麼做？","zo":["Kwame 立刻從 Sprint Report 重新開啟 Harbor 7，因為已完成的 sprint 不算 active sprint","由 Jira administrator 開啟 parallel sprints，接著 Kwame 重新開啟 Harbor 7，再把 story 移回去","Kwame 在 Project settings &gt; Features 為 HRB 開啟 parallel sprints，再重新開啟 Harbor 7","Kwame 在 backlog 把 story 從 Harbor 9 拖到 Harbor 7，已完成的 sprint 會一直列在那裡"],"fig":"","opts":["Kwame reopens Harbor 7 from the Sprint Report right away, because a completed sprint does not count as an active sprint","A Jira administrator enables parallel sprints; Kwame then reopens Harbor 7 and moves the story back","Kwame enables parallel sprints for HRB in Project settings &gt; Features, and then reopens Harbor 7","Kwame drags the story from Harbor 9 onto Harbor 7 in the backlog, where completed sprints stay listed"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。官方說：已經有其他 sprint 在進行時，要先開啟 parallel sprints，才能重新開啟已完成的 sprint。Harbor 8 正在跑，所以不能直接開。","B":"對。重新開啟 sprint 要 Manage Sprints 或 Jira admin，在 Sprint Report 選 sprint 操作；但 Harbor 8 還在跑，所以要先由 Jira admin 開 parallel sprints。","C":"錯。CMP 的 parallel sprints 開關在全站的 Jira configuration，需要 Administer Jira；Project settings 的 Features 沒有這個開關，scrum master 也開不了。","D":"錯。官方說要把 work item 移回已關閉的原 sprint，必須先重新開啟那個 sprint，不能直接拖回已完成的 sprint。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/use-parallel-sprints/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/reopen-a-sprint/"],"lvl":3,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.1-e06","sec":"620.2.1","dom":"620.2","type":"multi","n":3,"stem":"Imani runs parallel sprints on the company-managed board for project KST. She is completing <b>Kestrel Sprint 3</b> while <b>Falcon Sprint 3</b> is still active, and four issues are incomplete. Which destinations can she choose for these issues in the Complete sprint dialog? (Choose three.)","zh":"Imani 在 project KST 的 company-managed board 上跑 parallel sprints。她正在完成 <b>Kestrel Sprint 3</b>，而 <b>Falcon Sprint 3</b> 還在進行，有四個 work item 沒有完成。在 Complete sprint 對話框裡，她可以把這些 work item 移到哪些地方？（選三個）","zo":["Backlog","另一個 active sprint：Falcon Sprint 3","一個已經存在的未來 sprint","在對話框裡建立的新 sprint","這個 project 下一個尚未 release 的 version","Kestrel Sprint 3，讓它們留在已完成的 sprint"],"fig":"","opts":["The backlog","Falcon Sprint 3, the other active sprint","A future sprint that already exists","A new sprint created from the dialog","The next unreleased version of the project","Kestrel Sprint 3, so that they stay in the completed sprint"],"ans":"ACD","why":{"A":"對。Backlog 是 Complete sprint 對話框的三個去處之一。之後若要放進另一個 active sprint，也要先回 backlog 再加進去。","B":"錯。官方說未完成的 work item 不能直接移到另一個 active sprint，要先移到 backlog，再加進那個 active sprint。","C":"對。官方列出的去處之一是 any future sprint，也就是已經建好、但還沒開始的 sprint；Falcon Sprint 3 已經開始，所以不在這個清單裡。","D":"對。官方列出的去處之一是 New sprint：直接在對話框建立新的 sprint 並把未完成的工作移進去；新 sprint 建好時還沒開始，之後再另外開始。","E":"錯。Version 是 release 用的欄位，不是 sprint 的去處；Complete sprint 對話框只有 backlog、未來 sprint、新 sprint。","F":"錯。未完成的 work item 一定要移出已完成的 sprint；只有完成的工作會留在那個 sprint 的紀錄裡。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>現行 UI 把 issue 叫 work item。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/complete-a-sprint/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/complete-parallel-sprints/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.1-e07","sec":"620.2.1","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. Olumide is the project administrator of the company-managed project SKY. Two teams share its Scrum board, and he cannot start a second sprint while <b>Sprint 14</b> is in progress. His colleague found the settings page shown in the exhibit. Which statement is correct?","zh":"請看圖。Olumide 是 company-managed project SKY 的 project administrator。兩個團隊共用這個 project 的 Scrum board，而 <b>Sprint 14</b> 進行中時，他無法開始第二個 sprint。圖中是同事找到的設定頁面。哪個敘述正確？","zo":["只有具備 Administer Jira 權限的使用者能打開這個開關；打開後，board 就能同時有多個 active sprint","Olumide 可以只為 project SKY 打開這個開關，站上其他 project 不受影響","開關打開後，每位 board administrator 還要在 Board settings 開啟 parallel sprints，才能開始第二個 sprint","打開這個開關後，Velocity Chart 會分別顯示兩個團隊各自的 velocity"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 161\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Jira configuration\"><rect x=\"0.5\" y=\"0.5\" width=\"379\" height=\"160\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"380\" height=\"34\" rx=\"0\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Settings &gt; Jira apps</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Jira configuration</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Parallel sprints for company-managed spaces</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"95\" width=\"34\" height=\"18\" rx=\"9\" class=\"fl-gray\"/><circle cx=\"21\" cy=\"104\" r=\"6.5\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><text x=\"54\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Off</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"136\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s tf-violet\" style=\"font-weight:700\">Run several active sprints at once</text></svg>","opts":["Only a user with the Administer Jira permission can turn on this toggle; the board can then have multiple active sprints","Olumide can turn on this toggle for project SKY only, and other projects on the site are not affected","After the toggle is on, each board administrator must also enable parallel sprints in Board settings before a second sprint can start","After this toggle is turned on, the Velocity Chart will show a separate velocity for each of the two teams"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。這頁在 Settings &gt; Jira apps &gt; Jira configuration，官方說這個流程需要 Administer Jira。開了之後，同一個 backlog 就能同時有多個 active sprint。","B":"錯。Jira configuration 是全站設定，不是 project 設定；project admin 沒有 Administer Jira，打不開這個開關。","C":"錯。這個開關打開後就對全站的 company-managed board 生效；Board settings 裡沒有 parallel sprints 的開關，不需要再開第二次。","D":"錯。開了 parallel sprints 之後，Velocity Chart 仍然不會顯示每個團隊的 velocity，這是官方列出的限制。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>現行 UI 把 project 叫 space，所以開關名稱寫成 Parallel sprints for company-managed spaces。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/use-parallel-sprints/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/enable-jira-software-features/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/what-are-parallel-sprints/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.1-e08","sec":"620.2.1","dom":"620.2","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Sofía manages a company-managed Kanban board for a facilities team that handles requests continuously without sprints. She wants reports that show how long issues take and where work piles up. Which two reports can her board provide? (Choose two.)","zh":"Sofía 管理一張 company-managed Kanban board，屬於一個總務團隊，團隊隨時接件、不跑 sprint。她想要能看出 work item 要花多久、以及工作卡在哪裡的報表。她的 board 能提供哪兩種報表？（選兩個）","zo":["Velocity Chart","Sprint Report","Control Chart","Burndown Chart","Cumulative Flow Diagram"],"fig":"","opts":["Velocity Chart","Sprint Report","Control Chart","Burndown Chart","Cumulative Flow Diagram"],"ans":"CE","why":{"A":"錯。Velocity Chart 只有 Scrum template 才有，算的是每個 sprint 完成的量；沒有 sprint 的 Kanban board 用不到。","B":"錯。Sprint Report 官方寫明只適用 Scrum board，Kanban board 沒有 sprint 可以報告。","C":"對。Control Chart 顯示 work item 的 cycle time 或 lead time。官方還特別提到 Kanban 團隊可以用過去的表現來訂目標。","D":"錯。Burndown Chart 官方寫明只適用 Scrum board，因為它追蹤的是 sprint 剩下多少工作。","E":"對。Cumulative Flow Diagram 按 status 顯示各欄的 work item 數量，某一塊越來越寬就代表那一欄是瓶頸，Kanban board 也能用。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>現行 UI 把 issue 叫 work item。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-control-chart/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-cumulative-flow-diagram/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-sprint-report/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-burndown-chart/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-velocity-chart/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.1-e09","sec":"620.2.1","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Arjun is the board administrator of a company-managed Kanban board for a content team. The first column holds more than 200 ideas, and the team finds it hard to focus on work in progress. Planners want a separate list view to rank and split those ideas, but the team does not want to start using sprints. What should Arjun do?","zh":"Arjun 是某內容團隊 company-managed Kanban board 的 board administrator。第一欄堆了 200 多個點子，團隊很難專心處理進行中的工作。規劃人員想要一個獨立的清單畫面來排序和拆分這些點子，但團隊不想開始使用 sprint。Arjun 該怎麼做？","zo":["用同一份 saved filter 建一張 Scrum board，讓點子出現在它的 backlog","把 <b>Hide completed issues older than</b> 設成 1 週，讓第一欄變短","加一個 quick filter，讓團隊成員看不到第一欄的 work item","在 Board settings &gt; Columns，把 Backlog 之類的 status 拖到 Kanban backlog 面板上"],"fig":"","opts":["Create a Scrum board from the same saved filter so that the ideas appear in its backlog","Set <b>Hide completed issues older than</b> to 1 week to shorten the first column","Add a quick filter that hides issues in the first column from team members","In Board settings &gt; Columns, drag a status such as Backlog onto the Kanban backlog panel"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。另建 Scrum board 雖然有 backlog 畫面可以排序，但原本 Kanban board 第一欄的 200 多個點子一張都沒少，團隊還是無法專心處理進行中的工作。","B":"錯。這個設定只會藏掉 Done 欄裡超過指定週數的已完成工作，第一欄那些還沒開始的點子不受影響。","C":"錯。Quick filter 只是暫時篩選畫面，點子還是留在 board 上，而且規劃人員也拿不到獨立的清單畫面來排序、拆分。","D":"對。把 status 拖進 Kanban backlog 面板就開啟 Kanban backlog，得到獨立的 Backlog 畫面，可以排 rank、split work item，團隊在 board 上只看進行中的工作。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>現行 UI 把 issue 叫 work item，所以這個設定現在叫 Hide completed work items older than。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-columns/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/use-your-kanban-backlog/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.1-e10","sec":"620.2.1","dom":"620.2","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. Mateus, a board administrator, saved this column configuration on the company-managed Kanban board for project OPS. Which two statements about the board are true? (Choose two.)","zh":"請看圖。Board administrator Mateus 在 project OPS 的 company-managed Kanban board 上儲存了這個欄位設定。關於這張 board，哪兩個敘述正確？（選兩個）","zo":["Backlog 畫面會把 work item 分成 Backlog 段和 Ready 段顯示","這張 board 已經變成「Kanban with backlog」這種 board 類型，所以團隊現在可以開始 sprint","Backlog status 的 work item 在 board 和 Backlog 畫面上都看不到","只有 Jira administrator 才能把 Backlog status 移到 Kanban backlog 面板上","規劃人員可以在 Backlog 畫面 split work item，這在 Kanban board 上做不到"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 216\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Columns\"><rect x=\"0.5\" y=\"0.5\" width=\"379\" height=\"215\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"380\" height=\"34\" rx=\"0\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Board settings</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Columns</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"78\" width=\"84\" height=\"66\" rx=\"7\" class=\"bx amber\"/><text x=\"18\" y=\"93\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:11.5px\">Kanban bac…</text><rect x=\"17\" y=\"114\" width=\"74\" height=\"18\" rx=\"4\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"127\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Backlog</text><rect x=\"102\" y=\"78\" width=\"84\" height=\"66\" rx=\"7\" class=\"bx plain\"/><text x=\"108\" y=\"93\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:11.5px\">Ready</text><rect x=\"108\" y=\"114\" width=\"74\" height=\"18\" rx=\"4\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><text x=\"112\" y=\"127\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Ready</text><rect x=\"193\" y=\"78\" width=\"84\" height=\"88\" rx=\"7\" class=\"bx brand\"/><text x=\"199\" y=\"93\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:11.5px\">In Progress</text><rect x=\"198\" y=\"114\" width=\"74\" height=\"18\" rx=\"4\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><text x=\"203\" y=\"127\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Building</text><rect x=\"198\" y=\"136\" width=\"74\" height=\"18\" rx=\"4\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><text x=\"203\" y=\"149\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">In Review</text><rect x=\"284\" y=\"78\" width=\"84\" height=\"66\" rx=\"7\" class=\"bx green\"/><text x=\"290\" y=\"93\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:11.5px\">Done</text><rect x=\"288\" y=\"114\" width=\"74\" height=\"18\" rx=\"4\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><text x=\"294\" y=\"127\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Done</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"191\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s tf-amber\" style=\"font-weight:700\">Amber panel = Kanban backlog</text></svg>","opts":["The Backlog view shows issues in a Backlog section and in a Ready section","The board has become a Kanban with backlog board type, so the team can now start sprints","Issues in the Backlog status are hidden from both the board and the Backlog view","Only a Jira administrator could have moved the Backlog status onto the Kanban backlog panel","Planners can split an issue in the Backlog view, which they cannot do from the Kanban board"],"ans":"AE","why":{"A":"對。官方說 Kanban backlog 會同時顯示 Backlog 段與下一欄（這裡叫 Ready）的一段，方便把工作從一段拖到另一段。","B":"錯。Kanban with backlog 不是另一種 board 類型，只是開了 Kanban backlog 的 Kanban board；Kanban board 不能開始 sprint。","C":"錯。Backlog status 已經對到 Kanban backlog 欄，不是 unmapped。它的 work item 會離開 board，但會出現在 Backlog 畫面。","D":"錯。官方說 Jira administrator 或這張 board 的 board administrator 都能開啟 Kanban backlog，不限 Jira admin。","E":"對。官方說 split work item 只能在 Kanban backlog 做，不能在 Kanban board 上做。這也是開 Kanban backlog 的好處之一。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>現行 UI 把 issue 叫 work item。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-columns/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/use-your-kanban-backlog/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.1-e11","sec":"620.2.1","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Chioma leads a team-managed software project, NOVA. A second team wants its own board that shows only the NOVA issues labeled <code>backend</code>. What should Chioma do?","zh":"Chioma 負責一個 team-managed software project NOVA。第二個團隊想要一張自己的 board，只顯示 NOVA 裡標了 <code>backend</code> label 的 work item。Chioma 該怎麼做？","zo":["為這些 work item 存一個 filter，再用這個 saved filter 建 board","把游標移到側邊欄的 NOVA 上，按加號圖示，再選 Create board","在 Project settings &gt; Features 打開 Boards 功能，為 NOVA 增加第二張 board","先把 NOVA 改成 company-managed project，因為 team-managed project 永遠只能有一張 board"],"fig":"","opts":["Save a filter for those issues, and then create a board from that saved filter","Hover over NOVA in the sidebar, select the plus icon, and then select Create board","Turn on a Boards feature in Project settings &gt; Features to add a second board to NOVA","Change NOVA to a company-managed project first, because a team-managed project can only ever show one board"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。官方說 team-managed project 要建額外的 board，唯一的方法就是從 saved filter 建。建出來的是 company-managed board。","B":"錯。側邊欄專案名稱旁的加號建 board，官方寫的是 company-managed software space 的做法；TMP 不支援在 project 內直接建額外 board。","C":"錯。Features 是開關 Sprints 這類功能的地方。官方明說 TMP 不支援在 project 內直接建額外 board，要靠 saved filter。","D":"錯。不必轉成 company-managed。用 saved filter 建 board 就能讓 TMP 的工作出現在第二張 board 上。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>現行 UI 把 issue 叫 work item。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/create-a-board-based-on-filters/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.1-e12","sec":"620.2.1","dom":"620.2","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Rafael's team-managed project PIXL has the Sprints feature turned on. New team members are confused about how the board behaves. Which two statements are true? (Choose two.)","zh":"Rafael 的 team-managed project PIXL 開啟了 Sprints 功能。新成員搞不懂這張 board 的運作方式。哪兩個敘述正確？（選兩個）","zo":["可以直接在 board 的任何一欄建立 work item，再移進 sprint","Sprint 開始之前，board 不會顯示任何 work item","Done 欄的 work item 到達 Done 14 天後會從 board 移除","新的 work item 要在 backlog 建立，再加進 sprint","Sprint 完成時，Done 欄的 work item 會回到 backlog"],"fig":"","opts":["Issues can be created directly in any board column and then moved into the sprint","The board shows no issues until a sprint is started","Issues in the Done column are removed from the board 14 days after they reach Done","New issues are created in the backlog and then added to the sprint","When the sprint is completed, issues in the Done column return to the backlog"],"ans":"BD","why":{"A":"錯。官方說開了 Sprints 之後，不能直接在 board 上建 work item，只能在 backlog 建，再加進 sprint。","B":"對。官方說開了 Sprints 的 TMP，board 要等 sprint 開始才會顯示 work item。常見誤解：以為 board 空白是權限或 filter 出問題。","C":"錯。14 天自動清除只適用沒開 Sprints 的 TMP；開了 Sprints，Done 的工作是在完成 sprint 時才從 board 清掉。","D":"對。官方說開了 Sprints 時只能在 backlog 建 work item，再把它加進 sprint；board 本身不提供建立入口。","E":"錯。完成 sprint 時，最右欄的工作會從 board 清掉，而且官方明說不會回到 backlog。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>現行 UI 把 issue 叫 work item。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/get-started-with-team-managed-projects/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/what-is-a-jira-software-board/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.1-e13","sec":"620.2.1","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Ifeoma's product team commits to a set of stories every two weeks. Before each planning meeting, she wants to forecast how much work the team can take on, based on what it completed in past iterations. Which board type and report should the team use?","zh":"Ifeoma 的產品團隊每兩週承諾一批 story。每次規劃會議前，她想根據團隊過去幾期完成的量，預測這次能接多少工作。團隊應該用哪種 board 和哪張報表？","zo":["開啟 Kanban backlog 的 Kanban board，搭配 Velocity Chart","Kanban board，搭配 Control Chart","Scrum board，搭配 Velocity Chart","Kanban board，搭配 Cumulative Flow Diagram"],"fig":"","opts":["A Kanban board with the Kanban backlog enabled, and the Velocity Chart","A Kanban board, and the Control Chart","A Scrum board, and the Velocity Chart","A Kanban board, and the Cumulative Flow Diagram"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。開了 Kanban backlog 仍然是 Kanban board，沒有 sprint；Velocity Chart 只有 Scrum template 才有。","B":"錯。Control Chart 看的是 cycle time，也就是單件工作花多久，不是每期能完成多少量，無法用來規劃下一期的承諾。","C":"對。固定週期承諾一批工作就是 Scrum。Velocity Chart 追蹤每個 sprint 的承諾與完成量，取平均來預測下一個 sprint 能做多少。","D":"錯。CFD 顯示各 status 的工作量隨時間變化，用來找瓶頸，不是用來預測每期能完成多少。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-velocity-chart/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-control-chart/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.2-e01","sec":"620.2.2","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"At Harborline Freight, the CORE Scrum board uses the saved filter <b>Core delivery</b>, which Dana created and owns. Dana has not given anyone else permission to edit it. Mei, a team lead, copies the CORE board for a new squad. She now wants to add <code>AND labels = squad-b</code> to the new board's filter query. What happens when she edits the filter query from the new board's settings?","zh":"Harborline Freight 的 CORE Scrum board 使用 saved filter <b>Core delivery</b>，這份 filter 是 Dana 建立的，owner 也是她。Dana 沒有給任何人編輯權。Mei 是一位 team lead，她替新小組複製（Copy）了 CORE board，現在想在新 board 的 filter 查詢加上 <code>AND labels = squad-b</code>。她從新 board 的設定編輯 filter 查詢時，會發生什麼事？","zo":["她的變更會存進 <b>Core delivery</b>，而且只影響新 board","Jira 會自動把她的變更存到替新 board 另備的一份 filter 副本","她無法把變更存回 <b>Core delivery</b>，只能用 <b>Save as</b> 把查詢存成一份新的 filter","在她也被加為 CORE board 的 administrator 之前，她的變更會被擋下"],"fig":"","opts":["Her change is saved to <b>Core delivery</b> and affects only the new board","Jira automatically saves her change to a separate copy of the filter for the new board","She cannot save the change to <b>Core delivery</b>; she can only use <b>Save as</b> to save her query as a new filter","Her change is blocked until she is also added as an administrator of the CORE board"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。副本沿用同一份 Core delivery，就算改得動也會兩塊 board 一起變；何況她不是 filter 的建立者，根本存不回去。","B":"錯。常見誤解：Copy board 會替副本另備一份 filter。Jira 不會自動另存，要不要分開得由她自己 Save as。","C":"對。官方說不是 filter 原建立者時只能 Save as。Mei 雖然是新 board 的 administrator，filter 仍是 Dana 的，副本沿用的就是這一份。","D":"錯。Board admin 管的是 board 設定，不給 filter 編輯權；當上 CORE 的 admin 也改不動 Dana 的 filter。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/edit-a-board-filter-on-a-company-managed-board/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/copy-an-existing-board/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.2-e02","sec":"620.2.2","dom":"620.2","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Rafael copied the company-managed Scrum board of project SHOP so that his checkout squad could have its own board. The copy should show only issues with the label <code>checkout</code>, and the original board must keep showing everything it shows today. The board filter is owned by Beatriz, who has not granted Rafael edit rights. Which two actions should Rafael take? (Choose two.)","zh":"Rafael 複製了 project SHOP 的 company-managed Scrum board，讓他的結帳小組有自己的 board。副本只該顯示帶有 <code>checkout</code> label 的 issue，而原本的 board 必須維持現在顯示的全部內容。這份 board filter 的 owner 是 Beatriz，她沒有給 Rafael 編輯權。Rafael 應該做哪兩件事？（選兩個）","zo":["請 Jira administrator 把現有 filter 的 ownership 轉給他，然後在上面加 label 條件","從副本的 Board settings 編輯 filter 查詢，再用 <b>Save as</b> 存成一份新的 filter","把副本的 Location 改成他的個人 profile，讓它的 filter 與原 board 分開","再複製一次 board，並選擇替新 board 建立獨立 filter 的選項","在副本 General 設定的 Saved Filter 欄位選擇新的 filter"],"fig":"","opts":["Ask a Jira administrator to transfer ownership of the existing filter to him, then add the label condition to it","Edit the filter query from the copy's Board settings and use <b>Save as</b> to save it as a new filter","Change the copy's Location to his personal profile so that its filter is separated from the original board","Copy the board again and choose the option that creates a separate filter for the new board","Select the new filter in the Saved Filter field of the copy's General settings"],"ans":"BE","why":{"A":"錯。就算 Jira admin 把 ownership 轉給他，改的還是兩塊 board 共用的那一份 filter，原 board 也會一起被縮小，違反題目要求。","B":"對。不是 filter 的原建立者時，改完查詢只能 Save as 存成新名字的新 filter。這樣原 filter 不動，原 board 也不受影響。","C":"錯。Location 只決定 board 掛在哪個 project 或個人 profile、由誰管理，不會影響 board 用哪一份 filter 或顯示哪些 issue。","D":"錯。常見誤解：Copy board ≠ Copy filter。官方的 Copy 沒有「另建 filter」選項，副本一律沿用原 board 的同一份 filter。","E":"對。新 filter 存好後，要在副本 General 設定的 Saved Filter 改選它，副本才和原 board 脫鉤；原 board 仍用原本那份。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/edit-a-board-filter-on-a-company-managed-board/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/change-board-filters-for-a-company-managed-board/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/copy-an-existing-board/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.2-e03","sec":"620.2.2","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. Tomás copied the <b>Checkout board</b> at Quillstone Retail. The exhibit shows the General settings of the new board. Tomás did not change anything after copying. Who can open the new board?","zh":"請看附圖。Tomás 在 Quillstone Retail 複製了 <b>Checkout board</b>。附圖是新 board 的 General 設定。Tomás 複製後沒有改任何東西。誰能打開這塊新 board？","zo":["只有 Tomás，直到他在 board settings 把新 board 分享給團隊為止","在 board 的 location（project CHK）擁有 Browse Projects 權限的任何人","只有新 board 的 Administrators 欄位裡列出的使用者","能檢視 <b>Filter for Checkout board</b> 的使用者，也就是和原 board 相同的一群人"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 454\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"General\"><rect x=\"0.5\" y=\"0.5\" width=\"379\" height=\"453\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"380\" height=\"34\" rx=\"0\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"34\" width=\"106\" height=\"420\" rx=\"0\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><line x1=\"106\" y1=\"34\" x2=\"106\" y2=\"454\" class=\"gl\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Board settings</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">General</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Board name</text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"95\" width=\"250\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"128\" y=\"113\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Checkout board (copy)</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"144\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Administrators</text><line x1=\"118\" y1=\"174\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"174\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"118\" y=\"166\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Tomás Herrera</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"166\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">user</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"195\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Location</text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"201\" width=\"250\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"128\" y=\"219\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Checkout (CHK)</text><path d=\"M350,212 l5,5 l5,-5\" class=\"ln ink\" style=\"stroke-width:1.6\"/><text x=\"118\" y=\"250\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Saved Filter</text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"256\" width=\"250\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx brand\"/><text x=\"128\" y=\"274\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Filter for Checkout board</text><path d=\"M350,267 l5,5 l5,-5\" class=\"ln ink\" style=\"stroke-width:1.6\"/><text x=\"118\" y=\"305\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Filter details</text><line x1=\"118\" y1=\"335\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"335\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"118\" y=\"327\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Owner</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"327\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Nadia Rahman</text><line x1=\"118\" y1=\"361\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"361\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"118\" y=\"353\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Shared with</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"353\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Group: checkout-squad</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"382\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Filter query</text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"388\" width=\"250\" height=\"44\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"126\" y=\"406\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t mono\" style=\"font-size:11px\">project in (CHK, PAY)</text><text x=\"126\" y=\"422\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t mono\" style=\"font-size:11px\">ORDER BY Rank ASC</text><rect x=\"6\" y=\"39\" width=\"94\" height=\"22\" rx=\"6\" class=\"sf-brand\"/><text x=\"14\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">General</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"80\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Columns</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"106\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Swimlanes</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"132\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Quick filters</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"158\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Card colors</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"184\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Card layout</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"210\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Estimation</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"236\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Working days</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"262\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Issue detail</text></svg>","opts":["Only Tomás, until he shares the new board with his team from its board settings","Anyone who has the Browse Projects permission in project CHK, the board's location","Only the users listed in the Administrators field of the new board","Users who can view <b>Filter for Checkout board</b>, the same audience as the original board"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。Board 本身沒有獨立的分享設定；官方說要讓不同的人看到 board，只能改 filter 的分享或換一份 filter。","B":"錯。附圖的 filter 只分享給 checkout-squad；Location 只管 board 掛哪，CHK 的 Browse Projects 看不到這份 filter。","C":"錯。Administrators 欄位決定誰能改這塊 board 的設定，不是誰能看；能看 filter 的一般使用者也打得開 board。","D":"對。副本沿用同一份 filter，board 對看得到該 filter 的人開放，所以觀眾和原 board 相同；卡片另需各 project 的 Browse Projects。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/copy-an-existing-board/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-a-company-managed-board/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/create-a-board-based-on-filters/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.2-e04","sec":"620.2.2","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Oluwaseun is preparing a short guide on copying boards for the project administrators at Pinewave Media. Which statement about copying a company-managed board is NOT true?","zh":"Oluwaseun 正在替 Pinewave Media 的 project administrator 們寫一份複製 board 的簡短指南。關於複製 company-managed board，哪一個敘述<b>不</b>正確？","zo":["Jira 會把原 board 的 filter 複製一份，owner 是執行複製的人","執行複製的人會成為新 board 的 administrator","如果 board 的 filter 不是複製者建立的，複製者可能無法編輯那份 filter","新 board 以原 board 同一份 issue filter 為基礎"],"fig":"","opts":["Jira creates a duplicate of the original board's filter, owned by the person who copies the board","The person who copies the board becomes an administrator of the new board","If the copier did not create the board's filter, the copier might not be able to edit that filter","The new board is based on the same issue filter as the original board"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"錯誤敘述（要選）。常見誤解：Copy board 會順便 copy filter。官方說副本以原 board 同一份 filter 為基礎，不會替複製的人另建一份 filter。","B":"正確敘述（不選）。官方明說執行複製的人會成為新 board 的 administrator，可以改這塊新 board 的設定。","C":"正確敘述（不選）。官方提醒：filter 若不是複製者建立的，他可能改不動它；這正是因為副本沿用原本那一份 filter。","D":"正確敘述（不選）。官方原意：新 board 以原 board 同一份 issue filter 為基礎，所以一開始兩塊 board 的資料範圍完全相同。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/copy-an-existing-board/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.2-e05","sec":"620.2.2","dom":"620.2","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"At Sunmesa Games, Wen owns the saved filter <b>Growth work</b>, which ends with <code>ORDER BY priority DESC</code> and is used by the <b>Growth Kanban</b> board. Wen copies that board to create <b>Growth Lab</b> for a new team. In the board configuration of Growth Lab, she then selects <b>Add Rank</b>. Which two statements describe the result? (Choose two.)","zh":"在 Sunmesa Games，Wen 是 saved filter <b>Growth work</b> 的 owner，這份 filter 的結尾是 <code>ORDER BY priority DESC</code>，由 <b>Growth Kanban</b> board 使用。Wen 複製這塊 board，替新團隊建立 <b>Growth Lab</b>。接著她在 Growth Lab 的 board 設定裡選了 <b>Add Rank</b>。哪兩個敘述描述了結果？（選兩個）","zo":["<b>Growth work</b> filter 被更新為依 Rank 排序","Jira 會先替 Growth Lab 另存一份 filter，所以只有 Growth Lab 會改變","只有 Growth Lab 的 backlog 重新排序，filter 查詢本身不會改變","Growth Kanban 也會受影響，因為它和 Growth Lab 使用同一份 filter","這個變更會被擋下，直到 Jira administrator 核准複製出來的 board"],"fig":"","opts":["The <b>Growth work</b> filter is updated to order by Rank","Jira first saves a separate filter for Growth Lab, so only Growth Lab changes","Only the backlog of Growth Lab is reordered; the filter query itself is not changed","Growth Kanban is also affected, because it uses the same filter as Growth Lab","The change is blocked until a Jira administrator approves it for the copied board"],"ans":"AD","why":{"A":"對。官方說選 Add Rank 後，board 的 filter 會被更新成依 Rank 排序（<code>ORDER BY Rank ASC</code>）。改的是 filter 本身，不是只改畫面排序。","B":"錯。Add Rank 不會另存新 filter；而且副本沿用原 board 的同一份 filter，要分開必須自己先 Save as 新 filter 再指定給副本。","C":"錯。Add Rank 的做法就是改 filter 的 ORDER BY 子句，讓 filter 依 Rank 排序；它不是只重排某一塊 board 的 backlog 畫面。","D":"對。官方提醒這個變更會影響所有使用這份 filter 的 board。常見誤解：以為副本有自己的 filter；其實 Copy board 沿用同一份，原 board 會一起變。","E":"錯。Jira 沒有核准複製 board 設定的流程；Wen 是新 board 的 admin 兼 filter owner，可直接 Add Rank。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/enable-ranking/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/copy-an-existing-board/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.2-e06","sec":"620.2.2","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Three weeks ago, Farida copied the <b>Retail App</b> board so her new squad could have its own board. Today, Sven, who owns the board's filter, edited the filter query on the Retail App board to exclude issues in the <b>Legacy</b> component. Farida's squad now reports that Legacy issues have disappeared from their board too. What is the most likely cause?","zh":"三週前，Farida 複製了 <b>Retail App</b> board，讓她的新小組有自己的 board。今天，這塊 board filter 的 owner Sven 在 Retail App board 上編輯 filter 查詢，排除 <b>Legacy</b> component 的 issue。Farida 的小組回報說，他們 board 上的 Legacy issue 也不見了。最可能的原因是什麼？","zo":["Farida 的 board 有一個 sub-filter，會繼承原 board filter 查詢的變更","Farida 的 board 和 Retail App board 掛在同一個 project，所以繼承了那塊 board 的設定","兩塊 board 使用同一份 saved filter，因為複製 board 不會建立新的 filter","Sven 的編輯替 Legacy 的 issue 套用了 issue security level，讓 Farida 的小組看不到"],"fig":"","opts":["Farida's board has a sub-filter that inherits changes from the original board's filter query","Farida's board is located in the same project as the Retail App board, so it inherits that board's settings","Both boards use the same saved filter, because copying a board does not create a new filter","Sven's edit applied an issue security level to the Legacy issues, hiding them from Farida's squad"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。Sub-filter 是單一 Kanban board 自己的額外篩選，不會繼承別塊 board 的變化；兩塊一起變是因為共用 filter。","B":"錯。Location 只決定 board 掛在哪裡、哪個 project admin 能管，不會讓一塊 board 繼承另一塊 board 的設定或資料範圍。","C":"對。Copy board 讓新 board 以同一份 filter 為基礎，所以 Sven 改 filter，兩塊 board 都跟著變。常見誤解：以為複製後兩塊 board 就互不相干。","D":"錯。Issue security level 能讓人看不到 issue，但它設在 issue 上；編輯 filter 查詢不會改 security level。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/copy-an-existing-board/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/edit-a-board-filter-on-a-company-managed-board/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.2-e07","sec":"620.2.2","dom":"620.2","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Leon is a team lead at Corvid Labs. He has the Browse Projects permission in the company-managed projects DATA and ML and wants one Kanban board that shows issues from both projects. Which two methods can he use? (Choose two.)","zh":"Leon 是 Corvid Labs 的 team lead。他在 company-managed project DATA 和 ML 都有 Browse Projects 權限，想要一塊同時顯示兩個 project issue 的 Kanban board。他可以用哪兩種方法？（選兩個）","zo":["打開既有 DATA board 的 board settings，把 ML 加進它的 Location 欄位","請 Jira administrator 在全域 Jira 設定裡開啟跨 project board","建立一塊以既有 project 為基礎的 Kanban board，並同時選擇 DATA 和 ML","在 ML 的 project settings 裡把 ML project 連結到 DATA board","用一份查詢同時包含 DATA 和 ML 的既有 saved filter 建立 board"],"fig":"","opts":["Open the board settings of the existing DATA board and add ML to its Location field","Ask a Jira administrator to turn on cross-project boards in the global Jira settings","Create a Kanban board based on existing projects and select both DATA and ML","Link the ML project to the DATA board from the ML project settings","Create a board from an existing saved filter whose query includes both DATA and ML"],"ans":"CE","why":{"A":"錯。Location 只能指定一個 project 或個人 profile，決定 board 掛在哪裡；它不決定 board 顯示哪些 issue。","B":"錯。Jira 沒有「開啟跨 project board」這種全域開關；board 顯示什麼完全由它的 filter 決定。","C":"對。官方說建立 board 時可以選擇以一個或多個既有 project 為基礎，需要這些 project 的 Browse Projects。Jira 會替 board 建好對應的 filter。","D":"錯。Project settings 裡沒有把 project「連結」到別人 board 的功能；要讓 board 包含 ML，得改 board 用的 filter。","E":"對。官方說可以用既有 saved filter 建立顯示多個 project 的 board；只要 filter 查詢含 DATA 和 ML。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/create-a-board-based-on-filters/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/create-a-kanban-board-based-on-projects/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.2-e08","sec":"620.2.2","dom":"620.2","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Ines works on a company-managed Scrum board whose filter is <code>project in (PAY, LEDG) ORDER BY Rank ASC</code>. Ranking is enabled. She can drag PAY cards up and down the backlog, but she cannot re-rank any LEDG cards, even though she can see them. Which two permissions must she have in project LEDG to rank those issues? (Choose two.)","zh":"Ines 使用一塊 company-managed Scrum board，它的 filter 是 <code>project in (PAY, LEDG) ORDER BY Rank ASC</code>，而且已經啟用 ranking。她可以在 backlog 裡上下拖曳 PAY 的卡片，卻無法重新排序任何 LEDG 的卡片，雖然她看得到那些卡片。她在 project LEDG 必須有哪兩個權限，才能 rank 這些 issue？（選兩個）","zo":["Manage Sprints","Schedule Issues","Transition Issues","Edit Issues","Administer Projects","Assign Issues"],"fig":"","opts":["Manage Sprints","Schedule Issues","Transition Issues","Edit Issues","Administer Projects","Assign Issues"],"ans":"BD","why":{"A":"錯。Manage Sprints 是建立、開始、完成 sprint 用的；它本身不允許調整 sprint 裡的工作，也不是 rank issue 的條件。","B":"對。官方說 rank issue 要有 Schedule Issues 和 Edit Issues；跨 project board 上看 issue 所屬的 project。","C":"錯。Transition Issues 是改 status（把卡片拖到另一欄）用的；在 backlog 上下拖曳排序不是狀態轉換。","D":"對。Rank 的另一個條件是 Edit Issues。她看得到 LEDG 的卡片代表有 Browse Projects，但少了這兩個權限仍然排不了序。","E":"錯。Administer Projects 讓人管理 project 的設定與角色，但官方列的 rank 條件不包含它；有 Schedule Issues 與 Edit Issues 就夠了。","F":"錯。Assign Issues 是把 issue 指派給經辦人（assignee）用的權限，和在 backlog 裡調整 issue 的排序無關。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/rank-an-issue/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/permissions-for-company-managed-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.2-e09","sec":"620.2.2","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. Nkechi is the board administrator of a company-managed Kanban board at Tessellate. She wants board admins to be able to add statuses directly from Board settings, but the <b>Simplify workflow</b> button is not displayed on the Columns page. Based on the exhibit, which prerequisite is clearly not met?","zh":"請看附圖。Nkechi 是 Tessellate 一塊 company-managed Kanban board 的 board administrator。她希望 board admin 能直接在 Board settings 新增 status，但 Columns 頁面上沒有顯示 <b>Simplify workflow</b> 按鈕。根據附圖，哪一個前提明顯沒有滿足？","zo":["Board 的 filter 只能看一個 project 的 issue","Board 必須是 Scrum board，因為 Kanban board 不能使用 simplified workflow","Filter 查詢必須以 <code>ORDER BY Rank ASC</code> 結尾","必須先把 column constraints 設成 None，才能簡化 workflow"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 303\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Columns\"><rect x=\"0.5\" y=\"0.5\" width=\"379\" height=\"302\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"380\" height=\"34\" rx=\"0\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"34\" width=\"106\" height=\"269\" rx=\"0\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><line x1=\"106\" y1=\"34\" x2=\"106\" y2=\"303\" class=\"gl\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Board settings</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Columns</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Workflow type</text><line x1=\"118\" y1=\"119\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"119\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"118\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">You&#x27;re using the Jira workflow</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\"></text><text x=\"118\" y=\"140\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s tf-rose\" style=\"font-weight:700\">No Simplify workflow button is shown</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"164\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Column constraint</text><circle cx=\"125\" cy=\"177\" r=\"7\" class=\"bx\"/><circle cx=\"125\" cy=\"177\" r=\"3.5\" class=\"fl-brand\"/><text x=\"140\" y=\"181\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">None</text><circle cx=\"125\" cy=\"198\" r=\"7\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"140\" y=\"202\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Issue Count</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"231\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Board filter (from General)</text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"237\" width=\"250\" height=\"44\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx brand\"/><text x=\"126\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t mono\" style=\"font-size:11px\">project in (LUMA, KITE)</text><text x=\"126\" y=\"271\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t mono\" style=\"font-size:11px\">ORDER BY Rank ASC</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">General</text><rect x=\"6\" y=\"65\" width=\"94\" height=\"22\" rx=\"6\" class=\"sf-brand\"/><text x=\"14\" y=\"80\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Columns</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"106\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Swimlanes</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"132\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Quick filters</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"158\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Card colors</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"184\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Card layout</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"210\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Estimation</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"236\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Working days</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"262\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Issue detail</text></svg>","opts":["The board's filter must view issues from only one project","The board must be a Scrum board, because Kanban boards cannot use the simplified workflow","The filter query must end with <code>ORDER BY Rank ASC</code>","Column constraints must be set to None before the workflow can be simplified"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。官方列的第一個前提是 board 只看一個 project。圖上的 filter 包含 LUMA 和 KITE 兩個 project，所以按鈕不會出現。","B":"錯。官方說 Scrum 和 Kanban board 預設都使用 simplified workflow，Kanban board 當然可以用，不是這個原因。","C":"錯。圖上的 filter 已經以 <code>ORDER BY Rank ASC</code> 結尾；而且這是 ranking 的條件，不在 simplified workflow 的前提清單裡。","D":"錯。Column constraints 只是欄位件數上下限的視覺提醒，官方的 simplified workflow 前提清單裡沒有這一項。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/use-the-simplified-workflow/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.2-e10","sec":"620.2.2","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. At Brightwater Bank, Gabriela has the Manage Sprints permission in projects SHOP and PAY, which are the only projects that contain issues with the label <code>checkout</code>. When she tries to complete the active sprint on this board, Jira does not let her. Which action does Atlassian recommend as the easier way to resolve this problem?","zh":"請看附圖。在 Brightwater Bank，Gabriela 在 project SHOP 和 PAY 都有 Manage Sprints 權限，而帶有 <code>checkout</code> label 的 issue 只存在於這兩個 project。她想完成這塊 board 上進行中的 sprint，Jira 卻不讓她完成。Atlassian 建議用哪一個比較簡單的做法來解決這個問題？","zo":["給 Gabriela 站上每一個 project 的 Manage Sprints 權限","除了她現有的權限之外，再讓 Gabriela 成為 board administrator","開啟 parallel sprints，讓每個 project 的 issue 可以分開完成","把 board filter 改成 <code>project in (SHOP, PAY) AND labels = checkout</code>"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 290\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"General\"><rect x=\"0.5\" y=\"0.5\" width=\"379\" height=\"289\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"380\" height=\"34\" rx=\"0\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"34\" width=\"106\" height=\"256\" rx=\"0\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><line x1=\"106\" y1=\"34\" x2=\"106\" y2=\"290\" class=\"gl\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Board settings</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">General</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Board name</text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"95\" width=\"250\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"128\" y=\"113\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Checkout sprint board</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"144\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Saved Filter</text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"150\" width=\"250\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"128\" y=\"168\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">All checkout work</text><path d=\"M350,161 l5,5 l5,-5\" class=\"ln ink\" style=\"stroke-width:1.6\"/><text x=\"118\" y=\"199\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Filter query</text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"205\" width=\"250\" height=\"44\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx brand\"/><text x=\"126\" y=\"223\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t mono\" style=\"font-size:11px\">labels = checkout</text><text x=\"126\" y=\"239\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t mono\" style=\"font-size:11px\">ORDER BY Rank ASC</text><rect x=\"6\" y=\"39\" width=\"94\" height=\"22\" rx=\"6\" class=\"sf-brand\"/><text x=\"14\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">General</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"80\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Columns</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"106\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Swimlanes</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"132\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Quick filters</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"158\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Card colors</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"184\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Card layout</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"210\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Estimation</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"236\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Working days</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"262\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Issue detail</text></svg>","opts":["Grant Gabriela the Manage Sprints permission in every project on the site","Make Gabriela a board administrator in addition to her current permissions","Enable parallel sprints so that each project's issues can be completed separately","Change the board filter to <code>project in (SHOP, PAY) AND labels = checkout</code>"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。官方確實說查詢複雜時可能要給她全站所有 project 的 Manage Sprints，但這範圍大又費工；官方說更簡單的做法是簡化 board 的 JQL。","B":"錯。Board admin 只管 board 設定；完成 sprint 看 Manage Sprints，卡在 Jira 判斷不出涵蓋哪些 project。","C":"錯。Parallel sprints 是讓同一塊 board 同時有多個 active sprint，和 Jira 判斷 filter 涵蓋哪些 project 無關，解決不了權限判斷問題。","D":"對。圖上的 filter 沒有限定 project，Jira 無法判斷會撈到哪些 project，因此權限檢查過不了。官方建議把 JQL 簡化、明確寫出 project，最省事。"},"note":"現行 UI 把 project 叫 space、issue 叫 work item；JQL 仍可用 <code>project</code>。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/complete-a-sprint/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/permissions-for-company-managed-projects/"],"lvl":3,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.2-e11","sec":"620.2.2","dom":"620.2","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Mateo configures a company-managed Scrum board for two teams whose issues live in projects WEB and APP. Which two board configurations can he set up on this cross-project board? (Choose two.)","zh":"Mateo 替兩個團隊設定一塊 company-managed Scrum board，他們的 issue 分別在 project WEB 和 APP。在這塊跨 project board 上，他可以設定哪兩種 board 設定？（選兩個）","zo":["依 project 分的 swimlane，讓每個 project 各有一條 swimlane","在同一塊 board 上，WEB 的 issue 用 story points、APP 的 issue 用時間估算","建立一次、讓 WEB 和 APP 的 issue 都能設成 Fix Version 的同一個 version","用 simplified workflow，直接從 board 的 Columns 頁面新增 status","Quick filter，例如只顯示 <code>project = WEB</code> 的 issue"],"fig":"","opts":["Swimlanes based on projects, so that each project gets its own swimlane","Story points for WEB issues and time estimates for APP issues on the same board","One version, created once, that both WEB and APP issues can use as their Fix Version","New statuses added directly from the board's Columns page using the simplified workflow","Quick filters, such as one that shows only issues where <code>project = WEB</code>"],"ans":"AE","why":{"A":"對。Swimlanes 的設定方法之一就是依 project 分，一個 project 一條 swimlane，各自的 issue 顯示在所屬 project 底下。","B":"錯。Estimation method 是整塊 board 的單一設定，一塊 board 只能選一種估算方式，不能依 project 分開。","C":"錯。Version 屬於各自的 project，是那個 project 的時間點；兩個 project 無法共用同一個 version。","D":"錯。Simplified workflow 要求 board 只看一個 project；跨 project board 不能在 board 上直接加 status。","E":"對。Quick filter 是 board 上用 JQL 定義的篩選，可以引用 filter 範圍內任何一個 project，跨 project board 照樣能用。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>Swimlanes 的方法考試叫 Projects，現行 UI 叫 Spaces。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-swimlanes/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-quick-filters/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-estimation-and-tracking/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/manage-versions/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/use-the-simplified-workflow/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.3-e01","sec":"620.2.3","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. Aroha is a project administrator of the team-managed project HLX. She opens the Edit column dialog for the In Review column. The team wants the column to warn them when it holds fewer than 2 issues. What should she do?","zh":"請看圖。Aroha 是 team-managed project HLX 的 project administrator。她打開 In Review 欄的 Edit column 對話框。團隊希望這一欄少於 2 件 issue 時會提醒他們。她該怎麼做？","zo":["在 Edit column 對話框往下捲，在最大值欄位下方的最小值欄位輸入 2","告訴團隊這裡沒有最小值可設；只有 company-managed board 支援","把 maximum number of issues 從 6 改成 2，然後儲存","先到 Board settings &gt; Columns 開啟 Column constraints，這個對話框就會多出最小值欄位"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 262\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Edit column\"><rect x=\"0.5\" y=\"0.5\" width=\"379\" height=\"261\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"380\" height=\"34\" rx=\"0\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Project settings › Board › Columns and statuses</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Edit column</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Column name</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"95\" width=\"356\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"113\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">In Review</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"144\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Maximum number of issues</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"150\" width=\"356\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx brand\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"168\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">6</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"199\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s tf-violet\" style=\"font-weight:700\">Column changes color when over the limit</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"212\" width=\"46.0\" height=\"26\" rx=\"6\" class=\"fl-brand\"/><text x=\"35.0\" y=\"229\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"w\">Save</text></svg>","opts":["Scroll down in the Edit column dialog and enter 2 in the minimum field below the maximum field","Tell the team a minimum is not available here; only company-managed boards support one","Change the maximum number of issues from 6 to 2 and save the column","Turn on Column constraints under Board settings &gt; Columns first, which adds a minimum field to this dialog"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。Team-managed 的 Edit column 對話框除了欄名，只有「最大件數」這一個上限欄位，往下捲也找不到最小值可以填。","B":"對。Team-managed board 的 column limit 只能設上限；要「少於幾件就警示」的下限，只有 company-managed board 的 column constraints 才有（可設 minimum 與 maximum）。","C":"錯。把上限改成 2，是「超過 2 件才變色」，方向剛好相反，仍然做不到「少於 2 件就警示」。","D":"錯。Board settings &gt; Columns 的 Column constraints 是 company-managed board 的設定頁；team-managed project 沒有這個選項。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>考試寫 Project settings &gt; Board（Columns and statuses）；現行新版 team-managed board 改在 board 選單（…）&gt; Configure columns 設定，圖上的 Maximum number of issues 在現行 UI 叫 Maximum number of work items。<br>考試版 team-managed board 只能設最大件數。2026 年 8 月起，新版 board（modernised board）已推到大多數 team-managed Software board，可以同時設最小值與最大值，設定位置在欄位選單或 board 的 column configuration 面板。作答仍以考試版為準。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/manage-columns-with-multiple-statuses-in-a-team-managed-project/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-columns/","https://community.atlassian.com/forums/discussion/3240014/upcoming-changes-to-software-boards-in-team-managed-spaces"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.3-e02","sec":"620.2.3","dom":"620.2","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Nnamdi is a project administrator of the team-managed project QRL. His team asks him how WIP limits work on their board. Which statements are true? (Choose two.)","zh":"Nnamdi 是 team-managed project QRL 的 project administrator。他的團隊問他 board 上的 WIP limit 怎麼運作。下列哪兩個敘述正確？（選兩個。）","zo":["只有 Jira administrator 能設 column limit，而且只能在 workflow editor 裡設","每一欄都能同時設最小件數與最大件數","Column limit 是在 Columns and statuses 設定頁的 Edit column 對話框裡設定","Team-managed board 不支援 column limit，必須改用 company-managed board","欄內 issue 超過上限時，這一欄會變色"],"fig":"","opts":["Only a Jira administrator can set a column limit, and only in the workflow editor","Each column can have both a minimum and a maximum number of issues","A column limit is set in the Edit column dialog of the Columns and statuses settings","Team-managed boards do not support column limits; a company-managed board is required","The column changes color when it holds more issues than its limit"],"ans":"CE","why":{"A":"錯。Team-managed 的欄位設定由 project 的 administrator 角色處理，不需要 Jira admin，也不是在 workflow editor 裡設。","B":"錯。常見誤解：以為兩種 project 都有上下限。Team-managed 只能設最大件數，沒有最小值。","C":"對。在 Columns and statuses 設定頁把游標移到欄名、選 Edit column，就能輸入這一欄的最大件數。這個對話框只有上限一個欄位，沒有下限可填。","D":"錯。常見誤解：「TMP 不能設 WIP limit」。Team-managed board 可以設上限，只是沒有下限。","E":"對。官方說明：欄內 issue 超過設定的最大件數時，這一欄會變色提醒，但這只是視覺警示。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>考試版 team-managed 只能設最大值（B 為錯）。2026 年 8 月起，現行的新版 team-managed board（modernised board）已經可以設最小值和最大值。現行設定入口已改為 board 選單（…）&gt; Configure columns。作答仍以考試版為準。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/manage-columns-with-multiple-statuses-in-a-team-managed-project/","https://community.atlassian.com/forums/discussion/3240014/upcoming-changes-to-software-boards-in-team-managed-spaces"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.3-e03","sec":"620.2.3","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Yuki is the scrum master and board administrator of a company-managed Scrum board for project KFR. During each sprint, the QA column should warn the team when it holds fewer than 2 issues or more than 5 issues. What should she do?","zh":"Yuki 是 project KFR 的 company-managed Scrum board 的 scrum master，也是 board administrator。每個 sprint 期間，QA 欄少於 2 件或多於 5 件 issue 時，都要提醒團隊。她該怎麼做？","zo":["把 board 改成 Kanban board，因為 column constraint 只有 Kanban board 有","在 Edit column 對話框設最大值 5，因為 Scrum board 不能設最小值","在 Board settings &gt; Columns 的 Column constraints 選 Issue Count，並替 QA 欄填入 2 和 5","請 Jira administrator 在 workflow 加一個 validator，限制能進入 QA 的 issue 數量"],"fig":"","opts":["Convert the board to a Kanban board, because column constraints are available only on Kanban boards","Set a maximum of 5 in the Edit column dialog, because a Scrum board cannot use a minimum","In Board settings &gt; Columns, select Issue Count under Column constraints and enter 2 and 5 for QA","Ask a Jira administrator to add a workflow validator that limits how many issues can enter QA"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。常見誤解：「Scrum board 不能設 column constraint」。官方說 constraint 對 Kanban 很重要，在 Scrum 也能用來及早看出瓶頸。","B":"錯。Edit column 對話框、只能設上限是 team-managed 的做法。Company-managed 的 Scrum board 一樣可以設最小值。","C":"對。Company-managed 的 Scrum 與 Kanban board 都能在 Columns 頁開啟 Column constraints，並在欄名下方填最小值與最大值；低於最小值欄頭變黃，超過最大值變紅。","D":"錯。Validator 是在 transition 時擋下不合規則的操作，會真的阻止移動；題目要的是警示，而且 validator 也沒有「欄內件數」這種檢查。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>考試叫 Issue Count，現行 UI 叫 Work item count。B 解析說的「team-managed 只能設上限」是考試版的行為；2026 年 8 月起，現行新版 team-managed board 已經可以設上下限。<br>company-managed 正在推出新版 board view，新版的欄位設定改由 board 的 More actions &gt; Configure columns 進入，操作方式和 team-managed 相同；作答以考試版的 Board settings &gt; Columns 為準。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-columns/","https://community.atlassian.com/forums/discussion/3240014/upcoming-changes-to-software-boards-in-team-managed-spaces"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.3-e04","sec":"620.2.3","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Leila is training new board administrators at Quillion. Which statement about WIP limits (column constraints) is NOT true?","zh":"Leila 正在 Quillion 公司訓練新的 board administrator。關於 WIP limit（column constraint），下列哪一個敘述<b>不</b>正確？","zo":["Company-managed 的 Scrum board 可以替一欄同時設最小值與最大值","Team-managed board 可以替一欄設最大值，但不能設最小值","在 company-managed board 上，計數會包含被目前 quick filter 隱藏的 issue","在 company-managed board 上，欄位已達最大值時，issue 就拖不進那一欄"],"fig":"","opts":["A company-managed Scrum board can have both a minimum and a maximum for a column","A team-managed board can have a maximum for a column but not a minimum","On a company-managed board, the count includes issues hidden by an active quick filter","On a company-managed board, an issue cannot be dragged into a column whose maximum is reached"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"正確敘述（不選）。Company-managed 的 Scrum board 和 Kanban board 一樣，都能替欄位設最小值與最大值。","B":"正確敘述（不選）。Team-managed board 在 Edit column 只能填最大件數，沒有最小值可設。","C":"正確敘述（不選）。官方說明 column constraint 算的是整欄總數，不管 issue 有沒有被 quick filter 藏起來。","D":"錯誤敘述（要選）。Column constraint 只會讓欄頭變色（超過上限變紅、低於下限變黃），卡片照樣拖得進去，不會阻擋。常見誤解是把它當成硬性限制。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>B 以考試版為準：team-managed 只能設上限。2026 年 8 月起，新版 team-managed board（modernised board）已可設上下限。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-columns/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/manage-columns-with-multiple-statuses-in-a-team-managed-project/","https://community.atlassian.com/forums/discussion/3240014/upcoming-changes-to-software-boards-in-team-managed-spaces"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.3-e05","sec":"620.2.3","dom":"620.2","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. On this company-managed Kanban board, In Progress contains 5 stories and 3 sub-tasks, and Review contains 1 story. Mateo has the quick filter “Only My Issues” selected, which shows only 2 of the In Progress stories. Which statements are true? (Choose two.)","zh":"請看圖。在這個 company-managed Kanban board 上，In Progress 有 5 個 story 和 3 個 sub-task，Review 有 1 個 story。Mateo 選了 quick filter「Only My Issues」，只看得到 In Progress 裡的 2 個 story。下列哪兩個敘述正確？（選兩個。）","zo":["In Progress 的欄頭顯示為紅色","In Progress 的欄頭顯示為黃色，因為 Mateo 只看到 2 件","Review 的欄頭顯示為黃色，因為裡面只有 1 件","那 3 個 sub-task 不算進 In Progress 的件數","Mateo 看到的 In Progress 欄頭是正常顏色，因為欄頭顏色只依每個人看得到的卡片計算"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 258\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Columns\"><rect x=\"0.5\" y=\"0.5\" width=\"379\" height=\"257\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"380\" height=\"34\" rx=\"0\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Board settings › Columns</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Columns</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Column constraint</text><circle cx=\"19\" cy=\"102\" r=\"7\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"106\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">None</text><circle cx=\"19\" cy=\"123\" r=\"7\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"127\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Issue Count</text><circle cx=\"19\" cy=\"144\" r=\"7\" class=\"bx\"/><circle cx=\"19\" cy=\"144\" r=\"3.5\" class=\"fl-brand\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"148\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\">Issue Count, excluding Sub-tasks</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"166\" width=\"84\" height=\"66\" rx=\"7\" class=\"bx plain\"/><text x=\"18\" y=\"181\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:11.5px\">To Do</text><rect x=\"17\" y=\"202\" width=\"74\" height=\"18\" rx=\"4\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"215\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">To Do</text><rect x=\"102\" y=\"166\" width=\"84\" height=\"66\" rx=\"7\" class=\"bx brand\"/><text x=\"108\" y=\"181\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:11.5px\">In Progress</text><text x=\"108\" y=\"196\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s tf-rose\" style=\"font-weight:700\">≥3 ≤4</text><rect x=\"108\" y=\"202\" width=\"74\" height=\"18\" rx=\"4\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><text x=\"112\" y=\"215\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Doing</text><rect x=\"193\" y=\"166\" width=\"84\" height=\"66\" rx=\"7\" class=\"bx plain\"/><text x=\"199\" y=\"181\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:11.5px\">Review</text><text x=\"199\" y=\"196\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s tf-rose\" style=\"font-weight:700\">≤3</text><rect x=\"198\" y=\"202\" width=\"74\" height=\"18\" rx=\"4\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><text x=\"203\" y=\"215\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Review</text><rect x=\"284\" y=\"166\" width=\"84\" height=\"66\" rx=\"7\" class=\"bx green\"/><text x=\"290\" y=\"181\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:11.5px\">Done</text><rect x=\"288\" y=\"202\" width=\"74\" height=\"18\" rx=\"4\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><text x=\"294\" y=\"215\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Done</text></svg>","opts":["The In Progress column header is shown in red","The In Progress column header is shown in yellow, because Mateo sees only 2 issues","The Review column header is shown in yellow, because it contains only 1 issue","The 3 sub-tasks are not included in the In Progress count","Mateo sees a normal In Progress header, because the header color is based only on the cards visible to each user"],"ans":"AD","why":{"A":"對。圖上選的是 Issue Count, excluding Sub-tasks，所以 In Progress 只算 5 個 story。5 超過上限 4，不論誰套了 quick filter，欄頭都會變紅。","B":"錯。Column constraint 算整欄總數，不管 quick filter 藏了幾張。就算 Mateo 只看到 2 張、低於下限 3，計數仍是整欄的 5 張，所以不會變黃。","C":"錯。黃色代表「沒達到最小值」，但圖上 Review 只設了上限 3、沒有設最小值，只有 1 件也不會變黃。","D":"對。圖上 Column constraint 選的是 Issue Count, excluding Sub-tasks，所以 3 個 sub-task 不列入計數。官方建議 Scrum 團隊用這個選項，限制 story 數，而不是個別任務的數量。","E":"錯。欄頭顏色由整欄總數決定，是 board 本身的狀態，不是依每個人看得到的 issue 計算；Mateo 和其他人看到的 In Progress 欄頭一樣是紅色。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>考試叫 Issue Count, excluding Sub-tasks，現行 UI 叫 Work item count, excluding subtasks。company-managed 正在推出新版 board view，新版的欄位設定改由 board 的 More actions &gt; Configure columns 進入；作答以考試版的 Board settings &gt; Columns 為準。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-columns/"],"lvl":3,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.3-e06","sec":"620.2.3","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Sione leads a team that uses a team-managed Kanban board in project MRA. The team wants the In Progress column to stand out whenever it holds more than 4 issues. Sione's manager says they must move to a company-managed project to get WIP limits. Which option meets the requirement with the least effort?","zh":"Sione 帶領的團隊在 project MRA 使用 team-managed Kanban board。團隊希望 In Progress 欄只要超過 4 件 issue 就能一眼看出來。Sione 的主管說必須改用 company-managed project 才有 WIP limit。哪個做法能以最少的工作量達成需求？","zo":["請 project administrator 在目前 board 的 In Progress 欄設最大值 4","把所有 issue 搬到新的 company-managed project，再在它的 board 設 column constraint","用撈 MRA 的 filter 另建一個 company-managed Kanban board，再在上面設 column constraint","建立 automation rule，在 In Progress 超過 4 件時自動留言"],"fig":"","opts":["Have a project administrator set a maximum of 4 on the In Progress column of the current board","Move all issues to a new company-managed project and configure column constraints on its board","Create a company-managed Kanban board from a filter on MRA and set column constraints on it","Create an automation rule that adds a comment when In Progress holds more than 4 issues"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。Team-managed board 本來就能替欄位設最大件數，超過時欄位會變色，正好符合需求，不必搬 project。主管的說法是常見誤解：TMP 可以設上限，考試版只是沒有下限。","B":"錯。搬到 company-managed project 確實能設 column constraint，但要搬 issue、重建設定，工作量遠比直接設上限大。","C":"錯。另外建 board 還要處理 filter 與欄位對應，團隊也得換 board 使用；原 board 就能設上限，這樣做多此一舉。","D":"錯。Automation 留言不會讓欄位本身變醒目，而且要寫規則與條件，比直接在欄位設上限麻煩。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>考試版 TMP 只有上限；2026 年 8 月起，現行新版 team-managed board 已經可以設上下限。這題的正解 A 在兩個版本都成立。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/manage-columns-with-multiple-statuses-in-a-team-managed-project/","https://community.atlassian.com/forums/discussion/3240014/upcoming-changes-to-software-boards-in-team-managed-spaces"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.3-e07","sec":"620.2.3","dom":"620.2","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Lumora has two teams. Team Falcon uses a team-managed board with the Sprints feature turned on. Team Heron uses a company-managed Scrum board. Both teams want a warning when their Review column holds fewer than 2 or more than 6 issues. Which statements are true? (Choose two.)","zh":"Lumora 公司有兩個團隊。Falcon 團隊用 team-managed board，並開啟了 Sprints 功能。Heron 團隊用 company-managed Scrum board。兩個團隊都希望 Review 欄少於 2 件或多於 6 件時能收到警示。下列哪兩個敘述正確？（選兩個。）","zo":["兩個團隊都不能設限制，因為 column limit 不適用於使用 sprint 的 board","Heron 可以在 Board settings &gt; Columns 同時設最小值與最大值","Falcon 可以設最大值 6，但不能設最小值 2","Falcon 可以在 Columns and statuses 設定頁的 Edit column 對話框設兩個限制","Heron 不能用 column constraint，因為只有 Kanban board 才有"],"fig":"","opts":["Neither team can configure limits, because column limits do not apply to boards that use sprints","Heron can set both the minimum and the maximum in Board settings &gt; Columns","Falcon can set the maximum of 6, but cannot set the minimum of 2","Falcon can set both limits in the Edit column dialog of the Columns and statuses settings","Heron cannot use column constraints, because they are available only on Kanban boards"],"ans":"BC","why":{"A":"錯。有沒有用 sprint 跟能不能設欄位上限無關；官方說 constraint 在 Scrum 也能用來看出瓶頸。","B":"對。Company-managed 的 Scrum board 也有 Column constraints：在 Board settings &gt; Columns 選 Issue Count，再在 Review 欄名下方同時填最小值 2 與最大值 6；少於 2 欄頭變黃，超過 6 變紅。","C":"對。Team-managed board 在 Columns and statuses 的 Edit column 只有最大件數欄位，所以能設 6，超過時欄位會變色，但 2 這個下限設不了。常見誤解：以為 TMP 完全不能設 WIP limit。","D":"錯。Team-managed 的 Edit column 只有最大件數欄位，沒有最小值；上下限都要的話只有 company-managed 做得到。","E":"錯。常見誤解：「Scrum board 不能設 column constraint」。Company-managed 的 Scrum 與 Kanban board 都能設上下限。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>考試版 team-managed 只能設最大件數，所以選 C。2026 年 8 月起，現行新版 team-managed board（modernised board）已經可以設最小值與最大值，設定入口是欄位選單或 board 的 column configuration 面板。現行設定入口已改為 board 選單（…）&gt; Configure columns。作答仍以考試版為準。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-columns/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/manage-columns-with-multiple-statuses-in-a-team-managed-project/","https://community.atlassian.com/forums/discussion/3240014/upcoming-changes-to-software-boards-in-team-managed-spaces"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.3-e08","sec":"620.2.3","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Ingrid is a project administrator of the team-managed project VLT. The Testing column now holds two statuses, so the columns can no longer be edited directly on the board. Where should she set a maximum number of issues for the Testing column?","zh":"Ingrid 是 team-managed project VLT 的 project administrator。Testing 欄現在放了兩個 status，所以不能再直接在 board 上編輯欄位。她該在哪裡替 Testing 欄設最大件數？","zo":["Board settings &gt; Columns &gt; Column constraints，然後在欄名下方填值","Project settings &gt; Board，然後在 Columns and statuses 設定頁對 Testing 選 Edit column","Workflow editor，替分配到 Testing 的每個 status 加一個屬性","Project settings &gt; Features，替 board 開啟 WIP limits 功能"],"fig":"","opts":["Board settings &gt; Columns &gt; Column constraints, then enter a value under the column name","Project settings &gt; Board, then Edit column on Testing in the Columns and statuses settings","The workflow editor, by adding a property to each status that is assigned to Testing","Project settings &gt; Features, by turning on a WIP limits feature for the board"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。Column constraints（選 Issue Count、在欄名下方填值）是 company-managed board 的 Board settings &gt; Columns 畫面。Team-managed 的 Board settings 會直接進 Columns and statuses 設定頁，沒有 Column constraints 選項，上限要在 Edit column 裡填。","B":"對。一欄有多個 status 後，欄位與 status 就分開管理，要到 Columns and statuses 設定頁；游標移到欄名選 Edit column，就能填最大件數。","C":"錯。Workflow editor 管的是 status 與 transition，欄位的件數上限不是 status 的屬性，這裡設不了。","D":"錯。Features 頁是開關 Sprints、Backlog 這類功能的地方，沒有 WIP limit 開關；上限是在欄位本身設定。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>考試版在 Project settings（現行叫 Space settings）&gt; Board 的 Columns and statuses 設定頁 Edit column。2026 年 8 月起，新版 team-managed board 的欄位設定改成在 board 上操作：board 選單（…）&gt; Configure columns，或直接用欄位選單。作答以考試版為準。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/manage-columns-with-multiple-statuses-in-a-team-managed-project/","https://community.atlassian.com/forums/discussion/3240014/upcoming-changes-to-software-boards-in-team-managed-spaces"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.3-e09","sec":"620.2.3","dom":"620.2","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. Ravi is a board administrator of a company-managed Scrum board for project PLM. He moved the Parked status to the Unmapped statuses panel. Which statements about issues in the Parked status are true? (Choose two.)","zh":"請看圖。Ravi 是 project PLM 的 company-managed Scrum board 的 board administrator。他把 Parked 這個 status 拖到 Unmapped statuses 面板。關於 Parked 狀態的 issue，下列哪兩個敘述正確？（選兩個。）","zo":["它們在 backlog 裡也會被隱藏","它們不會顯示在 active sprint 的 board 上","Jira 會把它們的 status 改成 To Do","完成 sprint 時它們會算成已完成","它們會和 Won't Do 一起出現在 Done 欄"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 243\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Columns\"><rect x=\"0.5\" y=\"0.5\" width=\"379\" height=\"242\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"380\" height=\"34\" rx=\"0\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Board settings › Columns</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Columns</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"78\" width=\"115\" height=\"66\" rx=\"7\" class=\"bx plain\"/><text x=\"18\" y=\"93\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:11.5px\">To Do</text><rect x=\"17\" y=\"114\" width=\"105\" height=\"18\" rx=\"4\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"127\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">To Do</text><rect x=\"133\" y=\"78\" width=\"115\" height=\"88\" rx=\"7\" class=\"bx brand\"/><text x=\"139\" y=\"93\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:11.5px\">In Progress</text><rect x=\"138\" y=\"114\" width=\"105\" height=\"18\" rx=\"4\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><text x=\"143\" y=\"127\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">In Progress</text><rect x=\"138\" y=\"136\" width=\"105\" height=\"18\" rx=\"4\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><text x=\"143\" y=\"149\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">In Review</text><rect x=\"253\" y=\"78\" width=\"115\" height=\"88\" rx=\"7\" class=\"bx green\"/><text x=\"259\" y=\"93\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:11.5px\">Done</text><rect x=\"258\" y=\"114\" width=\"105\" height=\"18\" rx=\"4\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><text x=\"263\" y=\"127\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Done</text><rect x=\"258\" y=\"136\" width=\"105\" height=\"18\" rx=\"4\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><text x=\"263\" y=\"149\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Won&#x27;t Do</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"191\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Unmapped statuses</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"197\" width=\"54.8\" height=\"20\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx rose\"/><text x=\"39.4\" y=\"211\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:11.5px\">Parked</text></svg>","opts":["They are also hidden from the backlog view","They are not displayed on the active sprint board","Their status is changed to To Do","They count as complete when the sprint is completed","They appear in the Done column with Won't Do"],"ans":"AB","why":{"A":"對。官方說明 unmapped status 在 board 和 backlog 都會隱藏。常見誤解是以為 backlog 不受欄位對應影響，其實 backlog 一樣要靠欄位對應才顯示。","B":"對。Status 沒有對到任何欄，board 就沒有地方放這些 issue，所以在 active sprint 看不到。","C":"錯。這是把 board 設定當成會改 issue 資料。拖到 Unmapped 只是改 board 的欄位對應，issue 本身的 status 仍是 Parked，不會被改成 To Do。","D":"錯。Scrum board 只把最右欄的 issue 當成完成；Parked 沒對到任何欄，當然不在最右欄，完成 sprint 時不會算完成。","E":"錯。Won't Do 對到 Done 欄，但 Parked 沒有對到任何欄，board 上就沒有位置放；issue 出現在哪一欄只看 status 的對應，不看 status category。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>company-managed 正在推出新版 board view，新版的欄位設定改由 board 的 More actions &gt; Configure columns 進入；作答以考試版的 Board settings &gt; Columns 為準。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-columns/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.3-e10","sec":"620.2.3","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Hana is the board administrator of a company-managed Scrum board. The Columns page shows “You're using the Jira workflow.” under Workflow type. She adds a new column named UAT. What is the result?","zh":"Hana 是某個 company-managed Scrum board 的 board administrator。Columns 頁的 Workflow type 顯示「You're using the Jira workflow.」。她新增了一個叫 UAT 的欄位。結果會如何？","zo":["Jira 自動建立同名的 UAT status，並加進 project 的 workflow","Jira 會擋下這個變更，因為只有使用 simplified workflow 的 board 才能加欄","UAT 左邊那一欄的 issue 會自動移到新欄位","出現一個空的 UAT 欄，必須再把 status 對應進去"],"fig":"","opts":["Jira creates a matching UAT status and adds it to the project's workflow automatically","Jira blocks the change, because columns can be added only on boards that use the simplified workflow","Issues in the column to the left of UAT are moved into the new column automatically","An empty UAT column appears, and a status must be mapped to it"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。只有用 simplified workflow 的 board，加 column 才會自動建立同名 status；這個 board 用的是 Jira workflow。","B":"錯。任何 company-managed board 都能加 column；simplified workflow 影響的是能不能順便建 status，不是能不能加欄。","C":"錯。新增欄位不會搬動任何 issue；issue 出現在哪一欄只看它的 status 對到哪一欄。","D":"對。用 Jira workflow 時加 column 只會多一個空欄，要從 Unmapped statuses 拖現有 status 進去才有 issue；若需要新 status，得請 Jira admin 在 workflow 裡加。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>company-managed 正在推出新版 board view，新版的欄位設定改由 board 的 More actions &gt; Configure columns 進入；作答以考試版的 Board settings &gt; Columns 為準。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-columns/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/use-the-simplified-workflow/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.3-e11","sec":"620.2.3","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Kwame is a project administrator of the team-managed project SNR. In the Columns and statuses settings, the Testing column holds the statuses Testing and Test Failed. He deletes the Testing column. What happens to issues in those two statuses?","zh":"Kwame 是 team-managed project SNR 的 project administrator。在 Columns and statuses 設定頁中，Testing 欄放了 Testing 和 Test Failed 兩個 status。他刪除了 Testing 欄。這兩個 status 的 issue 會怎樣？","zo":["它們保留原本的 status，但不再出現在 board 上","它們會被改成第一欄的 status，因為原本的欄位不存在了","它們會被刪除，因為刪欄也會一併刪掉 Testing 和 Test Failed 這兩個 status","它們會暫時顯示在最右欄，直到團隊替它們建立新欄位"],"fig":"","opts":["They keep their statuses, but they no longer appear on the board","They are moved to the status of the first column, because their column no longer exists","They are deleted, because deleting the column also deletes the Testing and Test Failed statuses","They are shown in the rightmost column until the team creates a new column for them"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。在 Columns and statuses 設定頁只能刪欄，status 與欄位各自獨立，所以 status 仍留在 workflow。官方說明：status 沒分配到欄位時，該 status 的 issue 不會出現在 board。","B":"錯。這是把刪欄想成會自動搬移 issue。刪欄不會替 issue 轉換 status，status 只會透過 workflow transition 改變，所以 issue 仍停在 Testing 或 Test Failed。","C":"錯。欄位與 status 分開後，在這個設定頁刪欄不會刪 status，更不會刪 issue；status 要到 workflow editor 管理。","D":"錯。沒有「暫放最右欄」這種機制；沒分配到欄位的 status，其 issue 直接從 board 上消失。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>考試版在 Project settings（現行叫 Space settings）&gt; Board 的 Columns and statuses 設定頁刪欄；現行新版 team-managed board 改從 board 選單（…）&gt; Configure columns 設定。刪欄後，沒分配到欄位的 status，它的 issue 一樣不會出現在 board 上。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/manage-columns-with-multiple-statuses-in-a-team-managed-project/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/assign-statuses-and-edit-columns-in-a-team-managed-project/","https://community.atlassian.com/forums/discussion/3240014/upcoming-changes-to-software-boards-in-team-managed-spaces"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.3-e12","sec":"620.2.3","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. Diego is the board administrator of a company-managed Kanban board for project PAY. He wants to add statuses from the Columns page. The page says the board uses the Jira workflow, and no Simplify workflow button is displayed. Project PAY uses one workflow for all issue types, built only with Atlassian-provided rules, and every status has an outgoing transition. What is the most likely reason?","zh":"請看圖。Diego 是 project PAY 的 company-managed Kanban board 的 board administrator。他想在 Columns 頁新增 status。頁面顯示這個 board 使用 Jira workflow，而且沒有 Simplify workflow 按鈕。Project PAY 的所有 issue type 共用一個 workflow，只用 Atlassian 內建的規則，每個 status 都有往外的 transition。最可能的原因是什麼？","zo":["Diego 不是 Jira administrator，只有 Jira administrator 能切換 board 的 workflow 類型","Simplified workflow 只適用 Scrum board，而這是 Kanban board","Board filter 撈出的 issue 不只來自 PAY，還包含其他 project","Column constraint 已開啟，要先設成 None 才能切換"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 326\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Columns\"><rect x=\"0.5\" y=\"0.5\" width=\"379\" height=\"325\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"380\" height=\"34\" rx=\"0\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"34\" width=\"106\" height=\"292\" rx=\"0\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><line x1=\"106\" y1=\"34\" x2=\"106\" y2=\"326\" class=\"gl\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Board settings</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Columns</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Board type</text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"95\" width=\"250\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"128\" y=\"113\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Kanban</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"144\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Workflow type</text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"150\" width=\"250\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"128\" y=\"168\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">You&#x27;re using the Jira workflow.</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"199\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Board filter (General)</text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"205\" width=\"250\" height=\"44\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx brand\"/><text x=\"126\" y=\"223\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t mono\" style=\"font-size:11px\">project in (PAY, WAL)</text><text x=\"126\" y=\"239\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t mono\" style=\"font-size:11px\">ORDER BY Rank ASC</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"270\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Column constraint</text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"276\" width=\"250\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"128\" y=\"294\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Issue Count</text><path d=\"M350,287 l5,5 l5,-5\" class=\"ln ink\" style=\"stroke-width:1.6\"/><text x=\"14\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">General</text><rect x=\"6\" y=\"65\" width=\"94\" height=\"22\" rx=\"6\" class=\"sf-brand\"/><text x=\"14\" y=\"80\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Columns</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"106\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Swimlanes</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"132\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Quick filters</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"158\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Card colors</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"184\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Card layout</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"210\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Estimation</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"236\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Working days</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"262\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Issue detail</text></svg>","opts":["Diego is not a Jira administrator, and only Jira administrators can switch a board's workflow type","The simplified workflow is available only for Scrum boards, and this is a Kanban board","The board filter returns issues from more than one project, not only PAY","Column constraints are enabled, and they must be set to None before switching"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。官方說 board administrator 或 board 所在 project 的 administrator 就能設定 board，包括在 Columns 頁按 Simplify workflow，不限 Jira admin。","B":"錯。Simplified workflow 同時適用 Scrum 與 Kanban board；官方的預設說明就列出兩種 board 各自的預設 status。","C":"對。官方前提之一是 board 只看一個 project。圖上 filter 撈 PAY 和 WAL 兩個 project，其他條件題目都已滿足，所以 Simplify workflow 按鈕不會出現。","D":"錯。Column constraint 只影響欄頭顏色提醒，不在切換 simplified workflow 的前提條件裡。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>company-managed 正在推出新版 board view，新版的欄位設定改由 board 的 More actions &gt; Configure columns 進入；作答以考試版的 Board settings &gt; Columns 為準。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/use-the-simplified-workflow/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/what-is-a-simplified-jira-workflow/"],"lvl":3,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.3-e13","sec":"620.2.3","dom":"620.2","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Farah, the board administrator of a company-managed Scrum board, drags the Released column to the far right, so the Done column becomes second from the right. The Done status stays mapped to the Done column, and the Released column holds the Released status. What are the results? (Choose two.)","zh":"Farah 是某個 company-managed Scrum board 的 board administrator。她把 Released 欄拖到最右邊，於是 Done 欄變成右邊數來第二欄。Done status 仍對應在 Done 欄，Released 欄放的是 Released status。結果會如何？（選兩個。）","zo":["Done status 的 status category 變成 In Progress","完成 sprint 時，Done 的 issue 會算成未完成","Jira 自動把 Done status 改對應到 Released 欄","Released 欄現在有綠色條","Done 狀態的 issue 從 board 上消失，直到 Done 被重新對應"],"fig":"","opts":["The status category of the Done status changes to In Progress","Done issues count as incomplete when the sprint is completed","Jira automatically remaps the Done status into the Released column","The Released column now has the green bar","Issues in the Done status disappear from the board until Done is remapped"],"ans":"BD","why":{"A":"錯。這是把欄位位置和 status category 混為一談。Status category 是在 workflow editor 替 status 設定的屬性，搬動 board 欄位不會改它，Done 仍屬 Done 類別。","B":"對。Scrum board 只把最右欄的 issue 當成完成。Done 欄不再是最右欄，Done status 的 issue 在完成 sprint 時會被當成未完成，帶到下一個 sprint。","C":"錯。欄位對應只會照 board admin 拖放的結果，Jira 不會自動把 status 改對到別欄。","D":"對。官方說明最右邊那一欄一律顯示綠色條，代表成功完成的狀態；中間欄是藍色，最左欄是灰色。","E":"錯。Done status 仍對應在 Done 欄，issue 照樣顯示；只有沒對到任何欄的 status 才會從 board 消失。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>company-managed 正在推出新版 board view，新版的欄位設定改由 board 的 More actions &gt; Configure columns 進入；作答以考試版的 Board settings &gt; Columns 為準。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-columns/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.4-e01","sec":"620.2.4","dom":"620.2","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Olumide tracks two company-managed projects, NOVA and HALO, on one company-managed Kanban board created from a saved filter. Issues resolved as Duplicate must disappear from the board once they have been resolved for more than 3 days. His manager reviews the team's flow in the board's Cumulative Flow Diagram (CFD). Which two statements are true? (Choose two.)","zh":"Olumide 用一個從 saved filter 建立的 company-managed Kanban board，追蹤兩個 company-managed project：NOVA 與 HALO。Resolution 為 Duplicate 的 issue，在解決超過 3 天後必須從 board 上消失。他的主管會用這個 board 的 Cumulative Flow Diagram（CFD）檢視團隊的工作流動。哪兩個敘述正確？（選兩個。）","zo":["Hide completed work items older than 可以設成 3 天，並且只針對 Duplicate 的 issue。","用 sub-filter 把 Duplicate 的 issue 藏起來，也會把它們從 board 的 CFD 移除。","在 NOVA 建一個 team-managed Kanban board，可以用 custom filter 把 HALO 的 issue 加進來。","用 JQL 寫的 Kanban board sub-filter，可以藏起解決超過 3 天的 Duplicate issue。","被 sub-filter 藏起來的 Duplicate issue 仍會計入 CFD，因為 CFD 依據的是 board 的 saved filter。"],"fig":"","opts":["Hide completed work items older than can be set to 3 days and limited to Duplicate issues.","A sub-filter that hides the Duplicate issues also removes them from the board's CFD.","A team-managed Kanban board in NOVA could add the HALO issues through a custom filter.","A Kanban board sub-filter written in JQL can hide Duplicate issues resolved over 3 days ago.","Duplicate issues hidden by a sub-filter still count in the CFD, which uses the board's saved filter."],"ans":"DE","why":{"A":"錯。Hide completed work items older than 只有 1、2、4 週（或全部顯示）可選，沒有 3 天，也不能只針對 Duplicate。常見誤解就是以為能自訂時間或指定 resolution。","B":"錯。常見誤解：以為 sub-filter 會讓報表跟著縮小。Sub-filter 只改變 board 上顯示的卡；CFD 只看 board 的 saved filter，被 sub-filter 藏掉的 issue 仍會算進去。","C":"錯。Team-managed 的 custom filter 限定單一 project，只能在 NOVA 自己的 issue 裡篩，撈不到 HALO；team-managed board 也沒有 sub-filter。","D":"對。Sub-filter 是 company-managed Kanban board 專屬、用 JQL 寫的第二層篩選，例如 <code>resolution is EMPTY OR resolution != Duplicate OR resolved &gt;= -3d</code>，就能只藏掉 Duplicate 且解決超過 3 天的卡。","E":"對。官方 CFD 頁說 CFD 只包含符合 board saved filter 的 issue。Sub-filter 不改 saved filter，所以被藏的 Duplicate issue 仍在 CFD 裡；官方說的「show different data in Reports」就是指 board 和報表可以顯示不同資料。"},"note":"JQL 的 <code>!=</code> 不會包含空值，所以 sub-filter 要另外寫 <code>resolution is EMPTY</code>，未解決的 issue 才不會被藏掉。Data Center 官方頁也寫明：預設 sub-filter 讓已 release 的 issue 從 board 消失，但 Reports 仍會顯示它們。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/add-a-sub-filter-to-a-company-managed-kanban-board/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-cumulative-flow-diagram/","https://confluence.atlassian.com/jirasoftwareserver/configuring-filters-938845268.html","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/manage-custom-filters-in-team-managed-projects/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira/kb/kanban-board-shows-or-hides-completed-work-unexpectedly-in-jira-cloud/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/jql-operators/"],"lvl":3,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.4-e02","sec":"620.2.4","dom":"620.2","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Yusuf is a board administrator preparing a short training session on board filtering. Which two statements about the Kanban board sub-filter are true? (Choose two.)","zh":"Yusuf 是 board administrator，正在準備一場關於 board 篩選的簡短教育訓練。關於 Kanban board sub-filter，哪兩個敘述正確？（選兩個。）","zo":["它用 JQL 撰寫，會在 board 的 saved filter 結果裡再進一步縮小範圍。","company-managed Scrum board 也有，位在 Board settings 的 Backlog 區塊。","Team-managed project 的 project administrator 可以在 Project settings &gt; Board 設定它。","它設定在 company-managed Kanban board 的 Board settings 的 General 頁面。","它可以讓被 board filter 排除的 project 的 issue 出現在 board 上。"],"fig":"","opts":["It is written in JQL and further narrows the issues returned by the board's saved filter.","It is also available on company-managed Scrum boards, under the Backlog section of Board settings.","Project administrators of team-managed projects can set it under Project settings &gt; Board.","It is configured on the General page of Board settings for a company-managed Kanban board.","It can make issues from projects that the board filter excludes appear on the board."],"ans":"AD","why":{"A":"對。官方說 sub-filter 會「refines the issues returned by your board's filter」，也就是用 JQL 撰寫的第二層篩選，只能在 board filter 撈到的結果裡再縮小，不能擴大。","B":"錯。Scrum board 的設定頁沒有 sub-filter；常見誤解是以為每種 board 都有。它只出現在 company-managed Kanban board。","C":"錯。Team-managed project 的 board 只有 custom filter 可用，設定裡找不到 Kanban board sub-filter。常見誤解：以為 TMP Kanban 也有 sub-filter。","D":"對。官方步驟是進 Board settings → General，在 Filter 區塊找到 Kanban board sub-filter，按 Add sub-filter 或修改既有查詢，最後按 Update 存檔。這個欄位只出現在 company-managed Kanban board。","E":"錯。Sub-filter 是第二層漏斗，只能從 board filter 撈到的 issue 裡再篩掉一些，不能把範圍外的 issue 加進來。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/add-a-sub-filter-to-a-company-managed-kanban-board/","https://confluence.atlassian.com/jirasoftwareserver/configuring-filters-938845268.html","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/manage-custom-filters-in-team-managed-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.4-e03","sec":"620.2.4","dom":"620.2","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Mei-Ling, a board administrator for a company-managed Kanban board, is reviewing the Hide completed work items older than setting. Which two statements about this setting are true? (Choose two.)","zh":"Mei-Ling 是某個 company-managed Kanban board 的 board administrator，正在檢查 Hide completed work items older than 這個設定。關於這個設定，哪兩個敘述正確？（選兩個。）","zo":["可以只針對特定 resolution 的 issue，例如 Won't Fix。","可選的值是 1 週、2 週或 4 週，或者顯示所有已完成的 issue。","Scrum board 與 Kanban board 都有這個設定。","只有狀態對應到最右欄時，issue 才算完成。","編輯某個已完成 issue 的描述，可能讓它重新出現在 board 上。"],"fig":"","opts":["It can be limited to issues with a specific resolution, such as Won't Fix.","The available choices are 1 week, 2 weeks, or 4 weeks, or showing all completed issues.","It is available on both Scrum boards and Kanban boards.","An issue counts as completed only when its status is mapped to the right-most column.","Editing the description of a completed issue can make it reappear on the board."],"ans":"BE","why":{"A":"錯。這個設定只看時間，不能指定 resolution。常見誤解：以為能只藏 Won't Fix；要依 resolution 藏卡得用 sub-filter 寫 JQL。","B":"對。官方 KB 說時間只能改成 1 週、2 週、4 週，或整個關掉改成全部顯示；沒有 48 小時、3 週之類的自訂值。","C":"錯。Hide completed 和 sub-filter 一樣只有 Kanban board 有；Scrum board 的完成工作是靠完成 sprint 從 board 移走。","D":"錯。那是 Scrum board 判斷完成的方式。Kanban board 看 status category：只要狀態屬於 Done 類別就算完成，不管在哪一欄。","E":"對。計時是看最後一次編輯。完成後只要改了 Description、Fix version 等欄位，計時就重來，卡片會重新出現，直到期限再次過去。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>考試版叫 Hide completed issues older than，現行 UI 叫 Hide completed work items older than。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira/kb/kanban-board-shows-or-hides-completed-work-unexpectedly-in-jira-cloud/","https://jira.atlassian.com/browse/JRACLOUD-86435","https://confluence.atlassian.com/jirasoftwareserver/configuring-filters-938845268.html"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.4-e04","sec":"620.2.4","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit.\nThe PAY Kanban board has Hide completed work items older than set to 2 weeks. Today is Mar 20. Done and Closed both belong to the Done status category. The Updated column shows when each issue's fields were last edited. Which issues are hidden from the board?","zh":"請看圖。PAY 這個 Kanban board 的 Hide completed work items older than 設為 2 週，今天是 3 月 20 日。Done 與 Closed 都屬於 Done status category。Updated 欄位是每個 issue 最後一次被編輯欄位的日期。哪些 issue 會從 board 上被藏起來？","zo":["只有 PAY-11","PAY-11 與 PAY-15","PAY-11、PAY-12 與 PAY-15","PAY-11、PAY-13 與 PAY-15"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 198\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"PAY Kanban board issue list\"><rect x=\"10\" y=\"8\" width=\"300\" height=\"182\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx plain\"/><text x=\"20\" y=\"28\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\">PAY board issues (today: Mar 20)</text><rect x=\"16\" y=\"39\" width=\"288\" height=\"22\" rx=\"5\" class=\"sf-gray\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Key</text><text x=\"88\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Status</text><text x=\"168\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Resolved</text><text x=\"238\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Updated</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"62\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"62\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">PAY-11</text><text x=\"88\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Done</text><text x=\"168\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Feb 20</text><text x=\"238\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Feb 21</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"86\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"86\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">PAY-12</text><text x=\"88\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Done</text><text x=\"168\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Feb 25</text><text x=\"238\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Mar 16</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"110\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"126\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">PAY-13</text><text x=\"88\" y=\"126\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">In Progress</text><text x=\"168\" y=\"126\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">-</text><text x=\"238\" y=\"126\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Jan 30</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"134\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"134\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"150\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">PAY-14</text><text x=\"88\" y=\"150\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Done</text><text x=\"168\" y=\"150\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Mar 12</text><text x=\"238\" y=\"150\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Mar 12</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"158\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"158\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"174\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">PAY-15</text><text x=\"88\" y=\"174\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Closed</text><text x=\"168\" y=\"174\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Feb 2</text><text x=\"238\" y=\"174\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Feb 3</text></svg>","opts":["PAY-11 only","PAY-11 and PAY-15","PAY-11, PAY-12, and PAY-15","PAY-11, PAY-13, and PAY-15"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。PAY-15 也是 Done 類別，最後編輯是 Feb 3，早就超過 2 週，一樣會被藏起來，不只 PAY-11。","B":"對。兩張都是 Done 類別，最後編輯（Feb 21、Feb 3）都在 2 週以前。PAY-12 雖然 Feb 25 就解決，但 Mar 16 被編輯過，計時重來，所以還看得到。","C":"錯。PAY-12 在 Mar 16 被編輯過，計時從那天重算，還沒滿 2 週，所以仍會顯示。常見誤解是以為只看 Resolved 日期。","D":"錯。PAY-13 是 In Progress，不屬於 Done 類別，不算已完成；不管多久沒更新，Hide completed 都不會藏它。"},"note":"官方 KB 說明，issue 完成後只要編輯任何欄位，Hide completed 的計時就會重來。JRACLOUD-86404 是一張功能建議（Suggestion），希望改用 Resolution Date；它也記錄這個設定目前實際看的是 Updated，不是 Resolved 日期。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira/kb/kanban-board-shows-or-hides-completed-work-unexpectedly-in-jira-cloud/","https://jira.atlassian.com/browse/JRACLOUD-86404"],"lvl":3,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.4-e05","sec":"620.2.4","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit.\nEpic ATLAS-40 has seven child issues in project ATLAS: three stories, two bugs, and two tasks. When Fatima opens the backlog of this Scrum board and expands ATLAS-40 in the Epics panel, how many issues does the panel count for the epic?","zh":"請看圖。Epic ATLAS-40 在 ATLAS project 裡有 7 個 child issue：3 個 story、2 個 bug、2 個 task。Fatima 打開這個 Scrum board 的 backlog，在 Epics 面板展開 ATLAS-40 時，面板會替這個 epic 算出幾個 issue？","zo":["7","2","3","5"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 290\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"General\"><rect x=\"0.5\" y=\"0.5\" width=\"379\" height=\"289\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"380\" height=\"34\" rx=\"0\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"34\" width=\"106\" height=\"256\" rx=\"0\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><line x1=\"106\" y1=\"34\" x2=\"106\" y2=\"290\" class=\"gl\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Board settings</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">General</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Board name</text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"95\" width=\"250\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"128\" y=\"113\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">ATLAS Scrum</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"144\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Saved Filter</text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"150\" width=\"250\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"128\" y=\"168\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">ATLAS stories and bugs</text><path d=\"M350,161 l5,5 l5,-5\" class=\"ln ink\" style=\"stroke-width:1.6\"/><text x=\"118\" y=\"199\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Filter query</text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"205\" width=\"250\" height=\"60\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx brand\"/><text x=\"126\" y=\"223\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t mono\" style=\"font-size:11px\">project = ATLAS AND</text><text x=\"126\" y=\"239\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t mono\" style=\"font-size:11px\">issuetype in (Epic, Story, Bug)</text><text x=\"126\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t mono\" style=\"font-size:11px\">ORDER BY Rank ASC</text><rect x=\"6\" y=\"39\" width=\"94\" height=\"22\" rx=\"6\" class=\"sf-brand\"/><text x=\"14\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">General</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"80\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Columns</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"106\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Swimlanes</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"132\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Quick filters</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"158\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Card colors</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"184\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Card layout</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"210\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Estimation</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"236\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Working days</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"262\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Issue detail</text></svg>","opts":["7","2","3","5"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。7 是 epic 真正的 child 數量。Board 上的計數只算這個 board 撈得到的 issue，2 個 task 被 filter 排除了。常見誤解：以為 epic 計數不受 board filter 影響。","B":"錯。2 只是 bug 的數量。Filter 同時包含 Story 與 Bug，所以 3 個 story 也要算進去。","C":"錯。3 只是 story 的數量。Filter 用 <code>issuetype in (Epic, Story, Bug)</code>，2 個 bug 也會被撈到並計入。","D":"對。官方 KB：board 上的 issue 計數只包含出現在該 board 的 issue。Filter 的 child 類型只有 Story 與 Bug，所以是 3＋2＝5，2 個 task 不算。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira/kb/epic-panel-under-scrum-board-backlog-is-showing-incorrect-number-of-child-issues/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.4-e06","sec":"620.2.4","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Aiyana is the scrum master and a board administrator of the REEF Scrum board. She is not the owner of the board's saved filter. Which statement about the board filter is NOT true?","zh":"Aiyana 是 REEF Scrum board 的 scrum master，也是 board administrator，但她不是這個 board 的 saved filter 擁有者。關於 board filter，哪一個敘述是錯的？","zo":["修改 saved filter 的 JQL，會改變所有使用這份 filter 的 board 範圍。","Backlog 的 Epics 面板會計入 epic 的每一個 child issue，包括被 board filter 排除的。","能看到這份 saved filter、而且能瀏覽其中 project 的使用者，都能使用這個 board。","因為 filter 不是她建立的，編輯後的查詢只能用 Save as 另存新名稱來保留。"],"fig":"","opts":["Changing the JQL of the saved filter changes the scope of every board that uses that filter.","The Epics panel in the backlog counts every child issue of an epic, including children the board filter excludes.","The board is available to users who can view its saved filter and who can browse the projects it shows.","Because she did not create the filter, she can keep an edited query only by using Save as with a new name."],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"正確敘述（不選）。Board 本身不存 JQL，而是指向一份 saved filter；改了這份 filter，所有用它的 board 範圍都會一起變。","B":"錯誤敘述（要選）。官方 KB 說 board 上的計數只包含出現在該 board 的 issue，被 board filter 排除的 child 不會算進去。常見誤解就是以為 epic 計數是全部。","C":"正確敘述（不選）。官方說 board 對所有能看到其 saved filter 的使用者開放，但他們也需要相關 project 的 Browse Projects 權限。","D":"正確敘述（不選）。官方說不是 filter 原建立者時，編輯查詢後只能 Save as 並取新名稱，再讓 board 改用新 filter。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira/kb/epic-panel-under-scrum-board-backlog-is-showing-incorrect-number-of-child-issues/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-a-company-managed-board/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/edit-a-board-filter-on-a-company-managed-board/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/enable-ranking/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.4-e07","sec":"620.2.4","dom":"620.2","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Three teams work in the company-managed project HELIX and share one Scrum board. Each team owns its own component. Liang, the Falcon team lead, wants his team to see only Falcon issues on a board, without restricting anyone's access to any issue. Which two approaches meet the requirement? (Choose two.)","zh":"三個團隊在 company-managed project HELIX 裡工作，共用一個 Scrum board，每個團隊負責自己的 component。Falcon 團隊的組長 Liang 希望他的團隊在 board 上只看到 Falcon 的 issue，而且不限制任何人存取任何 issue。哪兩種做法符合需求？（選兩個。）","zo":["用 saved filter 建一個新 board，filter 為 <code>project = HELIX AND component = Falcon</code>","設定 issue security scheme，建一個 Falcon security level 並套用到 Falcon 的 issue","在共用的 Scrum board 加一個 quick filter：<code>component = Falcon</code>","在共用的 Scrum board 加一個 Kanban board sub-filter：<code>component = Falcon</code>","把另外兩個團隊的 project role 的 Browse Projects 權限拿掉"],"fig":"","opts":["Create a new board from a saved filter with <code>project = HELIX AND component = Falcon</code>","Configure an issue security scheme with a Falcon security level and apply it to Falcon issues","Add a quick filter <code>component = Falcon</code> to the shared Scrum board","Add a Kanban board sub-filter <code>component = Falcon</code> to the shared Scrum board","Remove the Browse Projects permission from the other two teams' project roles"],"ans":"AC","why":{"A":"對。從 saved filter 建一個新 board，把範圍限定在 Falcon component，Falcon 團隊打開這個 board 就只看到自己的 issue；原本三隊共用的 board 與 filter 都不受影響，也沒有改動任何權限。","B":"錯。Issue security 是權限控制，不在這個 level 的人會完全看不到這些 issue，違反「不限制任何人存取」。常見誤解：把它當成 board 顯示設定。","C":"對。Quick filter 就是官方說的「在共用 backlog 上切換成團隊專屬的檢視」，Falcon 成員按一下就只看自己的 issue，不影響別人的畫面。","D":"錯。Sub-filter 是 company-managed Kanban board 專屬的設定，Scrum board 的 General 頁根本沒有這個欄位，所以這個做法無法執行。","E":"錯。拿掉 Browse Projects 會讓其他團隊連整個 project 都進不去，是權限調整，不是 board 篩選，也違反題目限制。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/create-a-board-based-on-filters/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-quick-filters/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-issue-security-schemes/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/add-a-sub-filter-to-a-company-managed-kanban-board/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.4-e08","sec":"620.2.4","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Hana, a Jira administrator, receives a request from a team lead in project QUILL: \"Please add an issue security level for my team so that our board only shows our issues.\" If Hana applies a security level that only the team's members can view to the team's issues, what is the result?","zh":"Jira administrator Hana 收到 QUILL project 一位組長的請求：「請幫我的團隊加一個 issue security level，讓我們的 board 只顯示我們的 issue。」如果 Hana 對這個團隊的 issue 套用只有團隊成員能看的 security level，結果會是什麼？","zo":["沒有被授予這個 security level 的使用者，在 Jira 任何地方都看不到這些 issue，包括搜尋結果和其他 board。","只有這個團隊的 board 會改變；在搜尋結果和其他 board 上，所有人仍看得到這些 issue。","Board filter 會自動加上一段符合新 security level 的條件。","這些 issue 會移到團隊專屬的 backlog，但仍會出現在其他團隊的 board 報表裡。"],"fig":"","opts":["Users who are not granted the security level can no longer see those issues anywhere in Jira, including search results and other boards.","Only the team's board changes; the issues remain visible to everyone in search results and on other boards.","The board filter is updated automatically with a clause that matches the new security level.","The issues move to a separate backlog for the team but still appear in other teams' board reports."],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。Issue security 決定「誰能看到這張 issue」。沒被授予這個 level 的人即使能進 project 也看不到，搜尋、board、報表都一樣。要只改 board 顯示，應用 board filter 或 quick filter。","B":"錯。這描述的是 board filter 或 quick filter 的效果。Issue security 是權限層級的限制，會影響所有地方，不只一個 board。","C":"錯。套用 security level 不會去改任何 saved filter 的 JQL；board 內容變少是因為權限，不是因為 filter 被改。","D":"錯。Issue security 不會產生獨立的 backlog；沒有權限的人在報表裡也看不到這些 issue。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>現行 UI 叫 work item security scheme。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-issue-security-schemes/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-quick-filters/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.4-e09","sec":"620.2.4","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit.\nChiara opens the WAVE board and selects both the Mobile and the Web quick filters. Which issues does the board display?","zh":"請看圖。Chiara 打開 WAVE board，同時選取 Mobile 與 Web 兩個 quick filter。Board 會顯示哪些 issue？","zo":["Component 是 Mobile 或 Web 的 issue","Board 上所有 issue，因為兩個 quick filter 會互相抵消","只有同時掛著 Mobile 與 Web 兩個 component 的 issue","完全沒有 issue，即使某個 issue 同時有兩個 component"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 290\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Quick Filters\"><rect x=\"0.5\" y=\"0.5\" width=\"379\" height=\"289\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"380\" height=\"34\" rx=\"0\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"34\" width=\"106\" height=\"256\" rx=\"0\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><line x1=\"106\" y1=\"34\" x2=\"106\" y2=\"290\" class=\"gl\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Board settings</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Quick Filters</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Name / JQL</text><line x1=\"118\" y1=\"119\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"119\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"118\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Only My Issues</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">assignee = currentUser()</text><line x1=\"118\" y1=\"145\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"145\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"118\" y=\"137\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Recently Updated</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"137\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">updatedDate &gt;= -1d</text><line x1=\"118\" y1=\"171\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"171\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"118\" y=\"163\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Mobile</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"163\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">component = Mobile</text><line x1=\"118\" y1=\"197\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"197\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"118\" y=\"189\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Web</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"189\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">component = Web</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">General</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"80\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Columns</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"106\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Swimlanes</text><rect x=\"6\" y=\"117\" width=\"94\" height=\"22\" rx=\"6\" class=\"sf-brand\"/><text x=\"14\" y=\"132\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Quick filters</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"158\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Card colors</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"184\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Card layout</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"210\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Estimation</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"236\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Working days</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"262\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Issue detail</text></svg>","opts":["Issues whose component is Mobile or Web","All issues on the board, because the two quick filters cancel each other out","Only issues that have both Mobile and Web as components","No issues at all, even if an issue has both components"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。多個 quick filter 同時選取時是 AND，不是 OR。要看 Mobile 或 Web，應建一個 quick filter 寫 <code>component in (Mobile, Web)</code>。","B":"錯。Quick filter 不會互相抵消；每多選一個，條件就多一層，結果只會更少，不會回到全部。","C":"對。同時選取的 quick filter 會用 AND 串起來，變成 component = Mobile AND component = Web；只有同時掛兩個 component 的 issue 會符合。","D":"錯。AND 不等於一定是空的。Component 可以多值，同時掛 Mobile 與 Web 的 issue 兩個條件都成立，就會顯示。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-quick-filters/","https://jira.atlassian.com/browse/JRACLOUD-85787"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.4-e10","sec":"620.2.4","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Mateo is a board administrator of the ORCA Kanban board, whose saved filter is <code>project = ORCA ORDER BY Rank ASC</code>. He owns the filter. Teammates want this board to include LYNX issues as well, and they want a one-click way to see only the LYNX issues. What should Mateo do?","zh":"Mateo 是 ORCA Kanban board 的 board administrator，這個 board 的 saved filter 是 <code>project = ORCA ORDER BY Rank ASC</code>，filter 是他建立的。隊友希望這個 board 也納入 LYNX 的 issue，並且能一鍵只看 LYNX 的 issue。Mateo 該怎麼做？","zo":["修改 board filter 讓它同時包含 ORCA 與 LYNX，再加一個 quick filter <code>project = LYNX</code>。","加一個 quick filter <code>project = LYNX</code>；quick filter 可以撈進 board filter 以外 project 的 issue。","加一個 Kanban board sub-filter <code>project in (ORCA, LYNX)</code>，讓 board 也撈進 LYNX 的 issue。","把 board 的 location 改到 LYNX project，讓它的 issue 可以出現在 board 上。"],"fig":"","opts":["Edit the board filter so that it includes both ORCA and LYNX, and then add a quick filter <code>project = LYNX</code>.","Add a quick filter <code>project = LYNX</code>; quick filters can bring in issues from projects outside the board filter.","Add a Kanban board sub-filter <code>project in (ORCA, LYNX)</code> so that the board also pulls in LYNX issues.","Change the board's location to the LYNX project so that its issues become available to the board."],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。Quick filter 只能在 board filter 的結果裡再篩，所以要先把 LYNX 納入 board filter，再建 quick filter，讓大家一按就只看 LYNX。Mateo 是 filter 擁有者，可以直接改 JQL。","B":"錯。Quick filter 是在 board 既有的 issue 裡「further filter」，board filter 沒撈到的 LYNX issue 不會因此出現，結果會是空的。","C":"錯。Sub-filter 是第二層，只會縮小 board filter 的結果，不能把 LYNX 加進來；而且它會影響所有人，不是可切換的按鈕。","D":"錯。Board location 只決定 board 掛在哪個 project 或個人名下，不會改變 saved filter。Board 顯示哪些 issue 只由 board filter（JQL）決定，所以顯示的 issue 不變。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-quick-filters/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/add-a-sub-filter-to-a-company-managed-kanban-board/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/change-the-location-of-a-board/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-filters/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.4-e11","sec":"620.2.4","dom":"620.2","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Kwame is a developer on the company-managed project SPARK. He wants a new quick filter on the SPARK board, but the Quick Filters tab is not available to him. Which two users can add the quick filter? (Choose two.)","zh":"Kwame 是 company-managed project SPARK 的開發人員。他想在 SPARK board 上新增一個 quick filter，但他看不到 Quick Filters 分頁。哪兩種使用者可以新增這個 quick filter？（選兩個。）","zo":["在 SPARK 有 Browse Projects 權限的任何使用者","SPARK board 的 board administrator","Board 的 saved filter 的擁有者，但他既不是 board administrator 也不是 project administrator","SPARK（board 所在 project）的 project administrator","SPARK 的 Developers project role 裡的任何成員"],"fig":"","opts":["Any user who has the Browse Projects permission in SPARK","A board administrator of the SPARK board","The owner of the board's saved filter who is neither a board administrator nor a project administrator","A project administrator of SPARK, the project where the board is located","Any member of the Developers project role in SPARK"],"ans":"BD","why":{"A":"錯。Browse Projects 只讓人能看到 project 與 board，不能改 board 設定。Quick filter 的管理需要管理者身分。","B":"對。官方說設定 board 與其任何設定（包括 quick filter）必須是 board admin 或該 board 所在位置的 project admin，board admin 是其一。","C":"錯。擁有 saved filter 只代表能改 filter 的 JQL，不等於能改 board 設定；quick filter 屬於 board 設定，需要 board admin 或 project admin。","D":"對。官方列出的另一種身分是 board 所在位置（location）那個 project 的 project admin，他也能設定 board，包括新增、編輯、刪除和排序 quick filter。","E":"錯。Developers 角色通常只有處理 issue 的權限，不會因此成為 board admin 或 project admin，所以不能管理 quick filter。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>新版 board 把 quick filter 改叫 custom filter，入口在 More actions → Manage custom filters，權限要求相同。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-quick-filters/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-a-company-managed-board/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.4-e12","sec":"620.2.4","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Beatriz wants a quick filter on the GLOW board that shows only issues assigned to members of the <code>falcon-devs</code> group. Which JQL should she use?","zh":"Beatriz 想在 GLOW board 上建一個 quick filter，只顯示指派給 <code>falcon-devs</code> 群組成員的 issue。她該用哪一段 JQL？","zo":["<code>assignee = membersOf(\"falcon-devs\")</code>","<code>group = \"falcon-devs\"</code>","<code>assignee in currentUser(\"falcon-devs\")</code>","<code>assignee in membersOf(\"falcon-devs\")</code>"],"fig":"","opts":["<code>assignee = membersOf(\"falcon-devs\")</code>","<code>group = \"falcon-devs\"</code>","<code>assignee in currentUser(\"falcon-devs\")</code>","<code>assignee in membersOf(\"falcon-devs\")</code>"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。membersOf() 回傳的是一群使用者，官方列出它不支援 = 運算子，只支援 IN、NOT IN 等，這樣寫會出錯。","B":"錯。JQL 沒有叫 group 的欄位可以直接比對群組；要用 assignee 搭配 membersOf() 函式才能找群組成員。","C":"錯。currentUser() 只代表目前登入的使用者，不接受群組名稱當參數，也無法列出整個群組的成員。","D":"對。官方 quick filter 範例就是 <code>assignee in membersOf(\"bugfix\")</code>。membersOf() 會回傳群組的所有成員，搭配 IN 運算子，就能只顯示指派給這些成員的 issue。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-quick-filters/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/jql-functions/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.4-e13","sec":"620.2.4","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Dmitri is a board administrator of the company-managed Kanban board FERN. A few abandoned stories sat In Progress for months before being moved back to the backlog, so they distort the Control Chart. He labeled them <code>outlier</code>. He wants the Control Chart to exclude them, but the board itself must keep showing every issue by default. What should he do?","zh":"Dmitri 是 company-managed Kanban board FERN 的 board administrator。有幾張被放棄的 story 在 In Progress 停了好幾個月才被移回 backlog，扭曲了 Control Chart。他替這些 issue 加上 <code>outlier</code> 標籤。他希望 Control Chart 排除它們，但 board 本身預設仍要顯示每一個 issue。他該怎麼做？","zo":["建一個 quick filter <code>labels is EMPTY OR labels not in (outlier)</code>，在 refine Control Chart 時選取它。","在 Kanban board sub-filter 加上 <code>AND (labels is EMPTY OR labels not in (outlier))</code>。","修改 board 的 saved filter，排除標了 <code>outlier</code> 的 issue。","把 Hide completed work items older than 設成 1 週，讓舊的 outlier 從圖上消失。"],"fig":"","opts":["Create a quick filter <code>labels is EMPTY OR labels not in (outlier)</code> and select it when refining the Control Chart.","Add <code>AND (labels is EMPTY OR labels not in (outlier))</code> to the Kanban board sub-filter.","Edit the board's saved filter to exclude issues labeled <code>outlier</code>.","Set Hide completed work items older than to 1 week so that old outliers drop out of the chart."],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。官方 Control Chart 頁就建議用 quick filter 排除 outlier，再在 Refine report 選它。Quick filter 平常不勾就不影響 board，只在報表需要時套用。","B":"錯。Sub-filter 是 board 設定，改了之後所有人打開 board 都看不到這些 issue，違反「board 預設要顯示每一個 issue」。","C":"錯。改 saved filter 會把 outlier 從 board、backlog 與所有用這份 filter 的 board 全部移除，影響範圍太大。","D":"錯。Hide completed 只藏 Done 類別的已完成卡，而且只看時間；這些 story 被移回 backlog，不在 Done 類別，不會被藏。它也只影響 board 顯示，不是報表的篩選工具。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-control-chart/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-quick-filters/"],"lvl":3,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.4-e14","sec":"620.2.4","dom":"620.2","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Rafael owns a saved filter that returns issues from two company-managed projects, NOVA and PULSE. He creates a Kanban board and chooses Board from an existing Saved Filter. Which two statements about the new board are true? (Choose two.)","zh":"Rafael 擁有一份 saved filter，會撈出兩個 company-managed project：NOVA 與 PULSE 的 issue。他建立一個 Kanban board，並選擇 Board from an existing Saved Filter。關於這個新 board，哪兩個敘述正確？（選兩個。）","zo":["它會變成位於 NOVA project 裡的 team-managed board。","在 Rafael 把其他人加為 board administrator 之前，只有他能打開這個 board。","所有能看到這份 saved filter、而且能瀏覽這些 project 的使用者，都能使用這個 board。","它只能顯示兩個 project 其中一個，也就是被選為 location 的那一個。","它是 company-managed board，會同時顯示兩個 project 的 issue。"],"fig":"","opts":["It becomes a team-managed board that is located inside the NOVA project.","Only Rafael can open it until he adds other users as board administrators.","It is available to all users who can view the saved filter and browse the projects.","It can show issues from only one of the two projects, whichever is chosen as the location.","It is a company-managed board that displays issues from both projects."],"ans":"CE","why":{"A":"錯。用 Board from an existing Saved Filter 建出來的是 company-managed board；team-managed 的 board 沒有 board filter，也撈不到別的 project 的 issue。","B":"錯。Board admin 決定誰能改設定，不決定誰能看。能不能看 board 取決於 saved filter 的分享對象與 project 權限。","C":"對。官方說新 board 對所有能存取所選 filter 的使用者開放；同時他們也要有 board 上各 project 的 Browse Projects 權限。","D":"錯。Location 只決定 board 掛在哪裡，不會限制內容；board 顯示什麼由 saved filter 的 JQL 決定，兩個 project 都會出現。","E":"對。官方說從 filter 建 board，建立的是能顯示多個 project 工作項目的 company-managed board；board 的範圍就是這份 filter 的 JQL，所以 NOVA 與 PULSE 都會出現。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>現行 UI 把 issue 改叫 work item、project 改叫 space；題目沿用考試時代的名詞。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/create-a-board-based-on-filters/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-a-company-managed-board/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/change-the-location-of-a-board/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.4-e15","sec":"620.2.4","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"The SOLA team uses a company-managed Kanban board with default settings. After Nadia releases version 3.2 with the Release button, all issues in that version disappear from the board, although they still exist in the project. What is the most likely cause?","zh":"SOLA 團隊使用一個維持預設設定的 company-managed Kanban board。Nadia 用 Release 按鈕發布 3.2 版後，該版本的所有 issue 都從 board 上消失了，但它們仍在 project 裡。最可能的原因是什麼？","zo":["Hide completed work items older than 會立刻移除任何屬於已發布版本的 issue。","發布版本會把其中的 issue 封存，只有管理員還找得到。","Board 預設的 Kanban sub-filter 會排除 fix version 已發布的 issue。","Release 按鈕會修改 board 的 saved filter，把 3.2 版排除。"],"fig":"","opts":["Hide completed work items older than immediately removes any issue that belongs to a released version.","Releasing a version archives its issues, so only administrators can still find them.","The board's default Kanban sub-filter excludes issues whose fix version has been released.","The Release button edits the board's saved filter to exclude version 3.2."],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。Hide completed 只看已完成多久（1、2、4 週），跟版本有沒有 release 無關，也不會「立刻」藏卡。","B":"錯。Release 只是把版本標成已發布，不會封存 issue；題目也說 issue 仍在 project 裡，一般使用者照樣搜得到。","C":"對。Kanban board 預設的 sub-filter 是 <code>fixVersion in unreleasedVersions() OR fixVersion is EMPTY</code>。版本一按 Release，裡面的 issue 既不屬於未發布版本、fix version 也不是空的，就被篩出 board。","D":"錯。Release 不會修改任何 saved filter；board filter 沒變，是 sub-filter 這第二層把已發布版本的 issue 篩掉。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira/kb/kanban-board-shows-or-hides-completed-work-unexpectedly-in-jira-cloud/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/add-a-sub-filter-to-a-company-managed-kanban-board/","https://confluence.atlassian.com/jirasoftwareserver/configuring-filters-938845268.html"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.4-e16","sec":"620.2.4","dom":"620.2","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"The RIVET Scrum board and the OPS Kanban board both use the saved filter \"Platform issues\". Sofia owns the filter and is a board administrator of both boards. From the RIVET board settings, she selects Edit Filter Query, adds <code>AND labels = sre</code>, and saves the filter. Which two results should she expect? (Choose two.)","zh":"RIVET Scrum board 和 OPS Kanban board 都使用名為「Platform issues」的 saved filter。Sofia 是這份 filter 的擁有者，也是兩個 board 的 board administrator。她在 RIVET 的 board 設定裡選 Edit Filter Query，加上 <code>AND labels = sre</code> 並存檔。她應該預期哪兩個結果？（選兩個。）","zo":["OPS Kanban board 現在也只顯示標了 sre 的 issue。","只有 RIVET board 會改變，因為每個 board 都保有自己的一份 filter。","沒有 sre 標籤的 issue 會被移到封存區，直到加上標籤為止。","其他使用者在清除自己的 quick filter 之前，仍看到舊的範圍。","RIVET 的 backlog 不再列出沒有 sre 標籤的 issue。"],"fig":"","opts":["The OPS Kanban board now also shows only issues labeled sre.","Only the RIVET board changes, because each board keeps its own copy of the filter.","Issues without the sre label are moved to an archive until the label is added.","Other users keep seeing the old scope until they clear their quick filters.","The RIVET backlog no longer lists issues that lack the sre label."],"ans":"AE","why":{"A":"對。兩個 board 指向同一份 saved filter，Edit Filter Query 改的是 filter 本身，所以 OPS board 也跟著縮小。官方在 Add Rank 也提醒會影響所有用這份 filter 的 board。","B":"錯。Board 不會複製一份 filter，而是直接引用 saved filter；要只改一個 board，得 Save as 新 filter 再讓那個 board 改用它。","C":"錯。Board filter 只決定 board 顯示哪些 issue，不會移動或封存 issue；沒有 sre 標籤的 issue 仍在 project 裡。","D":"錯。Quick filter 的勾選和 board 範圍無關；filter 存檔後，每個人打開 board 都立即使用新範圍。","E":"對。Scrum board 的 backlog 和 active sprint 畫面用的是同一個 board filter；filter 範圍縮小後，沒有 sre 標籤的 issue 也會一起從 backlog 消失，不會只改 board 欄位畫面。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/edit-a-board-filter-on-a-company-managed-board/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/enable-ranking/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-a-company-managed-board/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.4-e17","sec":"620.2.4","dom":"620.2","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Leilani is a project administrator of the team-managed project KOA. A colleague tells her to \"just add a sub-filter\" to the KOA board. Which two statements about filtering in team-managed projects are true? (Choose two.)","zh":"Leilani 是 team-managed project KOA 的 project administrator。一位同事叫她「在 KOA board 加個 sub-filter 就好」。關於 team-managed project 的篩選，哪兩個敘述正確？（選兩個。）","zo":["KOA board 在 Project settings &gt; Board 下有 Kanban board sub-filter，和 company-managed board 一樣。","Custom filter 用 JQL 定義，而且限定單一 project。","身為 project administrator，Leilani 可以為 board 與 backlog 建立、編輯、刪除 custom filter。","Custom filter 可以把另一個 team-managed project 的 issue 加到 KOA board。","KOA 的額外 board 可以直接從 KOA 的 project 側邊欄建立，不需要 saved filter。"],"fig":"","opts":["The KOA board has a Kanban board sub-filter under Project settings &gt; Board, just like company-managed boards.","Custom filters are defined with JQL and are limited to a single project.","As a project administrator, Leilani can create, edit, and delete custom filters for the board and backlog.","A custom filter can add issues from another team-managed project to the KOA board.","Additional boards for KOA can be created directly from the KOA project sidebar without a saved filter."],"ans":"BC","why":{"A":"錯。Sub-filter 只有 company-managed Kanban board 有；team-managed board 沒有這個設定。常見誤解：以為 TMP Kanban 也有 sub-filter。","B":"對。官方說 custom filter 是用 JQL 定義、可重複使用的查詢，只套用在 board 與 backlog，而且限定單一 project。它的角色接近 CMP 的 quick filter，不是 sub-filter。","C":"對。官方說 project admin 可以管理 custom filter，入口是 board 或 backlog 的 More actions → Manage custom filters，也可以從 Project settings → Board → Custom filters 進去。","D":"錯。Custom filter 限定單一 project，只能在 KOA 自己的 issue 裡篩選，無法把別的 project 的 issue 帶進來。","E":"錯。官方說 team-managed project 不支援在 project 內直接建立額外 board，要另外建 board 就得從 saved filter 建立。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>現行 UI 把 project 改叫 space，Project settings 改叫 Space settings。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/manage-custom-filters-in-team-managed-projects/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/create-a-board-based-on-filters/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/add-a-sub-filter-to-a-company-managed-kanban-board/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.5-e01","sec":"620.2.5","dom":"620.2","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"The FERN team's company-managed Scrum board uses Story Points as the estimation statistic, and Time tracking is set to None. On day 4 of the sprint, Luca adds two sub-tasks to a story that is already in the sprint and enters 3 story points on each sub-task. Ines, the product owner, notices that the story point total on the burndown chart has not changed. Which two statements are true? (Choose two.)","zh":"FERN 團隊的 company-managed Scrum board 用 Story Points 當 estimation statistic，Time tracking 設成 None。Sprint 第 4 天，Luca 在一張已經在 sprint 裡的 story 下加了兩張 sub-task，並在每張 sub-task 上各填 3 個 story points。Product owner Ines 發現 burndown chart 上的 story point 總量沒有變。哪兩個敘述正確？（選兩個）","zo":["加這些 sub-task 仍然算 scope change，只是 burndown 不會標示出來","Sub-task 上的 6 個 story points 會自動加到 parent story 的估算","這些 sub-task 不算 scope change，因為 parent story 在 sprint 開始時就已經承諾了","等 sub-task 完成後，它們的 story points 就會算進 velocity chart","填在 sub-task 上的 story points 不會計入 burndown chart，也不會計入 velocity chart"],"fig":"","opts":["Adding the sub-tasks is still treated as a scope change, even though the burndown does not indicate it","The 6 story points on the sub-tasks are automatically added to the parent story's estimate","The sub-tasks are not a scope change, because the parent story was committed at sprint start","The sub-tasks' story points will be counted in the velocity chart once the sub-tasks are done","Story points entered on sub-tasks are not included in the burndown chart or the velocity chart"],"ans":"AE","why":{"A":"對。官方寫明：沒開 Remaining Estimate and Time Spent 時，替 active sprint 裡的 issue 加 sub-task「also treated as scope change」，只是 burndown 不標示。常見誤解：圖上沒畫就等於沒記。","B":"錯。Jira 不會把 sub-task 的 story points 加到 parent；會捲到 parent 的只有開了 Remaining Estimate and Time Spent 時的剩餘工時，點數不會捲。","C":"錯。Parent 在 sprint 開始時就被承諾，不影響判斷；官方規則是替 active sprint 裡的 issue 加 sub-task 就算 scope change。","D":"錯。Velocity chart 只算 parent 的估算，官方說 sub-task 的 estimates 不計入；sub-task 完成時也不會把點數加進 velocity。","E":"對。官方 burndown 頁說 sub-task 上的 Story Points 不計入，只算 parent；velocity 頁也說 sub-task 的估算不計入。所以填了 6 點，兩張圖的總量都不會變。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-burndown-chart/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-velocity-chart/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.5-e02","sec":"620.2.5","dom":"620.2","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. Tane is the board administrator of the KORU Scrum board and saved the estimation settings shown. On day 5 of the sprint, a developer creates a sub-task with a 6h estimate under KORU-41, a story that is already in the active sprint. Which two statements are true? (Choose two.)","zh":"請看圖。Tane 是 KORU Scrum board 的 board administrator，儲存了圖中的 estimation 設定。Sprint 第 5 天，一位開發者在 KORU-41 底下建立一張估 6h 的 sub-task；KORU-41 是一張已經在 active sprint 裡的 story。哪兩個敘述正確？（選兩個）","zo":["新 sub-task 上填的 story points 會加進這個 sprint 的 velocity","因為 KORU-41 在 active sprint 裡，這張 sub-task 會被視為 scope change","Sub-task 的剩餘估時會分開追蹤，不影響 KORU-41","因為已儲存的 Time tracking 設定，這個 scope change 會出現在 burndown 上","這不算 scope change，因為 sprint 開始時 KORU-41 就已經承諾了"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 290\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"KORU board 的 Estimation 設定：Story Points，Time tracking 選 Remaining Estimate and Time Spent\"><rect x=\"0.5\" y=\"0.5\" width=\"379\" height=\"289\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"380\" height=\"34\" rx=\"0\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"34\" width=\"106\" height=\"256\" rx=\"0\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><line x1=\"106\" y1=\"34\" x2=\"106\" y2=\"290\" class=\"gl\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Board settings · KORU board</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Estimation</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Estimation statistic</text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"95\" width=\"250\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"128\" y=\"113\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Story Points</text><path d=\"M350,106 l5,5 l5,-5\" class=\"ln ink\" style=\"stroke-width:1.6\"/><text x=\"118\" y=\"144\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Time tracking</text><circle cx=\"125\" cy=\"157\" r=\"7\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"140\" y=\"161\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">None</text><circle cx=\"125\" cy=\"178\" r=\"7\" class=\"bx\"/><circle cx=\"125\" cy=\"178\" r=\"3.5\" class=\"fl-brand\"/><text x=\"140\" y=\"182\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Remaining Estimate and Time Spent</text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"200\" width=\"46.0\" height=\"26\" rx=\"6\" class=\"fl-brand\"/><text x=\"141.0\" y=\"217\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"w\">Save</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">General</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"80\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Columns</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"106\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Swimlanes</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"132\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Quick filters</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"158\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Card colors</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"184\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Card layout</text><rect x=\"6\" y=\"195\" width=\"94\" height=\"22\" rx=\"6\" class=\"sf-brand\"/><text x=\"14\" y=\"210\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Estimation</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"236\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Working days</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"262\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Issue detail</text></svg>","opts":["Story points entered on the new sub-task will be added to the sprint's velocity","The sub-task is treated as a scope change because KORU-41 is in the active sprint","The sub-task's remaining estimate is tracked separately and does not affect KORU-41","Because of the saved Time tracking setting, the scope change appears on the burndown","It is not a scope change, because KORU-41 was already committed at sprint start"],"ans":"BD","why":{"A":"錯。Velocity chart 只加總 parent 的估算，官方原句說 sub-task 的 estimates 不計入 velocity，填了也不會加上去。","B":"對。在 active sprint 的 issue 下加 sub-task，不論 Time tracking 怎麼設都視為 scope change。這題 board 開了 Remaining Estimate and Time Spent，一樣成立。","C":"錯。「各自追蹤、不捲到 parent」是 Time tracking 為 None 時的行為；圖中開了 Remaining Estimate and Time Spent，sub-task 的剩餘工時會捲到 parent。","D":"對。開了 Remaining Estimate and Time Spent 時，官方說這個 scope change「also indicated in the Burndown Chart」。常見誤解：以為 sub-task 永遠不會出現在 burndown。","E":"錯。Parent 早在 sprint 裡不影響判斷；官方規則是替 active sprint 裡的 issue 加 sub-task 就算 scope change。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>考試寫 Estimation statistic；現行 Board settings → Estimation 的下拉選單叫 Estimation method，功能相同。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-burndown-chart/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-velocity-chart/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.5-e03","sec":"620.2.5","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Farid is preparing a cheat sheet for new scrum masters on how sub-tasks affect the burndown chart of a company-managed Scrum board. Which statement is NOT true?","zh":"Farid 在替新手 scrum master 整理小抄，說明 sub-task 如何影響 company-managed Scrum board 的 burndown chart。哪一個敘述不正確？","zo":["填在 sub-task 上的 story points 不會計入 burndown chart","開了 Remaining Estimate and Time Spent 時，sub-task 的剩餘估時會捲到 parent","沒開 Remaining Estimate and Time Spent 時，時間估算在每張 sub-task 與 parent 本身上各自追蹤","在 active sprint 的 issue 下加 sub-task，只有在開了 Remaining Estimate and Time Spent 時才算 scope change"],"fig":"","opts":["Story points entered on sub-tasks are not included in the burndown chart","When Remaining Estimate and Time Spent is enabled, the remaining estimates of sub-tasks roll up to the parent","When Remaining Estimate and Time Spent is disabled, time estimates are tracked individually on each sub-task and on the parent issue itself","Adding a sub-task to an issue in an active sprint counts as a scope change only when Remaining Estimate and Time Spent is enabled"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"正確敘述（不選）。官方 burndown 頁寫明 sub-task 上的 Story Points 不計入，只算 parent 上的 Story Points。","B":"正確敘述（不選）。開了 Remaining Estimate and Time Spent 時，sub-task 的剩餘估時會捲到 parent，parent 會帶著所有 sub-task 剩餘估時的總和。","C":"正確敘述（不選）。沒開 Remaining Estimate and Time Spent 時，官方說時間估算在 sub-task 與 parent 上各自追蹤，不會捲上去。","D":"錯誤敘述（要選）。不論有沒有開 time tracking，加 sub-task 都算 scope change；開關只決定 burndown 畫不畫得出來。常見誤解：把「看不到」當成「不算」。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-burndown-chart/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/estimate-an-issue/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.5-e04","sec":"620.2.5","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Nadia is the scrum master of the PAVO team. Their company-managed Scrum board estimates in Story Points with Time tracking set to None. Developers often split stories into sub-tasks mid-sprint, and Nadia wants these additions to be visible as scope changes on the burndown chart. What should the board administrator do?","zh":"Nadia 是 PAVO 團隊的 scrum master。他們的 company-managed Scrum board 用 Story Points 估算，Time tracking 設成 None。開發者常在 sprint 中途把 story 拆成 sub-task，Nadia 希望這些新增的工作能在 burndown chart 上顯示成 scope change。Board administrator 該怎麼做？","zo":["把 estimation statistic 改成 Issue Count，讓每張新的 sub-task 都算進 burndown","請團隊替 sprint 中建立的每張 sub-task 都填 story points","在 Board settings &gt; Estimation 把 Time tracking 設成 Remaining Estimate and Time Spent","請 Jira administrator 在全站的 Time tracking 設定裡開啟 time tracking"],"fig":"","opts":["Change the estimation statistic to Issue Count so that every new sub-task is counted on the burndown","Ask the team to enter story points on every sub-task they create during the sprint","In Board settings &gt; Estimation, set Time tracking to Remaining Estimate and Time Spent","Ask a Jira administrator to turn on time tracking in the global Time tracking settings"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。Issue Count 只是換一種估算單位；官方說 Time tracking 沒開時，sub-task 的 scope change 不會標在 burndown，換單位解決不了。","B":"錯。Sub-task 上的 story points 本來就不計入 burndown，填了也不會讓 scope change 出現在圖上。","C":"對。官方寫明開了 Remaining Estimate and Time Spent 後，加 sub-task 的 scope change 會標在 burndown。這是 board 層級的設定，board admin 就能改。","D":"錯。Time tracking 在 Jira Cloud 預設就開著，不必請 Jira admin 打開；burndown 用不用剩餘工時，是每張 board 在 Estimation 頁的設定。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>考試寫 Estimation statistic；現行 Board settings → Estimation 的下拉選單叫 Estimation method，功能相同。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-burndown-chart/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-estimation-and-tracking/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-time-tracking/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.5-e05","sec":"620.2.5","dom":"620.2","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Wei Ling administers the SOLA company-managed Scrum board. The team wants to keep estimating stories in story points so that velocity stays comparable across sprints, but during each sprint they want the burndown to track progress by the hours they log. Which two settings should she select in Board settings &gt; Estimation? (Choose two.)","zh":"Wei Ling 管理 SOLA 的 company-managed Scrum board。團隊想繼續用 story points 估 story，讓 velocity 能跨 sprint 比較；但在每個 sprint 進行中，他們希望 burndown 依照記錄的工時來追蹤進度。她在 Board settings &gt; Estimation 應該選哪兩個設定？（選兩個）","zo":["Estimation statistic：Story Points","Time tracking：None","Estimation statistic：Original Time Estimate","Time tracking：Remaining Estimate and Time Spent","Estimation statistic：Issue Count"],"fig":"","opts":["Estimation statistic: Story Points","Time tracking: None","Estimation statistic: Original Time Estimate","Time tracking: Remaining Estimate and Time Spent","Estimation statistic: Issue Count"],"ans":"AD","why":{"A":"對。Estimation statistic 決定估算單位，velocity chart 的縱軸就是這個 statistic；保留 Story Points，velocity 的單位不變，才能和過去的 sprint 放在一起比較。","B":"錯。選 None 代表沿用 estimation statistic 來追蹤進度，burndown 會繼續用 story points，不會反映記錄的工時。","C":"錯。Original Time Estimate 會把估算單位改成時間，velocity 也跟著變成時間，就不能和過去用點數的 sprint 比較了。","D":"對。官方說很多團隊用兩種方法：一種估算、一種追蹤進度；選 Remaining Estimate and Time Spent 就是用記錄的工時從估時中扣掉來追蹤。","E":"錯。Issue Count 是用張數估算，既不是點數也不是工時，兩個需求都不符合。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>考試寫 Estimation statistic；現行 Board settings → Estimation 的下拉選單叫 Estimation method，功能相同。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-estimation-and-tracking/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-velocity-chart/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.5-e06","sec":"620.2.5","dom":"620.2","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Chidi is working on BRIX-88, an issue in the active sprint of the BRIX team's company-managed Scrum board. At the end of the day he selects Log work on the issue. Which two values can he enter in the Log work dialog? (Choose two.)","zh":"Chidi 正在處理 BRIX-88，這張 issue 在 BRIX 團隊 company-managed Scrum board 的 active sprint 裡。下班前他在這張 issue 上選了 Log work。他可以在這個 Log work 視窗裡填哪兩個值？（選兩個）","zo":["Story points","Work ratio","Time spent","Original estimate","Time remaining"],"fig":"","opts":["Story points","Work ratio","Time spent","Original estimate","Time remaining"],"ans":"CE","why":{"A":"錯。Story points 是 estimation statistic 的一種，不是 time tracking 欄位，也不在 Log work 視窗裡。常見誤解：把點數當成工時欄位。","B":"錯。Work ratio 是 Jira 用 Time spent ÷ Original estimate 自動算出的百分比，可以用 JQL 查，但不能手動填，Log work 視窗裡沒有這一欄。","C":"對。Log work 就是記錄這次花了多少時間，會累加到 Time spent。Time tracking 三個欄位是 Original estimate、Remaining estimate、Time spent。","D":"錯。Original estimate 是開工前填的估時，在 issue 的估算欄位設定；Log work 視窗只處理這次花費與剩餘時間。","E":"對。官方步驟是「Enter your time spent and time remaining」，記工時時可以一併調整剩餘時間，也就是 Remaining estimate；它是 time tracking 三個欄位之一。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>現行 UI 的 Log work 也可以直接點 issue 上的 Time tracking 欄位打開，視窗內容相同。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/estimate-an-issue/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/log-time-on-an-issue/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/jql-fields/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.5-e07","sec":"620.2.5","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Bongani, a team lead in project QUILL, wants a filter that returns every issue on which more than 8 hours of work have already been logged, regardless of how much work is left. Which JQL query meets the requirement?","zh":"Bongani 是 project QUILL 的 team lead，他想要一個 filter，列出所有「已經記錄超過 8 小時工時」的 issue，不管還剩多少工作。哪一個 JQL 符合需求？","zo":["<code>project = QUILL AND timeSpent &gt; 8h</code>","<code>project = QUILL AND remainingEstimate &gt; 8h</code>","<code>project = QUILL AND originalEstimate &gt; 8h</code>","<code>project = QUILL AND \"Story Points\" &gt; 8</code>"],"fig":"","opts":["<code>project = QUILL AND timeSpent &gt; 8h</code>","<code>project = QUILL AND remainingEstimate &gt; 8h</code>","<code>project = QUILL AND originalEstimate &gt; 8h</code>","<code>project = QUILL AND \"Story Points\" &gt; 8</code>"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。<code>timeSpent</code> 就是 Time spent 欄位，存的是已經 log 的總工時，可以用 &gt; 搭配 w、d、h、m 單位比較，查的是實際記錄的工時。","B":"錯。<code>remainingEstimate</code> 是 Remaining estimate，代表「還剩多少」，不是已經花了多少；題目要求不管剩多少。","C":"錯。<code>originalEstimate</code> 是開工前填的 Original estimate，屬於計畫值，不會因為有人 log work 而增加，找不到實際花掉的工時。","D":"錯。Story Points 是估點用的數字欄位，不是 time tracking 欄位，跟實際記錄的工時無關。常見誤解：把點數當工時。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/jql-fields/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.5-e08","sec":"620.2.5","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Sunita is a Jira administrator. The company-managed Scrum board for project MPL uses Original Time Estimate as its estimation statistic, but users report that they cannot enter an original estimate when they create issues in MPL. What should Sunita do?","zh":"Sunita 是 Jira administrator。Project MPL 的 company-managed Scrum board 用 Original Time Estimate 當 estimation statistic，但使用者反映在 MPL 建立 issue 時無法填 original estimate。Sunita 該怎麼做？","zo":["把 board 的 Time tracking 設定改成 Remaining Estimate and Time Spent","在 MPL 的 permission scheme 裡把 Work On Issues 權限給這些使用者","把 Story Points 欄位加到 MPL 使用的建立 issue 畫面","把 Time tracking 欄位加到 MPL 使用的建立 issue 畫面"],"fig":"","opts":["Change the board's Time tracking setting to Remaining Estimate and Time Spent","Grant the Work On Issues permission to the users in the MPL permission scheme","Add the Story Points field to the create issue screen used by MPL","Add the Time tracking field to the create issue screen used by MPL"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。Board 的 Time tracking 只決定 burndown 用不用剩餘工時追蹤進度，不會把欄位放到建立 issue 的畫面上。","B":"錯。Work On Issues 是記錄工時（log work）需要的權限；這題的問題是建立畫面上沒有可以填估時的欄位。","C":"錯。Story Points 是點數欄位，不是 Original estimate；board 用的是時間估算，放上點數欄位沒有用。","D":"對。官方說要讓使用者在建立或編輯 issue 時填 original estimate，必須把 Time Tracking 欄位加到建立與編輯用的 screen。欄位不在畫面上，就沒有地方填估時。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>現行 UI 的 permission 叫 Work On Work Items，project 叫 space。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-time-tracking/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.5-e09","sec":"620.2.5","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Mateus is the administrator of HALO, a team-managed Scrum project. Estimation has never been turned on, and the team now wants to estimate its work in hours instead of story points. What should Mateus do?","zh":"Mateus 是 team-managed Scrum project HALO 的管理者。這個 project 從來沒開過 Estimation，現在團隊想改用小時、而不是 story points 來估工作。Mateus 該怎麼做？","zo":["打開 Board settings &gt; Estimation，把 estimation statistic 設成 Original Time Estimate","打開 Project settings &gt; Features，開啟 Estimation，然後選 Time","請 Jira administrator 在全站的 Time tracking 設定裡開啟 time tracking","在每個 issue type 加上 Story point estimate 欄位，請團隊在裡面填小時數"],"fig":"","opts":["Open Board settings &gt; Estimation and set the estimation statistic to Original Time Estimate","Open Project settings &gt; Features, turn on Estimation, and select Time","Ask a Jira administrator to enable time tracking in the global Time tracking settings","Add the Story point estimate field to each issue type and ask the team to enter hours in it"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。Board settings &gt; Estimation 是 company-managed Scrum board 才有的頁面，官方說這個設定只給 company-managed scrum 團隊改。","B":"對。Team-managed project 的估算在 Project settings &gt; Features 管理：打開 Estimation，再選 Story points 或 Time。第一次開啟並選 Time 後，issue 會自動加上 Original estimate 欄位。","C":"錯。全站的 Time tracking 設定管的是每日工時、顯示格式、預設單位等；team-managed project 要不要估時是 Features 裡的開關。","D":"錯。Story point estimate 是點數欄位，拿來填小時只是把數字換個名字，報表仍把它當點數，也沒有打開 Estimation 功能。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>現行 UI 叫 Space settings &gt; Features。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-estimation-and-tracking/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/enable-estimation/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.5-e10","sec":"620.2.5","dom":"620.2","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Rafael is a project administrator for CEDR, a company-managed project with one Scrum board and one Kanban board. He is documenting the Estimation page in Board settings. Which two statements are true? (Choose two.)","zh":"Rafael 是 company-managed project CEDR 的 project administrator，這個 project 有一張 Scrum board 和一張 Kanban board。他正在整理 Board settings 裡 Estimation 頁的說明。哪兩個敘述正確？（選兩個）","zo":["Kanban board 可以用 Estimation 頁把 Control Chart 的單位選成 Story Points","Estimation 頁只能在 company-managed Scrum board 上設定","修改 estimation 設定需要 Administer Jira 這個 global permission","Team-managed project 也在同一個 Board settings 頁面設定 estimation","Board 所在位置的 project administrator 或 board administrator 都能修改"],"fig":"","opts":["The Kanban board can use the Estimation page to select Story Points as the unit for its Control Chart","The Estimation page can only be configured for company-managed Scrum boards","Changing the estimation settings requires the Administer Jira global permission","Team-managed projects configure estimation on this same Board settings page","Either a project administrator of the board's location or a board administrator can change it"],"ans":"BE","why":{"A":"錯。Kanban board 的 Board settings 裡沒有 Estimation 頁；官方寫明這個設定只能在 company-managed scrum board 上改，Kanban 無法選 statistic。","B":"對。官方原文說這個設定只能給 company-managed scrum 團隊改，所以 CEDR 只有那張 Scrum board 會有 Estimation 頁，Kanban board 沒有。","C":"錯。改 board 設定不需要 Jira admin；官方列的條件是 board 所在位置的 project admin 或這張 board 的 board admin。","D":"錯。Team-managed project 沒有 Board settings 的 Estimation 頁，要到 Project settings &gt; Features 打開 Estimation，再選 Story points 或 Time。","E":"對。官方說設定 board 需要是 board 所在位置的 project administrator，或這張 board 的 board administrator，兩者擇一即可，不需要 Jira admin。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>現行官方頁寫 space administrator，就是考試的 project administrator。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-estimation-and-tracking/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.5-e11","sec":"620.2.5","dom":"620.2","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. Aiko configured the LUMA company-managed Scrum board as shown. Which two statements about this board's reports are true? (Choose two.)","zh":"請看圖。Aiko 把 LUMA 的 company-managed Scrum board 設定成圖中的樣子。關於這張 board 的報表，哪兩個敘述正確？（選兩個）","zo":["Velocity chart 的縱軸顯示記在 Time spent 欄位裡的工時","Velocity chart 用原始估時來衡量承諾量與完成量","Sprint report 會多一條綠線，顯示 issue 上記錄的工時","Velocity chart 用每張 issue 在 sprint 結束時的剩餘估時計算","Sub-task 上填的 original estimate 會加進 parent 的 velocity"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 290\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"LUMA board 的 Estimation 設定：Original Time Estimate，Time tracking 選 Remaining Estimate and Time Spent\"><rect x=\"0.5\" y=\"0.5\" width=\"379\" height=\"289\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"380\" height=\"34\" rx=\"0\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"34\" width=\"106\" height=\"256\" rx=\"0\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><line x1=\"106\" y1=\"34\" x2=\"106\" y2=\"290\" class=\"gl\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Board settings · LUMA board</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Estimation</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Estimation statistic</text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"95\" width=\"250\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"128\" y=\"113\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Original Time Estimate</text><path d=\"M350,106 l5,5 l5,-5\" class=\"ln ink\" style=\"stroke-width:1.6\"/><text x=\"118\" y=\"144\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Time tracking</text><circle cx=\"125\" cy=\"157\" r=\"7\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"140\" y=\"161\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">None</text><circle cx=\"125\" cy=\"178\" r=\"7\" class=\"bx\"/><circle cx=\"125\" cy=\"178\" r=\"3.5\" class=\"fl-brand\"/><text x=\"140\" y=\"182\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Remaining Estimate and Time Spent</text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"200\" width=\"46.0\" height=\"26\" rx=\"6\" class=\"fl-brand\"/><text x=\"141.0\" y=\"217\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"w\">Save</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">General</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"80\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Columns</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"106\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Swimlanes</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"132\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Quick filters</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"158\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Card colors</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"184\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Card layout</text><rect x=\"6\" y=\"195\" width=\"94\" height=\"22\" rx=\"6\" class=\"sf-brand\"/><text x=\"14\" y=\"210\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Estimation</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"236\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Working days</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"262\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Issue detail</text></svg>","opts":["The velocity chart's y-axis shows the hours logged in the Time spent field","The velocity chart measures commitment and completed work in original time estimates","The sprint report shows a green line that indicates work logged on issues","The velocity chart uses the remaining estimate of each issue at the end of the sprint","Original estimates entered on sub-tasks are added to the velocity of their parent"],"ans":"BC","why":{"A":"錯。Velocity chart 的縱軸是 board 的 estimation statistic，不是 Time spent；Time tracking 的設定不會改變 velocity 的單位。","B":"對。官方說 velocity 的縱軸就是估算用的 statistic，可以是 Original time；圖中 statistic 是 Original Time Estimate，所以 Commitment 與 Completed 都用原始估時。","C":"對。官方 sprint report 頁說，board 設定成追蹤 remaining estimates and time spent 時，報表會多一條綠線，顯示 issue 上 log 的工時。","D":"錯。剩餘估時是 time tracking 用來畫 burndown 的；velocity 看的是 estimation statistic，也就是這裡的原始估時。","E":"錯。官方 velocity 頁寫明 sub-task 的估算不計入，只算 parent 上的估算，不論是點數還是時間。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>考試寫 Estimation statistic；現行 Board settings → Estimation 的下拉選單叫 Estimation method，功能相同。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-velocity-chart/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-sprint-report/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-estimation-and-tracking/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.5-e12","sec":"620.2.5","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Olumide is a developer on the OKRA team. While reviewing the burndown chart of the team's company-managed Scrum board, he switches the estimation statistic drop-down on the report from Story Points to Issue Count. What is the result?","zh":"Olumide 是 OKRA 團隊的開發者。他在看團隊 company-managed Scrum board 的 burndown chart 時，把報表上的 estimation statistic 下拉選單從 Story Points 切成 Issue Count。結果會怎樣？","zo":["Board 的 Estimation 設定對所有使用這張 board 的人都改成 Issue Count","這張 board 的 velocity chart 也會跟著切成 Issue Count","只有他自己看到的 burndown 改變，而且這個選擇會保留到他下次開啟","這個變更會被擋下來，因為只有 board administrator 能改 statistic"],"fig":"","opts":["The board's Estimation settings change to Issue Count for everyone who uses the board","The velocity chart for the board also switches to Issue Count","Only his view of the burndown changes, and the choice is saved for his next visit","The change is blocked because only a board administrator can change the statistic"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。報表上的下拉只影響檢視，不會改動 Board settings &gt; Estimation；board 的設定仍是 Story Points，其他人看到的不變。","B":"錯。Velocity chart 依 board 的 estimation statistic 決定縱軸；在 burndown 報表上切換，不會連帶改掉其他報表。","C":"對。官方說在 burndown 上選別的 estimation statistic，這個選擇會替他本人保存，下次開這張圖時沿用；board 的設定不受影響。","D":"錯。報表上的下拉是個人的檢視選擇，官方說會替使用者本人保存；需要 board admin 或 project admin 的是 Board settings 的 Estimation 設定。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-burndown-chart/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.5-e13","sec":"620.2.5","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. Zara is the board administrator of the NOVA Scrum board, which uses Original Time Estimate as the estimation statistic and Remaining Estimate and Time Spent for time tracking. NOVA-7 is the only story in sprint 12, and NOVA-12 is a sub-task created under it during the sprint. What is the total remaining time shown on the burndown chart at the end of day 4?","zh":"請看圖。Zara 是 NOVA Scrum board 的 board administrator，這張 board 用 Original Time Estimate 當 estimation statistic，time tracking 用 Remaining Estimate and Time Spent。NOVA-7 是 sprint 12 裡唯一的 story，NOVA-12 是 sprint 進行中建立在它底下的 sub-task。第 4 天結束時，burndown chart 上顯示的剩餘時間總共是多少？","zo":["10h","14h","16h","8h"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 150\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"NOVA sprint 12 事件：第 1 天 sprint 開始 NOVA-7 剩 10h；第 3 天新增 sub-task NOVA-12 估 6h；第 4 天在 NOVA-12 log 2h，剩 4h\"><rect x=\"10\" y=\"8\" width=\"300\" height=\"134\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx plain\"/><text x=\"20\" y=\"28\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\">Sprint 12 log · NOVA board</text><rect x=\"16\" y=\"39\" width=\"288\" height=\"22\" rx=\"5\" class=\"sf-gray\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Day</text><text x=\"64\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Event</text><text x=\"180\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Key</text><text x=\"298\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Remaining</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"62\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"62\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">1</text><text x=\"64\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Sprint started</text><text x=\"180\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">NOVA-7</text><text x=\"298\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"t\">10h</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"86\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"86\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">3</text><text x=\"64\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Sub-task added</text><text x=\"180\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">NOVA-12</text><text x=\"298\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"t\">6h</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"110\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"126\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">4</text><text x=\"64\" y=\"126\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Logged 2h</text><text x=\"180\" y=\"126\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">NOVA-12</text><text x=\"298\" y=\"126\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"t\">4h</text></svg>","opts":["10h","14h","16h","8h"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。10h 是把 NOVA-12 整個漏掉：沒加第 3 天的 6h，也沒扣第 4 天的 2h。開了 time tracking，sub-task 的估時會捲到 parent 並畫在 burndown 上。","B":"對。第 3 天在 active sprint 的 story 下加 sub-task 算 scope change，開了 time tracking 會畫在 burndown：10h＋6h＝16h。第 4 天 log 2h，NOVA-12 剩 4h，所以是 10h＋4h＝14h。","C":"錯。16h 只算到第 3 天的 scope change，忘了 log work 會扣剩餘時間；官方說這個設定是用 Time spent 從估時裡扣掉來追蹤進度。","D":"錯。8h 是把 NOVA-12 的 2h 從 NOVA-7 原本的 10h 扣掉，卻漏算第 3 天加進來的 6h scope change。常見誤解：以為 sub-task 不會出現在 burndown。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>考試寫 Estimation statistic；現行 Board settings → Estimation 的下拉選單叫 Estimation method，功能相同。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-burndown-chart/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-estimation-and-tracking/"],"lvl":3,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.6-e01","sec":"620.2.6","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Lumenwave runs two Scrum teams in project LUM, each with its own company-managed board. The Dubai team works Sunday to Thursday, and the Lisbon team works Monday to Friday. Yusuf, a Jira administrator, believes working days are a single site-wide setting, so one team's burndown will always look wrong. What should be done so that both teams' burndown charts skip their own days off?","zh":"Lumenwave 在 project LUM 裡有兩個 Scrum 團隊，各自有一張 company-managed board。杜拜團隊週日到週四上班，里斯本團隊週一到週五上班。Jira administrator Yusuf 認為 working days 是全站只有一份的設定，所以一定有一個團隊的 burndown 看起來不對。要讓兩個團隊的 burndown chart 都跳過自己的休息日，該怎麼做？","zo":["把全站 Time tracking 設定裡的 <b>Working days per week</b> 改成符合杜拜團隊","把杜拜團隊搬到另一個 project，因為 working days 是以 project 為單位設定","在兩個團隊各自 board 的 board settings 裡分別設定 <b>Working days</b>","請每位成員在自己的 Jira 個人 profile 設定偏好的工作日"],"fig":"","opts":["Change <b>Working days per week</b> in the global Time tracking settings to match the Dubai team","Move the Dubai team into a separate project, because working days are configured per project","Configure <b>Working days</b> separately in the board settings of each team's board","Ask each team member to set their preferred working days in their personal Jira profile settings"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。Time tracking 的 Working days per week 是全站的工時換算（1 週＝幾天），用來換算估時單位，不是報表日曆要跳過哪幾天。","B":"錯。Working days 不是 project 層級的設定，同一個 project 底下的兩張 board 本來就能各設各的，不必拆 project。","C":"對。官方說 Working days 是「your board」的設定，每張 board 各自設定工作日、非工作日與時區。常見誤解：以為它是全站設定。","D":"錯。個人 profile 只有語言、時區等個人偏好，沒有工作日設定；報表跳過哪些日子是由 board 的設定決定。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-working-days/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-time-tracking/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.6-e02","sec":"620.2.6","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. Ngozi, the board administrator of the company-managed Scrum board for project PFR, saved the working days shown. A sprint on this board runs from Monday 2026-10-05 to Friday 2026-10-16, including both dates. On how many days of this sprint will the grey guideline in the Sprint Report burn down, rather than stay flat?","zh":"請看圖。Ngozi 是 project PFR 那張 company-managed Scrum board 的 board administrator，她儲存了圖中的 working days 設定。這張 board 上有一個 sprint，從 2026-10-05（週一）到 2026-10-16（週五），頭尾兩天都算在內。在這個 sprint 裡，Sprint Report 的灰色 guideline 會有幾天往下降，而不是保持水平？","zo":["8","9","10","12"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 449\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"PFR board working days settings\"><rect x=\"0.5\" y=\"0.5\" width=\"379\" height=\"448\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"380\" height=\"34\" rx=\"0\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"34\" width=\"106\" height=\"415\" rx=\"0\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><line x1=\"106\" y1=\"34\" x2=\"106\" y2=\"449\" class=\"gl\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Board settings</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Working days</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Standard working days</text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"95\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" class=\"fl-brand\"/><path d=\"M121,102 l3,3 l5,-6\" class=\"ln\" style=\"stroke:var(--on-color);stroke-width:2\"/><text x=\"140\" y=\"106\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Monday</text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"116\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" class=\"fl-brand\"/><path d=\"M121,123 l3,3 l5,-6\" class=\"ln\" style=\"stroke:var(--on-color);stroke-width:2\"/><text x=\"140\" y=\"127\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Tuesday</text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"137\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" class=\"fl-brand\"/><path d=\"M121,144 l3,3 l5,-6\" class=\"ln\" style=\"stroke:var(--on-color);stroke-width:2\"/><text x=\"140\" y=\"148\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Wednesday</text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"158\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" class=\"fl-brand\"/><path d=\"M121,165 l3,3 l5,-6\" class=\"ln\" style=\"stroke:var(--on-color);stroke-width:2\"/><text x=\"140\" y=\"169\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Thursday</text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"179\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" class=\"fl-brand\"/><path d=\"M121,186 l3,3 l5,-6\" class=\"ln\" style=\"stroke:var(--on-color);stroke-width:2\"/><text x=\"140\" y=\"190\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Friday</text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"200\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"140\" y=\"211\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Saturday</text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"221\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"140\" y=\"232\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Sunday</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"261\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Non-working days</text><line x1=\"118\" y1=\"291\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"291\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"118\" y=\"283\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">2026-10-09</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"283\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">×</text><line x1=\"118\" y1=\"317\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"317\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"118\" y=\"309\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">2026-10-10</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"309\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">×</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"338\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Region</text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"344\" width=\"250\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"128\" y=\"362\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Asia</text><path d=\"M350,355 l5,5 l5,-5\" class=\"ln ink\" style=\"stroke-width:1.6\"/><text x=\"118\" y=\"393\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Time zone</text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"399\" width=\"250\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"128\" y=\"417\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Asia/Taipei</text><path d=\"M350,410 l5,5 l5,-5\" class=\"ln ink\" style=\"stroke-width:1.6\"/><text x=\"14\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">General</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"80\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Columns</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"106\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Swimlanes</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"132\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Quick filters</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"158\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Card colors</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"184\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Card layout</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"210\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Estimation</text><rect x=\"6\" y=\"221\" width=\"94\" height=\"22\" rx=\"6\" class=\"sf-brand\"/><text x=\"14\" y=\"236\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Working days</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"262\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Issue detail</text></svg>","opts":["8","9","10","12"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。這是把 2026-10-10 又多扣了一次。那天是週六，本來就不在 Standard working days 裡，列進 Non-working days 也不會再少一天。","B":"對。10-05 到 10-16 共有 10 個週一到週五，再扣掉列為非工作日的 10-09（週五），剩 9 天。官方說 Sprint Report 的 guideline 在非工作日保持水平。","C":"錯。10 天只算了週一到週五，漏掉 Non-working days 清單裡的 10-09（週五）。常見誤解：只看 Standard working days，忘了個別假日。","D":"錯。12 天是把整個 sprint 的日曆天全算進去，等於以為 Sprint Report 不吃 working days。常見誤解：它其實在官方 5 張報表清單裡。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-working-days/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-sprint-report/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.6-e03","sec":"620.2.6","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Haruto shows the Burndown Chart report of his team's board in a sprint review. A stakeholder compares it with the Burndown gadget for the same board on a leadership dashboard and asks whether the gadget also skips the board's non-working days. Which statement is correct?","zh":"Haruto 在 sprint review 展示團隊 board 的 Burndown Chart 報表。一位利害關係人拿它和主管 dashboard 上、同一張 board 的 Burndown gadget 比較，問 gadget 是否也會跳過這張 board 的非工作日。哪個敘述正確？","zo":["只有 Burndown Chart 報表會反映 working days；Burndown gadget 一律用日曆天計算","只有 Burndown gadget 會反映 working days，因為 dashboard gadget 讀的是全站日曆","兩者都不會反映 working days；燒盡類圖表中只有 Sprint Report 會跳過非工作日","Burndown Chart 報表與 Burndown gadget 都會反映這張 board 的 working days"],"fig":"","opts":["Only the Burndown Chart report reflects working days; the Burndown gadget always counts calendar days","Only the Burndown gadget reflects working days, because dashboard gadgets read a site-wide calendar","Neither reflects working days; among burndown-style charts, only the Sprint Report skips non-working days","Both the Burndown Chart report and the Burndown gadget reflect the board's working days"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。這只說對一半。官方清單裡報表有 Burndown Chart，gadget 也有 Burndown Gadget，兩個都會吃 working days。","B":"錯。gadget 沒有另外一份全站日曆，它用的是來源 board 的 working days；而且 Burndown Chart 報表也會吃。","C":"錯。Sprint Report 確實吃 working days，但官方清單同時列了 Burndown Chart 與 Burndown Gadget。常見誤解：以為只有 Sprint Report 會跳過非工作日。","D":"對。官方清單同時列出 Burndown Chart（報表）與 Burndown Gadget。常見誤解：以為只有報表吃、dashboard 上的 gadget 不吃。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-working-days/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.6-e04","sec":"620.2.6","dom":"620.2","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Aiko, a scrum master at Tidewell, adds a two-day company retreat as non-working days on her team's company-managed Scrum board. She wants to warn the team which reports will <b>not</b> change because of this. Which two reports are not affected by the board's working days setting? (Choose two.)","zh":"Tidewell 的 scrum master Aiko 在團隊的 company-managed Scrum board 上，把為期兩天的公司員工旅遊加為 non-working days。她想提醒團隊，哪些報表<b>不會</b>因此改變。哪兩張報表不受 board 的 working days 設定影響？（選兩個）","zo":["Burndown Chart","Release burndown","Version Report","Epic Report","Burnup report"],"fig":"","opts":["Burndown Chart","Release burndown","Version Report","Epic Report","Burnup report"],"ans":"BE","why":{"A":"錯。Burndown Chart 是官方 working days 清單的第一張報表，加了這兩天非工作日，它就會跟著反映。","B":"對。Release burndown 不在官方的 5 張報表清單裡，改 working days 不會影響它。常見誤解：名字像 Burndown Chart 就以為也吃。","C":"錯。Version Report 在官方的 5 張報表清單裡，會反映 board 的 working days，所以加了非工作日它會跟著變。","D":"錯。Epic Report 在官方清單裡，會跟著 board 的 working days 設定調整，所以會受影響。","E":"對。Burnup report 也不在官方清單裡。官方只列 5 張報表：Burndown、Sprint、Epic、Version、Control，外加 2 個 gadget。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-working-days/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.6-e05","sec":"620.2.6","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"The company-managed board \"Mobile Release\" is located in project MOB, but its filter also includes issues from project WEB. Farah is a project administrator of WEB only and is not a board administrator. She tries to add a public holiday to the board's working days but cannot save the change. Which user can make this change?","zh":"Company-managed board「Mobile Release」的 location 在 project MOB，但它的 filter 也撈了 project WEB 的 issue。Farah 只是 WEB 的 project administrator，不是 board administrator。她想把一個國定假日加進這張 board 的 working days，卻無法儲存變更。哪一位使用者能做這個修改？","zo":["Farah，只要她在 MOB 與 WEB 都拿到 Manage Sprints 權限","MOB（這張 board 的 location）的 project administrator","這張 board 的 saved filter 的擁有者，即使他不是 board administrator","任何在 project MOB 有 Browse Projects 權限的使用者"],"fig":"","opts":["Farah, after she is granted the Manage Sprints permission in both MOB and WEB","A project administrator of MOB, the board's location","The owner of the board's saved filter, even if that person is not a board administrator","Any user who has the Browse Projects permission in project MOB"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。Manage Sprints 管的是 sprint 的建立、開始、結束，不是 board settings；改 working days 要 board admin 或 location 的 project admin。","B":"對。官方規定能改 board 設定的是 board 所在 location 的 project admin，或這張 board 的 board admin。Filter 撈到的其他 project 的 admin 不算。","C":"錯。Filter owner 只管 filter 本身能不能改，不會因此變成 board admin，也就不能改 working days 等 board settings。","D":"錯。Browse Projects 只讓人看得到 project 與 board，看得到不等於能設定，board settings 仍需要 admin 身分。"},"note":"現行 UI 把 project 改叫 space，所以官方頁寫的是「a space admin for the location of the board」。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-working-days/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.6-e06","sec":"620.2.6","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Project SUP has two company-managed boards: a Scrum board for the platform team and a Kanban board for the support team. In early December, Chidi adds 25 December as a non-working day in the Scrum board's settings. In early January, the support lead notices that cycle times in the Kanban board's Control Chart still include 25 December. What is the most likely cause?","zh":"Project SUP 有兩張 company-managed board：平台團隊的 Scrum board 與客服團隊的 Kanban board。12 月初，Chidi 在 Scrum board 的設定裡把 12 月 25 日加為 non-working day。到了一月初，客服主管發現 Kanban board 的 Control Chart 在計算 cycle time 時仍把 12 月 25 日算進去。最可能的原因是什麼？","zo":["Working days 是每張 board 各自設定，Kanban board 的 working days 從沒改過","Control Chart 在任何類型的 board 上都不理會 working days","Non-working days 只套用在加入日期之後才開始的 sprint","要先由 Jira administrator 重建全站索引，新的非工作日才會生效"],"fig":"","opts":["Working days are configured per board, and the Kanban board's working days were never updated","The Control Chart ignores working days on every board type","Non-working days apply only to sprints that start after the date is added","A Jira administrator must re-index the site before new non-working days take effect"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。Working days 是每張 board 各自的設定，改了 Scrum board 不會連帶改到同 project 的 Kanban board。常見誤解：以為改一次全站或整個 project 都生效。","B":"錯。Control Chart 在官方 working days 清單裡，會受 working days 影響；問題出在設定只改了另一張 board。","C":"錯。官方沒有「只對之後開始的 sprint 生效」的規則，而且 Kanban board 根本沒有 sprint，這個說法不成立。","D":"錯。Working days 是 board settings 的一般設定，儲存後就生效，官方步驟裡沒有任何重建索引的要求。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-working-days/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.6-e07","sec":"620.2.6","dom":"620.2","type":"multi","n":3,"stem":"A PMO analyst at Corvid Labs adds the company's founding day as a non-working day on a company-managed Scrum board. She reviews the reports and dashboard gadgets that use this board as their source. Which three will reflect the new non-working day? (Choose three.)","zh":"Corvid Labs 的 PMO 分析師在一張 company-managed Scrum board 上，把公司創立紀念日加為 non-working day。她檢查以這張 board 為來源的報表與 dashboard gadget。哪三個會反映這個新的非工作日？（選三個）","zo":["Velocity chart","Burndown gadget","Cumulative flow diagram","Sprint Health gadget","Control Chart","Epic burndown"],"fig":"","opts":["Velocity chart","Burndown gadget","Cumulative flow diagram","Sprint Health gadget","Control Chart","Epic burndown"],"ans":"BDE","why":{"A":"錯。Velocity chart 比較每個 sprint 的承諾與完成量，不在官方 working days 清單裡，不會因非工作日改變。","B":"對。Burndown Gadget 是官方清單裡的 2 個 gadget 之一，會跟 Burndown Chart 報表一樣跳過非工作日。","C":"錯。Cumulative flow diagram 看各欄位 issue 數量隨時間的變化，不在官方清單裡，不受 working days 影響。","D":"對。Sprint Health Gadget 是官方清單裡的另一個 gadget。常見誤解：以為 working days 只影響 Reports 裡的報表。","E":"對。Control Chart 在官方的 5 張報表清單裡（Burndown、Sprint、Epic、Version、Control），會把新的非工作日排除在外。","F":"錯。Epic burndown 名字很像清單裡的 Epic Report，但不在官方清單裡。常見誤解：把 Epic burndown 和 Epic Report 當成同一張。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-working-days/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.6-e08","sec":"620.2.6","dom":"620.2","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. Ingrid configured card colors on her team's company-managed board as shown. Which two statements are true? (Choose two.)","zh":"請看圖。Ingrid 在團隊的 company-managed board 上設定了如圖的 card colors。哪兩個敘述正確？（選兩個）","zo":["逾期的 Bug 會顯示綠色色條，因為依 issue type 的 query 比依到期日的 query 更精準","逾期的 Bug 會顯示紅色色條","沒有逾期、priority 為 Medium 的 Story 會顯示灰色色條","沒有逾期、priority 為 Highest 的 Bug 會顯示藍色色條","符合 Red query 的卡片會移到 board 最上方"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 290\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Card colors based on queries\"><rect x=\"0.5\" y=\"0.5\" width=\"379\" height=\"289\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"380\" height=\"34\" rx=\"0\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"34\" width=\"106\" height=\"256\" rx=\"0\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><line x1=\"106\" y1=\"34\" x2=\"106\" y2=\"290\" class=\"gl\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Board settings</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Card colors</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Colors based on</text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"95\" width=\"250\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"128\" y=\"113\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Queries</text><path d=\"M350,106 l5,5 l5,-5\" class=\"ln ink\" style=\"stroke-width:1.6\"/><text x=\"118\" y=\"144\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Queries (top to bottom)</text><line x1=\"118\" y1=\"174\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"174\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"118\" y=\"166\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Red</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"166\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">duedate &lt; now()</text><line x1=\"118\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"200\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"118\" y=\"192\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Green</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"192\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">issuetype = Bug</text><line x1=\"118\" y1=\"226\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"226\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"118\" y=\"218\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Blue</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"218\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">priority = Highest</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">General</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"80\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Columns</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"106\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Swimlanes</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"132\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Quick filters</text><rect x=\"6\" y=\"143\" width=\"94\" height=\"22\" rx=\"6\" class=\"sf-brand\"/><text x=\"14\" y=\"158\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Card colors</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"184\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Card layout</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"210\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Estimation</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"236\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Working days</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"262\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Issue detail</text></svg>","opts":["An overdue Bug shows a green strip, because the issue type query is more specific than the due date query","An overdue Bug shows a red strip","A Story with Medium priority that is not overdue shows a grey strip","A Highest-priority Bug that is not overdue shows a blue strip","Cards that match the Red query move to the top of the board"],"ans":"BC","why":{"A":"錯。Card colors 不比較哪條 query 比較「精準」，只看由上到下第一條符合的；逾期 Bug 先符合第一條 Red。","B":"對。Queries 模式下每張卡片套用第一條符合的 query。逾期的 Bug 同時符合 Red 與 Green，第一條 Red 排在上面，所以是紅色。","C":"對。官方說不符合任何 query 的卡片會顯示灰色。這張 Story 沒逾期、不是 Bug、也不是 Highest，三條都不符合。","D":"錯。Highest 的 Bug 會先符合排第二的 Green（issuetype = Bug），輪不到第三條 Blue，所以顯示綠色。","E":"錯。Card colors 只在卡片左緣加一條色條，不會改變卡片位置；要改位置得用 swimlane 或 rank。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/customize-cards/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.6-e09","sec":"620.2.6","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Mateo is the scrum master for a company-managed Scrum board. During backlog refinement, the team wants each card in the backlog to show the Due date. During the sprint, they want the cards on the active sprint board to show Components and Fix versions instead. Which option meets this requirement?","zh":"Mateo 是一張 company-managed Scrum board 的 scrum master。做 backlog refinement 時，團隊希望 backlog 裡每張卡片都顯示 Due date；sprint 進行中，則希望 active sprint board 上的卡片改為顯示 Components 與 Fix versions。哪個做法符合需求？","zo":["使用依 queries 的 card colors，每個到期日區間用一種顏色","把這三個欄位加到 View issue screen，讓它們出現在卡片上","做不到，因為 card layout 在 backlog 與 active sprint 一定顯示相同欄位","設定 card layout：backlog 顯示 Due date，active sprints 顯示 Components 與 Fix versions"],"fig":"","opts":["Use card colors based on queries, with one color for each due date range","Add the three fields to the View issue screen so that they appear on the cards","This is not possible, because card layout always shows the same fields in the backlog and the active sprint","Configure the card layout with Due date for the backlog, and Components and Fix versions for active sprints"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。Card colors 只會在卡片左緣上色，不會把欄位的值顯示在卡片上，團隊還是看不到實際的到期日。","B":"錯。View issue screen 決定的是點開 issue 後的詳細畫面有哪些欄位，不會把欄位加到 board 或 backlog 的卡片上。","C":"錯。官方說 Scrum board 的 backlog 和 Active sprints 可以設定不同的欄位，並不是一定要一樣。","D":"對。Card layout 可在卡片上多顯示最多 3 個欄位，而且 Scrum board 的 backlog 與 active sprint 可分開設定，正好符合需求。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>考試版在 Board settings → Card layout 設定；現行正在推出的新 board 體驗，card layout 改從 board 上的 View settings 進入。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/customize-cards/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.6-e10","sec":"620.2.6","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Leilani, a developer, uses <b>View settings</b> on her team's board to hide Priority and show Card cover on the cards. The next morning, a teammate says the board still shows Priority on his screen. Which statement explains this?","zh":"開發者 Leilani 在團隊 board 上用 <b>View settings</b> 把卡片上的 Priority 隱藏、並顯示 Card cover。隔天早上，一位同事說他的畫面上 board 還是顯示 Priority。哪個敘述能解釋這個現象？","zo":["她的變更要先經 board administrator 核准，才會套用到整個團隊","View settings 是每個使用者各自的設定，所以她的變更只影響她自己的 board 與 backlog","View settings 的變更要等下一個 sprint 開始後，才會對全隊生效","她的變更只套用到 backlog，因為 View settings 不能改 board 上的卡片"],"fig":"","opts":["Her changes need approval from a board administrator before they apply to the team","View settings apply per user, so her changes affect only her own board and backlog","View settings changes take effect for the whole team only after the next sprint starts","Her changes applied to the backlog only, because View settings cannot change board cards"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。View settings 沒有送審流程，任何能看 board 的人都能調整自己的檢視；改的是自己的畫面，不需要誰核准。","B":"對。官方說 view settings are applied per user：改了只影響自己的 board 與 backlog，同事的畫面不受影響。常見誤解：以為 View settings 是全隊共用的 board 設定。","C":"錯。View settings 是個人偏好，改完立刻套用在自己的畫面，跟 sprint 何時開始完全無關，也不會延後生效。","D":"錯。Board 的 View settings 本來就能切換卡片上的欄位，例如 Priority、Card cover；backlog 另有自己的 View settings。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/customize-your-view-of-the-board-and-backlog/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.6-e11","sec":"620.2.6","dom":"620.2","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Rafael is a project administrator for company-managed project CRV. His team wants to adjust which fields appear when an issue is opened from the board. Which two statements about the issue detail view are true? (Choose two.)","zh":"Rafael 是 company-managed project CRV 的 project administrator。他的團隊想調整從 board 點開 issue 時會出現哪些欄位。關於 issue detail view，哪兩個敘述正確？（選兩個）","zo":["Summary 一律顯示，而且不能從預設版面移除","即使 issue 沒有任何 link，issue links 區塊也一律顯示","不論使用哪種 field configuration，Description 都不能被隱藏","加到 View issue screen 的欄位，要和該 issue type 有關聯且沒被隱藏才會出現","沒有 project administrator 權限的 board administrator，也能把欄位加到 View issue screen"],"fig":"","opts":["Summary is always displayed and cannot be removed from the default layout","The issue links section is always displayed, even when the issue has no links","Description can never be hidden, whatever field configuration is used","A field added to the View issue screen appears only if it is associated with the issue type and not hidden","A board administrator without project administrator rights can add fields to the View issue screen"],"ans":"AD","why":{"A":"對。官方表格寫明 Summary 一律顯示、值一律可編輯，也不能從預設版面刪除。它是 issue detail view 固定存在的欄位。","B":"錯。官方寫的是 issue links 只有在這張 issue 至少有一個 link 時才顯示，沒有 link 就不會出現。","C":"錯。官方說 Description 不能從預設版面刪除，但依使用的 field configuration，它可以被隱藏。","D":"對。官方提醒：欄位加到 View issue screen 後，還要和該 issue type 有關聯、且沒被隱藏，才會出現在 issue 上。","E":"錯。要改 project 的 Screens 設定需要 project admin（Administer Projects）；只有 board admin 身分改不了 View issue screen。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>考試版的 Issue detail view 是 Board settings 裡的一頁；現行文件改由 Project settings → Screens 的 View issue screen（現行 UI 叫 View work item screen）控制。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-the-issue-detail-view/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.6-e12","sec":"620.2.6","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Wei-Ting's company-managed Scrum board uses swimlanes based on Epics. She wants the Payments epic swimlane to appear above the Onboarding epic swimlane, and the team wants to keep swimlanes based on Epics. What should she do?","zh":"Wei-Ting 的 company-managed Scrum board 使用依 Epics 分的 swimlanes。她希望 Payments epic 的泳道排在 Onboarding epic 的泳道上方，而且團隊想繼續依 Epics 分泳道。她該怎麼做？","zo":["在 board 的 backlog 裡，把 Payments epic 拖放到 Onboarding epic 上方","在 board settings 的 Swimlanes 頁面，把 Payments 泳道拖到最上面","替 Payments epic 改名，讓它依字母排在最前面","把 Payments epic 的 priority 設得比 Onboarding epic 高"],"fig":"","opts":["Drag and drop the Payments epic above the Onboarding epic in the board's backlog","Drag the Payments swimlane to the top on the Swimlanes page of the board settings","Rename the Payments epic so that it comes first alphabetically","Set the Payments epic to a higher priority than the Onboarding epic"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。官方說依 Epics 分泳道時，要改泳道順序就到 board 的 Backlog 拖放 epic。泳道順序跟著 epic 的排序走。","B":"錯。Swimlanes 設定頁上的拖放把手只給 Queries 模式用來調整 query 泳道順序，Epics 模式的泳道不能在那裡拖。","C":"錯。Epic 泳道不是依名稱字母排序，改名不會改變順序，反而可能讓團隊找不到原本的 epic。","D":"錯。Priority 是 issue 的欄位，不決定 epic 泳道的順序；泳道順序看的是 epic 在 backlog 的排序。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-swimlanes/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.6-e13","sec":"620.2.6","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. Tomasz, a board administrator, added the \"Due this week\" swimlane shown. Several cards in that swimlane are not sorted by due date, even though the query includes an ORDER BY clause. What is the most likely cause?","zh":"請看圖。Board administrator Tomasz 新增了圖中的「Due this week」泳道。雖然 query 裡有 ORDER BY 子句，這條泳道裡還是有幾張卡片沒有依到期日排序。最可能的原因是什麼？","zo":["泳道 query 的 ORDER BY 只在 backlog 生效，在 board 上不生效","要先把 Everything Else 泳道移到其他泳道上方，排序才會生效","泳道不會使用 ORDER BY 子句；每條泳道裡的卡片依 rank 排序","要先把這條 query 另存成 quick filter，ORDER BY 才會生效"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 319\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Query-based swimlanes with ORDER BY\"><rect x=\"0.5\" y=\"0.5\" width=\"379\" height=\"318\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"380\" height=\"34\" rx=\"0\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"34\" width=\"106\" height=\"285\" rx=\"0\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><line x1=\"106\" y1=\"34\" x2=\"106\" y2=\"319\" class=\"gl\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Board settings</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Swimlanes</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Base swimlanes on</text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"95\" width=\"250\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"128\" y=\"113\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Queries</text><path d=\"M350,106 l5,5 l5,-5\" class=\"ln ink\" style=\"stroke-width:1.6\"/><text x=\"118\" y=\"144\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Swimlanes (top to bottom)</text><line x1=\"118\" y1=\"174\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"174\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"118\" y=\"166\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Expedite</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"166\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">priority = Blocker</text><line x1=\"118\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"200\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"118\" y=\"192\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Due this week</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"192\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">see query below</text><line x1=\"118\" y1=\"226\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"226\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"118\" y=\"218\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Everything Else</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"218\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\"></text><text x=\"118\" y=\"247\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Due this week – JQL</text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"253\" width=\"250\" height=\"44\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx brand\"/><text x=\"126\" y=\"271\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t mono\" style=\"font-size:11px\">duedate &lt;= endOfWeek()</text><text x=\"126\" y=\"287\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t mono\" style=\"font-size:11px\">ORDER BY duedate ASC</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">General</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"80\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Columns</text><rect x=\"6\" y=\"91\" width=\"94\" height=\"22\" rx=\"6\" class=\"sf-brand\"/><text x=\"14\" y=\"106\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Swimlanes</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"132\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Quick filters</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"158\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Card colors</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"184\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Card layout</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"210\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Estimation</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"236\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Working days</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"262\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Issue detail</text></svg>","opts":["The ORDER BY clause in a swimlane query is applied only in the backlog, not on the board","The Everything Else swimlane must be moved above the other swimlanes before sorting works","Swimlanes do not use the ORDER BY clause; cards in each swimlane are ordered by rank","The query must also be saved as a quick filter before its ORDER BY clause takes effect"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。官方說泳道完全不使用 ORDER BY，一律依 rank 排序；並沒有「只在 backlog 生效」的規則。","B":"錯。Everything Else 永遠在最下方、不能刪除也不能移到上面，它只負責接住不符合其他 query 的卡片，跟排序無關。","C":"對。官方說泳道不會使用 JQL 的 ORDER BY，預設依 rank 排序。要調整卡片順序，得在 board 或 backlog 上拖放改 rank。","D":"錯。Quick filter 與泳道是兩個獨立設定，存成 quick filter 也不會讓泳道用 ORDER BY；泳道仍依 rank 排序。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-swimlanes/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.7-e01","sec":"620.2.7","dom":"620.2","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Brightloom's project QRY uses a company-managed Scrum board. Emeka, a project administrator, is creating a \"Backlog Owner\" project role. Members of this role already have Browse Projects. They must be able to drag issues up and down the backlog to set priority, but they must <b>not</b> be able to create, start, or complete sprints. Which two permissions should Emeka grant to the role? (Choose two.)","zh":"Brightloom 的 project QRY 使用一張 company-managed Scrum board。Project administrator Emeka 正在建立一個「Backlog Owner」project role。這個 role 的成員已經有 Browse Projects。他們必須能在 backlog 上下拖曳 issue 來排優先順序，但<b>不可以</b>建立、開始或完成 sprint。Emeka 應該給這個 role 哪兩個權限？（選兩個）","zo":["Manage Sprints","Schedule Issues","Transition Issues","Administer Projects","Edit Issues"],"fig":"","opts":["Manage Sprints","Schedule Issues","Transition Issues","Administer Projects","Edit Issues"],"ans":"BE","why":{"A":"錯。Manage Sprints 管的是 sprint 本身：建立、開始、完成、改期間與目標，正好是題目禁止的動作。常見誤解：以為排 backlog 順序要靠它。","B":"對。Schedule Issues 讓使用者改 board 與 backlog 上的 ranking（也能改 Due date）。官方寫明拖曳排序要有 Schedule 與 Edit 兩個權限。","C":"錯。Transition Issues 是把 issue 推到下一個 status（觸發 workflow），跟在 backlog 裡上下拖曳排序無關。","D":"錯。Administer Projects 是 project 管理權限，範圍遠超過需求，也不是排序的必要條件；給了反而違反最小權限。","E":"對。Rank a work item 官方頁寫明，排序需要對該 issue 同時有 Schedule 與 Edit 權限。只給 Schedule 還是拖不動。"},"note":"現行 UI 把這兩個權限叫 Schedule work items 與 Edit work items。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/rank-an-issue/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/use-manage-sprints-permission-for-advanced-cases/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/space-access-and-configuration-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.7-e02","sec":"620.2.7","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Svetlana, the scrum master for project HRB's company-managed Scrum board, is explaining the Manage Sprints permission to new team members. Which statement about the Manage Sprints permission is NOT true?","zh":"Svetlana 是 project HRB 那張 company-managed Scrum board 的 scrum master，她正在向新成員說明 Manage Sprints 權限。關於 Manage Sprints，哪一個敘述<b>不正確</b>？","zo":["它讓使用者可以建立、開始、完成 sprint","它讓使用者可以修改 sprint 的期間與 sprint goal","它讓使用者在沒有 Schedule Issues 權限的情況下，也能排序 sprint 裡的 issue","如果一個 sprint 含有多張 board 的 issue，使用者要在所有相關 project 都有這個權限才能更新該 sprint"],"fig":"","opts":["It allows a user to create, start, and complete sprints","It allows a user to change a sprint's duration and sprint goal","It allows a user to rank issues inside a sprint without the Schedule Issues permission","If a sprint contains issues from multiple boards, the user needs it in all the involved projects to update the sprint"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"正確敘述（不選）。官方 Manage sprints 說明第一句就是能 create、start、complete sprint，這是它的核心用途。","B":"正確敘述（不選）。官方明寫 Manage sprints 也能調整 sprint duration 與 goal，所以這句是對的。","C":"錯誤敘述（要選）。官方說 Manage sprints 不能更動 sprint 裡的工作，排序要靠 Schedule Issues 加 Edit Issues。常見誤解：有 Manage Sprints 就能排序。","D":"正確敘述（不選）。官方提醒 sprint 內含多張 board 的工作時，要在所有相關 project 都有 Manage sprints 才能更新該 sprint。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/space-access-and-configuration-permissions/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/rank-an-issue/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.7-e03","sec":"620.2.7","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. On the company-managed Scrum board for project PAY, all statuses are mapped as shown. Mateo sees the board and most PAY issues in the active sprint, but PAY-88 is missing for him. His team lead sees PAY-88 in the In Progress column. When Mateo opens PAY-88 directly by its key, Jira says he cannot view it. Mateo has no quick filters selected. What is the most likely cause?","zh":"請看圖。Project PAY 的 company-managed Scrum board 上，所有 status 都已照圖對應到欄位。Mateo 看得到這張 board，也看得到 active sprint 裡大部分的 PAY issue，但他看不到 PAY-88。他的主管在 In Progress 欄看得到 PAY-88。Mateo 直接用 key 開 PAY-88 時，Jira 說他沒辦法檢視。Mateo 沒有勾任何 quick filter。最可能的原因是什麼？","zo":["PAY-88 的 status 沒有對應到 board 上任何欄位","這張 board 的 saved filter 沒有分享給 Mateo","In Progress 欄超過了最大限制，所以多出來的卡片被藏起來","PAY-88 有一個 Mateo 無權檢視的 issue security level"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 260\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"PAY board column mapping\"><rect x=\"0.5\" y=\"0.5\" width=\"379\" height=\"259\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"380\" height=\"34\" rx=\"0\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Board settings</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Columns</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Map statuses to columns</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"95\" width=\"115\" height=\"66\" rx=\"7\" class=\"bx plain\"/><text x=\"18\" y=\"110\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:11.5px\">To Do</text><rect x=\"17\" y=\"131\" width=\"105\" height=\"18\" rx=\"4\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"144\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">To Do</text><rect x=\"133\" y=\"95\" width=\"115\" height=\"88\" rx=\"7\" class=\"bx brand\"/><text x=\"139\" y=\"110\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:11.5px\">In Progress</text><text x=\"139\" y=\"125\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s tf-rose\" style=\"font-weight:700\">≤4</text><rect x=\"138\" y=\"131\" width=\"105\" height=\"18\" rx=\"4\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><text x=\"143\" y=\"144\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">In Progress</text><rect x=\"138\" y=\"153\" width=\"105\" height=\"18\" rx=\"4\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><text x=\"143\" y=\"166\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">In Review</text><rect x=\"253\" y=\"95\" width=\"115\" height=\"66\" rx=\"7\" class=\"bx green\"/><text x=\"259\" y=\"110\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:11.5px\">Done</text><rect x=\"258\" y=\"131\" width=\"105\" height=\"18\" rx=\"4\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><text x=\"263\" y=\"144\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Done</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"208\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Unmapped statuses</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"238\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"238\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"230\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">(none)</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"230\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\"></text></svg>","opts":["The status of PAY-88 is not mapped to any column on the board","The board's saved filter is not shared with Mateo","The In Progress column has exceeded its maximum constraint, so extra cards are hidden","PAY-88 has an issue security level that Mateo is not allowed to see"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。圖上 Unmapped statuses 是空的，而且主管在 In Progress 欄看得到 PAY-88，所以不是欄位對應的問題。題幹已先排除這一層。","B":"錯。Filter 沒分享給他的話，他連整張 board 都打不開；題目說他看得到 board 和其他 PAY issue，所以不是分享問題。","C":"錯。官方說 column constraint 只會讓欄位標頭變色，不影響顯示的 issue 數量；超過上限也不會把卡片藏起來。","D":"對。Issue security level 能讓特定人看不到個別 issue，連直接開 key 或搜尋都看不到。只有他看不到、別人看得到，正是它的典型症狀。"},"note":"現行 UI 把 issue security level 叫 work item security level。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/what-are-work-item-security-schemes/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/space-access-and-configuration-permissions/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-columns/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.7-e04","sec":"620.2.7","dom":"620.2","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Leilani is a developer on project ENG, which uses a company-managed Scrum board. She copies the board's filter query into issue search, and the results include ENG-412. However, she cannot find ENG-412 on the board's Active sprints view. Before contacting the board administrator, she wants to rule out causes. Based only on this evidence, which two causes can she rule out? (Choose two.)","zh":"Leilani 是 project ENG 的開發者，這個 project 使用一張 company-managed Scrum board。她把 board 的 filter query 複製到 issue search 執行，結果裡有 ENG-412。可是她在 board 的 Active sprints 畫面找不到 ENG-412。聯絡 board administrator 之前，她想先排除一些原因。只根據這些證據，她可以排除哪兩個原因？（選兩個）","zo":["ENG-412 有 issue security level，讓 Leilani 看不到它","ENG-412 的 status 沒有對應到 board 上任何欄位","Board 的 filter query 撈不到 ENG-412","Leilani 先前勾選的某個 quick filter 把 ENG-412 藏起來了","ENG-412 在 backlog 或未來的 sprint 裡，不在 active sprint"],"fig":"","opts":["ENG-412 has an issue security level that hides it from Leilani","The status of ENG-412 is not mapped to any column on the board","The board's filter query does not match ENG-412","A quick filter that Leilani selected earlier is hiding ENG-412","ENG-412 is in the backlog or a future sprint, not in the active sprint"],"ans":"AC","why":{"A":"對。她自己跑 filter 搜得到 ENG-412，代表她有權限看這張 issue，issue security 沒擋她。先用題幹排除這一層。","B":"錯。Status 沒對應到欄位時，issue 在搜尋裡照樣找得到，只是 board 和 backlog 都不顯示，所以這個原因還排除不了。","C":"對。Board filter 的 query 在搜尋裡已經撈到 ENG-412，代表 filter 有包含它，這一層可以直接排除。","D":"錯。Quick filter 只影響 board 上的顯示，不影響 issue search 的結果，所以搜得到不代表沒被 quick filter 藏起來。","E":"錯。Filter 撈得到的 issue 不一定在 active sprint；它也可能在 backlog 或未來的 sprint，所以這點還得去 backlog 確認。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-columns/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/space-access-and-configuration-permissions/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-quick-filters/"],"lvl":3,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.7-e05","sec":"620.2.7","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. Harborlight's team added a new Blocked status to the workflow used by project DOC. After several issues were moved to Blocked, they disappeared from the company-managed Scrum board. The product owner, Anjali, says: \"Don't worry, they are still in the backlog.\" Which statement is correct?","zh":"請看圖。Harborlight 的團隊在 project DOC 使用的 workflow 裡新增了 Blocked status。幾張 issue 被改成 Blocked 之後，就從 company-managed Scrum board 上消失了。Product owner Anjali 說：「別擔心，它們還在 backlog 裡。」哪個敘述正確？","zo":["Anjali 說得對：unmapped status 只會在 Active sprints 畫面隱藏 issue，backlog 仍然會列出它們","這些 issue 在 board 和 backlog 都被隱藏了；把 Blocked 對應到某個欄位，它們就會重新出現","必須修改 board filter，加上 <code>OR status = Blocked</code>，因為 filter 會排除新的 status","在 admin 對應這個 status 之前，Jira 會自動把 unmapped status 的 issue 顯示在最右邊的欄位"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 238\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"DOC board columns with unmapped Blocked status\"><rect x=\"0.5\" y=\"0.5\" width=\"379\" height=\"237\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"380\" height=\"34\" rx=\"0\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Board settings</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Columns</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Map statuses to columns</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"95\" width=\"115\" height=\"66\" rx=\"7\" class=\"bx plain\"/><text x=\"18\" y=\"110\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:11.5px\">To Do</text><rect x=\"17\" y=\"131\" width=\"105\" height=\"18\" rx=\"4\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"144\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">To Do</text><rect x=\"133\" y=\"95\" width=\"115\" height=\"66\" rx=\"7\" class=\"bx brand\"/><text x=\"139\" y=\"110\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:11.5px\">In Progress</text><rect x=\"138\" y=\"131\" width=\"105\" height=\"18\" rx=\"4\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><text x=\"143\" y=\"144\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">In Progress</text><rect x=\"253\" y=\"95\" width=\"115\" height=\"66\" rx=\"7\" class=\"bx green\"/><text x=\"259\" y=\"110\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:11.5px\">Done</text><rect x=\"258\" y=\"131\" width=\"105\" height=\"18\" rx=\"4\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><text x=\"263\" y=\"144\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Done</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"186\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Unmapped statuses</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"216\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"216\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"208\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Blocked</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"208\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">3 issues</text></svg>","opts":["Anjali is right: unmapped statuses only hide issues in the Active sprints view, and the backlog still lists them","The issues are hidden in both the board and the backlog; mapping Blocked to a column makes them appear again","The board filter must be changed to add <code>OR status = Blocked</code>, because the filter excludes new statuses","Jira automatically shows issues with an unmapped status in the right-most column until an admin maps the status"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。官方寫明 unmapped status 會同時把 issue 從 board view 和 backlog view 藏起來，所以 backlog 也看不到它們。","B":"對。官方說 unmapped status 會讓 issue 在 board 與 backlog 都不顯示。Board 或 project admin 把 Blocked 拖進適當的欄位，卡片就會回來。","C":"錯。Filter 不會因為 workflow 多了新 status 就自動排除它；圖上 Blocked 列在 Unmapped statuses，問題出在欄位對應，不在 filter。","D":"錯。Jira 不會自動把 unmapped status 放進任何欄位，包括最右欄；官方說這些 issue 會被隱藏，必須手動拖進欄位。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-columns/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.7-e06","sec":"620.2.7","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. Hiroshi views the company-managed Kanban board for project APP. The board has two quick filters: <b>Bugs</b> (<code>type = Bug</code>) and <b>Only My Issues</b> (<code>assignee = currentUser()</code>). The exhibit lists every issue currently on the board. Hiroshi selects both quick filters. Which issues does he see?","zh":"請看圖。Hiroshi 在看 project APP 的 company-managed Kanban board。這張 board 有兩個 quick filter：<b>Bugs</b>（<code>type = Bug</code>）與 <b>Only My Issues</b>（<code>assignee = currentUser()</code>）。圖中列出目前 board 上所有的 issue。Hiroshi 同時勾選這兩個 quick filter。他會看到哪些 issue？","zo":["只有 APP-11 與 APP-15","APP-11、APP-12、APP-13、APP-14 與 APP-15","只有 APP-11、APP-13 與 APP-15，因為只有最後勾選的 quick filter 會生效","什麼都看不到，因為兩個不同欄位的 quick filter 不能同時開啟"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 198\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"APP board issue list\"><rect x=\"10\" y=\"8\" width=\"300\" height=\"182\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx plain\"/><text x=\"20\" y=\"28\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\">Issues on the APP board</text><rect x=\"16\" y=\"39\" width=\"288\" height=\"22\" rx=\"5\" class=\"sf-gray\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Key</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Type</text><text x=\"210\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Assignee</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"62\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"62\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">APP-11</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Bug</text><text x=\"210\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Hiroshi</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"86\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"86\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">APP-12</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Story</text><text x=\"210\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Hiroshi</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"110\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"126\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">APP-13</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"126\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Bug</text><text x=\"210\" y=\"126\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Zainab</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"134\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"134\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"150\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">APP-14</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"150\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Task</text><text x=\"210\" y=\"150\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Hiroshi</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"158\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"158\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"174\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">APP-15</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"174\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Bug</text><text x=\"210\" y=\"174\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Hiroshi</text></svg>","opts":["APP-11 and APP-15 only","APP-11, APP-12, APP-13, APP-14, and APP-15","APP-11, APP-13, and APP-15 only, because only the last selected quick filter applies","No issues, because two quick filters on different fields cannot be active at the same time"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。同時勾選的 quick filter 會用 AND 疊加，只留下同時符合兩者的 issue：是 Bug 且指派給 Hiroshi 的 APP-11 與 APP-15。","B":"錯。這是把兩個 quick filter 當成 OR（聯集）的結果。常見誤解：多勾一個 quick filter 會多看到東西；其實只會越篩越少。","C":"錯。Quick filter 不是「最後一個勝出」；兩個同時開啟時會一起套用，所以指派給 Zainab 的 APP-13 也會被濾掉。","D":"錯。不同欄位的 quick filter 可以同時開啟，會以 AND 一起套用；只有沒有任何 issue 同時符合所有條件時，畫面才會是空的。"},"note":"官方說明頁沒有逐字寫出 AND，這個行為由 Atlassian 公開 issue JRACLOUD-85787 佐證（同時勾兩個 quick filter 取交集）。現行新版 board 把 quick filter 改叫 Custom filters。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-quick-filters/","https://jira.atlassian.com/browse/JRACLOUD-85787"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.7-e07","sec":"620.2.7","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Quillstone's checkout squad shares a company-managed Kanban board. Team lead Naledi wants to see issues labeled <code>checkout</code> <b>or</b> <code>payments</code> with a single click on the board. Selecting the existing \"Checkout\" and \"Payments\" quick filters together shows only a few issues. Other teams using the board must keep seeing all issues by default. Which option meets the requirement with the least effort?","zh":"Quillstone 的結帳小組共用一張 company-managed Kanban board。Team lead Naledi 想在 board 上點一下，就能看到標了 <code>checkout</code> <b>或</b> <code>payments</code> label 的 issue。同時勾選現有的「Checkout」與「Payments」兩個 quick filter，只剩下少數幾張 issue。其他使用這張 board 的團隊，預設仍必須看得到全部 issue。哪個做法最省事又符合需求？","zo":["請團隊每次都同時勾選「Checkout」與「Payments」兩個 quick filter","修改 board 的 saved filter，加上 <code>AND labels in (checkout, payments)</code>","新增一個 JQL 為 <code>labels in (checkout, payments)</code> 的 quick filter","請 Jira administrator 在 board settings 把 quick filter 的邏輯從 AND 改成 OR"],"fig":"","opts":["Ask the team to always select the \"Checkout\" and \"Payments\" quick filters at the same time","Edit the board's saved filter to add <code>AND labels in (checkout, payments)</code>","Create a new quick filter with the JQL <code>labels in (checkout, payments)</code>","Ask a Jira administrator to switch the board's quick filter logic from AND to OR in board settings"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。同時勾兩個 quick filter 是 AND，只會留下兩個 label 都有的 issue，這正是她現在看到結果變少的原因。","B":"錯。改 board 的 saved filter 會改變所有人看到的 board（也影響報表），違反「其他團隊預設要看到全部」的限制。","C":"對。把 OR 寫進同一個 quick filter 的 JQL，一次點選就能看到兩種 label；quick filter 只是再篩一次，不影響其他人的預設畫面。","D":"錯。Board settings 沒有把 quick filter 改成 OR 的選項；Atlassian 的公開功能需求 JRACLOUD-85787 仍在收集意見。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-quick-filters/","https://jira.atlassian.com/browse/JRACLOUD-85787"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.7-e08","sec":"620.2.7","dom":"620.2","type":"multi","n":3,"stem":"Tomás is the board administrator of a company-managed Scrum board for project GRN. He is training new team members on quick filters. Which three statements are true? (Choose three.)","zh":"Tomás 是 project GRN 那張 company-managed Scrum board 的 board administrator，他在教新成員使用 quick filter。哪三個敘述正確？（選三個）","zo":["Quick filter 可以引用既有的 saved filter，例如 <code>savedfilter = \"Release blockers\"</code>","Quick filter 可以顯示 board 的 filter 沒有撈到的 issue","任何在 GRN 有 Browse Projects 的使用者，都可以替整張 board 新增 quick filter","同時勾選兩個 quick filter 時，board 只顯示兩者都符合的 issue","Column constraint 會計算欄位裡的所有 issue，包括被 quick filter 藏起來的","預設的 Recently Updated quick filter 顯示最近 7 天內更新過的 issue"],"fig":"","opts":["A quick filter can reference an existing saved filter, for example <code>savedfilter = \"Release blockers\"</code>","A quick filter can display issues that the board's filter does not return","Any user with Browse Projects in GRN can add a new quick filter for the whole board","When two quick filters are selected, the board shows only issues that match both","Column constraints count all issues in a column, including issues hidden by a quick filter","The default Recently Updated quick filter shows issues updated in the last 7 days"],"ans":"ADE","why":{"A":"對。官方 quick filter 範例 JQL 就有 <code>savedfilter = \"My Filter\"</code>，可以把 saved filter 的條件拿來當 quick filter 用。","B":"錯。官方說 quick filter 是在 board 已撈到的 issue 裡「再篩一次」，只能縮小範圍，不能把 board filter 以外的 issue 叫出來。","C":"錯。要設定 quick filter，必須是 board 所在 location 的 project admin 或這張 board 的 board admin；只有 Browse 不夠。","D":"對。同時勾選的 quick filter 會疊加成 AND，只顯示同時符合的 issue。常見誤解：以為多勾一個會看到聯集。","E":"對。官方寫明 column constraint 算的是欄位裡的 issue 總數，不管有沒有被 quick filter 藏起來；所以篩選後欄位仍可能顯示超量。","F":"錯。預設的 Recently Updated 是 <code>updatedDate &gt;= -1d</code>，也就是最近 24 小時，不是 7 天。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-quick-filters/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-columns/","https://jira.atlassian.com/browse/JRACLOUD-85787"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.7-e09","sec":"620.2.7","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. Chen Wei, the scrum master for project LOG's company-managed Scrum board, has the Schedule Issues and Edit Issues permissions, but he cannot drag issues to reorder the backlog. He wants to keep priority as a secondary sort. Which change fixes the problem?","zh":"請看圖。Chen Wei 是 project LOG 那張 company-managed Scrum board 的 scrum master，他有 Schedule Issues 與 Edit Issues 權限，卻無法拖曳 issue 來調整 backlog 順序。他想保留 priority 當作第二順位的排序。哪個修改能解決問題？","zo":["給 Chen Wei Manage Sprints 權限，並保留目前的 filter query","把 ORDER BY 子句改成 <code>ORDER BY priority DESC, Rank DESC</code>","把 ORDER BY 子句換成條件：<code>AND Rank is not EMPTY ORDER BY priority DESC</code>","把 board 從 Scrum 換成 Kanban，因為只有 Kanban board 允許第二順位的排序","把 ORDER BY 子句改成 <code>ORDER BY Rank ASC, priority DESC</code>"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 309\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"LOG board general settings\"><rect x=\"0.5\" y=\"0.5\" width=\"379\" height=\"308\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"380\" height=\"34\" rx=\"0\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"34\" width=\"106\" height=\"275\" rx=\"0\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><line x1=\"106\" y1=\"34\" x2=\"106\" y2=\"309\" class=\"gl\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Board settings</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">General</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Saved filter</text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"95\" width=\"250\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"128\" y=\"113\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Filter for LOG board</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"144\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Filter query</text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"150\" width=\"250\" height=\"44\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx brand\"/><text x=\"126\" y=\"168\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t mono\" style=\"font-size:11px\">project = LOG</text><text x=\"126\" y=\"184\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t mono\" style=\"font-size:11px\">ORDER BY priority DESC, Rank ASC</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"215\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Ranking</text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"221\" width=\"250\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx brand\"/><text x=\"128\" y=\"239\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Disabled: not ordered by Rank</text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"259\" width=\"76.0\" height=\"26\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"156.0\" y=\"276\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"t\">Add Rank</text><rect x=\"6\" y=\"39\" width=\"94\" height=\"22\" rx=\"6\" class=\"sf-brand\"/><text x=\"14\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">General</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"80\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Columns</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"106\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Swimlanes</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"132\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Quick filters</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"158\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Card colors</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"184\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Card layout</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"210\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Estimation</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"236\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Working days</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"262\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Issue detail</text></svg>","opts":["Grant Chen Wei the Manage Sprints permission and keep the current filter query","Change the ORDER BY clause to <code>ORDER BY priority DESC, Rank DESC</code>","Replace the ORDER BY clause with a condition: <code>AND Rank is not EMPTY ORDER BY priority DESC</code>","Switch the board from Scrum to Kanban, because only Kanban boards allow a secondary sort","Change the ORDER BY clause to <code>ORDER BY Rank ASC, priority DESC</code>"],"ans":"E","why":{"A":"錯。Manage Sprints 管 sprint 的建立、開始、完成，跟排序無關；問題出在 filter 沒以 Rank 為第一排序。常見誤解：拖不動就加 Manage Sprints。","B":"錯。Rank 仍然排在 priority 後面當第二順位，而且方向變成 DESC；官方要求 Rank 以 ASC 當第一順位，ranking 才會開啟。","C":"錯。把 Rank 放在 WHERE 條件裡不算排序；ORDER BY 還是只有 priority，ranking 依然是停用狀態。","D":"錯。Scrum 與 Kanban 的 ranking 規則相同，都要求 board filter 以 Rank 為第一排序；換 board 類型解決不了問題。","E":"對。官方 KB 說 Rank 必須是第一順位的排序條件，不能當第二順位。改成 Rank ASC 在前、priority 在後，就能拖曳排序。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira/kb/issues-cant-be-manually-ranked-error-when-ranking-issues-in-the-backlog/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/enable-ranking/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/rank-an-issue/"],"lvl":3,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.7-e10","sec":"620.2.7","dom":"620.2","type":"multi","n":3,"stem":"Ingrid created a company-managed Scrum board from an existing saved filter: <code>project in (NET, OPS) ORDER BY created DESC</code>. Her team reports several problems. Which three problems will be solved by selecting <b>Add Rank</b> in the board settings? (Choose three.)","zh":"Ingrid 用一個既有的 saved filter 建立了 company-managed Scrum board：<code>project in (NET, OPS) ORDER BY created DESC</code>。她的團隊回報了好幾個問題。在 board settings 按下 <b>Add Rank</b>，能解決哪三個問題？（選三個）","zo":["其他部門的同事完全看不到這張 board","團隊成員無法在 backlog 拖曳 issue 調整順序","QA status 的 issue 在 board 和 backlog 都沒出現","Ingrid 無法在這張 board 建立 sprint","沒有 Edit Issues 權限的成員無法排序 issue","Sub-task 沒有集中排在各自的 parent issue 底下"],"fig":"","opts":["Colleagues in another department cannot see the board at all","Team members cannot drag issues to reorder them in the backlog","Issues in the QA status do not appear on the board or in the backlog","Ingrid cannot create a sprint on the board","A team member without the Edit Issues permission cannot rank issues","Sub-tasks are not grouped underneath their parent issues"],"ans":"BDF","why":{"A":"錯。看不到 board 是 filter 沒分享給他們；Board 沒有自己的分享設定，Add Rank 只改排序，不改 filter 的檢視權限。","B":"對。官方說開啟 ranking 才能在 board 與 backlog 拖曳排序。Add Rank 會把 filter 改成 <code>ORDER BY Rank ASC</code>。","C":"錯。QA 的 issue 在 board 與 backlog 都消失，是 QA status 沒對應到欄位；要到 Columns 去對應，跟 Rank 無關。","D":"對。官方寫明 enabling ranking 讓你能在 Scrum board 建立 sprint；沒有 Rank 排序的 board 建不了 sprint。","E":"錯。缺 Edit Issues 是權限問題；排序要對該 issue 同時有 Schedule 與 Edit 權限，Add Rank 不會替任何人加權限。","F":"對。官方說開啟 ranking 也讓 Jira 把 sub-task 集中排在 parent 底下；目前 ORDER BY created 會讓它們散開。"},"note":"Add Rank 會直接改寫這個 saved filter，所以所有使用同一個 filter 的 board 都會一起受影響。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/enable-ranking/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/rank-an-issue/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-columns/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.7-e11","sec":"620.2.7","dom":"620.2","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Kofi, a developer on project KIT, opens the team's board and sees: \"You can't access this board. You don't have permission to access this board based on its filter.\" The board's filter owner, Rukmini, is on long leave, and her filter is Private. Rafael is a Jira administrator. How can Rafael restore access for the team without waiting for Rukmini?","zh":"Project KIT 的開發者 Kofi 打開團隊的 board，看到：「You can't access this board. You don't have permission to access this board based on its filter.」這張 board 的 filter owner Rukmini 正在請長假，而她的 filter 是 Private。Rafael 是 Jira administrator。Rafael 要怎麼做，才能不等 Rukmini 就讓團隊恢復存取？","zo":["把 filter 的 owner 改成他自己，再把 filter 分享給 KIT project","在 board settings 裡把 Kofi 和他的隊友加為 board administrator","在 project KIT 把 Browse Projects 權限給團隊的 group","把 board 的 location 從 Rukmini 的個人 profile 移到 KIT project"],"fig":"","opts":["Change the filter's owner to himself, then share the filter with the KIT project","Add Kofi and his teammates as board administrators in the board's settings","Grant the Browse Projects permission in project KIT to the team's group","Move the board's location from Rukmini's user profile to the KIT project"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。官方 KB 指出這個錯誤是因為 filter 是 Private；Jira admin 可以不等 owner，先 Change owner 再 Edit permissions 分享 filter。","B":"錯。Board 沒有自己的檢視權限設定，加成 board admin 也不會讓 Private 的 filter 變得看得到，錯誤訊息依然存在。","C":"錯。Browse Projects 讓人看得到 project 裡的 issue，但 filter 仍是 Private，board 還是打不開；這個錯誤的原因是 filter 分享。","D":"錯。Location 決定 board 掛在哪、誰能管理它，不會改變 filter 的分享設定；filter 仍是 Private，團隊還是看不到。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira/kb/troubleshooting-you-cant-access-this-board-you-dont-have-permission-to-access-this-board-based-on-its-filter-to-access-this-board-update-the-filters-owner-and-permissions/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/manage-shared-filters/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/manage-filters/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.2.7-e12","sec":"620.2.7","dom":"620.2","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Cobaltive's release board uses the saved filter <code>project in (WEB, API) ORDER BY Rank ASC</code>, which is shared with the <b>eng-all</b> group. Owen, the board administrator, did not create the filter and is not one of its editors. Which two statements are true? (Choose two.)","zh":"Cobaltive 的 release board 使用 saved filter <code>project in (WEB, API) ORDER BY Rank ASC</code>，這個 filter 已分享給 <b>eng-all</b> group。Board administrator Owen 不是這個 filter 的建立者，也不是它的 editor。哪兩個敘述正確？（選兩個）","zo":["eng-all 的任何成員都能打開這張 board，因為 board 對所有能存取其 filter 的使用者開放","把 filter 分享給 eng-all，也等於給這個 group 在 WEB 與 API 的 Browse Projects","因為 Owen 是 board administrator，他可以在 board settings 直接覆寫 filter 的 query","在 API 沒有 Browse Projects 的 eng-all 成員，在這張 board 上看不到 API 的 issue","要讓 eng-all 以外的承包商使用這張 board，Owen 應該直接把 board 分享給這位承包商"],"fig":"","opts":["Any member of eng-all can open the board, because a board is available to all users who can access its filter","Sharing the filter with eng-all also grants the group Browse Projects in WEB and API","Owen can overwrite the filter's query from the board settings because he is a board administrator","An eng-all member who lacks Browse Projects in API will not see API issues on the board","To let a contractor outside eng-all use the board, Owen should share the board itself with the contractor"],"ans":"AD","why":{"A":"對。官方說用 saved filter 建的 board，對所有能存取該 filter 的使用者都可用。Board 沒有自己的分享設定，分享的是 filter。","B":"錯。Filter 分享只決定誰看得到這個 filter；Browse Projects 來自 permission scheme，分享 filter 不會替任何人加 project 權限。","C":"錯。官方說不是 filter 原始建立者時，編輯 board filter 只能 Save as 另存新 filter。常見誤解：board admin 就等於 filter editor。","D":"對。能打開 board 不代表看得到每張 issue；使用者只看得到有 Browse Projects、且沒被 issue security 擋住的 issue，所以 API 的卡片不會出現。","E":"錯。Board 本身沒有分享設定；要讓承包商使用，得把 filter 分享給他，並確保他在相關 project 有 Browse Projects。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/create-a-board-based-on-filters/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/edit-a-board-filter-on-a-company-managed-board/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/space-access-and-configuration-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.1-e01","sec":"620.3.1","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. At Copperleaf Insurance, Nadia is the scrum master for project CLM and belongs only to the Scrum Masters role. She can create, start, and complete sprints and edit issue fields, but she cannot drag issues to reorder the backlog. The board filter is ordered by Rank. Which permission should be granted to the Scrum Masters role so that she can rank issues?","zh":"Copperleaf Insurance 的 Nadia 是 project CLM 的 scrum master，只屬於 Scrum Masters 這個 role。她可以建立、開始、完成 sprint，也能編輯 issue 欄位，但無法拖曳 issue 來調整 backlog 的順序。Board 的 filter 有依 Rank 排序。要讓她能排序 issue，應該把哪一個權限授予 Scrum Masters role？","zo":["Administer Projects","Manage Sprints","Transition Issues","Schedule Issues"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 297\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"CLM permission scheme\"><rect x=\"0.5\" y=\"0.5\" width=\"379\" height=\"296\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"380\" height=\"34\" rx=\"0\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Project settings › Permissions</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">CLM permission scheme</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Permission → Granted to</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"119\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"119\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Browse Projects</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Developers, Scrum Masters</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"145\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"145\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"137\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Create Issues</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"137\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Developers, Scrum Masters</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"171\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"171\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"163\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Edit Issues</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"163\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Developers, Scrum Masters</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"197\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"197\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"189\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Schedule Issues</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"189\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Developers</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"223\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"223\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"215\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Manage Sprints</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"215\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Scrum Masters</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"249\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"249\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"241\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Transition Issues</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"241\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Developers, Scrum Masters</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"275\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"275\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"267\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Administer Projects</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"267\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Administrators</text></svg>","opts":["Administer Projects","Manage Sprints","Transition Issues","Schedule Issues"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。Administer Projects 管 role 成員、components、versions 與 project details，並不包含調整 issue 的 Rank。","B":"錯。圖上 Scrum Masters 已經有 Manage Sprints，她也能開始、完成 sprint；這個權限只管 sprint 本身，不管 sprint 或 backlog 裡的 issue 排序。","C":"錯。Transition Issues 是把 issue 換狀態，跟拖曳排序無關；而且她的問題不是狀態改不了。","D":"對。排序要同時有 Schedule Issues 與 Edit Issues。圖上她已經有 Edit Issues，只差 Schedule Issues。常見誤解：以為能管 sprint 就能排序 backlog。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/rank-an-issue/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/space-access-and-configuration-permissions/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/how-permissions-interact-with-each-other/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.1-e02","sec":"620.3.1","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. Mateo is a developer at Harborlight Clinics. On any issue in project ORC he can edit the Summary and change the Due date. However, when he tries to drag issues on the ORC Kanban board to change their order within a column, the order does not change. What is the most likely cause?","zh":"Mateo 是 Harborlight Clinics 的開發人員。在 project ORC 的任何 issue 上，他都能編輯 Summary、修改 Due date。但他在 ORC 的 Kanban board 上拖曳 issue 想改變順序時，同一欄裡的順序卻不會改變。最可能的原因是什麼？","zo":["Board 的 filter query 沒有依 Rank 排序，所以這張 board 的 ranking 被停用","他缺少 Schedule Issues 權限，因為修改 Due date 只需要 Edit Issues","他缺少 Manage Sprints 權限，這個權限控制 board 上 issue 的順序","他不是 board administrator，只有 board administrator 能排序 issue"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 342\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"General\"><rect x=\"0.5\" y=\"0.5\" width=\"379\" height=\"341\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"380\" height=\"34\" rx=\"0\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"34\" width=\"106\" height=\"308\" rx=\"0\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><line x1=\"106\" y1=\"34\" x2=\"106\" y2=\"342\" class=\"gl\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Board settings</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">General</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Board name</text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"95\" width=\"250\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"128\" y=\"113\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">ORC Kanban</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"144\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Saved filter</text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"150\" width=\"250\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"128\" y=\"168\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Filter for ORC</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"199\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Filter query</text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"205\" width=\"250\" height=\"60\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx brand\"/><text x=\"126\" y=\"223\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t mono\" style=\"font-size:11px\">project = ORC</text><text x=\"126\" y=\"239\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t mono\" style=\"font-size:11px\">ORDER BY priority DESC,</text><text x=\"126\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t mono\" style=\"font-size:11px\">  created ASC</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"286\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Location</text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"292\" width=\"250\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"128\" y=\"310\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Orchid (ORC)</text><rect x=\"6\" y=\"39\" width=\"94\" height=\"22\" rx=\"6\" class=\"sf-brand\"/><text x=\"14\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">General</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"80\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Columns</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"106\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Swimlanes</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"132\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Quick filters</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"158\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Card colors</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"184\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Card layout</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"210\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Estimation</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"236\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Working days</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"262\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Issue detail</text></svg>","opts":["The board's filter query is not ordered by Rank, so ranking is disabled for the board","He lacks the Schedule Issues permission, because changing the Due date requires only Edit Issues","He lacks the Manage Sprints permission, which controls the order of issues on a board","He is not a board administrator, and only board administrators can rank issues"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。官方說要先啟用 ranking 才能排序；圖上 filter 是 <code>ORDER BY priority DESC</code>，不是依 Rank，board 的排序就被停用。要在 board 設定按 Add Rank。","B":"錯。官方把 Due date 列在 Schedule Issues 之下，「改 Due date 只需要 Edit Issues」這個理由不成立。而且圖上 board filter 是 <code>ORDER BY priority DESC</code>，排序被停用的原因已經很明確。","C":"錯。Manage Sprints 只管 sprint 的建立、開始、完成與目標，不管 issue 排序；何況 Kanban board 本來就沒有 sprint。","D":"錯。Board admin 是改 board 設定用的；排序看的是 Schedule Issues＋Edit Issues 與 filter 是否依 Rank，一般成員也能排序。"},"note":"現行 UI 把 issue 叫 work item、project 叫 space；權限名稱也跟著改成 Schedule work items、Edit work items。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/enable-ranking/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira/kb/users-are-unable-to-rank-issues-on-jira-boards/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/work-item-permissions/"],"lvl":3,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.1-e03","sec":"620.3.1","dom":"620.3","type":"multi","n":3,"stem":"Ingrid, a team lead at Pelican Freight, must move 40 issues from project LEGACY to project CARGO in a single bulk operation. She can already browse both projects. Which three permissions does she need? (Choose three.)","zh":"Pelican Freight 的組長 Ingrid 必須用一次批次操作，把 40 張 issue 從 project LEGACY 搬到 project CARGO。她已經能瀏覽這兩個 project。她需要哪三個權限？（選三個）","zo":["CARGO 的 Administer Projects 權限","全域權限 Make bulk changes","LEGACY 的 Move Issues 權限","在 LEGACY 的 permission scheme 裡授予她 role 的 Make bulk changes 權限","CARGO 的 Create Issues 權限","LEGACY 的 Delete Issues 權限"],"fig":"","opts":["The Administer Projects permission in CARGO","The Make bulk changes global permission","The Move Issues permission in LEGACY","The Make bulk changes permission granted to her role in the LEGACY permission scheme","The Create Issues permission in CARGO","The Delete Issues permission in LEGACY"],"ans":"BCE","why":{"A":"錯。Administer Projects 是管 project 設定與 role 成員的權限；把 issue 搬進 CARGO 只需要在那裡能建立 issue。","B":"對。官方說任何批次操作都要全域的 Make bulk changes，再加上各 project 對應動作的權限。沒有它，搜尋結果的 ••• 裡不會出現 Bulk change。","C":"對。搬移 issue 要在來源 project 有 Move Issues。官方舉的例子正是 Move work item＋Make bulk changes 才能一次搬一批。","D":"錯。Make bulk changes 是全域權限，由 Jira admin 在 Global permissions 頁授予，permission scheme 裡根本沒有這一項。常見誤解：把它當成 project 權限。","E":"對。官方說 Move Issues 還需要目的地 project 的 Create Issues。這是「一個動作要兩個 project 的鑰匙」的典型例子。","F":"錯。Delete Issues 是刪除 issue 與附屬資料；搬移不會先刪再建，不需要這個權限。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/edit-multiple-issues-at-the-same-time/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/work-item-permissions/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/manage-global-permissions/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/how-permissions-interact-with-each-other/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.1-e04","sec":"620.3.1","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. Tomás belongs to the <b>jira-users</b> group and to the Developers role in project FIN, where Developers have Browse Projects, Edit Issues, and Schedule Issues. He needs to change the Due date on 60 FIN issues at once, but <b>Bulk change</b> does not appear in the search results menu. Which change allows Tomás to make the update?","zh":"Tomás 屬於 <b>jira-users</b> group，也是 project FIN 的 Developers role 成員；FIN 的 Developers 有 Browse Projects、Edit Issues 與 Schedule Issues。他需要一次修改 60 張 FIN issue 的 Due date，但搜尋結果的選單裡沒有 <b>Bulk change</b>。哪一項變更能讓 Tomás 完成這次修改？","zo":["在 FIN 的 permission scheme 裡，把 Edit Issues 授予 jira-bulk-editors group","把 FIN 的 Administer Projects 權限授予 Developers role","請管理員把 Tomás 加進 jira-bulk-editors group","在 FIN 的 permission scheme 裡，把 Make bulk changes 授予 Developers role"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 245\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Global permissions\"><rect x=\"0.5\" y=\"0.5\" width=\"379\" height=\"244\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"380\" height=\"34\" rx=\"0\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Settings › System</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Global permissions</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Permission → Granted to (groups)</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"119\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"119\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Administer Jira</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">jira-admins</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"145\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"145\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"137\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Browse users and groups</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"137\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">jira-users</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"171\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"171\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"163\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Share dashboards and filters</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"163\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">jira-users</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"197\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"197\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"189\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Make bulk changes</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"189\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">jira-bulk-editors</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"223\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"223\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"215\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Create team-managed projects</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"215\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">jira-users</text></svg>","opts":["Grant Edit Issues to the jira-bulk-editors group in the FIN permission scheme","Grant the Administer Projects permission for FIN to the Developers role","Have an administrator add Tomás to the jira-bulk-editors group","Add Make bulk changes to the Developers role in the FIN permission scheme"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。這是把 project 權限給 jira-bulk-editors，Tomás 不在這個 group 裡，也沒有補上他缺的全域 Make bulk changes，Bulk change 入口仍然不會出現。","B":"錯。Administer Projects 讓人管 project 設定與 role 成員，不會讓 Bulk change 出現；Bulk 的入口看的是全域權限。","C":"對。圖上 Make bulk changes 只授予 jira-bulk-editors，他不在裡面。把他加進這個 group（成員由 org admin 管理）就補上入口；批次改 Due date 還要 Edit＋Schedule，他都有。","D":"錯。Make bulk changes 是全域權限，permission scheme 裡沒有這一項，也不能給 project role。常見誤解：以為它是 project 權限。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/manage-global-permissions/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/view-grant-revoke-global-permissions-in-jira/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/edit-multiple-issues-at-the-same-time/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.1-e05","sec":"620.3.1","dom":"620.3","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Kofi is a Jira administrator at Tidewater Foods. Everyone in the <b>all-staff</b> group must be able to report facility problems in project FAC, but they must not see any FAC issues, including other people's reports. Kofi grants Create Issues to all-staff and does not grant Browse Projects to it. No other Browse Projects grants in the FAC permission scheme apply to all-staff members. Which two statements are true? (Choose two.)","zh":"Kofi 是 Tidewater Foods 的 Jira 管理員。<b>all-staff</b> group 的每個人都必須能在 project FAC 回報設施問題，但不能看到任何 FAC issue，包括別人的回報。Kofi 把 Create Issues 授予 all-staff，沒有授予 Browse Projects。FAC 的 permission scheme 裡，沒有其他 Browse Projects 授權適用於 all-staff 的成員。哪兩個敘述正確？（選兩個）","zo":["all-staff 的成員即使沒有 Browse Projects，也能建立 FAC issue","Jira 會自動把每張 issue 的 Browse Projects 權限給回報它的人","這個設定行不通，因為沒有 Browse Projects 時 Create Issues 沒有作用","送出 issue 之後，all-staff 的成員打不開自己剛建立的那張 issue","Create Issues 只能授予有 Jira 產品存取權的使用者"],"fig":"","opts":["Members of all-staff can create FAC issues even though they do not have Browse Projects","Jira automatically grants Browse Projects on each issue to the person who reported it","The configuration fails, because Create Issues has no effect without Browse Projects","After submitting an issue, a member of all-staff cannot open the issue they just created","Create Issues can be granted only to users who have Jira product access"],"ans":"AD","why":{"A":"對。官方原文：Create work items 讓使用者建立 issue，即使沒有 Browse spaces 也可以。Create 是「幾乎所有 issue 權限都要 Browse」的例外。","B":"錯。Jira 不會自動把 Browse 給 reporter；要 reporter 看得到自己的單，必須在 scheme 裡把 Browse Projects 授予 Reporter。","C":"錯。這正是常見誤解：以為建立 issue 一定要先有 Browse Projects。官方寫明 Create Issues 不需要 Browse。","D":"對。看 project 與其中的 issue 靠的是 Browse Projects；沒有它就打不開任何 FAC issue，連自己剛建的也一樣，剛好符合「看不到別人回報」的要求。","E":"錯。官方說 Create work items 不需要 Jira 產品存取權，只要能進站台的使用者都可以被授予。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/work-item-permissions/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/space-access-and-configuration-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.1-e06","sec":"620.3.1","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Esther is reviewing the permission scheme for project WAVE at Verdant Rail before a compliance audit. Which statement about how project permissions work together is NOT true?","zh":"Verdant Rail 的 Esther 在法遵稽核前檢查 project WAVE 的 permission scheme。關於 project 權限如何互相搭配，哪一個敘述<b>不</b>正確？","zo":["幾乎所有 issue 權限都還需要 Browse Projects 權限","使用者必須先有 Browse Projects，Create Issues 權限才能讓他建立 issue","把 issue 搬到另一個 project，還需要目的地 project 的 Create Issues","Manage Sprints 讓使用者更新 sprint，但不能修改 sprint 裡的 issue"],"fig":"","opts":["Almost all issue permissions also require the Browse Projects permission","A user must have Browse Projects before the Create Issues permission lets them create issues","Moving an issue to another project also requires Create Issues in the destination project","Manage Sprints lets a user update a sprint, but not change the issues inside it"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"正確敘述（不選）。官方說幾乎所有 issue 權限都要 Browse Projects；缺了它，Edit、Transition 等權限都用不上。","B":"錯誤敘述（要選）。官方寫明 Create Issues 即使沒有 Browse Projects 也能建立 issue，它就是那個例外。常見誤解：以為建立前一定要先能瀏覽 project。","C":"正確敘述（不選）。Move Issues 讓人把 issue 搬出去，但還要在目的地 project 有 Create Issues 才搬得進去。","D":"正確敘述（不選）。Manage Sprints 只管 sprint 本身；要改 sprint 裡的 issue，要 Edit Issues 與 Schedule Issues 這類 issue 權限。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/how-permissions-interact-with-each-other/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/work-item-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.1-e07","sec":"620.3.1","dom":"620.3","type":"multi","n":3,"stem":"Hana is a Jira administrator at Lantern Bio. A new release train manager asks what the Manage Sprints permission does in a company-managed project. Which three statements are true? (Choose three.)","zh":"Hana 是 Lantern Bio 的 Jira 管理員。一位新的 release train manager 問她：在 company-managed project 裡，Manage Sprints 權限能做什麼。哪三個敘述正確？（選三個）","zo":["它讓使用者建立、開始、完成 sprint，並修改 sprint 的期間與目標","Jira 管理員也需要該 project 的 Manage Sprints 才能完成 sprint","它是全域權限，在 Global permissions 頁授予","Sprint 裡有好幾個 project 的 issue 時，要更新這個 sprint，使用者需要在所有這些 project 都有 Manage Sprints","即使沒有 Schedule Issues，它也讓使用者能排序 backlog 裡的 issue","要修改 sprint 裡的 issue（例如排序），使用者還需要 Edit Issues 與 Schedule Issues"],"fig":"","opts":["It allows a user to create, start, and complete sprints, and to change a sprint's duration and goal","A Jira administrator also needs Manage Sprints in the project to complete a sprint","It is a global permission, granted on the Global permissions page","To update a sprint that contains issues from several projects, the user needs Manage Sprints in all of those projects","It allows a user to rank issues in the backlog, even without Schedule Issues","To change the issues in a sprint, such as their rank, the user also needs Edit Issues and Schedule Issues"],"ans":"ADF","why":{"A":"對。官方說 Manage Sprints 讓使用者建立、開始、完成 sprint，並調整 sprint 的期間與目標。它管的是 sprint 這個容器本身。","B":"錯。官方說完成 sprint 要「Jira administrator 或有 Manage Sprints 的人」，兩者其一即可，Jira admin 不必另外拿 Manage Sprints。","C":"錯。Manage Sprints 是 project 權限，寫在 permission scheme 裡；全域權限清單裡沒有它。","D":"對。官方說 sprint 內有多個 project 的 issue 時，要在所有相關 project 都有 Manage Sprints 才能更新這個 sprint。","E":"錯。這是常見誤解：Manage Sprints 不管 issue 排序。拖曳排序要 Schedule Issues＋Edit Issues。","F":"對。官方寫明 Manage Sprints 不允許更新 sprint 裡的工作，要改 issue 得靠 Edit Issues 與 Schedule Issues。排序正是這兩把鑰匙。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/space-access-and-configuration-permissions/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/how-permissions-interact-with-each-other/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/complete-a-sprint/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.1-e08","sec":"620.3.1","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"At Quillmark Publishing, contractors in project EDIT report that when they @mention someone in a comment or use the Reviewer user picker field, they only see people who can browse EDIT. Employees from other departments do not appear. Which permission are the contractors missing?","zh":"Quillmark Publishing 的外包人員在 project EDIT 回報：他們在留言裡 @提及別人，或使用 Reviewer 這個 user picker 欄位時，只看得到能瀏覽 EDIT 的人，其他部門的員工都不會出現。這些外包人員缺少哪一個權限？","zo":["Assignable User","Browse Projects","Administer Projects","Browse users and groups"],"fig":"","opts":["Assignable User","Browse Projects","Administer Projects","Browse users and groups"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。Assignable User 決定誰「可以被指派」issue，跟 @提及或 user picker 能看到哪些人無關。","B":"錯。他們已經看得到 EDIT 的內容；Browse Projects 只管看 project 與 issue，不會讓他們在 picker 裡看到全站的人。","C":"錯。Administer Projects 管 project 設定與 role 成員，不會改變 @提及與 user picker 能搜尋到誰。","D":"對。這是全域權限。官方說沒有它的人，在 user picker 與 @提及時只看得到在目前 project 有 Browse 的使用者；有了才看得到全站所有人。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/manage-global-permissions/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/troubleshoot-permissions-configurations/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.1-e09","sec":"620.3.1","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Rahul, a product manager at Brightwater Energy, can create team-managed projects on his own. When he tries to create a company-managed Scrum project for a new program, he cannot. He is a project administrator of two existing company-managed projects. What is the reason?","zh":"Brightwater Energy 的產品經理 Rahul 可以自己建立 team-managed project。但他想為新計畫建立一個 company-managed Scrum project 時卻建不了。他是兩個既有 company-managed project 的 project administrator。原因是什麼？","zo":["他得先在一個已經使用 Scrum 範本的既有 project 裡擁有 Administer Projects 權限","建立 company-managed project 需要 Administer Jira 全域權限，而他沒有","他缺少 Browse users and groups 全域權限，而指定 project lead 需要這個權限","即使使用者有 Administer Jira，也只有 organization admin 能建立 company-managed project"],"fig":"","opts":["He first needs the Administer Projects permission in an existing project that already uses the Scrum template","Creating a company-managed project requires the Administer Jira global permission, which he does not have","He lacks the Browse users and groups global permission, which is required to add a project lead","Only organization admins can create company-managed projects, even if a user has Administer Jira"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。Administer Projects 是單一 project 內的權限，管那個 project 的設定，不會讓人建立新的 company-managed project。","B":"對。官方說 Create team-managed projects 只能建 team-managed；company-managed 由 Administer Jira 決定。他當得了兩個 CMP 的 project admin，也不等於有 Administer Jira。","C":"錯。Browse users and groups 影響 user picker 與 @提及能看到誰，不是建立 project 的門檻。","D":"錯。官方說有 Administer Jira 的 Jira admin 就能建立 company-managed 與 team-managed project，不必是 org admin。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/manage-global-permissions/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/create-a-new-project/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.1-e10","sec":"620.3.1","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"At Solace Robotics, eight company-managed projects share one permission scheme. The Jira administrator, Aroha, wants each project's administrators to decide who can manage sprints in their own project, without Aroha editing the scheme every time someone changes. Which option meets the requirement with the least ongoing effort?","zh":"Solace Robotics 有八個 company-managed project 共用一個 permission scheme。Jira 管理員 Aroha 希望每個 project 的管理員自己決定誰能在自己的 project 管理 sprint，而不必每次換人都由 Aroha 修改 scheme。哪個做法以最少的後續工作達成需求？","zo":["在共用 scheme 裡把 Manage Sprints 授予個別使用者，每次有 project 提出需求就更新名單","為每個 project 建立各自的 permission scheme，在每一份裡把 Manage Sprints 授予不同使用者","在共用 scheme 裡把 Manage Sprints 授予一個新的 project role，再讓各 project 管理員填入這個 role 的成員","在共用 scheme 裡把 Manage Sprints 授予一個新的 group，再請每個 project 管理員把自己的 sprint 負責人加進那個 group"],"fig":"","opts":["Grant Manage Sprints to individual users in the shared scheme and update the list whenever a project asks","Create a separate permission scheme for each project and grant Manage Sprints to different users in each one","Grant Manage Sprints to a new project role in the shared scheme, and let project administrators add the role members","Grant Manage Sprints to a new group in the shared scheme, and ask each project administrator to add their sprint leads to that group"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。直接把使用者寫進共用 scheme，那個人在八個 project 都會有 Manage Sprints，而且每次變動都得由 Jira admin 改 scheme。","B":"錯。拆成八份 scheme 雖然能分開控制，但每次換人仍要 Jira admin 去改 scheme，維護成本最高。","C":"對。Role 是 scheme 裡的佔位；官方正是用「Lead Developer role 拿 Manage Sprints」舉例。各 project 的 admin 自己填 role 成員，權限只在自己的 project 生效。","D":"錯。Group 是全站共用的，成員在八個 project 都會拿到權限；而且 group 成員由 org admin 管理，project admin 改不動。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/how-to-use-space-roles/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/grant-or-revoke-permissions-in-a-scheme/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.1-e11","sec":"620.3.1","dom":"620.3","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Chioma has the Administer Projects permission in the company-managed project MKT at Saffron Media, but she is not a Jira administrator. Which two tasks can she perform on her own? (Choose two.)","zh":"Saffron Media 的 Chioma 在 company-managed project MKT 擁有 Administer Projects 權限，但她不是 Jira 管理員。她可以自己完成哪兩件事？（選兩個）","zo":["為 MKT 建立一個叫 Reviewer 的新 project role","把一位使用者加進 MKT 既有的 Developers role","把 MKT 換成另一份 permission scheme","編輯一個 MKT 與另外三個 project 共用的 workflow","在 MKT 建立與編輯 components"],"fig":"","opts":["Create a new project role called Reviewer for MKT","Add a user to the existing Developers role in MKT","Switch MKT to a different permission scheme","Edit a workflow that MKT shares with three other projects","Create and edit components in MKT"],"ans":"BE","why":{"A":"錯。建立新的 project role 要到 ⚙ → System → Project roles，只有 Jira admin 做得到；project admin 只能把人放進既有的 role。","B":"對。官方說只有 Administer Projects 的人能把使用者指派到 project role。這正是 role 設計的用意：Jira admin 定 scheme，project admin 填成員。","C":"錯。官方說替 company-managed project 換成另一份 permission scheme 需要 Administer Jira，只有 Administer Projects 做不到。","D":"錯。Workflow 若被其他 project 共用，官方說要 Administer Jira 才能改；Edit workflows 權限只適用於沒被共用的 workflow。","E":"對。官方列出 Administer Projects 可以編輯 components、versions，以及名稱、URL、lead、描述等 project details。"},"note":"現行 UI 把 Administer Projects 叫 Administer spaces，project role 叫 space role。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/space-access-and-configuration-permissions/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/create-a-new-space-role/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/change-which-permission-scheme-a-space-uses/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/how-permissions-interact-with-each-other/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.1-e12","sec":"620.3.1","dom":"620.3","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. The permission scheme for project OPS at Marlow Transit is shown. Yusuf belongs only to the Contractors role, and Leah belongs only to the Leads role. Which two statements are true? (Choose two.)","zh":"圖中是 Marlow Transit 的 project OPS 所用的 permission scheme。Yusuf 只屬於 Contractors role，Leah 只屬於 Leads role。哪兩個敘述正確？（選兩個）","zo":["只有 Leads role 的成員能修改 OPS issue 的 Assignee 欄位","Yusuf 可以修改 Assignee 欄位，因為 Edit Issues 涵蓋所有欄位","Leah 可以修改 Assignee 欄位，但不能編輯 Summary 等其他欄位","Yusuf 可以被選為 OPS issue 的 assignee","Leah 可以被選為 OPS issue 的 assignee"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 219\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"OPS permission scheme\"><rect x=\"0.5\" y=\"0.5\" width=\"379\" height=\"218\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"380\" height=\"34\" rx=\"0\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Project settings › Permissions</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">OPS permission scheme</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Permission → Granted to</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"119\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"119\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Browse Projects</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Developers, Contractors, Leads</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"145\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"145\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"137\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Edit Issues</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"137\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Developers, Contractors</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"171\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"171\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"163\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Assign Issues</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"163\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Leads</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"197\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"197\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"189\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Assignable User</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"189\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Developers</text></svg>","opts":["Only members of the Leads role can change the Assignee field on OPS issues","Yusuf can change the Assignee field, because Edit Issues covers every field","Leah can change the Assignee field, but she cannot edit other fields such as Summary","Yusuf can be selected as the assignee of an OPS issue","Leah can be selected as the assignee of an OPS issue"],"ans":"AC","why":{"A":"對。Scheme 另外設定了 Assign Issues，改 Assignee 只看這個最具體的權限；Developers 與 Contractors 雖然有 Edit Issues，也改不了 Assignee。","B":"錯。只有在 scheme 完全沒設定 Assign Issues 時，Edit Issues 才涵蓋 Assignee；圖上 Assign Issues 已經授予 Leads。","C":"對。官方說只有 Assign Issues、沒有 Edit Issues 的人，只能改 Assignee，其他欄位都不能改。Leah 正是這種情況。","D":"錯。能不能「被指派」看 Assignable User，圖上只授予 Developers；Yusuf 能編輯 issue，不代表能出現在指派名單裡。","E":"錯。Leah 有 Assign Issues，能去改 Assignee 欄位，但官方說這不等於她能被指派；Assignable User 只給了 Developers。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/how-permissions-interact-with-each-other/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/work-item-permissions/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/troubleshoot-permissions-configurations/"],"lvl":3,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.2-e01","sec":"620.3.2","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Lucía Ferreira is the project administrator of the company-managed project NOVA at Quillfeather Media. She saved a filter that returns overdue NOVA issues and wants its results emailed every Monday to the people in NOVA's Developers project role. Those people are not currently in any shared group. She holds the Manage group filter subscriptions global permission. What should she do?","zh":"Lucía Ferreira 是 Quillfeather Media 的 company-managed project NOVA 的 project administrator。她存了一個會撈出 NOVA 逾期 issue 的 filter，想在每週一把結果寄給 NOVA 的 Developers project role 裡的人。這些人目前不在任何共同的 group 裡。她擁有 Manage group filter subscriptions 全域權限。她該怎麼做？","zo":["在這個 filter 建立新的 subscription，把 NOVA 的 Developers project role 選為每週信件的收件人。","把 filter 分享給 NOVA 的 Developers role；filter 分享給哪個 role，該 role 的成員就會收到結果的 email。","請人把這些 developer 放進一個她自己也在裡面的 group，再讓那個 group 訂閱這個 filter。","在 NOVA 使用的 notification scheme 裡，把 Developers role 加成 Issue Updated 事件的收件人。"],"fig":"","opts":["Create a new subscription on the filter and choose the Developers project role of NOVA as the recipient of the weekly email.","Share the filter with the Developers role of NOVA; members of a role that a filter is shared with receive its results by email.","Get the developers placed in a group she also belongs to, then subscribe that group to the filter.","Add the Developers role as a recipient of the Issue Updated event in the notification scheme that NOVA uses."],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。常見誤解：filter subscription 可以訂給 project role。官方寫明收件人只能選自己或 group，清單裡根本沒有 project role。","B":"錯。Share 給 role 只是讓這些人看得到、能執行這個 filter，不會定期寄信；定期寄信要另外建立 subscription。","C":"對。Filter subscription 的收件人只能是自己或 group，而且只能選自己所屬的 group。她已有 Manage group filter subscriptions 全域權限，所以只差把人放進她所屬的 group。","D":"錯。Notification scheme 是 issue 發生事件時才寄通知，不會每週寄出 filter 的結果；改它還會影響所有共用這份 scheme 的 project。"},"note":"Role「能用」：分享 filter／dashboard。Role「不能用」：filter subscription、全域權限。分享和訂閱是兩件事，別混在一起。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/manage-filters/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.2-e02","sec":"620.3.2","dom":"620.3","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Omar Haddad, a Jira administrator at Brightwater Labs, is documenting where the Release Managers project role can be used. In which two places is a project role NOT available as a choice? (Choose two.)","zh":"Omar Haddad 是 Brightwater Labs 的 Jira administrator，正在整理 Release Managers 這個 project role 能用在哪些地方。在下列哪兩個地方，<b>不能</b>選 project role？（選兩個。）","zo":["Notification scheme 中某個事件的收件人","Filter 的 email subscription 收件人","被授予某個 issue security level 的使用者","Workflow transition 上的 condition","被授予 Make bulk changes 全域權限的使用者","共享 dashboard 的檢視者"],"fig":"","opts":["The recipients of an event in a notification scheme","The recipients of a filter's email subscription","The users granted an issue security level","A condition on a workflow transition","The users granted the Make bulk changes global permission","The viewers of a shared dashboard"],"ans":"BE","why":{"A":"錯。這裡可以用 role：notification scheme 的收件人類型就有 project role，官方還建議優先用 role 而不是 group，以減少 scheme 數量。","B":"對。這裡不能用 role。Filter subscription 的收件人只能選自己或 group（而且是自己所屬的 group），沒有 project role 可選。","C":"錯。這裡可以用 role：issue security level 可以授予 project role，各 project 由自己的成員決定誰看得到受保護的 issue。","D":"錯。這裡可以用 role：workflow 有 User Is In Project Role 這類 condition，只讓特定 role 的成員執行某個 transition。","E":"對。這裡不能用 role。Make bulk changes 是全域權限，套用在整個站台，授予對象是 group（或個別使用者），不能選 project role。","F":"錯。這裡可以用 role：dashboard 和 filter 都能分享給某個 project 的某個 role，這正是 role 的用途之一。"},"note":"口訣：Role 五能用（permission、notification、security level、workflow condition、分享）；三不能（全域權限、產品存取、filter subscription）。<br><b>考試版／現行版：</b>現行 UI 把 project role 叫 space role、issue security level 叫 work item security level。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/how-to-use-space-roles/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/manage-filters/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/what-are-global-permissions-and-what-do-they-do/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/view-grant-revoke-global-permissions-in-jira/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-notification-schemes/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-advanced-issue-workflows/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.2-e03","sec":"620.3.2","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. Projects ORCA and PELI at Harbor &amp; Pine Outfitters use the permission scheme shown, and the scheme has no other grants. The ORCA project administrator adds Nadia Rahman to the Scrum Masters role in ORCA only. Nadia holds no other role in either project. What is the result?","zh":"請看附圖。Harbor &amp; Pine Outfitters 的 ORCA 與 PELI 兩個 project 使用圖中的 permission scheme，而且這份 scheme 沒有其他授權。ORCA 的 project administrator 只在 ORCA 把 Nadia Rahman 加進 Scrum Masters role。Nadia 在兩個 project 都沒有其他 role。結果會是什麼？","zo":["Nadia 在 ORCA 和 PELI 都能管理 sprint，因為兩個 project 共用同一份 permission scheme。","Nadia 可以開始和完成 ORCA 的 sprint，因為 Manage Sprints 自動包含 Browse Projects。","要等 Jira administrator 也把她的名字加進 permission scheme，Nadia 才會有任何變化。","Nadia 仍然看不到 ORCA 和它的 issue，因為 Browse Projects 只授予 Developers role。"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 329\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Permission scheme\"><rect x=\"0.5\" y=\"0.5\" width=\"379\" height=\"328\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"380\" height=\"34\" rx=\"0\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Jira settings › Issues</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Permission scheme</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Scheme name</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"95\" width=\"356\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"113\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Harbor Shared Scheme</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"144\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Used by projects</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"150\" width=\"356\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"168\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">ORCA, PELI</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"199\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Permission / Granted to</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"229\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"221\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Browse Projects</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"221\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Project role: Developers</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"255\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"255\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"247\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Create Issues</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"247\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Project role: Developers</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"281\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"281\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"273\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Manage Sprints</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"273\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Project role: Scrum Masters</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"307\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"307\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"299\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Administer Projects</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"299\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Project role: Administrators</text></svg>","opts":["Nadia can manage sprints in both ORCA and PELI, because the two projects share the permission scheme.","Nadia can start and complete ORCA sprints, because Manage Sprints automatically includes Browse Projects.","Nothing changes for Nadia until a Jira administrator also adds her name to the permission scheme.","Nadia still cannot view ORCA or its issues, because Browse Projects is granted only to the Developers role."],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。Scheme 裡寫的是 role，而 role 的成員是各 project 分開填的。她只在 ORCA 的 Scrum Masters 裡，PELI 的同名 role 沒有她。","B":"錯。常見誤解：有其他權限就自動能看 project。Manage Sprints 不包含 Browse Projects；Browse Projects 要另外授予，而圖上它只給了 Developers。","C":"錯。Role 就是 scheme 裡的佔位符：project admin 把人放進 role，她就立刻擁有該 role 在 scheme 裡的權限，不需要 Jira admin 改 scheme。","D":"對。官方說 Browse Projects 是 project 裡幾乎所有權限的前提。圖上它只授予 Developers，Nadia 只有 Scrum Masters，所以看不到 ORCA 和它的 issue，Manage Sprints 也就用不上。"},"note":"Browse Projects 是幾乎所有 project 權限的前提。檢查某人能不能做某事時，先確認他看不看得到這個 project。<br><b>考試版／現行版：</b>現行 UI 叫 Browse spaces。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/space-access-and-configuration-permissions/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/how-to-use-space-roles/"],"lvl":3,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.2-e04","sec":"620.3.2","dom":"620.3","type":"multi","n":4,"stem":"Mateus Oliveira, a Jira administrator at Sundial Insurance, is preparing an audit of every configuration that references the Auditors project role and opens View Usage for it. Which four types of configuration can this page list? (Choose four.)","zh":"Sundial Insurance 的 Jira administrator Mateus Oliveira 正在整理稽核報告，要列出所有引用 Auditors 這個 project role 的設定，於是對它按了 View Usage。這一頁可以列出哪四類設定？（選四個。）","zo":["Permission scheme","Filter subscription","Notification scheme","Issue security level","全域權限（global permission）","Workflow condition"],"fig":"","opts":["Permission schemes","Filter subscriptions","Notification schemes","Issue security levels","Global permissions","Workflow conditions"],"ans":"ACDF","why":{"A":"對。Permission scheme 最常引用 role，例如把 Browse Projects 授予某個 role。View Usage 會列出這些 scheme，稽核時可以看出哪些權限是透過這個 role 給出去的。","B":"錯。常見誤解：subscription 也能訂給 role。Filter subscription 的收件人只能是自己或 group，本來就不會引用 role，也不會出現在這頁。","C":"對。Notification scheme 的收件人可以選某個 project role，事件發生時寄給該 project 的 role 成員。View Usage 會列出引用這個 role 的 notification scheme，稽核時就知道哪些通知會寄給這個 role。","D":"對。Issue security level 可以授予 project role。View Usage 會列出哪些 security level 用到它，稽核時可以看出誰能透過這個 role 看到受保護的 issue。","E":"錯。全域權限套用在整個站台，授予對象是 group 或個別使用者，不能選 project role，所以不會出現在 role 的使用清單裡。","F":"對。Workflow 可以用 User Is In Project Role 之類的 condition，限制只有某個 role 的成員能執行 transition。View Usage 會列出用到這個 role 的 workflow condition，稽核時可以看出哪些 transition 受這個 role 限制。"},"note":"官方 View space role usage 頁列出四類：permission scheme、email notification scheme、work item security level、workflow condition。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/view-space-role-usage/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/manage-filters/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/what-are-global-permissions-and-what-do-they-do/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.2-e05","sec":"620.3.2","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. Tomasz Wójcik is a Jira administrator at Kestrel Air. The members of the QA Leads project role in project KITE want to email filter results to their QA groups on a schedule, but when they create a filter subscription they can select only themselves as the recipient. What should Tomasz do?","zh":"請看附圖。Tomasz Wójcik 是 Kestrel Air 的 Jira administrator。KITE project 裡 QA Leads project role 的成員想定期把 filter 結果寄給他們的 QA group，但建立 filter subscription 時，收件人只能選他們自己。Tomasz 該怎麼做？","zo":["請人把 QA lead 們加進一個 group，再到 Global permissions 頁把 Manage group filter subscriptions 授予這個 group。","在 Global permissions 頁把 Manage group filter subscriptions 直接授予 QA Leads project role。","把 Manage group filter subscriptions 加進 KITE 的 permission scheme，並授予 QA Leads project role。","請 KITE 的 project administrator 從 Project settings → People 把這個權限給 QA lead 們。"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 243\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Global permissions\"><rect x=\"0.5\" y=\"0.5\" width=\"379\" height=\"242\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"380\" height=\"34\" rx=\"0\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Jira settings › System</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Global permissions</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Permission / Granted to group</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"119\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"119\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Administer Jira</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">kestrel-admins</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"145\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"145\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"137\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Browse users and groups</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"137\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">kestrel-staff</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"171\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"171\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"163\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Manage group filter subscriptions</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"163\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">kestrel-admins</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"197\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"197\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"189\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Make bulk changes</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"189\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">kestrel-staff</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"218\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s tf-violet\" style=\"font-weight:700\">No other grants exist for these permissions.</text></svg>","opts":["Have the QA leads added to a group, then grant Manage group filter subscriptions to that group on the Global permissions page.","Grant Manage group filter subscriptions directly to the QA Leads project role on the Global permissions page.","Add Manage group filter subscriptions to KITE's permission scheme and grant it to the QA Leads project role.","Ask the KITE project administrator to grant the permission to the QA leads from Project settings → People."],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。圖上 Manage group filter subscriptions 只授予 kestrel-admins，所以他們只能訂給自己。全域權限要授予 group（或個別使用者）。group 成員由組織管理員維護，Tomasz 負責在 Global permissions 頁授權。","B":"錯。常見誤解：全域權限可以授予 project role。全域權限套用在整個站台，授予對象只有 group 或個別使用者，選單裡沒有 project role。","C":"錯。Manage group filter subscriptions 是全域權限，不是 project 權限；permission scheme 只放 project 權限，裡面根本沒有這一項可以授予。","D":"錯。People 頁只能把人放進 project role，改變的是 project 權限；全域權限只有 Jira admin 能在 Global permissions 頁授予。"},"note":"官方 Manage filters 頁：要把 group 選為 subscription 收件人，必須有 Manage group filter subscriptions 全域權限，而且只能選自己所屬的 group。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/what-are-global-permissions-and-what-do-they-do/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/view-grant-revoke-global-permissions-in-jira/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/manage-filters/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/grant-or-revoke-permissions-in-a-scheme/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.2-e06","sec":"620.3.2","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Ama Owusu is a product owner at Solace Energy and a member of the Stakeholders role in the company-managed project MERI. She has built a dashboard that only people in MERI's Stakeholders role should see, and access must follow automatically whenever the project administrator changes the role's members. Which option meets the requirement with the least effort?","zh":"Ama Owusu 是 Solace Energy 的 product owner，也是 company-managed project MERI 的 Stakeholders role 成員。她做了一個 dashboard，只有 MERI 的 Stakeholders role 成員應該看得到，而且 project administrator 更動 role 成員時，可看的人要自動跟著變。哪個做法最省力又符合需求？","zo":["請 Jira administrator 用目前的 stakeholder 建一個 group，再把 dashboard 分享給這個 group。","在 dashboard 使用 Rename or share，把 project MERI 的 Stakeholders role 加為 viewer。","為 Stakeholders role 建立 filter subscription，讓成員每週收到 dashboard 的連結。","在 MERI 使用的 permission scheme 裡，授予 Stakeholders role 存取這個 dashboard 的權限。"],"fig":"","opts":["Ask a Jira administrator to create a group with the current stakeholders, then share the dashboard with that group.","Use Rename or share on the dashboard and add project MERI with the Stakeholders role as a viewer.","Create a filter subscription for the Stakeholders role so its members receive the dashboard link every week.","Grant the Stakeholders role access to the dashboard in the permission scheme that MERI uses."],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。分享給 group 做得到，但 group 由組織管理員維護，project admin 改 role 成員時不會跟著變，還要多請人建 group，不是最省力。","B":"對。Dashboard 和 filter 都能分享給「某個 project 的某個 role」。之後 project admin 在 People 頁增減 Stakeholders 成員，能看的人就自動跟著變。","C":"錯。Filter subscription 的收件人只能是自己或 group，不能選 project role；而且寄連結也不會限制誰能看 dashboard。","D":"錯。Permission scheme 管的是 project 權限，例如 Browse Projects，裡面沒有 dashboard 這一項；dashboard 的可見範圍在它自己的分享設定裡。"},"note":"Role 能用在「分享」filter／dashboard，但不能用在 filter「訂閱」。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/how-to-use-space-roles/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/create-and-edit-dashboards/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/manage-filters/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.2-e07","sec":"620.3.2","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Farida Nasser, a Jira administrator at Lindqvist Legal, maintains one issue security scheme shared by 20 client projects. Issues set to the Partner Eyes Only level must be visible only to that project's engagement counsel (the partners assigned to that client). Each project has different counsel, and each project administrator must be able to update the list without editing the scheme. What should Farida add to the security level?","zh":"Farida Nasser 是 Lindqvist Legal 的 Jira administrator，維護一份由 20 個客戶 project 共用的 issue security scheme。設成 Partner Eyes Only level 的 issue，只能讓該 project 的 engagement counsel（負責這個客戶的 partner）看到。每個 project 的人選都不同，而且各 project administrator 要能自己更新名單，不必修改 scheme。Farida 應該把什麼加到這個 security level？","zo":["Group：legal-partners","為每位 partner 各加一筆 Single user","Reporter","Project lead","Project role：Engagement Counsel"],"fig":"","opts":["Group: legal-partners","A Single user entry for every partner","Reporter","Project lead","Project role: Engagement Counsel"],"ans":"E","why":{"A":"錯。Group 在所有 project 都是同一批人，A 客戶的 partner 也會看到 B 客戶的 issue；而且 group 不是 project admin 能自己改的。","B":"錯。在共用的 scheme 裡加 Single user，這個人在 20 個 project 都拿得到這個 level；每次換人還得請 Jira admin 改 scheme。","C":"錯。Reporter 是依每張 issue 的 Reporter 欄位決定，只有列在該欄位的人看得到（預設是建立者，但可以改），跟「這個 project 的 engagement counsel 名單」無關。","D":"錯。Project lead 每個 project 只有一個人，無法涵蓋多位 partner；而且換 lead 屬於 project 設定，不是維護名單。","E":"對。Issue security level 可以授予 project role。Scheme 只寫 Engagement Counsel role 這個佔位符，各 project admin 在 People 頁填入自己負責的 partner，20 個 project 各看各的，也不必動 scheme。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>現行 UI 叫 work item security level，Project lead 叫 Space lead。Issue security scheme 不能在 Free 方案設定。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/grant-users-access-to-security-levels-in-a-work-item-security-scheme/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/how-to-use-space-roles/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.2-e08","sec":"620.3.2","dom":"620.3","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Kwame Mensah is the project administrator of the company-managed project TERRA at Ostrava Robotics. He is not a Jira administrator. Which two actions can he perform himself from Project settings → People? (Choose two.)","zh":"Kwame Mensah 是 Ostrava Robotics 的 company-managed project TERRA 的 project administrator，但不是 Jira administrator。他可以自己在 Project settings → People 完成哪兩件事？（選兩個。）","zo":["把 robotics-qa 這個 group 加進 TERRA 的 Testers role","為 TERRA 建立一個叫 Testers 的新 project role","把某位使用者設成 Testers role 在所有新 project 的 default member","把一位同事加進 TERRA 的 Administrators role","把 Browse users and groups 全域權限授予 TERRA 的 Testers role","把 TERRA 改用另一份 permission scheme"],"fig":"","opts":["Add the group robotics-qa to TERRA's Testers role","Create a new project role called Testers for TERRA","Make a user a default member of the Testers role for all new projects","Add a teammate to TERRA's Administrators role","Grant the Browse users and groups global permission to TERRA's Testers role","Switch TERRA to a different permission scheme"],"ans":"AD","why":{"A":"對。Project admin 在 People 頁按 Add people，就能把使用者或 group 放進既有的 role，成員立刻取得該 role 在 scheme 裡的權限。","B":"錯。常見誤解：project admin 能自己建 role。CMP 的 role 由 Jira admin 在 System → Project roles 建立，建好後各 project 才能填人。","C":"錯。Default members 由 Jira admin 在 System → Project roles 的 Manage Default Members 設定，而且只套用到之後新建的 project。","D":"對。官方說同樣的步驟也能把使用者或 group 加進 Administrators role。要注意 role 本身不帶權限：被加進去的人能不能管理 TERRA，要看 permission scheme 有沒有把 Administer Projects 授予這個 role。","E":"錯。Browse users and groups 是全域權限，只有 Jira admin 能在 Global permissions 頁授予，對象是 group（或個別使用者），不能選 project role。","F":"錯。換 project 使用的 permission scheme 需要 Administer Jira 全域權限，是 Jira admin 的工作，project admin 做不到。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>現行 UI 路徑是 Space settings → People → Add people。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/add-users-to-space-roles-in-your-space/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/create-a-new-space-role/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/change-which-permission-scheme-a-space-uses/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/view-grant-revoke-global-permissions-in-jira/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.2-e09","sec":"620.3.2","dom":"620.3","type":"multi","n":3,"stem":"Olu Adeyemi, a Jira administrator at Pinewood Transit, adds Beatriz Costa to the Administrators role of the company-managed project ZEST. In ZEST's permission scheme, that role holds Administer Projects. Which three things can Beatriz now do in ZEST? (Choose three.)","zh":"Pinewood Transit 的 Jira administrator Olu Adeyemi 把 Beatriz Costa 加進 company-managed project ZEST 的 Administrators role。在 ZEST 的 permission scheme 裡，這個 role 擁有 Administer Projects。Beatriz 現在可以在 ZEST 做哪三件事？（選三個。）","zo":["編輯 ZEST 使用的 notification scheme","把使用者加進 ZEST 的 project role","建立和編輯 ZEST 的 components","讓 ZEST 改用另一份 permission scheme","修改 ZEST 的名稱和 project lead","為姊妹團隊建立一個新的 company-managed project"],"fig":"","opts":["Edit the notification scheme that ZEST uses","Add users to ZEST's project roles","Create and edit ZEST's components","Associate ZEST with a different permission scheme","Change ZEST's name and project lead","Create a new company-managed project for a sister team"],"ans":"BCE","why":{"A":"錯。建立和編輯 notification scheme 屬於 Administer Jira 全域權限的範圍；而且 scheme 可能被多個 project 共用，不是單一 project admin 能改的。","B":"對。官方寫明只有擁有 Administer Projects 的人能把使用者指派到 project role。她可以在 People 頁增減各 role 的成員，這正是 project admin 最常用的能力。","C":"對。官方列出的 Administer Projects 能力包含編輯 components 與 versions。這些設定只影響 ZEST 這一個 project，所以交給 project admin 自己管理，不需要 Jira admin。","D":"錯。換 project 使用的 permission scheme 需要 Administer Jira 全域權限；project admin 只能在既有 scheme 的 role 裡填人。","E":"對。Administer Projects 可以編輯部分 project 細節，包括名稱、URL、project lead 和描述。要注意的是，company-managed project 的 key 與 category 仍然只有 Jira admin 能改。","F":"錯。建立 company-managed project 需要 Administer Jira 全域權限；Create team-managed projects 全域權限也只能建 team-managed。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>現行 UI 叫 Administer spaces。CMP 的 project key 與 category 只有 Jira admin 能改（MERGE-LOG V1、V3）。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/space-access-and-configuration-permissions/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/what-are-global-permissions-and-what-do-they-do/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/change-which-permission-scheme-a-space-uses/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.2-e10","sec":"620.3.2","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. At Corran Metro, Rafael Moreno leads only the BUSX project. He was added to the pm-leads group so that he could manage BUSX's role members. Other project administrators now complain that Rafael can also change roles and components in their projects. Each of the other project administrators is already a member of the Administrators role in their own project. The scheme must remain shared. Which change fixes the problem?","zh":"請看附圖。在 Corran Metro，Rafael Moreno 只負責 BUSX 這個 project。當初為了讓他管理 BUSX 的 role 成員，把他加進了 pm-leads group。現在其他 project administrator 抱怨 Rafael 也能改他們 project 的 role 和 components。其他 project administrator 都已經是自己 project 的 Administrators role 成員。這份 scheme 必須繼續共用。哪個改法能解決問題？","zo":["把 Rafael 移出 pm-leads，改在共用的 scheme 裡用一筆 Single user 把 Administer Projects 授予他。","為 12 個 project 各複製一份獨立的 permission scheme。","把 Rafael 設成 Administrators role 的 default member，讓他只在 BUSX 當 admin。","把 Administer Projects 改授予 Administrators role、不再授予 pm-leads，並把 Rafael 加進 BUSX 的這個 role。"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 353\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Permission scheme\"><rect x=\"0.5\" y=\"0.5\" width=\"379\" height=\"352\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"380\" height=\"34\" rx=\"0\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Jira settings › Issues</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Permission scheme</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Scheme name</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"95\" width=\"356\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"113\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Transit Default Scheme</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"144\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Used by</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"150\" width=\"356\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"168\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">12 projects (including BUSX)</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"199\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Permission / Granted to</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"229\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"221\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Administer Projects</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"221\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Group: pm-leads</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"255\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"255\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"247\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Browse Projects</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"247\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Group: metro-staff</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"281\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"281\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"273\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Manage Sprints</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"273\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Project role: Developers</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"307\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"307\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"299\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Create Issues</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"299\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Project role: Developers</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"328\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s tf-violet\" style=\"font-weight:700\">Every employee belongs to metro-staff.</text></svg>","opts":["Remove Rafael from pm-leads and instead grant Administer Projects to him as a Single user entry in the shared scheme.","Create a separate copy of the permission scheme for each of the 12 projects.","Make Rafael a default member of the Administrators role so that he is an admin only in BUSX.","Grant Administer Projects to the Administrators role instead of pm-leads, and add Rafael to that role in BUSX."],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。Single user 寫在共用 scheme 裡，一樣對 12 個 project 全部生效，Rafael 還是能改別人的 project，問題沒解決。","B":"錯。拆成 12 份 scheme 做得到，但違反「scheme 要繼續共用」的要求，之後每次調整都要 Jira admin 改 12 份。","C":"錯。Default members 只會在之後新建的 project 自動加入，既有的 BUSX 不會變；而且圖中 Administer Projects 授予的是 pm-leads，不是 Administrators role，加進 role 也拿不到權限，更沒有把他移出 pm-leads。","D":"對。Group 在所有 project 都是同一批人，所以 Rafael 拿到 12 個 project 的 Administer Projects。改授予 role 後，各 project 自己填 Administrators，他只在 BUSX 有權；其他 admin 已在自己 project 的 role 裡，權限不受影響。"},"note":"判斷口訣：各 project 的人不同→用 role；全站都是同一批人→用 group。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/how-to-use-space-roles/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/grant-or-revoke-permissions-in-a-scheme/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/create-a-new-space-role/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/space-access-and-configuration-permissions/"],"lvl":3,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.3-e01","sec":"620.3.3","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. Bianca is the board administrator of the Scrum board used by two squads that work in projects NOVA and ORCA. When the squads open the timeline, Jira says that timelines are designed for a single project. The site is on Jira Software Standard, and leadership wants one roadmap that shows the epics of both projects together. What should Bianca recommend?","zh":"請看圖。Bianca 是一張 Scrum board 的 board administrator，這張 board 給在 NOVA 與 ORCA 兩個 project 工作的兩個小隊使用。小隊打開 timeline 時，Jira 顯示 timeline 是為單一 project 設計的。站台用的是 Jira Software Standard，主管想要一張同時顯示兩個 project 的 epic 的 roadmap。Bianca 應該建議什麼？","zo":["在 board 的 Timeline 設定開啟 child-level issue scheduling，讓兩個 project 的 issue 都能排上 timeline","把 ORCA 的 Browse Projects 權限給每位小隊成員，讓 timeline 讀得到 ORCA 的 issue","把站台升級到 Jira Premium 或 Enterprise，並在 Plans（Advanced Roadmaps）建立一個包含兩個 project 的 plan","把查詢中 <code>ORCA</code> 的部分搬到 Kanban board sub-filter，讓 timeline 只看到 NOVA"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 311\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Squad board 的 General 設定與 timeline 訊息\"><rect x=\"0.5\" y=\"0.5\" width=\"379\" height=\"310\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"380\" height=\"34\" rx=\"0\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"34\" width=\"106\" height=\"277\" rx=\"0\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><line x1=\"106\" y1=\"34\" x2=\"106\" y2=\"311\" class=\"gl\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Board settings</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">General</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Board name</text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"95\" width=\"250\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"128\" y=\"113\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Squad board</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"144\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Board type</text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"150\" width=\"250\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"128\" y=\"168\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Scrum</text><path d=\"M350,161 l5,5 l5,-5\" class=\"ln ink\" style=\"stroke-width:1.6\"/><text x=\"118\" y=\"199\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Filter query</text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"205\" width=\"250\" height=\"44\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx brand\"/><text x=\"126\" y=\"223\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t mono\" style=\"font-size:11px\">project in (NOVA, ORCA)</text><text x=\"126\" y=\"239\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t mono\" style=\"font-size:11px\">ORDER BY Rank ASC</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"270\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s tf-rose\" style=\"font-weight:700\">Timeline：Timelines are designed for a </text><text x=\"118\" y=\"286\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s tf-rose\" style=\"font-weight:700\">single project</text><rect x=\"6\" y=\"39\" width=\"94\" height=\"22\" rx=\"6\" class=\"sf-brand\"/><text x=\"14\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">General</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"80\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Columns</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"106\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Swimlanes</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"132\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Quick filters</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"158\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Card colors</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"184\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Card layout</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"210\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Estimation</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"236\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Working days</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"262\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Issue detail</text></svg>","opts":["Turn on child-level issue scheduling in the board's Timeline settings so that issues from both projects can be placed on the timeline","Grant the Browse Projects permission in ORCA to every squad member so that the timeline can read the ORCA issues","Upgrade the site to Jira Premium or Enterprise and build a plan in Plans (Advanced Roadmaps) that includes both projects","Move the <code>ORCA</code> part of the query into a Kanban board sub-filter so that the timeline only sees NOVA"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。Child-level scheduling 只是讓 story 層也能在 timeline 上排日期，不會解除「只能一個 project」的限制；board filter 撈兩個 project，timeline 照樣不能用。","B":"錯。這是 timeline 的範圍限制，不是權限問題；就算每個人都看得到 ORCA 的 issue，timeline 仍然只吃一個 project 的 issue。","C":"對。官方說 timeline 只能顯示一個 project 的 issue，跨 project 規劃只能用 Plans，而 Plans 只包含在 Premium 和 Enterprise。常見誤解：以為 timeline 能看多個 project，或 Standard 也有 Plans。","D":"錯。Sub-filter 只有 company-managed Kanban board 才有，這張是 Scrum board；而且就算只剩 NOVA，也做不到「兩個 project 在同一張 roadmap」的需求。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>現行 UI 把 project 叫 space，錯誤訊息寫成「Timelines are designed for a single space」。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/set-up-the-roadmap/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/what-is-the-roadmap/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/troubleshoot-the-timeline/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-filters/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.3-e02","sec":"620.3.3","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Tomasz, a scrum master for project KESTREL, turns on <b>Dependencies</b> and <b>Progress</b> in the timeline's View settings before a planning meeting. The next day, his teammate Leilani opens the same timeline and sees no dependency lines and no progress bars. Nothing else was changed. What is the most likely explanation?","zh":"Tomasz 是 project KESTREL 的 scrum master，他在規劃會議前，於 timeline 的 View settings 打開了 <b>Dependencies</b> 和 <b>Progress</b>。隔天，同事 Leilani 打開同一個 timeline，卻看不到依賴線，也看不到進度條。其他設定都沒有改過。最可能的原因是什麼？","zo":["Timeline 的 view settings 是每個使用者各自的，Leilani 要在自己的 View settings 打開 Dependencies 和 Progress","Tomasz 不是 board administrator，所以他一離開頁面，View settings 的變更就被捨棄了","只有 Plans 的 plan 才能顯示 dependencies，所以 Tomasz 看到的線在每次工作階段結束後就會消失","Leilani 沒有 Link Issues 權限，沒有這個權限 Jira 會在她的 timeline 上隱藏依賴線"],"fig":"","opts":["Timeline view settings apply per user, so Leilani must turn on Dependencies and Progress in her own View settings","Tomasz is not a board administrator, so his View settings changes were discarded when he left the page","Dependencies can be shown only in a plan in Plans, so the lines Tomasz saw disappear after each session","Leilani lacks the Link Issues permission, and without it Jira hides dependency lines from her timeline"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。View settings 是個人的顯示偏好，Tomasz 打開只影響他自己的畫面，同事要自己開。常見誤解：以為 view settings 是全域的，改了大家都變。","B":"錯。View settings 不需要 board admin 身分，也不會離開頁面就被丟掉；它是每個人自己的設定，Tomasz 自己的畫面仍會保留。","C":"錯。Project 的 timeline 本身就能在 View settings 的 Visual details 打開 Dependencies，不是只有 Plans 才有，也不會在工作階段結束後消失。","D":"錯。Link Issues 是建立或移除 issue link 的權限，不是「看得到依賴線」的條件；題目說其他都沒變，差別來自個人的 view settings。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>考試版把 timeline 的 View settings 當成個人設定。現行 Jira 多了 saved views：一般成員改的 view 只影響自己；space admin 則可以用 <b>Save view</b> 把設定存成全 space 共用的版本。本題 Tomasz 是 scrum master，也沒有存成共用 view，所以答案不變。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/customize-your-roadmaps-view-settings/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/show-or-hide-dependencies-on-your-roadmap/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/customize-your-view-of-the-board-and-backlog/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/save-and-share-views-from-your-list/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.3-e03","sec":"620.3.3","dom":"620.3","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Rafael, a product owner in project HELIX, opens the timeline to review last quarter's work and notices that several epics completed a few weeks ago are missing. His teammate Ayesha still sees those epics on her timeline. Which two statements are correct? (Choose two.)","zh":"Rafael 是 project HELIX 的 product owner，他打開 timeline 回顧上一季的工作，發現幾個幾週前完成的 epic 不見了。他的同事 Ayesha 在自己的 timeline 上仍看得到這些 epic。哪兩個敘述正確？（選兩個）","zo":["已完成的 parent 層項目（例如 epic）要不要顯示，是在 timeline 的 View settings 裡控制","Epic 一移到 Done 狀態，Jira 就會把它從所有 timeline 上永久移除","只有 Jira administrator 能改已完成項目的顯示方式，而且改了會套用到所有使用者","Timeline 會自動排除進入 Done 狀態類別超過一年的項目","已完成的 epic 只能在 Plans 的 plan 裡查看，而 Plans 需要 Jira Premium 或 Enterprise"],"fig":"","opts":["Whether done parent-level items such as epics appear is controlled from the timeline's View settings","Jira permanently removes every epic from all timelines as soon as the epic moves to a Done status","Only a Jira administrator can change how done items are shown, and the change applies to all users","The timeline automatically excludes items that moved to the Done status category more than a year ago","Done epics can be viewed only in a plan in Plans, which requires Jira Premium or Enterprise"],"ans":"AD","why":{"A":"對。已完成的 parent 層 issue（例如 epic）要不要顯示，是在 timeline 的 View settings 裡決定；而且這是個人設定，所以 Ayesha 還看得到。常見誤解：以為完成的 epic 會全部自動消失。","B":"錯。完成的 epic 不會一變成 Done 就被全部移除；只要 View settings 設定成顯示，它們仍會出現在 timeline 上，Ayesha 的畫面就是例子。","C":"錯。這是每個人在 timeline View settings 裡自己調的顯示選項，不需要 Jira admin，也不會改到其他使用者的畫面。","D":"對。官方的 timeline 限制說明：進入 Done 狀態類別超過一年的 issue 會被自動排除。所以只有「很久以前完成的」才會自動不見，幾週前完成的不會。","E":"錯。Project timeline 本身就能顯示已完成的 epic，只要 View settings 沒有把它們藏起來；不必為了看完成的 epic 去用 Plans。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>考試版在 View settings 的 <b>Issue display range</b>（教材稱 Show completed）選擇已完成的 issue 要顯示多久，預設 12 個月，也可以選 Hide all completed epic issues。現行 UI 改成 <b>Hide done item</b> 開關，只作用在 parent 層。兩個版本都不是「完成就全部自動移除」。另外，現行 Jira 多了 saved views：一般成員改的 view 只影響自己；space admin 則可以用 <b>Save view</b> 把設定存成全 space 共用的版本。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/customize-your-roadmaps-view-settings/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/troubleshoot-the-timeline/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/save-and-share-views-from-your-list/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.3-e04","sec":"620.3.3","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Jonas, the project administrator of the company-managed Scrum project PALLAS, archived version 4.2 last month because the team had stopped using it. Today the finance team asks for the Version Report of 4.2, but Jonas cannot find 4.2 in the report's version drop-down. What should he do?","zh":"Jonas 是 company-managed Scrum project PALLAS 的 project administrator，上個月因為團隊不再使用而把 4.2 版封存（archive）了。今天財務部門要 4.2 版的 Version Report，但 Jonas 在報表的版本下拉選單裡找不到 4.2。他該怎麼做？","zo":["把 4.2 重新填回每張 issue 的 Fix versions 欄位，因為封存時已經把所有 issue 上的這個值清掉了","把團隊改用 Kanban board，因為只有 Kanban board 的 Version Report 會列出封存的版本","把 4.2 Merge 到目前未發布的版本，讓它的 issue 與歷史出現在那個版本的報表裡","Unarchive 4.2，因為 Version Report 會顯示已發布的版本，但不會顯示已封存的版本"],"fig":"","opts":["Add 4.2 back to the Fix versions field of each issue, because archiving removed the value from all of its issues","Switch the team to a Kanban board, because the Version Report lists archived versions only on Kanban boards","Merge 4.2 into the current unreleased version so that its issues and history appear in that version's report","Unarchive 4.2, because the Version Report shows released versions but does not show archived versions"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。Archive 只是把版本從報表和其他地方藏起來，不會清掉 issue 上的 Fix versions 值；常見誤解就是以為封存後 issue 跟著不見。","B":"錯。官方說 Version Report 只適用 Scrum board，而且不管哪種 board 都不顯示 archived 版本；換 board 解決不了問題。","C":"錯。Merge 會把 4.2 的 issue 全部改掛到目標版本，4.2 本身就沒了，財務要的 4.2 報表反而再也拿不到。","D":"對。官方 Version Report 說明寫明會顯示 Released 版本、不顯示 Archived 版本。Archive 可以用 Unarchive 還原，還原後就能在下拉選單選到 4.2。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-version-report/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/manage-versions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.3-e05","sec":"620.3.3","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Keiko, the project administrator of project STRATA, is preparing training material for new team leads about version management. Which statement about archiving a version is NOT true?","zh":"Keiko 是 project STRATA 的 project administrator，正在為新任 team lead 準備版本管理的教材。關於封存（archive）版本，哪個敘述<b>不</b>正確？","zo":["封存的版本隨時可以在 Releases 頁選 <b>Unarchive</b> 還原","封存版本會刪除 Fix versions 欄位含有這個版本的 issue","封存的版本會從報表中隱藏，例如不會出現在 Version Report","版本的狀態（例如 Archived）會影響它是否出現在 Fix versions 這類版本欄位的下拉選單"],"fig":"","opts":["An archived version can be restored at any time by selecting <b>Unarchive</b> on the Releases page","Archiving a version deletes the issues whose Fix versions field contains that version","An archived version is hidden from reports, for example it does not appear in the Version Report","A version's status, such as Archived, affects whether it is offered in version field drop-downs like Fix versions"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"正確敘述（不選）。官方 Manage versions 頁說封存後可以從 More actions 選 Unarchive 還原，所以 archive 是可逆的動作。","B":"錯誤敘述（要選）。封存只是把版本從報表與下拉選單藏起來，issue 本身不會被刪除，仍留在 project 裡。常見誤解：以為 archived version 的 issue 會從 board 和搜尋消失。","C":"正確敘述（不選）。官方說 archive 會把版本從報表等地方隱藏；Version Report 也明寫不顯示 Archived 版本。","D":"正確敘述（不選）。官方說版本的狀態會影響它出現在哪些版本欄位的下拉選單，例如 Fix version；封存後就不能再拿來指派新 issue。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/manage-versions/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-version-report/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.3-e06","sec":"620.3.3","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Mateus, a project administrator for the Scrum project CORAL, created version 7.0 and added its issues three months ago during roadmap planning, but the team only began working on it this month. The Version Report for 7.0 shows a very low average velocity and a predicted release date that is far too late. What should Mateus do to make the report more accurate?","zh":"Mateus 是 Scrum project CORAL 的 project administrator。三個月前做 roadmap 規劃時，他建立了 7.0 版並把 issue 加進去，但團隊這個月才真正開始做。7.0 的 Version Report 顯示平均速度非常低，預測的 release 日期也太晚。Mateus 該怎麼做，才能讓報表更準確？","zo":["把 board 的估算單位從 Story Points 改成 Original Time Estimate，讓速度重新計算","在 timeline 的 View settings 打開 Releases，讓版本日期顯示在時程條上方","編輯 7.0 版，把 Start date 設成實際開工那天，因為報表是從這個日期開始算","把 7.0 版封存，再建一個同名的新版本，讓報表從今天重新開始"],"fig":"","opts":["Change the board's estimation statistic from Story Points to Original Time Estimate so velocity is recalculated","Turn on Releases in the timeline's View settings so the version's dates are shown above the schedule bars","Edit version 7.0 and set its Start date to the day work actually began, because the report starts from that date","Archive version 7.0 and create a new version with the same name so that the report starts again today"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。換估算單位只是改用別的數字畫圖，報表的橫軸還是從第一張 issue 加進版本那天開始，平均速度一樣被拉低。","B":"錯。這只會讓版本出現在 timeline 上方，是個人的顯示選項，不會改變 Version Report 計算速度的起點。","C":"對。官方說 Version Report 的橫軸從版本的 Start date 開始；沒填時才從第一張 issue 加進版本的日期算。提早規劃、晚開工時，填 Start date 報表會更準。","D":"錯。封存再重建會讓舊版本從報表消失，還得把所有 issue 重新指派，而且只要沒填 Start date，新版本一樣從加入 issue 那天算。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/manage-versions/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-version-report/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.3-e07","sec":"620.3.3","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Diego manages releases for project ZEPHYR. Last month he noticed that he could release version 3.1 even though the listed approver, Mei-Ling, had not yet responded. For version 3.2, the release must not go out until the approvers have approved it. What should Diego do?","zh":"Diego 負責 project ZEPHYR 的 release。上個月他發現，即使列出的 approver Mei-Ling 還沒回覆，他仍然可以 release 3.1 版。對於 3.2 版，要等 approver 核准之後才能 release。Diego 該怎麼做？","zo":["什麼都不用做，因為只有當版本在 release 頁上同時出現 warnings 時，approvals 才會擋住 release","請 Jira administrator 拿掉他的管理員權限，因為 Jira administrator 會跳過 release 的核准","把 approver 的名字連結到版本的 Related work 區塊，讓 Jira 等待他們的決定","編輯 3.2 版並勾選 <b>Require approvals</b>，因為預設 approvals 不會擋住 release"],"fig":"","opts":["Nothing, because approvals only block a release when the version also shows warnings on the release page","Ask a Jira administrator to remove his admin rights, because Jira administrators bypass release approvals","Link the approvers' names in the version's Related work section so that Jira waits for their decision","Edit version 3.2 and select <b>Require approvals</b>, because approvals do not block a release by default"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。Warnings 只是提醒 issue 資料和開發資料可能不同步，和 approvals 是兩件事；approvals 要不要擋 release，看的是有沒有勾 Require approvals。","B":"錯。問題不在 Diego 的身分。官方說沒勾 Require approvals 時，任何有權 release 的人都能在沒核准的情況下 release。","C":"錯。Related work 是放 release notes、設計稿、文件等連結的區塊，用來讓大家找得到相關資料，不會讓 release 等待任何人核准。","D":"對。官方說 release 在沒有核准時仍可發布，除非在建立或編輯版本的視窗勾了 Require approvals。3.1 沒勾，所以 Mei-Ling 還沒回應也擋不住。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/use-the-release-page-to-check-the-progress-of-a-version/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.3-e08","sec":"620.3.3","dom":"620.3","type":"multi","n":3,"stem":"Obinna is the project administrator of project AURA. Bitbucket and Bitbucket Pipelines are connected, the team has the View Development Tools permission, and warnings are enabled for the version 1.8 release page. He wants to tell the developers which situations will raise a warning on that page. Which three situations will produce a warning? (Choose three.)","zh":"Obinna 是 project AURA 的 project administrator。Bitbucket 與 Bitbucket Pipelines 已經連線，團隊有 View Development Tools 權限，1.8 版的 release 頁也已開啟 warnings。他想告訴開發者，哪些情況會在這個頁面上出現 warning。哪三種情況會產生 warning？（選三個）","zo":["一張 To Do 狀態的 issue 沒有 story point 估算","一張 Done 狀態的 issue 仍有未合併的 pull request","一張 Done 狀態的 issue 有 commit 不屬於任何 pull request 或 code review","一張 In Progress 狀態的 issue 有未合併的 pull request","版本預定的 release 日期已經過了","一張 Done 狀態的 issue 連到失敗的 build"],"fig":"","opts":["An issue in the To Do status has no story point estimate","An issue in a Done status still has an open pull request","An issue in a Done status has commits that are not part of any pull request or code review","An issue in the In Progress status has an open pull request","The version's planned release date has already passed","An issue in a Done status is linked to a failing build"],"ans":"BCF","why":{"A":"錯。沒有估點是規劃問題，不是 issue 資料和開發資料不同步，release 頁不會因為它出 warning。","B":"對。官方 warning 類型之一是 Open pull requests：issue 已經 Done，卻還有沒合併的 PR。重點是「已完成卻還有開發工作沒收尾」。","C":"對。官方 warning 類型之一是 Unreviewed code：issue 已經標成 Done，但它的 commit 不屬於任何 PR 或 code review，代表這些程式碼還沒有人審過就算完成。","D":"錯。Issue 還在 In Progress，有 open PR 是正常狀態；官方的 warning 都是針對「已標成 Done」的 issue，這個不符合條件。","E":"錯。過了預定日期、還沒 release 的版本，只會把 release date 顯示成紅色表示逾期，這不是 release 頁上的 warning。","F":"對。官方 warning 類型之一是 Failing builds：issue 已經標成 Done，卻連到一個失敗的 build。前提是 Jira 已經連上 build 工具，否則根本不會有 build 資料可以比對。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/use-the-release-page-to-check-the-progress-of-a-version/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/manage-versions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.3-e09","sec":"620.3.3","dom":"620.3","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. Sunita is the project administrator of the company-managed Kanban project KITE, whose board has the columns To Do, In Progress, In Review, and Done. She opens the <b>Release</b> menu above the board, and only version 2.2 is listed, not 2.3. Which two statements are correct? (Choose two.)","zh":"請看圖。Sunita 是 company-managed Kanban project KITE 的 project administrator，board 的欄位是 To Do、In Progress、In Review、Done。她打開 board 上方的 <b>Release</b> 選單，裡面只列出 2.2 版，沒有 2.3。哪兩個敘述正確？（選兩個）","zo":["2.3 版沒出現在選單裡，是因為它還沒有 release date","2.3 版沒出現，是因為它的 issue 沒有任何一張在 board 的 Done 欄","從 board 發布 2.2 會自動把 KITE-47 轉到 Done 欄","只有 Jira administrator 能從 board 發布；project administrator 必須用 Releases 頁","Sunita 發布 2.2 之後，KITE-41 和 KITE-44 會從 board 消失，因為它們的 fix version 全部都已發布"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 198\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"KITE board 上的 issue 與 fix version\"><rect x=\"10\" y=\"8\" width=\"300\" height=\"182\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx plain\"/><text x=\"20\" y=\"28\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\">KITE Kanban board</text><rect x=\"16\" y=\"39\" width=\"288\" height=\"22\" rx=\"5\" class=\"sf-gray\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Key</text><text x=\"112\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Board column</text><text x=\"232\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Fix version</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"62\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"62\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">KITE-41</text><text x=\"112\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Done</text><text x=\"232\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">2.2</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"86\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"86\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">KITE-44</text><text x=\"112\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Done</text><text x=\"232\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">2.2</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"110\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"126\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">KITE-47</text><text x=\"112\" y=\"126\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">In Review</text><text x=\"232\" y=\"126\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">2.3</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"134\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"134\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"150\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">KITE-52</text><text x=\"112\" y=\"150\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">In Progress</text><text x=\"232\" y=\"150\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">2.3</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"158\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"158\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"174\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">KITE-53</text><text x=\"112\" y=\"174\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">To Do</text><text x=\"232\" y=\"174\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">—</text></svg>","opts":["Version 2.3 is missing from the menu because it does not have a release date yet","Version 2.3 is missing because none of its issues are in the board's Done column","Releasing 2.2 from the board automatically transitions KITE-47 to the Done column","Only a Jira administrator can release from the board; project administrators must use the Releases page","After Sunita releases 2.2, KITE-41 and KITE-44 disappear from the board because all their fix versions are released"],"ans":"BE","why":{"A":"錯。官方說 Release 選單列出的是「有 issue 在 Done 欄」的未發布版本，條件跟有沒有填 release date 無關；日期可以在 release 時再填。","B":"對。官方說 board 上的 Release 選單只列出至少有一張 issue 在 Done 欄的版本。圖中 2.3 的 issue 在 In Review 和 In Progress，所以不會出現。","C":"錯。KITE-47 掛的是 2.3，發布 2.2 根本不會動到它；而且 release 本來就不會替 issue 轉換狀態，只會問這個版本裡未解決的 issue 要怎麼處理。","D":"錯。官方說 release 版本需要的是 project admin 權限，不是 Jira admin 專屬；company-managed Kanban 也能直接從 board 上方的 Release 選單發布。","E":"對。官方說在 company-managed Kanban board 上，issue 的所有 fix version 都 release 之後，它就會從 board 上消失。KITE-41、KITE-44 只掛 2.2，所以 2.2 發布後會離開 board。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/release-a-version-in-your-classic-project/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-filters/"],"lvl":3,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.3-e10","sec":"620.3.3","dom":"620.3","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. It shows the Version Report for version 3.0 on the Scrum board of project QUILL. The upper line (labeled 版本總量 in the exhibit) is the version's total estimated work, the green line is completed work, and the blue vertical line is the predicted release date. Which two statements are correct? (Choose two.)","zh":"請看圖。這是 project QUILL 的 Scrum board 上 3.0 版的 Version Report。上方那條線（圖上標「版本總量」）是版本的總估算量，綠線是已完成的量，藍色直線是預測的 release 日。哪兩個敘述正確？（選兩個）","zo":["總量線往上跳的那一刻，完成線會往下掉，因為加入的 scope 會減少已完成的工作","預測的 release 日是根據目前 sprint 開始時承諾的 story points 算出來的","總量線往上跳，表示版本開始之後又有估算工作被加進這個版本","藍線右邊的陰影區是悲觀日期，用平均每日速度減 10% 算出","報表會把 sub-task 另外計算，所以是在 story 底下加 sub-task 造成總量往上跳"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 200\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Version report 示意\"><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"116.66666666666666\" x2=\"306\" y2=\"116.66666666666666\" class=\"gl\"/><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"71.33333333333333\" x2=\"306\" y2=\"71.33333333333333\" class=\"gl\"/><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"26.0\" x2=\"306\" y2=\"26.0\" class=\"gl\"/><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"162\" x2=\"306\" y2=\"162\" class=\"ax\"/><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"162\" x2=\"40\" y2=\"20\" class=\"ax\"/><text x=\"173.0\" y=\"190\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"s\">日期 →</text><text x=\"34\" y=\"16\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">故事點</text><rect x=\"229.8181818181818\" y=\"26\" width=\"45.45454545454544\" height=\"136\" rx=\"0\" class=\"sf-gray\"/><polyline points=\"48,53 139,53 139,37 298,37\" class=\"ln ink\"/><polyline points=\"48,162 93,140 139,118 184,94 207,83\" class=\"ln green w3\"/><polyline points=\"207,83 253,37\" class=\"ln green d\"/><line x1=\"252.54545454545453\" y1=\"26\" x2=\"252.54545454545453\" y2=\"162\" class=\"ln brand w3\"/><text x=\"252.54545454545453\" y=\"20\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"s tf-brand\" style=\"font-weight:700\">預測 release 日</text><text x=\"226.8181818181818\" y=\"154\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">樂觀</text><text x=\"278.27272727272725\" y=\"154\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">悲觀</text><text x=\"46\" y=\"30.879999999999995\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">版本總量</text></svg>","opts":["The completed line drops at the moment the total line steps up, because added scope reduces completed work","The predicted release date is based on the story points committed at the start of the current sprint","The step up in the total line shows that estimated work was added to the version after it had started","The shaded area to the right of the blue line is the pessimistic date, based on average daily velocity minus 10%","The report counts sub-tasks separately, so adding sub-tasks to stories is what caused the step up"],"ans":"CD","why":{"A":"錯。圖上綠色的完成線一路往上，沒有下降。Scope 增加只會讓總量變大、完成比例變低，已完成的工作不會因此消失。","B":"錯。預測日看的是版本開始以來的平均每日速度和剩餘估算，不是某個 sprint 開始時承諾的點數；那是 Sprint report／Velocity 的概念。","C":"對。Version Report 會畫出任一時間點版本的總點數與完成點數，讓你看出 scope 的變化；總量線往上跳，就是中途有工作加進這個版本。","D":"對。官方說藍線右邊的陰影是悲觀預測，用平均每日速度減 10% 算出；左邊是樂觀預測，用加 10% 算出。Scope 增加也會把預測日往後推。","E":"錯。官方說 Version Report 會排除 sub-task 類型的 issue，所以總量上跳不是 sub-task 造成的，而是有其他 issue 或估點加進版本。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-version-report/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.3-e11","sec":"620.3.3","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Kwame works on a Jira Premium site. On the timeline of project TIDE, he drags the schedule bar of epic TIDE-8 two weeks later. Then, in a plan in Plans that includes TIDE and two other projects, he drags epic TIDE-15 two weeks later but does nothing else. A colleague immediately opens both issues in Jira. What will the colleague see?","zh":"Kwame 在一個 Jira Premium 站台上工作。他在 project TIDE 的 timeline 上，把 epic TIDE-8 的時程條往後拖兩週。接著，他在 Plans 裡一個包含 TIDE 與另外兩個 project 的 plan 中，把 epic TIDE-15 往後拖兩週，之後什麼都沒做。一位同事馬上在 Jira 裡打開這兩張 issue。同事會看到什麼？","zo":["TIDE-8 已經顯示新日期，但在 Kwame 於 plan 裡 review 並儲存變更之前，TIDE-15 仍是舊日期","兩張 issue 都維持舊日期，直到 Kwame review 並儲存變更，因為 timeline 也使用草稿變更","兩張 issue 都已顯示新日期，因為 plan 和 timeline 的每個變更都會即時寫回 Jira","TIDE-15 已經顯示新日期，但在 project administrator 發布 timeline 之前，TIDE-8 仍是舊日期"],"fig":"","opts":["TIDE-8 already shows the new dates, but TIDE-15 keeps its old dates until Kwame reviews and saves the change in the plan","Both issues keep their old dates until Kwame reviews and saves the changes, because the timeline also uses draft changes","Both issues already show the new dates, because every change in a plan or a timeline is written to Jira in real time","TIDE-15 already shows the new dates, but TIDE-8 keeps its old dates until a project administrator publishes the timeline"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。官方說 timeline 上的變更會即時存回 Jira issue；plan 則像沙盒，變更先是草稿，要在 Review changes 選取並儲存才會更新 issue。常見誤解：忘了 Plans 要 review 才寫回。","B":"錯。只有 plan 的變更是草稿；project timeline 上拖動時程條會即時存回 issue，不需要另外 review 或儲存。","C":"錯。Plan 的變更在儲存前只留在 plan 裡，官方說明「What happens in your plan stays in your plan」，所以 TIDE-15 還是舊日期。","D":"錯。剛好反過來。Timeline 沒有「發布」這個步驟，會即時寫回；需要 review 才寫回的是 plan 的變更。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>Plans 舊名 Advanced Roadmaps；現行 UI 的儲存視窗叫 Unsaved changes，官方文件也仍稱 Review changes。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/schedule-work-for-scrum-teams-on-your-roadmap/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/roll-up-dates-on-your-timeline/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/what-is-advanced-roadmaps/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/save-changes-made-in-advanced-roadmaps/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.3-e12","sec":"620.3.3","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Ines is the project administrator of company-managed project ATLAS on a Jira Premium site. The portfolio team wants an Initiative level above Epic so that it can group epics from several projects in a plan in Plans. What must happen first?","zh":"Ines 是 Jira Premium 站台上 company-managed project ATLAS 的 project administrator。Portfolio 團隊想在 Epic 之上加一個 Initiative 層級，用來在 Plans 的 plan 裡把好幾個 project 的 epic 分組。首先必須做什麼？","zo":["Ines 在 ATLAS 的 project settings 新增 Initiative issue type，並在 project 的 issue type 清單裡把它拖到 Epic 上面","由 Jira administrator 把 Initiative issue type 加進 scheme，並在 issue type hierarchy 裡把它對應到 Epic 之上的新層級","Ines 把 Epic issue type 改名為 Initiative，這樣就會自動在現有 epic 之上產生新的階層","不需要任何設定，因為所有 Jira 訂閱方案（包括 Standard）都內建 Initiative 層級"],"fig":"","opts":["Ines adds an Initiative issue type in ATLAS's project settings and drags it above Epic in the project's issue type list","A Jira administrator adds an Initiative issue type to the scheme and maps it to a new level above Epic in the issue type hierarchy","Ines renames the Epic issue type to Initiative in the project, which automatically creates a new hierarchy level above all of the existing epics","Nothing needs to be configured, because every Jira subscription, including Standard, already includes a built-in Initiative level"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。自訂 Epic 之上的階層，官方說只有 Jira administrator 權限才做得到；project admin 在 project settings 排 issue type 的順序，不會產生新的階層。","B":"對。官方流程分三步：建立 issue type、加進 issue type scheme、到 Issue type hierarchy 建立新層級並對應。整個流程要 Jira administrator 權限，而且是 Premium／Enterprise 才有。","C":"錯。官方說 Epic 可以改名，但改名後仍是 level 1；改名不會在 epic 之上多出一層，原本的 epic 也不會變成子層。","D":"錯。Jira 預設只有 Epic（level 1）、Story（level 0）與 sub-task；Epic 之上的層級要自己設定，而且只有 Premium／Enterprise 才能用。常見誤解：以為 Standard 也有。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>現行 UI 把 issue type 叫 work type，設定頁叫 Work type hierarchy。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-custom-hierarchy-levels-in-advanced-roadmaps/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/what-is-advanced-roadmaps/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.3-e13","sec":"620.3.3","dom":"620.3","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Chiara is the project administrator of the team-managed software project LOOM. The team has never used versions, so she turns on <b>Releases</b> in the project's Features settings. Which two changes happen as a result? (Choose two.)","zh":"Chiara 是 team-managed 軟體 project LOOM 的 project administrator。團隊從來沒用過版本，所以她在 project 的 Features 設定中打開了 <b>Releases</b>。這會帶來哪兩個變化？（選兩個）","zo":["會新增 Affects versions 欄位，讓 bug 能記錄是在哪些版本發現的","LOOM 裡現有的 epic 會自動轉成版本，版本名稱和 epic 相同","這個功能只有 Jira administrator 能開，所以 Chiara 的變更會被存成一個申請","會替 project 的 issue type 加上 Fix versions 欄位，讓 issue 可以被指派到版本","Project 的導覽列會新增一個 Releases 分頁，用來建立、追蹤與發布版本"],"fig":"","opts":["An Affects versions field is added so that bugs can record the versions in which they were found","Existing epics in LOOM are automatically converted into versions that use the same names as the epics","The feature can only be turned on by a Jira administrator, so Chiara's change is saved as a request","A Fix versions field is added to the project's issue types so issues can be assigned to versions","A Releases tab is added to the project navigation for creating, tracking, and releasing versions"],"ans":"DE","why":{"A":"錯。Team-managed project 開了 Releases 只會多出 Fix versions；Affects versions 在 TMP 仍不能用，對應的功能請求 JRACLOUD-85690 還在收集意見。常見誤解：以為兩個版本欄位會一起出現。","B":"錯。Epic 是 issue 階層裡的 parent，version 是出貨的時間點，兩者用途不同；開啟 Releases 不會把任何 epic 轉成版本。","C":"錯。官方說開啟 Releases 的是 project admin，在 project settings 的 Features 直接切換就生效，不必 Jira admin，也沒有送出申請這種流程。","D":"對。官方說開啟 Releases 功能時，會替 project 的 issue type 加上新的 Fix versions 欄位；填了這個欄位，issue 就會被加進該版本，並出現在那個版本的 release 頁上。","E":"對。官方說開啟 Releases 後，project 的導覽列會多一個 Releases 分頁；之後建立版本、把 issue 加進版本、查看進度與按下 Release，都從這個分頁進行。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>現行 UI 把 project 叫 space、issue type 叫 work type。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/enable-releases-and-versions/","https://jira.atlassian.com/browse/JRACLOUD-85690"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.4-e01","sec":"620.3.4","dom":"620.3","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Ayodele is a Jira administrator at Kestrel Freight. The team lead of the company-managed project HAUL cannot decide whether to categorize issues with Components or to replace them with a new custom field. Which two requirements could a custom field meet on its own, without using Components? (Choose two.)","zh":"Ayodele 是 Kestrel Freight 的 Jira administrator。Company-managed project HAUL 的 team lead 猶豫要用 Components 還是改用一個新的 custom field 來替 issue 分類。下列哪兩項需求，不用 Components、只靠 custom field 本身就能做到？（選兩個。）","zo":["新建立的 issue 會自動指派給所選值的負責人，不需要 automation rule。","使用者可以在同一張 issue 上選多個值。","有一個內建的 project 頁面列出每個值，並可點進去看連到它的 issue。","Project administrator 可以自己在 Project settings 新增值，不需要 Jira administrator。","建立 issue 時，欄位會預先帶入一個預設值。"],"fig":"","opts":["New issues are automatically assigned to the person responsible for the selected value, without an automation rule.","Users can select more than one value on the same issue.","A built-in project page lists every value and lets users open the issues linked to it.","Project administrators can add new values themselves in Project settings, without a Jira administrator.","The field is pre-filled with a default value when an issue is created."],"ans":"BE","why":{"A":"錯。自動指派是 component 的 default assignee 才有的功能；custom field 本身不會指派人，要另外寫 automation rule 才做得到。","B":"對。Select list (multiple choices)、Checkboxes 等 custom field 都能在一張 issue 選多個值。常見誤解：以為只有 Components 能多選。","C":"錯。這是 Components 頁：點 component 名稱就能看到所有相關 issue。Custom field 沒有這種現成的清單頁，只能自己下 JQL。","D":"錯。Company-managed 的 custom field 選項歸 Jira admin 管；project admin 能自己在 Project settings 新增的是 components。","E":"對。Custom field 可以用 context 設預設值，建立 issue 時自動帶入；Components 欄位反而沒有原生預設值。常見誤解：以為預設值是 Components 的功能。Components 獨有的是決定 assignee 與 components 頁。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>現行 UI 把 issue 改叫 work item、project 改叫 space；題目沿用考試時代的名詞。 Components 是系統欄位，Jira Cloud 目前不能替系統欄位設預設值（JRACLOUD-4812 仍是 Future Consideration；依 issue type 設預設 component 的 JRACLOUD-39600 已關成 Won't Fix），要預設帶入只能另寫 automation。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/custom-fields-types-in-company-managed-projects/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/what-are-field-contexts/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-jira-components/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-a-projects-components/","https://jira.atlassian.com/browse/JRACLOUD-4812","https://jira.atlassian.com/browse/JRACLOUD-39600"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.4-e02","sec":"620.3.4","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit.\nThe exhibit shows the components of the company-managed project SOLAR. The project's default assignee is the project lead, Farida, and every listed user has the Assignable User permission. Liang creates a bug, selects both the Payments and API components, and leaves Assignee set to Automatic. Who is the bug assigned to?","zh":"請參考附圖。\n附圖是 company-managed project SOLAR 的 components。這個 project 的 default assignee 是 project lead Farida，而且圖中每位使用者都有 Assignable User 權限。Liang 建立一張 bug，同時選了 Payments 與 API 兩個 component，Assignee 保持 Automatic。這張 bug 會指派給誰？","zo":["Tomasz","Farida","Rahel","沒有人；因為兩個 component 衝突，bug 會維持未指派"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 150\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"SOLAR components list\"><rect x=\"10\" y=\"8\" width=\"300\" height=\"134\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx plain\"/><text x=\"20\" y=\"28\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\">SOLAR components</text><rect x=\"16\" y=\"39\" width=\"288\" height=\"22\" rx=\"5\" class=\"sf-gray\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Component</text><text x=\"106\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Lead</text><text x=\"186\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Default assignee</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"62\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"62\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">API</text><text x=\"106\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Rahel</text><text x=\"186\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Component lead</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"86\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"86\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Payments</text><text x=\"106\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Tomasz</text><text x=\"186\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Component lead</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"110\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"126\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Search</text><text x=\"106\" y=\"126\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Ines</text><text x=\"186\" y=\"126\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Unassigned</text></svg>","opts":["Tomasz","Farida","Rahel","Nobody; the bug stays unassigned because the components conflict"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。Tomasz 是 Payments 的 lead；但兩個 component 指向不同人時，Jira 取字母序第一的 component，API 排在 Payments 前面。","B":"錯。Farida 是 project default assignee，但 component 的 default assignee 會覆蓋 project 的預設，所以輪不到她。","C":"對。Component 的 default assignee 覆蓋 project 預設；兩個 component 指向不同人時，Jira 取字母序第一的 API，指派給它的 lead Rahel。","D":"錯。Jira 不會因為兩個 component 指向不同的人就放著不指派，而是依 component 名稱的字母序挑一個。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>現行 UI 的 default assignee 選項寫成 Space default、Space owner、Component lead、Unassigned，也可以直接指定某個人；考試時代叫 Project default、Project lead。<br>官方文件寫取字母序第一個 component，考試照這條答。實際行為有公開 bug JRACLOUD-75245（未修），自己實測可能不同。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-jira-components/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/what-are-jira-components/","https://jira.atlassian.com/browse/JRACLOUD-75245"],"lvl":3,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.4-e03","sec":"620.3.4","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Nnamdi is the project administrator of the company-managed project ORCA. He has created five components, but reporters keep creating bugs without selecting any component. He wants the Components field to be mandatory for every issue type in ORCA. What should be done?","zh":"Nnamdi 是 company-managed project ORCA 的 project administrator。他已經建立了五個 component，但回報者建立 bug 時還是常常沒選任何 component。他希望 ORCA 的每個 issue type 都必須填 Components 欄位。應該怎麼做？","zo":["請 Jira administrator 在 ORCA 使用的 field configuration 裡把 Components 設為 Required。","不用做任何事；只要 project 有至少一個 component，Components 欄位就會自動變成必填。","把每個 component 的 default assignee 設成 Component lead，這樣沒有 component 就無法建立 issue。","把 Components 欄位加到 Create issue 畫面，因為這個畫面上的每個欄位都是必填。"],"fig":"","opts":["Have a Jira administrator set Components to Required in the field configuration used by ORCA.","Nothing; the Components field automatically becomes required once the project has at least one component.","Set the default assignee of every component to Component lead so that an issue cannot be created without a component.","Add the Components field to the Create issue screen, because every field on that screen is mandatory."],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。欄位必不必填由 field configuration 的 Required 開關決定，要 Jira admin 設定。前提是欄位要留在 Create 畫面上，使用者才填得到。","B":"錯。建立 component 只會讓 issue 上出現 Components 欄位，不會自動變成必填。常見誤解：以為 Components 預設就是必填。","C":"錯。Default assignee 只決定選了 component 時要指派給誰；沒選 component 的 issue 照樣能建立，完全不會被擋。","D":"錯。Screen 只決定欄位出不出現，不決定必不必填；必填的開關在 field configuration，不在 screen。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>Atlassian 正逐步把 field configuration 與 field configuration scheme 合併成 field schemes，新介面在 Change field behavior by work type 裡勾 Required；考試仍以 field configuration 為準。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/add-edit-and-delete-a-field-configuration/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-jira-components/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/change-the-way-fields-behave-for-different-work-types/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.4-e04","sec":"620.3.4","dom":"620.3","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Mireille is training new project administrators at Tessera Bank on how Components work in company-managed projects. Which two statements should she include? (Choose two.)","zh":"Mireille 正在為 Tessera Bank 的新任 project administrator 上課，說明 company-managed project 的 Components 怎麼運作。她應該講哪兩個敘述？（選兩個。）","zo":["Project 中不是 project administrator 的其他成員，仍然可以搜尋既有的 component，並把 issue 連到它們。","只要 project 有至少一個 component，建立 issue 時 Components 欄位就會變成必填。","在某個 company-managed project 建立的 component，可以在任何其他 company-managed project 的 issue 上選用。","Component 的 default assignee 會覆蓋 project 的 default assignee。","Team-managed project 可以在 Project settings 的 Features 頁開啟 Components。"],"fig":"","opts":["Other members of the project who are not project administrators can still search for existing components and link issues to them.","As soon as a project has at least one component, the Components field becomes required on issue creation.","A component created in one company-managed project can be selected on issues in any other company-managed project.","A component's default assignee overrides the project's default assignee.","Team-managed projects can turn on Components from the Features page in Project settings."],"ans":"AD","why":{"A":"對。官方說只有 project admin 能設定 components，其他人仍可檢視、搜尋 components，並把 issue 連到既有的 component。","B":"錯。Components 預設選填，要由 Jira admin 在 field configuration 設 Required。常見誤解：建了 component 就自動必填。","C":"錯。Component 的範圍只限建立它的 project；別的 project 就算有同名 component，也是各自獨立的物件。","D":"對。官方寫明 component 的 default assignee 會覆蓋 project 的整體 default assignee；這正是 Components 能「決定 assignee」的機制。","E":"錯。Components 只有 company-managed 才有；team-managed 的 Features 頁沒有這個開關，只能改用 labels 或自訂欄位。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>現行 UI 把 issue 改叫 work item、project 改叫 space；題目沿用考試時代的名詞。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/what-are-jira-components/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-jira-components/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/add-edit-and-delete-a-field-configuration/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.4-e05","sec":"620.3.4","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit.\nOksana is a Jira administrator at Lumen Retail. The category Retail Apps is currently used only by SHOP. She wants the company-managed projects SHOP, POS, and LOYAL grouped together so that one saved filter returns the issues of all three. What should she do?","zh":"請參考附圖。\nOksana 是 Lumen Retail 的 Jira administrator。目前只有 SHOP 使用 Retail Apps 這個 category。她想把 SHOP、POS、LOYAL 三個 company-managed project 歸在一起，讓一個 saved filter 就能撈出三個 project 的 issue。她該怎麼做？","zo":["為 POS 和 LOYAL 另建 Retail Apps 2 與 Retail Apps 3，因為一個 category 只能給一個 project 使用","在 POS 和 LOYAL 各自的 project details 指派 Retail Apps，再存一個 <code>category = \"Retail Apps\"</code> 的 filter","把 Retail Apps 改成父 category，底下為 POS 和 LOYAL 建立子 category，再存一個 <code>category = \"Retail Apps\"</code> 的 filter","請 POS 和 LOYAL 的 project administrator 在各自的 Project settings 指派 Retail Apps，再存一個 <code>category = \"Retail Apps\"</code> 的 filter"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 315\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Project categories\"><rect x=\"0.5\" y=\"0.5\" width=\"379\" height=\"314\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"380\" height=\"34\" rx=\"0\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Jira settings › Projects</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Project categories</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Category — projects using it</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"119\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"119\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Retail Apps</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">SHOP</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"145\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"145\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"137\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Back Office</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"137\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">(none)</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"166\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Name</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"172\" width=\"356\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"190\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\"></text><text x=\"12\" y=\"221\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Description</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"227\" width=\"356\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"245\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\"></text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"265\" width=\"38.5\" height=\"26\" rx=\"6\" class=\"fl-brand\"/><text x=\"31.25\" y=\"282\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"w\">Add</text></svg>","opts":["Create the categories Retail Apps 2 and Retail Apps 3 for POS and LOYAL, because a category can be used by only one project","Assign Retail Apps to POS and LOYAL in each project's details, then save a filter with <code>category = \"Retail Apps\"</code>","Turn Retail Apps into a parent category with child categories for POS and LOYAL, then save a filter with <code>category = \"Retail Apps\"</code>","Ask the project administrators of POS and LOYAL to assign Retail Apps in their Project settings, then save a filter with <code>category = \"Retail Apps\"</code>"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。一個 category 可以指派給很多個 project，不必為每個 project 另建一個。常見誤解：以為一個 category 只能給一個 project。","B":"對。同一個 category 可以指派給多個 project；三個都指派 Retail Apps 後，JQL 的 <code>category</code> 欄位就能一次撈出三個 project 的 issue。","C":"錯。建立 category 時只填名稱與描述，沒有上層 category 可選；官方也說 category 不能用來建立 project 階層。要分群就把多個 project 指派到同一個 category。","D":"錯。指派 category 的步驟確實在 project details，但 company-managed project 的 category 只有 Jira admin 能改，project admin 改不動，所以要由 Oksana 自己指派。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>現行 UI 把 issue 改叫 work item、project 改叫 space；題目沿用考試時代的名詞。 現行 UI 的 project category 叫 space category。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/add-assign-and-delete-project-categories/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/jql-fields/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.4-e06","sec":"620.3.4","dom":"620.3","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Tariq is a Jira administrator at Brightwell Health and is documenting how project categories work on the company's Jira Cloud site. Which two statements are correct? (Choose two.)","zh":"Tariq 是 Brightwell Health 的 Jira administrator，正在撰寫公司 Jira Cloud 網站上 project category 的使用說明。哪兩個敘述正確？（選兩個。）","zo":["一個 category 只能指派給一個 project，所以每個 project 都要有自己的 category。","Category 可以巢狀設計，讓一個父 category 底下有好幾個子 category。","一個 project 同一時間只能屬於一個 category。","Company-managed project 的 project administrator 可以在 Project settings 建立新的 category。","JQL 查詢 <code>category = \"Clinical\"</code> 會撈出 Clinical category 裡每個 project 的 issue。"],"fig":"","opts":["A category can be assigned to only one project, so each project needs its own category.","Categories can be nested so that a parent category contains several child categories.","A project can belong to only one category at a time.","Project administrators of company-managed projects create new categories from Project settings.","The JQL query <code>category = \"Clinical\"</code> returns issues from every project in the Clinical category."],"ans":"CE","why":{"A":"錯。這正好說反了：一個 category 可以指派給很多 project，是一對多的關係。常見誤解：以為一個 category 只能給一個 project。","B":"錯。建立 category 時只填名稱與描述，沒有上層 category 可選；官方也說 category 不能用來建立 project 階層。要分群就把多個 project 指派到同一個 category。","C":"對。Project details 的 category 是單選下拉選單，一個 project 同一時間只能有一個 category；反過來一個 category 可以給很多 project。","D":"錯。Category 由 Jira admin 在 Jira settings › Projects 建立，不在 Project settings；CMP 的 project admin 連指派都不行。","E":"對。JQL 的 <code>category</code> 欄位會撈出屬於該 category 所有 project 的 issue，這正是 category 能跨 project 看工作的用途。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>現行 UI 把 issue 改叫 work item、project 改叫 space；題目沿用考試時代的名詞。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/add-assign-and-delete-project-categories/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/jql-fields/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.4-e07","sec":"620.3.4","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"The marketing team at Vireo Studios works in three company-managed projects. For every campaign they want to tag issues with the campaign name, such as <code>spring-sale</code>. Any team member who can edit an issue must be able to create a new tag on the spot, without waiting for an administrator, and the same tag must be usable in all three projects. What should they use?","zh":"Vireo Studios 的行銷團隊在三個 company-managed project 中工作。每檔活動他們都想用活動名稱替 issue 加標記，例如 <code>spring-sale</code>。任何能編輯 issue 的成員都要能當場建立新標記，不必等管理員；而且同一個標記要能在三個 project 都使用。他們該用什麼？","zo":["Components，每個 project 都為每檔活動建立一個","一個 Select list (multiple choices) custom field，每檔活動一個選項","每檔活動一個 project category","Labels"],"fig":"","opts":["Components, created for each campaign in every project","A Select list (multiple choices) custom field with one option per campaign","A project category for each campaign","Labels"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。Component 只屬於建立它的 project，而且只有 project admin 能新增；三個 project 要各建一次，一般成員也不能當場建立。","B":"錯。Select list 的選項固定，要由 Jira admin 新增，一般成員無法當場加一個新活動名稱；它適合要管控、不准打錯字的情境。","C":"錯。Project category 是替整個 project 分群，不是替單張 issue 貼標籤，而且只有 Jira admin 能建立。","D":"對。有編輯權限的人在 Labels 欄位直接打字就能建立新 label，company-managed project 之間共用同一批 label。代價是沒有管控，拼錯就變成另一個 label。"},"note":"Label 不能含空白，多個字要用連字號或底線串起來，例如 <code>spring-sale</code>。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira/kb/how-to-create-and-use-labels-in-jira-cloud/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/custom-fields-types-in-company-managed-projects/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/what-are-jira-components/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.4-e08","sec":"620.3.4","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Hiroshi is a Jira administrator at Copperleaf Energy. Each issue in the company-managed project GRID already has two number fields, Allocated budget and Actual spend. Finance wants every issue to show the difference between them automatically, without anyone typing it in. Which field type should Hiroshi create?","zh":"Hiroshi 是 Copperleaf Energy 的 Jira administrator。Company-managed project GRID 的每張 issue 已經有兩個數字欄位：Allocated budget 與 Actual spend。財務部希望每張 issue 自動顯示兩者的差額，不需要任何人手動輸入。Hiroshi 應該建立哪一種欄位型別？","zo":["設成 currency 格式的 Number 欄位","Formula 欄位","Short text 欄位","Select list (cascading) 欄位"],"fig":"","opts":["A Number field formatted as currency","A Formula field","A Short text field","A Select list (cascading) field"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。Number 欄位可以用 currency 格式顯示金額，但數字要由人手動輸入，不會自動算出兩個欄位的差額。","B":"對。Formula 欄位會直接在 issue 上顯示計算結果，官方舉的例子就是預算減實際支出；輸出可以是 number、text、date 或 duration，number 還能用 currency 格式顯示。","C":"錯。Short text 是最多 255 字的純文字欄位，只能手動輸入，不會做任何計算。","D":"錯。Cascading select 是兩層下拉選單（父選項＋子選項），用來整理大量固定選項，不會做計算。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>Formula 是現行 Jira Cloud 新增的 custom field 型別；考試若沒有這個選項，同樣的需求只能靠 automation 算好後寫入 Number 欄位。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/custom-fields-types-in-company-managed-projects/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/create-a-formula-field/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.4-e09","sec":"620.3.4","dom":"620.3","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit.\nBabajide is a Jira administrator at Orinoco Devices. The service desk manager submitted the field request shown in the exhibit. Which two field configurations meet the request? (Choose two.)","zh":"請參考附圖。\nBabajide 是 Orinoco Devices 的 Jira administrator。Service desk 經理提出了附圖中的欄位需求。哪兩個欄位設定符合需求？（選兩個。）","zo":["Hardware：Radio buttons","Hardware：Select list (cascading)","Approver：Group picker (single group)，並把 finance-approvers 設為預設值","Approver：User picker (single user)，並用 context 限制只能選 finance-approvers 群組的人","Approver：User picker (multiple users)，並用 context 限制只能選 finance-approvers 群組的人"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 248\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"New field request\"><rect x=\"0.5\" y=\"0.5\" width=\"379\" height=\"247\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"380\" height=\"34\" rx=\"0\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Service request ORI-212</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">New field request</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Field 1: Hardware</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"95\" width=\"356\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx brand\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"113\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Pick a category, then a model in it</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"144\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s tf-violet\" style=\"font-weight:700\">e.g. Laptop → ThinkPad X1 / MacBook Air</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"168\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Field 2: Approver</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"174\" width=\"356\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx brand\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"192\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">One person, from finance-approvers only</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"223\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s tf-violet\" style=\"font-weight:700\">Other users must not appear in the list</text></svg>","opts":["Hardware: Radio buttons","Hardware: Select list (cascading)","Approver: Group picker (single group), with finance-approvers set as the default value","Approver: User picker (single user), with the context restricted to the finance-approvers group","Approver: User picker (multiple users), with the context restricted to the finance-approvers group"],"ans":"BD","why":{"A":"錯。Radio buttons 只有一層選項，選了 Laptop 之後沒辦法再從 Laptop 底下挑型號，做不出兩層選單。","B":"對。Cascading select 可以先建父選項，再把子選項收在底下，正好是「先選類別、再選該類別的型號」的兩層選單。","C":"錯。Group picker 選的是「群組」本身，不是群組裡的人；就算預設帶入 finance-approvers，也選不出一位核准者。","D":"對。User picker 可在 context 用 Edit User Filtering 依群組或 project role 限制可選的人，只列出 finance-approvers 的成員。","E":"錯。Context 限制是對的，但 multiple users 允許選好幾個人，不符合圖中「One person」只能選一位核准者的要求。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/custom-fields-types-in-company-managed-projects/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-advanced-field-options-using-contexts/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.4-e10","sec":"620.3.4","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Salomé is a Jira administrator at Nordwind Logistics. Teams in Germany and in Brazil each track which vendor completed the work, but each country has its own list of approved vendors, and each team must be able to select only the vendors approved for its own country. Management wants one report that covers vendor data from both countries. Which approach meets these requirements with the fewest fields to maintain?","zh":"Salomé 是 Nordwind Logistics 的 Jira administrator。德國與巴西的團隊都要記錄是哪家廠商完成工作，但兩國各有自己的核可廠商清單，而且每個團隊只能選到自己國家核可的廠商。管理階層希望一份報表就能涵蓋兩國的廠商資料。哪個做法能用最少的欄位滿足這些需求？","zo":["建立兩個 Select list 欄位 Vendor (DE) 與 Vendor (BR)，各自只加到自己國家的 project","請各團隊在 issue 上加 <code>vendor-acme</code> 這類 label","建立一個 Vendor select list，為兩國的 project 各設一個 context，各有自己的選項","建立一個 Vendor select list，它的 global context 列出兩國所有核可廠商"],"fig":"","opts":["Create two Select list fields, Vendor (DE) and Vendor (BR), and add each one only to its own country's projects","Ask each team to add a label such as <code>vendor-acme</code> to their issues","Create one Vendor select list with a separate context, and its own options, for each country's projects","Create one Vendor select list whose global context lists every approved vendor from both countries"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。兩個欄位做得到分開的清單，但資料被拆成兩個欄位，報表要分別處理，還多一個欄位要維護；context 正是用來避免這種重複欄位。","B":"錯。Label 沒有管控，任何人都能打出新值，拼錯就是另一個 label，無法保證只選核可廠商。","C":"對。Context 讓同一個欄位在不同 project 顯示不同的選項清單，但資料都存在同一個欄位，報表可以一起統計。官方舉的例子就是依國家列出不同廠商。","D":"錯。只有一個 global context 時，兩國看到的是同一份合併清單，德國團隊也選得到巴西廠商，不符合每個團隊只能選自己國家廠商的要求。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/what-are-field-contexts/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-advanced-field-options-using-contexts/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.5-e01","sec":"620.3.5","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. Ingrid is the project administrator of the company-managed project NXR, and Oksana is the project lead. A reporter creates an issue with the components <b>Mobile</b>, <b>Billing</b>, and <b>Checkout</b>, and leaves the Assignee field set to <b>Automatic</b>. Everyone in the exhibit, as well as Oksana, has the Assignable User permission. Who is assigned to the new issue?","zh":"請看圖。Ingrid 是 company-managed project NXR 的 project administrator，Oksana 是這個 project 的 project lead。有位回報者建立一張 issue，選了 <b>Mobile</b>、<b>Billing</b>、<b>Checkout</b> 三個 components，Assignee 欄位維持 <b>Automatic</b>。圖中所有人（以及 Oksana）都有 Assignable User 權限。新 issue 會指派給誰？","zo":["Haruto，因為在各 component lead 之中，他的名字字母排最前面","Oksana，因為 Billing 設定的 Project lead 優先於 Component lead","Ngozi，因為在設成 Component lead 的 components 中，Checkout 排在 Mobile 前面","Rahul，因為他負責的 component 名稱字母排最前面"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 174\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"NXR 的 components 清單\"><rect x=\"10\" y=\"8\" width=\"300\" height=\"158\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx plain\"/><text x=\"20\" y=\"28\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\">Components in project NXR</text><rect x=\"16\" y=\"39\" width=\"288\" height=\"22\" rx=\"5\" class=\"sf-gray\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Component</text><text x=\"116\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Lead</text><text x=\"186\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Default assignee</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"62\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"62\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Analytics</text><text x=\"116\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Zainab</text><text x=\"186\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Unassigned</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"86\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"86\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Billing</text><text x=\"116\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Rahul</text><text x=\"186\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Project lead</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"110\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"126\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Checkout</text><text x=\"116\" y=\"126\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Ngozi</text><text x=\"186\" y=\"126\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Component lead</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"134\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"134\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"150\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Mobile</text><text x=\"116\" y=\"150\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Haruto</text><text x=\"186\" y=\"150\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Component lead</text></svg>","opts":["Haruto, because his name comes first alphabetically among the component leads","Oksana, because Billing's Project lead setting outranks Component lead","Ngozi, because Checkout precedes Mobile among the components set to Component lead","Rahul, because he leads the component whose name comes first alphabetically"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。這是把 lead 的名字拿來排序；官方明說同級時比的是 component 名稱，不是 lead 名稱。常見誤解：多個 component 時依 lead 名字排序。","B":"錯。順序剛好相反：Component lead 是最高一級，Project lead 排第二；Checkout 與 Mobile 都是 Component lead，所以輪不到 Billing。常見誤解：以為 project 層級的角色比 component lead 優先。","C":"對。先比類型：Component lead 最高，Mobile 和 Checkout 都是這一級；同級再比 component 名稱，Checkout 的 C 在 Mobile 的 M 前面，所以指派給 Ngozi。","D":"錯。Rahul 雖是 Billing 的 component lead，但 Billing 的 default assignee 設成 Project lead，指向 Oksana 而不是 Rahul，而且這一級又輸給 Component lead。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>現行 UI 把 Project lead 叫 Space owner、Project default 叫 Space default。<br>Configure Jira components 頁只簡述「取字母序最前的 component」；完整規則以官方 KB 為準：先比類型，同級才比 component 名稱。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira/kb/manage-components-default-assignee-jira-software/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.5-e02","sec":"620.3.5","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. In the company-managed project KITE, Mateo is the project lead and the project's default assignee is Unassigned. Jae-won creates an issue with the components <b>Zephyr</b>, <b>Atlas</b>, and <b>Beacon</b> and leaves the Assignee field set to Automatic. Everyone involved has the Assignable User permission. What is the result?","zh":"請看圖。在 company-managed project KITE 裡，Mateo 是 project lead，project 的 default assignee 是 Unassigned。Jae-won 建立一張 issue，選了 <b>Zephyr</b>、<b>Atlas</b>、<b>Beacon</b> 三個 components，Assignee 欄位維持 Automatic。相關人員都有 Assignable User 權限。結果會是什麼？","zo":["Issue 保持未指派，因為 Atlas 字母排最前面，而它的 default assignee 是 Unassigned","Issue 保持未指派，因為 Beacon 用的是 Project default，而 project 的 default assignee 是 Unassigned","指派給 Jonas，因為 component lead 的優先序永遠高於其他 default assignee 選項","指派給 Mateo，因為 Project lead 的優先序高於 Unassigned 和 Project default"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 259\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"KITE 的 components 與 default assignee\"><rect x=\"0.5\" y=\"0.5\" width=\"379\" height=\"258\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"380\" height=\"34\" rx=\"0\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Project settings</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Components</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Component → Default assignee</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"119\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"119\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Atlas</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Unassigned</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"145\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"145\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"137\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Beacon</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"137\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Project default</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"171\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"171\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"163\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Kite</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"163\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Component lead (Jonas)</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"197\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"197\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"189\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Zephyr</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"189\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Project lead</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"218\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s tf-violet\" style=\"font-weight:700\">Project lead: Mateo · Project default assignee: Unassign</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"234\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s tf-violet\" style=\"font-weight:700\">ed</text></svg>","opts":["The issue stays unassigned, because Atlas comes first alphabetically and its default assignee is Unassigned","The issue stays unassigned, because Beacon uses Project default and the project's default assignee is Unassigned","Jonas is assigned, because a component lead always outranks the other default assignee options","Mateo is assigned, because Project lead ranks above both Unassigned and Project default"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。這是先看字母序的錯誤順序；Jira 先比 default assignee 的類型，Atlas 的 Unassigned 低於 Zephyr 的 Project lead，字母序派不上用場。","B":"錯。Beacon 的 Project default 是四種類型裡最低的一級，根本輪不到它；而且這張 issue 還有更高一級的 Project lead。","C":"錯。Jonas 是 Kite component 的 lead，但這張 issue 沒有選 Kite；只有 issue 上實際選到的 components 才會參與比較。","D":"對。三個 components 的類型分別是 Project lead、Unassigned、Project default；依 Component lead＞Project lead＞Unassigned＞Project default，Zephyr 勝出，指派給 project lead Mateo。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira/kb/manage-components-default-assignee-jira-software/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.5-e03","sec":"620.3.5","dom":"620.3","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"In the company-managed project FERN, Lucía is the project lead and the project's default assignee is set to Project lead. Component <b>Apex</b> has its default assignee set to Project default, and component <b>Birch</b> has its default assignee set to Unassigned. New issues that have both components and Assignee set to Automatic stay unassigned. Lucía has the Assignable User permission. Which two changes would cause these issues to be assigned to Lucía automatically? (Choose two.)","zh":"在 company-managed project FERN 裡，Lucía 是 project lead，project 的 default assignee 設成 Project lead。Component <b>Apex</b> 的 default assignee 設成 Project default，component <b>Birch</b> 的 default assignee 設成 Unassigned。同時有這兩個 components、Assignee 為 Automatic 的新 issue 都保持未指派。Lucía 有 Assignable User 權限。哪兩項變更能讓這類 issue 自動指派給 Lucía？（選兩個。）","zo":["把 Birch 改名為 Zinc，讓 Apex 依字母序先被判斷","把 Apex 的 default assignee 改成 Project lead","讓 Lucía 擔任 Apex 的 component lead，但不改它的 default assignee","在 Details 頁的 Default assignee 欄位直接選 Lucía 本人","把 Birch 的 default assignee 改成 Project lead"],"fig":"","opts":["Rename Birch to Zinc so that Apex is evaluated first alphabetically","Change the default assignee of Apex to Project lead","Make Lucía the component lead of Apex without changing its default assignee","Select Lucía by name in the project's Default assignee field on the Details page","Change the default assignee of Birch to Project lead"],"ans":"BE","why":{"A":"錯。改名只影響同一類型之間的字母序；Apex 是 Project default、Birch 是 Unassigned，類型不同，先比類型，Unassigned 照樣勝出。","B":"對。Apex 改成 Project lead 後，它的類型高於 Birch 的 Unassigned，Jira 就指派給 project lead Lucía。常見誤解：以為 Project default 會指向 Lucía 就等於 Project lead。","C":"錯。只設 component lead 不會改變 default assignee；Apex 仍是 Project default，排名依然低於 Unassigned，issue 還是未指派。","D":"錯。Details 頁的 Default assignee 只能選 Unassigned 或 Project lead，不能直接挑某個人；而且問題出在 component 的類型排序，不在 project 層。","E":"對。Birch 改成 Project lead 後，兩個 components 中最高一級是 Project lead，高於 Apex 的 Project default，所以指派給 Lucía。"},"note":"官方 KB 範例：Alpha 設 Project default（而 project default 是 Project Lead）、Beta 設 Unassigned，結果仍是 Unassigned。Jira 比的是「類型」，不是類型最後解析成誰。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira/kb/manage-components-default-assignee-jira-software/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/edit-a-projects-details/"],"lvl":3,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.5-e04","sec":"620.3.5","dom":"620.3","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Keanu is preparing a short guide for new project administrators at Lumora about what happens when an issue is created with several components and the Assignee is left as Automatic. Everyone involved has the Assignable User permission. Which two statements should he include? (Choose two.)","zh":"Keanu 正在為 Lumora 公司新任的 project administrator 準備一份簡短說明，內容是：建立 issue 時選了好幾個 components、Assignee 維持 Automatic，會發生什麼事。相關人員都有 Assignable User 權限。他應該寫進哪兩項敘述？（選兩個。）","zo":["如果有兩個以上的 components 使用 Component lead，Jira 會指派給這些 components 中名稱字母排最前面那個的 lead","如果有兩個以上的 components 使用 Component lead，Jira 會指派給顯示名稱字母排最前面的那位 lead","設成 Project default 的 component 優先於設成 Unassigned 的，因為 project 層級的設定比 component 設定優先","設成 Project lead 的 component 優先於設成 Unassigned 的，和 component 名稱無關","Jira 會指派給最先加到 issue 上的那個 component 的 lead","如果各 components 的 default assignee 不同，Jira 會讓 issue 保持未指派"],"fig":"","opts":["If two or more of the components use Component lead, Jira assigns the lead of whichever of those components comes first alphabetically","If two or more of the components use Component lead, Jira assigns the lead whose display name comes first alphabetically","A component set to Project default outranks one set to Unassigned, because project-level settings take priority over component settings","A component set to Project lead outranks one set to Unassigned, regardless of the component names","Jira assigns the lead of the component that was added to the issue first","If the components have different default assignees, Jira leaves the issue unassigned"],"ans":"AD","why":{"A":"對。同一類型（例如都是 Component lead）時，Jira 依 component 名稱字母序，取排最前面那個 component 的 lead。官方特別強調看的是 component 名稱，不是 lead 名稱。","B":"錯。這是把排序對象搞錯；官方 KB 明說比的是 component 的名稱，不是 lead 的名稱。常見誤解：多個 component 時依 lead 名字排序。","C":"錯。順序剛好相反：Component lead＞Project lead＞Unassigned＞Project default，Project default 是最低一級，會輸給 Unassigned。","D":"對。先比 default assignee 的類型，Project lead 高於 Unassigned；類型不同時字母序完全不列入考慮，名稱怎麼取都一樣。","E":"錯。Jira 不看 component 加到 issue 上的先後順序；它依類型優先序，同級時才用 component 名稱字母序。","F":"錯。多個 components 的 default assignee 不同時，Jira 會照優先序挑出一個，不會因為衝突就留空；只有 Unassigned 勝出時才會未指派。"},"note":"Configure Jira components 頁只簡述「取字母序最前面的 component」；完整的類型優先序寫在官方 KB。兩者合起來看：先比類型，同級才比名稱。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira/kb/manage-components-default-assignee-jira-software/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-jira-components/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.5-e05","sec":"620.3.5","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. In the company-managed project TIDE, Inês is the project lead and belongs to the Developers role. Kwame is the lead of component <b>Kappa</b>, whose default assignee is Component lead, but he belongs only to the Viewers role. Component <b>Omega</b> has its default assignee set to Project lead. A reporter creates an issue with both components and leaves the Assignee set to Automatic. What is the result?","zh":"請看圖。在 company-managed project TIDE 裡，Inês 是 project lead，屬於 Developers 角色。Kwame 是 component <b>Kappa</b> 的 lead，Kappa 的 default assignee 是 Component lead，但 Kwame 只屬於 Viewers 角色。Component <b>Omega</b> 的 default assignee 設成 Project lead。有位回報者建立一張同時有這兩個 components 的 issue，Assignee 維持 Automatic。結果會是什麼？","zo":["指派給 Kwame，因為 Component lead 的優先序最高","指派給 Inês，因為 Kwame 會被跳過，接著輪到 Omega 的 Project lead","Issue 保持未指派，因為最優先的候選人無法被指派時，Jira 就會停止","指派給 Kwame，因為有 Browse Projects 就足以接收 issue"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 217\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"TIDE 的 permission scheme 摘要\"><rect x=\"0.5\" y=\"0.5\" width=\"379\" height=\"216\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"380\" height=\"34\" rx=\"0\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Project settings</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Permissions</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Permission → Granted to</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"119\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"119\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Browse Projects</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Project role: Viewers, Developers</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"145\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"145\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"137\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Assign Issues</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"137\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Project role: Developers</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"171\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"171\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"163\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Assignable User</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"163\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Project role: Developers</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"192\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s tf-violet\" style=\"font-weight:700\">Kwame: Viewers only · Inês: Developers (project lead)</text></svg>","opts":["Kwame is assigned, because Component lead has the highest precedence","Inês is assigned, because Kwame is skipped and Omega's Project lead is next","The issue stays unassigned, because Jira stops when the top candidate cannot be assigned","Kwame is assigned, because Browse Projects is enough to receive issues"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。Component lead 的確是最高一級，但前提是這個人能被指派；Kwame 沒有 Assignable User，Jira 不能把 issue 指派給他。","B":"對。圖中 Assignable User 只給 Developers，Kwame 只在 Viewers，所以被跳過；下一個候選是 Omega 的 Project lead，也就是 Inês。官方 KB 範例正是這個結果。","C":"錯。官方 KB 的範例中，component lead 缺 Assignable User 時，issue 改指派給另一個 component 的 Project lead，並不是直接停下來留空。","D":"錯。Browse Projects 只讓人看得到 project 與 issue；能不能被指派取決於 Assignable User 權限，兩者是不同的權限。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira/kb/manage-components-default-assignee-jira-software/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/work-item-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.5-e06","sec":"620.3.5","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Oluwaseun is the project administrator of the company-managed project TERRA. The team does not use components, and most issues are created with the Assignee set to Automatic. She wants these issues to go to Chiara, the triage coordinator, and she does not want to create automation rules. On the project's Details page, Chiara is not listed in the Default assignee field. What should Oluwaseun do?","zh":"Oluwaseun 是 company-managed project TERRA 的 project administrator。團隊沒有使用 components，大多數 issue 建立時 Assignee 都維持 Automatic。她希望這些 issue 交給負責分派的 Chiara，而且不想建立 automation rule。在 project 的 Details 頁，Default assignee 欄位裡沒有 Chiara。Oluwaseun 應該怎麼做？","zo":["讓 Chiara 擔任 project lead，再把 Default assignee 設成 Project lead","給 Chiara Assignable User 權限，讓她的名字出現在 Default assignee 欄位","請 Jira administrator 關閉 Allow unassigned issues，讓欄位列出所有可被指派的使用者","把 Chiara 加進 Administrators project role，讓她能被選為 default assignee"],"fig":"","opts":["Make Chiara the project lead, and then set the Default assignee to Project lead","Grant Chiara the Assignable User permission so that her name appears in the Default assignee field","Ask a Jira administrator to turn off Allow unassigned issues so that the field lists every assignable user","Add Chiara to the Administrators project role so that she can be selected as the default assignee"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。官方說 project 的 default assignee 只能是 Unassigned 或 project lead；想指定特定的人，就要先把那個人設成 project lead，再把 Default assignee 設成 Project lead。","B":"錯。Assignable User 決定一個人能不能被指派，但 Default assignee 欄位本來就只有 Unassigned 與 Project lead 兩種，給了權限也不會出現她的名字。","C":"錯。Allow unassigned issues 是全站設定，關掉後 issue 必須有人負責，預設會落到 project lead；它不會讓欄位列出所有使用者。","D":"錯。加進 Administrators 角色只會讓她取得管理權限，Default assignee 欄位仍然只有 Unassigned 與 Project lead 可選。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>現行 UI 把 project lead 叫 Space owner，官方原文寫「only be either Unassigned, or the Space owner」。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/edit-a-projects-details/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-jira-application-options/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.5-e07","sec":"620.3.5","dom":"620.3","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Mariam is the project administrator of the service project SUPRT. She is building an automation rule with the Issue created trigger and the Assign issue action so that new requests are spread across four agents listed in the action. Which two statements about the Assign issue action are correct? (Choose two.)","zh":"Mariam 是 service project SUPRT 的 project administrator。她正在建立一條 automation rule，用 Issue created 觸發、Assign issue 動作，把新請求分給動作裡列出的四位客服人員。關於 Assign issue 動作，哪兩項敘述正確？（選兩個。）","zo":["Random 選項會把每張新 issue 指派給名單中目前未完成 issue 最少的人","這個動作可以把 issue 指派給名單中沒有 Assignable User 權限的使用者","Round-robin 選項會依 action 裡使用者名單的順序輪流指派","Balanced workload 選項要求名單上每個人都必須是 project 裡某個 component 的 lead","Balanced workload 選項讓名單中每個人負責的 issue 數量相同，範圍由 JQL 定義"],"fig":"","opts":["The Random option assigns each new issue to whichever listed user currently has the fewest open issues","The action can assign issues to listed users who do not have the Assignable User permission","The Round-robin option assigns issues in the sequential order of the user list in the action","The Balanced workload option requires every listed user to be a component lead in the project","The Balanced workload option aims to give each listed user an equal number of issues, with the scope defined in JQL"],"ans":"CE","why":{"A":"錯。「挑目前 issue 最少的人」是 Balanced workload 的概念；Random 是從名單中隨機挑一個，不考慮每個人手上有多少 issue。","B":"錯。官方文件列出 Assign issue 動作的 Required permissions 是 Assign work items 與 Assignable user；名單上的人沒有 Assignable User，就不能被指派。","C":"對。Round-robin 依 action 裡使用者名單的順序輪流指派，最適合「大家輪流接單」。被指派的人仍需要 Assignable User 權限。","D":"錯。Balanced workload 只看名單中的使用者與 JQL 範圍，和 component lead 無關；components 是另一種自動指派手段。","E":"對。Balanced workload 讓名單中每個人負責的 issue 數量相同，計算範圍由 JQL 定義，適合「平均分配」的需求。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>現行文件把這個 action 叫 Assign work item，Automatic 寫成「Assign it to the space’s default assignee」。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/jira-automation-actions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.5-e08","sec":"620.3.5","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"In the company-managed project HARBOR, the <b>Payments</b> component has its default assignee set to Component lead, and Tomás is its lead. The project's default assignee is Project lead. Farida creates an issue with the Payments component and, before selecting Create, picks Yusuf in the Assignee field. Yusuf has the Assignable User permission. Who is assigned to the issue?","zh":"在 company-managed project HARBOR 裡，<b>Payments</b> component 的 default assignee 設成 Component lead，lead 是 Tomás。Project 的 default assignee 是 Project lead。Farida 建立一張有 Payments component 的 issue，按下 Create 之前，在 Assignee 欄位選了 Yusuf。Yusuf 有 Assignable User 權限。這張 issue 會指派給誰？","zo":["Tomás，因為 component 的 default assignee 會覆蓋建立畫面上選的值","Project lead，因為 project 層級的 default assignee 比 component 設定優先","沒有人，因為 Assignee 和 component 預設衝突時，Jira 會清空 Assignee","Yusuf，因為 default assignee 規則只在 Assignee 維持 Automatic 時才會套用"],"fig":"","opts":["Tomás, because a component default assignee overrides the value chosen on the create screen","The project lead, because the project-level default assignee takes priority over component settings","Nobody, because Jira clears the Assignee when it conflicts with the component default","Yusuf, because the default assignee rules apply only when the Assignee is left as Automatic"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。Component 的 default assignee 會覆蓋 project default，但不會覆蓋回報者手動選的人；只有 Assignee 維持 Automatic 時才輪到它。","B":"錯。順序其實相反：component 的 default assignee 會覆蓋 project default；而且這張 issue 已經手動選了人，兩種預設都用不上。","C":"錯。手動選的 assignee 和 component 設定不算「衝突」，Jira 不會清空欄位；它直接採用回報者選的人。","D":"對。官方規則的第一步：回報者自己選了 assignee，就指派給那個人，不管 project 或 component 的設定。只有維持 Automatic，Jira 才去看 components 與 project default。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira/kb/manage-components-default-assignee-jira-software/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/who-does-the-automatic-assignee-option-assign-an-issue-to/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.6-e01","sec":"620.3.6","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit.\nNgozi is the project administrator of the team-managed project TRAIL. She opens the rule list for the Resolve transition of the Bug workflow. Her manager wants the Resolve screen that a Jira administrator designed for the company's other projects, with Root cause, Resolution, and Fix versions, to appear on this transition. What should Ngozi tell her manager?","zh":"請參考附圖。\nNgozi 是 team-managed project TRAIL 的 project administrator。她打開 Bug workflow 中 Resolve transition 的 rule 清單。她的主管希望 Jira administrator 替公司其他 project 設計的 Resolve screen（含 Root cause、Resolution、Fix versions）也出現在這個 transition 上。Ngozi 該怎麼回覆主管？","zo":["她可以加 Update an issue field rule，選 Resolve screen 當作轉換時要顯示的值。","她應該請 Jira administrator 在這個 project 的 screen scheme 裡，把 Resolve screen 對應到 Bug issue type。","Team-managed project 不能把 screen 掛到 transition；Resolve screen 只能用在 company-managed project。","她可以把 Root cause 拖到 Hide when empty 分隔線上方，這樣 bug 被解決時 Resolve screen 就會出現。"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 376\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"TRAIL Bug workflow rule list\"><rect x=\"0.5\" y=\"0.5\" width=\"379\" height=\"375\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"380\" height=\"34\" rx=\"0\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Project settings</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Add rule · Resolve</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Project</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"95\" width=\"356\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"113\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">TRAIL (team-managed) · Bug</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"144\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Choose a rule</text><circle cx=\"19\" cy=\"157\" r=\"7\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"161\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Assign an issue to someone</text><circle cx=\"19\" cy=\"178\" r=\"7\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"182\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Update an issue field</text><circle cx=\"19\" cy=\"199\" r=\"7\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"203\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Copy the value of one field to another</text><circle cx=\"19\" cy=\"220\" r=\"7\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"224\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Remind people to update empty fields</text><circle cx=\"19\" cy=\"241\" r=\"7\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"245\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Restrict who can move an issue</text><circle cx=\"19\" cy=\"262\" r=\"7\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"266\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Check that an issue has been through a status</text><circle cx=\"19\" cy=\"283\" r=\"7\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"287\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Restrict to when an issue is a specific value</text><circle cx=\"19\" cy=\"304\" r=\"7\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"308\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Validate that people have a specific permission</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"326\" width=\"61.0\" height=\"26\" rx=\"6\" class=\"fl-brand\"/><text x=\"42.5\" y=\"343\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"w\">Select</text></svg>","opts":["She can add the Update an issue field rule and choose the Resolve screen as the value to display during the transition.","She should ask a Jira administrator to associate the Resolve screen with the Bug issue type in the project's screen scheme.","Team-managed projects cannot map a screen to a transition; the Resolve screen can be used only in a company-managed project.","She can drag Root cause above the Hide when empty divider so that the Resolve screen appears when a bug is resolved."],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。Update an issue field 是在轉換時由 Jira 自動把欄位改成指定的值，不會顯示任何 screen，也沒有「選一個 screen」的設定。","B":"錯。Team-managed project 沒有 screen scheme，欄位直接掛在 issue type 上；Jira admin 也沒有這個 project 的 screen scheme 可改。","C":"對。考試版的 TMP 沒有 screen，workflow rule 沒有一條能把 screen 掛到 transition；要用 company-managed project，由 Jira admin 掛上 screen。常見誤解：以為 TMP 也能加 transition screen。","D":"錯。Hide when empty 分隔線只決定空欄位要不要收進 More fields，是 issue 上的排版，不會在轉換狀態時跳出畫面。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>考試版的 team-managed project 沒有 screen，transition 也不能掛畫面。現行的 Map a screen to a workflow transition 官方頁已寫明，team-managed space 也能從 Space settings → Work types → Edit workflow，在 transition 加 <b>Request input → Show a screen</b> 規則（screen 要事先建好）。現行 TMP 另有 <b>Remind people to update empty fields</b> 規則，會在轉換時提示填寫指定的空欄位，但它不是 screen。作答以考試版為準；現行 UI 把 issue 叫 work item、project 叫 space。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/available-workflow-rules-in-team-managed-projects/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/add-or-remove-workflow-rules-in-team-managed-projects/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/what-are-team-managed-and-company-managed-projects/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/map-a-screen-to-a-workflow-transition/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.6-e02","sec":"620.3.6","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Hamid administers the team-managed project ORCA. He wants a new Release notes field to appear when bugs are created and to appear on a transition screen when bugs move to Done. He searches Project settings for Screens and Screen schemes but finds neither. What is the reason?","zh":"Hamid 管理 team-managed project ORCA。他想讓新的 Release notes 欄位在建立 bug 時出現，並在 bug 移到 Done 時出現在 transition screen 上。他在 Project settings 裡找 Screens 和 Screen schemes，但兩個都找不到。原因是什麼？","zo":["Team-managed project 不使用 screen。他可以把欄位加到 Bug issue type，但無法把 screen 掛到 Done transition。","Screen 對 project administrator 隱藏。必須由 Jira administrator 把欄位加到 create screen，並把 screen 掛到 Done transition。","Hamid 沒有 Administer Projects 權限，所以 Project settings 裡看不到 Screens 和 Screen schemes 頁面。","要先在 Project settings 的 Features 頁開啟 Workflow screens 選項，Screens 頁才會出現。"],"fig":"","opts":["Team-managed projects do not use screens. He can add the field to the Bug issue type, but he cannot map a screen to the Done transition.","Screens are hidden from project administrators. A Jira administrator must add the field to the create screen and map a screen to the Done transition.","Hamid does not have the Administer Projects permission, so the Screens and Screen schemes pages are hidden from his view of Project settings.","The Screens page appears only after he turns on the Workflow screens option in Project settings, under the Features page of the project."],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。TMP 的欄位直接加在 issue type 上，沒有 screen 與 screen scheme，所以找不到；加上欄位後建立 bug 時就看得到。但考試版的 TMP 沒有 screen 可以掛到 transition，這一半需求做不到。","B":"錯。Jira admin 負責 screen 與 screen scheme 的是 company-managed project；TMP 沒有這些設定，找 Jira admin 也無從掛起。","C":"錯。Hamid 已經在管理這個 project 並打開 Project settings，代表他有管理權限；找不到 Screens 和權限無關。","D":"錯。TMP 的 Features 頁是開關 sprints、releases 等功能，沒有任何選項能讓 screen 出現。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>考試版的 team-managed project 沒有 screen，transition 也不能掛畫面。現行的 Map a screen to a workflow transition 官方頁已寫明，team-managed space 也能從 Space settings → Work types → Edit workflow，在 transition 加 <b>Request input → Show a screen</b> 規則（screen 要事先建好）。現行 TMP 另有 <b>Remind people to update empty fields</b> 規則，會在轉換時提示填寫指定的空欄位，但它不是 screen。作答以考試版為準；現行 UI 把 issue 叫 work item、project 叫 space。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/issue-types-how-do-team-managed-and-company-managed-projects-differ/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/customize-an-issues-fields-in-team-managed-projects/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/what-are-team-managed-and-company-managed-projects/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/add-or-remove-workflow-rules-in-team-managed-projects/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/map-a-screen-to-a-workflow-transition/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.6-e03","sec":"620.3.6","dom":"620.3","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Leilani is the project administrator of the team-managed project MOSS. She wants to handle the following requests without involving a Jira administrator. Which two requests can she complete on her own? (Choose two.)","zh":"Leilani 是 team-managed project MOSS 的 project administrator。她想在不找 Jira administrator 的情況下處理下列需求。哪兩項她可以自己完成？（選兩個。）","zo":["當 issue 移到 Done 時，顯示一個詢問 Root cause 的 screen","建立一個只在 MOSS 使用的新 custom field","把 MOSS 的 workflow 分享給第二個 team-managed project","Issue 移到 In review 時自動指派給 QA 負責人","替 Bug issue type 對應另一個 screen scheme"],"fig":"","opts":["Display a screen that asks for a Root cause when an issue moves to Done","Create a new custom field that is used only in MOSS","Share the MOSS workflow with a second team-managed project","Automatically assign issues to the QA lead when they move to In review","Associate a different screen scheme with the Bug issue type"],"ans":"BD","why":{"A":"錯。考試版的 TMP 沒有 transition screen，workflow rule 裡沒有「顯示畫面」這一項。常見誤解：以為 TMP 的 admin 什麼都能自己加。","B":"對。TMP 的 project admin 可以在 Project settings 的 Fields 或 issue type 裡用 Create field 建欄位；這種欄位只屬於這個 project，別的 project 用不到。","C":"錯。TMP 的 workflow 只屬於自己的 project，不能和其他 project 共用；要多個 project 共用 workflow，得用 company-managed。","D":"對。TMP workflow 有 Assign an issue to someone rule，可指定移到某個 status 時自動指派給特定的人，project admin 自己就能加。","E":"錯。Screen scheme 是 company-managed 的機制，由 Jira admin 設定；TMP 的欄位直接放在 issue type 上，沒有 screen scheme。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>考試版的 team-managed project 沒有 screen，transition 也不能掛畫面。現行的 Map a screen to a workflow transition 官方頁已寫明，team-managed space 也能從 Space settings → Work types → Edit workflow，在 transition 加 <b>Request input → Show a screen</b> 規則（screen 要事先建好）。現行 TMP 另有 <b>Remind people to update empty fields</b> 規則，會在轉換時提示填寫指定的空欄位，但它不是 screen。作答以考試版為準；現行 UI 把 issue 叫 work item、project 叫 space。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/customize-an-issues-fields-in-team-managed-projects/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/available-workflow-rules-in-team-managed-projects/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/what-are-team-managed-and-company-managed-projects/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/issue-types-how-do-team-managed-and-company-managed-projects-differ/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/map-a-screen-to-a-workflow-transition/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.6-e04","sec":"620.3.6","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Tomasz is reviewing training notes about transition screens before a workshop for new project administrators. Which statement is NOT true?","zh":"Tomasz 在替新任 project administrator 辦工作坊之前，檢查一份關於 transition screen 的教學筆記。下列哪一項敘述不正確？","zo":["在 company-managed project 中，screen 必須先存在，才能加到 transition 上。","Workflow 更新之後，變更會套用到所有使用這個 workflow 的 project。","Bug 移到 Done 時，transition screen 可以收集 Resolution、Fix versions 等欄位。","在 team-managed project 中，project administrator 可以在 issue type 的 workflow 編輯器裡替 transition 加上 screen。"],"fig":"","opts":["In a company-managed project, the screen must already exist before it can be added to a transition.","After the workflow is updated, the change applies to every project that uses that workflow.","A transition screen can collect fields such as Resolution and Fix versions when a bug moves to Done.","In a team-managed project, the project administrator can add a screen to a transition in the issue type's workflow editor."],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"正確敘述（不選）。官方步驟的前提就是先有一個放好欄位的 screen，才能在 transition 上選它。","B":"正確敘述（不選）。官方頁說更新 workflow 會影響所有使用這個 workflow 的 project，改之前要先確認影響範圍。","C":"正確敘述（不選）。官方的例子正是 bug 從 In progress 到 Done 時，跳出含 Fix version 與 Resolution 的畫面。","D":"錯誤敘述（要選）。考試版的 team-managed workflow 編輯器只有指派、更新欄位、限制轉換等 rule，沒有 screen 可掛。常見誤解：以為 TMP 也能加 transition screen。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>考試版的 team-managed project 沒有 screen，transition 也不能掛畫面。現行的 Map a screen to a workflow transition 官方頁已寫明，team-managed space 也能從 Space settings → Work types → Edit workflow，在 transition 加 <b>Request input → Show a screen</b> 規則（screen 要事先建好）。現行 TMP 另有 <b>Remind people to update empty fields</b> 規則，會在轉換時提示填寫指定的空欄位，但它不是 screen。作答以考試版為準；現行 UI 把 issue 叫 work item、project 叫 space。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/map-a-screen-to-a-workflow-transition/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/available-workflow-rules-in-team-managed-projects/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/what-are-team-managed-and-company-managed-projects/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.6-e05","sec":"620.3.6","dom":"620.3","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Lindiwe, a developer in the company-managed project HALO, pins the Due date field while viewing a bug. Which two statements are true? (Choose two.)","zh":"Lindiwe 是 company-managed project HALO 的開發者，她在看一張 bug 時把 Due date 欄位釘選（pin）起來。下列哪兩項敘述正確？（選兩個。）","zo":["她在 HALO 打開有這個欄位的 story 和 task 時，Due date 也會被釘選。","HALO 的隊友現在會在每張 bug 的最上方看到被釘選的 Due date。","在全站所有使用這個欄位的 project 裡，Due date 都會替她釘選。","要先經過 project administrator 核准，被釘選的欄位才會出現。","只有 Lindiwe 會在自己的 Pinned fields 群組看到 Due date。"],"fig":"","opts":["Due date is also pinned when she opens stories and tasks in HALO that have the field.","Her teammates in HALO now see Due date pinned at the top of every bug.","Due date is pinned for her in every project on the site that uses the field.","The project administrator must approve the change before the pinned field appears.","Only Lindiwe sees Due date in her Pinned fields group."],"ans":"AE","why":{"A":"對。官方說釘選會套用到同一個 project 裡所有有這個欄位的 issue type；在 bug 上釘 Due date，story、task 也會一起出現。","B":"錯。這是把釘選當成 issue layout。Layout 由 project admin 設定、全隊都看得到；釘選是個人設定，隊友看不到。","C":"錯。釘選的範圍是單一 project，不是全站；換到別的 project 要自己重新釘選。","D":"錯。釘選不需要任何人核准，使用者把游標移到欄位名稱上、按下圖釘就立即生效。","E":"對。官方說釘選欄位完全是個人的，只有自己看得到。要讓全隊看到同樣的排列，得由 project admin 調整 issue layout。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>現行 UI 把 issue 叫 work item、project 叫 space；釘選欄位出現在右側 context fields 的 Pinned fields 群組。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/pin-a-field-to-the-top-of-an-issue/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-field-layout-in-the-issue-view/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.6-e06","sec":"620.3.6","dom":"620.3","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit.\nThe exhibit shows part of the permission scheme for the company-managed project DUNE. Tuan belongs only to the Developers project role. All fields are on the project's edit screen. Which two fields can Tuan NOT change on a DUNE issue? (Choose two.)","zh":"請參考附圖。\n附圖是 company-managed project DUNE 的部分 permission scheme。Tuan 只屬於 Developers 這個 project role，而且所有欄位都在這個 project 的 edit screen 上。在 DUNE 的 issue 上，Tuan「不能」修改哪兩個欄位？（選兩個。）","zo":["Summary","Due date","Reporter","Assignee","Labels"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 297\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"DUNE permission scheme excerpt\"><rect x=\"0.5\" y=\"0.5\" width=\"379\" height=\"296\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"380\" height=\"34\" rx=\"0\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Project settings</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">DUNE permission scheme</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Permission → Granted to</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"119\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"119\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Browse Projects</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Developers, Administrators</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"145\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"145\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"137\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Edit Issues</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"137\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Developers, Administrators</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"171\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"171\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"163\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Assign Issues</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"163\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Developers, Administrators</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"197\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"197\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"189\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Assignable User</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"189\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Developers, Administrators</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"223\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"223\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"215\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Modify Reporter</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"215\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Administrators</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"249\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"249\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"241\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Schedule Issues</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"241\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Administrators</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"275\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"275\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"267\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Transition Issues</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"267\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Developers, Administrators</text></svg>","opts":["Summary","Due date","Reporter","Assignee","Labels"],"ans":"BC","why":{"A":"錯。Summary 是一般欄位，沒有專屬權限，只看 Edit Issues；圖中 Developers 有 Edit Issues，所以 Tuan 改得了。要另外看權限的是 Assignee、Reporter、Due date 這類欄位。","B":"對。Due date 是日期欄位，受 Schedule Issues 另外限制；圖中只有 Administrators 有這個權限，所以 Tuan 看得到卻改不了。常見誤解：以為有 Edit Issues 就能改所有欄位。","C":"對。Reporter 要 Modify Reporter 才能改，圖中只給 Administrators。欄位在畫面上但是灰色的，就是權限問題，不是 layout 問題。","D":"錯。改 Assignee 要操作者有 Assign Issues、被指派的人有 Assignable User；圖中 Developers 兩個都有，所以 Tuan 可以改 Assignee。","E":"錯。Labels 是一般欄位，只看 Edit Issues，沒有另外的專屬權限；Developers 有 Edit Issues 就能改。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>現行 UI 的權限名稱改成 Edit work items、Schedule work items、Modify reporters、Assign work items、Assignable user。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/work-item-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.6-e07","sec":"620.3.6","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Rashid is the project administrator of the company-managed project VELA. He finished the issue layout for the screen used by stories. He asks why he cannot find the Copy issue layout button in Project settings, although two other projects use the same screen. What is the most likely cause?","zh":"Rashid 是 company-managed project VELA 的 project administrator。他調好了 story 所用 screen 的 issue layout。他問：另外兩個 project 明明用同一個 screen，為什麼 Project settings 裡找不到 Copy issue layout 按鈕？最可能的原因是什麼？","zo":["另外兩個 project 用的是不同的 screen，所以在它們換 screen 之前按鈕會隱藏。","只有 Jira administrator 看得到、也能使用 Copy issue layout 按鈕。","Layout 必須先存成共用的 layout scheme，才能複製。","複製 issue layout 只有 team-managed project 能用。"],"fig":"","opts":["The other two projects use a different screen, so the button is hidden until they switch screens.","Only Jira administrators can see and use the Copy issue layout button.","The layout must first be saved as a shared layout scheme before it can be copied.","Copying an issue layout is available only in team-managed projects."],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。目標 project 是否用同一個 screen，只影響複製時能選哪些 project；題目也說它們用同一個 screen，不是按鈕消失的原因。","B":"對。官方說要是 Jira admin 才能把 layout 複製到其他 project，按鈕也只有 Jira admin 看得到。複製會覆蓋目標 project 的 layout，之後兩邊不會連動。","C":"錯。Jira 沒有「共用 layout scheme」；官方說 layout 是各 project 各自的設定，不能共用，只能一次性複製。","D":"錯。剛好相反，複製 issue layout 是 company-managed project 的功能；TMP 的欄位排列在 issue type 設定裡調整。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>現行 UI 的按鈕叫 Copy work item layout，路徑是 Space settings → Work items → Layout；官方頁註明此功能仍在逐步推出，可能比考試版新。<br>官方頁也說 layout 是各 project 各自的設定，即使多個 project 共用同一個 screen，也各自排版。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/copy-an-issue-layout-to-other-projects/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-field-layout-in-the-issue-view/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.7-e01","sec":"620.3.7","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. Tariq is the board administrator of the company-managed Scrum board for project KOALA. The team estimates stories in story points and wants to keep using story points for velocity. Team members already log work on their issues, but the sprint burndown does not change when they log hours. The team lead wants the burndown to track progress by the hours logged and remaining. What should Tariq do?","zh":"請看圖。Tariq 是 project KOALA 的 company-managed Scrum board 的 board administrator。團隊用 story points 估算 story，也想繼續用 story points 算 velocity。成員已經在 issue 上記工時（log work），但記了工時之後，sprint burndown 並沒有變化。Team lead 希望 burndown 依已記錄與剩餘的工時來追蹤進度。Tariq 應該怎麼做？","zo":["把 Estimation Statistic 改成 Original Time Estimate，讓 board 開始追蹤團隊記的工時","維持現有設定，因為 Jira 會用 Working hours per day 設定把 story points 換算成工時","把 Time Tracking 設成 Remaining Estimate and Time Spent，並保留 Story Points 當 Estimation Statistic","把 Work On Issues 權限給團隊，讓他們記的工時算進 burndown"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 290\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"KOALA board 的 Estimation 設定\"><rect x=\"0.5\" y=\"0.5\" width=\"379\" height=\"289\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"380\" height=\"34\" rx=\"0\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"34\" width=\"106\" height=\"256\" rx=\"0\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><line x1=\"106\" y1=\"34\" x2=\"106\" y2=\"290\" class=\"gl\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Board settings</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Estimation</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Estimation Statistic</text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"95\" width=\"250\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"128\" y=\"113\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Story Points</text><path d=\"M350,106 l5,5 l5,-5\" class=\"ln ink\" style=\"stroke-width:1.6\"/><text x=\"118\" y=\"144\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Time Tracking</text><rect x=\"118\" y=\"150\" width=\"250\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"128\" y=\"168\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">None</text><path d=\"M350,161 l5,5 l5,-5\" class=\"ln ink\" style=\"stroke-width:1.6\"/><text x=\"118\" y=\"199\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s tf-violet\" style=\"font-weight:700\">Team already logs work on issues</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">General</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"80\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Columns</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"106\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Swimlanes</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"132\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Quick filters</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"158\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Card colors</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"184\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Card layout</text><rect x=\"6\" y=\"195\" width=\"94\" height=\"22\" rx=\"6\" class=\"sf-brand\"/><text x=\"14\" y=\"210\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Estimation</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"236\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Working days</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"262\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Issue detail</text></svg>","opts":["Change the Estimation Statistic to Original Time Estimate so that the board starts tracking the hours the team logs","Keep the current settings, because Jira converts story points into hours by using the Working hours per day setting","Set Time Tracking to Remaining Estimate and Time Spent, and keep Story Points as the Estimation Statistic","Grant the Work On Issues permission to the team so that their logged hours are counted on the burndown"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。改成 Original Time Estimate 會連「估算單位」一起換掉，團隊就不能再用 story points 算 velocity，違反題目要保留 story points 的條件。","B":"錯。常見誤解：以為 story points 會換算成工時。官方說 story points 是相對的努力量，跟時間沒有對應，Working hours per day 不會拿它來換算。","C":"對。Board 可以用一種單位估算、另一種方式追蹤進度；Time Tracking 選 Remaining Estimate and Time Spent，就依 Time spent 與剩餘估計追蹤，story points 照樣算 velocity。","D":"錯。Work On Issues 是記工時的權限，題目說大家已經在記工時了；burndown 不動是因為 board 的 Time Tracking 還是 None，跟權限無關。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>現行 UI 把 Estimation Statistic 改叫 Estimation method，Time Tracking 的選項寫成 Remaining estimate and time spent。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-estimation-and-tracking/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/what-are-story-points/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/time-tracking-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.7-e02","sec":"620.3.7","dom":"620.3","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. Elif, a project manager for project LUMA, wants to find issues that have already used most of their time budget. She runs the JQL query <code>project = LUMA AND workRatio &gt; 75</code>. Which two issues are returned? (Choose two.)","zh":"請看圖。Elif 是 project LUMA 的專案經理，想找出已經用掉大部分時間預算的 issue。她執行 JQL 查詢 <code>project = LUMA AND workRatio &gt; 75</code>。哪兩張 issue 會被撈到？（選兩個。）","zo":["LUMA-1","LUMA-2","LUMA-3","LUMA-4","LUMA-5"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 198\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"LUMA 的 story points 與工時\"><rect x=\"10\" y=\"8\" width=\"300\" height=\"182\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx plain\"/><text x=\"20\" y=\"28\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\">Issues in project LUMA</text><rect x=\"16\" y=\"39\" width=\"288\" height=\"22\" rx=\"5\" class=\"sf-gray\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Key</text><text x=\"128\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Story pts</text><text x=\"210\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Orig. est.</text><text x=\"296\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Time spent</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"62\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"62\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">LUMA-1</text><text x=\"128\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"t\">8</text><text x=\"210\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"t\">4h</text><text x=\"296\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"t\">1h</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"86\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"86\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">LUMA-2</text><text x=\"128\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"t\">2</text><text x=\"210\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"t\">2h</text><text x=\"296\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"t\">2h</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"110\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"126\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">LUMA-3</text><text x=\"128\" y=\"126\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"t\">13</text><text x=\"210\" y=\"126\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"t\">8h</text><text x=\"296\" y=\"126\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"t\">4h</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"134\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"134\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"150\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">LUMA-4</text><text x=\"128\" y=\"150\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"t\">1</text><text x=\"210\" y=\"150\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"t\">6h</text><text x=\"296\" y=\"150\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"t\">5h</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"158\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"158\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"174\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">LUMA-5</text><text x=\"128\" y=\"174\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"t\">3</text><text x=\"210\" y=\"174\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"t\">4h</text><text x=\"296\" y=\"174\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"t\">3h</text></svg>","opts":["LUMA-1","LUMA-2","LUMA-3","LUMA-4","LUMA-5"],"ans":"BD","why":{"A":"錯。Time spent 1h ÷ Original estimate 4h＝25%，沒有超過 75。8 個 story points 不會讓它比較「滿」，workRatio 根本不看 story points。","B":"對。workRatio＝Time spent ÷ Original estimate × 100，2h ÷ 2h＝100%，大於 75。只用到 time tracking 的兩個欄位，story points 只有 2 也不影響。","C":"錯。常見誤解：以為 13 個 story points 代表工作量快用完。workRatio 只算 4h ÷ 8h＝50%，story points 不屬於 time tracking 欄位。","D":"對。5h ÷ 6h 約等於 83%，大於 75，所以會被撈到。story points 只有 1 也無關，因為 workRatio 只比較 Time spent 和 Original estimate。","E":"錯。3h ÷ 4h 剛好是 75%，而查詢條件是「大於 75」，不含等於，所以 LUMA-5 不會出現在結果裡。"},"note":"官方 JQL fields 頁：workRatio＝(timeSpent / originalEstimate) × 100。Time tracking 的三個欄位是 Original estimate、Remaining estimate、Time spent；Story points 是估算單位，不是 time tracking 欄位。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/jql-fields/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/what-are-story-points/"],"lvl":3,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.7-e03","sec":"620.3.7","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Ines is the project administrator of the team-managed project WREN. The Story issue type currently shows the Story point estimate field. The team must now log the hours they work on each story and see how much time remains. What should Ines do?","zh":"Ines 是 team-managed project WREN 的 project administrator。Story 這個 issue type 目前顯示 Story point estimate 欄位。團隊現在必須記錄每張 story 花了多少小時，也要看到還剩多少時間。Ines 應該怎麼做？","zo":["在 project settings 打開 Story 這個 issue type，把 Time tracking 欄位加上去","把 Story point estimate 欄位改名為 Hours，讓團隊在裡面填每張 story 花的小時數","請 Jira administrator 把 Edit All Worklogs 權限給團隊成員","建立一個名為 Time spent 的 Number 欄位，加到 Story issue type"],"fig":"","opts":["In the project settings, open the Story issue type and add the Time tracking field to it","Rename the Story point estimate field to Hours so that the team can enter the hours they work on each story","Ask a Jira administrator to grant the Edit All Worklogs permission to the team members","Create a new Number field named Time spent and add it to the Story issue type"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。官方說 team-managed project 是靠在 issue type 上加入或移除 Time tracking 欄位來決定用不用 time tracking；加上後就能 Log work，並看到已記錄與剩餘的時間。","B":"錯。常見誤解：以為 story points 欄位可以拿來記工時。Story points 是跟時間無關的相對單位，改名也不會產生 worklog 或剩餘時間。","C":"錯。Edit All Worklogs 只是修改任何人既有的工時紀錄；Story 上沒有 Time tracking 欄位，團隊還是沒有地方記工時。","D":"錯。自訂的 Number 欄位只是一個數字，名字取成 Time spent 也不會產生 worklog，更不會算出 Remaining estimate。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>現行 UI 把 project settings 叫 Space settings、issue type 叫 work type。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-time-tracking/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/customize-an-issues-fields-in-team-managed-projects/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/what-are-story-points/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/time-tracking-permissions/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.7-e04","sec":"620.3.7","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. Hana is a Jira administrator. Keanu, a developer in the company-managed project MAPLE, can delete a log file that he attached to MAPLE-88, but he cannot delete a screenshot that a tester attached to the same issue. The MAPLE project administrator asks Hana to let every developer remove any attachment in MAPLE, without allowing developers to delete issues. What should Hana do?","zh":"請看圖。Hana 是 Jira administrator。Keanu 是 company-managed project MAPLE 的開發者，他可以刪除自己附加在 MAPLE-88 上的 log 檔，卻刪不掉測試人員附加在同一張 issue 上的截圖。MAPLE 的 project administrator 請 Hana 讓每位開發者都能刪除 MAPLE 裡的任何附件，但不讓開發者刪除 issue。Hana 應該怎麼做？","zo":["把 Delete Issues 權限給 Developers role","把 Delete Own Attachments 權限給 Developers role","在附件設定中開啟 ZIP support","把 Delete All Attachments 權限給 Developers role"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 274\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"MAPLE 的附件相關權限\"><rect x=\"0.5\" y=\"0.5\" width=\"379\" height=\"273\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"380\" height=\"34\" rx=\"0\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Project settings</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Permissions</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Permission scheme</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"95\" width=\"356\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"113\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">MAPLE Permission Scheme</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"144\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Attachments and issue permissions</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"174\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"174\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"166\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Create Attachments</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"166\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Developers, Testers</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"200\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"192\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Delete Own Attachments</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"192\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Developers, Testers</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"226\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"226\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"218\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Delete All Attachments</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"218\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Administrators</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"252\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"252\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"244\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Delete Issues</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"244\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Administrators</text></svg>","opts":["Grant the Delete Issues permission to the Developers role","Grant the Delete Own Attachments permission to the Developers role","Turn on ZIP support in the attachment settings","Grant the Delete All Attachments permission to the Developers role"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。Delete Issues 是刪整張 issue 的權限，官方明說它不能刪單一附件或留言；而且題目要求不能讓開發者刪 issue。","B":"錯。圖上 Developers 已經有 Delete Own Attachments，所以 Keanu 刪得掉自己的 log 檔；這個權限只管自己上傳的附件。","C":"錯。ZIP support 只是讓使用者預覽 ZIP 內容、把全部附件打包成一個 ZIP 下載，跟刪除別人的附件無關。","D":"對。Delete All Attachments 允許刪除 project 內任何 issue 上的附件，不限上傳者；CMP 的 permission scheme 要有 Administer Jira 才能改，所以由 Hana 來做。常見誤解：以為能上傳就能刪別人的。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/voters-watchers-comment-and-attachment-permissions/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/work-item-permissions/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-file-attachments/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/grant-or-revoke-permissions-in-a-scheme/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.7-e05","sec":"620.3.7","dom":"620.3","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Mateus is a Jira administrator. In the company-managed project QUILL, testers must enter an Original estimate while they create Bug issues, but the Create issue dialog for bugs shows only Summary, Priority, and Description. Which two actions should Mateus take? (Choose two.)","zh":"Mateus 是 Jira administrator。在 company-managed project QUILL 中，測試人員建立 Bug 時必須填 Original estimate，但 bug 的 Create issue 對話框只顯示 Summary、Priority 和 Description。Mateus 應該做哪兩件事？（選兩個。）","zo":["把 Story Points 欄位加到建立 bug 用的 screen，讓測試人員在那裡填估計","在 QUILL board 的 Estimation 設定，把 Time Tracking 設成 Remaining Estimate and Time Spent","把 Time tracking 欄位加到對應 bug 的 Create issue 操作的 screen","在 QUILL 的 permission scheme 把 Edit All Worklogs 權限給測試人員","確認 Bug issue type 使用的 field configuration 沒有把 Time tracking 欄位隱藏"],"fig":"","opts":["Add the Story Points field to the screen used for creating bugs, so that testers can enter their estimate there","Set Time Tracking to Remaining Estimate and Time Spent in the Estimation settings of the QUILL board","Add the Time tracking field to the screen that is associated with the Create issue operation for bugs","Grant the Edit All Worklogs permission to the testers in the QUILL permission scheme","Make sure the Time tracking field is not hidden in the field configuration used by the Bug issue type"],"ans":"CE","why":{"A":"錯。常見誤解：把 story points 當成 time tracking 欄位。Story points 是跟時間無關的相對單位，不是 Original estimate，填了也不算時間估計。","B":"錯。這是 board 的進度追蹤方式，只影響 board 與報表怎麼算，不會把任何欄位放進 Create issue 畫面。","C":"對。官方說要讓團隊在建立或編輯 issue 時輸入 original estimate，就要把 Time Tracking 欄位加到對應該操作的 screen 上。","D":"錯。Edit All Worklogs 是修改任何人既有工時紀錄的權限，跟建立 issue 時能不能看到估算欄位無關。","E":"對。官方說 company-managed project 是靠 field configuration 顯示或隱藏 Time tracking 欄位；欄位一旦被隱藏，就算已經放在 screen 上，建立 bug 時也不會出現。"},"note":"Company-managed：screen 決定欄位「放在哪個畫面」，field configuration 決定欄位「顯示或隱藏」，兩者都要過。Team-managed 則是直接在 issue type 上加入 Time tracking 欄位。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-time-tracking/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/what-are-story-points/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.7-e06","sec":"620.3.7","dom":"620.3","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Sakura is a team lead in project ARGO. She wants to record that ARGO-31 cannot start until ARGO-18 is finished. She also wants ARGO-31 to reference the payment vendor's public API documentation, which is hosted on the vendor's own website. Which two actions should she take? (Choose two.)","zh":"Sakura 是 project ARGO 的 team lead。她想記錄「ARGO-31 要等 ARGO-18 完成後才能開始」。她也希望 ARGO-31 能參考付款廠商公開的 API 文件，這份文件放在廠商自己的網站上。她應該做哪兩件事？（選兩個。）","zo":["在 ARGO-31 上新增 linked issue，關係選 <b>is blocked by</b>，再選 ARGO-18","在 ARGO-31 上新增 linked issue，關係選 <b>blocks</b>，再選 ARGO-18","在 ARGO-31 上加一個連到 ARGO-18 的 <b>relates to</b> link，因為這樣 Jira 會在 ARGO-18 完成前擋住 ARGO-31 的狀態變更","請 Jira administrator 建立一個 Documentation 的 issue link type，讓廠商網址能用 issue link 連起來","在 ARGO-31 上加一個 web link，填入廠商網址和連結文字"],"fig":"","opts":["On ARGO-31, add a linked issue with the relationship <b>is blocked by</b> and select ARGO-18","On ARGO-31, add a linked issue with the relationship <b>blocks</b> and select ARGO-18","On ARGO-31, add a <b>relates to</b> link to ARGO-18, because Jira then prevents ARGO-31 from moving until ARGO-18 is done","Ask a Jira administrator to create a Documentation issue link type so that the vendor URL can be linked as an issue link","On ARGO-31, add a web link that contains the vendor's URL and a link text"],"ans":"AE","why":{"A":"對。在 ARGO-31 上選 is blocked by 再選 ARGO-18，意思就是 ARGO-31 被 ARGO-18 擋住；issue link 有方向，兩張 issue 上都會顯示這個關係。","B":"錯。方向反了：在 ARGO-31 上選 blocks，表示 ARGO-31 擋住 ARGO-18，跟「ARGO-31 要等 ARGO-18」的需求相反。","C":"錯。relates to 沒有先後意思；而且官方說連結 issue 不會以其他方式改變 issue，Jira 不會因為有 link 就擋住狀態轉換。","D":"錯。Link type 是 Jira admin 定義的「issue 與 issue 之間」的關係，只能連到另一張 issue，不能拿來連外部網址。","E":"對。Web link 就是把任何網址加到 issue 上，並填一段 Link text；它只是參考資料，沒有 issue link 那種方向。"},"note":"Confluence 頁面也能連到 issue（從 Attachments 區的 Add attachment 或 epic 的相關工作），但前提是 Jira 已和 Confluence 連結；廠商自己的網站不是 Confluence，用 web link。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/add-files-images-and-other-content-to-describe-an-issue/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/link-issues/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-issue-linking/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.7-e07","sec":"620.3.7","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Dmitri, a developer in project PELICAN, reviews and comments on dozens of issues every week. He is now automatically watching all of them, and his inbox is flooded with notifications. He wants Jira to stop adding him as a watcher when he comments on or updates an issue, without changing anything for other users. What should he do?","zh":"Dmitri 是 project PELICAN 的開發者，每週要審查並留言幾十張 issue。現在他自動 watch 了所有這些 issue，信箱被通知塞爆。他希望以後在 issue 上留言或更新時，Jira 不要再自動把他加成 watcher，而且不能影響其他使用者。他應該怎麼做？","zo":["在每張留言過的 issue 上按 <b>W</b>，讓 Jira 以後不再幫他 watch 新的 issue","在自己的 Personal settings 關掉 Watch your issues 偏好","請 project administrator 在 PELICAN 的 permission scheme 拿掉他的 Manage Watchers 權限","請 Jira administrator 在 PELICAN 的 notification scheme 把每個事件的 All Watchers 都移除"],"fig":"","opts":["Press <b>W</b> on each issue he has commented on, so that Jira stops watching future issues for him","In his Personal settings, turn off the Watch your issues preference","Ask the project administrator to remove his Manage Watchers permission in the PELICAN permission scheme","Ask a Jira administrator to remove All Watchers from every event in the PELICAN notification scheme"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。W 是對單一 issue 切換 watch／unwatch 的快捷鍵，只能一張一張取消目前的 watch，之後再留言還是會自動被加進去。","B":"對。自動 watch 自己留言或更新過的 issue，是每個人在 Personal settings 裡的偏好；關掉只影響 Dmitri 自己，不會改到別人。","C":"錯。Manage Watchers 是替 issue 新增或移除 watcher 的權限，不是控制「自己會不會被自動加入」；拿掉它也擋不住自動 watch。","D":"錯。Notification scheme 的 All Watchers 是對整個 project 生效，拿掉後所有 watcher 都收不到通知，違反「不影響其他使用者」的條件。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>現行 UI 的偏好名稱是 Personal settings 裡的 Watch your work items。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/watch-share-and-comment-on-a-work-item/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/voters-watchers-comment-and-attachment-permissions/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-notification-schemes/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.3.7-e08","sec":"620.3.7","dom":"620.3","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refilwe is a developer in project SHIP. A Jira administrator has connected Bitbucket Cloud to the site, and Refilwe can see branches and pull requests in the Development panel of other SHIP issues that her teammates work on. For SHIP-214, she created the branch <code>fix-rounding</code>, pushed two commits with the message <code>fix cart rounding</code>, and opened a pull request titled <code>ship-214 fix cart rounding</code>. The Development panel on SHIP-214 shows nothing. What is the most likely cause?","zh":"Refilwe 是 project SHIP 的開發者。Jira administrator 已經把 Bitbucket Cloud 連到站台，Refilwe 也看得到隊友負責的其他 SHIP issue 的 Development 面板裡的 branch 和 pull request。為了 SHIP-214，她建立了 branch <code>fix-rounding</code>，推送兩個訊息為 <code>fix cart rounding</code> 的 commit，並開了一個標題是 <code>ship-214 fix cart rounding</code> 的 pull request。SHIP-214 的 Development 面板什麼都沒有顯示。最可能的原因是什麼？","zo":["Bitbucket 連線沒有啟用 smart commits，所以 pull request 無法關聯到 SHIP-214","Pull request 標題裡的 issue key 是小寫，但 Jira 要的是大寫的 key","Refilwe 在 project SHIP 沒有 View Development Tools 權限","Pull request 合併之後，開發資訊才會出現在 Jira"],"fig":"","opts":["Smart commits are not enabled for the Bitbucket connection, so the pull request cannot be linked to SHIP-214","The issue key in the pull request title is lowercase, but Jira expects keys in capital letters","Refilwe does not have the View Development Tools permission in project SHIP","Development information appears in Jira only after the pull request has been merged"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。Smart commits 是在 commit 訊息裡下指令（留言、記工時、轉狀態）；用 issue key 關聯 branch、commit、PR 是預設就會運作的，不需要 smart commits。","B":"對。Branch 名稱和 commit 訊息都沒有 key，唯一的 key 在 PR 標題卻寫成小寫。官方提醒 key 要用大寫（例如 JRA-123，不是 jra-123）才對得上。","C":"錯。缺 View Development Tools 的人看不到任何 issue 的 Development 面板，但她看得到隊友其他 SHIP issue 的 branch 和 PR，所以她在 SHIP 有這個權限。","D":"錯。只要推送到已連結的 repository，幾分鐘內就會同步；PR 標題帶 key 在建立時就會關聯，不必等合併。"},"note":"Key 可以放在 branch 名稱、commit 訊息或 PR 標題，三者擇一即可；最簡單的修正是把 PR 標題改成大寫的 <code>SHIP-214</code>，或從 issue 的 Development 區直接 Create branch，key 會自動帶入。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/reference-issues-in-your-development-work/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.4.1-e01","sec":"620.4.1","dom":"620.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. Rahul is a member of the jira-users group and of the Developers role in project PAY at Pacifica Payments. He can edit PAY issues one at a time, but the Bulk Change option is not available to him in search results. Which change lets Rahul bulk edit PAY issues while granting the least additional access?","zh":"Refer to the exhibit.（請看附圖。）Rahul 是 Pacifica Payments 的 jira-users 群組成員，也在 project PAY 的 Developers role 裡。他可以一張一張編輯 PAY 的 issue，但在搜尋結果裡看不到 Bulk Change 選項。哪一種調整能讓 Rahul 批次編輯 PAY 的 issue，而且額外給的權限最少？","zo":["在 PAY 的 permission scheme 裡，把 Developers project role 加到 Make bulk changes 項目。","把 Rahul 加進 PAY 的 Administrators project role（這個 role 有 Administer Projects）。","把 Rahul 放進一個新群組，再把 Make bulk changes 這個 global permission 授給該群組。","在 PAY 的 permission scheme 裡，直接把 Edit Issues 權限單獨授給 Rahul 這個使用者。"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 322\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Global permissions and PAY permission scheme\"><rect x=\"0.5\" y=\"0.5\" width=\"379\" height=\"321\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"380\" height=\"34\" rx=\"0\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Settings</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Permissions overview</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Global permissions</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"119\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"119\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Administer Jira</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">jira-admins</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"145\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"145\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"137\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Share dashboards and filters</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"137\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">jira-users</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"171\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"171\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"163\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Manage group filter subscriptions</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"163\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">jira-admins</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"197\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"197\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"189\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Make bulk changes</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"189\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">jira-admins</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"218\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">PAY permission scheme</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"248\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"248\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"240\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Browse Projects</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"240\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Developers (role)</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"274\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"274\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"266\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Edit Issues</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"266\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Developers (role)</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"300\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"300\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"292\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Administer Projects</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"292\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Administrators (role)</text></svg>","opts":["Add the Developers project role to a Make bulk changes entry in the PAY permission scheme.","Add Rahul to the Administrators project role in PAY, which holds Administer Projects.","Put Rahul in a new group and grant that group the Make bulk changes global permission.","Grant Rahul the Edit Issues permission directly as a single user in the PAY permission scheme."],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。常見誤解：以為 Make bulk changes 是 project 權限。它其實是 global 權限，permission scheme 裡根本沒有這一項可以加。","B":"錯。Administrators role 給的是 Administer Projects 等專案管理權，和 Make bulk changes 這個 global 權限無關，而且給得太多。","C":"對。Make bulk changes 是 global 權限，只能在 Global permissions 授給群組。Rahul 已有 PAY 的 Edit Issues，補上這個 global 權限就能批次編輯，也不會讓所有 jira-users 都拿到。","D":"錯。圖上 Developers role 已經有 Edit Issues，Rahul 本來就能逐張編輯；缺的是 global 的 Make bulk changes，再給一次 Edit Issues 沒有用。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>考試寫 issue、project；現行 UI 改叫 work item、space，權限名稱也跟著改成 Edit work items、Schedule work items 等。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/what-are-global-permissions-and-what-do-they-do/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/edit-multiple-issues-at-the-same-time/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.4.1-e02","sec":"620.4.1","dom":"620.4","type":"multi","n":3,"stem":"Yuki, a team lead at Lynxwave, needs to set the same Due Date on 60 issues in project LYNX in one operation. Which three permissions must she have? (Choose three.)","zh":"Yuki 是 Lynxwave 的 team lead，她要一次把 project LYNX 裡 60 張 issue 的 Due Date 設成同一天。她必須具備哪三個權限？（選三個。）","zo":["Make bulk changes 這個 global permission","在 LYNX 的 permission scheme 裡，授給她所屬 role 的 Make bulk changes","project LYNX 的 Edit Issues","project LYNX 的 Administer Projects","project LYNX 的 Assign Issues","project LYNX 的 Schedule Issues"],"fig":"","opts":["The Make bulk changes global permission","Make bulk changes, granted to her role in the LYNX permission scheme","Edit Issues in project LYNX","Administer Projects in project LYNX","Assign Issues in project LYNX","Schedule Issues in project LYNX"],"ans":"ACF","why":{"A":"對。任何 bulk 操作都要先有 global 的 Make bulk changes；它只負責「能不能批次操作」，實際能改哪些欄位還要看每個 project 的權限。","B":"錯。常見誤解：以為 Make bulk changes 是 project 權限。它只存在於 Global permissions，permission scheme 裡沒有這一項。","C":"對。官方表格列出批次修改 Due Date 的條件之一，是對所有選到的 issue 都有 Edit Issues 權限，而且 Due Date 欄位沒被隱藏。","D":"錯。Administer Projects 是管理 project 設定用的權限，不是批次修改 Due Date 的條件，給了也不能取代 Edit Issues。","E":"錯。Assign Issues 是批次修改 Assignee 時官方要求的權限，用來指派負責人；這題只改 Due Date，不需要它。","F":"對。Due Date 屬於排程欄位，官方表格另外要求對所有選到的 issue 都有 Schedule Issues 權限，只有 Edit Issues 還不夠。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>考試寫 issue、project；現行 UI 改叫 work item、space，權限名稱也跟著改成 Edit work items、Schedule work items 等。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/edit-multiple-issues-at-the-same-time/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/what-are-global-permissions-and-what-do-they-do/"],"lvl":3,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.4.1-e03","sec":"620.4.1","dom":"620.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. Ivan has the Make bulk changes global permission and Edit Issues in both NOVA and HALO. Both projects have components, and the Component/s field is not hidden in either project. He selects all five issues for a bulk edit, but Change Component/s is not offered. What is the most likely cause?","zh":"Refer to the exhibit.（請看附圖。）Ivan 有 Make bulk changes 這個 global permission，在 NOVA 和 HALO 兩個 project 都有 Edit Issues，兩個 project 都有設定 components，Component/s 欄位在兩邊也都沒有被隱藏。他把五張 issue 全部選起來做 bulk edit，卻沒看到 Change Component/s 這個選項。最可能的原因是什麼？","zo":["批次修改 components 還需要 Administer Projects 權限。","Components 只能用 bulk move 修改，不能用 bulk edit。","Components 和 Resolution 一樣，只能在 bulk transition 時設定。","選到的 issue 分屬不只一個 project。"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 198\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Issues selected for bulk edit\"><rect x=\"10\" y=\"8\" width=\"300\" height=\"182\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx plain\"/><text x=\"20\" y=\"28\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\">Selected for bulk edit (5)</text><rect x=\"16\" y=\"39\" width=\"288\" height=\"22\" rx=\"5\" class=\"sf-gray\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Key</text><text x=\"92\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Type</text><text x=\"150\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Status</text><text x=\"296\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Component</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"62\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"62\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">NOVA-12</text><text x=\"92\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Bug</text><text x=\"150\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">To Do</text><text x=\"296\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"t\">API</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"86\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"86\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">NOVA-15</text><text x=\"92\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Story</text><text x=\"150\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">To Do</text><text x=\"296\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"t\">Web</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"110\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"126\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">NOVA-19</text><text x=\"92\" y=\"126\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Bug</text><text x=\"150\" y=\"126\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">In Progress</text><text x=\"296\" y=\"126\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"t\">API</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"134\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"134\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"150\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">HALO-3</text><text x=\"92\" y=\"150\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Task</text><text x=\"150\" y=\"150\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">To Do</text><text x=\"296\" y=\"150\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"t\">Mobile</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"158\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"158\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"174\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">HALO-8</text><text x=\"92\" y=\"174\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Bug</text><text x=\"150\" y=\"174\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">To Do</text><text x=\"296\" y=\"174\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"t\">Mobile</text></svg>","opts":["Changing components in bulk also requires the Administer Projects permission.","Components can only be changed with a bulk move, not a bulk edit.","Components can only be set during a bulk transition, like Resolution.","The selected issues belong to more than one project."],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。批次改 Component/s 的官方條件是 Edit Issues、欄位沒隱藏、issue 同屬一個 project，不需要 Administer Projects。","B":"錯。Bulk move 是把 issue 搬到別的 project 或 issue type 用的；在同一個 project 內改 components 本來就用 bulk edit。","C":"錯。官方只點名 Resolution 要改走 bulk transition；Component/s 仍是 bulk edit 可以改的欄位，只是有同一個 project 的限制。","D":"對。常見誤解：以為有 Make bulk changes 加 Edit Issues 就夠了。Components 屬於各 project，官方要求選到的 issue 都在同一個 project；圖上混了 NOVA 和 HALO，所以這個選項不會出現。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/edit-multiple-issues-at-the-same-time/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.4.1-e04","sec":"620.4.1","dom":"620.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Leena manages project KITE at Kestrel Air. She wants the people in KITE's Developers project role to receive the results of her saved filter \"KITE open bugs\" by email every Monday. The same people are members of the kite-devs group, and Leena also belongs to that group. What should she do?","zh":"Leena 管理 Kestrel Air 的 project KITE。她希望 KITE 的 Developers project role 裡的人，每週一都能用 email 收到她存好的 filter「KITE open bugs」的結果。這些人同時也是 kite-devs 群組的成員，Leena 自己也在這個群組裡。她該怎麼做？","zo":["把訂閱寄給 kite-devs 群組；這需要 Manage group filter subscriptions 這個 global permission。","建立新的 filter subscription，在 Recipients 欄位選 KITE 的 Developers project role。","把 filter 分享給 Developers project role，讓這個 role 的每位成員每週用 email 收到結果。","在 KITE 的 notification scheme 裡，把 Developers project role 加為 Issue Updated 事件的收件對象。"],"fig":"","opts":["Subscribe the kite-devs group, which requires the Manage group filter subscriptions global permission.","Create a new filter subscription and choose KITE's Developers project role in the Recipients field.","Share the filter with the Developers project role so that every member of the role is emailed the results weekly.","Add the Developers project role as a recipient of the Issue Updated event in KITE's notification scheme."],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。訂閱的收件人只能是自己或自己所屬的群組；kite-devs 成員和 Developers role 相同，Leena 也在群組裡。要訂給群組，還得有 Manage group filter subscriptions 這個 global 權限。","B":"錯。常見誤解：以為訂閱可以選 project role。官方只提供「自己」或「自己所屬的群組」兩種收件人，選不到 project role。","C":"錯。Filter 確實可以分享給 project role，但分享只是讓對方看得到、能執行這個 filter，不會定期寄 email。","D":"錯。Notification scheme 是在某張 issue 發生事件時逐張通知，不會每週一寄出整份 filter 結果清單。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/manage-filters/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/what-are-global-permissions-and-what-do-they-do/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.4.1-e05","sec":"620.4.1","dom":"620.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Chidi is preparing a short training on filter subscriptions for the service desk leads at Harbourline. Which statement about filter subscriptions is NOT true?","zh":"Chidi 正在為 Harbourline 的 service desk lead 準備一堂 filter subscription 的簡短教學。下列關於 filter subscription 的敘述，哪一個<b>不</b>正確？","zo":["每位收件人收到的結果都依他自己的權限計算；查詢裡用了 <code>currentUser()</code> 時，會以每位收件人的身分執行。","只要 filter 有分享給某個 project role（例如 Developers），就可以把訂閱寄給這個 role。","訂閱 email 只會包含 filter 回傳的前 200 張 issue。","排程選 Advanced 時，寄送頻率要用 cron expression 設定。"],"fig":"","opts":["Each recipient receives results evaluated with that recipient's own permissions, so a query that uses <code>currentUser()</code> is run as each recipient.","A subscription can be sent to a project role, such as Developers, as long as the filter is shared with that role.","Only the first 200 issues returned by the filter are included in a subscription email.","With the Advanced schedule option, the sending interval is defined with a cron expression."],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"正確敘述（不選）。官方說明寄出的結果會依每位收件人分別計算，查詢用了 <code>currentUser()</code> 時會把收件人當成目前使用者。","B":"錯誤敘述（要選）。常見誤解：以為訂閱能訂給 project role。收件人只能選自己或自己所屬的群組；把 filter 分享給 role 只讓對方看得到，不代表能訂閱給 role。","C":"正確敘述（不選）。官方明確寫出訂閱 email 只會送出 filter 的前 200 筆結果，結果更多時要自己縮小查詢範圍。","D":"正確敘述（不選）。排程選 Advanced 時，要用 cron expression 指定寄送頻率，例如每月第二個星期五早上 8:15。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/manage-filters/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.4.1-e06","sec":"620.4.1","dom":"620.4","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. Jomo has the Manage group filter subscriptions global permission and is a member of the mobile-team and qa-guild groups. He wants the \"ORCA release blockers\" filter emailed to the Developers project role of ORCA and to the platform-eng group, but neither appears in the Recipients list. Which two statements explain this? (Choose two.)","zh":"Refer to the exhibit.（請看附圖。）Jomo 有 Manage group filter subscriptions 這個 global permission，也是 mobile-team 和 qa-guild 兩個群組的成員。他想把「ORCA release blockers」這個 filter 寄給 ORCA 的 Developers project role 和 platform-eng 群組，但這兩個都沒出現在 Recipients 清單裡。哪兩個敘述可以解釋這個狀況？（選兩個。）","zo":["這個 filter 回傳超過 200 張 issue，所以不能選群組當收件人。","Project role 不能被選為 filter subscription 的收件人。","只有 Advanced 排程才能選群組當收件人。","Jomo 沒有 Share dashboards and filters 這個 global permission。","Jomo 不是 platform-eng 群組的成員。"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 298\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"New filter subscription dialog\"><rect x=\"0.5\" y=\"0.5\" width=\"379\" height=\"297\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"380\" height=\"34\" rx=\"0\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Filters</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Subscribe: ORCA release blockers</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Recipients (options)</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"119\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"119\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Personal subscription</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Jomo</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"145\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"145\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"137\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Group</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"137\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">mobile-team</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"171\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"171\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"163\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Group</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"163\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">qa-guild</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"192\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Schedule</text><circle cx=\"19\" cy=\"205\" r=\"7\" class=\"bx\"/><circle cx=\"19\" cy=\"205\" r=\"3.5\" class=\"fl-brand\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"209\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Default schedule: Mon 08:00</text><circle cx=\"19\" cy=\"226\" r=\"7\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"230\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Advanced (cron expression)</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"248\" width=\"83.5\" height=\"26\" rx=\"6\" class=\"fl-brand\"/><text x=\"53.75\" y=\"265\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"w\">Subscribe</text></svg>","opts":["The filter returns more than 200 issues, so group recipients are disabled.","Project roles cannot be selected as recipients of a filter subscription.","Group recipients are available only with the Advanced schedule.","Jomo lacks the Share dashboards and filters global permission.","Jomo is not a member of the platform-eng group."],"ans":"BE","why":{"A":"錯。200 筆是訂閱 email 內容的上限，超過只是後面的不寄，和收件人清單能不能選群組無關。","B":"對。常見誤解：以為訂閱能給 project role。官方收件人只有「自己」或「群組」兩種，所以 Developers role 永遠不會出現在清單裡。","C":"錯。排程（預設排程或 Advanced 的 cron expression）只決定寄送頻率；圖上選的是一般排程，清單照樣列出 mobile-team 和 qa-guild，可見和能不能選群組無關。","D":"錯。Share dashboards and filters 管的是能不能把 filter 分享出去；要訂給群組，看的是 Manage group filter subscriptions，他已經有了。","E":"對。官方規定只能選自己所屬的群組當收件人。Jomo 只在 mobile-team 和 qa-guild，所以清單裡看不到 platform-eng；就算有 Manage group filter subscriptions 也一樣。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/manage-filters/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/what-are-global-permissions-and-what-do-they-do/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.4.1-e07","sec":"620.4.1","dom":"620.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Noura, a Jira administrator at Saltmarsh Foods, opens the permission scheme used by project CRAB so she can grant Make bulk changes to the Developers role. She cannot find that permission anywhere in the scheme. What explains this?","zh":"Noura 是 Saltmarsh Foods 的 Jira administrator，她打開 project CRAB 使用的 permission scheme，想把 Make bulk changes 授給 Developers role，卻在整個 scheme 裡都找不到這個權限。原因是什麼？","zo":["這個 scheme 被好幾個 project 共用，必須先複製一份，Make bulk changes 才會出現。","Make bulk changes 是在 project 的 Access 頁面管理，而且只有 team-managed project 有。","它是授給群組的 global permission；每一種批次動作，還需要 CRAB 對應的 project 權限。","Administrators project role 裡的每個人都會自動繼承它，無法單獨授予。"],"fig":"","opts":["The scheme is shared by several projects, so she must copy it before Make bulk changes becomes visible.","Make bulk changes is managed on the project's Access page and is available only in team-managed projects.","It is a global permission granted to groups; each bulk action also needs the matching CRAB project permissions.","It is inherited automatically by everyone in the Administrators project role and cannot be granted on its own."],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。Permission scheme 被幾個 project 共用，只影響修改的波及範圍，不會把某個權限藏起來；複製一份也找不到這一項。","B":"錯。Team-managed project 的 Access 頁面管的是角色和存取，不是 Make bulk changes；它在任何類型的 project 都不是 project 層級設定。","C":"對。常見誤解：以為 Make bulk changes 是 project 權限。它是 global 權限，要到 Global permissions 授給群組；真正執行時，還要有每個 project 對應的權限，例如 Edit Issues。","D":"錯。Administrators project role 只帶 project 層級的權限，不會自動附帶任何 global 權限，Make bulk changes 也不例外。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/what-are-global-permissions-and-what-do-they-do/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/edit-multiple-issues-at-the-same-time/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.4.1-e08","sec":"620.4.1","dom":"620.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"At Brightpath Studio, every time a story in project ARC is transitioned to Done, all of its open sub-tasks must also be transitioned to Done automatically. No one should have to take any manual action. Which approach meets this requirement?","zh":"在 Brightpath Studio，project ARC 的 story 每次被轉到 Done，它底下所有未完成的 sub-task 也都要自動轉成 Done，不需要任何人手動操作。哪一種做法符合需求？","zo":["每次 story 關閉時，請一位組員對 sub-task 執行 bulk transition。","建立一個 filter subscription，每天早上寄出「Done story 底下還沒完成的 sub-task」清單。","在 story 的 Done transition 加上 Copy Value From Other Field post function。","在 story 的 Done transition 加上 Sub-Task Blocking Condition。","建立一條 automation rule：Issue transitioned trigger、sub-task 的 branch、Transition issue action。"],"fig":"","opts":["Ask a team member to run a bulk transition on the sub-tasks whenever a story is closed.","Create a filter subscription that emails the list of open sub-tasks under Done stories every morning.","Add the Copy Value From Other Field post function to the story's Done transition.","Add the Sub-Task Blocking Condition to the story's Done transition.","Create an automation rule: Issue transitioned trigger, sub-tasks branch, Transition issue action."],"ans":"E","why":{"A":"錯。Bulk transition 確實能一次轉好幾張 sub-task，但每次都要有人手動操作，不符合「不需要任何人動手」。","B":"錯。Filter subscription 只會定期寄出清單通知，不會修改任何 issue，sub-task 還是維持原本狀態。","C":"錯。Copy Value From Other Field 會把欄位值複製到正在 transition 的這張 issue，來源可以是同一張或它的 parent；它只改欄位，不會幫任何 sub-task 做 transition。","D":"錯。Sub-Task Blocking Condition 的作用剛好相反：sub-task 沒完成時先擋住 parent 的 transition，不會去關 sub-task。","E":"對。Issue transitioned trigger 監聽 story 轉到 Done，branch 讓後面的動作套用到每一張 sub-task，再用 Transition issue action 把它們轉成 Done，全程不用人工。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>考試寫 automation rule、Issue transitioned trigger、Transition issue action；現行官方文件分別叫 automation flow、Work item transitioned trigger、Transition work item action，rule actor 也改叫 flow actor，功能相同。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/branch-automation-rules-to-perform-actions-on-related-issues/","https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/jira-automation-triggers/","https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/jira-automation-actions/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-advanced-issue-workflows/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.4.1-e09","sec":"620.4.1","dom":"620.4","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Hana has the Administer Projects and Browse Projects permissions in TERRA, a company-managed project at Greenfield Energy. She is planning her first automation rule. Which two statements are true? (Choose two.)","zh":"Hana 在 Greenfield Energy 的 company-managed project TERRA 有 Administer Projects 和 Browse Projects 權限，她正在規劃自己的第一條 automation rule。哪兩個敘述正確？（選兩個。）","zo":["預設情況下，Hana 可以建立並管理 scope 為 TERRA 的 automation rule。","只要 Hana 也是 OCEAN 的管理員，TERRA 的 rule 就能在 project OCEAN 的 linked issue 上留言。","Issue history 會把每次變更顯示為 Hana 做的，因為 rule 是她建立的。","如果 rule 對四張 sub-task 做 branch，這些 branch 會依序執行，所以每個 branch 都能用到前一個 branch 的變更。","預設情況下，rule 做的變更在 issue history 裡會記成 Automation for Jira 做的。"],"fig":"","opts":["By default, Hana can create and manage automation rules scoped to TERRA.","A TERRA rule can comment on linked issues in project OCEAN as long as Hana is also an administrator of OCEAN.","The issue history will show Hana as the person who made each change, because she created the rule.","If the rule branches over four sub-tasks, the branches run one after another, so each branch can use the changes made by the previous one.","By default, changes made by the rule are recorded in the issue history as made by Automation for Jira."],"ans":"AE","why":{"A":"對。官方說明 company-managed project 裡同時有 Administer Projects 和 Browse Projects 的人，預設就能為自己的 project 建立與管理 automation rule，除非 global admin 關掉這個能力。","B":"錯。Scope 決定 rule 能在哪裡做變更；要對其他 project 的 issue 動作，scope 必須是 multiple projects 或 global。單一 project 的 rule 做不到，與 Hana 是不是 OCEAN 的管理員無關。現行文件叫 Single space scope。","C":"錯。在 Jira automation 裡，rule 做的變更預設記在 rule actor 名下，而預設 actor 是 Automation for Jira，不是建立 rule 的人。","D":"錯。官方說明對多張 issue 的 branch 會平行執行，不保證先後，彼此看不到對方的變更，所以不能依賴前一個 branch 的結果。","E":"對。Rule 做的任何變更都算在 rule actor 身上，Jira automation 的預設 actor 是 Automation for Jira，所以 History 會顯示它；有權編輯 rule 的人可以改 actor。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>考試寫 automation rule；現行官方文件改叫 automation flow，rule actor 也改叫 flow actor，功能相同。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/permissions-required-for-jira-cloud-automation-rules/","https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/what-is-a-rule-actor/","https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/branch-automation-rules-to-perform-actions-on-related-issues/","https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/what-are-rule-details-in-atlassian-automation/"],"lvl":3,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.4.1-e10","sec":"620.4.1","dom":"620.4","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. Kwame configured the Close transition in the workflow used by project DOCK. Sione, who can see the Close button, selects it but leaves Fix Version/s empty. Which two statements describe the result? (Choose two.)","zh":"Refer to the exhibit.（請看附圖。）Kwame 設定了 project DOCK 所用 workflow 裡的 Close transition。Sione 看得到 Close 按鈕，他按下去時沒有填 Fix Version/s。哪兩個敘述描述了結果？（選兩個。）","zo":["因為 Fix Version/s 是空的，Close 按鈕本來就不會顯示給 Sione。","Issue 會移到 Closed，並自動加上一則「缺少 Fix Version/s」的留言。","Issue 會停留在目前的狀態。","Resolution 會被設成 Done，但狀態不變。","這個 transition 的 post function 全部都不會執行。"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 373\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Close transition configuration\"><rect x=\"0.5\" y=\"0.5\" width=\"379\" height=\"372\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"380\" height=\"34\" rx=\"0\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Workflow: DOCK Workflow</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Transition: Close</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Conditions</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"119\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"119\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">(none)</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\"></text><text x=\"12\" y=\"140\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Validators</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"170\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"170\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"162\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Field Required</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"162\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Fix Version/s</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"191\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Post functions</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"221\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"221\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"213\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Set status to linked status</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"213\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">essential</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"247\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"247\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"239\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Update Issue Field</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"239\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Resolution = Done</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"273\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"273\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"265\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Add comment if entered</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"265\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">essential</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"299\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"299\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"291\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Update history, store issue</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"291\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">essential</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"325\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"325\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"317\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Reindex issue</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"317\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">essential</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"351\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"351\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"343\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Fire Generic Event</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"343\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">essential</text></svg>","opts":["The Close button was already hidden from Sione because Fix Version/s was empty.","The issue moves to Closed, and a comment is added saying that Fix Version/s is missing.","The issue stays in its current status.","Resolution is set to Done, but the status does not change.","None of the transition's post functions are executed."],"ans":"CE","why":{"A":"錯。把按鈕藏起來是 condition 的行為；圖上設定的是 validator，按鈕照常出現，按下去時才檢查。","B":"錯。Validator 不通過時，issue 根本不會移到目的狀態，也沒有「移過去再補留言」這種結果。","C":"對。Validator 在 transition 執行前檢查輸入；Fix Version/s 必填卻留空，檢查失敗，issue 就不會前進到 Closed，停在原本的狀態。","D":"錯。Update Issue Field 是 post function，要在 transition 成功之後才會跑；transition 被擋下，Resolution 也不會被設定。","E":"對。官方說明 validator 失敗時，issue 不會到目的狀態，這個 transition 的 post function 也全部不會執行，包括圖上設定 Resolution 的那一個。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>考試寫 Update Issue Field、issue；現行官方文件改叫 Update Work Item Field、work item，功能相同。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-advanced-issue-workflows/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.4.1-e11","sec":"620.4.1","dom":"620.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"In project MESA, the Start Review transition has the Assign to Current User post function. When Tariq, a stakeholder who only comments on issues, performs Start Review, the issue changes status but stays assigned to the previous assignee, and no error appears. What is the most likely cause?","zh":"在 project MESA，Start Review 這個 transition 加了 Assign to Current User post function。Tariq 是只負責留言的 stakeholder，他執行 Start Review 後，issue 的狀態變了，但 assignee 還是原本的人，也沒有出現任何錯誤。最可能的原因是什麼？","zo":["Assign to Current User post function 只能用在 workflow 的 Create transition。","Tariq 在 project MESA 沒有 Assignable User 權限。","Tariq 在 project MESA 沒有 Assign Issues 權限。","Post function 只有在 transition 是由 automation rule 觸發時才會執行。"],"fig":"","opts":["The Assign to Current User post function works only on the workflow's Create transition.","Tariq does not have the Assignable User permission in project MESA.","Tariq does not have the Assign Issues permission in project MESA.","Post functions run only when a transition is triggered by an automation rule."],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。這個 post function 可以加在一般 transition 上；只有 Create Comment、Store Issue 等少數項目才限定用在初始 transition。","B":"對。官方說明 Assign to Current User 在執行者沒有 Assignable User 權限時會被直接略過，不會報錯；Tariq 只負責留言，很可能不在 Assignable User 的授權範圍內，所以沒被指派。","C":"錯。常見誤解：把兩個權限混為一談。Assign Issues 管的是能不能修改 Assignee、把 issue 指派給別人；這個 post function 看的是執行者有沒有 Assignable User，也就是能不能被指派。","D":"錯。Post function 會在任何人成功執行 transition 後執行，不論是使用者手動按下還是 automation 觸發。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>考試寫 Assign Issues；現行官方文件改叫 Assign work items，Assignable User 則改叫 Assignable user，意思不變。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-advanced-issue-workflows/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/work-item-permissions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.4.1-e12","sec":"620.4.1","dom":"620.4","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Farah, a Jira administrator at Quillmark, wants to use only Jira's built-in optional workflow post functions, without automation rules or Marketplace apps. Which two requirements can she meet? (Choose two.)","zh":"Farah 是 Quillmark 的 Jira administrator，她只想用 Jira 內建的 optional workflow post function，不用 automation rule 或 Marketplace app。她能滿足哪兩個需求？（選兩個。）","zo":["每週五把 project INK 未解決的 issue 清單寄給 editors 群組。","每當 bug 被轉到 Done 時，把 Resolution 設成 Fixed。","story 被轉到 In Progress 時，把它的 parent epic 也轉成 In Progress。","Sub-task 做 transition 時，把 parent issue 的某個欄位值複製到這張 sub-task。","有人只修改 issue 的 Priority、沒有改變狀態時，通知某個聊天頻道。"],"fig":"","opts":["Email the list of unresolved issues in project INK to the editors group every Friday.","Set Resolution to Fixed whenever a bug is transitioned to Done.","When a story is moved to In Progress, move its parent epic to In Progress as well.","Copy a field value from the parent issue into a sub-task when the sub-task is transitioned.","Notify a chat channel whenever someone edits an issue's Priority without changing its status."],"ans":"BD","why":{"A":"錯。定期寄出清單是 filter subscription 的工作；post function 只在有人執行 transition 時才跑，沒有排程能力。","B":"對。內建的 Update Issue Field post function 可以在 transition 後把 Resolution 設成指定值，這正是官方示範的用法；transition screen 不放 Resolution 欄位，交給 post function 自動填。","C":"錯。Post function 只處理正在 transition 的這一張 issue，不會去轉動 parent epic；要連動 parent，需要 automation rule 的 branch（Parent）。","D":"對。內建的 Copy Value From Other Field post function 可以在同一張 issue 內複製欄位，也可以從 parent 複製到 sub-task，讓 sub-task 沿用 parent 的值，不必手動再填。","E":"錯。只改 Priority、沒有做 transition 時，post function 根本不會觸發；這種情境要用 automation 的 Field value changed trigger。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>考試寫 Update Issue Field、issue；現行官方文件改叫 Update Work Item Field、work item，功能相同。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-advanced-issue-workflows/","https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/jira-automation-triggers/","https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/branch-automation-rules-to-perform-actions-on-related-issues/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.4.2-e01","sec":"620.4.2","dom":"620.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Lars is a project administrator for project NRV at Norveld. He is building a rule that adds a checklist comment whenever an issue is created, but it must run only for Bug and Task issues. In the rule details he looks for a scope that limits the rule to those two issue types. What should he do?","zh":"Lars 是 Norveld 公司 project NRV 的 project administrator。他在做一條 rule：每當 issue 建立時就加一則檢查清單留言，但只能對 Bug 和 Task 執行。他在 rule details 裡找一個能把 rule 限定在這兩種 issue type 的 scope。他該怎麼做？","zo":["請 Jira administrator 把 scope 改成 <b>Multiple issue types</b>，再在 scope 清單裡選 Bug 和 Task","把 scope 改成 <b>Project type</b>，類型選 Bug","保留 <b>Single project</b> scope，加一個 issue type 為 Bug 或 Task 的 <b>Issue fields</b> condition","把 rule 複製成兩份，每份的 scope 各設成一種 issue type"],"fig":"","opts":["Ask a Jira administrator to change the scope to <b>Multiple issue types</b>, then select Bug and Task in the scope list","Change the scope to <b>Project type</b> and choose Bug as the type","Keep the <b>Single project</b> scope and add an <b>Issue fields</b> condition for issue type Bug or Task","Create two copies of the rule and scope each copy to one issue type"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。Automation 沒有「Multiple issue types」這種 scope。常見誤解：以為 scope 能挑 issue type；scope 只有 Single project、Multiple projects、Project type、Global 四種。","B":"錯。Project type 指的是 software、service management、business 這類 project 類型，不是 issue type，所以根本選不到 Bug 這個值。","C":"對。Scope 只決定 rule 在哪些 project 跑；要限定 issue type，就在 trigger 後面加 Issue fields condition。其他 issue type 不符條件，rule 就安靜停下，不算錯誤。","D":"錯。拆成兩條也沒用，因為 scope 本來就不能指定 issue type；每條還是要靠 condition 限定，反而多一條要維護。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>考試版的 scope 是 Single project、Multiple projects、Project type、Global 四種；現行 UI 改叫 Single space、Multi-space、Space type、Global，另外多了給 Operations 團隊用的 team scope，不在考試範圍。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/what-are-rule-details-in-atlassian-automation/","https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/jira-automation-conditions/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.4.2-e02","sec":"620.4.2","dom":"620.4","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. Wen Li, a Jira administrator at Quillcrest, saved the rule details shown. The site has software projects APP and WEB, a business project LGL, and a service management project HELP. A new software project, MOB, will be created next month. Wen Li also wants the rule to act only on Bug issues. Which two statements are true? (Choose two.)","zh":"請看圖。Quillcrest 的 Jira administrator Wen Li 儲存了圖中的 rule details。站上有 software project APP 和 WEB、business project LGL，以及 service management project HELP。下個月會新建一個 software project MOB。Wen Li 也希望這條 rule 只處理 Bug。哪兩個敘述正確？（選兩個）","zo":["這條 rule 也會在 LGL 執行，因為 software 這個 project type 也涵蓋 business project","MOB 建立後，這條 rule 就會在 MOB 執行，不需要任何人修改 rule","這條 rule 也會在 HELP 執行，因為 service management project 是建立在 software 類型上","要把 rule 限定在 Bug，Wen Li 應該加一個 Issue fields condition，而不是改 scope","要等 Wen Li 把 WEB 加進 scope 清單，這條 rule 才會在 WEB 執行"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 348\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Quillcrest global rule details with project type scope\"><rect x=\"0.5\" y=\"0.5\" width=\"379\" height=\"347\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"380\" height=\"34\" rx=\"0\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Global automation</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Rule details</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Name</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"95\" width=\"356\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"113\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Flag stale work older than 14 days</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"144\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Scope</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"150\" width=\"356\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx brand\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"168\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Project type: Software</text><path d=\"M350,161 l5,5 l5,-5\" class=\"ln ink\" style=\"stroke-width:1.6\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"199\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Owner</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"205\" width=\"356\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"223\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Wen Li</text><path d=\"M350,216 l5,5 l5,-5\" class=\"ln ink\" style=\"stroke-width:1.6\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"254\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Actor</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"260\" width=\"356\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"278\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Automation for Jira</text><path d=\"M350,271 l5,5 l5,-5\" class=\"ln ink\" style=\"stroke-width:1.6\"/><rect x=\"12\" y=\"298\" width=\"46.0\" height=\"26\" rx=\"6\" class=\"fl-brand\"/><text x=\"35.0\" y=\"315\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"w\">Save</text></svg>","opts":["The rule also runs in LGL, because the software project type also covers business projects","The rule will run in MOB after it is created, without anyone editing the rule","The rule also runs in HELP, because service management projects are built on the software type","To limit the rule to Bug issues, Wen Li should add an Issue fields condition instead of changing the scope","The rule also runs in WEB only after Wen Li adds WEB to the scope list"],"ans":"BD","why":{"A":"錯。Project type 會把 software、service management、business 分開，選 Software 只涵蓋 software project，business 的 LGL 不在範圍內。","B":"對。Project type scope 會在「某一類型的全部 project」執行。MOB 建好後就是 software project，自動落在範圍內，不必改 rule；Multiple projects 才要手動加。","C":"錯。Service management 是獨立的 project type，和 software、business 分開。Scope 選 Software 時，HELP 不在範圍內，rule 不會在那裡執行。","D":"對。Issue type 不是 scope 的選項，要限定 Bug 得在 rule 裡加 Issue fields condition，不是 Bug 的 issue 就在 condition 停下。常見誤解：想在 scope 裡找 issue type。","E":"錯。Project type scope 會涵蓋該類型的全部 project，WEB 本來就是 software project，不必手動加；要手動挑 project 的是 Multiple projects。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>考試版的 scope 是 Single project、Multiple projects、Project type、Global 四種；現行 UI 改叫 Single space、Multi-space、Space type、Global，另外多了給 Operations 團隊用的 team scope，不在考試範圍。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/what-are-rule-details-in-atlassian-automation/","https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/jira-automation-conditions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.4.2-e03","sec":"620.4.2","dom":"620.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"At Harbinline, Mateus is training new project administrators on automation. He wants to include one incorrect statement about rule scope in a quiz. Which statement about automation rule scope is NOT true?","zh":"Harbinline 的 Mateus 正在訓練新的 project administrator 使用 automation。他想在小考中放一句關於 rule scope 的錯誤敘述。下列關於 automation rule scope 的敘述，哪一個「不」正確？","zo":["Project administrator 可以在 project 的設定裡建立 <b>Single project</b> scope 的 rule","只有具備 <b>Administer Jira</b> global permission 的使用者，才能建立 <b>Multiple projects</b> scope 的 rule","<b>Global</b> scope 的 rule 會在 Jira site 的所有 project 執行","Rule 可以把 scope 設成特定 issue type，讓其他 issue type 被略過"],"fig":"","opts":["A project administrator can create a rule with a <b>Single project</b> scope from the project's settings","Only a user with the <b>Administer Jira</b> global permission can create a rule with a <b>Multiple projects</b> scope","A rule with a <b>Global</b> scope runs across all projects on the Jira site","A rule can be scoped to specific issue types so that other issue types are ignored"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"正確敘述（不選）。Project admin 預設就能在自己 project 的 Project settings → Automation 建立與管理 single project rule。","B":"正確敘述（不選）。官方權限頁說，有 Administer Jira 的人才能建立任何 scope 的 rule，包括 multi-project 與全站 rule。","C":"正確敘述（不選）。Global scope 的意思就是在這個 Jira site 的所有 project 執行，範圍最廣。","D":"錯誤敘述（要選）。Scope 只有 Single project、Multiple projects、Project type、Global，沒有 issue type。常見誤解：把 issue type 當 scope；要限定 issue type 請用 condition。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>考試版的 scope 是 Single project、Multiple projects、Project type、Global 四種；現行 UI 改叫 Single space、Multi-space、Space type、Global，另外多了給 Operations 團隊用的 team scope，不在考試範圍。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/what-are-rule-details-in-atlassian-automation/","https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/permissions-required-for-jira-cloud-automation-rules/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.4.2-e04","sec":"620.4.2","dom":"620.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Oskar is a project administrator for project OPS at Brightfen. His rule runs when an OPS issue transitions to Done. It then branches on linked issues with the <b>blocks</b> link type and transitions each linked issue to Ready. Linked issues in OPS are transitioned correctly, but linked issues in project FAC are never updated. What is the most likely cause?","zh":"Oskar 是 Brightfen 公司 project OPS 的 project administrator。他的 rule 在 OPS 的 issue 轉到 Done 時執行，接著對 link type 為 <b>blocks</b> 的 linked issues 做 branch，把每張 linked issue 轉到 Ready。OPS 裡的 linked issue 都正確轉換，但 project FAC 裡的 linked issue 從來沒有被更新。最可能的原因是什麼？","zo":["這條 rule 的 scope 是 <b>Single project</b>；要處理其他 project 的 issue，必須是 multi-project 或 global rule","Linked issues 的 branch 只會處理找到的第一張 linked issue，後面的都被略過","Linked issues 的 branch 只能處理 sub-task，不能處理用 link type 連起來的 issue","<b>Automation for Jira</b> 這個 actor 不能轉換 issue，所以 actor 必須換成真實的使用者"],"fig":"","opts":["The rule's scope is <b>Single project</b>; acting on issues in another project needs a multi-project or global rule","A linked-issues branch only processes the first linked issue it finds, so later issues are skipped","The linked-issues branch can only act on sub-tasks, not on issues connected by a link type","The <b>Automation for Jira</b> actor is not allowed to transition issues, so the actor must be changed to a real user"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。官方說 rule 要處理另一個 project 的 issue，必須是 multi-project 或 global rule。Oskar 在 OPS 建的是 single project rule，碰不到 FAC；要請 Jira admin 改 scope。","B":"錯。Branch 會對每一張相關 issue 各跑一次（平行執行），不是只處理第一張；而且 OPS 裡的 linked issue 都有被處理。","C":"錯。Linked issues 本來就是 branch 可選的對象之一，和 sub-tasks 分開；OPS 裡的 linked issue 都成功轉換也證明它能用。","D":"錯。Automation for Jira 是預設 actor，能轉換 issue；OPS 的 issue 都成功轉換了，問題不在 actor，而在 scope 碰不到 FAC。"},"note":"現行 UI 把 issue 改叫 work item、project 改叫 space，官方頁寫的是「multi-project or global flow」。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/branch-automation-rules-to-perform-actions-on-related-issues/","https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/what-are-rule-details-in-atlassian-automation/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.4.2-e05","sec":"620.4.2","dom":"620.4","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Chiamaka is a Jira administrator at Veltrix. She needs two rules. Rule 1 must run in every software project, including software projects created in the future, but not in business or service management projects. Rule 2 must run only in the business projects HR, FIN, and LEG, and not in any other business project. Which two scope choices meet these requirements? (Choose two.)","zh":"Chiamaka 是 Veltrix 的 Jira administrator，她需要兩條 rule。Rule 1 必須在每個 software project 執行，包括未來新建的 software project，但不能在 business 或 service management project 執行。Rule 2 只能在 business project HR、FIN、LEG 執行，不能在其他 business project 執行。哪兩個 scope 選擇符合需求？（選兩個）","zo":["Rule 1：<b>Project type</b> scope，設為 software","Rule 1：<b>Global</b> scope","Rule 2：<b>Project type</b> scope，設為 business","Rule 2：在 HR 用 <b>Single project</b> scope，再加一個檢查 issue type 的 condition","Rule 2：<b>Multiple projects</b> scope，選 HR、FIN、LEG"],"fig":"","opts":["Rule 1: <b>Project type</b> scope set to software","Rule 1: <b>Global</b> scope","Rule 2: <b>Project type</b> scope set to business","Rule 2: <b>Single project</b> scope in HR with a condition that checks the issue type","Rule 2: <b>Multiple projects</b> scope with HR, FIN, and LEG selected"],"ans":"AE","why":{"A":"對。Project type scope 會在某一類型的全部 project 執行，之後新建的 software project 也包含在內，而且不會碰到 business 和 service management project。","B":"錯。Global 會在站上所有 project 執行，連 business 與 service management project 都包含，違反 Rule 1 的限制。","C":"錯。Project type 選 business 會涵蓋所有 business project，不只 HR、FIN、LEG，違反 Rule 2 的限制。","D":"錯。Single project 只在 HR 一個 project 執行，FIN 與 LEG 不在範圍內；issue type condition 也改變不了 scope 的範圍。","E":"對。Multiple projects scope 讓 Jira admin 自己挑選幾個 project，正好只涵蓋 HR、FIN、LEG，其他 business project 不受影響。之後若要加 project，得手動編輯 rule。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>考試版的 scope 是 Single project、Multiple projects、Project type、Global 四種；現行 UI 改叫 Single space、Multi-space、Space type、Global，另外多了給 Operations 團隊用的 team scope，不在考試範圍。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/what-are-rule-details-in-atlassian-automation/","https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/permissions-required-for-jira-cloud-automation-rules/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.4.2-e06","sec":"620.4.2","dom":"620.4","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Farid, a Jira administrator at Solmara, must make sure that every Epic created in any project on the site gets a default Due date. Other issue types must not be changed. Which two steps meet this requirement with the least effort? (Choose two.)","zh":"Solmara 的 Jira administrator Farid 必須確保站上任何 project 建立的每一張 Epic 都會自動帶一個預設的 Due date，其他 issue type 不能被修改。哪兩個步驟能以最少工夫達成需求？（選兩個）","zo":["把 rule 的 scope 設成 <b>Multiple projects</b>，並勾選目前所有的 project","把 rule 的 scope 設成 <b>Project type</b>，並選 Epic","把 rule 的 scope 設成 <b>Global</b>","請每位 project administrator 在自己的 project 用 <b>Single project</b> scope 建立同樣的 rule","在 <b>Issue created</b> trigger 後面加一個 <b>Issue fields</b> condition，檢查 issue type 是 Epic"],"fig":"","opts":["Set the rule scope to <b>Multiple projects</b> and select every project that exists today","Set the rule scope to <b>Project type</b> and choose Epic","Set the rule scope to <b>Global</b>","Ask each project administrator to build the same rule in their own project with a <b>Single project</b> scope","Add an <b>Issue fields</b> condition after the <b>Issue created</b> trigger that checks the issue type is Epic"],"ans":"CE","why":{"A":"錯。Multiple projects 只涵蓋手動勾選的 project，之後新建的 project 會漏掉，還得一直回來加；而且 scope 只管 project 範圍，限定 Epic 仍要靠 condition。","B":"錯。Project type 的選項是 software、service management、business 這類 project 類型，Epic 是 issue type，不能當成 project type。","C":"對。需求是「站上任何 project」，Global scope 會在所有 project 執行，只要一條 rule；建立 global rule 需要 Jira admin，Farid 正好是。","D":"錯。每個 project 各建一條技術上做得到，但要維護幾十條一樣的 rule，不是最省力；新 project 還會漏掉。","E":"對。Issue type 要用 condition 限定：Issue created 後面接 Issue fields condition，只有 Epic 才會往下執行 Edit issue，其他 issue type 會在 condition 安靜停下，欄位不會被改。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>考試版的 scope 是 Single project、Multiple projects、Project type、Global 四種；現行 UI 改叫 Single space、Multi-space、Space type、Global，另外多了給 Operations 團隊用的 team scope，不在考試範圍。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/what-are-rule-details-in-atlassian-automation/","https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/jira-automation-conditions/","https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/permissions-required-for-jira-cloud-automation-rules/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.4.2-e07","sec":"620.4.2","dom":"620.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Keala is a Jira administrator at Cobaltia, which has 30 projects. Six of them are team-managed projects: some are software projects and some are business projects. She wants one rule that runs only in those six team-managed projects. Which scope should she choose?","zh":"Keala 是 Cobaltia 的 Jira administrator，公司有 30 個 project，其中六個是 team-managed project，有些是 software project、有些是 business project。她想要一條只在這六個 team-managed project 執行的 rule。她該選哪個 scope？","zo":["<b>Project type</b>，類型選 Team-managed","<b>Multiple projects</b>，勾選這六個 team-managed project","<b>Project type</b> 設為 Software，因為每個 team-managed project 都是 software 類型","<b>Global</b>，因為 global rule 預設會略過 company-managed project"],"fig":"","opts":["<b>Project type</b>, and select Team-managed as the type","<b>Multiple projects</b>, and select the six team-managed projects","<b>Project type</b> set to Software, because every team-managed project uses the software type","<b>Global</b>, because global rules skip company-managed projects by default"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。Project type 的選項是 software、service management、business，不是 team-managed／company-managed。常見誤解：把「管理方式」當成 project type。","B":"對。Multiple projects 讓 Jira admin 自己勾選要涵蓋的 project，正好只選那六個。Scope 只有四種，沒有依 team-managed 或 company-managed 分的選項。","C":"錯。Team-managed 只是管理方式，software 與 business 都能是 team-managed；選 Software 會漏掉 team-managed 的 business project，還會包含 company-managed 的 software project。","D":"錯。Global scope 會在站上所有 project 執行，不會自動略過 company-managed project，其餘 24 個 project 也會被套用，範圍太大。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>考試版的 scope 是 Single project、Multiple projects、Project type、Global 四種；現行 UI 改叫 Single space、Multi-space、Space type、Global，另外多了給 Operations 團隊用的 team scope，不在考試範圍。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/what-are-rule-details-in-atlassian-automation/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.4.2-e08","sec":"620.4.2","dom":"620.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Signe, a project administrator, builds a rule for project TDL. Inside a <b>For sub-tasks</b> branch, she adds a <b>Create variable</b> action named <code>openWork</code>. After the branch, in the main part of the rule, a <b>Comment on issue</b> action uses <code>{{openWork}}</code>. The rule succeeds, but the comment always shows an empty value. What is the reason?","zh":"Project administrator Signe 為 project TDL 建一條 rule。她在 <b>For sub-tasks</b> branch 裡加了一個名為 <code>openWork</code> 的 <b>Create variable</b> action。Branch 之後，在 rule 的主流程裡，有一個 <b>Comment on issue</b> action 使用 <code>{{openWork}}</code>。Rule 執行成功，但留言中的值永遠是空白。原因是什麼？","zo":["多張 sub-task 的 branch 一張接一張執行，所以最後一張 sub-task 總是用空值覆寫變數","Create variable action 只接受數字，所以文字值會被丟掉","Comment on issue action 的留言內容不支援 smart value","在 branch 裡做的變更（包括建立的變數）主流程看不到"],"fig":"","opts":["Branches over several sub-tasks run one after another, so the last sub-task always overwrites the variable with an empty value","The Create variable action only accepts numbers, so any text value is discarded","The Comment on issue action does not support smart values in its comment text","Changes made inside a branch, including created variables, are not visible to the main branch"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。多張 sub-task 的 branch 是平行執行、不保證順序，不是一張接一張；而且問題不在覆寫，是主流程根本讀不到。","B":"錯。官方說 Create variable 一律回傳字串，文字當然可以；它也支援 smart value 與數學運算。","C":"錯。Comment on issue 的留言內容可以用 smart value，例如 {{issue.key}}；空白的原因在變數的可見範圍。","D":"對。官方說 branch 彼此隔離：在 branch 裡用 Create variable 建的 smart value，只能在同一個 branch 用，主流程和其他 branch 都讀不到。"},"note":"現行 UI 叫 Comment on work item、For sub-tasks 的 branch 在現行文件統稱 related work items branch。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/branch-automation-rules-to-perform-actions-on-related-issues/","https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/jira-automation-actions/"],"lvl":3,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.4.2-e09","sec":"620.4.2","dom":"620.4","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Maximilian, a project administrator at Tarnwick, is designing a rule that branches over the sub-tasks of a story. Which two statements about branches are true? (Choose two.)","zh":"Tarnwick 的 project administrator Maximilian 正在設計一條 rule，要對一張 story 的所有 sub-task 做 branch。關於 branch，哪兩個敘述正確？（選兩個）","zo":["Branch 不能放在另一個 branch 裡面","有四張 sub-task 時，branch 會依 rank 順序一張接一張處理","在 sub-task 的 branch 裡，<code>{{issue}}</code> 仍然指觸發 rule 的那張 story","Branch 裡不能使用 <b>If/else block</b> condition","Rule 的主流程會等所有 sub-task 的 branch 都做完才繼續往下"],"fig":"","opts":["A branch cannot be placed inside another branch","When there are four sub-tasks, the branch processes them one after another in rank order","Inside the sub-task branch, <code>{{issue}}</code> still refers to the story that triggered the rule","The <b>If/else block</b> condition cannot be used inside a branch","The main part of the rule waits until every sub-task branch has finished before it continues"],"ans":"AD","why":{"A":"對。官方的 branching restrictions 寫明 branch 不能巢狀，不能在 branch 裡再開 branch；要處理更深一層的關係得換個設計。","B":"錯。多張 issue 的 branch 是平行執行，不保證誰先做完，所以不能依賴 branch 之間的先後順序。","C":"錯。進了 branch，{{issue}} 指的是目前處理的那張相關 issue（這裡是 sub-task）；要取觸發的 story 要用 {{triggerIssue}}。","D":"對。官方說 branch 不支援 If/else block condition。常見誤解：以為主流程能用的 condition 在 branch 裡都能用；一般 condition 可以，If/else block 不行。","E":"錯。官方說多張 issue 的 branch 會另開一個 process 執行，主流程會先繼續往下跑，不會等 branch 做完。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/branch-automation-rules-to-perform-actions-on-related-issues/"],"lvl":3,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.4.2-e10","sec":"620.4.2","dom":"620.4","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Ana is a project administrator for project QLT at Ferrovane. She wants a rule to notify the team lead when the <b>Priority</b> field or the custom field <b>Severity</b> changes while someone edits an issue, but not when these values are first set during issue creation. She plans to use the <b>Field value changed</b> trigger. Which two statements about this trigger are true? (Choose two.)","zh":"Ana 是 Ferrovane 公司 project QLT 的 project administrator。她想要一條 rule：有人編輯 issue 時，只要 <b>Priority</b> 欄位或 custom field <b>Severity</b> 改變，就通知 team lead；但 issue 建立時第一次填入這些值，不要觸發。她打算用 <b>Field value changed</b> trigger。關於這個 trigger，哪兩個敘述正確？（選兩個）","zo":["它只支援 system field，所以 Severity 這個 custom field 要另外建一條使用 Issue updated trigger 的 rule","它可以同時監看多個欄位，也可以用 regular expression 比對欄位名稱","它可以限定特定的 issue 操作（例如 edit），因此建立時的變更會被略過","它只在 issue 從一個 status 轉到另一個 status 時執行","它需要一段 JQL query 來列出要監看的欄位"],"fig":"","opts":["It supports system fields only, so the Severity custom field needs a separate rule that uses the Issue updated trigger","It can monitor more than one field, and field names can also be matched with a regular expression","It can be limited to specific issue operations, such as edit, so changes made during creation are ignored","It runs only when the issue is transitioned from one status to another","It requires a JQL query that lists the fields to monitor"],"ans":"BC","why":{"A":"錯。官方說 Field value changed 支援所有 system field 與 custom field，Severity 這種 custom field 也能直接監看。","B":"對。設定時可以選要監看哪些欄位，也可以用 regex 比對欄位名稱，所以 Priority 和 Severity 可以放在同一個 trigger 裡。","C":"對。這個 trigger 可以把觸發來源限定在 create、edit、transition、assign 其中幾種；只選 edit，建立時設定的值就不會觸發。","D":"錯。那是 Issue transitioned trigger 的行為；Field value changed 看的是欄位值有沒有改變，不限於轉換狀態。","E":"錯。要監看的欄位是在 trigger 設定裡直接挑選或用 regex 比對，不需要寫 JQL。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/jira-automation-triggers/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.4.2-e11","sec":"620.4.2","dom":"620.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Dmitri, a Jira administrator at Orchidline, builds a global rule and sets its actor to the user <b>ops.bot</b>, who does not have the Browse Projects permission in project SEC. The rule has a JQL condition <code>labels = urgent</code>. When Dmitri selects <b>Validate query</b>, SEC issues appear in the results. However, when the rule runs, SEC issues labeled urgent never pass the condition. What is the most likely cause?","zh":"Orchidline 的 Jira administrator Dmitri 建了一條 global rule，把 actor 設成使用者 <b>ops.bot</b>；ops.bot 在 project SEC 沒有 Browse Projects permission。這條 rule 有一個 JQL condition <code>labels = urgent</code>。Dmitri 按下 <b>Validate query</b> 時，結果裡有 SEC 的 issue；但 rule 實際執行時，SEC 裡標了 urgent 的 issue 從來沒有通過這個 condition。最可能的原因是什麼？","zo":["JQL condition 不能搜尋 Labels 欄位，這段 query 只在 issue navigator 有效","Validate query 只檢查語法，永遠不會回傳符合的 issue","執行時 JQL condition 用的是 actor 的權限；Validate query 用的是 Dmitri 自己的權限","對於使用 issue security scheme 限制存取的 project，global rule 一律略過 JQL condition"],"fig":"","opts":["The JQL condition cannot search the Labels field, so the query only works in the issue navigator","Validate query only checks the syntax and never returns matching issues","At run time the JQL condition uses the actor's permissions; Validate query used Dmitri's own permissions","Global rules always skip JQL conditions for issues in projects that use an issue security scheme to restrict access"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。JQL condition 可以用一般 JQL，labels 沒有限制；Validate query 也確實找到了 SEC 的 issue，代表語法和欄位都沒問題。","B":"錯。官方說 Validate query 會依按下按鈕那個人的權限找出 issue，不只檢查語法；只有 JQL 裡有 smart value 時才無法用它驗證。","C":"對。官方說 Validate query 找到的 issue 依操作者自己的權限，rule 執行時則改用 rule actor 的權限。ops.bot 看不到 SEC，所以 SEC 的 issue 永遠不符合條件。","D":"錯。官方沒有這種依 issue security 略過 condition 的規則；global rule 一樣會評估 JQL condition，差別只在用誰的權限：驗證時用 Dmitri，執行時用 ops.bot。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/jira-automation-conditions/","https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/what-is-a-rule-actor/"],"lvl":3,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.4.2-e12","sec":"620.4.2","dom":"620.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Thandiwe, a project administrator at Pelagos, has a rule that adds the comment <code>Current owner: {{issue.assignee.displayName}}</code>. When the issue is unassigned, the comment reads \"Current owner:\" followed by nothing. She wants the comment to show <b>Nobody yet</b> in that case, and the assignee's name otherwise. Which smart value should she use?","zh":"Pelagos 的 project administrator Thandiwe 有一條 rule 會加上留言 <code>Current owner: {{issue.assignee.displayName}}</code>。Issue 沒有指派時，留言只顯示「Current owner:」，後面什麼都沒有。她希望這種情況下顯示 <b>Nobody yet</b>，有指派時照常顯示負責人的名字。她該用哪個 smart value？","zo":["<code>{{issue.assignee.displayName|\"Nobody yet\"}}</code>","<code>{{#issue.assignee.displayName}}Nobody yet{{/}}</code>","<code>{{triggerIssue.assignee.displayName}}</code>","<code>{{issue.assignee.displayName.concat(\"Nobody yet\")}}</code>"],"fig":"","opts":["<code>{{issue.assignee.displayName|\"Nobody yet\"}}</code>","<code>{{#issue.assignee.displayName}}Nobody yet{{/}}</code>","<code>{{triggerIssue.assignee.displayName}}</code>","<code>{{issue.assignee.displayName.concat(\"Nobody yet\")}}</code>"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。在 smart value 後面加 <code>|\"預設文字\"</code> 就是官方的 default value 寫法：值不存在時顯示預設文字，有值時照常顯示名字。","B":"錯。<code>{{#…}}…{{/}}</code> 是逐項處理 list 的區段寫法，用來對每個項目重複輸出，不是「沒有值就顯示備用文字」。","C":"錯。{{triggerIssue}} 是觸發 rule 的那張 issue，在這條沒有 branch 的 rule 裡就是同一張，沒指派時一樣是空白。","D":"錯。concat() 會把文字接在後面，有指派時會變成「名字＋Nobody yet」，不是在沒有值時才顯示備用文字。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/what-are-smart-values/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.4.2-e13","sec":"620.4.2","dom":"620.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. Rosa, a project administrator for project OPS at Lindqvist, built the rule shown. The audit log shows the rule succeeded, and the new issue's Due date is set correctly. However, the comment on the issue always ends with an empty date. What should Rosa do?","zh":"請看圖。Rosa 是 Lindqvist 公司 project OPS 的 project administrator，她建了圖中的 rule。Audit log 顯示 rule 執行成功，新 issue 的 Due date 也設定正確；但 issue 上的留言最後的日期永遠是空白。Rosa 該怎麼做？","zo":["在 rule details 開啟 <b>Allow rule trigger</b>，讓留言能讀到編輯後的值","在 Edit issue action 和 Comment on issue action 之間加一個 <b>Re-fetch issue data</b> action","把 rule actor 改成她自己，讓 rule 有權限讀取新 issue 的 Due date 欄位","把 Comment on issue action 移到 Edit issue action 前面"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 400\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"OPS automation rule with edit then comment\"><rect x=\"0.5\" y=\"0.5\" width=\"379\" height=\"399\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"380\" height=\"34\" rx=\"0\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Project settings</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Rule: Set due date on blockers</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Rule chain</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"119\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"119\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">1  Trigger</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Issue created</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"145\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"145\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"137\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">2  Condition</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"137\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Priority equals Highest</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"171\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"171\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"163\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">3  Action</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"163\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Edit issue: Due date</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"197\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"197\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"189\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">4  Action</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"189\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Comment on issue</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"218\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Step 3: Due date value</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"224\" width=\"356\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"20\" y=\"242\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t mono\" style=\"font-size:11px\">{{now.plusDays(2)}}</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"273\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Step 4: Comment text</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"279\" width=\"356\" height=\"44\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx brand\"/><text x=\"20\" y=\"297\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t mono\" style=\"font-size:11px\">Blocker logged. Please resolve</text><text x=\"20\" y=\"313\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t mono\" style=\"font-size:11px\">this by {{issue.duedate}}</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"344\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Actor</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"350\" width=\"356\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"368\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Automation for Jira</text><path d=\"M350,361 l5,5 l5,-5\" class=\"ln ink\" style=\"stroke-width:1.6\"/></svg>","opts":["Turn on <b>Allow rule trigger</b> in the rule details so the comment can read the edited value","Add a <b>Re-fetch issue data</b> action between the Edit issue action and the Comment on issue action","Change the rule actor to herself so the rule has permission to read the Due date field on new issues","Move the Comment on issue action above the Edit issue action"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。Allow rule trigger 是讓「其他 rule 的動作」可以觸發這條 rule，和同一條 rule 裡讀不到新值無關。","B":"對。官方說 {{issue}} 預設在 rule 執行期間不會更新，保留觸發當下的值；Re-fetch issue data 會用最新欄位值刷新 smart value，留言就讀得到 Due date。","C":"錯。Actor 是 Automation for Jira，而且 Edit issue 已經成功寫入 Due date，代表權限沒問題；空白是因為讀到的是舊快照。","D":"錯。把留言移到 Edit 前面，留言時 Due date 還沒設定，一樣是空白，反而更確定讀不到。"},"note":"現行 UI 叫 Re-fetch work item data、Edit work item、Comment on work item。現行 UI 把 rule 改叫 flow；Allow rule trigger 現在叫 Allow flow trigger，和 scope、actor 一起放在 flow 的 Settings。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/jira-automation-actions/","https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/what-are-rule-details-in-atlassian-automation/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.4.3-e01","sec":"620.4.3","dom":"620.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. Kwame is a project administrator for the company-managed project FLEET at Pellucid Freight. His rule runs as the default actor, Automation for Jira, and transitions every new issue to Triage. Each run fails, and the audit log shows: \"The rule actor for this rule is missing some required permissions.\" The exhibit shows part of the FLEET permission scheme. Which change resolves the error?","zh":"請看附圖。Kwame 是 Pellucid Freight 的 company-managed project FLEET 的 project administrator。他的 rule 以預設 actor（Automation for Jira）執行，會把每張新 issue transition 到 Triage。每次執行都失敗，audit log 顯示：「The rule actor for this rule is missing some required permissions.」附圖是 FLEET permission scheme 的一部分。哪一項變更能解決這個錯誤？","zo":["把 Automation for Jira 這個 app 使用者加進 FLEET 的 Developers project role","在 rule details 開啟 Allow rule trigger","把 Transition Issues 權限給 atlassian-addons-project-access 角色","把 rule 的 scope 從 Single project 改成 Global"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 269\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Permission scheme: FLEET\"><rect x=\"0.5\" y=\"0.5\" width=\"379\" height=\"268\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"380\" height=\"34\" rx=\"0\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Project settings</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Permission scheme: FLEET</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s tf-violet\" style=\"font-weight:700\">addons role = atlassian-addons-project-access</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"113\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Permission / Granted to</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"143\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"143\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"135\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Browse Projects</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"135\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Developers, addons role</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"169\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"169\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"161\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Create Issues</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"161\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Developers, addons role</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"195\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"195\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"187\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Edit Issues</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"187\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Developers, addons role</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"221\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"221\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"213\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Transition Issues</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"213\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Developers</text><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"247\" x2=\"368\" y2=\"247\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"239\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Assign Issues</text><text x=\"368\" y=\"239\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">Developers, addons role</text></svg>","opts":["Add the Automation for Jira app user to the Developers project role in FLEET","Turn on Allow rule trigger in the rule details","Grant Transition Issues to the atlassian-addons-project-access role","Change the rule scope from Single project to Global"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。App 使用者是系統管理的帳號，在 UI 裡無法被選進 project role；官方的修法是在 permission scheme 裡補角色。","B":"錯。Allow rule trigger 只決定別條 rule 的動作能不能觸發這條 rule，和 actor 有沒有權限無關。","C":"對。Automation for Jira 的 project 權限來自 atlassian-addons-project-access 角色；圖中 Transition Issues 沒給這個角色，transition 就會失敗。","D":"錯。Scope 只決定 rule 在哪些 project 生效，不會多給權限；而且 Global scope 只有 Jira admin 能設。"},"note":"常見誤解：「Automation for Jira 是系統帳號，不受權限限制」。它照樣要有 project 權限，只是權限掛在 atlassian-addons-project-access 這個角色上。CMP 的 permission scheme 要 Jira admin 才能改。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira/kb/automation-rule-actor-missing-permissions-in-jsm-cloud/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira/kb/automation-error-actor-does-not-have-permission-to-view/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira/kb/the-atlassian-addons-project-access-project-role-in-jira-cloud/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.4.3-e02","sec":"620.4.3","dom":"620.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Zeynep is a Jira administrator at Brightwell Insurance. A scheduled rule in the CLM project uses JQL to find overdue claims and adds a reminder comment to each one. The rule actor is Automation for Jira, and the atlassian-addons-project-access role holds every project permission the rule needs. Most claims receive the comment, but claims set to the Legal Hold security level never do. What is the most likely cause?","zh":"Zeynep 是 Brightwell Insurance 的 Jira administrator。CLM project 裡有一條 scheduled rule，用 JQL 找出逾期的理賠單，並在每張加上提醒 comment。Rule actor 是 Automation for Jira，而 atlassian-addons-project-access 角色已經有這條 rule 需要的全部 project 權限。大部分理賠單都收到 comment，但設成 Legal Hold security level 的理賠單從來沒收到。最可能的原因是什麼？","zo":["Legal Hold security level 沒有包含 rule actor，所以 rule 看不到那些 issue","Rule 碰到 Lookup issues 的上限，只處理了前 100 張 issue","Allow rule trigger 沒開，所以有 security level 的 issue 被略過","Scheduled rule 一律會略過設有任何 security level 的 issue"],"fig":"","opts":["The Legal Hold security level does not include the rule actor, so the rule cannot see those issues","The rule reached the Lookup issues limit, so only the first 100 issues were processed","Allow rule trigger is turned off, so issues with a security level are skipped","Scheduled rules always skip issues that have any security level set"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。Actor 也要通過 issue security level 才看得到 issue；看不到就撈不到、也加不了 comment。官方 KB 要求一併檢查 security scheme。","B":"錯。100 筆是 Lookup issues 動作的上限，這條 rule 沒用那個動作；而且只有特定等級的 issue 被略過，不是數量問題。","C":"錯。Allow rule trigger 只管別條 rule 能不能觸發它；scheduled rule 靠排程執行，與 security level 無關。","D":"錯。沒有這種規則；只要 actor 在 security level 允許的名單內，scheduled rule 照樣能處理這些 issue。"},"note":"排查口訣：project 權限（permission scheme）＋ issue security level，兩關都要過，actor 才看得到、改得動那張 issue。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira/kb/automation-error-actor-does-not-have-permission-to-view/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira/kb/automation-rule-actor-missing-permissions-in-jsm-cloud/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.4.3-e03","sec":"620.4.3","dom":"620.4","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Lars is a project administrator for the company-managed project MKT at Orchard Media. He wants comments added by an automation rule to appear under a real team member's name instead of Automation for Jira. Which two statements about the rule actor are true? (Choose two.)","zh":"Lars 是 Orchard Media 的 company-managed project MKT 的 project administrator。他希望 automation rule 加的 comment 以真實團隊成員的名字出現，而不是 Automation for Jira。關於 rule actor，哪兩項敘述正確？（選兩個）","zo":["Lars 可以把 MKT Administrators 角色裡的任何成員設成 rule actor","Lars 只能把自己或 Automation for Jira 設成 rule actor","即使 actor 是真人，issue History 仍會把變更記在 Automation for Jira 名下","Jira administrator 可以選 Marketplace app 的使用者當 rule actor","如果 Jira administrator 把別人設成 actor，Lars 必須先把 actor 改成自己或 Automation for Jira，才能修改這條 rule"],"fig":"","opts":["Lars can set any member of the MKT Administrators role as the rule actor","Lars can set only himself or Automation for Jira as the rule actor","Even when a person is the actor, the issue History still credits Automation for Jira with the changes","A Jira administrator can select a Marketplace app user as the rule actor","If a Jira administrator set another user as the actor, Lars must change the actor to himself or Automation for Jira before he can edit the rule"],"ans":"BE","why":{"A":"錯。Project admin 不能指定別人；能把任何人設成 actor 的只有 global admin（Jira admin）。","B":"對。官方寫明 project admin 只能選自己或 Automation for Jira 當 actor。要讓其他同事當 actor，得請 Jira admin 設定。","C":"錯。換成真人 actor 後，issue 的 History 會顯示由這位 actor 做的變更，這正是換 actor 的目的。","D":"錯。官方註明 Marketplace app 的使用者不能被選為 rule actor，Jira admin 也一樣。","E":"對。Actor 是別人時，project admin 要先把 actor 改回自己或 Automation for Jira 才能改 rule；global admin 不受此限。"},"note":"被設成 actor 的人會收到通知信，之後 rule 以他名義做的每個動作也會寄信給他。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/run-jira-rules-as-another-user/","https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/what-is-a-rule-actor/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.4.3-e04","sec":"620.4.3","dom":"620.4","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Olga is a team lead at Quillon Bank. She is not a Jira administrator, but she must create and manage automation rules for the company-managed project SUP. Which two permissions must she hold in SUP? (Choose two.)","zh":"Olga 是 Quillon Bank 的 team lead。她不是 Jira administrator，但必須替 company-managed project SUP 建立並管理 automation rule。她在 SUP 必須具備哪兩項權限？（選兩個）","zo":["Browse Projects","Edit Issues","Transition Issues","Administer Projects","Modify Reporter"],"fig":"","opts":["Browse Projects","Edit Issues","Transition Issues","Administer Projects","Modify Reporter"],"ans":"AD","why":{"A":"對。官方規定 company-managed project 裡要同時有 Administer Projects 與 Browse Projects 才能建立和管理 rule；只有其中一個不夠。","B":"錯。Edit Issues 是 actor 執行編輯動作時需要的權限，不是「管理 rule」的條件。","C":"錯。Transition Issues 是 actor 執行 transition 動作時需要的權限，不是建立或管理 rule 的條件。","D":"對。有 Administer Projects 才是 project admin，再加 Browse Projects 就能管理 SUP 的 rule（前提是 Jira admin 沒關掉這項功能）。","E":"錯。Modify Reporter 只控制能否改 issue 的 Reporter 欄位，和管理 automation 無關。"},"note":"Team-managed project 則是要有 Administrator 存取權（角色）。Jira admin 可以在 Global automation → Global configuration 取消 project admin 管理 rule 的能力。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/permissions-required-for-jira-cloud-automation-rules/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.4.3-e05","sec":"620.4.3","dom":"620.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Ravi, a project administrator at Lumen Rail, built a rule in project TRK that posts a Slack message whenever an issue's status changes. He used the Issue updated trigger. When the team drags issues across the board, the rule does not run. According to Atlassian guidance, what should Ravi change?","zh":"Ravi 是 Lumen Rail 的 project administrator，他在 project TRK 建了一條 rule，只要 issue 的狀態改變就發 Slack 訊息。他用的是 Issue updated trigger。團隊在 board 上把 issue 拖到別的欄時，rule 沒有執行。依照 Atlassian 的說明，Ravi 應該改什麼？","zo":["開啟 Allow rule trigger，讓 board 上的移動能觸發 rule","把自己設成 rule actor，讓 rule 看得到 board 的動態","在 rule 第一步加一個 Re-fetch issue data 動作","把 trigger 換成 Issue transitioned"],"fig":"","opts":["Turn on Allow rule trigger so that board moves can trigger the rule","Set himself as the rule actor so that the rule can see board activity","Add a Re-fetch issue data action as the first step of the rule","Replace the trigger with Issue transitioned"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。Allow rule trigger 只處理「別條 rule 造成的事件」；這裡是使用者在 board 上拖卡，本來就不需要它。","B":"錯。Actor 影響的是 rule 做動作時的權限與署名，不會改變 trigger 監聽哪一種事件。","C":"錯。Re-fetch 是在 rule 已經執行後重新讀取 issue 資料；rule 根本沒被觸發時加它沒有用。","D":"對。官方說明要在 issue 狀態改變時執行，應該用 Issue transitioned trigger，而不是 Issue updated；它還能指定只監聽某些狀態。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>現行 UI 叫 Work item updated／Work item transitioned，rule 也改稱 flow。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/jira-automation-triggers/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.4.3-e06","sec":"620.4.3","dom":"620.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Nadia is a Jira administrator at Saltmarsh Logistics. She migrates 300 legacy tickets into the company-managed project DOCK through Settings &gt; System &gt; External System Import &gt; CSV. A rule in DOCK uses the Issue created trigger to assign every new issue to a triage owner. None of the imported issues were assigned, and the rule's audit log has no entries for them. What is the most likely cause?","zh":"Nadia 是 Saltmarsh Logistics 的 Jira administrator。她透過 Settings &gt; System &gt; External System Import &gt; CSV，把 300 張舊系統的單子搬進 company-managed project DOCK。DOCK 裡有一條 rule 使用 Issue created trigger，會把每張新 issue 指派給負責分流的人。匯入的 issue 一張都沒被指派，而且這條 rule 的 audit log 裡完全沒有這些 issue 的紀錄。最可能的原因是什麼？","zo":["Rule actor 在 DOCK 缺 Browse Projects 權限，看不到匯入的 issue","一次匯入 300 張 issue 超過 service limit，rule 被 throttle","CSV External System Import 不會發出 Issue created 事件","Allow rule trigger 沒開，所以系統匯入建立的 issue 會被忽略"],"fig":"","opts":["The rule actor lacks Browse Projects in DOCK, so it cannot see the imported issues","Importing 300 issues at once exceeded a service limit, so the rule was throttled","The CSV External System Import does not fire the Issue created event","Allow rule trigger is turned off, so issues created by a system import are ignored"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。Actor 缺權限時，rule 其實有被觸發，audit log 會留下錯誤或 No actions performed 的紀錄；這裡完全沒紀錄，代表 rule 根本沒被觸發。","B":"錯。超過 service limit 時，audit log 會出現 THROTTLED 紀錄；這裡連一筆紀錄都沒有，不是處理量的問題。","C":"對。External System Import 建立 issue 時不會發出 Issue created 事件（改發 Issue updated），所以 trigger 不會啟動、audit log 也沒紀錄。改用一般的 Import issues from CSV（Bulk Create）就會正常觸發。","D":"錯。Allow rule trigger 只決定「其他 rule 的動作」能不能觸發這條 rule；CSV 匯入不是 rule 造成的事件，開不開都一樣。"},"note":"常見誤解：「所有 CSV 匯入都不會觸發 Issue created」。只有 Jira admin 專用的 External System Import 不會；從 issue 搜尋頁 More actions → Import issues from CSV（Bulk Create，需要 Create Issues 與 Make bulk changes）匯入，會正常觸發（JRACLOUD-81955，已以 Won't Fix 關閉）。排查口訣：audit log 完全沒紀錄 → 先懷疑事件根本沒發生。<br><b>考試版／現行版：</b>現行 UI 叫 Import work items from CSV、Work item created。","src":["https://jira.atlassian.com/browse/JRACLOUD-81955","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/import-data-from-a-csv-file/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/create-issues-using-the-csv-importer/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.4.3-e07","sec":"620.4.3","dom":"620.4","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"At Tessera Games, Rule B uses the Issue updated trigger, and Allow rule trigger is turned on. Rule A acts on the same issues, and each option describes a single action in Rule A. Which two actions will NOT trigger Rule B? (Choose two.)","zh":"Tessera Games 的 Rule B 使用 Issue updated trigger，並已開啟 Allow rule trigger。Rule A 會處理同一批 issue，每個選項代表 Rule A 裡的一個動作。哪兩個動作不會觸發 Rule B？（選兩個）","zo":["用 Edit issue 動作把 Priority 設成 High","用 Link issues 動作把 issue 連到另一張相關的 bug","用 Edit issue 動作加上 label hotfix","用 Log work 動作記錄 2h 工時","用 Edit issue 動作修改 Due date"],"fig":"","opts":["An Edit issue action that sets Priority to High","A Link issues action that links the issue to a related bug","An Edit issue action that adds the label hotfix","A Log work action that records 2h","An Edit issue action that changes the Due date"],"ans":"BD","why":{"A":"錯。用 Edit issue 改 Priority 會產生 Issue updated 事件；Rule B 又開了 Allow rule trigger，所以會被觸發。","B":"對。官方列出 Issue updated 的例外：Link issue、Assign issue、Log work 造成的變更不會觸發它。監聽連結要用 Issue linked。","C":"錯。加 label 也是一般的欄位編輯，會產生 Issue updated 事件，Allow rule trigger 開著就會觸發 Rule B。","D":"對。Log work 動作是 Issue updated 的例外之一，不會觸發它；要監聽工時紀錄，應改用 Work logged trigger。","E":"錯。改 Due date 屬於一般欄位更新，會觸發 Issue updated；加上 Allow rule trigger 已開，Rule B 會執行。"},"note":"Issue updated 的三個例外：Link issue、Assign issue、Log work。另外，狀態改變要用 Issue transitioned。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/jira-automation-triggers/"],"lvl":3,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.4.3-e08","sec":"620.4.3","dom":"620.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. Farid is a project administrator at Northwind Grocers. His rule \"Sync to ERP\" sends a web request to the company's ERP system. The latest run in the audit log shows the status in the exhibit, and the step that stopped the run has an error icon. What should Farid expect?","zh":"請看附圖。Farid 是 Northwind Grocers 的 project administrator。他的 rule「Sync to ERP」會送出 web request 到公司的 ERP 系統。Audit log 裡最新一次執行的狀態如附圖，讓執行中斷的那個步驟旁有錯誤圖示。Farid 應該預期會發生什麼事？","zo":["不必處理；Automation 會從失敗的步驟重試這條 rule，最長七天","這次執行 24 小時後會被丟棄，所以他必須手動再觸發一次","Rule 因為超過 service limit 被停用了，必須重新啟用","這次執行被迴圈偵測中止；他應該關掉 Allow rule trigger"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 150\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Automation audit log 示意\"><rect x=\"10\" y=\"8\" width=\"300\" height=\"134\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx plain\"/><text x=\"20\" y=\"28\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\">Audit log: Sync to ERP</text><rect x=\"16\" y=\"39\" width=\"288\" height=\"22\" rx=\"5\" class=\"sf-gray\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Time</text><text x=\"80\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Rule</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Status</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"62\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"62\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">09:02</text><text x=\"80\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Sync to ERP</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"t\">QUEUED FOR RETRY</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"86\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"86\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">08:47</text><text x=\"80\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Sync to ERP</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"t\">SUCCESS</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"110\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"126\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">08:31</text><text x=\"80\" y=\"126\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Sync to ERP</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"126\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"t\">SUCCESS</text></svg>","opts":["No action is needed; Automation retries the rule from the failed step for up to seven days","The run is discarded after 24 hours, so he must trigger the rule again manually","The rule has been disabled for breaching a service limit and must be re-enabled","The run was stopped by loop detection; he should turn off Allow rule trigger"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。Queued for retry 代表遇到暫時性的系統錯誤，系統會自動從失敗的步驟重試，最長七天；七天內仍不成功，狀態才改成 Failure 並寄通知。","B":"錯。官方沒有「24 小時後丟棄」的規則；排入重試的執行會自動重跑，不需要手動再觸發一次。","C":"錯。超過 service limit 的狀態是 THROTTLED，嚴重時 rule 會被停用；Queued for retry 則是等待自動重試。","D":"錯。迴圈被偵測到時，狀態會是 LOOP；Queued for retry 與 rule 互相觸發無關。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/retry-failed-rules-in-atlassian-automation/","https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/what-is-the-automation-audit-log/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.4.3-e09","sec":"620.4.3","dom":"620.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. Aiko, a project administrator at Coralview Health, has taken over the HELIX project from Mateo, who moved to another team. When the rule shown fails, the error emails still go to Mateo. Which change makes Aiko receive the error emails instead?","zh":"請看附圖。Coralview Health 的 project administrator Aiko 從調到其他團隊的 Mateo 手上接下 HELIX project。圖中這條 rule 失敗時，錯誤通知信仍然寄給 Mateo。哪一項變更能讓 Aiko 改收錯誤通知信？","zo":["把 Actor 設成 Aiko","把 Owner 設成 Aiko","開啟 Allow rule trigger","修改 Notify on error，讓每位 project administrator 都收到 email"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 395\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Rule details\"><rect x=\"0.5\" y=\"0.5\" width=\"379\" height=\"394\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"380\" height=\"34\" rx=\"0\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Project settings</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Rule details</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Name</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"95\" width=\"356\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"113\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Escalate P1 bugs</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"144\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Owner</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"150\" width=\"356\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"168\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Mateo Ruiz</text><path d=\"M350,161 l5,5 l5,-5\" class=\"ln ink\" style=\"stroke-width:1.6\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"199\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Actor</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"205\" width=\"356\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"223\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Automation for Jira</text><path d=\"M350,216 l5,5 l5,-5\" class=\"ln ink\" style=\"stroke-width:1.6\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"254\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Scope</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"260\" width=\"356\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"278\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Single project: HELIX</text><path d=\"M350,271 l5,5 l5,-5\" class=\"ln ink\" style=\"stroke-width:1.6\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"309\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Allow rule trigger</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"315\" width=\"34\" height=\"18\" rx=\"9\" class=\"fl-gray\"/><circle cx=\"21\" cy=\"324\" r=\"6.5\" class=\"sf-surface\"/><text x=\"54\" y=\"328\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Off</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"345\" width=\"46.0\" height=\"26\" rx=\"6\" class=\"fl-brand\"/><text x=\"35.0\" y=\"362\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"w\">Save</text></svg>","opts":["Set Actor to Aiko","Set Owner to Aiko","Turn on Allow rule trigger","Change Notify on error so that every project administrator is emailed"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。Actor 決定 rule 以誰的身分做變更；真人 actor 會收到以他名義執行動作的信，但錯誤通知是寄給 Owner。","B":"對。Owner 預設是建立 rule 的人，rule 執行出錯時由 Owner 收到 email 通知。把 Owner 改成 Aiko，錯誤信就會改寄給她。","C":"錯。Allow rule trigger 決定別條 rule 能不能觸發這條 rule，與錯誤信寄給誰無關。","D":"錯。Notify on error 只設定「多久通知 Owner 一次」，不能改成通知所有 project admin。"},"note":"Owner＝收錯誤信的人；Actor＝執行變更、出現在 History 的人。兩者常被搞混。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/what-are-rule-details-in-atlassian-automation/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.4.3-e10","sec":"620.4.3","dom":"620.4","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"At Kestrel Warehousing, a scheduled rule in project WMS runs every 5 minutes with the JQL <code>project = WMS AND statusCategory != Done</code>, which matches thousands of issues. The audit log now shows THROTTLED, with a message that the rule exceeded the allowed total processing time. Which two changes follow Atlassian's recommendations? (Choose two.)","zh":"Kestrel Warehousing 的 project WMS 有一條 scheduled rule，每 5 分鐘執行一次，JQL 是 <code>project = WMS AND statusCategory != Done</code>，會撈到好幾千張 issue。Audit log 現在顯示 THROTTLED，訊息說這條 rule 超過允許的總處理時間。哪兩項變更符合 Atlassian 的建議？（選兩個）","zo":["把 rule 從每 5 分鐘改成每小時執行一次","把 rule actor 換成 Jira administrator","限縮 JQL，例如加上 <code>updated &gt; -1w</code>","開啟 Allow rule trigger，讓其他 rule 分擔負載","升級到 Premium 以放寬處理時間上限"],"fig":"","opts":["Run the rule every hour instead of every 5 minutes","Change the rule actor to a Jira administrator","Restrict the JQL, for example by adding <code>updated &gt; -1w</code>","Turn on Allow rule trigger so that other rules share the load","Upgrade to Premium to raise the processing-time limit"],"ans":"AC","why":{"A":"對。處理時間的上限是每 12 小時 60 分鐘；官方建議拉長 scheduled rule 的執行間隔，例如每小時跑一次，就能大幅減少累積的處理時間。","B":"錯。換 actor 只改變權限與署名，不會縮短處理時間；THROTTLED 不是權限問題。","C":"對。官方建議把 JQL 限縮到真正需要的 issue，例如只抓最近一週有更新的，每次處理的量變少，就不容易超過處理時間上限。","D":"錯。Allow rule trigger 讓別條 rule 能觸發它，只會增加執行次數，不會分擔負載，反而更容易被擋。","E":"錯。官方表格的處理時間上限是每 12 小時 60 分鐘，沒有依方案區分，升級 Premium 不會放寬它；會隨方案提高的只有同時執行的 rule 數量。"},"note":"官方另外建議：一次性要改幾千張 issue，改用 Jira 的 bulk change；步驟太多就拆成幾條 rule。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/automation-service-limits/","https://support.atlassian.com/automation/kb/difference-between-automation-service-limits-and-automation-usage-limits/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.4.3-e11","sec":"620.4.3","dom":"620.4","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Tomasz, a Jira administrator at Halvard Motors, creates a scheduled rule whose JQL returns about 400 issues. For each issue, a Related issues branch then processes its sub-tasks, and each issue has about 20 sub-tasks. After its first run, the rule is disabled automatically. What is the most likely cause?","zh":"Tomasz 是 Halvard Motors 的 Jira administrator，他建立一條 scheduled rule，JQL 會撈到約 400 張 issue。接著每張 issue 都進入 Related issues branch 處理它的 sub-task，每張大約有 20 個 sub-task。第一次執行後，rule 就被自動停用。最可能的原因是什麼？","zo":["Scheduled rule 連續失敗 10 次後會被停用","Branch 一再觸發 rule，被迴圈偵測中止","超過 Lookup issues 的 100 筆上限","這次執行超過單次 rule 執行 5,000 個相關項目的上限"],"fig":"","opts":["Scheduled rules are disabled after 10 consecutive failures","Loop detection stopped the rule because the branch triggered it repeatedly","The Lookup issues limit of 100 issues was exceeded","The run exceeded the limit of 5,000 associated items for a single rule execution"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。連續 10 次 Failure 才會自動停用 scheduled rule；這條 rule 只跑了一次就被停用，數字對不上。","B":"錯。迴圈偵測會把這次執行中止並標成 LOOP，不會停用 rule；而且這條 rule 沒有互相觸發的情況。","C":"錯。Lookup issues 動作只會使用前 100 筆，超過時是截斷，不會停用 rule；這條 rule 也沒用那個動作。","D":"對。單次執行最多能抓 5,000 個相關項目，算法是相乘：400 張 × 每張 20 個 sub-task ≈ 8,000。超過上限時 rule 會被停用，避免之後再跑。"},"note":"數字整理：LOOP＝10 次；Lookup issues＝100 筆；相關項目＝5,000（超過會停用）；scheduled 連續失敗 10 次停用；audit log 保留 90 天。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/cloud-automation/docs/automation-service-limits/"],"lvl":3,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.1-e01","sec":"620.5.1","dom":"620.5","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. Tomás, a project administrator for LOOP, runs the following query:\n<code>project = LOOP AND component != Billing</code>\nWhich two issues are returned? (Choose two.)","zh":"Refer to the exhibit.（請看附圖。）Tomás 是 LOOP 的 project administrator，他執行下面的查詢：\n<code>project = LOOP AND component != Billing</code>\n會回傳哪兩個 issue？（選兩個。）","zo":["LOOP-1","LOOP-2","LOOP-3","LOOP-4","LOOP-5"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 198\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"LOOP issue list\"><rect x=\"10\" y=\"8\" width=\"300\" height=\"182\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx plain\"/><text x=\"20\" y=\"28\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\">Issues in project LOOP</text><rect x=\"16\" y=\"39\" width=\"288\" height=\"22\" rx=\"5\" class=\"sf-gray\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Key</text><text x=\"110\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Component</text><text x=\"214\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Status</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"62\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"62\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">LOOP-1</text><text x=\"110\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Billing</text><text x=\"214\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">To Do</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"86\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"86\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">LOOP-2</text><text x=\"110\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">(none)</text><text x=\"214\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">To Do</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"110\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"126\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">LOOP-3</text><text x=\"110\" y=\"126\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Search</text><text x=\"214\" y=\"126\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">In Progress</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"134\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"134\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"150\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">LOOP-4</text><text x=\"110\" y=\"150\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Billing</text><text x=\"214\" y=\"150\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Done</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"158\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"158\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"174\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">LOOP-5</text><text x=\"110\" y=\"174\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Mobile</text><text x=\"214\" y=\"174\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">To Do</text></svg>","opts":["LOOP-1","LOOP-2","LOOP-3","LOOP-4","LOOP-5"],"ans":"CE","why":{"A":"錯。LOOP-1 的 component 就是 Billing，<code>!=</code> 會把它排除。","B":"錯。常見誤解：以為沒填 component 也算「不是 Billing」。<code>!=</code> 不匹配空欄位，LOOP-2 不會出現。","C":"對。LOOP-3 有 component 而且是 Search，不等於 Billing，所以會被找到；<code>!=</code> 只比對「有值且不是 Billing」的 issue。","D":"錯。LOOP-4 的 component 是 Billing，被這個條件排除。","E":"對。LOOP-5 有 component（Mobile），不是 Billing，符合條件。要連沒填的 LOOP-2 一起找，得再補 <code>OR component IS EMPTY</code>。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/advanced-search-reference-jql-operators/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.1-e02","sec":"620.5.1","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Kofi, a release manager at Tidewell Logistics, needs a filter that lists every TRAM issue that is <b>not</b> scheduled for version 4.0 or 4.1. Issues with no fix version at all must also be included. Which query meets the requirement?","zh":"Kofi 是 Tidewell Logistics 的 release manager，他需要一個 filter，列出 TRAM 中所有<b>沒有</b>排進 4.0 或 4.1 版的 issue。完全沒有 fix version 的 issue 也要列出來。哪個查詢符合需求？","zo":["<code>project = TRAM AND fixVersion not in (\"4.0\", \"4.1\")</code>","<code>project = TRAM AND fixVersion IS NOT (\"4.0\", \"4.1\")</code>","<code>project = TRAM AND (fixVersion not in (\"4.0\", \"4.1\") OR fixVersion is EMPTY)</code>","<code>project = TRAM AND (fixVersion not in (\"4.0\", \"4.1\") OR fixVersion IS NOT EMPTY)</code>"],"fig":"","opts":["<code>project = TRAM AND fixVersion not in (\"4.0\", \"4.1\")</code>","<code>project = TRAM AND fixVersion IS NOT (\"4.0\", \"4.1\")</code>","<code>project = TRAM AND (fixVersion not in (\"4.0\", \"4.1\") OR fixVersion is EMPTY)</code>","<code>project = TRAM AND (fixVersion not in (\"4.0\", \"4.1\") OR fixVersion IS NOT EMPTY)</code>"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。<code>NOT IN</code> 和 <code>!=</code> 一樣不匹配空欄位，沒有 fix version 的 issue 會被漏掉。","B":"錯。<code>IS NOT</code> 只能接 EMPTY 或 NULL，後面放版本清單會是無效的 JQL。","C":"對。<code>NOT IN</code> 只找「有版本但不是 4.0、4.1」的，另外用 <code>OR fixVersion is EMPTY</code> 把沒排版本的補回來，括號確保 project 條件套用到兩邊。","D":"錯。後半段 <code>IS NOT EMPTY</code> 找的是「有版本」的 issue，等於沒補到空值，沒排版本的照樣漏掉。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/advanced-search-reference-jql-operators/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.1-e03","sec":"620.5.1","dom":"620.5","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Leila leads the support rotation for project MOSS. She wants a queue of issues that are <b>not</b> assigned to Omar or Yusuf, and unassigned issues must appear in the queue as well. Which two queries return exactly this set? (Choose two.)","zh":"Leila 負責 MOSS 專案的支援輪值。她想要一個佇列，列出<b>沒有</b>指派給 Omar 或 Yusuf 的 issue，而且未指派的 issue 也要出現在佇列裡。哪兩個查詢剛好回傳這組結果？（選兩個。）","zo":["<code>project = MOSS AND ((assignee != omar AND assignee != yusuf) OR assignee = EMPTY)</code>","<code>project = MOSS AND assignee not in (omar, yusuf)</code>","<code>project = MOSS AND assignee IS NOT (omar, yusuf)</code>","<code>project = MOSS AND (assignee not in (omar, yusuf) OR assignee is EMPTY)</code>","<code>project = MOSS AND (assignee != omar OR assignee != yusuf OR assignee IS EMPTY)</code>"],"fig":"","opts":["<code>project = MOSS AND ((assignee != omar AND assignee != yusuf) OR assignee = EMPTY)</code>","<code>project = MOSS AND assignee not in (omar, yusuf)</code>","<code>project = MOSS AND assignee IS NOT (omar, yusuf)</code>","<code>project = MOSS AND (assignee not in (omar, yusuf) OR assignee is EMPTY)</code>","<code>project = MOSS AND (assignee != omar OR assignee != yusuf OR assignee IS EMPTY)</code>"],"ans":"AD","why":{"A":"對。兩個 <code>!=</code> 用 AND 接等於「不是 Omar 也不是 Yusuf」，再用 <code>assignee = EMPTY</code> 補回未指派；<code>= EMPTY</code> 等同 <code>IS EMPTY</code>，是合法寫法。","B":"錯。<code>NOT IN</code> 不匹配空欄位，未指派的 issue 不會出現，少了一部分。","C":"錯。<code>IS NOT</code> 只能接 EMPTY 或 NULL，接人名清單會是無效 JQL。","D":"對。這是官方建議的寫法：<code>NOT IN</code> 找指派給其他人的，<code>OR assignee is EMPTY</code> 把未指派的補進來。","E":"錯。兩個 <code>!=</code> 用 OR 接，任何有 assignee 的 issue 都至少滿足其中一個，連 Omar 的 issue 也會被列出。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/advanced-search-reference-jql-operators/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/advanced-search-reference-jql-keywords/"],"lvl":3,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.1-e04","sec":"620.5.1","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Aiko is building several filters for a dashboard. When she saves them, Jira rejects one of the queries as invalid JQL. Which query is it?","zh":"Aiko 正在替 dashboard 建幾個 filter。儲存時，Jira 判定其中一個查詢是無效的 JQL。是哪一個？","zo":["<code>priority = EMPTY</code>","<code>duedate is null</code>","<code>labels != EMPTY</code>","<code>priority IS High</code>"],"fig":"","opts":["<code>priority = EMPTY</code>","<code>duedate is null</code>","<code>labels != EMPTY</code>","<code>priority IS High</code>"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。<code>= EMPTY</code> 是合法寫法，意思和 <code>priority IS EMPTY</code> 相同，找沒有設定 priority 的 issue。","B":"錯。NULL 和 EMPTY 意思相同，<code>duedate is null</code> 找沒有 due date 的 issue，是合法查詢。","C":"錯。官方寫明 <code>field != EMPTY</code> 等同 <code>field IS NOT EMPTY</code>，找至少有一個 label 的 issue。","D":"對。<code>IS</code>／<code>IS NOT</code> 只能接 EMPTY 或 NULL；要找 priority 是 High，必須寫 <code>priority = High</code>。常見誤解是以為 IS 能接任何值。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/advanced-search-reference-jql-operators/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/advanced-search-reference-jql-keywords/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.1-e05","sec":"620.5.1","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"During a JQL workshop at Brightfern Studio, the trainer lists several statements about JQL operators and keywords. Which statement is NOT true?","zh":"在 Brightfern Studio 的 JQL 工作坊上，講師列出幾個關於 JQL 運算子與關鍵字的敘述。哪個敘述<b>不</b>正確？","zo":["<code>IS NOT</code> 後面只能接 EMPTY 或 NULL。","<code>EMPTY</code> 和 <code>NULL</code> 可以互換使用。","<code>status IS NOT Done</code> 等同於 <code>status != Done</code>。","<code>text</code> 這個主欄位只支援 <code>~</code> 運算子。"],"fig":"","opts":["<code>IS NOT</code> can only be followed by EMPTY or NULL.","<code>EMPTY</code> and <code>NULL</code> can be used interchangeably.","<code>status IS NOT Done</code> is equivalent to <code>status != Done</code>.","The <code>text</code> master field supports only the <code>~</code> operator."],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"正確敘述（不選）。官方原文：IS NOT 只能和 EMPTY 或 NULL 一起用，用來找「欄位有值」的 issue。","B":"正確敘述（不選）。官方 keywords 頁對 EMPTY 和 NULL 的定義相同，都是「欄位沒有值」，兩者可以互換。","C":"錯誤敘述（要選）。常見誤解：把 IS NOT 當成 !=。IS NOT 只能接 EMPTY 或 NULL，這句是無效 JQL；要寫 <code>status != Done</code>。","D":"正確敘述（不選）。官方 fields 頁寫明 text 這個主欄位只能搭配 CONTAINS 運算子（<code>~</code>），例如 <code>text ~ \"Fred\"</code>。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/advanced-search-reference-jql-operators/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/advanced-search-reference-jql-keywords/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/advanced-search-reference-jql-fields/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.1-e06","sec":"620.5.1","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Mateo's board filter is:\n<code>project = LUMA AND duedate = EMPTY ORDER BY created</code>\nA reviewer insists that <code>= EMPTY</code> is bad syntax and proposes rewrites. Mateo will accept a rewrite only if the board keeps showing exactly the same issues. Which replacement for <code>duedate = EMPTY</code> should he accept?","zh":"Mateo 的 board filter 是：\n<code>project = LUMA AND duedate = EMPTY ORDER BY created</code>\n審查的人堅持 <code>= EMPTY</code> 是錯誤語法，提出幾種改寫。Mateo 只接受讓 board 顯示完全相同 issue 的改寫。他應該接受把 <code>duedate = EMPTY</code> 換成哪一個？","zo":["<code>duedate IS NOT EMPTY</code>","<code>duedate IS NULL</code>","<code>duedate &lt; now()</code>","<code>duedate != EMPTY</code>"],"fig":"","opts":["<code>duedate IS NOT EMPTY</code>","<code>duedate IS NULL</code>","<code>duedate &lt; now()</code>","<code>duedate != EMPTY</code>"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。<code>IS NOT EMPTY</code> 找的是「有 due date」的 issue，剛好和原本的條件相反。","B":"對。<code>= EMPTY</code> 本來就合法，等同 <code>IS EMPTY</code>；NULL 與 EMPTY 可互換，所以 <code>IS NULL</code> 結果完全相同。常見誤解是以為 = EMPTY 是錯的寫法。","C":"錯。<code>duedate &lt; now()</code> 只找已經逾期的 issue，而且沒有 due date 的 issue 不會被比較到。","D":"錯。<code>!= EMPTY</code> 等同 <code>IS NOT EMPTY</code>，找有 due date 的 issue，結果相反。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/advanced-search-reference-jql-keywords/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/advanced-search-reference-jql-operators/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.1-e07","sec":"620.5.1","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Before sprint planning, Zanele, the scrum master for team Kestrel, wants a filter that shows every issue already placed in a sprint that has <b>not started yet</b>. Which query should she use?","zh":"在 sprint planning 之前，Kestrel 團隊的 scrum master Zanele 想要一個 filter，顯示所有已經排進<b>還沒開始</b>的 sprint 的 issue。她該用哪個查詢？","zo":["<code>sprint in futureSprints()</code>","<code>sprint = futureSprints()</code>","<code>sprint in nextSprints()</code>","<code>sprint IS EMPTY</code>"],"fig":"","opts":["<code>sprint in futureSprints()</code>","<code>sprint = futureSprints()</code>","<code>sprint in nextSprints()</code>","<code>sprint IS EMPTY</code>"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。<code>futureSprints()</code> 找「已排進尚未開始的 sprint」的 issue，而 sprint 函數只支援 <code>IN</code> 和 <code>NOT IN</code>。","B":"錯。函數名稱對了，但 sprint 函數不支援 <code>=</code>，必須寫成 <code>sprint in futureSprints()</code>。","C":"錯。內建 sprint 函數只有 openSprints()、futureSprints()、closedSprints() 三個，沒有 nextSprints()。","D":"錯。<code>sprint IS EMPTY</code> 找的是沒有排進任何 sprint 的 issue（backlog 裡的），不是未開始的 sprint。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/advanced-search-reference-jql-functions/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.1-e08","sec":"620.5.1","dom":"620.5","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Dmitri is reviewing JQL clauses that his teammates added to shared filters at Quillon Games. Which two clauses are valid JQL? (Choose two.)","zh":"Dmitri 正在檢查 Quillon Games 的同事加進共用 filter 的 JQL 子句。哪兩個子句是有效的 JQL？（選兩個。）","zo":["<code>sprint = openSprints()</code>","<code>sprint not in closedSprints()</code>","<code>sprint in currentSprint()</code>","<code>sprint WAS IN closedSprints()</code>","<code>sprint in openSprints()</code>"],"fig":"","opts":["<code>sprint = openSprints()</code>","<code>sprint not in closedSprints()</code>","<code>sprint in currentSprint()</code>","<code>sprint WAS IN closedSprints()</code>","<code>sprint in openSprints()</code>"],"ans":"BE","why":{"A":"錯。openSprints() 存在，但 sprint 函數不支援 <code>=</code>，只能搭配 <code>IN</code>／<code>NOT IN</code>。","B":"對。closedSprints() 支援 NOT IN，這是合法寫法。它會找出有排 sprint、但沒有任何一個已完成 sprint 的 issue；NOT IN 不比對空欄位，完全沒排 sprint 的 issue 不會出現。","C":"錯。常見誤解：以為有 currentSprint()。內建只有 openSprints()、futureSprints()、closedSprints()。","D":"錯。Sprint 欄位不支援 WAS 類歷史運算子；WAS 只給六個欄位，例如 Status、Assignee、Fix Version。","E":"對。這是找「進行中 sprint」的標準寫法：openSprints() 搭配 <code>IN</code>，回傳已開始但尚未完成的 sprint 裡的 issue。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/advanced-search-reference-jql-functions/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/advanced-search-reference-jql-fields/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.1-e09","sec":"620.5.1","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Ahmed wants to review carry-over work in project RIVA: issues that belonged to at least one <b>completed</b> sprint and still have no resolution. Some RIVA issues were closed in a status named Cancelled with the resolution Won't Do. Which query should he use?","zh":"Ahmed 想檢視 RIVA 專案的延續工作：曾經屬於至少一個<b>已完成</b> sprint、而且到現在還沒有 resolution 的 issue。RIVA 有些 issue 是在名為 Cancelled 的狀態關閉，resolution 設為 Won't Do。他該用哪個查詢？","zo":["<code>project = RIVA AND sprint in previousSprints() AND resolution = Unresolved</code>","<code>project = RIVA AND sprint in closedSprints() AND status != Done</code>","<code>project = RIVA AND sprint = closedSprints() AND resolution IS NOT EMPTY</code>","<code>project = RIVA AND sprint in closedSprints() AND resolution = Unresolved</code>"],"fig":"","opts":["<code>project = RIVA AND sprint in previousSprints() AND resolution = Unresolved</code>","<code>project = RIVA AND sprint in closedSprints() AND status != Done</code>","<code>project = RIVA AND sprint = closedSprints() AND resolution IS NOT EMPTY</code>","<code>project = RIVA AND sprint in closedSprints() AND resolution = Unresolved</code>"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。沒有 previousSprints() 這個函數；已完成的 sprint 要用 closedSprints()。","B":"錯。<code>status != Done</code> 會把狀態是 Cancelled、resolution 為 Won't Do 的 issue 也算進來，但它們其實已經解決。","C":"錯。sprint 函數不能用 <code>=</code>；而 <code>resolution IS NOT EMPTY</code> 找的是已解決的 issue，方向相反。","D":"對。closedSprints() 要搭配 IN，找曾在已完成 sprint 的 issue；<code>resolution = Unresolved</code> 只看有沒有 resolution，不管狀態叫什麼。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/advanced-search-reference-jql-functions/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/advanced-search-reference-jql-fields/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.1-e10","sec":"620.5.1","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Farah creates a filter for a dashboard gadget that must count work across three projects but leave out every sub-task. One project uses the sub-task type <b>Sub-task</b>, and another uses a custom sub-task type named <b>Checklist item</b>. Which clause excludes every sub-task, including sub-task types added later?","zh":"Farah 為 dashboard gadget 建一個 filter，要計算三個專案的工作，但不能算進任何 sub-task。其中一個專案用 <b>Sub-task</b> 這個 sub-task 類型，另一個用自訂的 sub-task 類型 <b>Checklist item</b>。哪個子句能排除所有 sub-task，包括日後新增的 sub-task 類型？","zo":["<code>issuetype not in (Sub-task, \"Checklist item\")</code>","<code>issuetype in standardIssueTypes()</code>","<code>issuetype in subtaskIssueTypes()</code>","<code>issuetype = standardIssueTypes()</code>"],"fig":"","opts":["<code>issuetype not in (Sub-task, \"Checklist item\")</code>","<code>issuetype in standardIssueTypes()</code>","<code>issuetype in subtaskIssueTypes()</code>","<code>issuetype = standardIssueTypes()</code>"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。現有兩種 sub-task 類型都排除了，但名稱是寫死的，日後新增的 sub-task 類型不會被排除。","B":"對。standardIssueTypes() 回傳所有「不是 sub-task」的類型，不管 sub-task 類型叫什麼名字或何時新增，都會自動排除。","C":"錯。subtaskIssueTypes() 剛好相反，只找 sub-task 類型的 issue。","D":"錯。函數對了，但它只支援 <code>IN</code>／<code>NOT IN</code>，用 <code>=</code> 會是無效 JQL。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>考試寫 <code>issuetype</code>、<code>standardIssueTypes()</code>；現行官方頁改名為 <code>type</code>（別名 <code>workType</code>）與 <code>standardWorkTypes()</code>，舊寫法仍可用。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/advanced-search-reference-jql-functions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.1-e11","sec":"620.5.1","dom":"620.5","type":"multi","n":3,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. In project ZEN, <b>QA check</b> is a custom sub-task issue type. Bjorn runs:\n<code>project = ZEN AND issuetype in standardIssueTypes()</code>\nWhich three issues are returned? (Choose three.)","zh":"Refer to the exhibit.（請看附圖。）在 ZEN 專案中，<b>QA check</b> 是自訂的 sub-task issue type。Bjorn 執行：\n<code>project = ZEN AND issuetype in standardIssueTypes()</code>\n會回傳哪三個 issue？（選三個。）","zo":["ZEN-1","ZEN-2","ZEN-3","ZEN-4","ZEN-5"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 198\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"ZEN issue list\"><rect x=\"10\" y=\"8\" width=\"300\" height=\"182\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx plain\"/><text x=\"20\" y=\"28\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\">Issues in project ZEN</text><rect x=\"16\" y=\"39\" width=\"288\" height=\"22\" rx=\"5\" class=\"sf-gray\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Key</text><text x=\"110\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Issue type</text><text x=\"214\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Status</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"62\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"62\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">ZEN-1</text><text x=\"110\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Epic</text><text x=\"214\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">In Progress</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"86\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"86\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">ZEN-2</text><text x=\"110\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Story</text><text x=\"214\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">To Do</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"110\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"126\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">ZEN-3</text><text x=\"110\" y=\"126\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Sub-task</text><text x=\"214\" y=\"126\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">To Do</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"134\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"134\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"150\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">ZEN-4</text><text x=\"110\" y=\"150\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Bug</text><text x=\"214\" y=\"150\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Done</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"158\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"158\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"174\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">ZEN-5</text><text x=\"110\" y=\"174\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">QA check</text><text x=\"214\" y=\"174\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">To Do</text></svg>","opts":["ZEN-1","ZEN-2","ZEN-3","ZEN-4","ZEN-5"],"ans":"ABD","why":{"A":"對。Epic 不是 sub-task 類型，所以算標準類型。常見誤解是以為 standardIssueTypes() 只包含 story、task、bug 這一層。","B":"對。Story 是標準類型，會被列出；standardIssueTypes() 的定義就是「所有不是 sub-task 的類型」。","C":"錯。ZEN-3 是 Sub-task，屬於 sub-task 類型，會被 standardIssueTypes() 排除。","D":"對。Bug 是標準類型，不是 sub-task，所以符合 <code>issuetype in standardIssueTypes()</code>。","E":"錯。QA check 雖然名字不叫 Sub-task，但它是 sub-task 類型，一樣會被排除。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>考試寫 <code>issuetype</code>、<code>standardIssueTypes()</code>；現行官方頁改名為 <code>type</code>（別名 <code>workType</code>）與 <code>standardWorkTypes()</code>，舊寫法仍可用。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/advanced-search-reference-jql-functions/"],"lvl":3,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.1-e12","sec":"620.5.1","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Ingrid's filter for project HELIX is <code>project = HELIX AND status != Done</code>. HELIX uses several workflows whose final statuses have different names (Done, Cancelled, Closed), and more workflows may be added later. The filter keeps showing issues that are already resolved. Which query lists only unresolved issues and keeps working when new workflows are added?","zh":"Ingrid 替 HELIX 專案建的 filter 是 <code>project = HELIX AND status != Done</code>。HELIX 用了好幾個 workflow，結束狀態名稱各不相同（Done、Cancelled、Closed），之後還可能新增 workflow。這個 filter 一直列出已經解決的 issue。哪個查詢只列出未解決的 issue，而且新增 workflow 後仍然有效？","zo":["<code>project = HELIX AND resolution != Done</code>","<code>project = HELIX AND status not in (Done, Cancelled, Closed)</code>","<code>project = HELIX AND resolution = Unresolved</code>","<code>project = HELIX AND resolution IS NOT EMPTY</code>"],"fig":"","opts":["<code>project = HELIX AND resolution != Done</code>","<code>project = HELIX AND status not in (Done, Cancelled, Closed)</code>","<code>project = HELIX AND resolution = Unresolved</code>","<code>project = HELIX AND resolution IS NOT EMPTY</code>"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。<code>!=</code> 不匹配空欄位，沒有 resolution 的 issue 反而全被漏掉，還會列出 Won't Do 等已解決的。","B":"錯。現在也許能用，但狀態名稱是寫死的；新 workflow 的結束狀態名稱不同，就會再漏判。","C":"對。只要 issue 沒有 resolution 就算未解決，<code>resolution = Unresolved</code> 不看狀態名稱，所以跨 workflow、日後新增也適用。","D":"錯。<code>IS NOT EMPTY</code> 找的是「有 resolution」的 issue，也就是已解決的，方向相反。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/advanced-search-reference-jql-fields/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/advanced-search-reference-jql-operators/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.1-e13","sec":"620.5.1","dom":"620.5","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Keanu needs a clause for a personal dashboard that returns only issues with <b>no resolution</b>. Which two clauses meet the requirement? (Choose two.)","zh":"Keanu 需要一個用在個人 dashboard 的子句，只回傳<b>沒有 resolution</b> 的 issue。哪兩個子句符合需求？（選兩個。）","zo":["<code>resolution IS EMPTY</code>","<code>resolution != Done</code>","<code>resolution IS Unresolved</code>","<code>resolved IS NOT EMPTY</code>","<code>resolution = Unresolved</code>"],"fig":"","opts":["<code>resolution IS EMPTY</code>","<code>resolution != Done</code>","<code>resolution IS Unresolved</code>","<code>resolved IS NOT EMPTY</code>","<code>resolution = Unresolved</code>"],"ans":"AE","why":{"A":"對。resolution 欄位沒有值就是未解決，<code>IS EMPTY</code> 正好找出沒有 resolution 的 issue。","B":"錯。<code>!=</code> 不匹配空欄位，沒有 resolution 的 issue 反而一個都找不到，只會列出 Won't Do 等其他 resolution。","C":"錯。<code>IS</code> 只能接 EMPTY 或 NULL，接 Unresolved 會是無效 JQL；要寫成 <code>= Unresolved</code>。","D":"錯。resolved 是「解決日期」欄位，有值代表已經解決，找到的是相反的一群。","E":"對。官方 fields 頁的例子：找沒有 resolution 的 issue 就寫 <code>resolution = unresolved</code>，和 IS EMPTY 同義。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/advanced-search-reference-jql-fields/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/advanced-search-reference-jql-operators/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.1-e14","sec":"620.5.1","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Sven is a Jira administrator at Norvik Bank. A manager asks which issues in project NOVA had their <b>resolution</b> changed since the start of last week, and who made each change. What should Sven do?","zh":"Sven 是 Norvik Bank 的 Jira administrator。主管問：NOVA 專案從上週開始到現在，有哪些 issue 的 <b>resolution</b> 被改過？每次是誰改的？Sven 該怎麼做？","zo":["到系統設定開啟 audit log，以 NOVA 專案篩選，再把符合的 resolution 事件匯出成 CSV 檔。","執行 <code>project = NOVA AND resolution CHANGED AFTER startOfWeek(\"-1\")</code>，再查看每張 issue 的 History。","執行 <code>project = NOVA AND updated &gt;= startOfWeek(\"-1\")</code>，並依 Resolution 排序結果。","請每位 project administrator 檢查該專案 permission scheme 的變更紀錄。"],"fig":"","opts":["Open the audit log in the system settings, filter it by project NOVA, and export the matching resolution events to a CSV file.","Run <code>project = NOVA AND resolution CHANGED AFTER startOfWeek(\"-1\")</code>, then check each issue's History.","Run <code>project = NOVA AND updated &gt;= startOfWeek(\"-1\")</code> and sort the results by Resolution.","Ask each project administrator to review the project's permission scheme change log."],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。常見誤解：以為 audit log 記錄一切。官方說它記的是設定變更（workflow、scheme、欄位設定等），不記 issue 欄位的每次修改。","B":"對。resolution 是支援 CHANGED 的 6 個欄位之一，能找出改過 resolution 的 issue；issue 的 History 會列出誰在何時改了欄位。","C":"錯。updated 只代表 issue 最近有任何更新，留言或改其他欄位都算，無法判斷是不是改了 resolution。","D":"錯。permission scheme 管的是誰能做什麼，不會記錄某張 issue 的 resolution 被誰修改。"},"note":"現行 UI 把 issue 叫 work item；History 在 work item 的 Activity 區塊。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/advanced-search-reference-jql-operators/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/what-are-the-different-types-of-activity-on-an-issue/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/audit-activities-in-jira-applications/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.1-e15","sec":"620.5.1","dom":"620.5","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"A compliance officer at Halvard Insurance asks Ji-woo, a Jira administrator, what the Jira audit log can be used for. Which two statements are true? (Choose two.)","zh":"Halvard Insurance 的法遵人員問 Jira administrator Ji-woo，Jira 的 audit log 可以拿來做什麼。哪兩個敘述正確？（選兩個。）","zo":["它記錄 issue 的每一次欄位修改，例如 resolution 從 Done 改成 Won't Do。","它記錄設定變更，例如 workflow 被編輯，或 scheme 中新增了某個 permission。","Project administrator 可以檢視自己專案的 audit log 紀錄。","檢視 audit log 需要 Administer Jira 這個 global permission。","可以用 JQL 的 CHANGED 運算子搜尋 audit log。"],"fig":"","opts":["It records every field edit on issues, such as a resolution being changed from Done to Won't Do.","It records configuration changes, such as a workflow being edited or a permission being added to a scheme.","Project administrators can view the audit log entries for their own projects.","Viewing the audit log requires the Administer Jira global permission.","It can be searched with JQL by using the CHANGED operator."],"ans":"BD","why":{"A":"錯。官方明寫 audit log 不打算記錄 Jira 的所有活動；issue 欄位的修改要看該 issue 的 History。","B":"對。官方表格列出 workflow 變更、permission scheme 變更等設定類事件，目的就是追查「誰改了會影響使用者與專案的設定」。","C":"錯。audit log 在 Jira 系統設定底下，project administrator 沒有這個權限。","D":"對。官方寫明要檢視 audit log 必須有 Administer Jira 這個 global permission，也就是 Jira admin。","E":"錯。CHANGED 是查 issue 欄位歷史的 JQL 運算子，和 audit log 無關；audit log 要在畫面篩選或匯出 CSV。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/audit-activities-in-jira-applications/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.1-e16","sec":"620.5.1","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"ORCA has released versions 2.0, 2.1, and 2.2, and version 2.3 is still unreleased. The project's version order is 2.0, 2.1, 2.2, 2.3. Pedro, the product owner, wants a filter that returns only the issues fixed in the <b>most recently released</b> version. Which query should he use?","zh":"ORCA 已經發布 2.0、2.1、2.2 版，2.3 版還沒發布。專案的版本順序是 2.0、2.1、2.2、2.3。Product owner Pedro 想要一個 filter，只回傳在<b>最近一次發布</b>的版本中修好的 issue。他該用哪個查詢？","zo":["<code>fixVersion = latestReleasedVersion(ORCA)</code>","<code>fixVersion in releasedVersions(ORCA)</code>","<code>fixVersion = earliestUnreleasedVersion(ORCA)</code>","<code>fixVersion in unreleasedVersions(ORCA)</code>"],"fig":"","opts":["<code>fixVersion = latestReleasedVersion(ORCA)</code>","<code>fixVersion in releasedVersions(ORCA)</code>","<code>fixVersion = earliestUnreleasedVersion(ORCA)</code>","<code>fixVersion in unreleasedVersions(ORCA)</code>"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。latestReleasedVersion() 依專案設定的版本順序，回傳最後一個已發布的版本（這裡是 2.2）；它只支援 <code>=</code>／<code>!=</code>，只會抓一個版本。","B":"錯。常見誤解：releasedVersions() 會抓所有已發布版本，也就是 2.0、2.1、2.2 全部，不是只有最近一版。","C":"錯。earliestUnreleasedVersion() 是下一個還沒發布的版本，這裡會找到 2.3，不是已發布的版本。","D":"錯。unreleasedVersions() 找的是所有尚未發布的版本，和「最近發布」剛好相反。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/advanced-search-reference-jql-functions/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.1-e17","sec":"620.5.1","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Hana's team released version 5.1 of project PIKA last month. Yesterday they released version 5.2, which is ordered <b>before</b> 5.1 in the project's version sequence. <code>fixVersion = latestReleasedVersion(PIKA)</code> still returns the 5.1 issues. What explains this?","zh":"Hana 的團隊上個月發布了 PIKA 專案的 5.1 版。昨天他們又發布了 5.2 版，在專案的版本順序中排在 5.1 <b>之前</b>。<code>fixVersion = latestReleasedVersion(PIKA)</code> 仍然回傳 5.1 的 issue。原因是什麼？","zo":["這個函數回傳發布日期最近的版本。","這個函數會快取結果，直到下一個 sprint 完成。","這個函數挑版本名稱中數字最大的已發布版本。","這個函數依專案中設定的版本順序判斷，不看日期。"],"fig":"","opts":["The function returns the version whose release date is the most recent.","The function caches its result until the next sprint is completed.","The function picks the released version with the highest version number in its name.","The function uses the order of versions set in the project, not their dates."],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。官方說「latest」不是依日期判斷；若看日期，昨天發布的 5.2 就會被選到，不會是 5.1。","B":"錯。這是虛構的機制；官方沒有任何依 sprint 快取函數結果的說法，也和 sprint 無關。","C":"錯。若看名稱數字，5.2 比 5.1 大，應該選 5.2。官方說版本比較依 space admin 設定的順序，not a numeric or alphabetic order。","D":"對。官方說 latest 依版本被指定的順序決定，不看日期。5.2 在順序上排在 5.1 之前，所以 5.1 仍是 latest。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/advanced-search-reference-jql-functions/"],"lvl":3,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.1-e18","sec":"620.5.1","dom":"620.5","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Wen is cleaning up the saved filters her team uses for project ABC. Which two clauses are valid JQL? (Choose two.)","zh":"Wen 正在整理團隊用在 ABC 專案的已儲存 filter。哪兩個子句是有效的 JQL？（選兩個。）","zo":["<code>fixVersion = releasedVersions(ABC)</code>","<code>fixVersion in releasedVersions()</code>","<code>fixVersion in latestReleasedVersion(ABC)</code>","<code>fixVersion IS unreleasedVersions(ABC)</code>","<code>affectedVersion = latestReleasedVersion(ABC)</code>"],"fig":"","opts":["<code>fixVersion = releasedVersions(ABC)</code>","<code>fixVersion in releasedVersions()</code>","<code>fixVersion in latestReleasedVersion(ABC)</code>","<code>fixVersion IS unreleasedVersions(ABC)</code>","<code>affectedVersion = latestReleasedVersion(ABC)</code>"],"ans":"BE","why":{"A":"錯。releasedVersions() 回傳一組版本，只支援 <code>IN</code>／<code>NOT IN</code>，不能用 <code>=</code>。","B":"對。releasedVersions() 可以省略 project 參數，會搜尋所有專案的已發布版本；搭配 IN 是正確寫法。","C":"錯。latestReleasedVersion() 只回傳一個版本，只支援 <code>=</code>／<code>!=</code>，官方列 IN 為不支援。","D":"錯。<code>IS</code> 只能接 EMPTY 或 NULL，不能接任何函數。","E":"對。latestReleasedVersion() 支援 AffectedVersion、FixVersion 與版本型自訂欄位，並搭配 <code>=</code>，這是官方範例用法。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/advanced-search-reference-jql-functions/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/advanced-search-reference-jql-fields/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.1-e19","sec":"620.5.1","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Noor needs a filter for project KITE that returns Bugs that are either <b>Highest</b> priority or assigned to her teammate Ravi. Issues from other projects must not appear. Which query meets the requirement?","zh":"Noor 需要替 KITE 專案建一個 filter，回傳 priority 為 <b>Highest</b>、或指派給她同事 Ravi 的 Bug。其他專案的 issue 不能出現。哪個查詢符合需求？","zo":["<code>project = KITE AND issuetype = Bug AND priority = Highest OR assignee = ravi</code>","<code>project = KITE AND issuetype = Bug AND priority = Highest AND assignee = ravi</code>","<code>project = KITE AND issuetype = Bug AND (priority = Highest OR assignee = ravi)</code>","<code>project = KITE AND issuetype = Bug AND priority in (Highest, ravi)</code>"],"fig":"","opts":["<code>project = KITE AND issuetype = Bug AND priority = Highest OR assignee = ravi</code>","<code>project = KITE AND issuetype = Bug AND priority = Highest AND assignee = ravi</code>","<code>project = KITE AND issuetype = Bug AND (priority = Highest OR assignee = ravi)</code>","<code>project = KITE AND issuetype = Bug AND priority in (Highest, ravi)</code>"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。沒有括號時由左到右評估，會變成「KITE 的 Highest bug」或「Ravi 的任何 issue」，其他專案的 issue 也會混進來。","B":"錯。全部用 AND 表示兩個條件都要成立，只會找到 Ravi 負責的 Highest bug，範圍太小。","C":"對。用括號把 OR 包起來，project 和 issue type 條件就同時套用到兩種情況。官方建議混用 AND／OR 時用括號決定優先順序。","D":"錯。IN 清單只能放同一個欄位的值；ravi 不是 priority 的值，這樣寫沒辦法表達「指派給 Ravi」。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/what-is-advanced-search-in-jira-cloud/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/advanced-search-reference-jql-keywords/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.1-e20","sec":"620.5.1","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. Chloé saves this filter for project TAO:\n<code>project = TAO ORDER BY priority DESC, created ASC</code>\nThe project uses the default priorities (Highest, High, Medium, Low, Lowest). In what order are the issues listed?","zh":"Refer to the exhibit.（請看附圖。）Chloé 替 TAO 專案儲存了這個 filter：\n<code>project = TAO ORDER BY priority DESC, created ASC</code>\n這個專案使用預設的 priority（Highest、High、Medium、Low、Lowest）。issue 會依什麼順序列出？","zo":["TAO-3、TAO-2、TAO-1、TAO-4","TAO-2、TAO-3、TAO-1、TAO-4","TAO-4、TAO-1、TAO-3、TAO-2","TAO-4、TAO-3、TAO-1、TAO-2"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 174\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"TAO issue list\"><rect x=\"10\" y=\"8\" width=\"300\" height=\"158\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx plain\"/><text x=\"20\" y=\"28\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\">Issues in project TAO (unsorted)</text><rect x=\"16\" y=\"39\" width=\"288\" height=\"22\" rx=\"5\" class=\"sf-gray\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Key</text><text x=\"110\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Priority</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Created</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"62\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"62\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">TAO-1</text><text x=\"110\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">High</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">2026-09-02</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"86\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"86\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">TAO-2</text><text x=\"110\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Highest</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">2026-09-05</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"110\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"126\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">TAO-3</text><text x=\"110\" y=\"126\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Highest</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"126\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">2026-09-01</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"134\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"134\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"150\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">TAO-4</text><text x=\"110\" y=\"150\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Medium</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"150\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">2026-08-30</text></svg>","opts":["TAO-3, TAO-2, TAO-1, TAO-4","TAO-2, TAO-3, TAO-1, TAO-4","TAO-4, TAO-1, TAO-3, TAO-2","TAO-4, TAO-3, TAO-1, TAO-2"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。先依 priority 由高到低（Highest、High、Medium）；同為 Highest 的兩張再依 created 由舊到新，所以 TAO-3 排在 TAO-2 前面。","B":"錯。priority 排對了，但同為 Highest 的兩張要依 created ASC（由舊到新），TAO-3 比 TAO-2 早建立，應該排前面。","C":"錯。這是把 priority 當成由低到高（ASC）排的結果：Medium、High，最後才是兩張 Highest。DESC 應該由高到低。","D":"錯。這是只依 created 由舊到新排序的結果，忽略了排在第一順位的 priority DESC。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/advanced-search-reference-jql-keywords/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.1-e21","sec":"620.5.1","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"The mobile team at Corvid Apps has a shared saved filter named <b>Mobile - Open bugs</b> (filter ID 10420). Chen wants a new filter that shows only the issues from that filter that are assigned to the person viewing it, and it must keep working even if someone renames the original filter. Which query should she save?","zh":"Corvid Apps 的行動團隊有一個共用的已儲存 filter，名為 <b>Mobile - Open bugs</b>（filter ID 10420）。Chen 想建一個新 filter，只顯示該 filter 中指派給目前檢視者的 issue，而且就算有人把原本的 filter 改名，也要能繼續運作。她該儲存哪個查詢？","zo":["<code>filter = \"Mobile - Open bugs\" AND assignee = currentUser()</code>","<code>filter = 10420 AND assignee = currentUser()</code>","<code>filter IS 10420 AND assignee = currentUser()</code>","<code>filter ~ \"Mobile - Open bugs\" AND assignee = currentUser()</code>"],"fig":"","opts":["<code>filter = \"Mobile - Open bugs\" AND assignee = currentUser()</code>","<code>filter = 10420 AND assignee = currentUser()</code>","<code>filter IS 10420 AND assignee = currentUser()</code>","<code>filter ~ \"Mobile - Open bugs\" AND assignee = currentUser()</code>"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。用名稱引用可以執行，但官方提醒 filter 名稱可能被改，改名後引用它的 filter 就會壞掉。","B":"對。filter 欄位可以用 ID 引用另一個已儲存的 filter；官方說 ID 唯一且不會變，比用名稱安全。currentUser() 依每位檢視者的身分計算。","C":"錯。<code>IS</code> 只能接 EMPTY 或 NULL；filter 欄位只支援 <code>=</code>、<code>!=</code>、<code>IN</code>、<code>NOT IN</code>。","D":"錯。<code>~</code> 是文字欄位用的 CONTAINS 運算子，filter 欄位不支援。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/advanced-search-reference-jql-fields/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/advanced-search-reference-jql-functions/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.1-e22","sec":"620.5.1","dom":"620.5","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Isabela pastes several clauses into the JQL editor to test them. Which two clauses will Jira reject as invalid? (Choose two.)","zh":"Isabela 把幾個子句貼進 JQL 編輯器測試。哪兩個子句會被 Jira 判定為無效？（選兩個。）","zo":["<code>summary = \"payment timeout\"</code>","<code>description ~ \"payment timeout\"</code>","<code>priority &gt; Medium</code>","<code>status &gt; \"In Progress\"</code>","<code>votes &gt;= 5</code>","<code>fixVersion &lt; \"3.0\"</code>"],"fig":"","opts":["<code>summary = \"payment timeout\"</code>","<code>description ~ \"payment timeout\"</code>","<code>priority &gt; Medium</code>","<code>status &gt; \"In Progress\"</code>","<code>votes &gt;= 5</code>","<code>fixVersion &lt; \"3.0\"</code>"],"ans":"AD","why":{"A":"對。summary 是文字欄位，只支援 <code>~</code>、<code>!~</code> 與 IS／IS NOT，不支援 <code>=</code>；要寫 <code>summary ~ \"payment timeout\"</code>。","B":"錯。description 是文字欄位，<code>~</code> 正是它支援的運算子，這個子句合法。","C":"錯。priority 支援比較運算子，依 priority 的排列順序比較，這個子句合法。","D":"對。status 不支援 <code>&gt;</code> 等比較運算子；比較運算子只給可排序的欄位，例如日期、版本、數字與 priority。","E":"錯。votes 是數字欄位，支援 <code>&gt;=</code>，找有 5 票以上的 issue。","F":"錯。fixVersion 支援比較運算子，依專案設定的版本順序比較，這個子句合法。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/advanced-search-reference-jql-operators/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/advanced-search-reference-jql-fields/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.1-e23","sec":"620.5.1","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Ravi wants to find every issue in project SOL that <b>ever</b> belonged to the component Payments, even if the component was removed later. Which statement is true?","zh":"Ravi 想找出 SOL 專案中<b>曾經</b>屬於 Payments 這個 component 的所有 issue，即使之後 component 被移除了也要找到。哪個敘述正確？","zo":["<code>component WAS Payments</code> 會回傳它們，包括之後 Payments component 被移除的 issue。","<code>component CHANGED FROM Payments</code> 只回傳後來移除了 Payments 的 issue。","<code>component WAS IN (Payments)</code> 可以用，但只限還沒解決的 issue。","Component 不支援 WAS 或 CHANGED；改為查看每張 issue 的 History。"],"fig":"","opts":["<code>component WAS Payments</code> returns them, including issues whose Payments component was later removed.","<code>component CHANGED FROM Payments</code> returns only the issues where Payments was later removed.","<code>component WAS IN (Payments)</code> works, but only for issues that are still unresolved.","Component does not support WAS or CHANGED; check each issue's History instead."],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。WAS 只支援 Assignee、Fix Version、Priority、Reporter、Resolution、Status，component 不在其中，這樣寫無效。","B":"錯。CHANGED 同樣只支援那六個欄位，component 用 CHANGED 也是無效 JQL。","C":"錯。WAS IN 是 WAS 的多值版本，限制相同，component 不支援；也沒有「只限未解決」這種規則。","D":"對。官方 fields 頁把 WAS、CHANGED 列為 component 不支援的運算子；過去的值只能到該 issue Activity 裡的 History 查看。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/advanced-search-reference-jql-operators/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/advanced-search-reference-jql-fields/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/what-are-the-different-types-of-activity-on-an-issue/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.1-e24","sec":"620.5.1","dom":"620.5","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. It shows the complete status history of issue SOL-42, which is currently Done. The project's workflow also includes an In Review status that SOL-42 never entered. Which two queries do NOT return SOL-42? (Choose two.)","zh":"Refer to the exhibit.（請看附圖。）圖中是 issue SOL-42 完整的狀態歷史，它目前是 Done。這個專案的 workflow 也有 In Review 狀態，但 SOL-42 從沒進過。哪兩個查詢<b>不會</b>回傳 SOL-42？（選兩個。）","zo":["<code>status = \"In Progress\"</code>","<code>status WAS Blocked</code>","<code>status WAS NOT \"In Review\"</code>","<code>status WAS NOT Blocked</code>","<code>status CHANGED FROM Blocked TO \"In Progress\"</code>","<code>status CHANGED TO Done AFTER \"2026-09-08\"</code>"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 198\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"SOL-42 status history\"><rect x=\"10\" y=\"8\" width=\"300\" height=\"182\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx plain\"/><text x=\"20\" y=\"28\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\">SOL-42 status history</text><rect x=\"16\" y=\"39\" width=\"288\" height=\"22\" rx=\"5\" class=\"sf-gray\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Date</text><text x=\"110\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">From</text><text x=\"214\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">To</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"62\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"62\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">2026-09-01</text><text x=\"110\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">(created)</text><text x=\"214\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">To Do</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"86\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"86\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">2026-09-03</text><text x=\"110\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">To Do</text><text x=\"214\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">In Progress</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"110\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"126\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">2026-09-04</text><text x=\"110\" y=\"126\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">In Progress</text><text x=\"214\" y=\"126\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Blocked</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"134\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"134\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"150\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">2026-09-06</text><text x=\"110\" y=\"150\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Blocked</text><text x=\"214\" y=\"150\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">In Progress</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"158\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"158\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"174\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">2026-09-09</text><text x=\"110\" y=\"174\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">In Progress</text><text x=\"214\" y=\"174\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Done</text></svg>","opts":["<code>status = \"In Progress\"</code>","<code>status WAS Blocked</code>","<code>status WAS NOT \"In Review\"</code>","<code>status WAS NOT Blocked</code>","<code>status CHANGED FROM Blocked TO \"In Progress\"</code>","<code>status CHANGED TO Done AFTER \"2026-09-08\"</code>"],"ans":"AD","why":{"A":"要選。<code>=</code> 只看目前的值；SOL-42 現在是 Done，不是 In Progress，所以不會被找到。常見誤解：以為 = 也會比對過去的狀態。","B":"不選。WAS 找「現在是或曾經是」該值的 issue；SOL-42 在 09-04 曾經是 Blocked，所以會被找到。","C":"不選。WAS NOT 找「從來沒有過」該值的 issue；歷史中完全沒出現 In Review，所以會被找到。","D":"要選。WAS NOT Blocked 只找從未是 Blocked 的 issue，但 SOL-42 在 09-04 到 09-06 之間是 Blocked，所以不會被找到。","E":"不選。CHANGED 搭配 FROM／TO 找發生過這次變更的 issue；09-06 由 Blocked 改回 In Progress，會被找到。","F":"不選。CHANGED 可加 AFTER 日期；SOL-42 在 2026-09-09 改成 Done，晚於 09-08，所以會被找到。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/advanced-search-reference-jql-operators/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.2-e01","sec":"620.5.2","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. Ines, a release manager at Quillstone, sends a screenshot of a gadget from her dashboard with the gadget name hidden. Which gadget is it?","zh":"看附圖。Quillstone 的 release manager Ines 傳來她 dashboard 上某個 gadget 的截圖，gadget 名稱被遮住了。這是哪個 gadget？","zo":["Sprint Health gadget","依 Fix Version 分組的 Issue Statistics gadget","Road Map gadget","Issue Calendar gadget"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 200\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"名稱已遮住的 gadget 示意\"><rect x=\"10\" y=\"8\" width=\"300\" height=\"184\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx plain\"/><text x=\"20\" y=\"28\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\">Gadget ?・Next 30 days</text><text x=\"20\" y=\"50\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\">MOB</text><text x=\"32\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">v2.3　10/02</text><rect x=\"32\" y=\"76\" width=\"206\" height=\"11\" rx=\"5\" class=\"sf-gray\"/><rect x=\"32\" y=\"76\" width=\"144.2\" height=\"11\" rx=\"5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"300\" y=\"86\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">14/20</text><text x=\"32\" y=\"104\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">v2.4　10/20</text><rect x=\"32\" y=\"110\" width=\"206\" height=\"11\" rx=\"5\" class=\"sf-gray\"/><rect x=\"32\" y=\"110\" width=\"41.2\" height=\"11\" rx=\"5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"300\" y=\"120\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">3/15</text><text x=\"20\" y=\"150\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\">WEB</text><text x=\"32\" y=\"170\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">2026.10　10/15</text><rect x=\"160\" y=\"161\" width=\"78\" height=\"11\" rx=\"5\" class=\"sf-gray\"/><rect x=\"160\" y=\"161\" width=\"39\" height=\"11\" rx=\"5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"300\" y=\"170\" text-anchor=\"end\" class=\"s\">8/16</text></svg>","opts":["Sprint Health gadget","Issue Statistics gadget grouped by Fix Version","Road Map gadget","Issue Calendar gadget"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。Sprint Health 接 board 與 sprint，畫的是一條依欄位上色的進度條，再加 Time elapsed、Scope change 等數字；圖上卻是依 project 分組的多個版本。","B":"錯。Issue Statistics 把結果依一個欄位分組，列出件數與百分比；它不會顯示版本的發布日，也沒有每個版本的完成進度條。","C":"對。Road Map gadget 列出指定天數內要 release 的版本，依 project 分組，每個版本附發布日與完成進度（例如 14/20）。常見誤解：以為它是橫向時間軸長條圖，其實是版本清單加進度條。","D":"錯。Issue Calendar gadget 用月曆格式依 due date 排出 issue 與版本，而且要先安裝相關外掛；圖上沒有月曆格，而是版本清單與進度條。"},"note":"現行 UI 把 issue 改叫 work item、project 改叫 space；gadget 清單裡的名稱也跟著改（例如 Work item Calendar Gadget）。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/use-dashboard-gadgets/","https://confluence.atlassian.com/jira061/jira-user-s-guide/customizing-the-dashboard/adding-the-road-map-gadget"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.2-e02","sec":"620.5.2","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. Tomasz configured a Road Map gadget for the MOB and WEB projects. The release manager says that a WEB version due for release in five weeks is missing from the gadget. What should Tomasz change?","zh":"看附圖。Tomasz 為 MOB 和 WEB 兩個 project 設定了一個 Road Map gadget。Release manager 說，WEB 有一個預計五週後 release 的版本沒有出現在 gadget 上。Tomasz 應該改什麼？","zo":["把 Number of Results 從 10 加到 50","把 Days 從 14 改成 35 以上","把兩個 project 換成放 WEB sprint 的那個 board","把 Refresh Interval 改成每 15 分鐘"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 348\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Road Map gadget 設定畫面示意\"><rect x=\"0.5\" y=\"0.5\" width=\"379\" height=\"347\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"380\" height=\"34\" rx=\"0\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Dashboard › Edit gadget</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Road Map</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Projects</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"95\" width=\"356\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"113\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">MOB, WEB</text><path d=\"M350,106 l5,5 l5,-5\" class=\"ln ink\" style=\"stroke-width:1.6\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"144\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Days</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"150\" width=\"356\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"168\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">14</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"199\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Number of Results</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"205\" width=\"356\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"223\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">10</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"254\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Refresh Interval</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"260\" width=\"356\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"278\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Every hour</text><path d=\"M350,271 l5,5 l5,-5\" class=\"ln ink\" style=\"stroke-width:1.6\"/><rect x=\"12\" y=\"298\" width=\"46.0\" height=\"26\" rx=\"6\" class=\"fl-brand\"/><text x=\"35.0\" y=\"315\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"w\">Save</text></svg>","opts":["Increase Number of Results from 10 to 50","Change Days from 14 to 35 or more","Replace the two projects with the board that contains the WEB sprints","Change Refresh Interval to every 15 minutes"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。Number of Results 是每頁最多顯示幾個版本；五週後到期的版本根本不在 14 天範圍內，加大筆數也不會讓它出現。","B":"對。Days 決定 gadget 往後看幾天內 due for release 的版本。五週後才到期的版本超出 14 天範圍，把 Days 改成 35 以上就會列進來。","C":"錯。Road Map 的來源是一個或多個 project，看的是版本的發布日；它不接 board，也跟 sprint 無關。","D":"錯。Refresh Interval 只決定 gadget 多久重新抓一次資料，不會改變納入哪些版本的天數範圍。"},"note":"設定欄位（Projects、Days、Number of Results、Refresh Interval）依官方 Road Map gadget 說明頁；現行 Cloud 把 project 改叫 space。","src":["https://confluence.atlassian.com/jira061/jira-user-s-guide/customizing-the-dashboard/adding-the-road-map-gadget","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/use-dashboard-gadgets/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.2-e03","sec":"620.5.2","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Olumide is the product owner of a Scrum team at Brightwake. For version BWK 4.0 only, he wants to see a predicted release date calculated from the team's velocity, including optimistic and pessimistic dates. What should he use?","zh":"Olumide 是 Brightwake 一個 Scrum 團隊的 product owner。他只想針對 BWK 4.0 這個版本，看到依團隊 velocity 算出的預測 release 日期，還要包含樂觀和悲觀的日期。他該用什麼？","zo":["設定 BWK project、90 天的 Road Map gadget","接團隊 board 的 Days Remaining in Sprint gadget","使用 filter <code>fixVersion = \"BWK 4.0\"</code> 的 Created vs Resolved gadget","團隊 board 的 Version Report"],"fig":"","opts":["A Road Map gadget configured for the BWK project and 90 days","A Days Remaining in Sprint gadget for the team's board","A Created vs Resolved gadget using the filter <code>fixVersion = \"BWK 4.0\"</code>","The Version Report for the team's board"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。常見誤解：把 Road Map 當成版本預測工具。它只列出指定天數內到期的多個版本與完成進度，不會用 velocity 算預測日，也沒有樂觀／悲觀區間。","B":"錯。Days Remaining in Sprint 只顯示目前 sprint 還剩幾天，對象是 sprint 而不是版本，也不會計算發布日。","C":"錯。Created vs Resolved 比較一段期間內建立與解決的件數，看得出 backlog 有沒有累積，但不會預測版本何時完成。","D":"對。Version Report 依版本開始以來的平均 velocity 和剩餘估算，畫出 Predicted Release Date，並加減 10% 給出樂觀、悲觀日期。它是 Scrum board 的報表，一次看一個版本。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-version-report/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/use-dashboard-gadgets/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.2-e04","sec":"620.5.2","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Aiko manages releases for three company-managed projects: PAY, CART, and SHIP. She already uses a Road Map gadget for PAY on her release dashboard. She now needs the CART and SHIP releases on the same dashboard, and a colleague says the gadget supports only one project. Which option meets the requirement with the least effort?","zh":"Aiko 負責三個 company-managed project（PAY、CART、SHIP）的 release。她的 release dashboard 上已經有一個接 PAY 的 Road Map gadget。現在她也要在同一個 dashboard 上看到 CART 和 SHIP 的 release，而同事說這個 gadget 只能接一個 project。哪個做法最省事又符合需求？","zo":["編輯現有的 Road Map gadget，在 Projects 加入 CART 和 SHIP","再加兩個 Road Map gadget，每個 project 一個","建立一個 project category，並替它加一個 Filter Results gadget","把這個 gadget 換成每個 board 各一個 Sprint Health gadget"],"fig":"","opts":["Edit the existing Road Map gadget and add CART and SHIP to Projects","Add two more Road Map gadgets, one per project","Create a project category and a Filter Results gadget for it","Replace the gadget with a Sprint Health gadget for each board"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。同事說錯了：Road Map 的 Projects 欄位可以選一個或多個 project（也能選 All Projects）。編輯現有 gadget、把 CART 和 SHIP 加進去，一個 gadget 就列出三個 project 的到期版本與進度。","B":"錯。多放兩個 Road Map 也看得到版本，但這是聽信「只能接一個 project」的誤解而多做工。常見誤解：只能顯示單一 project 的是 timeline，不是 Road Map gadget。","C":"錯。Filter Results 列的是一筆一筆的 issue，不是版本；它不會依發布日列出即將 release 的版本，也沒有每個版本的進度條，還得另外建 category。","D":"錯。Sprint Health 接 board 與 sprint，顯示單一 sprint 的進度與 scope change；它看的是 sprint 而不是版本，無法取代 Road Map。"},"note":"","src":["https://confluence.atlassian.com/jira061/jira-user-s-guide/customizing-the-dashboard/adding-the-road-map-gadget","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/use-dashboard-gadgets/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.2-e05","sec":"620.5.2","dom":"620.5","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Rafael is writing a quick reference about the Road Map gadget for new team leads at Harborlight. Which two statements about the Road Map gadget are true? (Choose two.)","zh":"Rafael 正在替 Harborlight 的新任 team lead 寫一份 Road Map gadget 速查表。下列哪兩個關於 Road Map gadget 的敘述正確？（選兩個）","zo":["它用一個 Scrum board 和其中一個進行中的 sprint 當資料來源。","它顯示在指定天數內要 release 的版本。","它像 project timeline 一樣，把 epic 畫成時間軸上的橫條。","它的日期範圍會跳過 board 上設定的非工作日。","它摘要每個列出版本中 issue 的完成進度。","它只顯示已經 release 的版本。"],"fig":"","opts":["It uses a Scrum board and one of its active sprints as its data source.","It shows versions that are due for release within a specified number of days.","It draws epics as horizontal bars on a timeline, like the project timeline.","Its date range skips the non-working days configured on the board.","It summarizes progress toward completing the issues in each listed version.","It shows only versions that have already been released."],"ans":"BE","why":{"A":"錯。接 board 加 sprint 的是 Sprint Health、Sprint Burndown、Days Remaining 這三個；Road Map 的來源是一個或多個 project。","B":"對。官方說明 Road Map 顯示在指定期間內 due for release 的版本，期間用 Days 欄位設定天數，例如未來 30 天。","C":"錯。常見誤解：以為名字叫 Road Map 就是時間軸長條圖。畫 epic 長條的是 project 的 timeline；Road Map gadget 是版本清單加進度條。","D":"錯。官方列出會套用 board working days 的 gadget 只有 Sprint Health 與 Burndown gadget；Road Map 不接 board，也不在清單裡。","E":"對。每個版本旁邊有一條進度條，摘要該版本 issue 的完成情況；點進度條可以打開該版本的 issue 清單。","F":"錯。Road Map 看的是「即將」release 的版本；已經 release 的版本要到 Releases 頁面或 Version Report 查看。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/use-dashboard-gadgets/","https://confluence.atlassian.com/jira061/jira-user-s-guide/customizing-the-dashboard/adding-the-road-map-gadget","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-working-days/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.2-e06","sec":"620.5.2","dom":"620.5","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Leila is the board administrator of the LUM Scrum board at Lumora Health. She adds three public holidays as non-working days in the board's Working days settings, then checks the Jira Cloud documentation on working days to see which reports and gadgets will reflect the change. All items below point at the LUM board or project. Which two items are NOT listed there as reflecting the board's working days? (Choose two.)","zh":"Leila 是 Lumora Health 的 LUM Scrum board 的 board administrator。她在 board 的 Working days 設定裡，把三個國定假日加成非工作日，接著查 Jira Cloud 關於 working days 的官方文件，確認哪些報表和 gadget 會反映這個變更。下列項目全都指向 LUM board 或 project。哪兩項「沒有」被列為會反映 board 的 working days？（選兩個）","zo":["Sprint Health gadget","Days Remaining in Sprint gadget","Epic Report","Sprint Burndown gadget","Road Map gadget"],"fig":"","opts":["Sprint Health gadget","Days Remaining in Sprint gadget","Epic Report","Sprint Burndown gadget","Road Map gadget"],"ans":"BE","why":{"A":"正確敘述（不選）。Sprint Health 在 Cloud 官方清單上；清單的 gadget 只有 Sprint Health Gadget 與 Burndown Gadget 兩個，它接 board，會用這個 board 的非工作日。","B":"錯誤敘述（要選）。常見誤解：以為接 board 的三個 sprint gadget 都吃 working days。Days Remaining 雖然也接 board，但 Cloud 官方清單沒有列它；Data Center 文件說它顯示剩餘 working days，考試以 Cloud 清單為準。","C":"正確敘述（不選）。Epic Report 是清單上的五張報表之一（Burndown Chart、Sprint Report、Epic Report、Version Report、Control Chart），會反映 board 的非工作日。","D":"正確敘述（不選）。Sprint Burndown 就是官方清單寫的 Burndown Gadget，和 board 上的 Burndown Chart 一樣會跳過非工作日。","E":"錯誤敘述（要選）。Road Map 的來源是 project，列出未來 N 天要 release 的版本與進度；它根本不接 board，也不在清單上。"},"note":"Cloud 的 Configure working days 頁只列 Sprint Health Gadget 與 Burndown Gadget；Data Center 的 gadget 清單把 Days Remaining 描述成「還剩幾個 working days」，考試以 Cloud 清單為準，所以題幹限定依 Cloud 文件。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-working-days/","https://confluence.atlassian.com/jirasoftwareserver0913/gadgets-for-jira-applications-1353587338.html"],"lvl":3,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.2-e07","sec":"620.5.2","dom":"620.5","type":"multi","n":3,"stem":"Hyun-woo sets Saturdays, Sundays, and a company retreat day as non-working days on the TSR Scrum board at Tessaract Labs. Which three items will reflect this change? (Choose three.)","zh":"Hyun-woo 在 Tessaract Labs 的 TSR Scrum board 上，把週六、週日和一天公司員工旅遊設成非工作日。下列哪三項會反映這個變更？（選三個）","zo":["TSR board 的 Velocity Chart","TSR board 的 Control Chart","指向 TSR board 的 Sprint Health gadget","TSR board 的 Cumulative Flow Diagram","TSR board 的 Version Report","TSR project 的 Created vs Resolved gadget"],"fig":"","opts":["The Velocity Chart for the TSR board","The Control Chart for the TSR board","A Sprint Health gadget that points at the TSR board","The Cumulative Flow Diagram for the TSR board","The Version Report for the TSR board","A Created vs Resolved gadget for the TSR project"],"ans":"BCE","why":{"A":"錯。Velocity Chart 以 sprint 為單位，比較每個 sprint 承諾與完成的估算量；它不在官方 working days 清單上。","B":"對。官方清單的五張報表是 Burndown Chart、Sprint Report、Epic Report、Version Report、Control Chart；Control Chart 在清單裡，所以會反映這個 board 設定的非工作日。","C":"對。官方清單上的 gadget 只有兩個：Sprint Health 與 Burndown gadget。這個 Sprint Health 接的正是 TSR board，所以會反映這次新增的非工作日。","D":"錯。Cumulative Flow Diagram 顯示各欄位件數隨時間的變化，不在官方列出的五張報表裡，不會套用非工作日。","E":"對。Version Report 在官方清單的五張報表中，會反映 board 設定的非工作日；它依 velocity 預測版本的發布日。","F":"錯。Created vs Resolved gadget 的來源是 filter 或 project，依日曆期間畫建立與解決兩條線；它不讀 board 設定，也不在官方清單上。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-working-days/"],"lvl":3,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.2-e08","sec":"620.5.2","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Yusuf, a project administrator at Nordhaven, notices that the Sprint Health gadget on his team dashboard counts the Lunar New Year holiday as part of the sprint. The gadget points at a board located in his project. What should he do?","zh":"Nordhaven 的 project administrator Yusuf 發現，團隊 dashboard 上的 Sprint Health gadget 把農曆新年假期算進了 sprint。這個 gadget 指向一個放在他 project 裡的 board。他該怎麼做？","zo":["編輯 Sprint Health gadget，打開它「排除週末與假日」的選項","請 Jira administrator 到全域 time tracking 設定修改 Working days per week","在 board 的 Working days 設定裡，把假日加到 Non-working days","打開 dashboard 的自動刷新，讓 gadget 每天重新計算"],"fig":"","opts":["Edit the Sprint Health gadget and turn on its option to exclude weekends and holidays","Ask a Jira administrator to change Working days per week in the global time tracking settings","Add the holiday dates under Non-working days in the board's Working days settings","Turn on automatic refresh for the dashboard so that the gadget recalculates every day"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。Sprint Health gadget 的設定只有 board、sprint 與更新頻率，沒有排除假日的選項；非工作日一定要到 board 上設定。","B":"錯。Time tracking 的 Working days per week 是一週有幾天的換算值，用在工時單位；它不會把特定假日從 sprint 報表或 gadget 中排除。","C":"對。到 board 的 Configure board → Working days，在 Non-working days 用日期選擇器加入假日。board 所在 project 的 admin 或 board admin 都能設定，Sprint Health gadget 會跟著反映。","D":"錯。自動刷新只決定 dashboard 多久重新載入一次；board 的日曆設定沒改，假日照樣會被算進 sprint。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-working-days/","https://confluence.atlassian.com/agile064/jira-agile-user-s-guide/using-the-jira-agile-gadgets/using-the-sprint-health-gadget","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-time-tracking/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.2-e09","sec":"620.5.2","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Chiara is training new scrum masters at Vantory on the board's Working days setting. Which statement is NOT true?","zh":"Chiara 正在教 Vantory 的新任 scrum master 認識 board 的 Working days 設定。下列哪個敘述「不」正確？","zo":["Working days 是每個 board 各自設定的。","Working days 是在 dashboard 上設定，而不是在 board 上。","Board administrator 可以加入單次的非工作日，例如公司放假日。","Control Chart 和 Sprint Report 會反映 board 的 working days。"],"fig":"","opts":["Working days are configured separately for each board.","Working days are configured on the dashboard rather than on the board.","A board administrator can add one-off non-working dates, such as a company holiday.","The Control Chart and the Sprint Report reflect the board's working days."],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"正確敘述（不選）。Working days 是 board 設定裡的一頁，路徑是 Configure board → Working days；每個 board 各自設定、互不影響。","B":"錯誤敘述（要選）。Dashboard 沒有 working days 設定，它屬於 board。只有接該 board 的 Sprint Health 與 Burndown gadget 會反映。常見誤解：以為整個 dashboard 會套用同一份日曆，或所有 gadget 都吃 working days。","C":"正確敘述（不選）。Non-working days 可以用日期選擇器加入國定假日或單次休假日；board admin 或 board 所在 project 的 admin 都能設定。","D":"正確敘述（不選）。官方清單的五張報表是 Burndown Chart、Sprint Report、Epic Report、Version Report、Control Chart，這兩張都在裡面。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-working-days/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.2-e10","sec":"620.5.2","dom":"620.5","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Mateo is building a release dashboard at Ferrovia with a Road Map gadget and a Sprint Health gadget side by side. Which two statements are true? (Choose two.)","zh":"Mateo 正在替 Ferrovia 做一個 release dashboard，把 Road Map gadget 和 Sprint Health gadget 並排放。下列哪兩個敘述正確？（選兩個）","zo":["Road Map gadget 的設定是一個或多個 project，加上天數。","Road Map gadget 的設定是一個 board 和一個 sprint。","Sprint Health gadget 可以改用 saved filter，不必接 board。","兩個 gadget 都會反映 board 的 working days 設定。","Sprint Health gadget 用 board 的 estimation statistic 計算 scope change。"],"fig":"","opts":["The Road Map gadget is configured with one or more projects and a number of days.","The Road Map gadget is configured with a board and a sprint.","The Sprint Health gadget can use a saved filter instead of a board.","Both gadgets reflect the board's working days configuration.","The Sprint Health gadget calculates scope change with the board's estimation statistic."],"ans":"AE","why":{"A":"對。Road Map 的設定欄位是 Projects（可多選）與 Days，另外還有顯示筆數與更新頻率；它完全不需要 board。","B":"錯。Board 加 sprint 是 Sprint Health、Sprint Burndown、Days Remaining 的設定方式；Road Map 看的是 project 裡的版本。","C":"錯。Sprint Health 只能先選 board 再選 sprint，不能改接 saved filter；需要 saved filter 的是 Filter Results、Two Dimensional 這類 gadget。","D":"錯。常見誤解：以為版本類和 sprint 類 gadget 都吃 working days。官方清單只有 Sprint Health 與 Burndown gadget，Road Map 不在其中。","E":"對。Sprint 開始後加入或移除 issue 算 scope change，百分比用 board 設定的 estimation statistic 計算，例如開始時 50 點、加入 5 點就是 10%。"},"note":"","src":["https://confluence.atlassian.com/jira061/jira-user-s-guide/customizing-the-dashboard/adding-the-road-map-gadget","https://confluence.atlassian.com/agile064/jira-agile-user-s-guide/using-the-jira-agile-gadgets/using-the-sprint-health-gadget","https://confluence.atlassian.com/jirasoftwareserver0913/gadgets-for-jira-applications-1353587338.html","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-working-days/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.2-e11","sec":"620.5.2","dom":"620.5","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Fatima is a new analyst at Sundial Freight. She is a regular Jira user, and her Jira administrator has not granted her the Share dashboards and filters global permission. Which two actions can she still perform? (Choose two.)","zh":"Fatima 是 Sundial Freight 的新進分析師。她是一般 Jira 使用者，Jira administrator 沒有給她 Share dashboards and filters 這個 global permission。下列哪兩件事她仍然做得到？（選兩個）","zo":["把自己的 dashboard 分享給 finance group 當 viewer","還原一個她自己丟進 trash 的 dashboard","建立一個新的 dashboard","在自己的 dashboard 上新增並設定 gadget","把同事的 dashboard 擁有者改成她自己"],"fig":"","opts":["Share her dashboard with the finance group as viewers","Restore a dashboard that she moved to the trash","Create a new dashboard","Add and configure gadgets on her own dashboard","Change the owner of a colleague's dashboard to herself"],"ans":"CD","why":{"A":"錯。把 dashboard 分享給 group 需要 global permission Share dashboards and filters；她沒有這個權限，dashboard 只能自己看。","B":"錯。丟進 trash 的 dashboard 只有 Jira admin 能還原，建立者自己也救不回來；60 天後會永久刪除。","C":"對。官方寫明任何 Jira 使用者都能建立 dashboard，不需要特別權限。權限只卡在「分享出去」這一步，也就是 Share dashboards and filters。","D":"對。建立 dashboard 的人就是擁有者，可以編輯自己的 dashboard，包括加 gadget、設定 gadget、換版面，這些都不需要分享權限。","E":"錯。更換 dashboard 擁有者是 Jira admin 的功能，要在 Settings → System → Shared items 操作，需要 Administer Jira global permission；一般使用者做不到。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/create-and-edit-dashboards/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/manage-shared-dashboards/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/what-are-global-permissions-and-what-do-they-do/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.2-e12","sec":"620.5.2","dom":"620.5","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Nkechi wants to share her Sundial Freight status dashboard with Public so that customers can view it without logging in, but Public is not available as a sharing option. Which two statements are true? (Choose two.)","zh":"Nkechi 想把她在 Sundial Freight 的狀態 dashboard 分享給 Public，讓客戶不用登入就能看，但分享選項裡沒有 Public。下列哪兩個敘述正確？（選兩個）","zo":["Dashboard 可以開啟公開分享，但 filter 永遠不行。","Jira administrator 必須先在網站的 General configuration 打開 Public sharing。","公開分享的 dashboard 只有持有 Jira 授權的人看得到。","如果網站是 Free 方案，dashboard 就不能公開分享。","打開 Public sharing 會自動把所有既有的 dashboard 變成公開。"],"fig":"","opts":["Public sharing can be turned on for dashboards but never for filters.","A Jira administrator must first turn on Public sharing in the site's General configuration.","A publicly shared dashboard is visible only to people who have a Jira license.","If the site is on the Free plan, the dashboard can't be shared publicly.","Turning on Public sharing automatically makes every existing dashboard public."],"ans":"BD","why":{"A":"錯。Public sharing 這個網站設定同時管 filter 與 dashboard；網站開放之後，兩者都可以公開分享。","B":"對。要公開分享 dashboard 或 filter，Jira admin 必須先到 General configuration 的 Options 打開 Public sharing；網站沒開，使用者就無法分享給 Public。","C":"錯。公開分享的意思是沒登入的人也看得到，而且會被網路搜尋到；不是只給有 Jira 授權的人看。","D":"對。官方寫明 Free 方案的 Jira 網站不能對外公開；Standard、Premium、Enterprise 方案才能公開分享 filter 與 dashboard，而且還要 Jira admin 先打開 Public sharing。","E":"錯。打開 Public sharing 只是「允許」公開分享，不會自動公開任何資料；每個 dashboard 仍要由擁有者自己改分享設定。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/allow-dashboards-and-filters-in-your-site-to-be-shared-publicly/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/manage-shared-dashboards/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.2-e13","sec":"620.5.2","dom":"620.5","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Dmitri, a Jira administrator at Brightwake, plans to reorganize the default dashboard. Which two statements about the default dashboard are true? (Choose two.)","zh":"Brightwake 的 Jira administrator Dmitri 打算重新整理 default dashboard。下列哪兩個關於 default dashboard 的敘述正確？（選兩個）","zo":["他做的變更，也會改變所有目前使用 default dashboard 的使用者所看到的畫面。","他可以把它分享給特定 group，例如 brightwake-engineering。","它不能被刪除。","沒有權限看某個 gadget 的使用者，會在那個位置看到錯誤訊息。","每個使用者各有一份私人副本，所以他的變更只影響新建立的使用者。"],"fig":"","opts":["Changes he makes also change the dashboard for all users who currently use the default dashboard.","He can share it with a specific group, such as brightwake-engineering.","It cannot be deleted.","Users who lack permission to see a gadget get an error message in its place.","Each user gets a private copy, so his changes affect only newly created users."],"ans":"AC","why":{"A":"對。官方說明：對 default dashboard 的所有變更，會同時改變所有正在使用它的使用者畫面；所以改版前要先想清楚影響範圍。","B":"錯。Default dashboard 只能分享給 My organization（組織內登入的人）或 Public，不能指定特定 group、space 或個人。","C":"對。Default dashboard 就是登入後預設看到的那一張，官方寫明它不能刪除；Jira admin 只能調整 gadget、版面和檢視對象。","D":"錯。使用者沒有權限看的 gadget 會直接不顯示，例如 Administration gadget 只有 admin 看得到；不會出現錯誤訊息。","E":"錯。Default dashboard 只有一份，由 Jira admin 管理；使用者不會各拿一份副本，想自訂要另外建立自己的 dashboard。"},"note":"考試時代多稱 System dashboard；現行官方頁叫 default dashboard。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-the-default-dashboard/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/what-is-a-jira-dashboard/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.2-e14","sec":"620.5.2","dom":"620.5","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Elif, a Jira administrator, restores a shared dashboard from the trash 20 days after it was moved there. The dashboard no longer has an assigned owner because its creator left the company. Which two outcomes should Elif expect? (Choose two.)","zh":"Jira administrator Elif 在一個共用 dashboard 被丟進 trash 20 天後把它還原。因為建立者已經離職，這個 dashboard 目前沒有指定擁有者。Elif 應該預期哪兩個結果？（選兩個）","zo":["丟進 trash 之前設定的所有分享權限都會還原。","還原後會變成私人 dashboard，每個分享都要重新設定。","這個 dashboard 會取代網站的 default dashboard。","還原會失敗，因為只有原擁有者能還原 dashboard。","Elif 會成為還原後 dashboard 的擁有者。"],"fig":"","opts":["All sharing permissions granted before the dashboard was trashed are restored.","The dashboard is restored as private, and every share must be recreated.","The dashboard replaces the site's default dashboard.","The restore fails because only the original owner can restore a dashboard.","Elif becomes the owner of the restored dashboard."],"ans":"AE","why":{"A":"對。從 trash 還原後，dashboard 會重新出現在目錄與搜尋結果裡，丟進 trash 之前設定的所有分享權限也會一起還原。","B":"錯。還原不會把 dashboard 變回私人；原本的分享設定會一起回來，不必重新設定一次。","C":"錯。還原只是把它放回原本的狀態，不會取代 default dashboard；default dashboard 由 Jira admin 在 System 設定裡另外管理。","D":"錯。只有 Jira admin 能從 trash 還原 dashboard，原擁有者自己反而沒辦法；在 60 天內都可以還原。","E":"對。官方說明：沒有指定擁有者的 dashboard，由執行還原的 admin 成為擁有者；之後可以在 Shared items 用 Change owner 轉給別人。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/manage-shared-dashboards/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/create-and-edit-dashboards/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.2-e15","sec":"620.5.2","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Kofi owns the Harborlight Ops dashboard, which is shared with several groups. Kofi is leaving the company. Ana must become the dashboard's owner, and all existing shares must be kept. What should be done?","zh":"Kofi 擁有 Harborlight Ops 這個 dashboard，它分享給好幾個 group。Kofi 即將離職。Ana 必須成為這個 dashboard 的擁有者，而且所有既有的分享都要保留。應該怎麼做？","zo":["由 Jira administrator 把 dashboard 的擁有者改成 Ana。","Ana 複製這個 dashboard，再把副本分享給同樣的 group。","Kofi 把 Ana 加進 dashboard 的 Editors 欄位。","由 project administrator 在 project 設定裡轉移擁有權。"],"fig":"","opts":["A Jira administrator changes the dashboard's owner to Ana.","Ana copies the dashboard and shares the copy with the same groups.","Kofi adds Ana to the dashboard's Editors field.","A project administrator transfers ownership from the project settings."],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。更換擁有者是 Jira admin 的功能：到 Settings → System → Shared items → Dashboards 找到 dashboard，選 Change owner。分享設定不變，新擁有者就能編輯管理。需要 Administer Jira global permission。","B":"錯。Copy dashboard 會以原本的為底另建一張新的；原本那張的擁有者仍是 Kofi，同事收藏的也還是舊的那張。","C":"錯。加進 Editors 只讓 Ana 能編輯內容，擁有者仍然是 Kofi；題目要求 Ana 成為擁有者，所以不符合。","D":"錯。Project settings 裡沒有轉移 dashboard 擁有者的功能；換擁有者要由 Jira admin 在 System 的 Shared items 操作。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/manage-shared-dashboards/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.2-e16","sec":"620.5.2","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Luca's company runs two Jira Cloud sites, one for engineering and one for customer support. He wants a single built-in Pie Chart gadget that combines issues from both sites. What is the best response?","zh":"Luca 的公司有兩個 Jira Cloud 網站，一個給工程部門、一個給客服部門。他想用「一個」內建的 Pie Chart gadget，把兩個網站的 issue 合在一起呈現。最好的回應是什麼？","zo":["加一個 Pie Chart gadget，使用涵蓋兩個網站 project 的 saved filter。","內建 gadget 無法跨多個 Jira 網站顯示資料，所以改用 Marketplace app。","把 dashboard 分享給兩個網站的 group，讓 gadget 合併它們的資料。","把 Pie Chart gadget 的來源設成兩個 project。"],"fig":"","opts":["Add a Pie Chart gadget that uses a saved filter covering projects from both sites.","Built-in gadgets can't display data across multiple Jira sites, so use a Marketplace app.","Share the dashboard with groups from both sites so that the gadget merges their data.","Configure the Pie Chart gadget with two projects as its source."],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。Saved filter 只能搜尋同一個 Jira 網站裡的 project，撈不到另一個網站的 issue；官方也明說內建 gadget 不能跨站台。","B":"對。官方說明內建 gadget 有限制：不能跨多個 Jira 站台顯示資料，也不能把多個資料來源合成一張圖；這類需求要改用 Atlassian Marketplace 的第三方 app。","C":"錯。分享 dashboard 只決定誰能打開它，不會改變 gadget 的資料來源，更不會把兩個網站的資料合在一起。","D":"錯。Pie Chart 的來源是一個 project 或一個 saved filter；就算想看多個 project 也要透過 filter，而且仍然只限同一個網站。"},"note":"現行 UI 把 issue 改叫 work item。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/add-and-customize-gadgets/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.2-e17","sec":"620.5.2","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"The Vantory team estimates only in story points and never logs time. Mei adds a Workload Pie Chart gadget for the VNT project to show each assignee's share of the remaining work, but the chart shows no meaningful data. What is the most likely cause?","zh":"Vantory 團隊只用 story points 估算，從來不記工時。Mei 替 VNT project 加了一個 Workload Pie Chart gadget，想看每個 assignee 分到多少剩餘工作，但圖上沒有有意義的資料。最可能的原因是什麼？","zo":["Workload Pie Chart gadget 只接受 board 當資料來源。","Dashboard 沒有分享給 VNT project。","這個 gadget 只納入過去 30 天內解決的 issue。","這個 gadget 用 time tracking 欄位計算工作量，不看 Story points。"],"fig":"","opts":["The Workload Pie Chart gadget accepts only a board as its data source.","The dashboard has not been shared with the VNT project.","The gadget includes only issues that were resolved in the last 30 days.","The gadget calculates workload from time tracking fields, not Story points."],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。Workload Pie Chart 的來源是 project 或 saved filter，不是 board；Mei 選 VNT project 當來源本身沒有錯。","B":"錯。分享設定只決定誰能看到 dashboard；Mei 就是建立者，自己看不到資料不是分享造成的。","C":"錯。題目的症狀是整張圖沒有有意義的資料；團隊從不記工時才是根本原因，改變納入哪些 issue 也生不出工時數字。","D":"對。官方舉例：Workload Pie Chart 依靠 Original estimate、Time spent、Current estimate 這類工時欄位，不看 Story points。團隊只估點、不記工時，圖就沒有可算的資料。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/add-and-customize-gadgets/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.2-e18","sec":"620.5.2","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Sanjay leads the support team at Lumora Health. For the past 30 days, he wants a bar chart showing how many issues were due on each day. Which gadget should he add?","zh":"Sanjay 帶領 Lumora Health 的客服團隊。他想要一張過去 30 天的長條圖，顯示每一天有幾張 issue 到期。他該加哪個 gadget？","zo":["Recently Created Issues","Average Age","Time Since Issues","Created vs Resolved"],"fig":"","opts":["Recently Created Issues","Average Age","Time Since Issues","Created vs Resolved"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。Recently Created Issues 只看「建立」這件事，畫出每期新建幾張、其中幾張已解決；不能改成依 Due date 統計。","B":"錯。Average Age 顯示未解決 issue 平均放了幾天，看的是存量的年齡，不是某個日期欄位每天發生幾件。","C":"對。Time Since Issues 依指定的日期欄位（Created、Updated、Due、Resolved 或自訂欄位），畫出每個期間有幾張 issue；選 Due 就能看每天有幾張到期。","D":"錯。Created vs Resolved 比較建立與解決兩條線，用來看 backlog 是否累積；它不能改用 Due date 當日期欄位。"},"note":"現行 UI 名稱是 Time Since Work items Gadget。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/use-dashboard-gadgets/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.2-e19","sec":"620.5.2","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Bjorn wants to know whether his team is getting faster at closing bugs. He needs a bar chart showing, per period, how many days on average fixed bugs stayed open before they were fixed. Which gadget fits?","zh":"Bjorn 想知道團隊處理 bug 是不是越來越快。他需要一張長條圖，依期間顯示已修好的 bug 平均開了幾天才修好。哪個 gadget 適合？","zo":["Average Age","Average Time in Status","Recently Created Issues","Resolution Time"],"fig":"","opts":["Average Age","Average Time in Status","Recently Created Issues","Resolution Time"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。Average Age 看的是「還沒解決」的 issue 平均放了幾天；題目要的是已解決的 bug 花了幾天，方向剛好相反。","B":"錯。Average Time in Status 顯示 issue 在各狀態平均停留幾天，可以找出卡住的狀態，但不是從建立到解決的總天數。","C":"錯。Recently Created Issues 顯示每期新建幾張、其中幾張已解決，是件數而不是花費的天數。","D":"對。Resolution Time 用長條圖顯示已解決 issue 的平均解決天數，也就是建立到解決的時間差；長條越來越低，代表團隊解得越快。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/use-dashboard-gadgets/","https://confluence.atlassian.com/jirasoftwareserver0913/gadgets-for-jira-applications-1353587338.html"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.2-e20","sec":"620.5.2","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. Aroha shared the Release Radar dashboard as shown. Members of the qa-team group can open the dashboard, but they can't add or rearrange gadgets. What should Aroha do?","zh":"看附圖。Aroha 照圖中的設定分享了 Release Radar dashboard。qa-team group 的成員打得開這個 dashboard，卻不能新增或調整 gadget。Aroha 該怎麼做？","zo":["把 qa-team group 加進 Editors 欄位","給 qa-team Share dashboards and filters 這個 global permission","把 gadget 用的 saved filter 分享給 qa-team","在相關 project 給 qa-team Browse Projects 權限"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 348\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Dashboard 分享設定示意\"><rect x=\"0.5\" y=\"0.5\" width=\"379\" height=\"347\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"380\" height=\"34\" rx=\"0\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Dashboards</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Rename or share</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Name</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"95\" width=\"356\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"113\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Release Radar</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"144\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Description</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"150\" width=\"356\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"168\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">QA sign-off status</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"199\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Viewers</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"205\" width=\"356\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"223\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Group: qa-team</text><path d=\"M350,216 l5,5 l5,-5\" class=\"ln ink\" style=\"stroke-width:1.6\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"254\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Editors</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"260\" width=\"356\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"278\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Private</text><path d=\"M350,271 l5,5 l5,-5\" class=\"ln ink\" style=\"stroke-width:1.6\"/><rect x=\"12\" y=\"298\" width=\"46.0\" height=\"26\" rx=\"6\" class=\"fl-brand\"/><text x=\"35.0\" y=\"315\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"w\">Save</text></svg>","opts":["Add the qa-team group to the Editors field","Grant qa-team the Share dashboards and filters global permission","Share the gadgets' saved filters with qa-team","Grant qa-team the Browse Projects permission in the related project"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。Dashboard 的分享分成 Viewers 與 Editors 兩個欄位；圖中 Editors 是 Private，只有擁有者能改。把 qa-team 加進 Editors，他們才能加 gadget、調整版面。","B":"錯。Share dashboards and filters 是 global permission，決定使用者能不能把自己看得到的 dashboard 或 filter 分享給別人；它不會讓 qa-team 取得編輯這個 dashboard 的權限。要讓他們能加 gadget，得把他們加進 Editors。","C":"錯。分享 filter 解決的是 gadget 一片空白、看不到資料的問題；題目中他們看得到 dashboard，卡住的是編輯權。","D":"錯。Browse Projects 決定能不能看到 project 的 issue，影響 gadget 顯示的資料；它不會給任何人編輯 dashboard 的權限。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/create-and-edit-dashboards/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/manage-shared-dashboards/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/what-are-global-permissions-and-what-do-they-do/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.3-e01","sec":"620.5.3","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. Hye-jin, a Kanban team lead at Corvid Games, wants to know whether code reviews are slowing her team down. She configures the Control Chart as shown. What does the Elapsed Time of each dot now represent?","zh":"請看附圖。Hye-jin 是 Corvid Games 的 Kanban team lead，想知道 code review 是否拖慢團隊。她照圖設定 Control Chart。現在每個點的 Elapsed Time 代表什麼？","zo":["從 issue 建立到進入 Done 的時間","那一天有幾張 issue 在 Code Review","該 issue 在 Code Review 狀態停留的時間","從 issue 進入 In Progress 到進入 Done 的時間"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 380 359\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Control Chart\"><rect x=\"0.5\" y=\"0.5\" width=\"379\" height=\"358\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"380\" height=\"34\" rx=\"0\" class=\"sf-bg\"/><circle cx=\"14\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-rose\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-amber\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4.5\" class=\"fl-green\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"s\">Reports</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"62\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"h\">Control Chart</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Timeframe</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"95\" width=\"356\" height=\"28\" rx=\"6\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"22\" y=\"113\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Past 3 months</text><path d=\"M350,106 l5,5 l5,-5\" class=\"ln ink\" style=\"stroke-width:1.6\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"144\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Columns</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"150\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"161\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">To Do</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"171\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"182\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">In Progress</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"192\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" class=\"fl-brand\"/><path d=\"M15,199 l3,3 l5,-6\" class=\"ln\" style=\"stroke:var(--on-color);stroke-width:2\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"203\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\">Code Review</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"213\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"224\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Done</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"253\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Quick filters</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"259\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"270\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Bugs only</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"280\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\" class=\"bx\"/><text x=\"34\" y=\"291\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Mobile squad</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"309\" width=\"53.5\" height=\"26\" rx=\"6\" class=\"fl-brand\"/><text x=\"38.75\" y=\"326\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"w\">Apply</text></svg>","opts":["The time from when the issue was created until it reached Done","The number of issues that were in Code Review on that date","The time the issue spent in the Code Review status","The time from when the issue entered In Progress until it reached Done"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。這是 lead time，要把從建立起算的所有狀態都勾進 Columns 才會是這個意思；圖上只勾了 Code Review。","B":"錯。每天各狀態有幾張是 Cumulative Flow Diagram 的讀法；Control Chart 的每個點是一張 issue 花的時間。","C":"對。Control Chart 只計算 Columns 勾選的狀態裡花掉的時間。只勾 Code Review，每個點的高度就是那張 issue 在 Code Review 待了多久。","D":"錯。要勾 In Progress 與 Code Review 等多個欄位才會算到那一段；圖上只勾一個狀態，只算那個狀態。"},"note":"常見誤解：「某狀態待多久」用 CFD。CFD 只看各欄的件數變化；時間長短要用 Control Chart，Columns 只勾那個狀態。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-control-chart/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.3-e02","sec":"620.5.3","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Tariq manages a company-managed Kanban project at Lumora Health. His director asks two questions:\n1) How many issues were sitting in the QA column each day last month?\n2) How long does a typical issue stay in QA?\nWhich pairing of reports answers these questions?","zh":"Tariq 管理 Lumora Health 的一個 company-managed Kanban project。主管問了兩個問題：<br>1) 上個月每天有幾張 issue 待在 QA 欄？<br>2) 一張 issue 通常在 QA 待多久？<br>哪一組報表能回答這兩個問題？","zo":["1) Cumulative Flow Diagram；2) 只勾 QA 欄的 Control Chart","1) Control Chart；2) Cumulative Flow Diagram","1) Cumulative Flow Diagram；2) 只顯示 QA 欄的 Cumulative Flow Diagram","1) Created vs. Resolved Issues 報表；2) Average Age 報表"],"fig":"","opts":["1) Cumulative Flow Diagram; 2) Control Chart with only the QA column selected","1) Control Chart; 2) Cumulative Flow Diagram","1) Cumulative Flow Diagram; 2) Cumulative Flow Diagram with only the QA column shown","1) Created vs. Resolved Issues report; 2) Average Age report"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。每天各欄有幾張是 CFD 的強項，色帶厚度就是件數；在某狀態待多久要看 Control Chart，Columns 只勾 QA。","B":"錯。剛好顛倒。Control Chart 的每個點是一張 issue 花的時間，不是每天件數；CFD 看的是件數。","C":"錯。常見誤解：CFD 能看待多久。CFD 追蹤的是通過各欄的件數，要看停留時間要改用 Control Chart。","D":"錯。這兩張是 issue analysis 報表，看的是建立與解決的數量、未解決 issue 的平均年齡，不是某個欄位的狀況。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-control-chart/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-cumulative-flow-diagram/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.3-e03","sec":"620.5.3","dom":"620.5","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Ingrid is a scrum master at Pellucid Bank. Her team uses both the Control Chart and the Cumulative Flow Diagram. Which two questions are better answered by the Control Chart than by the Cumulative Flow Diagram? (Choose two.)","zh":"Ingrid 是 Pellucid Bank 的 scrum master，團隊同時使用 Control Chart 與 Cumulative Flow Diagram。下列哪兩個問題用 Control Chart 回答比用 CFD 更適合？（選兩個。）","zo":["這次 release 期間，Testing 欄每天有幾張 issue","團隊每個 sprint 完成了多少 story points","哪一欄進來的工作比出去的多、一直在累積","流程調整之後，cycle time 是否變得更好預測","issue 從 In Progress 到 Done 通常要多久"],"fig":"","opts":["How many issues were in the Testing column each day during the release","How many story points the team completed in each sprint","Which column has been accumulating more work than it releases","Whether cycle time became more predictable after a process change","How long issues typically take from In Progress to Done"],"ans":"DE","why":{"A":"錯。每天各欄件數是 CFD 的讀法，色帶厚度就是該欄件數；Control Chart 看不出每天有幾張。","B":"錯。每個 sprint 完成幾點要看 Velocity Chart；Control Chart 的 Y 軸是經過時間，不是點數。","C":"錯。哪一欄越積越多是瓶頸問題，要看 CFD 哪條色帶越來越寬，不是 Control Chart。","D":"對。官方列出的用途包含衡量流程改變的效果；藍色標準差帶變窄，代表 cycle time 越來越好預測。","E":"對。這是 cycle time，正是 Control Chart 的用途：把 In Progress 到 Done 之前的欄位勾進 Columns，每個點就是一張 issue 花的時間。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-control-chart/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-cumulative-flow-diagram/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.3-e04","sec":"620.5.3","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. Nils uses a board with three columns: To Do, In Progress and Done. The table shows the values that the Cumulative Flow Diagram displays for each column at the end of each day. On which day was a card dragged from Done back to To Do?","zh":"請看附圖。Nils 的 board 有 To Do、In Progress、Done 三欄。表格是 Cumulative Flow Diagram 每天結束時各欄顯示的數值。哪一天有一張卡從 Done 被拖回 To Do？","zo":["週二","週三","週四","週五"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 198\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"CFD 每日數值表\"><rect x=\"10\" y=\"8\" width=\"300\" height=\"182\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx plain\"/><text x=\"20\" y=\"28\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\">CFD values at end of day</text><rect x=\"16\" y=\"39\" width=\"288\" height=\"22\" rx=\"5\" class=\"sf-gray\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Day</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">To Do</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">In Progress</text><text x=\"274\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Done</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"62\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"62\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Mon</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"t\">6</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"t\">2</text><text x=\"274\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"t\">0</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"86\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"86\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Tue</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"t\">6</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"t\">3</text><text x=\"274\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"t\">1</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"110\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"126\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Wed</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"126\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"t\">7</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"126\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"t\">4</text><text x=\"274\" y=\"126\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"t\">2</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"134\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"134\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"150\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Thu</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"150\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"t\">7</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"150\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"t\">3</text><text x=\"274\" y=\"150\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"t\">1</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"158\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"158\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"174\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Fri</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"174\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"t\">7</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"174\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"t\">4</text><text x=\"274\" y=\"174\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"t\">2</text></svg>","opts":["Tuesday","Wednesday","Thursday","Friday"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。週二 In Progress 與 Done 各加 1、To Do 不變，是卡片往右移；往回拖不會讓數字變大。","B":"錯。常見誤解：卡片拖回 To Do 會讓 To Do 加 1。週三 To Do 加 1 是有新卡進來，不是往回拖。","C":"對。週四 To Do 維持 7，In Progress 與 Done 各扣 1。CFD 是累積圖，卡片拖回時離開的欄位各扣 1，To Do 因為沒有新卡而不變。","D":"錯。週五 In Progress 與 Done 各加 1，代表有卡片往右推進到 Done；往回拖只會讓數字變小。"},"note":"官方例子：卡片從 Done 拖回 To Do，CFD 會從 Done 和 In Progress 各扣 1，To Do 不變，因為沒有新的 issue 進來。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-cumulative-flow-diagram/"],"lvl":3,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.3-e05","sec":"620.5.3","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Oluwaseun's team starts a sprint with 9 issues on a board with To Do, In Progress and Done columns. Over the next days, 5 issues are moved to In Progress, and 3 of those are moved on to Done. A tester then drags one Done issue straight back to To Do. Which statement about the Cumulative Flow Diagram is NOT true?","zh":"Oluwaseun 的團隊用 To Do、In Progress、Done 三欄的 board，sprint 開始時有 9 張 issue。接下來幾天，有 5 張移到 In Progress，其中 3 張再移到 Done。之後測試人員把一張 Done 的 issue 直接拖回 To Do。關於 Cumulative Flow Diagram，下列哪個敘述「不」正確？","zo":["To Do 維持 9","In Progress 從 5 變成 4","Done 從 3 變成 2","To Do 從 9 變成 10"],"fig":"","opts":["To Do stays at 9","In Progress changes from 5 to 4","Done changes from 3 to 2","To Do changes from 9 to 10"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"正確敘述（不選）。To Do 記的是通過 To Do 的件數；沒有新 issue 進來，拖回的卡也早就算過，所以維持 9。","B":"正確敘述（不選）。那張卡離開了 In Progress 之後的範圍，CFD 會把 In Progress 的累積值扣 1，從 5 變 4。","C":"正確敘述（不選）。卡片離開 Done，Done 的累積值扣 1，從 3 變 2。","D":"錯誤敘述（要選）。常見誤解：拖回 To Do 就讓 To Do 加 1。官方例子寫 To Do 不變，因為沒有新的 issue 進來。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-cumulative-flow-diagram/"],"lvl":3,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.3-e06","sec":"620.5.3","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Three squads at Tessel Health share one company-managed Kanban board. Each squad lead wants to see a Cumulative Flow Diagram that shows only their own squad's issues. Which approach meets the requirement with the least effort?","zh":"Tessel Health 的三個 squad 共用一個 company-managed Kanban board。每位 squad lead 都想看只含自己 squad issue 的 Cumulative Flow Diagram。哪個做法最省力又能達成需求？","zo":["替每個 squad 各建一個有自己 board filter 的 board，再從各自的 board 開 CFD","在 board 的 General 設定裡替每個 squad 加一個 sub-filter","替每個 squad 建一個 quick filter，再到 CFD 的 Refine report 裡選它","改用 Created vs. Resolved Issues 報表，並替每個 squad 各存一個 filter"],"fig":"","opts":["Create a separate board for each squad, each with its own board filter, and open the CFD from each board","Add a sub-filter for each squad in the board's General settings","Create a quick filter for each squad and select it under Refine report on the CFD","Use the Created vs. Resolved Issues report with a saved filter for each squad"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。另建 board 確實做得到，但要多維護三個 board；CFD 本身就能套 filter，這不是最省力的做法。","B":"錯。Sub-filter 是 board 設定裡唯一的一條 JQL，套用到整個 board 與所有人，不能替三個 squad 各設一個。","C":"對。Quick filter 本來就是做共用 backlog 的團隊視角；CFD 的 Refine report 能選 board 的 filter，一個 board 就切得出各 squad 的 CFD。","D":"錯。Created vs. Resolved 比較的是建立與解決的數量，沒有各欄位的流動狀況，不能取代 CFD。"},"note":"常見誤解：每個團隊要看自己的 CFD 就得各建一個 board。CFD 與 Control Chart 都有 Refine report，可以直接套 board 的 quick filter。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-cumulative-flow-diagram/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-quick-filters/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-control-chart/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/add-a-sub-filter-to-a-company-managed-kanban-board/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.3-e07","sec":"620.5.3","dom":"620.5","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Mateo's company has two Scrum boards. Board PAY tracks progress with Time tracking set to Remaining Estimate and Time Spent. Board OPS estimates in story points with Time tracking set to None. On both boards, a sub-task is added to a story that is already in the active sprint. Which two statements are true? (Choose two.)","zh":"Mateo 的公司有兩個 Scrum board。PAY board 的 Time tracking 設為 Remaining Estimate and Time Spent；OPS board 用 story points 估算，Time tracking 設為 None。兩個 board 都在 active sprint 裡的某個 story 底下新增一個 sub-task。哪兩個敘述正確？（選兩個。）","zo":["只有 PAY board 把新的 sub-task 當成 scope change","兩個 board 都把新的 sub-task 當成 scope change","OPS 的 burndown 會往上跳，因為 sub-task 的 story points 會加到 parent","只有 PAY 的 Burndown Chart 會標出這個 scope change","兩個 board 都不算 scope change，因為 sub-task 不會被排進 sprint"],"fig":"","opts":["Only board PAY treats the new sub-task as a scope change","Both boards treat the new sub-task as a scope change","The OPS burndown steps up because the sub-task's story points are added to the parent","Only the PAY Burndown Chart indicates the scope change","Neither board treats it as a scope change because sub-tasks are not planned into sprints"],"ans":"BD","why":{"A":"錯。常見誤解：只有開時間追蹤才算 scope change。官方寫兩種設定都 treated as scope change，差別只在圖上畫不畫。","B":"對。不論有沒有開時間追蹤，在 active sprint 的 issue 底下加 sub-task 都算 scope change。帳本一定記。","C":"錯。Sub-task 的 story points 不計入 Burndown Chart，只算 parent；OPS 的 burndown 也不畫這個變化。","D":"對。只有開時間追蹤的 PAY，Burndown Chart 會標出這個 scope change；OPS 也算 scope change，只是圖上看不到。","E":"錯。官方明講兩種設定下都算 scope change；sub-task 跟著 parent 所在的 sprint，一樣會被記錄。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-burndown-chart/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-estimation-and-tracking/"],"lvl":3,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.3-e08","sec":"620.5.3","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Chiara is preparing a training session on sprint reports for new scrum masters. Which statement about sub-tasks is NOT true?","zh":"Chiara 要替新進的 scrum master 上一堂 sprint 報表的課。下列關於 sub-task 的敘述，哪一個「不」正確？","zo":["Sub-task 上填的 story points 不會算進 Burnup Chart","在沒有使用時間追蹤的 board 上，替 active sprint 裡的 issue 新增 sub-task 不算 scope change","開啟 Remaining Estimate and Time Spent 時，sub-task 的時間估算會加總到 parent","Velocity Chart 的計算不包含 sub-task 上的估算"],"fig":"","opts":["Story points entered on sub-tasks are not included in the Burnup Chart","On a board that does not use time tracking, adding a sub-task to an issue in the active sprint is not treated as a scope change","When Remaining Estimate and Time Spent is enabled, time estimates of sub-tasks are rolled up to the parent","Estimates on sub-tasks are not included in the Velocity Chart's calculation"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"正確敘述（不選）。Burnup Chart 只算 parent 的 story points，sub-task 上的點數不會進圖。","B":"錯誤敘述（要選）。常見誤解就是這一句。官方寫沒開時間追蹤時，sub-task 也 treated as scope change，只是 Burndown Chart 不標示。","C":"正確敘述（不選）。開了 Remaining Estimate and Time Spent，sub-task 的剩餘時間會加總到 parent。","D":"正確敘述（不選）。Velocity Chart 只計算 parent 的估算，sub-task 的估算不列入。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-burndown-chart/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-burnup-chart/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-velocity-chart/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.3-e09","sec":"620.5.3","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Ji-woo's Scrum board estimates in story points. The scrum master complains that when sub-tasks are added to stories during an active sprint, the Burndown Chart never shows any scope change. What should the board administrator change so that these scope changes appear on the Burndown Chart?","zh":"Ji-woo 的 Scrum board 用 story points 估算。Scrum master 抱怨：sprint 進行中在 story 底下新增 sub-task，Burndown Chart 從來不顯示任何 scope change。Board 管理員該改什麼，才能讓這些 scope change 出現在 Burndown Chart 上？","zo":["請團隊在每個新的 sub-task 上填 story points","在 board 加一個包含 sub-task 的 sub-filter","把 board 改成 Kanban，改用 Cumulative Flow Diagram 追蹤進度","在 board 的 Estimation 設定裡，把 Time tracking 設為 Remaining Estimate and Time Spent"],"fig":"","opts":["Ask the team to put story points on each new sub-task","Add a sub-filter to the board that includes sub-tasks","Switch the board to Kanban and track the sprint with the Cumulative Flow Diagram instead","In the board's Estimation settings, set Time tracking to Remaining Estimate and Time Spent"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。Sub-task 上的 story points 不計入 Burndown Chart，只算 parent，填了圖上也不會出現變化。","B":"錯。Sub-filter 只有 company-managed Kanban board 才有，Scrum board 沒有這個設定。","C":"錯。CFD 看的是各欄件數，不是剩餘工作量；而且換成 Kanban 就沒有 sprint 與 Burndown Chart 了。","D":"對。Time tracking 改成 Remaining Estimate and Time Spent 後，新增的 sub-task 仍算 scope change，Burndown Chart 也會標出來。"},"note":"注意：沒開時間追蹤時，這些 sub-task 早就算 scope change 了，只是 burndown 不畫。帳本一定記，圖上不一定畫。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-burndown-chart/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-estimation-and-tracking/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.3-e10","sec":"620.5.3","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"At Quillfin, Farhan's Scrum team splits every story into sub-tasks and enters story points only on the sub-tasks; the parent stories have no estimate. After several sprints, the Velocity Chart shows almost zero Completed for every sprint. What is the most likely cause?","zh":"Quillfin 的 Farhan 帶的 Scrum 團隊把每個 story 拆成 sub-task，而且只在 sub-task 上填 story points，parent story 沒有估算。幾個 sprint 之後，Velocity Chart 每個 sprint 的 Completed 幾乎都是零。最可能的原因是什麼？","zo":["Velocity Chart 只計算 parent issue 上的估算，不算 sub-task","Board 的 working days 把每個 sprint 排除了太多天","Velocity Chart 需要開啟時間追蹤","Sub-task 要等 parent story 所屬的版本 release 之後才會被計算"],"fig":"","opts":["The Velocity Chart includes only estimates on parent issues, not on sub-tasks","The board's working days exclude too many days from each sprint","The Velocity Chart requires time tracking to be enabled","Sub-tasks are counted only after the parent story's fix version has been released"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。官方寫 Velocity Chart 的計算不含 sub-task 的估算，只算 parent。點數全填在 sub-task、parent 是空的，Completed 自然接近零。","B":"錯。Velocity 以 sprint 為單位，不在 working days 影響的報表清單裡；改工作日也不會讓完成量變成零。","C":"錯。Velocity Chart 可以用 story points、原始時間、件數或任何數字欄位估算，不需要開時間追蹤。","D":"錯。Velocity 只看 sprint 結束時完成的估算，跟版本有沒有 release 無關。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-velocity-chart/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.3-e11","sec":"620.5.3","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Arjun's team enters original time estimates on both parent issues and their sub-tasks, and Jira time tracking is enabled. For a release review meeting, he needs a report whose totals for each parent issue include the values from its sub-tasks. Which report provides this?","zh":"Arjun 的團隊在 parent issue 與 sub-task 上都填了原始時間估算，Jira 也開了 time tracking。為了 release 檢討會，他需要一張報表，每個 parent issue 的合計要包含它底下 sub-task 的數值。哪張報表做得到？","zo":["Time Tracking Report","Velocity Chart","Sprint Report","Burnup Chart"],"fig":"","opts":["Time Tracking Report","Velocity Chart","Sprint Report","Burnup Chart"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。Time Tracking Report 在有 sub-task 時會多一欄 Σ，把 parent 自己的值加上所有 sub-task 的值；最後一列是整個版本的合計。","B":"錯。Velocity Chart 只算 parent 的估算，官方明寫 sub-task 的估算不列入計算。","C":"錯。Sprint Report 只包含 parent 的估算，sub-task 的估算不會出現在報表的數字裡。","D":"錯。Burnup Chart 只算 parent 的估算，sub-task 上的數字不會進圖。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/generate-a-report/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-velocity-chart/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-sprint-report/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-burnup-chart/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.3-e12","sec":"620.5.3","dom":"620.5","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Leilani, a board administrator, adds a national holiday as a non-working day. The team's dashboard shows several gadgets that use this board. Which two gadgets will reflect the new non-working day? (Choose two.)","zh":"Board 管理員 Leilani 把國定假日加成 non-working day。團隊的 dashboard 上有好幾個使用這個 board 的 gadget。哪兩個 gadget 會反映新的非工作日？（選兩個。）","zo":["Created vs. Resolved Chart gadget","Sprint Health gadget","Two Dimensional Filter Statistics gadget","Filter Results gadget","Burndown gadget"],"fig":"","opts":["Created vs. Resolved Chart gadget","Sprint Health gadget","Two Dimensional Filter Statistics gadget","Filter Results gadget","Burndown gadget"],"ans":"BE","why":{"A":"錯。Created vs. Resolved 依 filter 畫建立與解決的數量，不在官方 working days 清單裡。","B":"對。官方清單上吃 working days 的 gadget 只有兩個，Sprint Health gadget 是其中之一。","C":"錯。這個 gadget 是依兩個欄位交叉統計件數的表格，跟 board 的工作日設定無關。","D":"錯。Filter Results 只是列出 filter 撈到的 issue，不做任何以日期推算的計算。","E":"對。Burndown gadget 是清單上另一個吃 working days 的 gadget。清單外的 gadget 都不受影響。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-working-days/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.3-e13","sec":"620.5.3","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Kwame, a scrum master at Halcyon Freight, adds two non-working days to his company-managed Scrum board for a company retreat. A stakeholder asks which report will be completely unaffected by this change. Which report should Kwame name?","zh":"Halcyon Freight 的 scrum master Kwame 因為公司旅遊，在 company-managed Scrum board 加了兩天 non-working day。利害關係人問：哪張報表完全不受這個改動影響？Kwame 該回答哪一張？","zo":["Epic Report","Control Chart","Epic Burndown","Sprint Report"],"fig":"","opts":["Epic Report","Control Chart","Epic Burndown","Sprint Report"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。Epic Report 在官方 working days 清單裡。常見誤解是以為 epic 類報表都不吃工作日。","B":"錯。Control Chart 在官方 working days 清單裡，改工作日會影響它；它是 Kanban 也有的報表，別因此以為它不吃。","C":"對。官方清單只有 Burndown、Sprint、Epic、Version report 與 Control Chart。Epic Burndown 名字像，但不在清單裡。","D":"錯。Sprint Report 在清單裡，上方的 guideline 在非工作日會保持水平。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-working-days/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.3-e14","sec":"620.5.3","dom":"620.5","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Emeka configured a holiday as a non-working day on his team's company-managed Scrum board. A week later, the team says the Cumulative Flow Diagram and the Velocity Chart look exactly the same as before. Which two statements explain this? (Choose two.)","zh":"Emeka 在團隊的 company-managed Scrum board 上把一個假日設成 non-working day。一週後，團隊說 Cumulative Flow Diagram 和 Velocity Chart 看起來跟以前完全一樣。哪兩個敘述能解釋這個現象？（選兩個。）","zo":["Cumulative Flow Diagram 不在會反映 working days 的報表之中","Burndown Chart 也一樣會忽略非工作日","Velocity Chart 不在會反映 working days 的報表之中","Working days 是在 project settings 設定，所以 board 層級的改動會被忽略","只有 Jira administrator 能讓 working days 套用到報表上"],"fig":"","opts":["The Cumulative Flow Diagram is not one of the reports that reflect working days","The Burndown Chart ignores non-working days in the same way","The Velocity Chart is not one of the reports that reflect working days","Working days are set in project settings, so a board-level change is ignored","Only a Jira administrator can make working days apply to reports"],"ans":"AC","why":{"A":"對。官方清單只有 5 張報表加 2 個 gadget，CFD 不在其中，所以改工作日不會讓它改變。","B":"錯。Burndown Chart 正好在官方 working days 清單裡，改非工作日會影響它，它不會忽略非工作日。","C":"對。Velocity Chart 以 sprint 為單位比較 Commitment 與 Completed，也不在官方清單裡，改工作日不影響它。","D":"錯。Working days 是 board 的設定，在 Board settings 裡改；不是 project settings。","E":"錯。Project admin（現行 UI 叫 space admin）或 board admin 就能設定 working days，也沒有另外「套用到報表」的步驟。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-working-days/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.3-e15","sec":"620.5.3","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Kenji opens the Sprint Report for his team's current sprint. The grey guideline stays flat for one day in the middle of the week, even though the team usually works that day. What is the most likely reason?","zh":"Kenji 打開團隊目前 sprint 的 Sprint Report。灰色 guideline 在週間某一天保持水平，但團隊那天通常是上班的。最可能的原因是什麼？","zo":["團隊那天沒有完成任何 issue","那一天在 board 的 Working days 設定裡被設成 non-working day","Sprint 在加入任何有估算的 issue 之前就開始了","團隊那天沒有記任何工時"],"fig":"","opts":["No issues were completed by the team on that day","That date is configured as a non-working day in the board's Working days settings","The sprint was started before any estimated issues had been added to it","The team did not log any time on that day"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。沒完成工作影響的是代表實際進度的紅線；灰色 guideline 是預先畫好的理想線，不看實際完成量。","B":"對。Sprint Report 的灰色 guideline 在非工作日保持水平。平常會上班的日子也變平，代表那天被加成 board 的 non-working day。","C":"錯。Sprint 開始時沒有 issue，結果是 guideline 整條畫不出來，而不是某一天變平。","D":"錯。沒記工時影響的是開時間追蹤時的綠線，不會改變灰色 guideline 的形狀。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-sprint-report/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/configure-working-days/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-burndown-chart/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.3-e16","sec":"620.5.3","dom":"620.5","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. Zainab recorded the values shown on the Burnup Chart for the first five days of a sprint. Which two statements are supported by the data? (Choose two.)","zh":"請看附圖。Zainab 記下某個 sprint 前五天 Burnup Chart 上顯示的數值。哪兩個敘述有資料佐證？（選兩個。）","zo":["Sprint 在第 3 天被加了工作","到第 5 天，團隊已完成 36 個 story points","第 3 天還剩 22 個 story points 的工作","第 5 天還剩 16 個 story points 的工作","Sprint 範圍在第 3 天被縮小"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 198\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Burnup chart 數值表\"><rect x=\"10\" y=\"8\" width=\"300\" height=\"182\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx plain\"/><text x=\"20\" y=\"28\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\">Burnup chart (story points)</text><rect x=\"16\" y=\"39\" width=\"288\" height=\"22\" rx=\"5\" class=\"sf-gray\"/><text x=\"28\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Day</text><text x=\"150\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Work scope</text><text x=\"256\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Completed</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"62\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"62\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"28\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Day 1</text><text x=\"150\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"t\">30</text><text x=\"256\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"t\">0</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"86\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"86\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"28\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Day 2</text><text x=\"150\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"t\">30</text><text x=\"256\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"t\">5</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"110\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"28\" y=\"126\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Day 3</text><text x=\"150\" y=\"126\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"t\">36</text><text x=\"256\" y=\"126\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"t\">8</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"134\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"134\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"28\" y=\"150\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Day 4</text><text x=\"150\" y=\"150\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"t\">36</text><text x=\"256\" y=\"150\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"t\">14</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"158\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"158\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"28\" y=\"174\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">Day 5</text><text x=\"150\" y=\"174\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"t\">36</text><text x=\"256\" y=\"174\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"t\">20</text></svg>","opts":["Work was added to the sprint on Day 3","By Day 5, the team had completed 36 story points","On Day 3, 22 story points of work remained","On Day 5, 16 story points of work remained","The sprint scope was reduced on Day 3"],"ans":"AD","why":{"A":"對。Work scope 在第 3 天從 30 跳到 36。官方說紅線在 sprint 中往上升就是 scope creep 的徵兆。","B":"錯。36 是 Work scope（總量，紅線），不是完成量；第 5 天的 Completed 只有 20。","C":"錯。剩餘工作是 Work scope 與 Completed 的差距：第 3 天是 36 − 8 ＝ 28，不是 22。","D":"對。官方說兩條線之間的距離就是剩餘工作量：第 5 天 36 − 20 ＝ 16；兩線相交才代表做完。","E":"錯。Work scope 在第 3 天是往上跳，代表加入工作，不是減少範圍。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-burnup-chart/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.3-e17","sec":"620.5.3","dom":"620.5","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. Rafael reviews the Velocity Chart data for his team's last four sprints before sprint planning. Which two statements are correct? (Choose two.)","zh":"請看附圖。Rafael 在 sprint planning 之前檢視團隊最近四個 sprint 的 Velocity Chart 資料。哪兩個敘述正確？（選兩個。）","zo":["可拿來規劃的團隊 velocity 大約是 23 個 story points","S22 的 Commitment 包含 sprint 開始後才加入的 story","Velocity 是 Commitment 的平均，所以大約是 24 個 story points","S24 的 Completed 比 Commitment 低，所以不列入 velocity","S22 在 sprint 開始後有加入工作或調高估算"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 174\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Velocity chart 數值表\"><rect x=\"10\" y=\"8\" width=\"300\" height=\"158\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx plain\"/><text x=\"20\" y=\"28\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\">Velocity chart (story points)</text><rect x=\"16\" y=\"39\" width=\"288\" height=\"22\" rx=\"5\" class=\"sf-gray\"/><text x=\"28\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Sprint</text><text x=\"150\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Commitment</text><text x=\"256\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Completed</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"62\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"62\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"28\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">S21</text><text x=\"150\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"t\">24</text><text x=\"256\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"t\">21</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"86\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"86\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"28\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">S22</text><text x=\"150\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"t\">22</text><text x=\"256\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"t\">28</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"110\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"28\" y=\"126\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">S23</text><text x=\"150\" y=\"126\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"t\">26</text><text x=\"256\" y=\"126\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"t\">23</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"134\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"134\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"28\" y=\"150\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">S24</text><text x=\"150\" y=\"150\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"t\">25</text><text x=\"256\" y=\"150\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"t\">20</text></svg>","opts":["The team's velocity for planning is about 23 story points","The Commitment for S22 includes stories added after the sprint started","Velocity is the average Commitment, so it is about 24 story points","S24 is excluded from velocity because Completed is lower than Commitment","In S22, work was added or estimates increased after the sprint started"],"ans":"AE","why":{"A":"對。Velocity 是最近幾個 sprint Completed 的平均：(21 + 28 + 23 + 20) ÷ 4 ＝ 23，可當下一個 sprint 的承諾參考。","B":"錯。Commitment 是 sprint 開始時的總估算；開始後加入的 story 或改過的估算不會算進去。","C":"錯。Velocity 用的是 Completed 的平均，不是 Commitment（灰色長條）的平均。","D":"錯。完成得比 Commitment 少的 sprint 照樣算進平均；官方範例只略過完成 0 點的 sprint。S24 完成 20 點，要算進去。","E":"對。Completed 包含開始後的 scope change，Commitment 不含。S22 完成量比承諾多，代表中途加了工作或調高估點。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-velocity-chart/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.3-e18","sec":"620.5.3","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Refer to the exhibit. Mai checks the Epic Burndown report for epic PAY-12. At the start of sprint S9, 24 story points remained in the epic. So far in S9, the team has completed 2 points. How many more sprints will the report most likely predict?","zh":"請看附圖。Mai 查看 epic PAY-12 的 Epic Burndown 報表。S9 開始時，這個 epic 還剩 24 個 story points；S9 到目前為止團隊完成了 2 點。報表最可能預測還要幾個 sprint？","zo":["大約 2 個 sprint，依四個已完成 sprint 的平均計算","大約 4 個 sprint，因為 S9 也算在最近三個 sprint 裡","大約 3 個 sprint，依 S6、S7、S8 的平均計算","大約 12 個 sprint，依目前這個 sprint 的速度計算"],"fig":"<svg class=\"dia\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 198\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Epic burndown 各 sprint 完成量\"><rect x=\"10\" y=\"8\" width=\"300\" height=\"182\" rx=\"10\" class=\"bx plain\"/><text x=\"20\" y=\"28\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\">Epic PAY-12 (story points)</text><rect x=\"16\" y=\"39\" width=\"288\" height=\"22\" rx=\"5\" class=\"sf-gray\"/><text x=\"28\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Sprint</text><text x=\"150\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Completed</text><text x=\"256\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"b\" style=\"font-size:12px\">State</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"62\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"62\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"28\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">S5</text><text x=\"150\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"t\">24</text><text x=\"256\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"t\">Closed</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"86\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"86\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"28\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">S6</text><text x=\"150\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"t\">6</text><text x=\"256\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"t\">Closed</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"110\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"28\" y=\"126\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">S7</text><text x=\"150\" y=\"126\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"t\">9</text><text x=\"256\" y=\"126\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"t\">Closed</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"134\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"134\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"28\" y=\"150\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">S8</text><text x=\"150\" y=\"150\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"t\">9</text><text x=\"256\" y=\"150\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"t\">Closed</text><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"158\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"158\" class=\"gl\"/><text x=\"28\" y=\"174\" text-anchor=\"start\" class=\"t\">S9</text><text x=\"150\" y=\"174\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"t\">2</text><text x=\"256\" y=\"174\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"t\">Active</text></svg>","opts":["About 2 sprints, based on the average of all four completed sprints","About 4 sprints, because S9 counts as one of the last three sprints","About 3 sprints, based on the average of S6, S7 and S8","About 12 sprints, based on the pace of the current sprint"],"ans":"C","why":{"A":"錯。預測只用最近三個 sprint，不用全部歷史；把 S5 的 24 點算進去才會得到平均 12、約 2 個 sprint。","B":"錯。目前的 sprint 通常不算；只有當它已完成的量超過預測量時才會算進三個 sprint。S9 只完成 2 點，沒超過。","C":"對。Velocity 取最近三個已完成的 sprint：(6 + 9 + 9) ÷ 3 ＝ 8 點；24 ÷ 8 ＝ 3。目前的 S9 只完成 2 點，沒超過預測，所以不算進去。","D":"錯。報表不是用目前 sprint 的進度推算；用 S9 的 2 點去除，才會得到 12 這個數字。"},"note":"這裡的 velocity 是 Epic Burndown 自己的算法（最近三個 sprint 的完成量），官方特別註明和 Velocity Chart 的 velocity 不同。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-epic-burndown-report/"],"lvl":3,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.3-e19","sec":"620.5.3","dom":"620.5","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Sofía is a product owner at Marigold Retail. For version 3.1, her sponsor asks two things: how many more sprints the team needs, and the optimistic and pessimistic release dates. Which two reports should Sofía use? (Choose two.)","zh":"Sofía 是 Marigold Retail 的 product owner。針對 version 3.1，贊助人問了兩件事：團隊還要幾個 sprint，以及樂觀與悲觀的 release 日期。Sofía 該用哪兩張報表？（選兩個。）","zo":["Epic Burndown","Release Burndown","Version Report","Velocity Chart","Burnup Chart"],"fig":"","opts":["Epic Burndown","Release Burndown","Version Report","Velocity Chart","Burnup Chart"],"ans":"BC","why":{"A":"錯。Epic Burndown 預測的是某個 epic 還要幾個 sprint，範圍是 epic 不是 version。","B":"對。Release Burndown 以 sprint 為單位，依最近三個 sprint 的完成量預測某個 version 還要幾個 sprint。","C":"對。Version Report 畫出預測 release 日的藍線，左右灰帶是樂觀（平均日速度 +10%）與悲觀（−10%）日期。","D":"錯。Velocity Chart 顯示每個 sprint 的 Commitment 與 Completed，沒有針對某個 version 的預測。","E":"錯。Burnup Chart 看的是單一 sprint 的完成量與總範圍，不預測 version 的完成時間。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/what-is-the-release-burndown-report/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-version-report/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/generate-a-report/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.3-e20","sec":"620.5.3","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Dmitri opens the Version Report on his company-managed Scrum board to review version 4.2, but 4.2 is not listed in the version drop-down. Other versions, including released ones, are listed. What is the most likely reason?","zh":"Dmitri 在 company-managed Scrum board 上打開 Version Report 要檢視 4.2 版，但版本下拉選單裡沒有 4.2。其他版本（包含已 release 的）都有列出。最可能的原因是什麼？","zo":["4.2 版沒有 Start Date","4.2 版裡有 sub-task 類型的 issue","4.2 版已經 release 了","4.2 版已經被封存（archived）"],"fig":"","opts":["Version 4.2 has no Start Date","Version 4.2 contains sub-task issues","Version 4.2 has already been released","Version 4.2 has been archived"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。沒有 Start Date 時，橫軸改從第一張 issue 加入版本的日期開始，報表照樣可以開。","B":"錯。Version Report 會排除 sub-task 類型的 issue，但只是不計入，不會讓整個版本從清單消失。","C":"錯。Version Report 會顯示 Released 的版本，題目也說其他已 release 的版本都在清單上。","D":"對。官方寫 Version Report 會顯示 Released 版本，但不顯示 Archived 版本。版本被封存後就不會出現在下拉選單。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-version-report/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.3-e21","sec":"620.5.3","dom":"620.5","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Aisha reviews her Kanban team's Control Chart for the last quarter. The rolling average trends steadily downward, and the blue shaded area around it is narrow. Which two conclusions are supported? (Choose two.)","zh":"Aisha 檢視她的 Kanban 團隊上一季的 Control Chart。Rolling average 穩定往下走，周圍的藍色區域很窄。哪兩個結論有依據？（選兩個。）","zo":["團隊的 cycle time 在縮短，代表生產力在提升","等在 To Do 欄的 issue 比以前多","進入 In Progress 欄的 issue 比離開的快","未來 issue 的 cycle time 很可能接近 rolling average","團隊每週完成的 issue 比上一季多"],"fig":"","opts":["The team's cycle time is decreasing, which suggests productivity is increasing","More issues are waiting in the To Do column than before","Issues are entering the In Progress column faster than they leave it","Cycle times of future issues are likely to be close to the rolling average","The team is finishing more issues per week than last quarter"],"ans":"AD","why":{"A":"對。藍線是依 issue 數算的 rolling average；往下走代表每張 issue 花的時間變短，官方例子就把它解讀為生產力上升。","B":"錯。各欄件數多寡要看 CFD 的色帶；Control Chart 的點代表 issue 在所選欄位花了多久，不是各欄的件數。","C":"錯。進得比出得快是 CFD 上 In Progress 色帶越來越寬的讀法，代表瓶頸；Control Chart 看不出各欄進出的件數。","D":"對。藍色區域是標準差。帶子窄代表資料離 rolling average 不遠，未來 issue 的 cycle time 可信地會接近平均。","E":"錯。每週完成幾張是 throughput，要看 CFD 的 Done 斜率或 Created vs. Resolved；Control Chart 的點是每張 issue 花的時間，不是件數。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-control-chart/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.3-e22","sec":"620.5.3","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"At Brightwell Labs, many bugs are resolved within minutes as Duplicate or Won't Do. Bjorn notices that these issues pull the average cycle time on the team's Control Chart far below reality. What does Atlassian recommend to exclude them?","zh":"Brightwell Labs 有很多 bug 在幾分鐘內就以 Duplicate 或 Won't Do 結案。Bjorn 發現這些 issue 讓團隊 Control Chart 上的平均 cycle time 遠低於實際。Atlassian 建議怎麼把它們排除？","zo":["建立 <code>resolution in (Fixed)</code> 的 quick filter，並讓 Control Chart 套用它","在 Columns 取消勾選 Done，讓已解決的 issue 不被計算","改用 Cumulative Flow Diagram，因為它不看 resolution","把 rolling average 的取樣從顯示總數的 20% 調高到 50%，降低離群值的影響"],"fig":"","opts":["Create a quick filter with <code>resolution in (Fixed)</code> and configure the Control Chart to use it","Clear the Done column under Columns so resolved issues are not counted","Use the Cumulative Flow Diagram instead, because it ignores resolutions","Raise the rolling average sample from 20% to 50% of the displayed issues so that outliers matter less"],"ans":"A","why":{"A":"對。官方 Tip 2：triage 掉的 issue 會拉低平均 cycle time，建立 <code>resolution in (Fixed)</code> 的 quick filter 讓 Control Chart 套用即可。","B":"錯。Columns 決定的是計算哪些狀態的時間，不是排除哪些 issue；取消勾選 Done 也不會把重複單剔除。","C":"錯。CFD 只看各欄件數，根本沒有 cycle time；換報表等於放棄要看的數字。","D":"錯。Rolling average 固定取顯示總數的 20%（最少 5 張、一定是奇數），不能自己調；而且這樣也排除不了那些 issue。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-control-chart/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.3-e23","sec":"620.5.3","dom":"620.5","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Yuna is explaining the Control Chart to a new team member. Which two statements about the dots on the chart are true? (Choose two.)","zh":"Yuna 向新成員解釋 Control Chart。關於圖上的點，哪兩個敘述正確？（選兩個。）","zo":["點的大小代表該 issue 的 story point 估算","點的水平位置代表 issue 建立的日期","一個點可能代表一群 issue，放在它們的平均 cycle time 高度","每個點代表一個已完成的 sprint","水平位置代表 issue 離開最後一個勾選欄位的時間"],"fig":"","opts":["The size of a dot shows the issue's story point estimate","The horizontal position of a dot shows the date the issue was created","A dot can represent a cluster of issues, placed at their average cycle time","Each dot represents one completed sprint","The horizontal position shows when the issue transitioned out of the last selected column"],"ans":"CE","why":{"A":"錯。點的大小不代表估點；Control Chart 完全不看 story points，Y 軸是經過時間。","B":"錯。橫軸不是建立日期，而是 issue 離開所選欄位的時間；建立日期只和 lead time 的起點有關。","C":"對。每個點可能是一張 issue，也可能是一群（cluster）issue；cluster 的點放在這群 issue 的平均 cycle time 高度。","D":"錯。每個點是 issue，不是 sprint；以 sprint 為單位的長條是 Velocity 或 Epic Burndown 的畫法。","E":"對。官方寫點的水平位置代表 issue 最近一次離開 Columns 裡最後一個勾選狀態的時間；垂直位置是 Elapsed Time。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-control-chart/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.3-e24","sec":"620.5.3","dom":"620.5","type":"multi","n":2,"stem":"Rashida's company-managed project has two Scrum boards, Mobile and Web, each with its own board filter. Which two statements about reporting in this project are true? (Choose two.)","zh":"Rashida 的 company-managed project 有 Mobile 與 Web 兩個 Scrum board，各有自己的 board filter。關於這個 project 的報表，哪兩個敘述正確？（選兩個。）","zo":["Project insights 儀表板只顯示符合所選 board filter 的 issue","傳統報表一定會合併 project 裡兩個 board 的資料","Sprint Report 這類傳統報表以目前正在看的 board 為範圍","Project 有一個以上的 board 時，就不能產生 Control Chart","Velocity Chart 只包含符合該 board saved filter 的 issue"],"fig":"","opts":["Project insights dashboards show only the issues that match the selected board's filter","Classic reports always combine the data from both boards in the project","Classic reports such as the Sprint Report run against the board currently being viewed","The Control Chart cannot be generated when a project has more than one board","The Velocity Chart includes only issues that match the board's saved filter"],"ans":"CE","why":{"A":"錯。Project insights（現行 UI 叫 space insights）的資料來自整個 project，官方明講不受所選 board 或 board filter 限制。","B":"錯。傳統報表不會合併兩個 board；切到哪個 board，就只看那個 board 的資料。","C":"對。官方提醒 company-managed project 可以有多個 board，傳統報表以目前正在看的 board 為範圍，產生報表前要先確認 board。","D":"錯。多個 board 不影響能不能開 Control Chart，只是範圍會是目前的 board。","E":"對。Velocity Chart 是 board-specific，只包含符合該 board saved filter 的 issue。"},"note":"<b>考試版／現行版：</b>現行 UI 把 project 叫 space、issue 叫 work item；點 Reports 會先看到 space insights，要按 More reports 才進到傳統報表。","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/generate-a-report/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-velocity-chart/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.3-e25","sec":"620.5.3","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Lucas facilitates the sprint retrospective for a team at Orchard Mobility. He wants one report that lists which issues were completed, which were not completed and pushed back to the backlog, and which were added after the sprint started, so the team can discuss whether it is overcommitting. Which report should he open?","zh":"Lucas 主持 Orchard Mobility 某團隊的 sprint retrospective。他想要一張報表，列出哪些 issue 完成、哪些沒完成而被推回 backlog、哪些是 sprint 開始後才加入的，讓團隊討論是否承諾過多。他該開哪張報表？","zo":["Velocity Chart","Burnup Chart","Control Chart","Sprint Report"],"fig":"","opts":["Velocity Chart","Burnup Chart","Control Chart","Sprint Report"],"ans":"D","why":{"A":"錯。Velocity Chart 只有每個 sprint 的 Commitment 與 Completed 兩根長條，沒有逐張 issue 的清單。","B":"錯。Burnup Chart 用兩條線看完成量與總範圍，能看出 scope creep，但沒有完成與未完成的 issue 清單。","C":"錯。Control Chart 看的是 cycle time，每個點是一張（或一群）issue 在所選欄位花的時間；它沒有列出完成、未完成、中途加入的 issue 清單。","D":"對。Sprint Report 下方依完成狀況列出 issue，sprint 開始後加入的標星號，官方說它適合 retrospective，也能看出是否 overcommit。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-sprint-report/","https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/generate-a-report/"],"lvl":1,"lang":"en","ex":1},{"id":"620.5.3-e26","sec":"620.5.3","dom":"620.5","type":"single","n":1,"stem":"Amara's Scrum board uses Remaining Estimate and Time Spent for time tracking. In the Sprint Report, she sees a green line in addition to the grey and red lines. What does the green line indicate?","zh":"Amara 的 Scrum board 用 Remaining Estimate and Time Spent 做時間追蹤。她在 Sprint Report 上除了灰線和紅線，還看到一條綠線。綠線代表什麼？","zo":["Sprint 期間完成的 issue","Sprint 期間在 issue 上記錄的工時","Sprint 開始後才加入的工作","扣掉非工作日之後的理想消耗速度"],"fig":"","opts":["The issues completed during the sprint","The work logged on issues during the sprint","The work added to the sprint after it started","The ideal burn rate adjusted for non-working days"],"ans":"B","why":{"A":"錯。完成的 issue 列在報表下方的清單裡；Sprint Report 圖上沒有一條專門畫完成件數的線。","B":"對。Board 有追蹤 remaining estimate 與 time spent 時，Sprint Report 會多一條綠線，代表 issue 上記錄的工時（現行 UI 叫 work item）。","C":"錯。中途加入的工作會讓紅線往上跳，清單裡也會標星號，不是用綠線表示。","D":"錯。理想線是灰色 guideline，在非工作日保持水平；它不是綠線。"},"note":"","src":["https://support.atlassian.com/jira-software-cloud/docs/view-and-understand-the-sprint-report/"],"lvl":2,"lang":"en","ex":1}];